values
  ('414906986255504071', 'Let''s Go Karaoke!', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Nobuhiro Yamashita, Kohei Adachi, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Akiko Nogi', 'Go Ayano, Jun Saito, Kazuki Kitamura, Kyoko Yoshine, Jun Hashimoto, Kyosuke Yabe, Shuhei Yoshinaga, Chance Oshiro', null, 'Satomi Oka is worried about his final choir competition but is accosted by a shadowy gangster, Kyouji Narita, who demands karaoke sessions with him.', 'Satomi Oka is worried about his final choir competition but is accosted by a shadowy gangster, Kyouji Narita, who demands karaoke sessions with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OXmRTWQoxjcPJHrm1qDdWddeJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1070507'),
  ('147073544137078330', 'Let''s Go to Prison', 2006, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ramsey Nickell, Bob Odenkirk', 'Robert Ben Garant, Thomas Lennon, Michael Patrick Jann', 'Dax Shepard, Will Arnett, Chi McBride, David Koechner, Dylan Baker, Michael Shannon, Miguel Nino, Jay Whittaker', 'R', 'When a career criminal''s plan for revenge is thwarted by unlikely circumstances, he puts his intended victim''s son in his place by putting him in prison...and then joining him.', 'When a career criminal''s plan for revenge is thwarted by unlikely circumstances, he puts his intended victim''s son in his place by putting him in prison...and then joining him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okkaFUou7Tmh9QWoa2FIViJ3OVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9809'),
  ('667851348882804757', 'Let''s Go To Rose Motel', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jeong-gyun Shin', 'Ma Kwang-Soo', 'Sung Eun-chae, Jang Sung-won, Woo Do-hwan, Yeo Min-jeong', null, 'Seong-soo hasn''t had any physical contact with his girlfriend yet after 6 months of being together so he''s always excited to see her. One day, Seong-soo succeeds in getting Min-ae into Rose Motel. When he is about to shower, Seong-soo discovers a small hole in the wall leading to the next room and watches the couple next door having intercourse. Seong-soo continues to watch out of curiosity but realizes he just watched celebrity Sara giving sexual favors to a big shot politician...', 'Seong-soo hasn''t had any physical contact with his girlfriend yet after 6 months of being together so he''s always excited to see her. One day, Seong-soo succeeds in getting Min-ae into Rose Motel. When he is about to shower, Seong-soo discovers a small hole in the wall leading to the next room and watches the couple next door having intercourse. Seong-soo continues to watch out of curiosity but realizes he just watched celebrity Sara giving sexual favors to a big shot politician...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ogCczLG6EhQEnSWoqs6092bGm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464026'),
  ('11017983311030733', 'Let''s Go to the Country', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Gianni Costantino, Andrea Rebuzzi, Giovanni Calvaruso', 'Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Fabrizio Testini', 'Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Tiziana Lodato, Fatima Trotta, Francesco Paolantoni, Mariano Rigillo, Nino Frassica, Ludovico Caldarera', null, 'Valentino and Salvo, unemployed and in search of fortune and recommendation, leave Palermo for Valentino’s home town, Monteforte, where they will try to survive the Italian crisis by opening some sort of hospice.', 'Valentino and Salvo, unemployed and in search of fortune and recommendation, leave Palermo for Valentino’s home town, Monteforte, where they will try to survive the Italian crisis by opening some sort of hospice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcUKXHI7uOLJeLdresvwHlRpGfs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301272'),
  ('461813950094099378', 'Let’s Go Up the Champs-Élysées', 1938, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Sacha Guitry, Jeanne Étiévant, Jean Bachelet', 'Sacha Guitry', 'Sacha Guitry, Lucien Baroux, Jean Périer, Roger Bourdin, Robert Pizani, Jean Coquelin, Émile Drain, Jean Davy', null, 'The history of one of France''s most famous streets is retold, featuring multiple performances from Guitry himself.', 'The history of one of France''s most famous streets is retold, featuring multiple performances from Guitry himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiECwedeOQMoJQ4IMCu9MMv2f5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80126'),
  ('989075519362814077', 'Let''s Go with Pancho Villa!', 1936, 'War, Adventure, Drama', 'Fernando de Fuentes, Jack Draper, Miguel M. Delgado', 'Xavier Villaurrutia', 'Antonio R. Frausto, Domingo Soler, Manuel Tamés, Ramón Vallarino, Carlos López, Raúl de Anda, Rafael F. Muñoz, Alfonso Sánchez Tello', null, 'The 1910 Mexican Revolution is on its way when six brave peasants, known as "Los Leones de San Pablo", decide to join Pancho Villa''s army and help end the suffering in their community by assisting in the struggle. Together, they will endure the tragedies and hardships of a civil war.', 'The 1910 Mexican Revolution is on its way when six brave peasants, known as "Los Leones de San Pablo", decide to join Pancho Villa''s army and help end the suffering in their community by assisting in the struggle. Together, they will endure the tragedies and hardships of a civil war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KatkO75WxXPJW7mOGONdjPpSej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106266'),
  ('716102201586434668', 'Let''s Go, Jets!', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Hayato Kawai, Yasushi Hanamura, Sokoku Lee', 'Tamio Hayashi', 'Suzu Hirose, Ayami Nakajo, Yuki Amami, Hirona Yamazaki, Miu Tomita, Haruka Fukuhara, Mackenyu, Yurina Yanagi', null, 'Female students, including Hikari Tomonaga, from a high school cheerdance club follow strict instructions from their teacher Kaoruko Saotome. They compete at the USA Cheerdance Championship.', 'Female students, including Hikari Tomonaga, from a high school cheerdance club follow strict instructions from their teacher Kaoruko Saotome. They compete at the USA Cheerdance Championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpBFMeQ4SuaBxBiAKFGNmWXAa8m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434236'),
  ('861429230661713575', 'Let''s Hope It''s a Girl', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mario Monicelli, Camillo Bazzoni, Riccardo Milani', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi, Mario Monicelli', 'Liv Ullmann, Catherine Deneuve, Philippe Noiret, Giuliana De Sio, Stefania Sandrelli, Bernard Blier, Giuliano Gemma, Athina Cenci', null, 'A multifaceted exploration of the pointlessness of sexual stereotypes. Liv Ullmann is a countess who, after her divorce, takes over the family farm. Realizing that she can''t rely on the patriarchal society structure for assistance, Ullmann runs the farm herself with the help of her female servants and relatives. When the Count (Philipe Noiret) comes back into her life, he and his male buddies find themselves outclassed by the expertise of the ladies.', 'A multifaceted exploration of the pointlessness of sexual stereotypes. Liv Ullmann is a countess who, after her divorce, takes over the family farm. Realizing that she can''t rely on the patriarchal society structure for assistance, Ullmann runs the farm herself with the help of her female servants and relatives. When the Count (Philipe Noiret) comes back into her life, he and his male buddies find themselves outclassed by the expertise of the ladies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/321Txwbxxh22jf2IQvAbJgGi6KT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58011'),
  ('887322320725492024', 'Let''s Kill Uncle', 1966, 'Thriller, Horror', 'William Castle, Harold Lipstein', 'Mark Rodgers', 'Nigel Green, Mary Badham, Pat Cardi, Robert Pickering, Linda Lawson, Ref Sanchez, Nestor Paiva, William Castle', null, 'A 12-year-old orphan who has just inherited a fortune is trapped on an island with his uncle, a former British intelligence commander who intends to kill him. A young girl is the boy''s only ally against the sarcastic uncle, who uses hypnotism, a pool of sharks, fire, and poisonous mushrooms as weapons.', 'A 12-year-old orphan who has just inherited a fortune is trapped on an island with his uncle, a former British intelligence commander who intends to kill him. A young girl is the boy''s only ally against the sarcastic uncle, who uses hypnotism, a pool of sharks, fire, and poisonous mushrooms as weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5i1dZSvGzxt5hQ2YEpKDsoEso3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29390'),
  ('315377107717114966', 'Let''s Kill Ward''s Wife', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Scott Foley, Eduardo Barraza, Jeff Shiffman', 'Scott Foley', 'Donald Faison, Dagmara Dominczyk, Patrick Wilson, Scott Foley, Marika Domińczyk, Amy Acker, James Carpinello, Greg Grunberg', 'R', 'Everyone hates Ward’s wife and wants her dead, Ward most of all. But when his friends’ murderous fantasies turn into an (accidental) reality, they have to deal with a whole new set of problems — like how to dispose of the body and still make their 3 p.m. tee time.', 'Everyone hates Ward’s wife and wants her dead, Ward most of all. But when his friends’ murderous fantasies turn into an (accidental) reality, they have to deal with a whole new set of problems — like how to dispose of the body and still make their 3 p.m. tee time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6jwjS9mS4qBzhaA6ob4PUd9PJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300706'),
  ('915159898452216114', 'Let''s Make a Dirty Movie', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Pirès, Michael Seresin', 'Nicole de Buron', 'Claude Brasseur, Robert Castel, Nathalie Courval, Jean-Pierre Darras, Guy Marchand, Serge Marquand, André Pousse, Anémone', null, 'A bumbling film crew attempts to make a porno movie.', 'A bumbling film crew attempts to make a porno movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcdWBxaUBI5sTPQXjUqGPF5rQYM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79633'),
  ('236691047121938950', 'Let''s Make a Dream', 1936, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sacha Guitry, Georges Benoît', 'Sacha Guitry', 'Sacha Guitry, Jacqueline Delubac, Raimu, Andrée Guise, Robert Seller, Louis Kerly, Michel Simon, Arletty', null, 'A husband who has just cheated on his wife returns home in the early morning, puzzled. He finds there, without knowing it, the lover of his wife, to whom he confesses his infidelity.', 'A husband who has just cheated on his wife returns home in the early morning, puzzled. He finds there, without knowing it, the lover of his wife, to whom he confesses his infidelity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyjGPZcM4taOoJ3TVm3gZL4FmeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76694'),
  ('211445428513408165', 'Let''s Make a Grandson', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Piotr Wereśniak', 'Piotr Wereśniak', 'Małgorzata Kożuchowska, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Paweł Deląg, Joanna Żółkowska, Andrzej Grabowski, Katarzyna Bujakiewicz, Andrzej Zaborski, Wojciech Skibiński', null, 'To save the family land from a mysterious millionaire, a farmer hatches a plan to marry off his two children so they can take over the business.', 'To save the family land from a mysterious millionaire, a farmer hatches a plan to marry off his two children so they can take over the business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZwEHMasx5dMJjSbqvzo0o8zDDz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74922'),
  ('316172588451632088', 'Let''s Make It Clear', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Palmerini, Danilo Desideri, Luciano Salce', 'Franco Bucceri, Roberto Leoni', 'Johnny Dorelli, Eleonora Giorgi, Angelo Infanti, Janet Ågren, Giacomo Furia, Geoffrey Copleston, Milly D''Abbraccio, Michele Mirabella', null, 'The young manager of a small television station loses his sight following an accident. When he buys her back, thanks to a new accident, he discovers that his wife is cheating on him, that his best friend has sold the television and that the girl he was falling in love with is only an investigator of the insurance company.', 'The young manager of a small television station loses his sight following an accident. When he buys her back, thanks to a new accident, he discovers that his wife is cheating on him, that his best friend has sold the television and that the girl he was falling in love with is only an investigator of the insurance company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7aGa0Daidb5EKB0LH6D4TbXRPWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193067'),
  ('396022708385169511', 'Let''s Make It Legal', 1951, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Lucien Ballard, Richard Sale, Eli Dunn', 'F. Hugh Herbert, I. A. L. Diamond', 'Claudette Colbert, Macdonald Carey, Zachary Scott, Barbara Bates, Robert Wagner, Marilyn Monroe, Frank Cady, Harry Harvey', 'NR', 'A woman divorces her husband of 20 years because he gambles too much.', 'A woman divorces her husband of 20 years because he gambles too much.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z440UCgYVwPv3QyIVp9cH44wpKF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24002'),
  ('718934338883362880', 'Let''s Make Love', 1960, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Cukor, David S. Hall, Daniel L. Fapp', 'Norman Krasna', 'Marilyn Monroe, Yves Montand, Tony Randall, Frankie Vaughan, Wilfrid Hyde-White, David Burns, Michael David, Mara Lynn', 'NR', 'When billionaire Jean-Marc Clement learns that he is to be satirized in an off-Broadway revue, he passes himself off as an actor playing him in order to get closer to the beautiful star of the show, Amanda Dell.', 'When billionaire Jean-Marc Clement learns that he is to be satirized in an off-Broadway revue, he passes himself off as an actor playing him in order to get closer to the beautiful star of the show, Amanda Dell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzBniSVhbXrGTRmyAH0k276NFzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24014'),
  ('680210247228427430', 'Let''s Make Money', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Erwin Wagenhofer', null, 'Mark Mobius', null, 'Let’s Make Money is an Austrian documentary by Erwin Wagenhofer released in the year 2008. It is about aspects of the development of the world wide financial system.', 'Let’s Make Money is an Austrian documentary by Erwin Wagenhofer released in the year 2008. It is about aspects of the development of the world wide financial system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UdFLgX4Mqx8NJtvjdUkOF5cuDe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23368'),
  ('218045528232927582', 'Let''s Murder Like It''s 1999!', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie, Mystery', null, 'Leo McGuigan', 'April Martucci, Josie Juliette Wert, Angie holmes, John Hardy, Oliver Bartolomeo', 'TV-14', 'Laney is dreading her high school reunion because of a sad background. However, when classmates begin to die, she must find the perpetrator before she or her daughter become the next victim.', 'Laney is dreading her high school reunion because of a sad background. However, when classmates begin to die, she must find the perpetrator before she or her daughter become the next victim.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FzKX4FkJynl73SGBCioffF9vmJy2.jpg', 'plex:movie:lets-murder-like-its-1999'),
  ('6179137950313018', 'Let''s Not Get Angry', 1966, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Georges Lautner, Maurice Fellous, Claude Vital', 'Michel Audiard, Marcel Jullian, Georges Lautner', 'Lino Ventura, Jean Lefebvre, Michel Constantin, Mireille Darc, Tommy Duggan, Marcel Bernier, Thierry Thibaud, André Pousse', null, 'One-time gangster Antoine is enjoying retirement on the coast, now managing a boating club. He receives a visit from a former accomplice who asks for a loan. The money will be repaid by a crook who is now in hiding; Antoine intends to recover his money.', 'One-time gangster Antoine is enjoying retirement on the coast, now managing a boating club. He receives a visit from a former accomplice who asks for a loan. The money will be repaid by a crook who is now in hiding; Antoine intends to recover his money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gsHUKobJzRQWOo1NOrHY7M2Rae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33360'),
  ('477356008884347634', 'Let''s Rob the Bank', 1964, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jean Girault, Alain Gouze, André Germain', 'Jacques Vilfrid, Jean Girault', 'Louis de Funès, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Yvonne Clech, Anne Doat, Michel Tureau, Catherine Demongeot, Georges Wilson, Jean Lefebvre', null, 'Shopkeeper Victor Garnier has naively invested his family''s life savings in an African mine, on his banker''s recommendation. When the mine is nationalized, rendering the stock worthless, he considers himself shamelessly robbed by the bank; it seems only fair to him to return the ''favor'' and rob the bank, teaming up with the whole family as they were all duped. Even for professionals such an enterprise -he decides to dig a tunnel- is quite demanding, but for simple commoners it''s daunting, as they also have their personal downsides; thus Victor''s wife has a most unwelcome tendency to blurt out the truth, even to the grumpy local copper: a crazy risk when you need to keep a criminal plan secret.', 'Shopkeeper Victor Garnier has naively invested his family''s life savings in an African mine, on his banker''s recommendation. When the mine is nationalized, rendering the stock worthless, he considers himself shamelessly robbed by the bank; it seems only fair to him to return the ''favor'' and rob the bank, teaming up with the whole family as they were all duped. Even for professionals such an enterprise -he decides to dig a tunnel- is quite demanding, but for simple commoners it''s daunting, as they also have their personal downsides; thus Victor''s wife has a most unwelcome tendency to blurt out the truth, even to the grumpy local copper: a crazy risk when you need to keep a criminal plan secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cz7LwYjJCwjkPNC1Eid3hRK1dwE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57144'),
  ('92172861323447891', 'Let''s Scare Jessica to Death', 1971, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'John D. Hancock, Robert M. Baldwin', null, 'Zohra Lampert, Barton Heyman, Kevin O''Connor, Gretchen Corbett, Alan Manson, Mariclare Costello', 'PG', 'Newly released from a mental ward, Jessica hopes to return to life the way it was before her nervous breakdown. But when Jessica moves to a country house with her husband and a close friend, she finds a mysterious girl living in there. Jessica''s terror and paranoia resurface as evil forces surround her.', 'Newly released from a mental ward, Jessica hopes to return to life the way it was before her nervous breakdown. But when Jessica moves to a country house with her husband and a close friend, she finds a mysterious girl living in there. Jessica''s terror and paranoia resurface as evil forces surround her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vR8H0KSUYptRjheMjysyidpbPSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16154'),
  ('7955449856782476', 'Let''s Scare Julie', 2020, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Emily Schweber, Chuck Ozeas, Jud Cremata', 'Jud Cremata', 'Odessa A''zion, Isabel May, Brooke Sorenson, Jessica Sarah Flaum, Troy Leigh-Anne Johnson, Bill Timoney, Dakota Baccelli, Valorie Hubbard', 'NR', 'When a group of teen girls set out to scare the reclusive girl next door, what seems like a simple prank goes horribly wrong.', 'When a group of teen girls set out to scare the reclusive girl next door, what seems like a simple prank goes horribly wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1c7OsovY4s15sLp8AfzxR92fTCU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537736'),
  ('240654978088041435', 'Let''s Sin', 2014, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Onur Ünlü', 'Onur Ünlü', 'Serkan Keskin, Hazal Kaya, Öner Erkan, Büşra Pekin, Osman Sonant, Umut Kurt, Özgür Çevik, Serdar Orçin', null, 'Selman is a former boxer who once was interested in anthropology, an extraordinary imam who now works in a mosque. One day, while praying in the mosque, gunshots are echoed. One of the people inside collapses and dies. The police come to the scene and collect the first evidence and start the investigation process. He takes action after this event and decides to resolve the case through some people and circumstances he suspects. Every clue leads to an unexpected point and the events become increasingly mysterious.', 'Selman is a former boxer who once was interested in anthropology, an extraordinary imam who now works in a mosque. One day, while praying in the mosque, gunshots are echoed. One of the people inside collapses and dies. The police come to the scene and collect the first evidence and start the investigation process. He takes action after this event and decides to resolve the case through some people and circumstances he suspects. Every clue leads to an unexpected point and the events become increasingly mysterious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIoARCZEJA69wAkyOZWvZW4hRUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265351'),
  ('148016846936380638', 'Let''s Spend the Night Together', 1982, 'Documentary, Music', 'Hal Ashby, Caleb Deschanel, Gerald Feil', null, 'Mick Jagger, Charlie Watts, Bill Wyman, Keith Richards, Ronnie Wood', 'PG', 'The Rolling Stones'' record-breaking 1981 North American arena tour documented by director Hal Ashby. Featuring the biggest Rolling Stones songs from the first 20 years - in the words of Mick Jagger, "a feel of what it''s like to be there", as 20 cameras take you onstage with the band in this groundbreaking, dynamic tour.', 'The Rolling Stones'' record-breaking 1981 North American arena tour documented by director Hal Ashby. Featuring the biggest Rolling Stones songs from the first 20 years - in the words of Mick Jagger, "a feel of what it''s like to be there", as 20 cameras take you onstage with the band in this groundbreaking, dynamic tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/asaEIVlajTldqznHI8YA8AhS0Pe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85910'),
  ('1108064916754642396', 'Let''s Stay Friends', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Antonello Grimaldi, Maura Morales Bergmann', 'Raffaello Fusaro, Marco Martani', 'Michele Riondino, Alessandro Roja, Violante Placido, Sveva Alviti, Libero De Rienzo, Mirko Trovato, Ivano Marescotti, Lidia Vitale', null, 'Alessandro, a forty-year-old widower pediatrician, lives with his teenage son, leading a monotonous and insipid existence. After a call from an old friend in Brazil, the man has his tired stability tested.', 'Alessandro, a forty-year-old widower pediatrician, lives with his teenage son, leading a monotonous and insipid existence. After a call from an old friend in Brazil, the man has his tired stability tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZIq7oBI44kbjJ3vIDmhkNz46Hr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605507'),
  ('665021866390069949', 'Let''s Stick Together', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', 'Nick George, Al Bertino', 'Clarence Nash, Bill Thompson, June Foray', 'NR', 'Even with his long white beard and aching back, an aging Donald still has to make ends meet by lancing trash in the park. When he happens upon his old partner, an elderly honey bee named Spike, it conjures up memories of the good ol'' days.', 'Even with his long white beard and aching back, an aging Donald still has to make ends meet by lancing trash in the park. When he happens upon his old partner, an elderly honey bee named Spike, it conjures up memories of the good ol'' days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtCfbOtdhl0PSi8JbFG08tZfj3e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66989'),
  ('1039469458690531551', 'Let''s Talk About Men', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Lina Wertmüller, Ennio Guarnieri, Argo Suglia', 'Lina Wertmüller', 'Nino Manfredi, Luciana Paluzzi, Margaret Lee, Milena Vukotić, Patrizia De Clara, Giulio Coltellacci, Alfredo Bianchini, Sergio Ferranino', null, 'An industrial exploiter, an old knife thrower, a cynical professor, and an ungrateful husband depict the selfishness and superficiality of the male gender.', 'An industrial exploiter, an old knife thrower, a cynical professor, and an ungrateful husband depict the selfishness and superficiality of the male gender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l48UjvIukjo9FMLmIqk7a7KswkF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196213'),
  ('45482840721811100', 'Let''s Talk About Women', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Ettore Scola, Alessandro D''Eva, Guglielmo Ambrosi', 'Ruggero Maccari, Ettore Scola', 'Vittorio Gassman, Sylva Koscina, Antonella Lualdi, Eleonora Rossi Drago, Jeanne Valérie, Riccardo Garrone, Maria Fiore, Umberto D''Orsi', null, 'Vittorio Gassman stars as different characters in each of the nine episodes of this unusual Italian comedy. Playing everything from a practical joker to a prisoner, he comments upon romance, love and women in general.', 'Vittorio Gassman stars as different characters in each of the nine episodes of this unusual Italian comedy. Playing everything from a practical joker to a prisoner, he comments upon romance, love and women in general.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qw5l2yhkjlWvqfedzR41mA3eTbF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92601'),
  ('307774540815304070', 'Lethal Hostage', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Cheng Er, Du Jie, Xu Wei', 'Cheng Er', 'Sun Honglei, Wang Luodan, Zhang Mo, Ni Dahong, Yang Kun, Gao Ye, Chen Xi', null, 'Produced by Crazy Racer director Ning Hao, Lethal Hostage revolves around a drug dealer who falls in love with his hostage and decides to quit the business following one final deal.', 'Produced by Crazy Racer director Ning Hao, Lethal Hostage revolves around a drug dealer who falls in love with his hostage and decides to quit the business following one final deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evuYmHm5JqLNuKNeKhimaqZ81an.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128842'),
