  ('733094449456993070', 'Life', 2023, 'Drama', 'Kürşat Üresin, Cevahir Şahin, Burak Yılmaz', 'Zeki Demirkubuz', 'Miray Daner, Burak Dakak, Cem Davran, Umut Kurt, Melis Birkan, Osman Alkaş, Ozan Dağara, Doğu Demirkol', null, 'Hicran runs away from home when she is forced into an engagement with Rıza by her father. Rıza, who thinks that Hicran doesn''t want to be with him, doesn''t care at first. But when it begins to bother him, he decides to confront the situation and embarks on a long search for her in Istanbul.', 'Hicran runs away from home when she is forced into an engagement with Rıza by her father. Rıza, who thinks that Hicran doesn''t want to be with him, doesn''t care at first. But when it begins to bother him, he decides to confront the situation and embarks on a long search for her in Istanbul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ga6MOnxYa5e0bF30TJOsdqO1j18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:710277'),
  ('96640821824011595', 'Life 101', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Redge Mahaffey, Howard Wexler', 'Redge Mahaffey', 'Ami Dolenz, Keith Coogan, Corey Haim, Louis Mandylor, Michael Goodwin, Christina Chambers, Kyle Cody, Traci Adell', null, 'A college freshman Ramsy, played by Corey Haim experiences love for the first time in the 1960s when he asks out Joy, played by Ami Dolenz. An education of the heart.', 'A college freshman Ramsy, played by Corey Haim experiences love for the first time in the 1960s when he asks out Joy, played by Ami Dolenz. An education of the heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1A6T9oOF1d4gReMaxZWyRHEKSR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35126'),
  ('105139352219017748', 'Life According To Agfa', 1992, 'Drama', 'Assi Dayan, Yoav Kosh', 'Assi Dayan', 'Gila Almagor, Shuli Rand, Irit Frank, Ezra Kafri, Sharon Alexander, Avital Dicker, Smadar Kilchinsky, Akram Tillawi', null, 'The film takes place in Tel Aviv, much of it in a fictitious local pub called Barbie, a satirical nickname for a famous Israeli mental health institution. The pub''s name hints at the characters and the events which occur in the pub and which befall its owner (Daliah), the employees and customers. The plot unfolds with a streak of violence which takes a surprising turn.', 'The film takes place in Tel Aviv, much of it in a fictitious local pub called Barbie, a satirical nickname for a famous Israeli mental health institution. The pub''s name hints at the characters and the events which occur in the pub and which befall its owner (Daliah), the employees and customers. The plot unfolds with a streak of violence which takes a surprising turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxxpg69YGid9u47EdDqLLspyS1h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117495'),
