  ('832021719984065108', 'Life After Beth', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy, Horror', 'Jeff Baena, M. Ryan Traylor, Kristofer Kolpek', 'Jeff Baena', 'Aubrey Plaza, Dane DeHaan, John C. Reilly, Molly Shannon, Cheryl Hines, Paul Reiser, Matthew Gray Gubler, Anna Kendrick', 'R', 'Zach is devastated by the unexpected death of his girlfriend, Beth. When she mysteriously returns, he gets a second chance at love. Soon his whole world turns upside down...', 'Zach is devastated by the unexpected death of his girlfriend, Beth. When she mysteriously returns, he gets a second chance at love. Soon his whole world turns upside down...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZQ8LoU9SwSxSrmc3aOtHmruk26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244566'),
  ('1133132085927075947', 'Life After Fighting', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Bren Foster, Shane Parsons', 'Bren Foster', 'Bren Foster, Cassie Howarth, Luke Ford, Annabelle Stephenson, Anthony Nassif, Arielle Jean Foster, Eddie Arrazola, Ethan Browne', null, 'Retired martial arts world champion Alex Faulkner has settled into a simple life, when the disappearance of two of his students leads to an unthinkable discovery close to home. Just when all hope of finding the children is lost, he locates the imprisoned girls and unsurfaces an international child trafficking operation, which draws him back into the fight of his life against those behind it.', 'Retired martial arts world champion Alex Faulkner has settled into a simple life, when the disappearance of two of his students leads to an unthinkable discovery close to home. Just when all hope of finding the children is lost, he locates the imprisoned girls and unsurfaces an international child trafficking operation, which draws him back into the fight of his life against those behind it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcf965PrbcIjFO6n3IIrSv09thh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1289601'),
  ('89619507690448134', 'Life after killing', 2016, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Isabelle Czajka', 'Olivier Gorce, Pierre Chosson', 'Frédéric Pierrot, Valérie Karsenti, Samuel Arnold, Pierre-Félix Gravière, Pascal Rénéric, Éva Lallier, Eric Pucheu, Julie Moulier', null, 'Italian jeweller Matteo Belmonte and his wife Christine are robbed for the third time in the space of a few months. With Christine in danger, Matteo fires two shots. The robber Rufin dies at the feet of Romy, the couple''s daughter. Self-defense or not, Matteo has to learn how to survive after killing a man in front of his traumatised family.', 'Italian jeweller Matteo Belmonte and his wife Christine are robbed for the third time in the space of a few months. With Christine in danger, Matteo fires two shots. The robber Rufin dies at the feet of Romy, the couple''s daughter. Self-defense or not, Matteo has to learn how to survive after killing a man in front of his traumatised family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQmc5J2gkYQTLHGtlau39iA87Fs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437576'),
  ('273709311565355071', 'Life After People', 2008, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Chris Laine, David De Vries', 'David De Vries', 'Struan Rodger, John Anderson, David Brin, Bill Bruninga, Ron Chesser, Dr. Howard Oliver', null, 'In this special documentary that inspired a two-season television series, scientists and other experts speculate about what the Earth, animal life, and plant life might be like if, suddenly, humanity no longer existed, as well as the effect humanity''s disappearance might have on the artificial aspects of civilization.', 'In this special documentary that inspired a two-season television series, scientists and other experts speculate about what the Earth, animal life, and plant life might be like if, suddenly, humanity no longer existed, as well as the effect humanity''s disappearance might have on the artificial aspects of civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDeK0Oc3SsxbfKjXWKH8XIChcLA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23190'),
  ('1116419121421945385', 'Life Ahead', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Ricardo Torres', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Manuel Pilares', 'Analía Gadé, Fernando Fernán Gómez, José Isbert, Félix de Pomés, Manuel Alexandre, Rafael Bardem, Xan das Bolas, Manuel de Juan', null, 'Finished their careers of Law and Medicine, respectively, Antonio Redondo and Josefina Castro, a pair of young Spanish newlyweds, are looking for work to buy an apartment and start a life together, but they will face enormous difficulties throughout the process.', 'Finished their careers of Law and Medicine, respectively, Antonio Redondo and Josefina Castro, a pair of young Spanish newlyweds, are looking for work to buy an apartment and start a life together, but they will face enormous difficulties throughout the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRwtkuWAZLnLM0diCqh9I0Ctyhm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217300'),
  ('449797162150873997', 'Life and a Day', 2016, 'Drama', 'Omid Raeis Dana, Maziar Miri, Saeed Roustaee', 'Saeed Roustaee', 'Payman Maadi, Parinaz Izadyar, Navid Mohammadzadeh, Shabnam Moghadami, Rima Raminfar, Mahdi Gorbani, Masoumeh Rahmani, Shirin Yazdanbakhsh', null, 'Somaieh, the youngest daughter of an indigent family, is getting married and fear is overwhelming each and every member of the family regarding how to overcome their difficulties after she''s gone.', 'Somaieh, the youngest daughter of an indigent family, is getting married and fear is overwhelming each and every member of the family regarding how to overcome their difficulties after she''s gone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oy0KMmuGr3pnobRZo5eZSvlmtg9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391039'),
  ('1132677291047009120', 'Life and Amazing Aventures of Robinson Crusoe', 1973, 'Adventure', 'Stanislav Govorukhin, Oleg Martynov, R. Vatsik', 'Feliks Mironer', 'Leonid Kuravlyov, Irakli Khizanishvili, Yevgeni Zharikov, Aleksei Safonov, Vladimir Marenkov, Valentin Kulik, Vladlen Paulus, Ermengeld Konovalov', null, 'In the seventeenth century, Robinson Crusoe is shipwrecked on a desert island and is the only survivor. He takes steps to get food and shelter, hoping one day to be rescued. One day a band of black men arrive by boat and are about to execute one of their number; Crusoe saves him and drives them off, and names the man Friday, and teaches him Crusoe''s on language. They survive together, but will they ever be rescued?', 'In the seventeenth century, Robinson Crusoe is shipwrecked on a desert island and is the only survivor. He takes steps to get food and shelter, hoping one day to be rescued. One day a band of black men arrive by boat and are about to execute one of their number; Crusoe saves him and drives them off, and names the man Friday, and teaches him Crusoe''s on language. They survive together, but will they ever be rescued?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eaIpD7SfvfBCkNzvACTFEGfir2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129540'),
  ('830658950029330887', 'Life and Deaths of Max Linder', 2026, 'Biography, Comedy, Drama, History, Documentary', 'Edward Porembny, Joo Joostberens', 'Edward Porembny', 'Rémi Bichet, Adam Levý, Nadir Legrand, Mikołaj Adamczuk, Daniel Echaust', null, 'An exploration of the dazzling rise and mysterious downfall of Max Linder, the world''s first international film star and mentor to Charlie Chaplin. Blending rare archives with AI-crafted recreations, director Edward Porembny resurrects the glitter of the Belle Époque while uncovering the shadows behind Linder''s suicide.', 'An exploration of the dazzling rise and mysterious downfall of Max Linder, the world''s first international film star and mentor to Charlie Chaplin. Blending rare archives with AI-crafted recreations, director Edward Porembny resurrects the glitter of the Belle Époque while uncovering the shadows behind Linder''s suicide.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F3A608LzUya2kHDbQlNdW71Hv3nf.jpg', 'plex:movie:life-and-deaths-of-max-linder-2026-1'),
  ('390330866087386201', 'Life and Nothing But', 1989, 'War, Drama', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Bruno de Keyzer', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Jean Cosmos', 'Philippe Noiret, Sabine Azéma, Pascale Vignal, Maurice Barrier, François Perrot, Jean-Pol Dubois, Daniel Russo, Michel Duchaussoy', null, 'In 1920, Major Dellaplane, a man of honor and ethics, searches for missing French soldiers. He meets Madame Irène de Courtil, a politically connected Parisian, and their paths cross.', 'In 1920, Major Dellaplane, a man of honor and ethics, searches for missing French soldiers. He meets Madame Irène de Courtil, a politically connected Parisian, and their paths cross.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxyXttnO7UkKovpFo0QmxxgZNAP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41936'),
  ('677358049318552174', 'Life as a Fatal Sexually Transmitted Disease', 2000, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Edward Kłosiński, Zbigniew Gruz', 'Krzysztof Zanussi', 'Zbigniew Zapasiewicz, Krystyna Janda, Tadeusz Bradecki, Monika Krzywkowska, Paweł Okraska, Jerzy Radziwiłowicz, Szymon Bobrowski, Aleksander Fabisiak', null, 'Tomasz, a doctor, and atheist, is diagnosed with cancer. His ex-wife offers him the money for treatment in Paris, but his lung cancer is past the operating stage. Facing imminent death, he questions the beliefs he has held all his life and starts experimenting with both his own life and those of others.', 'Tomasz, a doctor, and atheist, is diagnosed with cancer. His ex-wife offers him the money for treatment in Paris, but his lung cancer is past the operating stage. Facing imminent death, he questions the beliefs he has held all his life and starts experimenting with both his own life and those of others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhDzfGYFIZIMBkHOFyVvqqg67SO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81219'),
  ('1130713569222580054', 'Life as a House', 2001, 'Drama', 'Irwin Winkler, Vilmos Zsigmond, Vincent Lascoumes', 'Mark Andrus', 'Kevin Kline, Hayden Christensen, Kristin Scott Thomas, Jena Malone, Mary Steenburgen, Ian Somerhalder, Jamey Sheridan, Scott Bakula', 'R', 'When a man is diagnosed with terminal cancer, he takes custody of his misanthropic teenage son, for whom quality time means getting high, engaging in small-time prostitution, and avoiding his father.', 'When a man is diagnosed with terminal cancer, he takes custody of his misanthropic teenage son, for whom quality time means getting high, engaging in small-time prostitution, and avoiding his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNFlcei9vWh5NCRTVrs52qDvUmq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11457'),
  ('735255122393131756', 'Life as It Should Be', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ruud Schuurman', 'Anna Pauwels', 'Barbara Sloesen, Jan Kooijman, Sanne Langelaar, Jelle de Jong, Renée Fokker, Julia Akkermans, Tom Van Landuyt, Patrick Stoof', null, 'Immediately after the birth of their first child, Iris'' friend Pieter confesses that he never wanted this child, has been having an affair for a year and will soon be leaving for Africa with his new love.', 'Immediately after the birth of their first child, Iris'' friend Pieter confesses that he never wanted this child, has been having an affair for a year and will soon be leaving for Africa with his new love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hsRLHScnQcdU3NP4SjVJTG03Cr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:719270'),
  ('1028256171884729827', 'Life As We Know It', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Andrew Dunn, Greg Berlanti, Michael Lerman', 'Ian Deitchman, Kristin Rusk Robinson', 'Katherine Heigl, Josh Duhamel, Josh Lucas, Alexis Clagett, Brynn Clagett, Brooke Clagett, Hayes MacArthur, Christina Hendricks', 'PG-13', 'After a disastrous first date for caterer Holly and network sports director Messer, all they have in common is a dislike for each other and their love for their goddaughter Sophie. But when they suddenly become all Sophie has in this world, Holly and Messer must set their differences aside. Juggling careers and social calendars, they''ll have to find common ground while living under the same roof.', 'After a disastrous first date for caterer Holly and network sports director Messer, all they have in common is a dislike for each other and their love for their goddaughter Sophie. But when they suddenly become all Sophie has in this world, Holly and Messer must set their differences aside. Juggling careers and social calendars, they''ll have to find common ground while living under the same roof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLzS2aOqKsS0QvEaY6SfBw4VBqh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38408'),
  ('755648225922116777', 'Life at the Top', 1965, 'Drama', 'Ted Kotcheff, Oswald Morris, Kip Gowans', 'Mordecai Richler', 'Laurence Harvey, Jean Simmons, Honor Blackman, Michael Craig, Donald Wolfit, Robert Morley, Margaret Johnston, Ambrosine Phillpotts', 'NR', 'Successful businessman Joe Lampton is married to the wealthy Susan, has two children, and lives in the mill town of Warley in northern England. But his career seems to have plateaued, leaving him disillusioned. This feeling is only exacerbated when he discovers his wife''s infidelity with local man Mark. So he takes up with attractive TV host Norah and moves with her to London, aiming to reignite the fire that drove him to the top.', 'Successful businessman Joe Lampton is married to the wealthy Susan, has two children, and lives in the mill town of Warley in northern England. But his career seems to have plateaued, leaving him disillusioned. This feeling is only exacerbated when he discovers his wife''s infidelity with local man Mark. So he takes up with attractive TV host Norah and moves with her to London, aiming to reignite the fire that drove him to the top.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFiw7OzNxiOQdeufFmvZe5Ojc5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118255'),
  ('564618627550976753', 'Life Beyond Me', 2017, 'Drama', 'Alexis Kavyrchine, Olivier Peyon, Romina Pelufo', 'Olivier Peyon, Cécilia Rouaud', 'Isabelle Carré, Ramzy Bedia, María Dupláa, Dylan Cortés, Virginia Méndez, Lucas Barreiro, Olivier Ruidavet, Flavio Quintana', null, 'It''s been four years since Sylvie''s son Felipe was abducted by his father Pablo after their divorce. Having been let down by the French officials who had succeeded in tracking both them down, only to let them escape again, Sylvie has now decided to take matters into her own hands.', 'It''s been four years since Sylvie''s son Felipe was abducted by his father Pablo after their divorce. Having been let down by the French officials who had succeeded in tracking both them down, only to let them escape again, Sylvie has now decided to take matters into her own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lW6hZRXWkZcT0t3yf8PmabNHGDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430007'),
  ('418608891841034134', 'Life Dances On', 1937, 'Drama, Romance', 'Julien Duvivier, Charles Dorat, Pierre Duvivier', 'Jean Sarment, Bernard Zimmer, Yves Mirande', 'Harry Baur, Marie Bell, Pierre Blanchar, Fernandel, Louis Jouvet, Raimu, Françoise Rosay, Pierre Alcover', null, 'After the death of her husband, Christine realizes she has possibly wasted her life by marrying him instead of the man towards whom, in her youth, she had a stronger inclination. To overcome these dreary thoughts, she decides to find out about him and the other men who danced with her during a ball that was a turning point in her life, many years ago. She pays a visit to those forgotten acquaintances one after the other; Christine is not only surprised to see how they have fared, but also discovers the impact she had, unknowingly, on the feelings and the destiny of these persons.', 'After the death of her husband, Christine realizes she has possibly wasted her life by marrying him instead of the man towards whom, in her youth, she had a stronger inclination. To overcome these dreary thoughts, she decides to find out about him and the other men who danced with her during a ball that was a turning point in her life, many years ago. She pays a visit to those forgotten acquaintances one after the other; Christine is not only surprised to see how they have fared, but also discovers the impact she had, unknowingly, on the feelings and the destiny of these persons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxnVhnnsD3KieXZei0CyWJfLhkb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92257'),
  ('282764162533845617', 'Life During Wartime', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Todd Solondz, Edward Lachman', 'Todd Solondz', 'Shirley Henderson, Michael Kenneth Williams, Ally Sheedy, Paul Reubens, Allison Janney, Michael Lerner, Dylan Riley Snyder, Ciarán Hinds', 'R', 'Friends, family, and lovers struggle to find love, forgiveness, and meaning in an almost war-torn world riddled with comedy and pathos.', 'Friends, family, and lovers struggle to find love, forgiveness, and meaning in an almost war-torn world riddled with comedy and pathos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXCuzXPqd21orMT59JbGV01VRMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39800'),
  ('700189917293442922', 'Life Eternal', 2015, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Wolfgang Murnberger, Peter von Haller', 'Wolfgang Murnberger, Josef Hader, Wolf Haas', 'Josef Hader, Tobias Moretti, Nora Waldstätten, Christopher Schärf, Roland Düringer, Margarethe Tiesel, Johannes Silberschneider, Hary Prinz', null, 'Brenner returns to Graz, the city where he grew up. When confronted with his old friends, his former girlfriend and the major sin he committed when he was young, murders and a fateful gunshot to the head result. After Brenner comes out of a coma, he begins to search for the person who tried to kill him - however, everybody claims that he himself is responsible. In the beginning Brenner was at the end of his rope, but he could face a new beginning in the end.', 'Brenner returns to Graz, the city where he grew up. When confronted with his old friends, his former girlfriend and the major sin he committed when he was young, murders and a fateful gunshot to the head result. After Brenner comes out of a coma, he begins to search for the person who tried to kill him - however, everybody claims that he himself is responsible. In the beginning Brenner was at the end of his rope, but he could face a new beginning in the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSQ9fgPwhZfcFKxChHjHrbEiDLm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277967'),
  ('251794349874602728', 'Life Feels Good', 2013, 'Drama', 'Maciej Pieprzyca, Paweł Dyllus', 'Maciej Pieprzyca', 'Dawid Ogrodnik, Kamil Tkacz, Dorota Kolak, Arkadiusz Jakubik, Anna Nehrebecka, Katarzyna Zawadzka, Helena Sujecka, Mikołaj Roznerski', null, 'Mateusz is an intelligent, romantic young man tragically trapped inside his own body, suffering from severe cerebral palsy that makes speech and controlled movement nearly impossible. Born into a loving family, Mateusz’s protected world is shattered when circumstances place him in an institution where he is misunderstood and mistreated. Featuring an astonishing, virtuoso lead performance, Life Feels Good beautifully recounts the true story of one man’s extraordinary efforts to endure in the face of impossible odds.', 'Mateusz is an intelligent, romantic young man tragically trapped inside his own body, suffering from severe cerebral palsy that makes speech and controlled movement nearly impossible. Born into a loving family, Mateusz’s protected world is shattered when circumstances place him in an institution where he is misunderstood and mistreated. Featuring an astonishing, virtuoso lead performance, Life Feels Good beautifully recounts the true story of one man’s extraordinary efforts to endure in the face of impossible odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbLgertKok0jUk83zrqZTN2OMtT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226437'),
  ('222963101882306870', 'Life for Life: Maximilian Kolbe', 1991, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Edward Kłosiński', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Jan Józef Szczepański', 'Christoph Waltz, Edward Żentara, Artur Barciś, Tadeusz Bradecki, Gustaw Lutkiewicz, Jerzy Stuhr, Andrzej Szczepkowski, Krzysztof Zaleski', null, 'The story of catholic saint Maximilian Kolbe (1894-1941), who volunteered to die in place of a stranger in the Nazi concentration camp of Auschwitz.', 'The story of catholic saint Maximilian Kolbe (1894-1941), who volunteered to die in place of a stranger in the Nazi concentration camp of Auschwitz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40k326IEGBbAtt81yRR8HlmWSSL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268253'),
  ('258197155269786403', 'Life for Real', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Dany Boon, Laurent Cavallotto, Mathilde Snodgrass', 'Dany Boon', 'Dany Boon, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Kad Merad, Caroline Anglade, Maxime Gasteuil, Aurore Clément, Gaël Raës, Tatiana Gousseff', null, 'Tridan Lagache has spent his whole life at Club Med, changing friends every 8 days. At 50, he resigns from the vacation spot where he was born, determined to track down his great mini-club childhood love, Violette. He shows up in Paris, naïve and lost but glad to be lodged by Louis, a half-brother he never knew he had. In order to be rid of the cumbersome Tridan, Louis passes one of his fling off as Violette, and Tridan, all emotional, thinks he recognizes her at first glance.', 'Tridan Lagache has spent his whole life at Club Med, changing friends every 8 days. At 50, he resigns from the vacation spot where he was born, determined to track down his great mini-club childhood love, Violette. He shows up in Paris, naïve and lost but glad to be lodged by Louis, a half-brother he never knew he had. In order to be rid of the cumbersome Tridan, Louis passes one of his fling off as Violette, and Tridan, all emotional, thinks he recognizes her at first glance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dQUdw5QlbuektUaIfPRbPXpaHq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:967370'),
  ('37426817122522213', 'Life for Ruth', 1962, 'Drama', 'Otto Heller, Basil Dearden', 'Janet Green, James McCormick', 'Michael Craig, Patrick McGoohan, Janet Munro, Paul Rogers, Malcolm Keen, Megs Jenkins, Michael Bryant, Leslie Sands', null, 'John Harris finds himself ostracized and placed on trial for allowing his daughter Ruth to die. His religious beliefs forbade him to give consent for a blood transfusion that would have saved her life. Doctor Brown is determined to seek justice for what he sees as the needless death of a young girl.', 'John Harris finds himself ostracized and placed on trial for allowing his daughter Ruth to die. His religious beliefs forbade him to give consent for a blood transfusion that would have saved her life. Doctor Brown is determined to seek justice for what he sees as the needless death of a young girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NXbrYsfbCF91LYG8QjuRCT18Ye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173937'),
  ('181065573893279285', 'Life Goes On', 1965, 'Drama', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Emilio Foriscot, Arturo González', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez', 'Lina Canalejas, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Gemma Cuervo, Milagros Leal, Agustín González, Francisco Pierrá, José Morales, Fernando Guillén', null, 'Madrid, Spain. Eloísa, a self-sacrificing wife and efficient mother, lives in the neighborhood of Maravillas with her husband, a violent policeman; her sanctimonious son, who spends his life studying and praying to atone for the sins of his family; and her two daughters, obsessed with wealth, who hate each other deeply.', 'Madrid, Spain. Eloísa, a self-sacrificing wife and efficient mother, lives in the neighborhood of Maravillas with her husband, a violent policeman; her sanctimonious son, who spends his life studying and praying to atone for the sins of his family; and her two daughters, obsessed with wealth, who hate each other deeply.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kc30bNd44EtN6Wq5qg9o2WbVNSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164283'),
  ('218475942007605709', 'Life Goes On', 1969, 'Drama, Music', 'Eugenio Martín, Juan Amorós, Andrés Vich', 'Miguel Rubio, Vicente Coello, Leonardo Martín', 'Julio Iglesias, Jean Harrington, Charo López, Micky, Florinda Chico, Mayrata O''Wisiedo, Andrés Pajares, William Layton', null, 'A promising goalkeeper of Real Madrid sees his chance when a teammate is injured and is summoned to replace him. But the misfortune is primed with him when an untimely car accident damaged her spine and is forced to give up that had to be the game of his life. Tired of so much bad luck, he retreats to a seaside hotel, where chance will go up to the stage.', 'A promising goalkeeper of Real Madrid sees his chance when a teammate is injured and is summoned to replace him. But the misfortune is primed with him when an untimely car accident damaged her spine and is forced to give up that had to be the game of his life. Tired of so much bad luck, he retreats to a seaside hotel, where chance will go up to the stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kPgXHUlsZ84CsNgOvyz0cLDIDi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130457'),
  ('944204755900417018', 'Life Hotel', 2024, 'Family, Drama', 'Bowen Liu', '姚冠辰, Bowen Liu', 'Huang Xuan, Liu Yan, Liu Yang, Zhang Zhehua, Dong Baoshi, Li Xiaochuan, Ge Si, Ren Luomin', null, 'The former "street gangster" Li Qingrang (Huang Xuan) is released from prison and re-employed in a series of obstacles, and his chance encounter with an old acquaintance Wang Daji (Dong Jewel), so that he carries a conspiracy to join the "Home for the Sick", which hides what unknown transactions? And what kind of thrilling story will he collide with the hot boss of Lai Fu Hotel (Liu Yan)? As conspiracies and conflicts continue to emerge, on the one hand there are patients who are more like family than those who spend time together, and on the other hand there is an old acquaintance who throws money-making olive branches, what should he do, and whether the "Home for the Sick" Lai Fu Hotel can be saved from danger. ......', 'The former "street gangster" Li Qingrang (Huang Xuan) is released from prison and re-employed in a series of obstacles, and his chance encounter with an old acquaintance Wang Daji (Dong Jewel), so that he carries a conspiracy to join the "Home for the Sick", which hides what unknown transactions? And what kind of thrilling story will he collide with the hot boss of Lai Fu Hotel (Liu Yan)? As conspiracies and conflicts continue to emerge, on the one hand there are patients who are more like family than those who spend time together, and on the other hand there is an old acquaintance who throws money-making olive branches, what should he do, and whether the "Home for the Sick" Lai Fu Hotel can be saved from danger. ......', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvAy5Zs11wL2T4Ms72hkHlyRWFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241476'),
  ('726971904080500422', 'Life in a Day', 2011, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Kevin Macdonald, Zillah Bowes, Cristina Bocchialini', null, 'Cindy Baer, Moica, Caryn Waechter, Drake Shannon', 'PG-13', 'A documentary shot by filmmakers all over the world that serves as a time capsule to show future generations what it was like to be alive on the 24th of July, 2010.', 'A documentary shot by filmmakers all over the world that serves as a time capsule to show future generations what it was like to be alive on the 24th of July, 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4Kze731McN2WkcN0OLwi1CMa8u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66150'),
  ('916805777533696815', 'Life in a Metro', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anurag Basu, Mujahid Raza, Anil Subramani', 'Anurag Basu', 'Kay Kay Menon, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Konkona Sen Sharma, Irrfan Khan, Shiney Ahuja, Sharman Joshi, Kangana Ranaut, Dharmendra', null, 'A group of Mumbai up-and-comers search for love and struggle for success in this ensemble drama that centers on an eager young call centre executive.', 'A group of Mumbai up-and-comers search for love and struggle for success in this ensemble drama that centers on an eager young call centre executive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fe3uLmtsGRgZAh9Yv4ZFHAyrV41.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20492'),
  ('347148753036595444', 'Life in a Tin', 1967, 'Animation', 'Bruno Bozzetto', 'Bruno Bozzetto', null, null, 'From being born until his death, a man spends most of his time "imprisoned" in boxes.', 'From being born until his death, a man spends most of his time "imprisoned" in boxes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nUXcBWnaMCb8rYwarlgMb05BWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227464'),
  ('126259550209820992', 'Life in Loops (A Megacities RMX)', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Wolfgang Thaler, Timo Novotny', 'Michael Glawogger, Timo Novotny', null, null, 'Timo Novotny labels his new project an experimental music documentary film, in a remix of the celebrated film Megacities (1997), a visually refined essay on the hidden faces of several world "megacities" by leading Austrian documentarist Michael Glawogger. Novotny complements 30 % of material taken straight from the film (and re-edited) with 70 % as yet unseen footage in which he blends original shots unused by Glawogger with his own sequences (shot by Megacities cameraman Wolfgang Thaler) from Tokyo. Alongside the Japanese metropolis, Life in Loops takes us right into the atmosphere of Mexico City, New York, Moscow and Bombay. This electrifying combination of fascinating film images and an equally compelling soundtrack from Sofa Surfers sets us off on a stunning audiovisual adventure across the continents. The film also makes an original contribution to the discussion on new trends in documentary filmmaking.', 'Timo Novotny labels his new project an experimental music documentary film, in a remix of the celebrated film Megacities (1997), a visually refined essay on the hidden faces of several world "megacities" by leading Austrian documentarist Michael Glawogger. Novotny complements 30 % of material taken straight from the film (and re-edited) with 70 % as yet unseen footage in which he blends original shots unused by Glawogger with his own sequences (shot by Megacities cameraman Wolfgang Thaler) from Tokyo. Alongside the Japanese metropolis, Life in Loops takes us right into the atmosphere of Mexico City, New York, Moscow and Bombay. This electrifying combination of fascinating film images and an equally compelling soundtrack from Sofa Surfers sets us off on a stunning audiovisual adventure across the continents. The film also makes an original contribution to the discussion on new trends in documentary filmmaking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ln81BRnPR2wqxuITZxEciCe1lc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8'),
  ('1016619870341329911', 'Life in Shadows', 1949, 'Drama, History, War', 'Lorenzo Llobet Gràcia, Pedro Lazaga Sabater, Salvador Torres Garriga', 'Lorenzo Llobet Gràcia, Victorio Aguado', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, María Dolores Pradera, Isabel de Pomés, Fernando Sancho, Alfonso Estela, Félix de Pomés, Graciela Crespo, Mary Santpere', null, 'The creative and ambitious Carlos, a young Spanish film buff, manages to become a professional camera operator with time and effort, and is also blessed with the love of Ana, which he has longed for; but the outbreak of the Civil War in 1936 changes everything for both of them.', 'The creative and ambitious Carlos, a young Spanish film buff, manages to become a professional camera operator with time and effort, and is also blessed with the love of Ana, which he has longed for; but the outbreak of the Civil War in 1936 changes everything for both of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ECmFA3D0ggzARCa78ZCLx0KE0w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180010'),
  ('520515118906511436', 'Life Is a Bed of Roses', 1983, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alain Resnais, Bruno Nuytten', 'Jean Gruault', 'Vittorio Gassman, Ruggero Raimondi, Fanny Ardant, Geraldine Chaplin, Sabine Azéma, Pierre Arditi, Robert Manuel, Martine Kelly', null, 'In this whimsical fable, Resnais deftly interweaves three story lines: the creation of an early-20th-century utopia; romantic high jinks at a school conference; and a fantasy sparked by F/X pioneer Georges Méliès.', 'In this whimsical fable, Resnais deftly interweaves three story lines: the creation of an early-20th-century utopia; romantic high jinks at a school conference; and a fantasy sparked by F/X pioneer Georges Méliès.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vazCrUC6EbzgZnDGGse0Wyt7G56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63978'),
  ('114708045887230465', 'Life Is a Bitch', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Dante Belluti, Julia Rezende', 'Fernando Ceylão', 'Marcelo Valle, Fabiula Nascimento, Débora Lamm, Sílvio Guindane, Otávio Augusto, Zezeh Barbosa, Paulo Carvalho, Laryssa Dias', null, 'Lonely, frustrated, and unable to do anything that gives meaning to their lives, Vladimir, Clivia, Regina and Primo trace an absurd plan: to kidnap a millionaire. Yet, they have no experience with crime or any notion of what this kind operation entails. As they take practical steps forward, their fears and ambitions are revealed.', 'Lonely, frustrated, and unable to do anything that gives meaning to their lives, Vladimir, Clivia, Regina and Primo trace an absurd plan: to kidnap a millionaire. Yet, they have no experience with crime or any notion of what this kind operation entails. As they take practical steps forward, their fears and ambitions are revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9U14Dip0WmvEUMrU8cCcqipoHZF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480714'),
  ('1084979681413674500', 'Life Is a Circus, Charlie Brown', 1980, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Phil Roman', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Michael Mandy, Brent Hauer, Casey Carlson, Rocky Reilly, Kristen Fullerton, Shannon Cohn, Christopher Donohoe, Bill Melendez', null, 'When the circus comes to town, Snoopy naturally pays a visit. There he falls for a beautiful poodle performing there. He soon runs away to join it. While he quickly becomes a star performer, Charlie Brown is distraught by Snoopy''s decision while Snoopy himself has to face some realities of show business himself.', 'When the circus comes to town, Snoopy naturally pays a visit. There he falls for a beautiful poodle performing there. He soon runs away to join it. While he quickly becomes a star performer, Charlie Brown is distraught by Snoopy''s decision while Snoopy himself has to face some realities of show business himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZcFoPHNtDZpdD3jn0stXUOl5Vk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68917'),
  ('40710740057298888', 'Life Is a Long Quiet River', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Étienne Chatiliez, Pascal Lebègue', 'Étienne Chatiliez, Florence Quentin', 'Benoît Magimel, Valérie Lalande, Catherine Hiegel, Daniel Gélin, Hélène Vincent, André Wilms, Christine Pignet, Maurice Mons', null, 'Two babies are switched at birth. When the mistake is discovered 12 years later, it leads to complications in the lives of both families. One family is affluent, with dutiful and (apparently) contented children. The other family is poor, with rambunctious (even delinquent) children, often hungry, but with lots of laughter in the house.', 'Two babies are switched at birth. When the mistake is discovered 12 years later, it leads to complications in the lives of both families. One family is affluent, with dutiful and (apparently) contented children. The other family is poor, with rambunctious (even delinquent) children, often hungry, but with lots of laughter in the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYLueszPL3jydtdyXY0f6rNeFA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4271'),
  ('703040734372416462', 'Life Is a Miracle', 2004, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Emir Kusturica, Michel Amathieu', 'Emir Kusturica, Ranko Božić', 'Slavko Štimac, Nataša Tapušković, Vesna Trivalić, Vuk Kostić, Aleksandar Berček, Stribor Kusturica, Mirjana Karanović, Nikola Kojo', null, 'Set during the Bosnian war in the early 1990s, Luka is a mild-mannered railway clerk whose life is turned upside down, not just by the outbreak of the war, but when his wife runs off with a local musician. Then Luka''s son is conscripted and eventually captured in the fighting. To recover his son, Luka is commanded to guard a pretty young Muslim nurse who will be used in a hostage swapping operation.', 'Set during the Bosnian war in the early 1990s, Luka is a mild-mannered railway clerk whose life is turned upside down, not just by the outbreak of the war, but when his wife runs off with a local musician. Then Luka''s son is conscripted and eventually captured in the fighting. To recover his son, Luka is commanded to guard a pretty young Muslim nurse who will be used in a hostage swapping operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyPG79yFyq0zj4qWXD2CkCj0nTJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20128'),
  ('462340494579001016', 'Life Is a Wonderful Thing', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Giorgio Melidoni, Vivien Russo', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina', 'Gigi Proietti, Vincenzo Salemme, Nancy Brilli, Maurizio Mattioli, Enrico Brignano, Luisa Ranieri, Emanuele Bosi, Virginie Marsan', null, 'A policeman who spies on the lives of others, an important banker married to a housewife who poses as a noblewoman. A precarious young masseuse and an electrician madly in love. Very different lives that end up intertwining. But also extremely complicated and troubled lives ... Even if, after all, life is a wonderful thing ...', 'A policeman who spies on the lives of others, an important banker married to a housewife who poses as a noblewoman. A precarious young masseuse and an electrician madly in love. Very different lives that end up intertwining. But also extremely complicated and troubled lives ... Even if, after all, life is a wonderful thing ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6NsLKL4bZcjd8g6BnIuc6TM5Zs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42882'),
  ('517622738543345436', 'Life Is All You Get', 1997, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Martin Kukula, Wolfgang Becker', 'Wolfgang Becker, Tom Tykwer', 'Jürgen Vogel, Christiane Paul, Ricky Tomlinson, Christina Papamichou, Martina Gedeck, Armin Rohde, Rebecca Hessing, Meret Becker', null, 'After he loses his job, his father, and his girlfriend, Jan''s life is a shambles. Then suddenly he meets freakish street musician Vera, and a bittersweet romance unfolds...', 'After he loses his job, his father, and his girlfriend, Jan''s life is a shambles. Then suddenly he meets freakish street musician Vera, and a bittersweet romance unfolds...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skb7jy7QHcIp09UCFTZ7iH1ZeZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10018'),
  ('127944248456207368', 'Life Is Beautiful', 1979, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Grigoriy Chukhray, Mikhail Bits, Luigi Kuveiller', null, 'Giancarlo Giannini, Ornella Muti, Otar Koberidze, Regimantas Adomaitis, Juozas Budraitis, Enzo Fiermonte, Stefano Madia, Yevgeni Lebedev', null, 'Antonio is a retired aviator in an unnamed country ruled by a military junta which violently suppresses any free thought. He falls in love with a member of the resistance against the dictatorship. He is arrested but escapes with his love. The code word among the resisters is: ‘Life is Beautiful’.', 'Antonio is a retired aviator in an unnamed country ruled by a military junta which violently suppresses any free thought. He falls in love with a member of the resistance against the dictatorship. He is arrested but escapes with his love. The code word among the resisters is: ‘Life is Beautiful’.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gc0oeVo7YQwilGfh8wKIWsWtQa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333270'),
  ('1039790740191729973', 'Life Is Beautiful', 1985, 'Drama', 'Boro Drašković', 'Boro Drašković, Maja Drašković', 'Rade Šerbedžija, Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić, Sonja Savić, Pavle Vuisić, Ljubiša Samardžić, Predrag Laković, Ivan Bekjarev, Tihomir Pleskonjić', null, 'After a train breaks down and the passengers are forced to spend a day at a remote country tavern, the mix of seasonal farm workers, transients, musicians, and would-be party kingpins heads toward some explosive moments. A truckload of chickens arrive to be killed and cooked for the unruly group of passengers, and when a few boorish men harass a female singer, their actions lead to unexpected violence.', 'After a train breaks down and the passengers are forced to spend a day at a remote country tavern, the mix of seasonal farm workers, transients, musicians, and would-be party kingpins heads toward some explosive moments. A truckload of chickens arrive to be killed and cooked for the unruly group of passengers, and when a few boorish men harass a female singer, their actions lead to unexpected violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBSdqIsg4W01hEdhpKSGe31ItNb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204341'),
  ('110712835623571767', 'Life Is Beautiful', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roberto Benigni, Tonino Delli Colli, Gianni Arduini', 'Roberto Benigni, Vincenzo Cerami', 'Roberto Benigni, Nicoletta Braschi, Giorgio Cantarini, Giustino Durano, Sergio Bini Bustric, Marisa Paredes, Horst Buchholz, Lidia Alfonsi', 'PG-13', 'A touching story of an Italian book seller of Jewish ancestry who lives in his own little fairy tale. His creative and happy life would come to an abrupt halt when his entire family is deported to a concentration camp during World War II. While locked up he tries to convince his son that the whole thing is just a game.', 'A touching story of an Italian book seller of Jewish ancestry who lives in his own little fairy tale. His creative and happy life would come to an abrupt halt when his entire family is deported to a concentration camp during World War II. While locked up he tries to convince his son that the whole thing is just a game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfnkSeeVOBVheuyn2lo4tfmOPQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637'),
  ('640715294416069259', 'Life Is Beautiful', 2022, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Baek Yoon-seuk, Kim Chang-ho, Choi Kook-hee', 'Bae Se-young', 'Ryu Seung-ryong, Yum Jung-ah, Park Se-wan, Ong Seong-wu, Shim Dal-gi, Ha Hyun-sang, Kim Da-in, Park Young-kyu', null, 'Suddenly learning she is terminally ill, Se-yeon asks her husband, Jin-bong the absurd task of helping her find her first love, and he unwillingly joins her search. Along their journey, Se-yeon and Jin-bong are reminded of the most glittering, beautiful moments of their lives.', 'Suddenly learning she is terminally ill, Se-yeon asks her husband, Jin-bong the absurd task of helping her find her first love, and he unwillingly joins her search. Along their journey, Se-yeon and Jin-bong are reminded of the most glittering, beautiful moments of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yV4cquqr4QxOMWJNAmwtAQ9xVoo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616670'),
  ('90911932714228720', 'Life is Beautiful When You Are in Love', 1971, 'Comedy, Family, Drama, Romance', 'Cahit Engin, Temel Gürsu', 'Hamdi Değirmencioğlu', 'Zeynep Değirmencioğlu, Sertan Acar, Ömer Dönmez, Münir Özkul, Semra Sar, Metin Serezli, Suna Pekuysal, Nedret Güvenç', null, 'A young girl comes to an embittered town and confronts its attitude with her determination to see the best in life.', 'A young girl comes to an embittered town and confronts its attitude with her determination to see the best in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMLt7tcVDX5kdXcs8eDzYQtsueg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587469'),
  ('1001822287199270627', 'Life Is But a Dream', 2022, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Action', 'Kim Min-jae, Kim Woo-hyung, Park Chan-wook', 'Park Chan-wook, Park Chan-kyong', 'Yoo Hai-jin, Kim Ok-bin, Park Jeong-min, Woo Sang-gi, Kwon Ji-hoon, Jeon Hyo-jeong, Park Su-beom, Monika', null, 'An undertaker digs up an abandoned grave to get wood to build a coffin for the savior of his village, but in doing so, he awakens the ghost of an ancient swordsman, and the ghost wants his coffin back.', 'An undertaker digs up an abandoned grave to get wood to build a coffin for the savior of his village, but in doing so, he awakens the ghost of an ancient swordsman, and the ghost wants his coffin back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26VTwZc1sLsRVT5Wl94T9qYZhNl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927286'),
  ('1073044130850687698', 'Life Is Cheap... But Toilet Paper Is Expensive', 1989, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Wayne Wang, Amir Mokri, Spencer Nakasako', 'Spencer Nakasako', 'Victor Wong, Lo Lieh, Lo Wei, Spencer Nakasako, Cora Miao, Allen Fong, Cheng Kwun-Min, Lam Chung', null, 'A man is hired by a group of people he believes to be gangsters to escort a briefcase from America to Hong Kong. When he arrives, however, his contact is nowhere to be found. With no further instructions, he decides to take in the sights of Hong Kong, which consist of him taking part in a great deal of blood, sex and general weirdness, all while wearing a briefcase handcuffed to his arm.', 'A man is hired by a group of people he believes to be gangsters to escort a briefcase from America to Hong Kong. When he arrives, however, his contact is nowhere to be found. With no further instructions, he decides to take in the sights of Hong Kong, which consist of him taking part in a great deal of blood, sex and general weirdness, all while wearing a briefcase handcuffed to his arm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKseQRgRxiTwfJ34y5JbV0W9Kjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215715'),
  ('668465143580295781', 'Life Is Flashing Before Your Eyes', 1984, 'Fantasy, Animation, Music', 'Vince Collins', null, null, null, 'Colorful hallucinogenic trip in a cartoon fantasy world, or, as Timothy Leary put it, "Cheery pop images and mellow lyrics".', 'Colorful hallucinogenic trip in a cartoon fantasy world, or, as Timothy Leary put it, "Cheery pop images and mellow lyrics".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwXeTizG8Wo2YT38MANwGHR772i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105943'),
  ('1088667361615998976', 'Life is Fruity', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Kenshi Fushihara', null, 'Kirin Kiki, Shuichi Tsubata, Hideko Tsubata', null, '90-year-old architect Shuichi Tsubata and his 87-year-old wife Hideko live in Aichi Prefecture. Their garden is bursting with 70 types of vegetables and 50 types of fruits, and they live in harmony with nature.', '90-year-old architect Shuichi Tsubata and his 87-year-old wife Hideko live in Aichi Prefecture. Their garden is bursting with 70 types of vegetables and 50 types of fruits, and they live in harmony with nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfRSUqz9G0lDdCzQiQm86d6jtSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512350'),
  ('342447057739748276', 'Life Is Life', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Riccardo Milani, Saverio Guarna, Simone D''Onofrio', 'Riccardo Milani, Michele Astori', 'Giuseppe Ignazio Loi, Virginia Raffaele, Aldo Baglio, Diego Abatantuono, Geppi Cucciari, Jacopo Cullin, Gabriele Cossu, Massimiliano Medda', null, 'An elderly shepherd takes on big business when he becomes the only holdout against property developers building a luxury resort in his tiny Sardinian village.', 'An elderly shepherd takes on big business when he becomes the only holdout against property developers building a luxury resort in his tiny Sardinian village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvaD0vZ78w3hFuEBGyhpEkmHUOS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1397375'),
  ('703031490134759094', 'Life Is Not for Cowards', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'André Erkau, The Chau Ngo', 'Gernot Gricksch', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Frederick Lau, Rosalie Thomass, Helen Woigk, Edin Hasanović, Nina Petri, Franz Dinda, Christine Schorn', null, 'After the sudden death of his wife, the lives of Markus Färber and his daughter Kim fall into disarray. Markus’ attempt to bring back normality into their everyday lives fails - he can’t let go of the past. 15 year-old Kim feels left alone with her feelings of guilt. But then she falls in love with the cool school dropout Alex. The two of them run off to Denmark to the place of Kim’s carefree childhood. Together with his mother Gerlinde and her cheerful home care Paula, Markus sets off in search of his daughter. A trip full of surprises and a journey back to life.', 'After the sudden death of his wife, the lives of Markus Färber and his daughter Kim fall into disarray. Markus’ attempt to bring back normality into their everyday lives fails - he can’t let go of the past. 15 year-old Kim feels left alone with her feelings of guilt. But then she falls in love with the cool school dropout Alex. The two of them run off to Denmark to the place of Kim’s carefree childhood. Together with his mother Gerlinde and her cheerful home care Paula, Markus sets off in search of his daughter. A trip full of surprises and a journey back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acgMlxoxb06t57SjLIeFmM2aGEa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130694'),
  ('982756820491742046', 'Life Is Ours', 1936, 'Drama, History', 'Jacques Becker, Jacques Brunius, Henri Cartier-Bresson', 'Jacques Becker, Jacques Brunius, Jean Renoir', 'Jean Dasté, Nadia Sibirskaïa, Gaston Modot, Madeleine Sologne, Vladimir Sokoloff, Gabrielle Fontan, Henri Pons, Charles Blavette', null, 'A propaganda film of the communist party of France, showing how the comrades help the proletariat against the capitalists.', 'A propaganda film of the communist party of France, showing how the comrades help the proletariat against the capitalists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iOZfvaqq8oDUJVP8lRhiWIvlqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45537'),
  ('1053925081711019638', 'Life Is Rosy', 1987, 'Music, Romance', 'Mwezé Ngangura, Benoît Lamy, Michel Baudour', 'Benoît Lamy, Maryse León García, Mwezé Ngangura', 'Papa Wemba, Landu Nzunzimbu Matshia, Bibi Krubwa, Kanko Kasongo, Lokinda Menji Feza, Kalimazi Lombume Riva, Mazaza Mukoko, Tumba Ayila', null, 'A young man with dreams of pursuing a career in music moves form his small village to the capital. Along the way he falls head over heels for a woman - the same woman his boss is also pursuing for his own reasons.', 'A young man with dreams of pursuing a career in music moves form his small village to the capital. Along the way he falls head over heels for a woman - the same woman his boss is also pursuing for his own reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWU6bdzk1vqmGhMTKixafxIEeBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202425'),
  ('1073352828988400245', 'Life Is Ruff', 2005, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family', 'Charles Haid, Matias Alvarez, Tobijah Tyler', 'Eddie Guzelian', 'Kyle Massey, Kay Panabaker, Mitchel Musso, Carter Jenkins, Mark Christopher Lawrence, Alesandra Durham, Judith Moreland, Ibrahim Abdel-Baaith', 'PG', 'Calvin Wheeler is a scheming 13-year-old boy with everything going for him, except for an original issue of his precious comic book collection. When a prized show-dog chases him down while skateboarding one day, his owner inadvertently convinces him to adopt and train a dog of his own. However the only one available, is an uncouth stray Labrador/St. Bernard-mix named Tyko from a local animal shelter, who proves to be more than anybody can handle.', 'Calvin Wheeler is a scheming 13-year-old boy with everything going for him, except for an original issue of his precious comic book collection. When a prized show-dog chases him down while skateboarding one day, his owner inadvertently convinces him to adopt and train a dog of his own. However the only one available, is an uncouth stray Labrador/St. Bernard-mix named Tyko from a local animal shelter, who proves to be more than anybody can handle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsEratlHP5R0o5YgczNHyXeo9Mz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160155'),
  ('171004239261531529', 'Life Is Sweet', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gus Maclean, Simon Moseley, David Gilchrist', 'Mike Leigh', 'Alison Steadman, Jim Broadbent, Timothy Spall, Claire Skinner, Jane Horrocks, David Thewlis, Moya Brady, Stephen Rea', 'R', 'Just north of London live Wendy, Andy, and their twenty-something twins, Natalie and Nicola. Wendy clerks in a shop, Andy is a cook who forever puts off home remodeling projects, Natalie is a plumber and Nicola is jobless. This film is about how they interact and play out family, conflict and love.', 'Just north of London live Wendy, Andy, and their twenty-something twins, Natalie and Nicola. Wendy clerks in a shop, Andy is a cook who forever puts off home remodeling projects, Natalie is a plumber and Nicola is jobless. This film is about how they interact and play out family, conflict and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdkKNQzzwyciP9vAohAPFZdujlA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36843'),
  ('279328467403874673', 'Life Is Tough, Eh Providence?', 1972, 'Western, Comedy', 'Giulio Petroni', 'Giulio Petroni, Antonino Marino, Piero Regnoli', 'Tomas Milian, Gregg Palmer, Janet Ågren, Maurice Poli, Giovanni Cianfriglia, Carla Mancini, Paul Müller, Stelio Candelli', null, 'An eccentric bounty hunter named Providence captures and sets free a criminal in order to collect the same bounty over and over again in different states, until they discover that a local sheriff is up to something crooked.', 'An eccentric bounty hunter named Providence captures and sets free a criminal in order to collect the same bounty over and over again in different states, until they discover that a local sheriff is up to something crooked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZOP7gJar5zgnmQ8TIKsuCSNqEV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112563'),
  ('228662596446124633', 'Life Itself', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Steve James, Dana Kupper', null, 'Stephen Stanton, Roger Ebert, Chaz Ebert, Ramin Bahrani, Richard Corliss, Nancy De Los Santos, Ava DuVernay, Bruce Elliot', 'R', 'The surprising and entertaining life of renowned film critic and social commentator Roger Ebert (1942-2013): his early days as a freewheeling bachelor and Pulitzer Prize winner, his famously contentious partnership with Gene Siskel, his life-altering marriage, and his brave and transcendent battle with cancer.', 'The surprising and entertaining life of renowned film critic and social commentator Roger Ebert (1942-2013): his early days as a freewheeling bachelor and Pulitzer Prize winner, his famously contentious partnership with Gene Siskel, his life-altering marriage, and his brave and transcendent battle with cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nK4cYTEO2eHLMgMII0Ux0kBOGhG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250766'),
  ('475157412414531053', 'Life Itself', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dan Fogelman, Brett Pawlak, Vincent Giarratano', 'Dan Fogelman', 'Oscar Isaac, Olivia Wilde, Annette Bening, Antonio Banderas, Samuel L. Jackson, Olivia Cooke, Mandy Patinkin, Jean Smart', 'R', 'As a young New York couple goes from college romance to marriage and the birth of their first child, the unexpected twists of their journey create reverberations that echo over continents and through lifetimes.', 'As a young New York couple goes from college romance to marriage and the birth of their first child, the unexpected twists of their journey create reverberations that echo over continents and through lifetimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pE2hxC8bPbIi9tGyhFg5xiFW6dA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446696'),
  ('1136188778019069895', 'Life Kills Me', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sebastián Silva, Waldo Salgado, Sergio Armstrong', 'Sebastián Silva, Pedro Peirano', 'Gabriel Díaz, Diego Muñoz, Claudia Celedón, Amparo Noguera, Catalina Saavedra, Ramón Llao, Alejandro Sieveking, Roberto Farías', null, 'Gaspar is a young, lonely cinematographer. Unable to deal with his sister and sick grandfather he spends his time with Susana, an actress working on a opera. When he meets Alvaro, an idealistic traveler, Gaspar''s life changes. They embark on a adventure that help them unearth the fragility and value of human existence', 'Gaspar is a young, lonely cinematographer. Unable to deal with his sister and sick grandfather he spends his time with Susana, an actress working on a opera. When he meets Alvaro, an idealistic traveler, Gaspar''s life changes. They embark on a adventure that help them unearth the fragility and value of human existence', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywZxFVW6QDrUK3VpUq8A8kK4SKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172263'),
  ('751922007451057148', 'Life Lessons', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Frédéric Sojcher, Daniel Baschieri, Philippe Pangrazzi', 'Alain Layrac', 'Agnès Jaoui, Jonathan Zaccaï, Géraldine Nakache, Stéphane Henon, Lise Lomi, Guillaume Douat, Célie Verger, Philippe Chatard', null, 'Noémie, an experienced screenwriter, meets up with Vincent, her first childhood love, at the film school where he is now the director. Through an extraordinary masterclass where intimacy rubs shoulders with the universal and reality flirts with fiction, Noémie will teach Vincent and his students that the art of writing a screenplay is the art of living passionately.', 'Noémie, an experienced screenwriter, meets up with Vincent, her first childhood love, at the film school where he is now the director. Through an extraordinary masterclass where intimacy rubs shoulders with the universal and reality flirts with fiction, Noémie will teach Vincent and his students that the art of writing a screenplay is the art of living passionately.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wg92fUpEqy6ymuld69dBbDa3Arv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958857'),
  ('1031142632427144988', 'Life Like', 2019, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Ben Goodman, Josh Janowicz', 'Josh Janowicz', 'Drew Van Acker, Addison Timlin, James D''Arcy, Steven Strait, Mark Famiglietti, Hilary Barraford, Nicholas Baroudi, Ellen Michelle Monohan', 'R', 'An idealistic attractive young couple acquires a stunning, life-like robot for guilt free help, but as the three grow closer, their perception of humanity will be altered forever.', 'An idealistic attractive young couple acquires a stunning, life-like robot for guilt free help, but as the three grow closer, their perception of humanity will be altered forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOVGbT6TR8qiZiruX66yBRXq9Nv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586707'),
  ('197123013354746591', 'Life Love Death', 1969, 'Drama', 'Claude Lelouch, Jean Collomb', null, 'Amidou, Caroline Cellier, Janine Magnan, Lisette Bersy, Marcel Bozzuffi, Pierre Zimmer, Sylvia Saurel, Denyse Roland', null, 'François Toledo, married businessman and father, falls head-over-heels in love with Janine, a work colleague. However, he is soon found out: after three dates, he strangles some prostitutes, when, the victim of blackmail, he becomes dishonored. He is taken to court, and sentenced to be killed by a guillotine.', 'François Toledo, married businessman and father, falls head-over-heels in love with Janine, a work colleague. However, he is soon found out: after three dates, he strangles some prostitutes, when, the victim of blackmail, he becomes dishonored. He is taken to court, and sentenced to be killed by a guillotine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0JIhxL5bRShoFqY3ySN5I9kq0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11666'),
  ('887663466072088092', 'Life of a King', 2013, 'Drama', 'Jake Goldberger, Mark Schwartzbard, Cory Johnson', 'David Scott, Jake Goldberger, Dan Wetzel', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Malcolm M. Mays, Kevin Hendricks, Alani iLongwe, LisaGay Hamilton, Dennis Haysbert, Rachae Amber Thomas, Richard T. Jones', 'PG-13', 'The true story of one man''s mission to give inner city kids of Washington DC something he never had - a future. After being incarcerated for eighteen years, Eugene Brown established the Big Chair Chess Club to get kids off the streets and working towards lives they never believed they were capable of. This is his inspirational story.', 'The true story of one man''s mission to give inner city kids of Washington DC something he never had - a future. After being incarcerated for eighteen years, Eugene Brown established the Big Chair Chess Club to get kids off the streets and working towards lives they never believed they were capable of. This is his inspirational story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kLHMO2f2eSNDhrhbuK7S47UXbb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201550'),
  ('571877145935858287', 'Life of an American Fireman', 1903, 'Action', 'Edwin S. Porter', null, 'Vivian Vaughan, James H. White, Arthur White, Edwin S. Porter', null, 'Porter''s sequential continuity editing links several shots to form a narrative of firemen responding to a house fire. They leave the station with their horse drawn pumper, arrive on the scene, and effect the safe rescue of a woman from the burning house. But wait, she tells them of her child yet asleep in the burning bedroom...', 'Porter''s sequential continuity editing links several shots to form a narrative of firemen responding to a house fire. They leave the station with their horse drawn pumper, arrive on the scene, and effect the safe rescue of a woman from the burning house. But wait, she tells them of her child yet asleep in the burning bedroom...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEGJ6hwsjwB844f9CMRjzHjZF0P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44341'),
  ('1100875372843684853', 'Life of Belle', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Shawn Robinson, Shawn Robinson', 'Shawn Robinson', 'Syrenne Robinson, Zachary Robinson, Sarah Mae Robinson, Matthew Robinson, Victor Mele, Suzanne Kilborn, Sarah Flory, Lilli Albert', null, 'This is the true story of how on July 18th, 2018 an 8 year old Annabelle Starnes went missing. What was found in the home would shock this small town of South Carolina.', 'This is the true story of how on July 18th, 2018 an 8 year old Annabelle Starnes went missing. What was found in the home would shock this small town of South Carolina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzZjCmum13xtqEGNZ9GUvrIlJoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1135281'),
  ('447079174424929544', 'Life of Brian', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Peter Biziou, Terry Jones, Mohammed Azounadhea', 'Terry Gilliam, John Cleese, Terry Jones', 'Graham Chapman, John Cleese, Terry Gilliam, Eric Idle, Terry Jones, Michael Palin, Terence Bayler, Carol Cleveland', 'R', 'Brian Cohen is an average young Jewish man, but through a series of ridiculous events, he gains a reputation as the Messiah. When he''s not dodging his followers or being scolded by his shrill mother, the hapless Brian has to contend with the pompous Pontius Pilate and acronym-obsessed members of a separatist movement. Rife with Monty Python''s signature absurdity, the tale finds Brian''s life paralleling Biblical lore, albeit with many more laughs.', 'Brian Cohen is an average young Jewish man, but through a series of ridiculous events, he gains a reputation as the Messiah. When he''s not dodging his followers or being scolded by his shrill mother, the hapless Brian has to contend with the pompous Pontius Pilate and acronym-obsessed members of a separatist movement. Rife with Monty Python''s signature absurdity, the tale finds Brian''s life paralleling Biblical lore, albeit with many more laughs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSSA64WF0M0BXnjwr2quMh6shCl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583'),
  ('582951018100310299', 'Life of Crime', 2013, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Daniel Schechter, Eric Alan Edwards, Marcos Gonzalez Palma', 'Daniel Schechter', 'Jennifer Aniston, John Hawkes, Yasiin Bey, Isla Fisher, Will Forte, Tim Robbins, Mark Boone Junior, Kevin Cannon', 'R', 'Two common criminals get more than they bargained for after kidnapping the wife of a corrupt real-estate developer who shows no interest in paying the $1 million dollar ransom for her safe return.', 'Two common criminals get more than they bargained for after kidnapping the wife of a corrupt real-estate developer who shows no interest in paying the $1 million dollar ransom for her safe return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apO5xGmcEHpdIBc3Zreax7MXl2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209189'),
  ('984877688762101122', 'Life of Crime: 1984-2020', 2021, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Jon Alpert, Jon Alpert', null, 'Robert Steffey, Freddie Rodriguez, Deliris Vasquez', 'R', 'An intimate documentary that looks at the vicious cycles of drug addiction and street crime in one of the roughest parts of New Jersey.', 'An intimate documentary that looks at the vicious cycles of drug addiction and street crime in one of the roughest parts of New Jersey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HwH3RTBB7mS3RjCyfKuxxqiySO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854345'),
  ('203118489080260357', 'Life of Pi', 2012, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Ang Lee, Claudio Miranda, Cliff Lanning', 'David Magee', 'Suraj Sharma, Irrfan Khan, Ayush Tandon, Gautam Belur, Adil Hussain, Tabu, Ayaan Khan, Mohd Abbas Khaleeli', 'PG', 'The story of an Indian boy named Pi, a zookeeper''s son who finds himself in the company of a hyena, zebra, orangutan, and a Bengal tiger after a shipwreck sets them adrift in the Pacific Ocean.', 'The story of an Indian boy named Pi, a zookeeper''s son who finds himself in the company of a hyena, zebra, orangutan, and a Bengal tiger after a shipwreck sets them adrift in the Pacific Ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLgRu4hhSr6V1uManX6ukDriiSc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87827'),
  ('494622239776531979', 'Life of Pleasure', 1944, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Albert Valentin', null, 'Albert Préjean, Claude Génia, Hélène Constant, Yolande Laffon, Claude Nollier, Aimé Clariond, Jean Servais, Maurice Escande', null, 'An aristocrat instigates divorce proceedings against his son-in-law, a commoner and the ex-owner of night club "La Vie de Plaisir".', 'An aristocrat instigates divorce proceedings against his son-in-law, a commoner and the ex-owner of night club "La Vie de Plaisir".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJulpyS6fPJoO2SCdH5LOcsQ6c5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257033'),
  ('84060627211390711', 'Life of Riley', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alain Resnais, Dominique Bouilleret', 'Jean-Marie Besset, Alex Réval, Laurent Herbiet', 'Sabine Azéma, Hippolyte Girardot, Caroline Silhol, Michel Vuillermoz, Sandrine Kiberlain, André Dussollier, Alba Gaïa Bellugi', null, 'In the midst of rehearsals for a new play, amateur dramatics proponents Colin and Kathryn receive the shattering news that their friend George is fatally ill and only has a few months to live.', 'In the midst of rehearsals for a new play, amateur dramatics proponents Colin and Kathryn receive the shattering news that their friend George is fatally ill and only has a few months to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHUjlwalflF0yyDazECwvr7Plk4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255824'),
  ('832726253992102298', 'Life of the Party', 2018, 'Comedy', 'James Roque Jr., Daniel Silverberg, Ben Falcone', 'Melissa McCarthy, Ben Falcone', 'Melissa McCarthy, Matt Walsh, Molly Gordon, Gillian Jacobs, Luke Benward, Maya Rudolph, Julie Bowen, Jacki Weaver', 'PG-13', 'When her husband suddenly dumps her, longtime dedicated housewife Deanna turns regret into re-set by going back to college... landing in the same class and school as her daughter, who''s not entirely sold on the idea. Plunging headlong into the campus experience, the increasingly outspoken Deanna – now Dee Rock – embraces freedom, fun, and frat boys on her own terms, finding her true self in a senior year no one ever expected.', 'When her husband suddenly dumps her, longtime dedicated housewife Deanna turns regret into re-set by going back to college... landing in the same class and school as her daughter, who''s not entirely sold on the idea. Plunging headlong into the campus experience, the increasingly outspoken Deanna – now Dee Rock – embraces freedom, fun, and frat boys on her own terms, finding her true self in a senior year no one ever expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/749iUAWQWeutQuTd9excjmigecw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399796'),
  ('744513889013450072', 'Life on a String', 1991, 'Drama', 'Chen Kaige, Gu Changwei', 'Chen Kaige', 'Liu Zhongyuan, Xu Qing, Huang Lei, Ma Ling, Yao Er-ga, Zhang Zhengyuan, Zhang Jinzhan, Ling Zhong', null, 'A blind man''s master told him that after he has broken 1000 strings on his Banjo, he can open the Banjo to get a script for his eyes. After 60 years he broke the 1000th string.', 'A blind man''s master told him that after he has broken 1000 strings on his Banjo, he can open the Banjo to get a script for his eyes. After 60 years he broke the 1000th string.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kUZ4oh2L8t4hfP986ykoRmAzSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41783'),
  ('476709259068900210', 'Life on Earth', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Abderrahmane Sissako, Jacques Besse', 'Abderrahmane Sissako', 'Abderrahmane Sissako, Nana Baby, Mohamed Sissako, Bourama Coulibaly, Keita Bina Gaousso, Mahamadou Dramé, Moussa Fofana, Keita Kagny', null, 'Just before the turn of the 21st century, Dramane, a Malian who lives in Paris, returns to his family''s African village to visit his father. After biking around the town, Dramane realizes how different and stagnated his village is compared to the ever-changing modern world, especially at the dawn of a new millennium. While home, Dramane strikes up a friendship with beautiful villager Nana, with whom he contemplates the future. The film earned Sissako awards at the Fribourg International Film Festival, the Ouagadougou Panafrican Film and Television Festival and the San Francisco International Film Festival.', 'Just before the turn of the 21st century, Dramane, a Malian who lives in Paris, returns to his family''s African village to visit his father. After biking around the town, Dramane realizes how different and stagnated his village is compared to the ever-changing modern world, especially at the dawn of a new millennium. While home, Dramane strikes up a friendship with beautiful villager Nana, with whom he contemplates the future. The film earned Sissako awards at the Fribourg International Film Festival, the Ouagadougou Panafrican Film and Television Festival and the San Francisco International Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atf9YMyOG7Qx6sngROXbzSHxYUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37855'),
  ('308858623938482843', 'Life on Seacrow Island', 1968, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Olle Hellbom, Kalle Bergholm', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Torsten Lilliecrona, Louise Edlind, Björn Söderbäck, Urban Strand, Stephen Lindholm, Bengt Eklund, Eva Stiberg, Maria Johansson', null, 'A writer spends the summer holidays with his children on an island. The family grows together through friendships with humans and animals and through adventures.', 'A writer spends the summer holidays with his children on an island. The family grows together through friendships with humans and animals and through adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfZaN8dLAwFojrqikAKXiQCk2sQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355659'),
  ('845458120476656786', 'Life on the Line', 2016, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'David Hackl, Brian Pearson, Justin Ludwig', 'Peter I. Horton, Primo Brown, Marvin Peart', 'John Travolta, Kate Bosworth, Devon Sawa, Julie Benz, Ryan Robbins, Matt Bellefleur, Gil Bellows, Reese Alexander', 'R', 'As a huge electrical storm sweeps towards Texas, lineman Beau Ginner is haunted by memories of his brother''s death by lightning years earlier. Since that tragic day, he has raised his niece Bailey and risen to foreman of a lineman team. However, there is friction when Bailey''s on-off boyfriend Duncan joins the crew, while another new recruit is hiding PTSD symptoms. Beau and his team are soon putting their lives at risk in a race to replace miles of power cables to keep the electrical grid running before the deadly lightning storm strikes. Based on a true story; this film is a tribute to the heroes who risk it all to keep us safe.', 'As a huge electrical storm sweeps towards Texas, lineman Beau Ginner is haunted by memories of his brother''s death by lightning years earlier. Since that tragic day, he has raised his niece Bailey and risen to foreman of a lineman team. However, there is friction when Bailey''s on-off boyfriend Duncan joins the crew, while another new recruit is hiding PTSD symptoms. Beau and his team are soon putting their lives at risk in a race to replace miles of power cables to keep the electrical grid running before the deadly lightning storm strikes. Based on a true story; this film is a tribute to the heroes who risk it all to keep us safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGGJJxcS1UA5hvZvQW0fOnn46tZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398289'),
  ('872655273816970173', 'Life or Something Like It', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Stephen Herek, Karen Margolese, Karl Herrmann', 'John Scott Shepherd, Dana Stevens', 'Angelina Jolie, Edward Burns, Tony Shalhoub, Christian Kane, Melissa Errico, Lisa Thornhill, Stockard Channing, Gregory Itzin', 'PG-13', 'A reporter Lanie Kerrigan interviews a psychic homeless man for a fluff piece about a football game''s score. Instead he tells her that her life has no meaning and is going to end in just a few days, which sparks her to action, trying to change the pattern of her life...', 'A reporter Lanie Kerrigan interviews a psychic homeless man for a fluff piece about a football game''s score. Instead he tells her that her life has no meaning and is going to end in just a few days, which sparks her to action, trying to change the pattern of her life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9lUSfCjv8jjNRSsmk65HEV1Pv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16643'),
  ('531576807787036377', 'Life Overtakes Me', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Kristine Samuelson, John Haptas, John Haptas', null, 'Henry Ascher, Nadja Hatem, Mikael Billing, Karl Sallin, Elizabeth Hultcrantz, Gellert Tamas, Anne-Liis von Knorring', null, 'Hundreds of refugee children in Sweden, who have fled with their families from extreme trauma, have become afflicted with ''uppgivenhetssyndrom,'' or Resignation Syndrome. Facing deportation, they withdraw from the world into a coma-like state, as if frozen, for months, or even years.', 'Hundreds of refugee children in Sweden, who have fled with their families from extreme trauma, have become afflicted with ''uppgivenhetssyndrom,'' or Resignation Syndrome. Facing deportation, they withdraw from the world into a coma-like state, as if frozen, for months, or even years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHO4wOw7u6B9yIzLuKf0UBO7GmO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593280'),
  ('134597388857041111', 'Life Partner', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Rumi Jaffery', 'Rumi Jaffery', 'Fardeen Khan, Govinda, Tusshar Kapoor, Genelia D''Souza, Prachi Desai, Amrita Rao, Shoma Anand, Darshan Jariwala', null, 'The film is about three close friends, each one having a different perspective about marriage. Govinda plays a divorce lawyer in the film who doesn''t believe in marriage and is a Casanova of sorts. Khan plays a character for whom being in love matters most and D''Souza plays his love interest. Kapoor plays a Gujarati who believes in the system of arranged marriage and Desai plays his Gujarati wife.', 'The film is about three close friends, each one having a different perspective about marriage. Govinda plays a divorce lawyer in the film who doesn''t believe in marriage and is a Casanova of sorts. Khan plays a character for whom being in love matters most and D''Souza plays his love interest. Kapoor plays a Gujarati who believes in the system of arranged marriage and Desai plays his Gujarati wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIbT3VZ1FrWuG0LmvQGQKWwTzq7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21263'),
  ('741645333535851431', 'Life Partners', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Susanna Fogel, Brian Burgoyne', 'Joni Lefkowitz, Susanna Fogel', 'Leighton Meester, Gillian Jacobs, Adam Brody, Gabourey Sidibe, Beth Dover, Abby Elliott, Kate McKinnon, Mark Feuerstein', 'R', 'A 29-year-old lawyer and her lesbian best friend experience a dramatic shift in their longtime bond after one enters a serious relationship.', 'A 29-year-old lawyer and her lesbian best friend experience a dramatic shift in their longtime bond after one enters a serious relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/434samTfccB2N7zl0saWp9ev5pL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260001'),
  ('248096702325701060', 'Life Risking Romance', 2016, 'Romance, Thriller, Comedy', 'Moon Dae-young, Song Min-gyu, Lee Hyung-bin', 'Song Min-gyu, Kim Ba-da', 'Ha Ji-won, Chun Jung-myung, Chen Bolin, Yoon So-hee, Oh Jung-se, Lee Da-in, Jung Hae-kyun, Kim Won-hae', null, 'Je-In is a mystery novel writer. She chases after a serial killer with her longtime friend Rok-Hwan. Rok-Hwan is a detective. A handsome and mysterious man, Jason, appears in front of them.', 'Je-In is a mystery novel writer. She chases after a serial killer with her longtime friend Rok-Hwan. Rok-Hwan is a detective. A handsome and mysterious man, Jason, appears in front of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKmGEVlhPwH0YMFFnfS3mwF1qPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431251'),
  ('383980887968663805', 'Life Sentence', 1979, 'Crime, Drama', 'Arturo Ripstein, Jorge Stahl Jr.', 'Arturo Ripstein, Vicente Leñero', 'Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Narciso Busquets, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Ana Ofelia Murguía, Roberto Cobo, Angélica Chain, Pilar Pellicer, Rodrigo Puebla', null, 'After being released from jail, "Tarzan" Lira seeks to rebuild his life as a bank employee. Unfortunately, it might not be as easy as he thinks.', 'After being released from jail, "Tarzan" Lira seeks to rebuild his life as a bank employee. Unfortunately, it might not be as easy as he thinks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHZ8fNxaOpWdEBwX0Xb09zWu51r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116988'),
  ('45538476240219351', 'Life Sentence', 2008, 'Drama', 'Davide Barletti, Lorenzo Conte', null, 'Claudio Santamaria, Valentina Cervi, Daniele Pilli, Giorgio Careccia, Ippolito Chiariello, Giancarlo Luce, Ugo Lops, Danilo De Summa', null, 'A college student gets caught up in a spiral that leads him to become a real Mafia godfather.', 'A college student gets caught up in a spiral that leads him to become a real Mafia godfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otaXvOc5X2gsw9BYlwIMzSZxY8k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99746'),
  ('946236686496422555', 'Life Size', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Luis García Berlanga, Alain Derobe', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Luis García Berlanga', 'Valentine Tessier, Michel Piccoli, Rada Rassimov, Michel Aumont, Lucienne Hamon, Queta Claver, Manuel Alexandre, Amparo Soler Leal', null, 'When Michel gets the life-sized sex doll he ordered, shipped directly from Japan, he is only intrigued by it at first. Then the silent unresponsiveness of the thing begins to haunt him, and he finds himself reacting to it as if it were an equally unresponsive living woman. As time passes, more and more of his life is spent trying to satisfy or placate its relentless silence, and he goes somewhat mad. He dresses the doll and takes it with him wherever he goes. When his usually very tolerant wife discovers what is going on, her jealousy knows no bounds and she attempts to imitate this threatening love-object. The light-hearted quality of this addle-pated fantasy darkens quickly when various neighborhood men attempt to put the doll to its originally intended use.', 'When Michel gets the life-sized sex doll he ordered, shipped directly from Japan, he is only intrigued by it at first. Then the silent unresponsiveness of the thing begins to haunt him, and he finds himself reacting to it as if it were an equally unresponsive living woman. As time passes, more and more of his life is spent trying to satisfy or placate its relentless silence, and he goes somewhat mad. He dresses the doll and takes it with him wherever he goes. When his usually very tolerant wife discovers what is going on, her jealousy knows no bounds and she attempts to imitate this threatening love-object. The light-hearted quality of this addle-pated fantasy darkens quickly when various neighborhood men attempt to put the doll to its originally intended use.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eLNTV4eW4xDyHZD9hRKIvfXRqR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105416'),
  ('139012504928824253', 'Life Smartphone', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chenglin Xie', 'Chenglin Xie', null, 'NR', 'The phenomenon of increasing smartphone addiction can be attributed to today''s cutting-edge technology. Staring at glowing screens instead of exploring the cast expanse of life, people are gradually alienating themselves from the richness, depth, and loneliness of life.', 'The phenomenon of increasing smartphone addiction can be attributed to today''s cutting-edge technology. Staring at glowing screens instead of exploring the cast expanse of life, people are gradually alienating themselves from the richness, depth, and loneliness of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cy89OAy51qbkyf6XkgrSdvXNEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379381'),
  ('798266142945093593', 'Life Stinks', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Mel Brooks, Steven Poster, Mitchell Bock', 'Mel Brooks, Rudy De Luca, Steve Haberman', 'Mel Brooks, Lesley Ann Warren, Jeffrey Tambor, Stuart Pankin, Michael Ensign, Howard Morris, Matthew Faison, Rudy De Luca', 'PG-13', 'Affluent and arrogant businessman Goddard Bolt, feuding with rival Vance Crasswell over a land deal, makes a bet with Crasswell that he has the wits and street smarts to live penniless and anonymous on the rough streets of Los Angeles for thirty days. But Bolt has a rude awakening when the reality of homelessness hits him. Still, he finds a silver lining in a burgeoning romance with Molly, a former Broadway dancer who has fallen on hard times.', 'Affluent and arrogant businessman Goddard Bolt, feuding with rival Vance Crasswell over a land deal, makes a bet with Crasswell that he has the wits and street smarts to live penniless and anonymous on the rough streets of Los Angeles for thirty days. But Bolt has a rude awakening when the reality of homelessness hits him. Still, he finds a silver lining in a burgeoning romance with Molly, a former Broadway dancer who has fallen on hard times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRyxlMbGQwONnN2Ez9ECMPVHxok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6524'),
  ('762060149157940842', 'Life the Way It Is', 1978, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau, Georgy Fodor', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau', 'María Luisa García, Lucien Plazanet, Marie Rivière, Jenny Bellay, Daniel Tarrare, Jacques Serres, Bernard Tiphaine, Janine Souchon', null, 'Agnes leaves school and moves with a friend to a housing project in Bagnolet. Engaged as a clerk, she becomes associate staff after the dismissal of a colleague.', 'Agnes leaves school and moves with a friend to a housing project in Bagnolet. Engaged as a clerk, she becomes associate staff after the dismissal of a colleague.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUSHDcjwbqC46IGyjEOsW2yNZAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122519'),
  ('470361316855566702', 'Life Together', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Clément Duhour, Robert Lefebvre, Jacques Poitrenaud', 'Sacha Guitry, Jean Martin', 'Fernandel, Jean Marais, Gérard Philipe, Louis de Funès, Pierre Brasseur, Danielle Darrieux, Sophie Desmarets, Edwige Feuillère', null, 'The writer Pierre Carot became rich and famous with his book "Life as a Couple", which was based on the loving relationships of four couples. Now he''s setting up his will and wants to leave his wealth to the couples among the four, which are still as deeply in love - if any: else, his companions get the money. He sends them out to visit the couples and test their love.', 'The writer Pierre Carot became rich and famous with his book "Life as a Couple", which was based on the loving relationships of four couples. Now he''s setting up his will and wants to leave his wealth to the couples among the four, which are still as deeply in love - if any: else, his companions get the money. He sends them out to visit the couples and test their love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8I4qhi8fuQohOL5nppfTWYdkjdT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78475'),
  ('658991266745948523', 'Life Upside Down', 1964, 'Drama', 'Alain Jessua, Jacques Robin, Christian de Chalonge', 'Alain Jessua', 'Charles Denner, Anna Gaylor, Guy Saint-Jean, Nicole Gueden, Yvonne Clech, Jean Yanne, Robert Bousquet, Nane Germon', null, 'A Paris real estate developer feels compelled to withdraw from his seemingly perfect life into a world of his own. Is the man going insane? By conventional standards, maybe, but it''s clear that the life he''s fleeing is madder still from his point of view, and since that point of view is unfailingly witty and astute, we even come to accept his delusions as more "real" than reality.', 'A Paris real estate developer feels compelled to withdraw from his seemingly perfect life into a world of his own. Is the man going insane? By conventional standards, maybe, but it''s clear that the life he''s fleeing is madder still from his point of view, and since that point of view is unfailingly witty and astute, we even come to accept his delusions as more "real" than reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEwRqVzVUiCkpA2p2EfE4PfduP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4182'),
  ('898824847505398628', 'Life with Father', 1947, 'Comedy, Family', 'Michael Curtiz, J. Peverell Marley, William V. Skall', 'Donald Ogden Stewart', 'William Powell, Irene Dunne, Elizabeth Taylor, Edmund Gwenn, Zasu Pitts, Jimmy Lydon, Emma Dunn, Moroni Olsen', 'NR', 'A straitlaced turn-of-the-century father presides over a family of boys and the mother who really rules the roost.', 'A straitlaced turn-of-the-century father presides over a family of boys and the mother who really rules the roost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6b7xRttshmonGW6xzSCDMrHMTjA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41465'),
  ('616300798947812423', 'Life with Feathers', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Sara Berner, Dave Barry', null, 'A spurned love bird tries to get Sylvester to put him out of his misery.', 'A spurned love bird tries to get Sylvester to put him out of his misery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHuhEGhDvT5kAxu1WY5VOTaGKsH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202613'),
  ('411892401136027637', 'Life with Mikey', 1993, 'Comedy, Family', 'James Lapine, Rob Hahn', 'Marc Lawrence', 'Michael J. Fox, Christina Vidal Mitchell, Nathan Lane, Victor Garber, David Krumholtz, Cyndi Lauper, David Huddleston, Frances Chaney', 'PG', 'Michael Chapman, a former child TV star, runs a struggling talent agency specilizing in child acts. When a young girl off the street puts on a real performance after he catches her picking his pocket, he may have just found the next big thing.', 'Michael Chapman, a former child TV star, runs a struggling talent agency specilizing in child acts. When a young girl off the street puts on a real performance after he catches her picking his pocket, he may have just found the next big thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKsvF5t5xsm17HG3GJzQQGJpJzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42580'),
  ('319196915944038042', 'Life with the Kids', 1990, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Dino Risi, Miro Viglianesi', 'Ennio De Concini, Dino Risi', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Monica Bellucci, Corinne Cléry, Laura Linguiti, Tamara Donà, Deborah Bettega, Riccardo Acerbi, Franco Belli', null, 'The story of one man dealing with an unexpected series of events, discovering his youth once again in the relationship with a much younger woman and finally coming to grips with his age, and the fact that he hasn''t been there for his family like he should have.', 'The story of one man dealing with an unexpected series of events, discovering his youth once again in the relationship with a much younger woman and finally coming to grips with his age, and the fact that he hasn''t been there for his family like he should have.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYak3OlVKeDTxRcaxqCJHzuPwsQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239067'),
  ('361657950456645620', 'Life with Tom', 1953, 'Comedy, Animation', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Paul Frees, Jerry Mann', 'NR', 'Tom reads Jerry''s best selling book, "Life with Tom" and experiences some flashbacks.', 'Tom reads Jerry''s best selling book, "Life with Tom" and experiences some flashbacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1txQIeIWEQbTm0VlpJJiKnQApqk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72000'),
  ('387211713472630900', 'Life Without Dick', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bix Skahill, James Glennon', 'Bix Skahill', 'Sarah Jessica Parker, Harry Connick Jr., Johnny Knoxville, Craig Ferguson, Teri Garr, Geoffrey Blake, John Eddins, Brigid Brannagh', 'PG-13', 'By accident, Colleen Gibson shoots and kills her gold-digging cheating boyfriend, Dick, a private eye who happens to have a hitman on his tail. Danny the hitman works for his brother-in-law, a cheerful but nasty Irish mobster, hasn''t actually killed anyone, and wants to be a singer. He falls for Colleen. she likes him, too. He can solve her problem (Dick''s body), she can solve his (meeting the mobster''s demands that he kill people like Dick). Danny has an ex-girlfriend, who might still hold the key to his heart, two cops are sniffing around for Dick, a junk yard owner gets a conscience, and a talent show is coming up. Bullets, music, and true love are set to collide.', 'By accident, Colleen Gibson shoots and kills her gold-digging cheating boyfriend, Dick, a private eye who happens to have a hitman on his tail. Danny the hitman works for his brother-in-law, a cheerful but nasty Irish mobster, hasn''t actually killed anyone, and wants to be a singer. He falls for Colleen. she likes him, too. He can solve her problem (Dick''s body), she can solve his (meeting the mobster''s demands that he kill people like Dick). Danny has an ex-girlfriend, who might still hold the key to his heart, two cops are sniffing around for Dick, a junk yard owner gets a conscience, and a talent show is coming up. Bullets, music, and true love are set to collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KrPJ2ogmY4oR5P29qrzyFdf6mR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31460'),
  ('1075631442227666154', 'Life Without Principle', 2011, 'Crime, Drama', 'Johnnie To, Cheng Siu-Keung, Albert Mak Kai-Kwong', 'Jeff Cheung Ka-Kit, Yau Nai-Hoi, Yip Tin-Shing', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Richie Jen, Myolie Wu Hang-Yee, Denise Ho Wan-Si, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Lo Hoi-Pang, Singh Hartihan Bitto, Tam Bing-Man', null, 'A criminal, a bank clerk and a police officer find their destinies entwined when a loan shark gets assaulted after having withdrawn $10 million from the bank in the midst of the world financial crisis.', 'A criminal, a bank clerk and a police officer find their destinies entwined when a loan shark gets assaulted after having withdrawn $10 million from the bank in the midst of the world financial crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daQarDx1ags9E5K6zqwGYbkSQWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90147'),
  ('815672637378107870', 'Life-Changing Ad', 2015, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Julie Lopes-Curval', 'Julie Lopes-Curval, Sophie Hiet', 'Alice Taglioni, Éric Caravaca, Emilien Mathey, Cédric Appietto, Claude Perron, Hélène Vincent, Christian Bouillette, Marc Citti', null, 'Annette, 38, answers an ad from Paul, a farmer. She has only met him twice when she and her son Eric move in with him in the dead of winter. There Annette has to face Paul''s hostile sister and her own past, which soon catches up with her.', 'Annette, 38, answers an ad from Paul, a farmer. She has only met him twice when she and her son Eric move in with him in the dead of winter. There Annette has to face Paul''s hostile sister and her own past, which soon catches up with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XN1pu3CK8ZQHg5ikLy7IqhiBVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383705'),
  ('988596267896482024', 'Life-Size', 2000, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Mark Rosman, Philip Linzey', 'Mark Rosman, Stephanie Moore', 'Lindsay Lohan, Tyra Banks, Jere Burns, Anne Marie DeLuise, Garwin Sanford, Tom Butler, Jillian Fargey, Katelyn Wallace', 'PG', 'Sad and lonely after the death of her mother, Casey would do anything to see her again. But when a series of mystic mishaps mistakenly brings her fashion doll “Eve” to life instead, it changes Casey’s world forever!', 'Sad and lonely after the death of her mother, Casey would do anything to see her again. But when a series of mystic mishaps mistakenly brings her fashion doll “Eve” to life instead, it changes Casey’s world forever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kS91p5rwK0A0VGmBISVWK6O3So5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36968'),
  ('656491438586950787', 'Life-Size 2', 2018, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Steven K. Tsuchida, Sara Hartman, Sean Bozeman', 'Cameron Fay, Stacey Harman', 'Tyra Banks, Francia Raísa, Gavin Stenhouse, Hank Chen, Alison Fernández, Shanica Knowles, Elisa Lau, Nina Leon', null, 'Grace Manning is in the middle of her quarter-life crisis, realizing she is in over her head as CEO. To make matters worse, her wild-child ways are causing the company’s stock to plummet. With the help of her young next-door neighbor, Grace’s old Eve doll magically awakens to help get Grace back on track and give her the confidence to be the woman and leader Eve knows Grace can be.', 'Grace Manning is in the middle of her quarter-life crisis, realizing she is in over her head as CEO. To make matters worse, her wild-child ways are causing the company’s stock to plummet. With the help of her young next-door neighbor, Grace’s old Eve doll magically awakens to help get Grace back on track and give her the confidence to be the woman and leader Eve knows Grace can be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tPVZWZ13fWuWZRaZv3TyM7ilaw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500284'),
  ('336830197880611533', 'Life, and Nothing More…', 1992, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Abbas Kiarostami, Hassen Afakrimi, Behram Kadhemi', 'Abbas Kiarostami', 'Farhad Kheradmand, Buba Bayour, Hossein Rezai, Hocine Rifahi, Ferhendeh Feydi, Mahrem Feydi, Bahrovz Aydini, Ziya Babai', null, 'After the earthquake of Guilan, a film director and his son travel to the devastated area to search for the actors from the movie the director made there a few years previously. In their search, they see how people who have lost everything in the earthquake still have hope and try to live life to the fullest.', 'After the earthquake of Guilan, a film director and his son travel to the devastated area to search for the actors from the movie the director made there a few years previously. In their search, they see how people who have lost everything in the earthquake still have hope and try to live life to the fullest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/100CuZjqxtcbDvZ5qPsoi1VEU5n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83761'),
  ('278361847632853897', 'Life, Animated', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Roger Ross Williams, Thomas Bergmann', null, 'Owen Suskind, Ron Suskind, Jonathan Freeman, Gilbert Gottfried', 'PG', 'At three years old, a chatty, energetic little boy named Owen Suskind ceased to speak, disappearing into autism with apparently no way out. Almost four years passed and the only stimuli that engaged Owen were Disney films. Then one day, his father donned a puppet—Iago, the wisecracking parrot from Aladdin—and asked “what’s it like to be you?” And poof! Owen replied, with dialogue from the movie. Life, Animated tells the remarkable story of how Owen found in Disney animation a pathway to language and a framework for making sense of the world.', 'At three years old, a chatty, energetic little boy named Owen Suskind ceased to speak, disappearing into autism with apparently no way out. Almost four years passed and the only stimuli that engaged Owen were Disney films. Then one day, his father donned a puppet—Iago, the wisecracking parrot from Aladdin—and asked “what’s it like to be you?” And poof! Owen replied, with dialogue from the movie. Life, Animated tells the remarkable story of how Owen found in Disney animation a pathway to language and a framework for making sense of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAbgluMr621IDx0fvyzVOYtAhEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376233'),
  ('340032982250093730', 'Life''s A Beach', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Gennaro Nunziante, Agostino Castiglioni, Marco Limberti', 'Pio D''Antini, Amedeo Grieco, Gennaro Nunziante', 'Pio D''Antini, Amedeo Grieco, Francesca Valtorta, Nicola Rignanese, Christina Andrea Rosamilia, Claudio Bigagli, Rodolfo Corsato, Angelo Duro', null, 'The lawyer Pio has the personality of an earthworm. The priest assigns him, as a driver, the rather prejudiced Amedeo, rough manners and unlikely clothes. The second will wake up the first.', 'The lawyer Pio has the personality of an earthworm. The priest assigns him, as a driver, the rather prejudiced Amedeo, rough manners and unlikely clothes. The second will wake up the first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFsWwmLMJQmRw9jIbKaTQmjM8uX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1122517'),
