  ('384635711716079123', 'Lifeform', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'James Glennon, Mark H. Baker', 'Mark H. Baker', 'Cotter Smith, Deirdre O''Connell, Robert Wisdom, Ryan Phillippe, Raoul O''Connell, Carlos Carrasco, Leland Orser, Kevin Cooney', 'R', 'When the Viking space capsule suddenly returns to Earth from its long ago trip to Mars, it brings with it an intelligent visitor that is part "Alien" and part "ET". Encased in armor, it extends a human like form from its shell to examine its surroundings and shows an interest in humans including a soft caress of a female scientist prior to the Army killing it. This only enrages its sibling.', 'When the Viking space capsule suddenly returns to Earth from its long ago trip to Mars, it brings with it an intelligent visitor that is part "Alien" and part "ET". Encased in armor, it extends a human like form from its shell to examine its surroundings and shows an interest in humans including a soft caress of a female scientist prior to the Army killing it. This only enrages its sibling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPUZUV6sQFfLo4v7F7pXnLcrZc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128612'),
  ('144357997016675460', 'Lifeguard', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel Petrie, Ralph Woolsey, Richard Kobritz', 'Ron Koslow', 'Sam Elliott, Stephen Young, Anne Archer, Parker Stevenson, Kathleen Quinlan, Sharon Clark, Steve Burns, Lenka Peterson', 'PG', 'Rick is a Los Angeles County lifeguard who is in his thirties. At his 15-year high school reunion, he sees his old girlfriend who is now a divorced mother. After falling in love with her, Rick considers changing his career and lifestyle.', 'Rick is a Los Angeles County lifeguard who is in his thirties. At his 15-year high school reunion, he sees his old girlfriend who is now a divorced mother. After falling in love with her, Rick considers changing his career and lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8vhmXoJhUfc7iVXO3VEskXDKgK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5002'),
  ('791359398508647214', 'Lifeline', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'To Hung-Mo, Cheng Siu-Keung, Johnnie To', 'Yau Nai-Hoi', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Carman Lee Yeuk-Tung, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Ruby Wong Cheuk-Ling, Raymond Ho-Yin Wong, Chan Man-Lei, Yuen Bun', null, 'A heroic but cocky firefighter pays no regard to the dangers of the job but lacks the courage to face his personal demons. When faced with a giant and volatile inferno, he must put aside personal differences with his boss if they are both to survive.', 'A heroic but cocky firefighter pays no regard to the dangers of the job but lacks the courage to face his personal demons. When faced with a giant and volatile inferno, he must put aside personal differences with his boss if they are both to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QUI0mvYQqPsld6uswTcOeYYdpc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118442'),
  ('948286360263493817', 'Lifemark', 2022, 'Drama', 'Beverly Holloway, Bob Scott, Kevin Peeples', 'Kevin Peeples, Stephen Kendrick, Alex Kendrick', 'Raphael Ruggero, Kirk Cameron, Dawn Long, Rebecca Rogers, Alex Kendrick, Marisa Lynae Hampton, Isabelle Almoyan, Lowrey Brown', 'PG-13', 'David''s comfortable world is turned upside down when his birth mother Melissa unexpectedly reaches out, longing to meet the eighteen year old son she''s only held once.', 'David''s comfortable world is turned upside down when his birth mother Melissa unexpectedly reaches out, longing to meet the eighteen year old son she''s only held once.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGdXvXhbVO4a9ej3G8IE76wZK3m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975407'),
  ('179165124940320523', 'Lifepod', 1981, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Bruce Bryant, Steve Dubin, Barbara Minkus', 'Bruce Bryant, Carol Johnsen', 'Joe Penny, Kristine DeBell, Carl Lumbly, Sandy Kenyon, Jordan Michals, Christopher Cary, Neil Ross, Patti Glick', 'NR', 'The first interplanetary cruise ship malfunctions halfway to Jupiter, forcing most of the crew and passengers to abandon ship. A handful of people are trapped onboard.', 'The first interplanetary cruise ship malfunctions halfway to Jupiter, forcing most of the crew and passengers to abandon ship. A handful of people are trapped onboard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fd7ouL4P2xDgwW8ax7b89xCHgmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438807'),
  ('40081657283664474', 'Lifepod', 1993, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Ron Silver, Robert Steadman', 'Jay Roach, Pen Densham', 'Robert Loggia, Jessica Tuck, Ron Silver, Ed Gale, Stan Shaw, Adam Storke, Kelli Williams, CCH Pounder', null, 'Lifepod cronicles the trip of eight passengers after the ship they were traveling on blew up on Christmas Eve. Immediately people start dying. The passengers begin to investigate why the ship blew up and how it relates to them', 'Lifepod cronicles the trip of eight passengers after the ship they were traveling on blew up on Christmas Eve. Immediately people start dying. The passengers begin to investigate why the ship blew up and how it relates to them', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pn2ppzJPwHbe7APDEQyCbqXIlrc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19553'),
  ('421041399468626981', 'Lifespan', 1975, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Sandy Whitelaw, Olga Madsen, Eva van der Voort', 'Sandy Whitelaw, Judith Rascoe', 'Hiram Keller, Tina Aumont, Klaus Kinski, Fons Rademakers, Eric Schneider, Frans Mulder, Lyda Polak, Joan Remmelts', null, 'Cult icon Klaus Kinski features in this dark and intriguing existential thriller. He plays the mysterious "Swiss Man" - ruthless industrialist Nicolas Ulrich - who is obsessed with a search for the elixir of life. He tricks a young American scientist into joining him on his demonic quest. A quest that ends in suicide, death and madness. The story takes place in the atmospheric European city of Amsterdam. Its winding alleys and ancient canals trap the characters in a labyrinthine maze as they find themselves manipulated like figures on a giant chess board.', 'Cult icon Klaus Kinski features in this dark and intriguing existential thriller. He plays the mysterious "Swiss Man" - ruthless industrialist Nicolas Ulrich - who is obsessed with a search for the elixir of life. He tricks a young American scientist into joining him on his demonic quest. A quest that ends in suicide, death and madness. The story takes place in the atmospheric European city of Amsterdam. Its winding alleys and ancient canals trap the characters in a labyrinthine maze as they find themselves manipulated like figures on a giant chess board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYpKL0tsohNYTWgLDGziTIwaH8v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109150'),
