  ('666077920102290503', 'Lifted', 2006, 'Family, Animation, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Gary Rydstrom', 'Gary Rydstrom', null, 'G', 'When an overconfident teen alien gets behind the controls of a spaceship, he must attempt to abduct a slumbering farmer under the watchful eye of a critical instructor. But abducting humans requires precision and a gentle touch, and within a few missteps it''s painfully clear why more humans don''t go missing every year.', 'When an overconfident teen alien gets behind the controls of a spaceship, he must attempt to abduct a slumbering farmer under the watchful eye of a critical instructor. But abducting humans requires precision and a gentle touch, and within a few missteps it''s painfully clear why more humans don''t go missing every year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mh7VBbGPbGEITEPSSyRWQVO6HVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13060'),
