  ('851427641887716338', 'Light Gradient', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Bernadette Paaßen, Jan Krüger', 'Jan Krüger', 'Sebastian Schlecht, Eric Golub, Iris Minich, Denis Alevi, Rainer Winkelvoss, Bianca Wiedersich', null, 'Two young men, Johann and Robin, take a trip into the countryside. The more they walk the forests of Brandenburg, the stranger their adventure becomes. Bikes disappear, maps prove useless – and each gets to know a new side of the other.', 'Two young men, Johann and Robin, take a trip into the countryside. The more they walk the forests of Brandenburg, the stranger their adventure becomes. Bikes disappear, maps prove useless – and each gets to know a new side of the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTd401mToVnDEoae7iFTjraZxa0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165027'),
  ('807507734805854566', 'Light in the Piazza', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'Guy Green, Otto Heller, Mario Nascimbene', 'Julius J. Epstein', 'Olivia de Havilland, Rossano Brazzi, Yvette Mimieux, George Hamilton, Isabel Dean, Moultrie Kelsall, Nancy Nevinson, Barry Sullivan', null, 'A young American woman traveling in Italy with her mother is slender, blonde, beautiful and there is something charmingly naive about her. Fabrizio Naccarelli seems to always know where the mother and daughter will sightsee next. Signor Naccarelli is just as concerned about where this will lead as Mrs. Johnson is. Then she starts thinking that perhaps her daughter can be a wife of a wealthy young man in a society where all she has to do is look beautiful. What happens if Signor Naccarelli finds out who his prospective daughter-in-law really is?', 'A young American woman traveling in Italy with her mother is slender, blonde, beautiful and there is something charmingly naive about her. Fabrizio Naccarelli seems to always know where the mother and daughter will sightsee next. Signor Naccarelli is just as concerned about where this will lead as Mrs. Johnson is. Then she starts thinking that perhaps her daughter can be a wife of a wealthy young man in a society where all she has to do is look beautiful. What happens if Signor Naccarelli finds out who his prospective daughter-in-law really is?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNlaQd8MJRqIhk8a93PHJW619Db.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45247'),
  ('402174001196741723', 'Light Is Calling', 2004, null, 'Bill Morrison', null, null, null, 'A scene from The Bells (1926) is optically reprinted and edited to Michael Gordon''s 7 minute composition. A meditation on the fleeting nature of life and love, as seen through the roiling emulsion of a film.', 'A scene from The Bells (1926) is optically reprinted and edited to Michael Gordon''s 7 minute composition. A meditation on the fleeting nature of life and love, as seen through the roiling emulsion of a film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4axVoQWEvzzXsF8yLhvryfbzOnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129129'),
  ('714127454542917169', 'Light It Up', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Craig Bolotin, Elliot Davis', 'Craig Bolotin', 'Usher, Vanessa Williams, Forest Whitaker, Rosario Dawson, Robert Ri''chard, Judd Nelson, Fredro Starr, Sara Gilbert', 'R', 'On a winter day in a southside Queens high school, events collide and six students are suddenly in an armed standoff with the NYPD. At the school, classrooms freeze, teachers come and go, resources are scant.', 'On a winter day in a southside Queens high school, events collide and six students are suddenly in an armed standoff with the NYPD. At the school, classrooms freeze, teachers come and go, resources are scant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHbII8OHz2uoyOpPAVYe0LIJcdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19052'),
  ('566835994187261676', 'Light Light Light', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sari Aaltonen, Maria Reinup, Maria Kljukina', 'Juuli Niemi', 'Rebekka Baer, Anni Iikkanen, Laura Birn, Pirjo Lonka, Anna-Leena Sipilä, Janne Reinikainen, Kanerva Paunio, Bruno Baer', null, 'Mariia visits her childhood home and reminisces about the summer of 1986, when a girl named Mimi arrived in the small village and filled the life of the then 15-year-old Mariia with light.', 'Mariia visits her childhood home and reminisces about the summer of 1986, when a girl named Mimi arrived in the small village and filled the life of the then 15-year-old Mariia with light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzdSHEFJRZgSeXKv7hRSQY4lf4N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727414'),
  ('148895586947145583', 'Light of Day', 1987, 'Music, Drama', 'John Bailey, Paul Schrader', 'Paul Schrader', 'Michael J. Fox, Gena Rowlands, Joan Jett, Michael McKean, Thomas G. Waites, Cherry Jones, Michael Dolan, Paul J. Harkins', null, 'Cleveland siblings rise with a rock band while coping with personal problems.', 'Cleveland siblings rise with a rock band while coping with personal problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFXnASDyZd3i9TOuBPUtJRvfZsK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2115'),
  ('1081568808842325459', 'Light of My Eyes', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Giuseppe Piccioni, Alina Marazzi, Arnaldo Catinari', 'Umberto Contarello, Giuseppe Piccioni, Linda Ferri', 'Luigi Lo Cascio, Sandra Ceccarelli, Silvio Orlando, Barbara Valente, Toni Bertorelli, Paolo Pierobon, Mauro Marino, Riccardo Zinna', null, 'Antonio is a fallen angel, a rootless chauffeur who relates only to the lonely heroes in the science fiction novels he grew up with. Only through a chance meeting with Maria, a woman struggling to hold onto her daughter and her business, does he discover a hope that''s been in his detached existence.', 'Antonio is a fallen angel, a rootless chauffeur who relates only to the lonely heroes in the science fiction novels he grew up with. Only through a chance meeting with Maria, a woman struggling to hold onto her daughter and her business, does he discover a hope that''s been in his detached existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3TaMA3AgDiIoiu2BedHjOZ1mza.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46098'),
  ('962066898555682489', 'Light of My Life', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Lorie Gibson, Casey Affleck, Adam Arkapaw', 'Casey Affleck', 'Casey Affleck, Anna Pniowsky, Elisabeth Moss, Tom Bower, Timothy Webber, Hrothgar Mathews, Thelonius Serrell-Freed, Jesse James Pierce', 'R', 'Parent and child journey through the outskirts of society a decade after a pandemic has wiped out half the world''s population. As a father struggles to protect his child, their bond—and the character of humanity—is tested.', 'Parent and child journey through the outskirts of society a decade after a pandemic has wiped out half the world''s population. As a father struggles to protect his child, their bond—and the character of humanity—is tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbQQrOclR6G4r3T3EuOjp0f6VG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441183'),
  ('737222374260278956', 'Light of the World', 2025, 'Animation, Fantasy, Drama, Music', 'Tom Bancroft, John J. Schafer', 'David M. Armstrong, Drew Barton Armstrong, Jason Heaton', 'Ian Hanlin, Benjamin Jacobson, Vincent Tong, Michael Benyaer, David A. Kaye, Peter New, Richard Newman, Sam Darkoh', 'PG', 'It''s 30 AD and everyone is expectantly awaiting the coming Messiah. While Jesus isn''t exactly what they imagined, there is something special about this man. Soon, John, James, Andrew, Peter, and others begin to follow Jesus on an unexpected adventure. This beautifully animated story of Jesus is told through the eyes of his beloved young friend, the Apostle John.', 'It''s 30 AD and everyone is expectantly awaiting the coming Messiah. While Jesus isn''t exactly what they imagined, there is something special about this man. Soon, John, James, Andrew, Peter, and others begin to follow Jesus on an unexpected adventure. This beautifully animated story of Jesus is told through the eyes of his beloved young friend, the Apostle John.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vUqo90FCIHXPiXnQJEeqzg5EDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1374686'),
  ('97606322072469086', 'Light Sleeper', 1992, 'Drama, Crime', 'Paul Schrader, Edward Lachman', 'Paul Schrader', 'Willem Dafoe, Susan Sarandon, Dana Delany, David Clennon, Mary Beth Hurt, Victor Garber, Jane Adams, Sam Rockwell', 'R', 'John LeTour is a recovering drug user who suffers insomnia and still deals to a high-end New York clientele, even though he’s trying to move on from the business. John’s professional midlife crisis becomes something more acute — and dangerous — when he re-encounters an old flame while a string of seemingly drug-related murders rocks the city.', 'John LeTour is a recovering drug user who suffers insomnia and still deals to a high-end New York clientele, even though he’s trying to move on from the business. John’s professional midlife crisis becomes something more acute — and dangerous — when he re-encounters an old flame while a string of seemingly drug-related murders rocks the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFSdOYKp80rcK81KuNW3rz7FcLX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36351'),
  ('4805748758482244', 'Light the Fuse… Sartana Is Coming', 1970, 'Western', 'Giuliano Carnimeo, Michele Massimo Tarantini, Jaime Bayarri', 'Eduardo Manzanos, Tito Carpi, Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Gianni Garko, Nieves Navarro, Massimo Serato, Piero Lulli, Bruno Corazzari, Renato Baldini, Frank Braña, Franco Pesce', null, 'Wily roving gunslinger Sartana arrives in a small town and tries to find a hidden fortune of half a million dollars in gold and two million dollars in counterfeit money. Naturally, a bunch of other treacherous folks who include conniving widow Senora Manassas, shrewd fellow gunslinger Grand Full, and the vicious and unhinged General Monk are also looking to get their greedy hands on said fortune.', 'Wily roving gunslinger Sartana arrives in a small town and tries to find a hidden fortune of half a million dollars in gold and two million dollars in counterfeit money. Naturally, a bunch of other treacherous folks who include conniving widow Senora Manassas, shrewd fellow gunslinger Grand Full, and the vicious and unhinged General Monk are also looking to get their greedy hands on said fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9USuV1t7fouQ8ObLXJ86OnsbIGt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83124'),
  ('517740604675613365', 'Lighter Than Hare', 1960, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Family', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Outer space invader Yosemite Sam wants to capture typical earth creature Bugs Bunny.', 'Outer space invader Yosemite Sam wants to capture typical earth creature Bugs Bunny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbXUjIbifDU0NV1dMFrUufNY5zN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234744'),
  ('940170380016852363', 'Lighthouse', 2000, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Simon Hunter, Tony Imi', 'Simon Hunter', 'James Purefoy, Rachel Shelley, Christopher Adamson, Paul Brooke, Don Warrington, Christopher Dunne, Bob Goody, Pat Kelman', 'R', 'A prison ship on its way to a remote island prison runs aground on rocks and sinks. Mixed survivors of cons and prison guards struggle ashore, only to discover to their horror that another survivor got there first - the murderous & psychotic Leo Rook. Stranded, with no means of escape or call for help, the survivors must face a night of terror as they struggle to survive.', 'A prison ship on its way to a remote island prison runs aground on rocks and sinks. Mixed survivors of cons and prison guards struggle ashore, only to discover to their horror that another survivor got there first - the murderous & psychotic Leo Rook. Stranded, with no means of escape or call for help, the survivors must face a night of terror as they struggle to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66vc6Jicxi6S1eONK0VV6NOMHoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27336'),
  ('477918702501162568', 'Lighthouse Keeping', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald is a lighthouse keeper. He shines the light on a sleeping pelican; the angry bird comes into the lighthouse and tries to put out the light. Donald and the bird do battle through the rest of the picture.', 'Donald is a lighthouse keeper. He shines the light on a sleeping pelican; the angry bird comes into the lighthouse and tries to put out the light. Donald and the bird do battle through the rest of the picture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btZANhNyAmrMIASdgyNHsUdfw2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54411'),
  ('107054433959484295', 'Lighthouse Mouse', 1955, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Sylvester Cat is a lighthouse keeper''s mouse-catcher assigned to keep a mouse from unplugging the light. The mouse only wants a good night''s sleep and asks Hippety Hopper, the baby kangaroo who has just crashed off of a ship on the nearby rocks, to help him fight Sylvester and keep the lighthouse light turned off.', 'Sylvester Cat is a lighthouse keeper''s mouse-catcher assigned to keep a mouse from unplugging the light. The mouse only wants a good night''s sleep and asks Hippety Hopper, the baby kangaroo who has just crashed off of a ship on the nearby rocks, to help him fight Sylvester and keep the lighthouse light turned off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooxmr3pIvDAGft8nIuOm7emgGrx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235561'),
  ('1090149590483532133', 'Lighting Up the Stars', 2022, 'Drama', 'Liu Jiangjiang', 'Liu Jiangjiang', 'Zhu Yilong, Yang Enyou, Wang Ge, Liu Lu, Li Chunai, Janice Wu, Luo Jingmin, Zheng Weili', null, 'Having been released after serving his sentence, a funeral director accidentally crosses paths with a girl which brings about an unexpected change in his attitude towards life.', 'Having been released after serving his sentence, a funeral director accidentally crosses paths with a girl which brings about an unexpected change in his attitude towards life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHTGLYpZKfwGJ0lM2NEAmb6DdYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945664'),
  ('13680957707392061', 'Lightly and Shortly Dressed', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Jean Laviron', 'Jean Guitton', 'Louis de Funès, Madeleine Lebeau, Jacqueline Pierreux, Jacques-Henri Duval, Pierre Destailles, Nicole Jonesco, Jean Parédès', null, 'Jacqueline and Jacques, newlyweds, are in frequent discussions. The cause is Jacqueline''s flirtatious nature, which she has not been able to shake off despite her marriage. One of her tennis partners, Pierre, declares his love for her, but Jacqueline advises him to marry Simone instead. Meanwhile, the husband is approached by an unsympathetic character who suggests that Jacqueline is his mistress.', 'Jacqueline and Jacques, newlyweds, are in frequent discussions. The cause is Jacqueline''s flirtatious nature, which she has not been able to shake off despite her marriage. One of her tennis partners, Pierre, declares his love for her, but Jacqueline advises him to marry Simone instead. Meanwhile, the husband is approached by an unsympathetic character who suggests that Jacqueline is his mistress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fB4X8CqaVZrLM8nchydGagVeisR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78533'),
  ('942375093296657420', 'Lightning', 1952, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Shigeyoshi Mine, Fumiki Saijō', 'Sumie Tanaka', 'Hideko Takamine, Mitsuko Miura, Kyōko Kagawa, Chieko Murata, Jun Negami, Eitarō Ozawa, Kumeko Urabe, Chieko Nakakita', null, 'The story of Kiyoko, a young woman who has successfully managed to make a break with her dysfunctional family who have been trying to arrange a marriage for her with a disagreeable man whom she has rejected.', 'The story of Kiyoko, a young woman who has successfully managed to make a break with her dysfunctional family who have been trying to arrange a marriage for her with a disagreeable man whom she has rejected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4D5Jbd2ddycLXk7kdJdyxFVBxK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125358'),
  ('228375339191898619', 'Lightning Bolt', 1966, 'Action, Thriller', 'Antonio Margheriti, Nino Fruscella, Luis Marin', 'Alfonso Balcázar, José Antonio de la Loma', 'Anthony Eisley, Wandisa Guida, Folco Lulli, Diana Lorys, Luisa Rivelli, Francisco Sanz, José María Caffarel, Renato Montalbano', 'NR', 'A U.S. agent goes undercover as a rich playboy to stop a madman from destroying a NASA moon project.', 'A U.S. agent goes undercover as a rich playboy to stop a madman from destroying a NASA moon project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvG9MVAGQJHg0iElEyThpgIIlJK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91265'),
  ('156127540524852808', 'Lightning Bug', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Brandon Trost, Robert Hall', 'Robert Hall', 'Bret Harrison, Laura Prepon, Kevin Gage, Ashley Laurence, Shannon Eubanks, Lucas Till, Hal Sparks, Josh Todd', 'PG-13', 'In this drama thriller set in the South, a young boy named Green (Bret Harrison) longs to escape his unhappy life but feels trapped in his hometown. A gifted special-effects makeup artist, Green has big dreams of working in Hollywood. But the boy''s personal demons -- a drunken, abusive stepfather, a group of religious zealots out to destroy his work and the love of a girl who prefers small-town life -- may stand in the way of his dreams.', 'In this drama thriller set in the South, a young boy named Green (Bret Harrison) longs to escape his unhappy life but feels trapped in his hometown. A gifted special-effects makeup artist, Green has big dreams of working in Hollywood. But the boy''s personal demons -- a drunken, abusive stepfather, a group of religious zealots out to destroy his work and the love of a girl who prefers small-town life -- may stand in the way of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWoLLZJOmkingXZDdNZTa97w5eL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33459'),
  ('713513028593139054', 'Lightning Falls Behind', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kim Torres, Julio Hernández Cordón, Felipe Zúñiga', 'Julio Hernández Cordón', 'Álvaro Marenco, Adriana Alvarez, Natalia Arias, Lou Uba, Francisco Ortíz, Francisco Matamoros, Jean Paul Viquez, Nelson Roque Chacón', null, 'Hernandez had already made films in Guatemala and Mexico and this time found inspiring locations, unusual atmosphere and enthusiastic young people in Costa Rica. In this consciously unpolished film, the rebellious girls Sole and Ana open the trunk of a car in grandma’s garden and find something they’d rather immediately forget.', 'Hernandez had already made films in Guatemala and Mexico and this time found inspiring locations, unusual atmosphere and enthusiastic young people in Costa Rica. In this consciously unpolished film, the rebellious girls Sole and Ana open the trunk of a car in grandma’s garden and find something they’d rather immediately forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Xp6sffDZIKs73a5HjFeTRywSNy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437004'),
  ('107172324498528065', 'Lightning Jack', 1994, 'Comedy, Western', 'Simon Wincer, David Eggby', 'Paul Hogan', 'Paul Hogan, Beverly D''Angelo, Cuba Gooding Jr., Pat Hingle, Richard Riehle, Frank McRae, Roger Daltrey, L.Q. Jones', 'PG-13', 'Lightning Jack Kane is an Australian outlaw in the wild west. During a bungled bank robbery he picks up mute Ben Doyle as a hostage. The two become good friends, with Jack teaching Ben how to rob banks, while they plan Jack''s last heist.', 'Lightning Jack Kane is an Australian outlaw in the wild west. During a bungled bank robbery he picks up mute Ben Doyle as a hostage. The two become good friends, with Jack teaching Ben how to rob banks, while they plan Jack''s last heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YoRERjKWO2442ezcvgEjAZuxWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22317'),
  ('560894231177012762', 'Lightning Over Water', 1980, 'Documentary', 'Nicholas Ray, Wim Wenders, Edward Lachman', 'Nicholas Ray, Wim Wenders', 'Wim Wenders, Nicholas Ray, Susan Ray, Tom Farrell, Ronee Blakley, Gerry Bamman, Pierre Cottrell, Stefan Czapsky', null, 'Director ''Nicholas Ray'' is eager to complete a final film before his imminent death from cancer. Wim Wenders is working on his own film Hammett (1983) in Hollywood, but flies to New York to help Ray realize his final wish. Ray''s original intent is to make a fiction film about a dying painter who sails to China to find a cure for his disease. He and Wenders discuss this idea, but it is obviously unrealistic given Ray''s state of health.', 'Director ''Nicholas Ray'' is eager to complete a final film before his imminent death from cancer. Wim Wenders is working on his own film Hammett (1983) in Hollywood, but flies to New York to help Ray realize his final wish. Ray''s original intent is to make a fiction film about a dying painter who sails to China to find a cure for his disease. He and Wenders discuss this idea, but it is obviously unrealistic given Ray''s state of health.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFIaPUhcHCx51kEHfwWoBBgtLg0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42156'),
  ('1062025545778992827', 'Lightning Strike', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Tani Canevari', 'Domenico Saverni, Neri Parenti, Volfango De Biasi', 'Christian De Sica, Lillo Petrolo, Claudio Gregori, Simone Barbato, Luisa Ranieri, Arisa, Anna Foglietta, Debora Caprioglio', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o538evS1FqeftSKI7ixT2efkZKt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154512'),
  ('728207742279853572', 'Lightning Strikes', 2009, 'Science Fiction', 'Gary Jones, Natasha Roth, Martin Chichov', 'David A. Prior, Phillip J. Roth, Rafael Jordan', 'Kevin Sorbo, David Schofield, Annabel Wright, Robyn Addison, Tom Harper, Kolin Smialek, John Laskowski, Todd Jensen', null, 'A rural sheriff (Kevin Sorbo) faces a seemingly impossible battle when he is forced to defend his small town from a demon riding bolts of lightning and causing mayhem.', 'A rural sheriff (Kevin Sorbo) faces a seemingly impossible battle when he is forced to defend his small town from a demon riding bolts of lightning and causing mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpOnhaGCY9uyolbrud5ZjsxhKnG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53070'),
  ('1022635396308558393', 'Lightning Strikes Twice', 1951, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'King Vidor, Sidney Hickox, David Curtiz', 'Lenore J. Coffee', 'Ruth Roman, Richard Todd, Mercedes McCambridge, Zachary Scott, Frank Conroy, Kathryn Givney, Rhys Williams, Darryl Hickman', 'NR', 'Sent to a dude ranch in the west to recover her health, a New York actress falls in love with a ranch owner recently acquitted of the murder of his wife.', 'Sent to a dude ranch in the west to recover her health, a New York actress falls in love with a ranch owner recently acquitted of the murder of his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cS5T7GRkG2lD2BsImG7SPNNXv8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72479'),
