  ('417092260579983080', 'Lights', 1966, null, 'Marie Menken', null, null, null, 'Shot over a period of three years. Marie Menken photographed New York window displays during the Christmas holiday. In order to avoid foot and street traffic interrupting the shots, Menken filmed from midnight to 1:00 in the morning, but had to keep the camera under her coat to keep it from freezing.', 'Shot over a period of three years. Marie Menken photographed New York window displays during the Christmas holiday. In order to avoid foot and street traffic interrupting the shots, Menken filmed from midnight to 1:00 in the morning, but had to keep the camera under her coat to keep it from freezing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gH2ChQBjbbqc857zAXCOk8B8EKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152304'),
  ('579785124175209220', 'Lights Camera Death', 2026, 'Horror', 'Kevin Khachan', 'Kevin Khachan', 'Taleisha Bonora, Imogen Pickard-Ling, Claudia Haines-Cappeau, Beau Baker, Linden Trescott', 'R', 'A group of aspiring actors gathers at a remote holiday house to shoot a horror film with a promising director who harbors a dark secret. He knowingly allows them to discover a sinister symbol that serves as a gateway for a demon.', 'A group of aspiring actors gathers at a remote holiday house to shoot a horror film with a promising director who harbors a dark secret. He knowingly allows them to discover a sinister symbol that serves as a gateway for a demon.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FaQiHAdjq3mWe90eUzDGGY1OYkA9.jpg', 'plex:movie:lights-camera-death'),
  ('693264937747211807', 'Lights in the Dusk', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen, Nadja Delcos', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Janne Hyytiäinen, Maria Järvenhelmi, Maria Heiskanen, Ilkka Koivula, Sergei Doudko, Andrei Gennadiev, Artūras Pozdniakovas, Matti Onnismaa', 'NR', 'Outcast by his co-workers and living alone, Koistinen is a security guard who works the night shift in a luxury shopping mall in Helsinki. But when icy blonde Mirja approaches him, the lonely Koistinen falls helplessly for her, unaware she is manipulating him for her criminal boyfriend.', 'Outcast by his co-workers and living alone, Koistinen is a security guard who works the night shift in a luxury shopping mall in Helsinki. But when icy blonde Mirja approaches him, the lonely Koistinen falls helplessly for her, unaware she is manipulating him for her criminal boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBn28XPBI4vOKye1NSTGghdvGoJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1379'),
  ('1024434628177108548', 'Lights of New York', 1928, 'Crime, Drama', 'Edwin B. DuPar, Bryan Foy', 'Murray Roth, Hugh Herbert', 'Helene Costello, Cullen Landis, Mary Carr, Wheeler Oakman, Gladys Brockwell, Robert Elliott, Eugene Pallette, Tom Dugan', 'NR', 'Eddie is conned into fronting a speakeasy for a local gangster who intends to frame him for the murder of a cop.', 'Eddie is conned into fronting a speakeasy for a local gangster who intends to frame him for the murder of a cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUjBZO2dvE8AcPzz0uxLPoOxZXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173689'),
  ('922177367429923813', 'Lights Out', 2010, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Fabrice Gobert, Agnès Godard', 'Fabrice Gobert', 'Ana Girardot, Jules Pelissier, Laurent Delbecque, Audrey Bastien, Arthur Mazet, Alice Butaud, Laurent Capelluto, Yan Tassin', null, 'March 1992, in a small town in the suburbs of Paris. During an alcohol fueled party, teenagers discover a body hidden in the bushes of a forest. A body that seems lifeless. Two weeks earlier. Simon, a 16 year-old teenager, has not shown up for class. Blood stains are found in a class-room. Run-away, kidnap, suicide, murder? A few days later, Laetitia, a student from the same class goes missing without her parents knowing where she has gone. A young girl with no dark background or connection to Simon. The next day, Jean-Baptiste, a third student, also disappears. Rumors start to spread. The psychosis begins...', 'March 1992, in a small town in the suburbs of Paris. During an alcohol fueled party, teenagers discover a body hidden in the bushes of a forest. A body that seems lifeless. Two weeks earlier. Simon, a 16 year-old teenager, has not shown up for class. Blood stains are found in a class-room. Run-away, kidnap, suicide, murder? A few days later, Laetitia, a student from the same class goes missing without her parents knowing where she has gone. A young girl with no dark background or connection to Simon. The next day, Jean-Baptiste, a third student, also disappears. Rumors start to spread. The psychosis begins...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUZGt8VAtYzGxsIveM43uQQsZNs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59015'),
  ('177361200581683420', 'Lights Out', 2014, 'Horror', 'David F. Sandberg, David F. Sandberg', 'David F. Sandberg', 'Lotta Losten', null, 'A woman prepares for bed, but realizes that something may be lurking in the shadows.', 'A woman prepares for bed, but realizes that something may be lurking in the shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VzEIaYWO9HFIp6lgjfbLRJRKSF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259761'),
  ('749374881384858386', 'Lights Out', 2016, 'Horror', 'David F. Sandberg, Marc Spicer', 'Eric Heisserer', 'Teresa Palmer, Maria Bello, Gabriel Bateman, Alexander DiPersia, Alicia Vela-Bailey, Billy Burke, Andi Osho, Maria Russell', 'PG-13', 'Rebecca must unlock the terror behind her little brother''s experiences that once tested her sanity, bringing her face to face with a supernatural spirit attached to their mother.', 'Rebecca must unlock the terror behind her little brother''s experiences that once tested her sanity, bringing her face to face with a supernatural spirit attached to their mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BnElzAQQpp7ZgdJJiAe1diomr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345911'),
  ('15437475453708095', 'Lights Out', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Christian Sesma, Anthony J. Rickert-Epstein, Raven Lilly', 'Garry Charles, Chad Law', 'Frank Grillo, Mekhi Phifer, Jaime King, Dermot Mulroney, Scott Adkins, Amaury Nolasco, Donald Cerrone, JuJu Chan', 'R', 'A drifting ex-soldier turns underground fighter with the help of a just-released ex-con, pitting him against corrupt cops and hired killers now gunning for him and all those he cares about.', 'A drifting ex-soldier turns underground fighter with the help of a just-released ex-con, pitting him against corrupt cops and hired killers now gunning for him and all those he cares about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCOSDDyN0qA8rGoVwsZc72v3RuZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931642'),
  ('89335266677728809', 'Lights, Camera, Christmas!', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Weaver, Ryan McMaster', 'Gary Goldstein', 'Kimberley Sustad, John Brotherton, Laura Soltis, Matthew Kevin Anderson, Leila Harrison, Kallie Hu, Garfield Wilson, Nik Andrews', 'G', 'When a holiday rom-com movie shooting in her town needs a costume designer, Kerry, a local shop owner, steps into the role. While working on the movie, she rediscovers her passion for costume design and finds herself falling for Brad, the film’s famous leading man.', 'When a holiday rom-com movie shooting in her town needs a costume designer, Kerry, a local shop owner, steps into the role. While working on the movie, she rediscovers her passion for costume design and finds herself falling for Brad, the film’s famous leading man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xensL98L0bGnkkQsEFy3USC5n5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027439'),
  ('809526002546962093', 'Lightspeed', 2006, 'Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Don E. FauntLeRoy, Don E. FauntLeRoy', 'Steve Latshaw, John Gray', 'Jason Connery, Nicole Eggert, Daniel Goddard, Lee Majors, Michael Flynn, K.C. Clyde, Scott Hanks, Kari Hawker-Diaz', 'PG-13', 'Government agent Daniel Leight has his radiation treatments sabotaged. He soon finds that he can now move at super speeds but only by risking metabolic damage which could prove to be fatal. ''Lightspeed'' must now use his powers to go after old friend turned terrorist who is now a mutant half-snake called Python.', 'Government agent Daniel Leight has his radiation treatments sabotaged. He soon finds that he can now move at super speeds but only by risking metabolic damage which could prove to be fatal. ''Lightspeed'' must now use his powers to go after old friend turned terrorist who is now a mutant half-snake called Python.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnjmthhMcBmQlYUKrxxYXaOcO8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31985'),
  ('662986423454134788', 'Lightweight', 2004, 'Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Séverine Barde', 'Jean-Pierre Améris', 'Nicolas Duvauchelle, Bernard Campan, Maï Anh Le, Sophie Quinton, Élisabeth Commelin, Ugo Broussot, Hiep Tran-Nghia, Nguyen Thi My Chau', null, 'A young man tries his way in boxing, supported by a coach. He meets a girl, falls in love and she becomes pregnant.', 'A young man tries his way in boxing, supported by a coach. He meets a girl, falls in love and she becomes pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjHoB1gaTEgBJ7Bs8JzM11hHjIA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61681'),
  ('405439996863757326', 'Lightyear', 2022, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Family, Adventure', 'Ian Megibben, Jeremy Lasky, Angus MacLane', 'Jason Headley, Angus MacLane', 'Chris Evans, Keke Palmer, Peter Sohn, Taika Waititi, Dale Soules, James Brolin, Uzo Aduba, Mary McDonald-Lewis', 'PG', 'Legendary Space Ranger Buzz Lightyear embarks on an intergalactic adventure alongside a group of ambitious recruits and his robot companion Sox.', 'Legendary Space Ranger Buzz Lightyear embarks on an intergalactic adventure alongside a group of ambitious recruits and his robot companion Sox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9t3w1loraDh7hjdWmpc9ZsaYns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718789'),
  ('902118143075390798', 'Liian iso keikka', 1986, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Eero Jaakkola, Juha Jalasti, Timo Jalasti', 'Ere Kokkonen', 'Vesa-Matti Loiri, Hannele Lauri, Ritva Valkama, Pentti Siimes, Ville-Veikko Salminen, Aake Kalliala, Titta Jokinen', null, 'Nikolai Savitsenko, aka Nig, runs Crimes for You Ltd, whose other employees are Hikka, Pete and Nig''s little sister Mandi. While they are planning the heist of the century, robbing a bank''s cash transport vehicle, the gang continues with their usual scams. They divert parking fines to the wrong account, one belonging to Inspector Koistinen, arrange a pre-arranged lottery line by bribing the authorities, and break into a political party''s secret office to blow up the safe. Inspector Koistinen is in a tight spot. To make matters worse, he is assigned a new partner, Eevariita, who soon figures out that the same gang is behind all the scams.', 'Nikolai Savitsenko, aka Nig, runs Crimes for You Ltd, whose other employees are Hikka, Pete and Nig''s little sister Mandi. While they are planning the heist of the century, robbing a bank''s cash transport vehicle, the gang continues with their usual scams. They divert parking fines to the wrong account, one belonging to Inspector Koistinen, arrange a pre-arranged lottery line by bribing the authorities, and break into a political party''s secret office to blow up the safe. Inspector Koistinen is in a tight spot. To make matters worse, he is assigned a new partner, Eevariita, who soon figures out that the same gang is behind all the scams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSHCJ9l35VaRuD2DUM8vIr92ik7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55415'),
  ('1032523630046563092', 'Like a Boss', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Richard L. Fox, Emily McGovern, Miguel Arteta', 'Sam Pitman, Adam Cole-Kelly', 'Tiffany Haddish, Rose Byrne, Salma Hayek Pinault, Karan Soni, Jacob Latimore, Billy Porter, Jimmy O. Yang, Ryan Hansen', 'R', 'Two female friends with very different ideals decide to start a beauty company together. One is more practical, while the other wants to earn her fortune and live a lavish lifestyle.', 'Two female friends with very different ideals decide to start a beauty company together. One is more practical, while the other wants to earn her fortune and live a lavish lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yce0CZPWd0GGudksRJi8p4gDj1M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526019'),
  ('827247195977804854', 'Like a Brother', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Cyril Legann, Bernard Alapetite, Sylvain Daumer', 'Bernard Alapetite, Cyril Legann', 'Benoit Deliere, Johnny Amaro, Thibault Boucaux, Adeline Ishiomin, Amandine Maugy, Michel Derville, Gaëtan Borg, Patrick Esilva', null, 'Sebastien is a small town boy who moves to Paris and begins to explore the gay night life there. When a friend from back home calls to announce he''s coming to Paris, Sebastien confronts some unrequited feelings.', 'Sebastien is a small town boy who moves to Paris and begins to explore the gay night life there. When a friend from back home calls to announce he''s coming to Paris, Sebastien confronts some unrequited feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiAKYNJEpMnS8L1nKqEYC5yjm0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39688'),
  ('715207043145620413', 'Like a Cat on a Highway', 2017, 'Family, Comedy', 'Franco Nardella, Alessandro Coccia, Riccardo Milani', 'Furio Andreotti, Riccardo Milani, Paola Cortellesi', 'Paola Cortellesi, Antonio Albanese, Sonia Bergamasco, Luca Angeletti, Antonio D''Ausilio, Alice Maselli, Simone de Bianchi, Claudio Amendola', null, 'The story of an encounter between a bourgeois man and a poor woman, because their teenage children fall in love.', 'The story of an encounter between a bourgeois man and a poor woman, because their teenage children fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfIfo2JTPpLL06njlaRBxWVH9kN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492282'),
