  ('644525650795505599', 'Like a Dragon: Prologue', 2006, 'Drama, Crime', 'Takeshi Miyasaka, Takashi Miike', 'Masaru Nakamura', 'Masakatsu Funaki, Mikio Osawa, Ayaka Maeda, Harumi Sone, Hirotaro Honda', null, 'In 1970s-era Japan, three children, Kazuma Kiryu, Akira Nishikiyama, and his younger sister, Yuko Nishikiyama, are raised together in Shintaro Kazama''s Sunflower Orphanage. In the summer of 1980, Yumi Sawamura, a young girl whose parents were accidentally shot and killed during a gang''s shootout, joins them in the orphanage. Following a yakuza tradition, the honorable Kazama secretly raises orphans whose parents he has directly or indirectly killed. In return, the children love him as a father and he eventually inducts the teenage Kiryu and Nishikiyama into the Dojima Family, a Tojo Clan affiliate of which he is a senior officer.', 'In 1970s-era Japan, three children, Kazuma Kiryu, Akira Nishikiyama, and his younger sister, Yuko Nishikiyama, are raised together in Shintaro Kazama''s Sunflower Orphanage. In the summer of 1980, Yumi Sawamura, a young girl whose parents were accidentally shot and killed during a gang''s shootout, joins them in the orphanage. Following a yakuza tradition, the honorable Kazama secretly raises orphans whose parents he has directly or indirectly killed. In return, the children love him as a father and he eventually inducts the teenage Kiryu and Nishikiyama into the Dojima Family, a Tojo Clan affiliate of which he is a senior officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufUAm05Uk1ZAU3TELDE4RRJ4AFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35027'),
  ('261112413280755982', 'Like a Fish Out of Water', 1999, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Hervé Hadmar, Jacques Boumendil', 'Philippe Haïm, Hervé Hadmar, Christophe Bergeronneau', 'Tchéky Karyo, Monica Bellucci, Dominique Pinon, Michel Muller, José Garcia, Gérard Ismaël, Beatrice Palme, André Pousse', null, 'A seductive femme fatale (Monica Bellucci) and two con men -- one cool as ice, and one who just likes to "ice" his victims -- enlist a mild-mannered, unsuspecting man in their mission to steal a rare and valuable fish. They plan to sell it back to its grieving owner at an enormous profit (talk about "sleeping with the fishes!"). Tcheky Karyo, Michel Muller and Dominique Pinon co-star.', 'A seductive femme fatale (Monica Bellucci) and two con men -- one cool as ice, and one who just likes to "ice" his victims -- enlist a mild-mannered, unsuspecting man in their mission to steal a rare and valuable fish. They plan to sell it back to its grieving owner at an enormous profit (talk about "sleeping with the fishes!"). Tcheky Karyo, Michel Muller and Dominique Pinon co-star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UybnV2kxzTqSlwqXp9AAmK8wJa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18922'),
  ('598942428296688270', 'Like a Prince', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Victoire Nyault, Ali Marhyar', 'Julien Guetta, Ali Marhyar', 'Ahmed Sylla, Mallory Wanecque, Julia Piaton, Jonathan Cohen, Antoine Gouy, Youssef Hajdi, Jonathan Lambert, Tewfik Jallab', null, 'Souleyman, 27, a boxing champion in full preparation for the Olympic Games with the French team, sees his future crumble when he cracks the bones of his hand, following a fight in a bar. Souleyman is excluded from the team and is sent to the Château de Chambord, where he must perform his 400 hours of community service (TIG) collecting waste in the gardens.', 'Souleyman, 27, a boxing champion in full preparation for the Olympic Games with the French team, sees his future crumble when he cracks the bones of his hand, following a fight in a bar. Souleyman is excluded from the team and is sent to the Château de Chambord, where he must perform his 400 hours of community service (TIG) collecting waste in the gardens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esp2ki9rwiZzwpK5pz2gk7Tpyhn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1019864'),
  ('354713956047046469', 'Like A Rolling Stone', 2024, 'Drama, Family', 'Yin Lichuan, Chen-Yu Jin, Li Danfeng', 'A Mei, Yin Lichuan', 'Yong Mei, Jiang Wu, Janice Wu, Zhang Benyu, Ma Su, Ai Liya, Li Yixiang, Li Jiaxin', null, 'Based on the story of a 50-year-old aunt who took a driving trip. The naive and romantic Li Hong has had many dreams in her life, longing for college at 18, love at 25, and travel at 45. ...... But for those things that are "more important to others", she can only wait and wait again and again and again. At 50, she is determined not to wait any longer and to live a different life!', 'Based on the story of a 50-year-old aunt who took a driving trip. The naive and romantic Li Hong has had many dreams in her life, longing for college at 18, love at 25, and travel at 45. ...... But for those things that are "more important to others", she can only wait and wait again and again and again. At 50, she is determined not to wait any longer and to live a different life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRWmMGLDPY3OONmnFEDXys1rRxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1324509'),
  ('813867836752075930', 'Like a Son', 2024, 'Drama', 'Camille Bougon-Pigneul, Edouard Dupont, Éric Gautier', 'Nicolas Boukhrief, Éric Besnard', 'Vincent Lindon, Karole Rocher, Stefan Virgil Stoica, Sorin Mihai, Florin ''Beti'' Opasche, Robert Opasche, Guillaume Draux, Saïd Aïssaoui', null, 'Jacques Romand is a history teacher who has lost faith in his vocation. One evening, witnessing a shopkeeper attacked by three young robbers, he catches one of the aggressors, Victor, a 14-year-old Roma boy.', 'Jacques Romand is a history teacher who has lost faith in his vocation. One evening, witnessing a shopkeeper attacked by three young robbers, he catches one of the aggressors, Victor, a 14-year-old Roma boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9D2TqfIKUrVHuWeDEmJd96cTf8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1089309'),
