  ('489223457961959848', 'Like Dogs', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Randy Van Dyke', 'Randy Van Dyke', 'Annabel Barrett, Ignacyo Matynia, Ryan Q. Tran, Shay Denison, Katy Dore, Nicole Bleacher, Clay Coleman-Davis, Alan Maxson', 'NR', 'A behavioral experiment treating humans like animals goes awry when a University Student manipulates the research with deadly results.', 'A behavioral experiment treating humans like animals goes awry when a University Student manipulates the research with deadly results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKQZbEfMhmrAwasHdTfAjTcAZaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:798155'),
  ('299281273341892890', 'Like Father', 2018, 'Drama', 'Lauren Miller Rogen, Seamus Tierney', 'Lauren Miller Rogen', 'Kristen Bell, Kelsey Grammer, Seth Rogen, Amber Hodgkiss, Zach Appelman, Brittany Ross, Alex Pérez, Paul W. Downs', 'R', 'When a workaholic young executive is left at the altar, she ends up on her Caribbean honeymoon cruise with the last person she ever expected: her estranged and equally workaholic father. The two depart as strangers, but over the course of a few hilarious adventures, a couple of umbrella-clad cocktails and a whole lot of soul-searching, they return with a renewed appreciation for family and life.', 'When a workaholic young executive is left at the altar, she ends up on her Caribbean honeymoon cruise with the last person she ever expected: her estranged and equally workaholic father. The two depart as strangers, but over the course of a few hilarious adventures, a couple of umbrella-clad cocktails and a whole lot of soul-searching, they return with a renewed appreciation for family and life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPN8iFewcLAdonUec76qrAEnHm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518452'),
  ('207681919219138843', 'Like Father Like Son', 1987, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jack N. Green, Rod Daniel', 'Steve Bloom, Lorne Cameron, David Hoselton', 'Dudley Moore, Kirk Cameron, Margaret Colin, Catherine Hicks, Patrick O''Neal, Sean Astin, Camille Cooper, Micah Grant', 'PG-13', 'Dr. Jack Hammond has best chances to become medical superintendent in the clinic. So he''s completely absorbed in his work and has no understanding for his teenage son Chris'' problems with school. By accident one of them drinks a brain-exchanging serum, and it switches their identities. This leads of course to extraordinary complications in school and at work, but also to insight in the problems and feelings of each other.', 'Dr. Jack Hammond has best chances to become medical superintendent in the clinic. So he''s completely absorbed in his work and has no understanding for his teenage son Chris'' problems with school. By accident one of them drinks a brain-exchanging serum, and it switches their identities. This leads of course to extraordinary complications in school and at work, but also to insight in the problems and feelings of each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68OY9pYmKc3F2G6yxaXhxhnnFcU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36914'),
