  ('433754281507439178', 'Like It Never Was Before', 1995, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Susanne Bier, Kjell Lagerroos', 'Jonas Gardell', 'Loa Falkman, Stina Ekblad, Simon Norrthon, Philip Zandén, Sif Ruud, Ghita Nørby, Ingvar Hirdwall, Ulla Skoog', null, 'The Runeberg family is an ordinary middle class family, with a house in a suburb, a car and three children. By vacationing in a rented house by the sea, the hope is that the tension and anxiety between Rune and Gunnel will disappear. However, instead of spending time with his family, Rune finds himself attracted to a young man, Petrus. Whatever happens next, Rune realizes, it can never be like it was before.', 'The Runeberg family is an ordinary middle class family, with a house in a suburb, a car and three children. By vacationing in a rented house by the sea, the hope is that the tension and anxiety between Rune and Gunnel will disappear. However, instead of spending time with his family, Rune finds himself attracted to a young man, Petrus. Whatever happens next, Rune realizes, it can never be like it was before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0imk68JhlXK5STdKhWUaz1dc6d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72004'),
