  ('717063578331958266', 'Like Sheep Among Wolves', 2023, 'Crime', 'Lyda Patitucci, Giuseppe Maio, Monika Habilaj', 'Filippo Gravino', 'Isabella Ragonese, Andrea Arcangeli, Clara Ponsot, Tommaso Ragno, Carolina Michelangeli, Gennaro Di Colandrea, Aleksandar Gavranić, Alan Katić', null, 'Two estranged siblings are thrown back into each other''s lives during a high-stakes heist: one wearing the badge, the other holding the gun.', 'Two estranged siblings are thrown back into each other''s lives during a high-stakes heist: one wearing the badge, the other holding the gun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFKbH86qM20GU8tp7LqlXmskRc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064365'),
  ('703855768605933185', 'Like Someone in Love', 2012, 'Drama', 'Abbas Kiarostami, Katsumi Yanagijima, Yuichi Tazawa', 'Abbas Kiarostami', 'Rin Takanashi, Tadashi Okuno, Ryo Kase, Denden, Ryota Nakanishi, Reiko Mori, Kaneko Kubota, Mihoko Suzuki', 'NR', 'An old man and a young woman meet in Tokyo. She knows nothing about him, he thinks he knows her. He welcomes her into his home, she offers him her body. But the web that is woven between them in the space of twenty four hours bears no relation to the circumstances of their encounter.', 'An old man and a young woman meet in Tokyo. She knows nothing about him, he thinks he knows her. He welcomes her into his home, she offers him her body. But the web that is woven between them in the space of twenty four hours bears no relation to the circumstances of their encounter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g28JeY54PspCF9w0kdgwRhK1Qtu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102001'),
  ('541755299564918034', 'Like Sunday, Like Rain', 2014, 'Drama, Music', 'Jimi Jones, Frank Whaley', 'Frank Whaley', 'Leighton Meester, Debra Messing, Billie Joe Armstrong, Julian Shatkin, Georgia X. Lifsher, Olga Merediz, J. Smith-Cameron, Tamara Torres', 'R', 'A struggling musician becomes a 12-year-old musical prodigy''s guardian for a summer.', 'A struggling musician becomes a 12-year-old musical prodigy''s guardian for a summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdPWpwm3Zo2lpWcWxY2JTTLpaJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225044'),
  ('444414317949512433', 'Like the Clouds, Like the Wind', 1990, 'Romance, Animation, Comedy, History', 'Hisayuki Toriumi, Nobuo Koyama, Katsuya Kondo', 'Akira Miyazaki', 'Ryoko Sano, Atsuko Takahata, Ikuko Tani, Yosuke Akimoto, Nobuaki Fukuda, Kinto Tamura, Yuji Mitsuya, Akiji Kobayashi', null, 'Ginga is a simple—yet energetic—country girl, living with her father far from the capital city of the empire in ancient China. When she learns of an opportunity to become a concubine of the young new Emperor, with the possibility of becoming his head wife in charge of all of the other wives, Ginga convinces her father to let her go. Once there, she meets all of the other potential head wives, each of whom have various reasons for being there. All of them must learn to read and write, learn the history of their country, and learn the proper mannerisms for being in the royal court. Ginga''s enthusiasm tends to get her in trouble more often than not, but it works to her advantage when they learn that the former emperor''s head wife, who is not the mother of the current emperor, is plotting treachery against the new emperor, and that a rebellion is headed toward the capital.', 'Ginga is a simple—yet energetic—country girl, living with her father far from the capital city of the empire in ancient China. When she learns of an opportunity to become a concubine of the young new Emperor, with the possibility of becoming his head wife in charge of all of the other wives, Ginga convinces her father to let her go. Once there, she meets all of the other potential head wives, each of whom have various reasons for being there. All of them must learn to read and write, learn the history of their country, and learn the proper mannerisms for being in the royal court. Ginga''s enthusiasm tends to get her in trouble more often than not, but it works to her advantage when they learn that the former emperor''s head wife, who is not the mother of the current emperor, is plotting treachery against the new emperor, and that a rebellion is headed toward the capital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kZuESURYvZb9WzV13XQ0jadEgz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35589'),
  ('776147089914038871', 'Like the Wind', 2013, 'Drama', 'Marco S. Puccioni', 'Heidrun Schleef, Marco S. Puccioni, Nicola Lusuardi', 'Valeria Golino, Filippo Timi, Francesco Scianna, Marcello Mazzarella, Salvio Simeoli, Matteo Taranto, Chiara Caselli, Francesco Acquaroli', null, 'The last few years in the life of Armida Miserere, female jail director who committed suicide', 'The last few years in the life of Armida Miserere, female jail director who committed suicide', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgOgPIFfpjcucXocH4e2TKO9Dce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235208'),
  ('675223728007583125', 'Like Two Drops of Water', 1963, 'Drama, War', 'Fons Rademakers, Lili Rademakers, Peter Vink', 'Willem Frederik Hermans', 'Lex Schoorel, Nan Los, Van Doude, Guus Verstraete, Mia Goossen, Ko Arnoldi, Hans Polman, Ina van der Molen', null, 'The fainthearted cigar trader Ducker keeps himself quiet during World War II. That changes when parachutist Dorbeck lands in his backyard. It turns out the parachutist bears a remarkable resemblance to Ducker. Ducker follows Dorbeck blindly, becomes involved in the Dutch resistance and soon starts killing people. When he escapes through German lines to the freed South Netherlands, no one has ever heard of Dorbeck.', 'The fainthearted cigar trader Ducker keeps himself quiet during World War II. That changes when parachutist Dorbeck lands in his backyard. It turns out the parachutist bears a remarkable resemblance to Ducker. Ducker follows Dorbeck blindly, becomes involved in the Dutch resistance and soon starts killing people. When he escapes through German lines to the freed South Netherlands, no one has ever heard of Dorbeck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKQHzes6ouG6UWvcFciz5owuFnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85217'),
  ('372359233444565101', 'Like Water for Chocolate', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alfonso Arau, Steven Bernstein, Emmanuel Lubezki', 'Laura Esquivel', 'Lumi Cavazos, Marco Leonardi, Regina Torné, Mario Iván Martínez, Ada Carrasco, Yareli Arizmendi, Claudette Maillé, Pilar Aranda', 'R', 'Tita is passionately in love with Pedro, but her controlling mother forbids her from marrying him. When Pedro marries her sister, Tita throws herself into her cooking and discovers she can transfer her emotions through the food she prepares, infecting all who eat it with her intense heartbreak.', 'Tita is passionately in love with Pedro, but her controlling mother forbids her from marrying him. When Pedro marries her sister, Tita throws herself into her cooking and discovers she can transfer her emotions through the food she prepares, infecting all who eat it with her intense heartbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itwUdMqLmPfhtGJ44hiDxkqZhiq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18183'),
  ('346713856281943957', 'Like You Know It All', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hong Sang-soo, Lee Kwang-kuk, Lee Sang-min', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Kim Tae-woo, Uhm Ji-won, Ko Hyun-jung, Gong Hyung-jin, Jung Yu-mi, Seo Young-hwa, Moon Chang-gil, Yu Jun-sang', null, 'A South Korean art house film director is first invited to serve on the panel of a film festival, then to guest lecture at a film school.', 'A South Korean art house film director is first invited to serve on the panel of a film festival, then to guest lecture at a film school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTLZiYLeDDh7IYnHRXqYElKw8BV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86262'),
  ('346821556994931121', 'Like.Share.Follow.', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Glenn Gers', 'Glenn Gers', 'Keiynan Lonsdale, Ema Horvath, Nate Hartley, Amy Pham, Michael Boatman, Abraham Benrubi, Remy Nozik, Alexis G. Zall', 'NR', 'Garrett is a rising YouTube star. Shell is a deeply emotional fan. When they begin a romantic relationship, he''s forced to question whether opening your life to strangers online is an invitation to community and rescue... or to stalking, obsession and madness.', 'Garrett is a rising YouTube star. Shell is a deeply emotional fan. When they begin a romantic relationship, he''s forced to question whether opening your life to strangers online is an invitation to community and rescue... or to stalking, obsession and madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frh6P7hqfIqXhzRcKb5UjYRFfPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486011'),
  ('893901585724811743', 'Likemeback', 2019, 'Drama', 'Gian Filippo Corticelli, Leonardo Guerra Seràgnoli', 'Leonardo Guerra Seràgnoli', 'Blu Yoshimi, Denise Tantucci, Angela Fontana, Goran Marković, Carolina Pavone, Guglielmo Pinelli', null, 'Just out of high school, Lavinia, Carla and Danila leave for a yachting holiday. Accompanied only by a skipper, the three of them sail along the Croatian coast at the start of a new stage in their lives. Full of dreams, free and laid-back, they are unaware that sharing everything on the social media is about to transform their holiday into a brutal rite of passage to adulthood in which nothing, especially their friendship, will ever be the same again.', 'Just out of high school, Lavinia, Carla and Danila leave for a yachting holiday. Accompanied only by a skipper, the three of them sail along the Croatian coast at the start of a new stage in their lives. Full of dreams, free and laid-back, they are unaware that sharing everything on the social media is about to transform their holiday into a brutal rite of passage to adulthood in which nothing, especially their friendship, will ever be the same again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CFZLBcqWSpiK6gRqrj6Cjgf6oq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535421'),
  ('1128942649464140439', 'Lila', 2014, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Animation', 'Carlos Lascano, Carlos Lascano', 'Carlos Lascano', 'Alma García, Alejandro Gómez, Luján Capra, Rodolfo Steiner, Rodrigo Josserme, Paula Lema', null, 'Lila is a dreamy girl who can''t resign to accept reality as flat as she perceives it, hence she uses her imagination and her skills to modify it.', 'Lila is a dreamy girl who can''t resign to accept reality as flat as she perceives it, hence she uses her imagination and her skills to modify it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7x5R8JTdSP0GRredLl5fG53RMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339913'),
  ('991867150368462536', 'Lila & Eve', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Charles Stone III, Wyatt Garfield', 'Patrick Gilfillan', 'Viola Davis, Jennifer Lopez, Shea Whigham, Aml Ameen, Andre Royo, Chris Chalk, Julius Tennon, Yolonda Ross', 'R', 'Lila, a grief-stricken mother reeling from her son’s murder, attends a support group where she meets Eve, who urges her to take matters into her own hands to track down her son’s killers.', 'Lila, a grief-stricken mother reeling from her son’s murder, attends a support group where she meets Eve, who urges her to take matters into her own hands to track down her son’s killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGY41KlplvdPcUT0OeTu04ZPHke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309581'),
  ('166055457702742885', 'Lila Says', 2005, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Ziad Doueiri, John Daly', 'Ziad Doueiri, Mark Lawrence, Joelle Touma', 'Vahina Giocante, Moa Khouas, Karim Ben Haddou, Edmonde Franchi, Lotfi Chakri, Hamid Dkhissi, Carmen Lebbos, Ghandi Assad', 'R', 'Chimo develops a crush on the pretty, blond Lila, a girl who recently moved into his Arab ghetto with her aunt. When the leader of a rival gang also falls for Lila, the ensuing love triangle initiates a journey of sexual discovery -- and sets off a chain of devastating events.', 'Chimo develops a crush on the pretty, blond Lila, a girl who recently moved into his Arab ghetto with her aunt. When the leader of a rival gang also falls for Lila, the ensuing love triangle initiates a journey of sexual discovery -- and sets off a chain of devastating events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GCtiblUjnbhuHJnIXqWVi6zhHC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46825'),
  ('112724299611268193', 'Lilac', 1932, 'Crime', 'Anatole Litvak', 'Dorothy Farnum, Anatole Litvak, Serge Veber', 'Marcelle Romee, André Luguet, Fréhel, Jean Gabin, Lydie Villars, Fordyce, Marcel Delaître, Georges Paulais', null, 'Also known as Lilac, this early Anatole Litvak-directed talkie was based on a play by Tristan Bernard and Charles Henry Hirsch. The story bears traces of the Bertold Brecht-Weill piece The Threepenny Opera, with heroine Lilac (Marcelle Romeo) consorting with the criminal scum of Paris. Lilac falls in love with a handsome detective (Andre Luguet), but he doesn''t let his emotions stand in the way of his duty, and in the end he reluctantly turns her over to the authorities. At $120,000, Coeur de Lilas was one of the most expensive movies to come out of France in 1931, but it more than made back its cost at the box-office.', 'Also known as Lilac, this early Anatole Litvak-directed talkie was based on a play by Tristan Bernard and Charles Henry Hirsch. The story bears traces of the Bertold Brecht-Weill piece The Threepenny Opera, with heroine Lilac (Marcelle Romeo) consorting with the criminal scum of Paris. Lilac falls in love with a handsome detective (Andre Luguet), but he doesn''t let his emotions stand in the way of his duty, and in the end he reluctantly turns her over to the authorities. At $120,000, Coeur de Lilas was one of the most expensive movies to come out of France in 1931, but it more than made back its cost at the box-office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lDfcvkJEYjMmzgnPQhjC78qTKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64545'),
  ('586947562945796952', 'Lili', 1953, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Robert H. Planck, Charles Walters, Al Jennings', 'Helen Deutsch', 'Leslie Caron, Mel Ferrer, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Zsa Zsa Gabor, Kurt Kasznar, Amanda Blake, Alex Gerry, Ralph Dumke', 'NR', 'Members of a circus troupe "adopt" Lili Daurier when she finds herself stranded in a strange town. The magician who first comes to her rescue already has romantic entanglements and thinks of her as a little girl. Who can she turn to but the puppets, singing to them her troubles, forgetting that there are puppeteers? A crowd gathers around Lili as she sings. The circus has a new act. She now has a job. Will she get her heart''s desire?', 'Members of a circus troupe "adopt" Lili Daurier when she finds herself stranded in a strange town. The magician who first comes to her rescue already has romantic entanglements and thinks of her as a little girl. Who can she turn to but the puppets, singing to them her troubles, forgetting that there are puppeteers? A crowd gathers around Lili as she sings. The circus has a new act. She now has a job. Will she get her heart''s desire?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vcaVT09imU0XlxClUlgMAYMexu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43350'),
  ('1028776375882200002', 'Lili Marleen', 1981, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Xaver Schwarzenberger, Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Manfred Purzer, Joshua Sinclair, Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Hanna Schygulla, Giancarlo Giannini, Mel Ferrer, Karl-Heinz von Hassel, Erik Schumann, Hark Bohm, Gottfried John, Karin Baal', null, 'The story of a German singer named Willie, who while working in Switzerland, falls in love with a Jewish composer named Robert, whose family is helping people to flee from the Nazis. Robert’s family is skeptical of Willie, thinking she could be a Nazi as she becomes famous for singing the song “Lili Marleen”.', 'The story of a German singer named Willie, who while working in Switzerland, falls in love with a Jewish composer named Robert, whose family is helping people to flee from the Nazis. Robert’s family is skeptical of Willie, thinking she could be a Nazi as she becomes famous for singing the song “Lili Marleen”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJAS4FCOuFVQprgGfPuOnkZOtp0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265'),
  ('796994334558076067', 'Lilies', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Greyson, Daniel Jobin', 'Michel Marc Bouchard', 'Brent Carver, Marcel Sabourin, Aubert Pallascio, Jason Cadieux, Matthew Ferguson, Danny Gilmore, Ian D. Clark, Gary Farmer', null, '1952: Bishop Bilodeau visits a prison to hear the confession of Simon, a boyhood friend jailed for murder 40 years ago. However, once there, Bilodeau finds himself forced to watch a play put on by Simon and the other inmates depicting the two men''s youths. As the play progresses, the tragic truth of Simon''s crime comes to light.', '1952: Bishop Bilodeau visits a prison to hear the confession of Simon, a boyhood friend jailed for murder 40 years ago. However, once there, Bilodeau finds himself forced to watch a play put on by Simon and the other inmates depicting the two men''s youths. As the play progresses, the tragic truth of Simon''s crime comes to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgE2GVACHAuJNZ8WKKUm7PeMTmj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47643'),
  ('155930404538523615', 'Lilies of the Field', 1963, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ralph Nelson, Ernest Haller, Harry R. Sherman', 'James Poe', 'Sidney Poitier, Lilia Skala, Lisa Mann, Isa Crino, Francesca Jarvis, Pamela Branch, Stanley Adams, Dan Frazer', 'NR', 'An unemployed construction worker heading out west stops at a remote farm in the desert to get water when his car overheats. The farm is being worked by a group of East European Catholic nuns, headed by the strict mother superior, who believes the man has been sent by God to build a much needed church in the desert.', 'An unemployed construction worker heading out west stops at a remote farm in the desert to get water when his car overheats. The farm is being worked by a group of East European Catholic nuns, headed by the strict mother superior, who believes the man has been sent by God to build a much needed church in the desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYoVx2m8NP2hTWnEpwNeROIWrQ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38805'),
  ('900104060780105502', 'Liliom', 1930, 'Drama', 'Frank Borzage, Lew Borzage, Chester A. Lyons', 'Sonya Levien, S. N. Behrman', 'Charles Farrell, Rose Hobart, Estelle Taylor, H.B. Warner, Lee Tracy, Walter Abel, Mildred Van Dorn, Anne Shirley', 'NR', 'A carousel barker falls in love with a young woman. Both are fired from their jobs, and when the young woman becomes pregnant, the carousel barker tries to help pull off a robbery, which goes wrong. Because of the robbery, he dies, and after spending time in hell, is sent back to earth for one day to try to make amends. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive.', 'A carousel barker falls in love with a young woman. Both are fired from their jobs, and when the young woman becomes pregnant, the carousel barker tries to help pull off a robbery, which goes wrong. Because of the robbery, he dies, and after spending time in hell, is sent back to earth for one day to try to make amends. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHyMnjZFBR64MtaTblepjUUBJYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144792'),
  ('376521602528902398', 'Liliom', 1934, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Fritz Lang, Rudolph Maté', 'Ferenc Molnár, Bernard Zimmer, Robert Liebmann', 'Charles Boyer, Madeleine Ozeray, Robert Arnoux, Roland Toutain, Alexandre Rignault, Henri Richard, Marcel Barencey, Raoul Marco', 'NR', 'Two women love the same man in a world of few prospects. In Budapest, Liliom is a "public figure," a rascal who''s a carousel barker, loved by the experienced merry-go-round owner and by a young, innocent maid. The maid, Julie, loses her job after going out with Liliom; he''s fired by his jealous employer for going out with Julie. The two lovers move in with Julie''s aunt; unemployment emasculates him and a local weasel tempts him with crime. Julie, now wan, is true to Liliom even in his bad temper. Meanwhile, a stolid widower, a carpenter, wants to marry Julie. Is there any future on this earth for Julie and Liliom, whose love is passionate rather than ideal?', 'Two women love the same man in a world of few prospects. In Budapest, Liliom is a "public figure," a rascal who''s a carousel barker, loved by the experienced merry-go-round owner and by a young, innocent maid. The maid, Julie, loses her job after going out with Liliom; he''s fired by his jealous employer for going out with Julie. The two lovers move in with Julie''s aunt; unemployment emasculates him and a local weasel tempts him with crime. Julie, now wan, is true to Liliom even in his bad temper. Meanwhile, a stolid widower, a carpenter, wants to marry Julie. Is there any future on this earth for Julie and Liliom, whose love is passionate rather than ideal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vobL7LPk198YHXjkBnO6GeM7cj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63702'),
  ('399619418721572831', 'Lilith', 1964, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Robert Rossen, Larry Sturhahn, Allan Dennis', 'Robert Rossen', 'Warren Beatty, Jean Seberg, Peter Fonda, Kim Hunter, Anne Meacham, Jessica Walter, Gene Hackman, James Patterson', 'NR', 'Vincent Bruce, a war veteran, begins working as an occupational therapist at Poplar Lodge, a private psychiatric facility for wealthy people where he meets Lilith Arthur, a charming young woman suffering from schizophrenia, whose fragile beauty captivates all who meet her.', 'Vincent Bruce, a war veteran, begins working as an occupational therapist at Poplar Lodge, a private psychiatric facility for wealthy people where he meets Lilith Arthur, a charming young woman suffering from schizophrenia, whose fragile beauty captivates all who meet her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBTRVBpWZkkXkhfqqFTh59i4XjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60437'),
  ('309517745451351306', 'Lillian', 2019, 'Drama', 'Andreas Horvath, Andreas Horvath', 'Andreas Horvath', 'Patrycja Płanik', null, 'Lillian, stranded as an emigrant in New York, wants to walk back to her native Russia. Determined, she sets out on the long journey. A road movie across the United States into the cold of Alaska. The chronicle of a slow disappearance.', 'Lillian, stranded as an emigrant in New York, wants to walk back to her native Russia. Determined, she sets out on the long journey. A road movie across the United States into the cold of Alaska. The chronicle of a slow disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Njt8t3hS4Zfn2hfZ8ZILtL0oiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597095'),
  ('962230941747545956', 'Lillian Russell', 1940, 'Drama, Music', 'Irving Cummings, Leon Shamroy', 'William Anthony McGuire', 'Alice Faye, Don Ameche, Henry Fonda, Edward Arnold, Warren William, Leo Carrillo, Helen Westley, Nigel Bruce', 'NR', 'Alice Faye plays the title role in this 1940 film biography of the early-20th-century stage star.', 'Alice Faye plays the title role in this 1940 film biography of the early-20th-century stage star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zHQRm8vig16p6KjKPQRAQGG7t0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204604'),
