  ('14470771071041053', 'Lilly Turner', 1933, 'Drama', 'William A. Wellman, James Van Trees', 'Gene Markey, Kathryn Scola', 'Ruth Chatterton, George Brent, Frank McHugh, Guy Kibbee, Robert Barrat, Ruth Donnelly, Marjorie Gateson, Gordon Westcott', null, 'One woman faces many trials on the road to romance after unwittingly marrying a bigamist, then a carnival barker, and then falling for a young engineer.', 'One woman faces many trials on the road to romance after unwittingly marrying a bigamist, then a carnival barker, and then falling for a young engineer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5JWDsct38TWj5gNxqBi6sjoyy2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96170'),
  ('301472671475243967', 'Lilo & Stitch', 2002, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Chris Sanders, Dean DeBlois', 'Chris Sanders, Dean DeBlois', 'Daveigh Chase, Chris Sanders, Tia Carrere, David Ogden Stiers, Kevin McDonald, Ving Rhames, Zoe Caldwell, Jason Scott Lee', 'PG', 'As Stitch, a runaway genetic experiment from a faraway planet, wreaks havoc on the Hawaiian Islands, he becomes the mischievous adopted alien "puppy" of an independent little girl named Lilo and learns about loyalty, friendship, and ʻohana, the Hawaiian tradition of family.', 'As Stitch, a runaway genetic experiment from a faraway planet, wreaks havoc on the Hawaiian Islands, he becomes the mischievous adopted alien "puppy" of an independent little girl named Lilo and learns about loyalty, friendship, and ʻohana, the Hawaiian tradition of family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFuLvQJPoZpuruAtN3rVnMmLIH8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11544'),
  ('657752284811643242', 'Lilo & Stitch', 2025, 'Family, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Dean Fleischer Camp, Julien Pougnier, Nigel Bluck', 'Chris Sanders, Dean DeBlois', 'Maia Kealoha, Sydney Agudong, Chris Sanders, Zach Galifianakis, Billy Magnussen, Courtney B. Vance, Amy Hill, Tia Carrere', 'PG', 'The wildly funny and touching story of a lonely Hawaiian girl and the fugitive alien who helps to mend her broken family.', 'The wildly funny and touching story of a lonely Hawaiian girl and the fugitive alien who helps to mend her broken family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckQzKpQJO4ZQDCN5evdpKcfm7Ys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552524'),
  ('559241144870109375', 'Lilo & Stitch 2: Stitch Has a Glitch', 2005, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Michael LaBash, Tony Leondis', 'Eddie Guzelian, Alexa Junge, Michael LaBash', 'Chris Sanders, Dakota Fanning, Tia Carrere, David Ogden Stiers, Kevin McDonald, Kunewa Mook, Jason Scott Lee, William J. Caparella', 'PG', 'Now, we find the rowdy extraterrestrial getting used to life with his new ʻohana. However, a malfunction in the ultimate creation of Dr. Jumba soon emerges, which reinstates his destructive programming and threatens to both ruin his friendship with Lilo and to short him out for good!', 'Now, we find the rowdy extraterrestrial getting used to life with his new ʻohana. However, a malfunction in the ultimate creation of Dr. Jumba soon emerges, which reinstates his destructive programming and threatens to both ruin his friendship with Lilo and to short him out for good!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2R4mhZcikWEBlqv80VfJ7M9xql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20760'),
  ('1062250742795461705', 'Lilting', 2014, 'Drama', 'Hong Khaou, Urszula Pontikos', 'Hong Khaou', 'Ben Whishaw, Cheng Pei-Pei, Andrew Leung, Morven Christie, Naomi Yang, Peter Bowles, Shane Salter, Leila Wong', 'NR', 'A young man of Chinese-Cambodian descent dies, leaving behind his isolated mother and his lover of four years. Though the two don''t share a language, they grow close through their grief.', 'A young man of Chinese-Cambodian descent dies, leaving behind his isolated mother and his lover of four years. Though the two don''t share a language, they grow close through their grief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FevzSkxlAYnu3fsU3NWJnUoWZP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248212'),
  ('212761342211095712', 'Lily and Jim', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Don Hertzfeldt', 'Don Hertzfeldt', 'Robert May, Karin Anger', null, 'Lily and Jim are interviewed about their disastrous blind date.', 'Lily and Jim are interviewed about their disastrous blind date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9b93EGicJImI324TOtO0V0mKgT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32535'),
  ('137602461056726537', 'Lily C.A.T.', 1987, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Animation', 'Hisayuki Toriumi, Toshiyasu Okada, Shigeharu Shiba', 'Hiroyuki Hoshiyama', 'Osamu Saka, Chikao Ohtsuka, Hiroyuki Okita, Masako Katsuki, Eiko Yamada, Hiroshi Otake, Hideyuki Tanaka, Tessyo Genda', null, 'The crew of an interplanetary starship fights for survival after an alien force takes control of their craft.', 'The crew of an interplanetary starship fights for survival after an alien force takes control of their craft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRfQD3BgsAKCppB0YCX78ZhV8zB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67253'),
  ('576197162846901604', 'Lily Sometimes', 2010, 'Drama', 'Fabienne Berthaud, Fabienne Berthaud, Nathalie Durand', 'Pascal Arnold, Fabienne Berthaud', 'Diane Kruger, Ludivine Sagnier, Denis Ménochet, Brigitte Catillon, Jacques Spiesser, Anne Benoît, Jean-Pierre Martins, Gaëtan Gallier', null, 'After the death of her mother, a woman returns home to care for her sister.', 'After the death of her mother, a woman returns home to care for her sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnerG1oMGliTnin71S9NIzqbuCe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67509'),
  ('304767223748414802', 'Lily, aime-moi', 1975, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Maurice Dugowson, André Diot', 'Michel Vianey', 'Jean-Michel Folon, Patrick Dewaere, Rufus, Zouzou, Juliette Gréco, Jean-Pierre Bisson', null, 'Everything starts when a journalist François decides to investigate the world of working class people. He gets into the lives of Claude, a worker and his wife Lily who has left him.', 'Everything starts when a journalist François decides to investigate the world of working class people. He gets into the lives of Claude, a worker and his wife Lily who has left him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkwn7lj32BGh4IKSZJJDaxpTdjE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84388'),
  ('697683967876701546', 'Limbo', 1999, 'Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'John Sayles, Sandy McLeod, Haskell Wexler', 'John Sayles', 'Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, David Strathairn, Vanessa Martinez, Kris Kristofferson, Casey Siemaszko, Kathryn Grody, Rita Taggart, Leo Burmester', 'R', 'Traumatized by a fishing boat accident many years before, Joe Gastineau has given up his hopes for a life beyond the odd jobs he takes to support himself. That quickly changes when nomadic club singer Donna de Angelo and her troubled teen-age daughter enter Joe’s life. Both mother and daughter fall for Joe, increasing the friction between them. The tension continues to build when Joe invites them on a pleasure cruise up the Alaskan coast, discovering too late that the trip may cost them their lives.', 'Traumatized by a fishing boat accident many years before, Joe Gastineau has given up his hopes for a life beyond the odd jobs he takes to support himself. That quickly changes when nomadic club singer Donna de Angelo and her troubled teen-age daughter enter Joe’s life. Both mother and daughter fall for Joe, increasing the friction between them. The tension continues to build when Joe invites them on a pleasure cruise up the Alaskan coast, discovering too late that the trip may cost them their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ytI3G3dT6j888ySOwYhpJHz8ED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62676'),
  ('930388712087560013', 'Limbo', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nick Cooke, Danny Jackson, Wendy Ashman', 'Ben Sharrock', 'Amir El-Masry, Vikash Bhai, Ola Orebiyi, Kwabena Ansah, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Qais Nashif, Kenneth Collard, Sanjeev Kohli', 'R', 'An offbeat observation of refugees waiting to be granted asylum on a fictional remote Scottish island. It focuses on Omar, a young Syrian musician who is burdened by the weight of his grandfather’s oud, which he has carried all the way from his homeland.', 'An offbeat observation of refugees waiting to be granted asylum on a fictional remote Scottish island. It focuses on Omar, a young Syrian musician who is burdened by the weight of his grandfather’s oud, which he has carried all the way from his homeland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gkXhkAesdep1cC1mSTceccwbOt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554371'),
  ('738865201947446428', 'Limbo', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Action', 'Cheang Pou-Soi, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Au Kin-Yee, Shum Kwan-Sin', 'Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Liu Yase, Mason Lee, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Sammy Sum Chun-Hin, Fish Liew Chi-Yu, Hanna Chan, Kumer So Wai-Chuen', null, 'Veteran detective Cham works with rookie cop Will to hunt down the city''s serial killer. The investigation leads them to a lair littered with dismembered female limbs, and an ex-con who killed Cham''s wife and child years ago...', 'Veteran detective Cham works with rookie cop Will to hunt down the city''s serial killer. The investigation leads them to a lair littered with dismembered female limbs, and an ex-con who killed Cham''s wife and child years ago...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Hh2w1ei26DTJ3JWmW8qcGQUI1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591222'),
  ('771117788800409388', 'Limbo', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ivan Sen, Ivan Sen', 'Ivan Sen', 'Simon Baker, Rob Collins, Natasha Wanganeen, Nicholas Hope, Mark Coe, Joshua Warrior, Nick Buckland, Alexis Lennon', null, 'Travis, a jaded detective, arrives in the remote outback town of Limbo to investigate the cold case murder of local Indigenous girl Charlotte Hayes 20 years ago. As truths about the murder begin to unfold, the detective gains a new insight into the unsolved case.', 'Travis, a jaded detective, arrives in the remote outback town of Limbo to investigate the cold case murder of local Indigenous girl Charlotte Hayes 20 years ago. As truths about the murder begin to unfold, the detective gains a new insight into the unsolved case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9I1TsGYWMOiFSMfyRTnjhP9hdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1077670'),
  ('863846177432081432', 'Limit', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Lee Je-woo, Kim Sung-hwan, Lee Seung-jun', 'Lee Seung-joon, Shin Jai-ho, Hisashi Nozawa', 'Lee Jung-hyun, Moon Jeong-hee, Jin Seo-yeon, Park Myung-hoon, Choi Deok-moon, Park Kyung-hye, Im Cheol-hyung, Kim Ha-eon', null, 'A cop that goes undercover to hunt down the criminal behind a horrific kidnapping case. The police officer who gets involved in the case by taking the place of the kidnapping victim’s parents. As she fights to chase down the criminal, she finds herself caught up in tense, high-stakes mind games with the kidnapper.', 'A cop that goes undercover to hunt down the criminal behind a horrific kidnapping case. The police officer who gets involved in the case by taking the place of the kidnapping victim’s parents. As she fights to chase down the criminal, she finds herself caught up in tense, high-stakes mind games with the kidnapper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVoRc42K618DN88CBqFj46H1Wv4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718289'),
  ('846393490738243164', 'Limite', 1931, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Mário Peixoto, Ruy Santos, Edgar Brasil', 'Mário Peixoto', 'Olga Breno, Tatiana Rey, Raul Schnoor, Brutus Pedreira, Carmen Santos, Mário Peixoto, Edgar Brasil, Iolanda Bernardes', null, 'Adrift in the vast expanse of the ocean, a solitary boat carries three castaways—a man and two women. Stranded and devoid of any glimmer of rescue, they find solace in recounting the tales of their lives to one another. As they delve into their personal narratives, reminiscing about the circumstances that led them to this desolate predicament, they navigate through the depths of three distinct destinies. Bound by the confines of their shared space, every aspect of their existence becomes a boundary, underscoring their plight.', 'Adrift in the vast expanse of the ocean, a solitary boat carries three castaways—a man and two women. Stranded and devoid of any glimmer of rescue, they find solace in recounting the tales of their lives to one another. As they delve into their personal narratives, reminiscing about the circumstances that led them to this desolate predicament, they navigate through the depths of three distinct destinies. Bound by the confines of their shared space, every aspect of their existence becomes a boundary, underscoring their plight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRx6OsS1PXKs9k6pfUw4DhGkjNZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8353'),
  ('10584922436999222', 'Limited Life', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Aleksei Rudakov', 'Aleksei Rudakov', 'Marina Zudina, Oleg Menshikov, Evdokiya Germanova, Sergey Gazarov, Sergey Nikonenko, Vladimir Steklov, Nikolai Karnaukhov, Vasily Shlykov', null, 'A story about young girl Masha who is living in abandoned house and surrounded by the very strange company...', 'A story about young girl Masha who is living in abandoned house and surrounded by the very strange company...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0hxp792vWwvULDzPHPRNAcMGRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319496'),
  ('721284114557624009', 'Limitless', 2011, 'Thriller, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Neil Burger, Dale M. Nielsen, Richard Rutkowski', 'Leslie Dixon', 'Bradley Cooper, Robert De Niro, Abbie Cornish, Andrew Howard, Anna Friel, Johnny Whitworth, Tomas Arana, Robert John Burke', 'PG-13', 'The life of an unsuccessful writer is transformed by a top-secret ''smart drug'' that allows him to use 100% of his brain and become a perfect version of himself. His enhanced abilities soon attract shadowy forces that threaten his new life.', 'The life of an unsuccessful writer is transformed by a top-secret ''smart drug'' that allows him to use 100% of his brain and become a perfect version of himself. His enhanced abilities soon attract shadowy forces that threaten his new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCokPP4WCQRrrAuZ7FcpIyHr8b2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51876'),
  ('1062506272340350596', 'Limonov: The Ballad', 2024, 'History, Drama', 'Kirill Serebrennikov, Roman Vasyanov, Svetlana Punte', 'Kirill Serebrennikov, Ben Hopkins, Paweł Pawlikowski', 'Ben Whishaw, Viktoriya Miroshnichenko, Masha Mashkova, Tomas Arana, Corrado Invernizzi, Evgeny Mironov, Andrey Burkovskiy, Odin Lund Biron', null, 'A revolutionary militant, a thug, an underground writer, a butler to a millionaire in Manhattan. But also a switchblade-waving poet, a lover of beautiful women, a warmonger, a political agitator, and a novelist who wrote of his greatness. Eduard Limonov’s life story is a journey through Russia, America, and Europe during the second half of the 20th century.', 'A revolutionary militant, a thug, an underground writer, a butler to a millionaire in Manhattan. But also a switchblade-waving poet, a lover of beautiful women, a warmonger, a political agitator, and a novelist who wrote of his greatness. Eduard Limonov’s life story is a journey through Russia, America, and Europe during the second half of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oECqqtEb21qsVJangfa5F7Mdods.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495278'),
  ('806071385874958431', 'Lina', 2016, 'Drama', 'Michael Schaerer, Michael Saxer', 'Jan Poldervaart', 'Elisabeth Niederer, Rabea Egg, Flurin Giger, Fabian Krüger, Manuela Biedermann, Vilmar Bieri, Luna Wedler, Werner Biermeier', null, 'The film takes us back in time, to a relatively recent yet forgotten period in history, when many women like Lina were forced to fold in the face of unfair and blinkered authorities. The victim of an administrative internment aimed at re-educating her after her so-called "depraved behaviour", Lina finds herself completely abandoned, confused and humiliated. In present day, when she is 60 years old, for the first time in her life, our brave protagonist can finally "spill the beans", thus freeing herself of a burden that has threatened to destroy her all these years.', 'The film takes us back in time, to a relatively recent yet forgotten period in history, when many women like Lina were forced to fold in the face of unfair and blinkered authorities. The victim of an administrative internment aimed at re-educating her after her so-called "depraved behaviour", Lina finds herself completely abandoned, confused and humiliated. In present day, when she is 60 years old, for the first time in her life, our brave protagonist can finally "spill the beans", thus freeing herself of a burden that has threatened to destroy her all these years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e52gZwibt7ECx7YBnQl1kZnI3WJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404070'),
  ('98168335797855374', 'Lincoln', 2012, 'History, Drama', 'Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński, Adam Somner', 'Tony Kushner', 'Daniel Day-Lewis, Sally Field, David Strathairn, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, James Spader, Hal Holbrook, Tommy Lee Jones, John Hawkes', 'PG-13', 'The revealing story of the 16th US President''s tumultuous final months in office. In a nation divided by war and the strong winds of change, Lincoln pursues a course of action designed to end the war, unite the country and abolish slavery. With the moral courage and fierce determination to succeed, his choices during this critical moment will change the fate of generations to come.', 'The revealing story of the 16th US President''s tumultuous final months in office. In a nation divided by war and the strong winds of change, Lincoln pursues a course of action designed to end the war, unite the country and abolish slavery. With the moral courage and fierce determination to succeed, his choices during this critical moment will change the fate of generations to come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KeUqW6DpVtf8G9VMuI2l0XIPCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72976'),
  ('274188754446217871', 'Linda', 1993, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Nathaniel Gutman, Bryan England, Jay Tobias', null, 'Virginia Madsen, Richard Thomas, Ted McGinley, Laura Harrington, T.E. Russell, J. Don Ferguson, Richard K. Olsen, David Dwyer', 'PG-13', 'Two couples, friends for a long time, decide to go away together. Things soon take a turn for the worse when Linda and Jeff spend far too much time together instead of with their respective spouses, Paul and Stella.', 'Two couples, friends for a long time, decide to go away together. Things soon take a turn for the worse when Linda and Jeff spend far too much time together instead of with their respective spouses, Paul and Stella.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djdHFAAmWl3tJdEErqZI94CsrG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409349'),
  ('319189867581377678', 'Linda', 2024, 'Drama', 'Mariana Wainstein, Marcos Hastrup', 'Diego Bliffeld, Luciano Cocciardi, Horacio Convertini', 'Eugenia Suárez, Rafael Spregelburd, Julieta Cardinali, Minerva Casero, Felipe Otaño, Agustín Della Corte', null, 'Self-assured, mysterious, and captivating Linda agrees to work at an affluent home in Buenos Aires. Her charm sparks strong sexual attraction among all members of the family, exposing how fragile their externally happy veneer really is.', 'Self-assured, mysterious, and captivating Linda agrees to work at an affluent home in Buenos Aires. Her charm sparks strong sexual attraction among all members of the family, exposing how fragile their externally happy veneer really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lv6UUrTia3zv1iayirbDkYxScx8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1297185'),
  ('548378977066585062', 'Linda and Abilene', 1969, 'Drama, Western', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis, Herschell Gordon Lewis', 'Allison Louise Downe', 'Sharon Matt, Kip Marsh, Bambi Allen, Larry Martinelli, William Varris, Herbert Townsend, Bob Dorn', null, '19th century siblings Abilene and Tod, orphaned on their farm, become sexually attracted to each other. The confused Tod flees to a nearby town where he meets local bar girl Linda, and begins a sexual relationship with her. Meanwhile, a cowboy rapes Abilene, leading Tod seeking revenge despite Linda''s wariness and growing compassion for Abilene.', '19th century siblings Abilene and Tod, orphaned on their farm, become sexually attracted to each other. The confused Tod flees to a nearby town where he meets local bar girl Linda, and begins a sexual relationship with her. Meanwhile, a cowboy rapes Abilene, leading Tod seeking revenge despite Linda''s wariness and growing compassion for Abilene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTit60JZIx28CMxkUYeIWZCeZSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158443'),
  ('123026890149774503', 'Linda Linda Linda', 2005, 'Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Nobuhiro Yamashita, Yoshihiro Ikeuchi, Hideaki Satô', 'Wakako Miyashita, Nobuhiro Yamashita, Kosuke Mukai', 'Bae Doona, Aki Maeda, Yuu Kashii, Shiori Sekine, Takayo Mimura, Shione Yukawa, Yuko Yamazaki, Masahiro Komoto', 'NR', 'Only three days before their high school festival, guitarist Kei, drummer Kyoko, and bassist Nozomi are forced to recruit a new lead vocalist for their band. They choose Korean exchange student Son, though her comprehension of Japanese is a bit rough! It''s a race against time as the group struggles to learn three songs for the festival''s rock concert—including a classic ''80s song by the Japanese punk rock band The Blue Hearts called "Linda Linda".', 'Only three days before their high school festival, guitarist Kei, drummer Kyoko, and bassist Nozomi are forced to recruit a new lead vocalist for their band. They choose Korean exchange student Son, though her comprehension of Japanese is a bit rough! It''s a race against time as the group struggles to learn three songs for the festival''s rock concert—including a classic ''80s song by the Japanese punk rock band The Blue Hearts called "Linda Linda".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wX3xwuJ9uhCamndfGUePDkpAggZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27337'),
  ('944109871614697476', 'Linda Lovelace for President', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Claudio Guzmán, Robert Birchall, Richard Bremerkamp', 'Jack Margolis', 'Linda Lovelace, Fuddle Bagley, Val Bisoglio, Jack DeLeon, Micky Dolenz, Joey Forman, Danny Goldman, Garry Goodrow', 'R', 'An intentionally campy film designed to capitalize on Linda Lovelace''s sudden fame following "Deep Throat", this film centers around Linda''s fictional grass roots campaign to run for president. Touring the country with a rag-tag team of strange and wacky people, hilarity supposedly ensues at every stop.', 'An intentionally campy film designed to capitalize on Linda Lovelace''s sudden fame following "Deep Throat", this film centers around Linda''s fictional grass roots campaign to run for president. Touring the country with a rag-tag team of strange and wacky people, hilarity supposedly ensues at every stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgQ6gyZpyhaGa5fm1aUiRo6h8hF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30826'),
  ('597015281202675235', 'Lindenberg! Mach dein Ding', 2020, 'Music, Drama, Documentary', 'Sebastian Edschmid, Hermine Huntgeburth', 'Christian Lyra, Alexander M. Rümelin, Sebastian Wehlings', 'Jan Bülow, Julia Jentsch, Claude Heinrich, Jesse Hansen, Detlev Buck, Max von der Groeben, Charly Hübner, Udo Lindenberg', null, 'Long before his big stage breakthrough in 1973 in Hamburg, and 4.4 million records sold, the rock musician Udo Lindenberg from the Westphalian province, the man with the long hair and the hat, had many adventures. Before it all started, he moved from the remoteness of Gronau to Hamburg, where he met Paula, who was not his great love, but was quite a hottie. When the team of three was complete with Steffi Stephan, the idea of founding a band developed. But the road to get there was a long one: he drummed as a jazz drummer in bands, had a highly dangerous performance in a US military base in the middle of the Libyan desert and always believed in making it to the very top.', 'Long before his big stage breakthrough in 1973 in Hamburg, and 4.4 million records sold, the rock musician Udo Lindenberg from the Westphalian province, the man with the long hair and the hat, had many adventures. Before it all started, he moved from the remoteness of Gronau to Hamburg, where he met Paula, who was not his great love, but was quite a hottie. When the team of three was complete with Steffi Stephan, the idea of founding a band developed. But the road to get there was a long one: he drummed as a jazz drummer in bands, had a highly dangerous performance in a US military base in the middle of the Libyan desert and always believed in making it to the very top.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiOQyqAD8cjV40lqQo7alWwjHRY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633172'),
  ('731228510539903650', 'Line 9', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tavo Ruiz', 'Tavo Ruiz', 'Andrés Blanco De Durán, Holil Heredia', null, 'In a city with constant movement like the subway rides, the paths of Andrés and Miguel are crossing. It seems like the beginning of a new Romance but Andrés doesn''t know which direction to take.', 'In a city with constant movement like the subway rides, the paths of Andrés and Miguel are crossing. It seems like the beginning of a new Romance but Andrés doesn''t know which direction to take.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mUdPrT5KE9Bb6xoWOnz0epPVhr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499802'),
  ('109487367395640221', 'Line of Demarcation', 1966, 'Drama, War', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier', 'Colonel Rémy, Claude Chabrol', 'Jean Seberg, Maurice Ronet, Daniel Gélin, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Mario David, Jean Yanne, Jacques Perrin, Claude Léveillée', null, 'It is based on upon the memoir Mémoires d''un agent secret de la France libre et La Ligne de démarcation by Gilbert Renault under his pseudonym Colonel Rémy. A small village in the Jura is split by the river Loue which creates the line of demarcation between Nazi occupied France and freedom. A French officer, Pierre, is released by the Nazi soldiers to find his chateau converted into a German command centre. Whilst he is obliged to co-operate with the enemy, his wife Mary supports the resistance movement and is willing to risk her life for it. The Nazis step up their activity against the resistance, insisting that any who attempt to cross the line of demarcation will be shot. When his wife is arrested, Pierre decides to switch his allegiance.', 'It is based on upon the memoir Mémoires d''un agent secret de la France libre et La Ligne de démarcation by Gilbert Renault under his pseudonym Colonel Rémy. A small village in the Jura is split by the river Loue which creates the line of demarcation between Nazi occupied France and freedom. A French officer, Pierre, is released by the Nazi soldiers to find his chateau converted into a German command centre. Whilst he is obliged to co-operate with the enemy, his wife Mary supports the resistance movement and is willing to risk her life for it. The Nazis step up their activity against the resistance, insisting that any who attempt to cross the line of demarcation will be shot. When his wife is arrested, Pierre decides to switch his allegiance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUX9CorgUHlVgDUvtEbkXgmIMSc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70293'),
  ('836879798099793128', 'Line of Duty', 2019, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Steven C. Miller, Brandon Cox, Jeremy Phoenix', 'Jeremy Drysdale', 'Aaron Eckhart, Courtney Eaton, Ben McKenzie, Giancarlo Esposito, Jessica Lu, Dina Meyer, David Shae, Betzaida Landín', 'R', 'Frank Penny is a disgraced cop looking for a shot at redemption. When the police chief''s 11-year-old daughter is abducted, Frank goes rogue to try and save her. But to find the girl, Frank will need the help of Ava Brooks, whose live-streaming news channel is broadcasting Frank''s every move.', 'Frank Penny is a disgraced cop looking for a shot at redemption. When the police chief''s 11-year-old daughter is abducted, Frank goes rogue to try and save her. But to find the girl, Frank will need the help of Ava Brooks, whose live-streaming news channel is broadcasting Frank''s every move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3mrc6JunZYFTmFas2gKilmw77q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346709'),
  ('193911766926356702', 'Line Walker', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Jazz Boon, Kenny Tse Chung-To', 'Cat Kwan Ho-Ming', 'Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Louis Koo, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Moses Chan Ho, Louis Cheung, Clara Lee', null, 'The details of undercover police officers are deleted from a police database and a senior officer is left struggling to know who are the undercover officers and who are the criminals.', 'The details of undercover police officers are deleted from a police database and a senior officer is left struggling to know who are the undercover officers and who are the criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePNjPe80sb1NitOLHTGh1DxDkWO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411268'),
