  ('748577308334679425', 'Lines: Horizontal', 1962, 'Animation', 'Norman McLaren, Evelyn Lambart', null, null, null, 'An experiment in pure design by film artists Norman McLaren and Evelyn Lambart. Lines, ruled directly on film, move with precision and grace against a background of changing colors, in response to music specially composed for the films.', 'An experiment in pure design by film artists Norman McLaren and Evelyn Lambart. Lines, ruled directly on film, move with precision and grace against a background of changing colors, in response to music specially composed for the films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofanLb6c1cdrJ5yYfcf0636fdF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218658'),
