  ('402623251779179406', 'Linewatch', 2008, 'Crime, Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Kevin Bray', null, 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Omari Hardwick, Evan Ross, Dean Norris, Malieek Straughter, AMG, Sharon Leal, Omar Paz Trujillo', 'R', 'Academy Award Winner Cuba Gooding, Jr. is a Border Patrol Officer in the New Mexico desert with a secret past that is about to catch up with him. When his old gang leader tracks him down and forces him to smuggle drugs across the border, he must choose between the life he swore to leave behind and saving his family at any cost.', 'Academy Award Winner Cuba Gooding, Jr. is a Border Patrol Officer in the New Mexico desert with a secret past that is about to catch up with him. When his old gang leader tracks him down and forces him to smuggle drugs across the border, he must choose between the life he swore to leave behind and saving his family at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnwkCEBHKZexU1Bj4KSfWvDc6wy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15012'),
  ('507394936750130973', 'Lingaa', 2014, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'K. S. Ravikumar, Uzma Xina Kang, R. Ratnavelu', 'K. S. Ravikumar, Pon Kumaran', 'Rajinikanth, Anushka Shetty, Sonakshi Sinha, Santhanam, Karunakaran, Jagapati Babu, Dev Gill, Brahmanandam', null, 'After being turned down by the ruling Britons, the rightful heir to a famous dynasty inspires local villagers to build a dam themselves. A small-time thief reforms after learning about the role played by his grandfather in building a dam.', 'After being turned down by the ruling Britons, the rightful heir to a famous dynasty inspires local villagers to build a dam themselves. A small-time thief reforms after learning about the role played by his grandfather in building a dam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/595P2VmfbSOegsfAWK9A5j9MFoG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300425'),
  ('215445476733792890', 'Lingering', 2020, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Yoon Eun-kyoung', 'Yoon Eun-kyoung', 'Lee Se-young, Park Ji-young, Park Hyo-ju, Park Soi, Jeon Su-ji, Lee Ju-won, Kim Bo-yoon, Wang Seok-hyeon', null, 'When Yoo-mi seeks out her mother''s friend at a hotel to drop off her younger sister, she falls into unexpected mystery and horror.', 'When Yoo-mi seeks out her mother''s friend at a hotel to drop off her younger sister, she falls into unexpected mystery and horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWvi811WsBdBqFU8ZCg0ZWnHovQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675308'),
  ('321070226707032447', 'Lingua Franca', 2020, 'Drama', 'Dax Stringer, Brittney Elyse Vila, Isabel Sandoval', 'Isabel Sandoval', 'Isabel Sandoval, Lynn Cohen, Eamon Farren, Ivory Aquino, Lev Gorn, P.J. Boudousqué, Andrea Leigh, Leif Steinert', 'NR', 'Olivia, an undocumented Filipina immigrant paranoid about deportation, works as a caregiver to a Russian-Jewish grandmother in New York. When the man she’s secretly paying for a green card marriage backs out, she becomes involved with a slaughterhouse worker who is unaware that she’s a trans woman.', 'Olivia, an undocumented Filipina immigrant paranoid about deportation, works as a caregiver to a Russian-Jewish grandmother in New York. When the man she’s secretly paying for a green card marriage backs out, she becomes involved with a slaughterhouse worker who is unaware that she’s a trans woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20HKDrU2QccbEqzHmPJZRzMPoJM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583143'),
  ('189622485484109574', 'Lingui, the Sacred Bonds', 2021, 'Drama', 'Gabriele Roux, Mahamat-Saleh Haroun, Mathieu Giombini', 'Mahamat-Saleh Haroun', 'Achouackh Abakar Souleymane, Rihane Khalil Alio, Youssouf Djaoro, Briya Gomdigue, Saleh Sambo, Hadje Fatime N''Goua, Hamid Khayar, Emmanuel M''Baide Rotoubam', null, 'On the outskirts of the capital of Chad, determined single mother Amina works tirelessly to provide for herself and her 15-year old daughter Maria. When Amina discovers Maria is pregnant and does not want a child, the two women begin to seek out an abortion, condemned by both religion and law. In the process, mother and daughter forge a connection stronger than any they’ve ever known.', 'On the outskirts of the capital of Chad, determined single mother Amina works tirelessly to provide for herself and her 15-year old daughter Maria. When Amina discovers Maria is pregnant and does not want a child, the two women begin to seek out an abortion, condemned by both religion and law. In the process, mother and daughter forge a connection stronger than any they’ve ever known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Cg39mHfs9u8UiqZJZy5uYANWgG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820693'),
  ('526403378069319308', 'Linha de Passe', 2008, 'Drama', 'Daniela Thomas, Mauro Pinheiro Jr., Walter Salles', 'Walter Salles, Bráulio Mantovani, Daniela Thomas', 'Sandra Corveloni, Vinícius de Oliveira, João Baldasserini, Geraldo Rodrigues, Kaique Jesus Santos, Roberto Audi, Denise Weinberg, Ana Luiza Garritano', null, 'In the periphery of São Paulo, the pregnant single mother Cleuza works as maid in the apartment of a middle-class family. Each of her sons has a different unknown father: the oldest, Dênis, has a baby son that lives with his mother and he works as motorcycle courier.', 'In the periphery of São Paulo, the pregnant single mother Cleuza works as maid in the apartment of a middle-class family. Each of her sons has a different unknown father: the oldest, Dênis, has a baby son that lives with his mother and he works as motorcycle courier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKx5msZOhp71R7w9LPudDfrFQsz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8902'),
  ('436903009390818834', 'Link', 1986, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Richard Franklin, Mike Molloy, John Dodds', 'Everett De Roche', 'Elisabeth Shue, Terence Stamp, Steven Finch, Richard Garnett, David O''Hara, Kevin Lloyd, Joe Belcher, Geoffrey Beevers', 'R', 'Young graduate student Jane Chase becomes the new assistant to an eccentric zoology professor at the remote home he shares with two brilliant chimpanzees and an elderly orangutan butler named Link. But when one of the chimps is found dead and the professor mysteriously disappears, Link becomes dangerously aggressive towards Jane. Now, the time for “monkey business” is over and the true terror is about to begin.', 'Young graduate student Jane Chase becomes the new assistant to an eccentric zoology professor at the remote home he shares with two brilliant chimpanzees and an elderly orangutan butler named Link. But when one of the chimps is found dead and the professor mysteriously disappears, Link becomes dangerously aggressive towards Jane. Now, the time for “monkey business” is over and the true terror is about to begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5jQOHK9ZsxtDG8Pjah4j6ogFvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62131'),
  ('294597871641365818', 'Linkin Park: Live in Texas', 2003, 'Music, Documentary', 'Kimo Proudfoot', null, 'Chester Bennington, Mike Shinoda, Brad Delson, Joe Hahn, Rob Bourdon, Dave Farrell', null, 'Live in Texas is the first live album and third DVD by American rock band Linkin Park. The band''s main setlist includes songs from their studio albums Hybrid Theory and Meteora, as well as one song from their remix album Reanimation. The live album peaked at #23 on the Billboard 200, and it has sold 1.1 million copies in the United States.', 'Live in Texas is the first live album and third DVD by American rock band Linkin Park. The band''s main setlist includes songs from their studio albums Hybrid Theory and Meteora, as well as one song from their remix album Reanimation. The live album peaked at #23 on the Billboard 200, and it has sold 1.1 million copies in the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7b6aV79bXuoNktnP7oKfUzZGBka.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40444'),
  ('284381766010565557', 'Linnaisten vihreä kamari', 1945, 'Drama, Mystery, Horror', 'Valentin Vaala, Eino Heino', 'Valentin Vaala, Usko Kemppi', 'Rauli Tuomi, Regina Linnanheimo, Kaija Rahola, Paavo Jännes, Eine Laine, Reino Valkama, Ture Junttu, Mailis Vaaja', null, 'A nobleman in 1830''s Finland has to contend with stuck-up relatives, his daughters'' suitors, dark secrets from his family''s past, mistaken identities and a haunted wing of his mansion.', 'A nobleman in 1830''s Finland has to contend with stuck-up relatives, his daughters'' suitors, dark secrets from his family''s past, mistaken identities and a haunted wing of his mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3yVBx3uVoawi6gDeAHhxK0ghkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438815'),
  ('1106286068360106896', 'Linnea Quigley''s Horror Workout', 1990, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Fred Kennamer, Kenneth J. Hall, Michael Seaman', 'Kenneth J. Hall', 'Linnea Quigley, Cynthia Garris, Amy Hunt, Victoria Nesbitt, Kristine Seeley, Jeff Bowser, Patricia Harras, Randall Harvey', 'NR', 'Blood starts flowing as Linnea Quigley leads viewers through exercise routines while looking back on the films that made her a legend.', 'Blood starts flowing as Linnea Quigley leads viewers through exercise routines while looking back on the films that made her a legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cR1x3UYqhqbgr9CcIDLbFrORqxm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95115'),
  ('40677004255521933', 'Lino', 2017, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Rafael Ribas', 'Rafael Ribas, Estela Renner', 'Selton Mello, Luiz Carlos de Moraes, Dira Paes, Paolla Oliveira, Guilherme Lopes, Lupa Mabuze, Leonardo Rabelo, Hélio Ribeiro', 'G', 'Lino works as an entertainer at children''s parties, but he can''t stand the way children treat him, making fun of him because he works in a cat''s costume. Determined to change his life, he visits a wizard, but the magic doesn''t work in the right way, and he wakes up as a big cat.', 'Lino works as an entertainer at children''s parties, but he can''t stand the way children treat him, making fun of him because he works in a cat''s costume. Determined to change his life, he visits a wizard, but the magic doesn''t work in the right way, and he wakes up as a big cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d21rfVSBRvNbOk9m7K7UCgQhA2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459788'),
  ('269727069556018067', 'Linoleum', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama', 'Colin West, Ed Wu, Jessica Sherman', 'Colin West', 'Jim Gaffigan, Rhea Seehorn, Katelyn Nacon, Gabriel Rush, Amy Hargreaves, West Duchovny, Michael Ian Black, Tony Shalhoub', 'NR', 'When the host of a failing children’s science show tries to fulfill his childhood dream of becoming an astronaut by building a rocket ship in his garage, a series of bizarre events occur that cause him to question his own reality.', 'When the host of a failing children’s science show tries to fulfill his childhood dream of becoming an astronaut by building a rocket ship in his garage, a series of bizarre events occur that cause him to question his own reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAdPsBMnP5ctvKavQY9y8JazygK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765904'),
  ('1109104933863950121', 'Lion', 2019, 'Adventure, Animation', 'Amélie Goursat, Gaïanka Martinet, Thierry Hav', null, null, null, 'A young lonely lion crosses an arid and desert Savannah. He discovers that the only source of water is kept by a tyrannical buffalo.', 'A young lonely lion crosses an arid and desert Savannah. He discovers that the only source of water is kept by a tyrannical buffalo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4cMqc9lNy4aaLBEien5CaN93Ri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933720'),
