  ('677211493467261660', 'Lion Around', 1950, 'Animation', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald''s nephews use a mountain lion costume to scare Donald away so they can grab a pie off the windowsill. The deception is exposed, but a short while later, a real mountain lion comes along.', 'Donald''s nephews use a mountain lion costume to scare Donald away so they can grab a pie off the windowsill. The deception is exposed, but a short while later, a real mountain lion comes along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQ1y7sgeiNFK2iBp8T8iCmz8852.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66991'),
  ('563556529696446115', 'Lion Down', 1951, 'Comedy, Family, Animation', 'Jack Kinney', 'Dick Kinney, Milt Schaffer', 'Pinto Colvig, James MacDonald', null, 'Goofy is about to set up a hammock in the backyard of his penthouse apartment but is minus one tree. He immediately decides to get another one but he shows poor judgement in regards that the one he picks is unkowingly the home of a mountain lion. The lion returns to Goofy''s penthouse to reclaim his tree, notices the hammock, and decides this is a much better source of relaxation than laying on a tree branch. Thus, he tries to remove Goofy from the hammock so he can relax himself and eventually a battle ensues.', 'Goofy is about to set up a hammock in the backyard of his penthouse apartment but is minus one tree. He immediately decides to get another one but he shows poor judgement in regards that the one he picks is unkowingly the home of a mountain lion. The lion returns to Goofy''s penthouse to reclaim his tree, notices the hammock, and decides this is a much better source of relaxation than laying on a tree branch. Thus, he tries to remove Goofy from the hammock so he can relax himself and eventually a battle ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swSOzBicz7P1ECXcQqldNIVHyAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66993'),
  ('96932492890437357', 'Lion of the Desert', 1981, 'History, War, Drama', 'Moustapha Akkad, Jack Hildyard, Miguel Gil', 'David Butler, H.A.L. Craig', 'Anthony Quinn, Oliver Reed, Irene Papas, Raf Vallone, Rod Steiger, John Gielgud, Andrew Keir, Gastone Moschin', 'PG', 'Resistance leader Omar Mukhtar opposes Italian colonization before World War II. The brutal guerrilla war against Italian General Rodolfo Graziani and the Fascist forces of Benito Mussolini highlights the struggle for Libyan independence and the harsh tactics utilised by the colonisers.', 'Resistance leader Omar Mukhtar opposes Italian colonization before World War II. The brutal guerrilla war against Italian General Rodolfo Graziani and the Fascist forces of Benito Mussolini highlights the struggle for Libyan independence and the harsh tactics utilised by the colonisers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xm7CKN5mo09RNAcL1IP1xmJ5avT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26843'),
  ('635171207816298862', 'Lion, London Zoological Gardens', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Alexandre Promio', null, null, null, 'A male lion, right next to bars that are about 6 or 8 inches apart, keenly watches a uniformed zoo attendant toss small morsels of food into the cage. The lion alternates between finding the food on the cage floor and reaching through the bars to swipe at the man, who stays alarmingly close to the beast. In the background are the large rocks and brick wall at the back of the lion''s habitat.', 'A male lion, right next to bars that are about 6 or 8 inches apart, keenly watches a uniformed zoo attendant toss small morsels of food into the cage. The lion alternates between finding the food on the cage floor and reaching through the bars to swipe at the man, who stays alarmingly close to the beast. In the background are the large rocks and brick wall at the back of the lion''s habitat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNCEUulA6nX64OZdIJG2ZjXGkZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152458'),
  ('148919504295503682', 'Lion''s Den', 2008, 'Drama', 'Pablo Trapero, Jonás Costa, Mariano De Luca', 'Pablo Trapero, Alejandro Fadel, Martín Mauregui', 'Martina Gusmán, Elli Medeiros, Rodrigo Santoro, Laura García, Tomás Plotinsky, Leonardo Sauma, Walter Cignoli, Roberto Maciel', null, 'Julia, a 25 year-old university student, two weeks pregnant, with no criminal record, is sent to prison. Julia murdered the father of her child. This story addresses maternity, jail and Justice; confinement, guilt and solitude; but above all it deals with Julia and her son, Tomas, born inside an Argentinean prison.', 'Julia, a 25 year-old university student, two weeks pregnant, with no criminal record, is sent to prison. Julia murdered the father of her child. This story addresses maternity, jail and Justice; confinement, guilt and solitude; but above all it deals with Julia and her son, Tomas, born inside an Argentinean prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpYcisTwGJDnmlmjRrvySGcmbkX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8900'),
  ('526534123824840030', 'Lion''s Heart', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Marcos Carnevale, Inés Vera, Fernanda Delpino', 'Marcos Carnevale', 'Guillermo Francella, Julieta Díaz, Jorgelina Aruzzi, Nicolás Francella, Mauricio Dayub, María Nela Sinisterra, Nora Cárpena, Claudia Fontán', null, 'Ivana Cornejo is just getting used to being single again after her divorce three years ago. After an exasperating call from her ex-husband, she throws her cell phone away. Fortunately, the man who finds it calls her to return it, and to her amusement they have an instant rapport. The man on the other end of the phone is León Godoy, a renowned architect with a charming voice and a charismatic personality. They schedule a date so that he can return the cell phone. When León arrives, Ivana is surprised: he is everything she had imagined, except for one unexpected and startling detail... he’s only 4''5" tall.', 'Ivana Cornejo is just getting used to being single again after her divorce three years ago. After an exasperating call from her ex-husband, she throws her cell phone away. Fortunately, the man who finds it calls her to return it, and to her amusement they have an instant rapport. The man on the other end of the phone is León Godoy, a renowned architect with a charming voice and a charismatic personality. They schedule a date so that he can return the cell phone. When León arrives, Ivana is surprised: he is everything she had imagined, except for one unexpected and startling detail... he’s only 4''5" tall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnGZ6VPB7T923oLDGChcPdzmZxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222772'),
  ('505923262863038889', 'Lionel Messi: Destiny', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Alexander Hill', null, 'Lionel Messi, Lionel Scaloni, Emiliano Martínez, Alexis Mac Allister, Julián Álvarez, Gary Lineker, Marcela Mora y Araujo, Claudio Fabián Tapia', null, 'Behind-the-scenes documentary about how Lionel Messi succeeded in lifting the World Cup – the only trophy to have eluded him in an incredible career.', 'Behind-the-scenes documentary about how Lionel Messi succeeded in lifting the World Cup – the only trophy to have eluded him in an incredible career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFR8Sxvb1isO5UoMIWsXGs95fdk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1132324'),
  ('145205585634831131', 'Lionheart', 1987, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Franklin J. Schaffner, Alec Mills', 'Menno Meyjes, Richard Outten', 'Eric Stoltz, Gabriel Byrne, Nicola Cowper, Dexter Fletcher, Deborah Moore, Nicholas Clay, Bruce Purchase, Neil Dickson', 'PG', 'A young knight sets out to join King Richards crusaders. Along the way, he encounters The Black Prince who captures children and sells them as slaves to the Muslims. It is Robert Narra''s sworn duty to protect the children and lead them to safety.', 'A young knight sets out to join King Richards crusaders. Along the way, he encounters The Black Prince who captures children and sells them as slaves to the Muslims. It is Robert Narra''s sworn duty to protect the children and lead them to safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTkyJURfXLgGGBxE2g7xrw8PX1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78028'),
  ('769165825869520608', 'Lionheart', 1990, 'Action', 'Sheldon Lettich, Robert C. New, Roger La Page', 'Stefani Warren', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Harrison Page, Lisa Pelikan, Ashley Johnson, Deborah Rennard, Brian Thompson, Michel Qissi, Vojislav Govedarica', 'R', 'Lyon Gaultier is a deserter in the Foreign Legion arriving in the USA entirely hard up. He finds his brother between life and death and his sister-in-law without the money needed to heal her husband and to maintain her child. To earn the money needed, Gaultier decides to take part in some very dangerous clandestine fights.', 'Lyon Gaultier is a deserter in the Foreign Legion arriving in the USA entirely hard up. He finds his brother between life and death and his sister-in-law without the money needed to heal her husband and to maintain her child. To earn the money needed, Gaultier decides to take part in some very dangerous clandestine fights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4hdR6YSe0zRg8JuTpvW9kqXXlN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9399'),
  ('811963119055350019', 'Lionman', 1975, 'Action, Adventure, War, History', 'Natuk Baytan, Mustafa Yılmaz', 'Duygu Sağıroğlu, Natuk Baytan', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Bahar Erdeniz, Cemil Şahbaz, Hasan Ceylan, Reha Yurdakul, Ekrem Gökkaya, Yıldırım Gencer, Tarık Şimşek', null, 'When the king is murdered, his baby son and heir is hidden in the forest where he is abducted and raised by a pride of lions. As an adult he uses his beastly strength and claw-like hands to take revenge against the new king and his armies.', 'When the king is murdered, his baby son and heir is hidden in the forest where he is abducted and raised by a pride of lions. As an adult he uses his beastly strength and claw-like hands to take revenge against the new king and his armies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPHpamB8q4oIeyegZsChfq8uinB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116490'),
  ('304859870034012824', 'Lions', 2012, 'Drama, Adventure, Romance', 'Jazmín López', 'Jazmín López', 'Julia Volpato, Pablo Sigal, Macarena del Corro, Diego Vegezzi, Tomas Mackinlay', null, 'Deep in the forest a group of ﬁve friends wander around like a lion herd. Lost in their word games, they play and seduce each other while going back and forth into adulthood territory, in a desperate search to avoid their already written story.', 'Deep in the forest a group of ﬁve friends wander around like a lion herd. Lost in their word games, they play and seduce each other while going back and forth into adulthood territory, in a desperate search to avoid their already written story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJ7PsCMvoRBGpKQbDE59USlfp7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129115'),
  ('514817315260830055', 'Lions for Lambs', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History', 'Robert Redford, Philippe Rousselot, Dan Bradley', 'Matthew Michael Carnahan', 'Meryl Streep, Tom Cruise, Robert Redford, Andrew Garfield, Michael Peña, Derek Luke, Peter Berg, Kevin Dunn', 'R', 'Three stories told simultaneously in ninety minutes of real time: a Republican Senator who''s a presidential hopeful gives an hour-long interview to a skeptical television reporter, detailing a strategy for victory in Afghanistan; two special forces ambushed on an Afghani ridge await rescue as Taliban forces close in; a poli-sci professor at a California college invites a student to re-engage.', 'Three stories told simultaneously in ninety minutes of real time: a Republican Senator who''s a presidential hopeful gives an hour-long interview to a skeptical television reporter, detailing a strategy for victory in Afghanistan; two special forces ambushed on an Afghani ridge await rescue as Taliban forces close in; a poli-sci professor at a California college invites a student to re-engage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpwq5AHgj13uBE06B07xWqWQV5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4515'),
  ('514096940929742211', 'Lions Love', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Agnès Varda, Stevan Larner, Lynne Littman', 'Agnès Varda', 'Viva, James Rado, Gerome Ragni, Shirley Clarke, Carlos Clarens, Eddie Constantine, Max Laemmle, Steve Kenis', 'NR', 'Three actors in Hollywood live and love together. A director comes from New York to make a movie about actors and Hollywood.', 'Three actors in Hollywood live and love together. A director comes from New York to make a movie about actors and Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahLU10GZeVLFg1KoC6wblOk8ZlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63320'),
  ('838251049263300477', 'Lips of Blood', 1975, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Jean Rollin, Jean-François Robin', 'Jean Rollin, Jean-Loup Philippe', 'Jean-Loup Philippe, Annie Belle, Natalie Perrey, Catherine Castel, Marie-Pierre Castel, Anita Berglund, Hélène Maguin, Martine Grimaud', null, 'Frédéric sees a photograph of a ruined seaside castle, which triggers a strange childhood memory. He then goes on a strange quest, aided by four female vampires, to find the castle and the beautiful woman who lives there.', 'Frédéric sees a photograph of a ruined seaside castle, which triggers a strange childhood memory. He then goes on a strange quest, aided by four female vampires, to find the castle and the beautiful woman who lives there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KpdGQiCQfBUpGqMRZ9RvOtCYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29128'),
  ('318509370055451650', 'Lipsett Diaries', 2010, 'Animation, Documentary', 'Theodore Ushev', 'Chris Robinson', 'Xavier Dolan, Samuel Jacques, Jarvis Robinson Neall', null, 'A descent into the maelstrom of anguish that tormented Arthur Lipsett, a famed Canadian experimental filmmaker who died at 49. A diary transmuted into a clash of images and sounds charting a prodigious frenzy of creation, a tableau depicting an artist’s dizzying descent into depression and madness: with LIPSETT DIARIES, Theodore Ushev renews his filmmaking aesthetic and explores what happens when genius is on a first-name basis with madness.', 'A descent into the maelstrom of anguish that tormented Arthur Lipsett, a famed Canadian experimental filmmaker who died at 49. A diary transmuted into a clash of images and sounds charting a prodigious frenzy of creation, a tableau depicting an artist’s dizzying descent into depression and madness: with LIPSETT DIARIES, Theodore Ushev renews his filmmaking aesthetic and explores what happens when genius is on a first-name basis with madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Z95h1hF5HMn0em9OHzNdOaMKWg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234067'),
  ('464576816362160435', 'Lipstick', 1960, 'Drama, Crime', 'Maurizio Lucci, Pier Ludovico Pavoni, Damiano Damiani', 'Cesare Zavattini, Damiano Damiani', 'Pierre Brice, Giorgia Moll, Pietro Germi, Bella Darvi, Laura Vivaldi, Ivano Staccioli, Nino Marchetti, Renato Mambor', 'NR', 'A prostitute is robbed and murdered. A fourteen-year-old girl sees a suave gigolo come out of the hotel where the murder occurred. She has a schoolgirl crush on the handsome man though, so instead of reporting the crime she befriends him.', 'A prostitute is robbed and murdered. A fourteen-year-old girl sees a suave gigolo come out of the hotel where the murder occurred. She has a schoolgirl crush on the handsome man though, so instead of reporting the crime she befriends him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2f1ylhDMNKAU40Q7kpCJvHkk5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119886'),
  ('572862267107608039', 'Lipstick', 1976, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lamont Johnson, Craig Huston, Mickey McCardle', 'David Rayfiel', 'Margaux Hemingway, Chris Sarandon, Perry King, Anne Bancroft, John Bennett Perry, Mariel Hemingway, Francesco Scavullo, Meg Wyllie', 'R', 'An aspiring avant-garde composer rapes a fashion model. When she takes him to court, she''s slut-shamed by the defense and the man is exonerated. But justice will be served.', 'An aspiring avant-garde composer rapes a fashion model. When she takes him to court, she''s slut-shamed by the defense and the man is exonerated. But justice will be served.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJadg3azo3gHNhrVkJppFqJO62j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59809'),
  ('1123647078890728322', 'Lipstick Under My Burkha', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Akshay Singh, Alankrita Shrivastava, Harsh Mainra', 'Suhani Kanwar, Alankrita Shrivastava', 'Aahana Kumra, Ratna Pathak Shah, Plabita Borthakur, Konkona Sen Sharma, Shashank Arora, Vikrant Massey, Sushant Singh, Sonal Jha', null, 'Four ordinary women, inflicted by silly societal norms, have to steal, lie, cheat and hide in order to lead the lives that they rightfully deserve.', 'Four ordinary women, inflicted by silly societal norms, have to steal, lie, cheat and hide in order to lead the lives that they rightfully deserve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/watd7f9icZYuXd7ODenxw0tMAhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418235'),
  ('273343052231253476', 'Liquid Crystals', 1978, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé', null, null, null, 'Title cards introduce images we watch without narration; they are displays of shape and color. François de Roubaix''s electronic music accompanies these images, photographed under a polarizing microscope. The crystals appear to move like tiny organisms: small four-part fans share the frame with flowing lines of pink. Multiple patterns appear side by side.', 'Title cards introduce images we watch without narration; they are displays of shape and color. François de Roubaix''s electronic music accompanies these images, photographed under a polarizing microscope. The crystals appear to move like tiny organisms: small four-part fans share the frame with flowing lines of pink. Multiple patterns appear side by side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epGxvUlsZHz3UlSbz3LxM2AXrzA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146815'),
  ('1059143595581373197', 'Liquid Dreams', 1991, 'Thriller, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Mark S. Manos, Sven Kirsten', 'Zack Davis, Mark S. Manos', 'Candice Daly, Mink Stole, Paul Bartel, Tracey Walter, Richard Steinmetz, Frankie Thorn, John Doe, Juan Fernández', 'R', 'In a slightly future America, a woman goes to the big city to visit with her sister, who is dead in her apartment. In order to find out what happened to her sister, she gets a job working at a dance club, a lower notch in the strip joint circuit. Some of her colleagues begin showing up dead as she uncovers a sinister hierarchy in the strip club management that is harnessing the sexual activity for their own twisted ends.', 'In a slightly future America, a woman goes to the big city to visit with her sister, who is dead in her apartment. In order to find out what happened to her sister, she gets a job working at a dance club, a lower notch in the strip joint circuit. Some of her colleagues begin showing up dead as she uncovers a sinister hierarchy in the strip club management that is harnessing the sexual activity for their own twisted ends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dEAtFxn10GK9phEhzznKGP87WI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172426'),
  ('902018326513876222', 'Liquid Sky', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 'Slava Tsukerman, Yuri Neyman', 'Anne Carlisle, Slava Tsukerman, Nina V. Kerova', 'Anne Carlisle, Paula E. Sheppard, Bob Brady, Susan Doukas, Elaine C. Grove, Stanley Knapp, Jack Adalist, Otto von Wernherr', 'R', 'An alien creature invades New York''s punk subculture in its search for an opiate released by the brain during an orgasm.', 'An alien creature invades New York''s punk subculture in its search for an opiate released by the brain during an orgasm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMRvaqt0oUImW1Z91RXHTvkH6DE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20980'),
