  ('529260454799483458', 'Lisa', 1990, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror, Romance', 'Gary Sherman, Alex Nepomniaschy', 'Gary Sherman, Karen Clark', 'Staci Keanan, Cheryl Ladd, D.W. Moffett, Tanya Fenmore, Jeffrey Tambor, Edan Gross, Julie Cobb, Michael Robert Murphy', 'PG-13', 'A teenage girl becomes infatuated with a stranger who is, unbeknownst to her, a serial killer.', 'A teenage girl becomes infatuated with a stranger who is, unbeknownst to her, a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUx58fFzQE1bIFjURE4FlxMpbsz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95730'),
  ('231427756947570701', 'Lisa and the Devil', 1973, 'Horror', 'Mario Bava, Cecilio Paniagua, Lamberto Bava', 'Mario Bava, Alfredo Leone', 'Telly Savalas, Elke Sommer, Sylva Koscina, Alessio Orano, Eduardo Fajardo, Espartaco Santoni, Alida Valli, Gabriele Tinti', 'R', 'Lisa is a tourist in an ancient city. When she gets lost, she finds an old mansion in which to shelter. Soon she is sucked into a vortex of deception, debauchery and evil presided over by housekeeper Leandre.', 'Lisa is a tourist in an ancient city. When she gets lost, she finds an old mansion in which to shelter. Soon she is sucked into a vortex of deception, debauchery and evil presided over by housekeeper Leandre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kc1bN9JhSqbezrGcMt8lAvpmXnX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5483'),
  ('57880437309550102', 'Lisa Frankenstein', 2024, 'Horror, Comedy, Romance', 'Zelda Williams, Georgianna Paz, Jared Swidzinski', 'Diablo Cody', 'Kathryn Newton, Cole Sprouse, Liza Soberano, Henry Eikenberry, Joe Chrest, Carla Gugino, Joey Harris, Bryce Romero', 'PG-13', 'In 1989, a misunderstood teenager has a high school crush — who just happens to be a handsome corpse! After a set of playfully horrific circumstances bring him back to life, the two embark on a murderous journey to find love, happiness…and a few missing body parts along the way.', 'In 1989, a misunderstood teenager has a high school crush — who just happens to be a handsome corpse! After a set of playfully horrific circumstances bring him back to life, the two embark on a murderous journey to find love, happiness…and a few missing body parts along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAW7ZdIm4HLKB3g15uMOWYNdU8r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:993784'),
  ('786237600017005821', 'Lisa, Lisa', 1974, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Austin McKinney, Frederick R. Friedel', 'Frederick R. Friedel', 'Leslie Lee, Jack Canon, Ray Green, Frederick R. Friedel, Douglas Powers, Frank Jones, Carol Miller, George J. Monaghan', null, 'A group of three criminals on the run from the law, go about terrorizing the local townsfolk of a small community, before descending on an isolated farm which is home to a young girl named Lisa and her paralyzed grandfather. After being sexually assaulted by two of the gangsters, she retaliates using an axe and a razor blade.', 'A group of three criminals on the run from the law, go about terrorizing the local townsfolk of a small community, before descending on an isolated farm which is home to a young girl named Lisa and her paralyzed grandfather. After being sexually assaulted by two of the gangsters, she retaliates using an axe and a razor blade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fj2PR0EnAakr9F0VhUe2uwESmII.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56383'),
  ('696073983695759711', 'Lisabi: The Uprising', 2024, 'Drama', 'Niyi Akinmolayan, Nora Awolowo', 'Niyi Akinmolayan', 'Boma Akpore, Adebowale Adedayo, Gabriel Afolayan, Ibrahim Chatta, Lateef Adedimeji, Odunlade Adekola, Femi Adebayo, Adebimpe Oyebade', null, 'The legendary story of a folk hero''s rebellion against an oppressive empire, fighting for his freedom and forever altering the course of Yoruba history.', 'The legendary story of a folk hero''s rebellion against an oppressive empire, fighting for his freedom and forever altering the course of Yoruba history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p63pNkA43NUoQSVjoWJV6B4k8xC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1362418'),
  ('714262849888990490', 'Lisbon', 1956, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Ray Milland, Jack A. Marta, William Lang', 'John Tucker Battle', 'Ray Milland, Maureen O''Hara, Claude Rains, Francis Lederer, Yvonne Furneaux, Jay Novello, Percy Marmont, Robie Lester', 'NR', 'For Capt. Robert John Evans, smuggling black-market goods is nothing out of the ordinary. But one day he''s hired by Aristides Mavros for a more involved assignment -- sneaking an imprisoned American out of communist-controlled territory. The job seems challenging enough, but when he meets the prisoner''s sultry wife, Sylvia, he realizes his mission comes with a startling catch: Not only must he rescue this man, he must bring him back from the dead.', 'For Capt. Robert John Evans, smuggling black-market goods is nothing out of the ordinary. But one day he''s hired by Aristides Mavros for a more involved assignment -- sneaking an imprisoned American out of communist-controlled territory. The job seems challenging enough, but when he meets the prisoner''s sultry wife, Sylvia, he realizes his mission comes with a startling catch: Not only must he rescue this man, he must bring him back from the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTvxbD1OtFAqQQ8j69lu0qswtsg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241211'),
  ('469237784031375169', 'Lisbon Story', 1994, 'Drama, Music', 'Wim Wenders, Lisa Rinzler', 'Wim Wenders', 'Rüdiger Vogler, Patrick Bauchau, Teresa Salgueiro, Manoel de Oliveira, Vasco Sequeira, Joel Cunha Ferreira, Sofia Bénard da Costa, Vera Cunha Rocha', null, 'Wim Wenders'' homage to Lisbon and films. A sound engineer obtains a mysterious postcard from a friend who at the moment is filming a film in Lisbon. He sets out across Europe to find him and help him.', 'Wim Wenders'' homage to Lisbon and films. A sound engineer obtains a mysterious postcard from a friend who at the moment is filming a film in Lisbon. He sets out across Europe to find him and help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqxvLET9q43BxxNXmit9nNiEPPM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390'),
  ('25261422485362363', 'Lisístrata', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Francesc Bellmunt, Julián Elizalde', 'Francesc Bellmunt', 'Maribel Verdú, Juan Luis Galiardo, Javier Gurruchaga, Jesús Bonilla, Teté Delgado, Aitor Mazo, Glòria Cano, Eduardo Antuña', null, '411 BC, Sparta and Athens are in a endless war, but Lisistrata, a beautiful woman has an idea to stop the fight, and convinces all the women to do it: no sex until there is peace.', '411 BC, Sparta and Athens are in a endless war, but Lisistrata, a beautiful woman has an idea to stop the fight, and convinces all the women to do it: no sex until there is peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1h1UCiNx1RnDJKsJKKZDgAwpfhJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53039'),
  ('93170890726024029', 'Lissi and the Wild Emperor', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Michael Herbig, Peter Kaboth', 'Michael Herbig, Alfons Biedermann', 'Michael Herbig, Christian Tramitz, Waldemar Kobus, Rick Kavanian, Gerd Knebel, Lotte Ledl', null, 'The plot concerns a yeti who makes a pact with the devil to kidnap the most beautiful girl in the world. This turns out to be the Princess Lissi, who is clearly the Austrian Princess and later Empress Elisabeth of Bavaria, and much of the film is taken up with subplots related to the court and to the romantic relationship between Elisabeth and her husband. The film is thus a comic parody of the Sissi films.', 'The plot concerns a yeti who makes a pact with the devil to kidnap the most beautiful girl in the world. This turns out to be the Princess Lissi, who is clearly the Austrian Princess and later Empress Elisabeth of Bavaria, and much of the film is taken up with subplots related to the court and to the romantic relationship between Elisabeth and her husband. The film is thus a comic parody of the Sissi films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRqDnWHKPgbJ0yMaGd89sdrA3oU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4398'),
  ('91722980508094559', 'Listen', 1996, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Gavin Wilding, Brian Pearson', 'Michael Bafaro, Jonas Quastel', 'Brooke Langton, Sarah Buxton, Gordon Currie, Andy Romano, J. H. Wyman, Philip Granger, Frank Cassini, Iris Quinn', 'R', 'A young woman thinks one of her neighbors in her apartment building is a serial killer and begins to suspect both her current boyfriend and former girlfriend of being the killer.', 'A young woman thinks one of her neighbors in her apartment building is a serial killer and begins to suspect both her current boyfriend and former girlfriend of being the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OjJsqZqVvuDtBChtiV1qfgBCK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291367'),
  ('994859741335930268', 'Listen', 2020, 'Drama', 'Ana Rocha de Sousa, Rebecca Clayden, Lina Remeikaite', 'Aaron Brookner, Paula Alvarez Vaccaro, Ana Rocha de Sousa', 'Lúcia Moniz, Ruben Garcia, Maisie Sly, James Felner, Sophia Myles, Kiran Sonia Sawar, Brian Bovell, Jay Lycurgo', null, 'In the outskirts of London, Portuguese couple and parents of three, Bela and Jota, struggle to make ends meet. When a misunderstanding arises at school with their deaf daughter, the British social services grow concerned for the safety of their children. The film portrays the tireless battle of these immigrant parents against the law to keep their family together.', 'In the outskirts of London, Portuguese couple and parents of three, Bela and Jota, struggle to make ends meet. When a misunderstanding arises at school with their deaf daughter, the British social services grow concerned for the safety of their children. The film portrays the tireless battle of these immigrant parents against the law to keep their family together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqWqVxAxLPEmV90URLjvMTviLsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728143'),
  ('558126896094504498', 'Listen Out for Love', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'David I. Strasser, Robert Riendeau, Kevin Royce', 'Jason-Shane Scott', 'Stephanie Bennett, Mark Ghanimé, Lynn Whyte, Destiny Millns, Dave Kenneth MacKinnon, Shyinne Anastacio, Jonathan Purvis, Laura Yenga', 'G', 'Peyton Pepper, a goal-driven podcast producer, is forced to mold Alex McKinney, a brash loose cannon, into her next star and create the perfect show to save both of their careers. That show comes in the form of finding Peyton’s iconic idol, true love. But as the duo goes along for the ride, they are the ones who find love–once they open their hearts and listen.', 'Peyton Pepper, a goal-driven podcast producer, is forced to mold Alex McKinney, a brash loose cannon, into her next star and create the perfect show to save both of their careers. That show comes in the form of finding Peyton’s iconic idol, true love. But as the duo goes along for the ride, they are the ones who find love–once they open their hearts and listen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tM6dQjlwJMoI2zvD1ihkvbVsiS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876109'),
  ('851135648781397496', 'Listen to Britain', 1942, 'Documentary', 'Humphrey Jennings, Stewart McAllister, H.E. Fowle', 'Stewart McAllister, Humphrey Jennings', 'Leonard Brockington, Joseph Macleod, Bud Flanagan, Chesney Allen, Myra Hess, Queen Elizabeth the Queen Mother', null, 'A depiction of life in wartime Britain during the Second World War. Director Humphrey Jennings visits many aspects of civilian life and of the turmoil and privation caused by the war, all without narration.', 'A depiction of life in wartime Britain during the Second World War. Director Humphrey Jennings visits many aspects of civilian life and of the turmoil and privation caused by the war, all without narration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOkCsPLAi5wVEMJngDflGXCuCUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88609'),
  ('42191347189764574', 'Listen to Me', 1989, 'Romance, Drama', 'Douglas Day Stewart, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'Douglas Day Stewart', 'Kirk Cameron, Jami Gertz, Roy Scheider, Amanda Peterson, Tim Quill, Christopher Atkins, George Wyner, Anthony Zerbe', 'PG-13', 'It was the best time of their lives. A kid from Oklahoma. An immigrant''s daughter. A senator''s son, a society girl, and a college professor with a dream. They had one thing in common...the will to win. A group of college debaters learn about the world, friendships, love, dreams and family.', 'It was the best time of their lives. A kid from Oklahoma. An immigrant''s daughter. A senator''s son, a society girl, and a college professor with a dream. They had one thing in common...the will to win. A group of college debaters learn about the world, friendships, love, dreams and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjSrr8gtYUKOIVuutjAGFsxAGrS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86408'),
  ('346065203214451463', 'Listen to Me Marlon', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Stevan Riley, Ole Bratt Birkeland', 'Peter Ettedgui, Stevan Riley', 'Marlon Brando, Stella Adler, Bette Davis, Montgomery Clift, Anna Kashfi, Dick Cavett, Francis Ford Coppola, Konstantin Stanislavski', null, 'With exclusive access to his extraordinary unseen and unheard personal archive including hundreds of hours of audio recorded over the course of his life, this is the definitive Marlon Brando cinema documentary. Charting his exceptional career as an actor and his extraordinary life away from the stage and screen with Brando himself as your guide, the film will fully explore the complexities of the man by telling the story uniquely from Marlon''s perspective, entirely in his own voice. No talking heads, no interviewees, just Brando on Brando and life.', 'With exclusive access to his extraordinary unseen and unheard personal archive including hundreds of hours of audio recorded over the course of his life, this is the definitive Marlon Brando cinema documentary. Charting his exceptional career as an actor and his extraordinary life away from the stage and screen with Brando himself as your guide, the film will fully explore the complexities of the man by telling the story uniquely from Marlon''s perspective, entirely in his own voice. No talking heads, no interviewees, just Brando on Brando and life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhqIuN7VC5ZpBDyRnwyVRNR6CC3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319076'),
  ('747111747000936066', 'Listen to My Song', 1959, 'Drama, Music', 'Antonio del Amo, Juan Mariné', 'Emilio Canda, José Manuel Iglesias, Antonio del Amo', 'Joselito, Luz Márquez, Jesús Tordesillas, Barta Barri, Pilar Sanclemente, Carlos Miguel Solá, Salvador Soler Marí, Dolores Villaespesa', null, 'A poor child, who does not know his parents, joins a caravan of puppeteers to escape from the house where it is received and try to find his mother. Although living in extreme poverty, the child has, however, something that helps you get ahead: his great voice. One day, when a producer heard her singing in the street, receives an invitation to go to television.', 'A poor child, who does not know his parents, joins a caravan of puppeteers to escape from the house where it is received and try to find his mother. Although living in extreme poverty, the child has, however, something that helps you get ahead: his great voice. One day, when a producer heard her singing in the street, receives an invitation to go to television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfrLGo7oc7JmliSLpUncTgBVjk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118898'),
  ('569304643160053943', 'Listen to the Universe', 2019, 'Drama, Music', 'Piotr Niemyjski, Kei Ishikawa, Hirofumi Kawaguchi', 'Kei Ishikawa', 'Mayu Matsuoka, Tori Matsuzaka, Win Morisaki, Ouji Suzuka, Asami Usuda, Rila Fukushima, Hidekazu Mashima, Hairi Katagiri', null, 'Four pianists take part in the preliminary round of an international piano playing competition. Each has a story that is different and unique. One is a former child prodigy who stopped playing when her mother died. One is a Julliard student. One is a new face and yet comes recommended.', 'Four pianists take part in the preliminary round of an international piano playing competition. Each has a story that is different and unique. One is a former child prodigy who stopped playing when her mother died. One is a Julliard student. One is a new face and yet comes recommended.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZP7lqDePDqYbGJ3ybxXNXkilJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575701'),
  ('51773094353003343', 'Listen to Your Heart', 2010, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Matt Thompson, Chase Bowman', 'Kent Moran', 'Alexia Rasmussen, Cybill Shepherd, Shirley Knight, Ernie Sabella, Matthew Albrecht, Kent Moran, Frank Watson', null, 'Danny Foster doesn''t have much: an apartment as small as his paychecks, no family, and a struggling music career. Yet for him, "every day is a great day to be alive," an attitude he gained from his mother''s unwavering optimism during her losing battle with cancer. It''s love at first sight when Danny meets Ariana, a wealthy girl from Greenwich, CT who tragically cannot hear the music she inspires him to write. Ariana, hearing impaired since childhood, is torn between hanging onto the shelter her controlling mother provides and fighting for a love that, if given the chance, might just change her life', 'Danny Foster doesn''t have much: an apartment as small as his paychecks, no family, and a struggling music career. Yet for him, "every day is a great day to be alive," an attitude he gained from his mother''s unwavering optimism during her losing battle with cancer. It''s love at first sight when Danny meets Ariana, a wealthy girl from Greenwich, CT who tragically cannot hear the music she inspires him to write. Ariana, hearing impaired since childhood, is torn between hanging onto the shelter her controlling mother provides and fighting for a love that, if given the chance, might just change her life', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MATgoCyJKbnUM06dYPQ2fOGeoI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48373'),
  ('385357507025998371', 'Listen Up Philip', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alex Ross Perry, Sean Price Williams, Inna Braude', 'Alex Ross Perry', 'Jason Schwartzman, Elisabeth Moss, Jonathan Pryce, Krysten Ritter, Joséphine de la Baume, Jess Weixler, Kate Lyn Sheil, Dree Hemingway', null, 'Anger rages in Philip as he awaits the publication of his second novel. He feels pushed out of his adopted home city by the constant crowds and noise, a deteriorating relationship with his photographer girlfriend Ashley, and his own indifference to promoting the novel. When Philip''s idol Ike Zimmerman offers his isolated summer home as a refuge, he finally gets the peace and quiet to focus on his favorite subject: himself.', 'Anger rages in Philip as he awaits the publication of his second novel. He feels pushed out of his adopted home city by the constant crowds and noise, a deteriorating relationship with his photographer girlfriend Ashley, and his own indifference to promoting the novel. When Philip''s idol Ike Zimmerman offers his isolated summer home as a refuge, he finally gets the peace and quiet to focus on his favorite subject: himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHfrGEdTEW20W6L26qbJ0DFNDKo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251736'),
  ('406853899515270583', 'Listen, Darling', 1938, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Family', 'Edwin L. Marin, Charles Lawton Jr.', 'Elaine Ryan, Anne Morrison Chapin', 'Judy Garland, Freddie Bartholomew, Mary Astor, Walter Pidgeon, Alan Hale, Scotty Beckett, Gene Lockhart, Charley Grapewin', 'NR', 'To stop Pinkie''s widowed, struggling mother Dottie from marrying a well-off older man they know she doesn''t love, teenager Pinkie and her best friend Buzz kidnap her in the family travel trailer to live a carefree life on the open road. They then get the idea to find Dottie a financially secure husband whom both she and Pinkie would like.', 'To stop Pinkie''s widowed, struggling mother Dottie from marrying a well-off older man they know she doesn''t love, teenager Pinkie and her best friend Buzz kidnap her in the family travel trailer to live a carefree life on the open road. They then get the idea to find Dottie a financially secure husband whom both she and Pinkie would like.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ik3vQc7ogYxHcBAXKxfVrHItPfa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90932'),
  ('1089322446313991664', 'Listening', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Khalil Sullins, Blake McClure, Leah Mah', 'Khalil Sullins', 'Thomas Stroppel, Artie Ahr, Amber Marie Bollinger, Christine Haeberman, Steve Hanks, Buddy Daniels Friedman', 'NR', 'For years, we have tried to harness the power of the human mind… and failed. Now, one breakthrough will change everything. Beyond technology. Beyond humanity. Beyond control. David, Ryan, and Jordan hope the telepathy invention will solve all their problems, but the bleeding-edge technology opens a Pandora’s box of new dangers, as the team discovers that when they open their minds, there is nowhere to hide their thoughts.', 'For years, we have tried to harness the power of the human mind… and failed. Now, one breakthrough will change everything. Beyond technology. Beyond humanity. Beyond control. David, Ryan, and Jordan hope the telepathy invention will solve all their problems, but the bleeding-edge technology opens a Pandora’s box of new dangers, as the team discovers that when they open their minds, there is nowhere to hide their thoughts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrmNdnf0njvaH5TrX8wuHJdtIis.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331592'),
  ('430423544371376581', 'Lisztomania', 1975, 'Music, Comedy, History', 'Tim Hutchinson, Ken Russell, Peter Suschitzky', 'Ken Russell', 'Roger Daltrey, Sara Kestelman, Paul Nicholas, Ringo Starr, Rick Wakeman, John Justin, Fiona Lewis, Veronica Quilligan', 'R', 'In the 19th century, Romantic composer/pianist Franz Liszt tries to end his hedonistic ways but keeps getting sucked back in by his seductive fellow composer Richard Wagner.', 'In the 19th century, Romantic composer/pianist Franz Liszt tries to end his hedonistic ways but keeps getting sucked back in by his seductive fellow composer Richard Wagner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slkgkRL8hu0Sj4sOkcb8NSkwdGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67298'),
  ('951046627610523835', 'Litan', 1982, 'Horror, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Jean-Christophe David, Étienne Méry', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Patrick Granier, Jean-Claude Romer', 'Marie-José Nat, Jean-Pierre Mocky, Nino Ferrer, Marisa Muxen, Bill Dunn, Georges Wod, Dominique Zardi, Sophie Edelman', null, 'Married couple Jock & Nora are visiting the town of Litan during Litan''s Day, with its carnivalesque atmosphere. When Nora wakes that morning from dreaming the bizarre death of her husband, she sets out across town to find him and warn him. But as she does, she encounters stranger and stranger people and events erupting into a frenzy in front of her. Now, she and Jock must elude all of the impediments in their way of reaching safety on the outskirts of town.', 'Married couple Jock & Nora are visiting the town of Litan during Litan''s Day, with its carnivalesque atmosphere. When Nora wakes that morning from dreaming the bizarre death of her husband, she sets out across town to find him and warn him. But as she does, she encounters stranger and stranger people and events erupting into a frenzy in front of her. Now, she and Jock must elude all of the impediments in their way of reaching safety on the outskirts of town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVxnKp9kdPL5M6i1Ly1W7iu3FHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66448'),
  ('113279460978804213', 'Litchi Hikari Club', 2016, 'Horror', 'Eisuke Naito, Yoko Itakura, Masanori Midorikawa', 'Keisuke Tominaga, Eisuke Naito', 'Yuki Furukawa, Shuhei Nomura, Ayami Nakajo, Shotaro Mamiya, Junya Ikeda, Ryô Matsuda, Junki Tozuka, Reiya Masaki', null, 'In the bleak, smoke-choked Keiko Town, a gang of boys forms the Hikari Club to destroy the corrupt adult world. But as they build an AI to carry out their mission, they can’t stop the one thing they fear most—growing up themselves.', 'In the bleak, smoke-choked Keiko Town, a gang of boys forms the Hikari Club to destroy the corrupt adult world. But as they build an AI to carry out their mission, they can’t stop the one thing they fear most—growing up themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwj6ZEmeYoIr1lmjJMOHPDszhcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377662'),
  ('71887204809524708', 'Literally, Right Before Aaron', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Brandon Riley, Dylan Matlock, Sam Shapson', 'Ryan Eggold', 'Justin Long, Cobie Smulders, Ryan Hansen, John Cho, Kristen Schaal, Peter Gallagher, Dana Delany, Rick Overton', null, 'Still reeling from his breakup with college sweetheart Allison, Adam''s world is thrown into further chaos when he’s surprisingly invited to attend her upcoming wedding. Returning home for the festivities, Adam must confront unresolved feelings while trying to convince himself and everyone else that he is truly happy for her.', 'Still reeling from his breakup with college sweetheart Allison, Adam''s world is thrown into further chaos when he’s surprisingly invited to attend her upcoming wedding. Returning home for the festivities, Adam must confront unresolved feelings while trying to convince himself and everyone else that he is truly happy for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fdjQ5lFbkSWlAUv7px6KSEOdxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450477'),
  ('73714484841263131', 'Little', 2019, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Tina Gordon, Greg Gardiner, Mike Topoozian', 'Tracy Oliver, Tina Gordon', 'Regina Hall, Issa Rae, Marsai Martin, Tone Bell, Mikey Day, JD McCrary, Marc Hawes, Thalia Tran', 'PG-13', 'Jordan Sanders, a take-no-prisoners tech mogul, wakes up one morning in the body of her 13-year-old self right before a do-or-die presentation. Her beleaguered assistant April is the only one in on the secret that her daily tormentor is now trapped in an awkward tween body, just as everything is on the line.', 'Jordan Sanders, a take-no-prisoners tech mogul, wakes up one morning in the body of her 13-year-old self right before a do-or-die presentation. Her beleaguered assistant April is the only one in on the secret that her daily tormentor is now trapped in an awkward tween body, just as everything is on the line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MDB6jJl3U7xK1Gw64zIqt9pQA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526050'),
  ('442503769037543741', 'Little ''Tinker', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery', null, 'William Roberts', null, 'The lovesick B.O. Skunk is having no luck finding a mate, when Cupid gives him a book called "Advice for the Love-Worn" to help him out.', 'The lovesick B.O. Skunk is having no luck finding a mate, when Cupid gives him a book called "Advice for the Love-Worn" to help him out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ML0aurtXnaglLiBmDmoYvJS9A7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84897'),
  ('285932596224744115', 'Little Accidents', 2014, 'Drama', 'Rachel Morrison, Sara Colangelo', 'Sara Colangelo', 'Elizabeth Banks, Boyd Holbrook, Chloë Sevigny, Jacob Lofland, Josh Lucas, Alexia Rasmussen, James DeForest Parker, Travis Tope', null, 'In a small American coal town living in the shadow of a recent mining accident, the disappearance of a teenage boy draws three people together—a surviving miner, the lonely wife of a mine executive, and a local boy—in a web of secrets.', 'In a small American coal town living in the shadow of a recent mining accident, the disappearance of a teenage boy draws three people together—a surviving miner, the lonely wife of a mine executive, and a local boy—in a web of secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nGltRVl58E5GEwCqCtk9HOifV5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244260'),
  ('588113690834894600', 'Little Amélie or the Character of Rain', 2025, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'Laetitia Nurdin, Maïlys Vallade, Juliette Laurent', 'Aude Py, Eddine Noel, Liane-cho Han', 'Loïse Charpentier, Victoria Grobois, Yumi Fujimori, Cathy Cerda, Marc Arnaud, Laëtitia Coryn, Haylee Issembourg, Isaac Schoumsky', 'PG', 'The world is a perplexing, peaceful mystery to Amélie until a miraculous encounter with chocolate ignites her wild sense of curiosity. As she develops a deep attachment to her family''s housekeeper, Nishio-san, Amélie discovers the wonders of nature as well as the emotional truths hidden beneath the surface of her family''s idyllic life as foreigners in post-war Japan.', 'The world is a perplexing, peaceful mystery to Amélie until a miraculous encounter with chocolate ignites her wild sense of curiosity. As she develops a deep attachment to her family''s housekeeper, Nishio-san, Amélie discovers the wonders of nature as well as the emotional truths hidden beneath the surface of her family''s idyllic life as foreigners in post-war Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoqDvTUVPoZJWw24AjGDt3J4tZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682012'),
