  ('411575597980502914', 'Little Beau Pepé', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Chuck Jones, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Michael Maltese', null, 'After driving the Foreign Legionnaires from their fort with his aroma, lovesick skunk Pepe falls for the camp mascot, a cat who''s accidentally gotten a white stripe painted down her back.', 'After driving the Foreign Legionnaires from their fort with his aroma, lovesick skunk Pepe falls for the camp mascot, a cat who''s accidentally gotten a white stripe painted down her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qe4wXBJZzB4Zte2h264oJszHyUq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235934'),
  ('963469535267993707', 'Little Beau Porky', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Joe Dougherty', null, 'Porky''s in the foreign legion. But he''s not allowed to fight; all he can do is scrub camels, and he''s not particularly good at that. The other soldiers ride off to find the evil Ali Mode, leaving Porky behind. Ali Mode notices, and tries to gain entrance to the fort, first by tricking Porky, then by tunnelling, then by military assaults, but Porky rebuffs all attempts, ultimately landing Ali Mode in a big vat of "Cairo Syrup" and collecting a chestful of medals.', 'Porky''s in the foreign legion. But he''s not allowed to fight; all he can do is scrub camels, and he''s not particularly good at that. The other soldiers ride off to find the evil Ali Mode, leaving Porky behind. Ali Mode notices, and tries to gain entrance to the fort, first by tricking Porky, then by tunnelling, then by military assaults, but Porky rebuffs all attempts, ultimately landing Ali Mode in a big vat of "Cairo Syrup" and collecting a chestful of medals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPFDMWz7MZhv3afIDpC1ekFvoU8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201978'),
  ('194080260598290174', 'Little Bee', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Michelle Gabriel', null, 'Alex Minei, Thainá Almeida, Elisa Vilon, Laudi Regina, Adna Cruz, Raul Schlosser, Sidney Cesar, Wallace Costa', null, 'When a war threatens a beehive, peace may come from unexpected places. A honey-maker wants to fight, a soldier wants to make honey. Can these bees follow their hearts instead of the rules?', 'When a war threatens a beehive, peace may come from unexpected places. A honey-maker wants to fight, a soldier wants to make honey. Can these bees follow their hearts instead of the rules?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jykbvInQKrztF0P9IXtpBZ090dV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216115'),
