  ('503173355251320973', 'Little Big League', 1994, 'Comedy, Family', 'Andrew Scheinman, Donald E. Thorin', 'Gregory K. Pincus, Adam Scheinman', 'Luke Edwards, Timothy Busfield, John Ashton, Ashley Crow, Kevin Dunn, Billy L. Sullivan, Miles Feulner, Jonathan Silverman', 'PG', 'When the owner of the Minnesota Twins passes away, he bequeaths the team to his preteen grandson. The newly minted head honcho quickly appoints himself manager, causing unrest in an organization that struggles to take orders from a 12-year-old.', 'When the owner of the Minnesota Twins passes away, he bequeaths the team to his preteen grandson. The newly minted head honcho quickly appoints himself manager, causing unrest in an organization that struggles to take orders from a 12-year-old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ps0GapKs4vuV38XX6VUbTZm8QS6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31504'),
