  ('974499914944049742', 'Little Big Soldier', 2010, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure', 'Ding Sheng, Zhao Xiaoding', 'Jackie Chan, Ding Sheng', 'Jackie Chan, Leehom Wang, Steve Yoo, Lin Peng, Du Yuming, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Yu Rongguang, Wu Yue', 'NR', 'The story of a farmer forced into conscription, who has been looking to get out of the army ever since. His great chance arrives when he stumbles upon a wounded general from an enemy state, and he kidnaps him, intending to claim credit for the capture, which includes five acres of land, and most importantly, honorable discharge from the army.', 'The story of a farmer forced into conscription, who has been looking to get out of the army ever since. His great chance arrives when he stumbles upon a wounded general from an enemy state, and he kidnaps him, intending to claim credit for the capture, which includes five acres of land, and most importantly, honorable discharge from the army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCSQnopQPIw58RKTfzoRYxq9It5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35138'),
