  ('844300281134225265', 'Little Bird', 1997, 'Drama', 'Carlos Saura, José Luis López-Linares', 'Carlos Saura', 'Francisco Rabal, Alejandro Martínez, Dafne Fernández, Eusebio Lázaro, Manuel Bandera, Juan Luis Galiardo, María Luisa San José, Eulalia Ramón', null, 'Manu travels to Murcia to spend the summer with their grandparents because their parents are getting divorced. Surrounded by gardens, sea, nature, and lush, warm family, Manu find his first love and the first signs of adulthood.', 'Manu travels to Murcia to spend the summer with their grandparents because their parents are getting divorced. Surrounded by gardens, sea, nature, and lush, warm family, Manu find his first love and the first signs of adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwaq0nuJUAfl2OaXWOmOt2K3WPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114350'),
