  ('595487258238238547', 'Little Bites', 2024, 'Horror', 'Spider One, Andy Patch, Lisa Palenica', 'Spider One', 'Krsy Fox, Jon Sklaroff, Elizabeth Phoenix Caro, Barbara Crampton, Heather Langenkamp, Bonnie Aarons, Chaz Bono, Lyndsi LaRose', 'R', 'Mindy, a young widow and mother who tries to protect her daughter Alice from a flesh eating monster named Agyar. Mindy has been secretly sacrificing her own life by allowing the creature to feast on her body as she keeps Alice hidden away at her grandmother’s house.', 'Mindy, a young widow and mother who tries to protect her daughter Alice from a flesh eating monster named Agyar. Mindy has been secretly sacrificing her own life by allowing the creature to feast on her body as she keeps Alice hidden away at her grandmother’s house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lb8p3sR9A9Y3TTJZm6QgBicD6hJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1139095'),
  ('535652632919416188', 'Little Black Angels', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joselito Rodríguez, Eduardo Rojo, José Luis González de León', 'Joselito Rodríguez', 'Manuel López Ochoa, Martha Rangel, Titina Romay, Juanita Moore, Juanita Hernández Mejía, Neftali Lopez, Norma Jiménez Pons, Carlos Martínez Baena', null, 'A racist woman who doesn''t know about her own mixed heritage—even though she''s lived with her black mother since birth—marries a pop singer. Everybody conspires to protect her from finding out about herself. It''s not clear exactly why they do that.', 'A racist woman who doesn''t know about her own mixed heritage—even though she''s lived with her black mother since birth—marries a pop singer. Everybody conspires to protect her from finding out about herself. It''s not clear exactly why they do that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1LYxIXL1G0bW6OoUyvVSJ2lET8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542986'),
  ('471395238560510985', 'Little Black Book', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Nick Hurran, Theo van de Sande, Paula Harris', 'Elisa Bell, Melissa Carter', 'Brittany Murphy, Holly Hunter, Kathy Bates, Ron Livingston, Julianne Nicholson, Stephen Tobolowsky, Kevin Sussman, Rashida Jones', 'PG-13', 'Determined to learn about her boyfriend''s past relationships, Stacy -- who works for a talk show -- becomes a bona fide snoop. With her colleague, Barb, Stacy gets the names of Derek''s ex-lovers and interviews them, supposedly for an upcoming show. But what she learns only adds to her confusion, and her plans begin to unravel when she befriends one of the women.', 'Determined to learn about her boyfriend''s past relationships, Stacy -- who works for a talk show -- becomes a bona fide snoop. With her colleague, Barb, Stacy gets the names of Derek''s ex-lovers and interviews them, supposedly for an upcoming show. But what she learns only adds to her confusion, and her plans begin to unravel when she befriends one of the women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6TD54dLIryqhQAOdGExy8Lie1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14846'),
  ('928980811538515707', 'Little Black Dress', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Heo In-moo, Son Jae-hyuk, Yoon Hong-sik', 'Heo In-moo', 'Park Han-byul, Yoo In-na, Cha Ye-ryun, Yoon Eun-hye, Lee Yong-woo, Jeon Soo-kyeong, Choi Yoon-young, Dong-Ho', null, 'Little Black Dress depicts the friendships, jealousies, hopes and failures of four 24-year-old girls. The girls first met as first year students in college. They seem to be enjoying their 20''s, but inside they all have worries.', 'Little Black Dress depicts the friendships, jealousies, hopes and failures of four 24-year-old girls. The girls first met as first year students in college. They seem to be enjoying their 20''s, but inside they all have worries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjhFHMsMy4gaLSs8LwBRvoT3yYm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64846'),
  ('211453214823358907', 'Little Black Sambo', 1935, 'Animation', 'Ub Iwerks, Al Eugster, Shamus Culhane', null, null, null, 'Mammy gives Little Black Sambo a quick scrub on the washboard, then pats him down with baby powder, black baby powder, before sending him off to play. She warns him about the tiger...', 'Mammy gives Little Black Sambo a quick scrub on the washboard, then pats him down with baby powder, black baby powder, before sending him off to play. She warns him about the tiger...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DwHNR4WM0RY55gZruOfNlcCKTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184606'),
  ('528397762807924383', 'Little Blond Death', 1993, 'Drama', 'Jean van de Velde, Jules van den Steenhoven', 'Rob Houwer, Jean van de Velde', 'Antonie Kamerling, Olivier Tuinier, Loes Wouterson, Gees Linnebank, Liz Snoijink, Yoran Hensel, Reinout Bussemaker, Ellen ten Damme', null, 'The poet Valentijn Boecke meets his former teacher Mieke. They have a short relation. After a while Mieke appears to be pregnant. Valentijn is through with Mieke and leaves her...', 'The poet Valentijn Boecke meets his former teacher Mieke. They have a short relation. After a while Mieke appears to be pregnant. Valentijn is through with Mieke and leaves her...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qG0X3T67z5ncfsDiy1pEn2EkDQd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47231'),
  ('474624079351217184', 'Little Blue', 2022, 'Drama', 'Lee Yi-fang, Eric Chao', 'Lee Yi-fang', 'Wang Yu-xuan, Helena Hsu, Ye Ting-qi, Wasir Chou, Roy Chang, Yen-Cheng Li, Tiffany Anais Lin, Hu Jhih-ciang', null, 'Xiao Lan''s first sexual experience is on the beach with a football jock from her school. When the boy leaks a photo of her in a sexually compromising position online, Xiao Lan''s entire world collapses. Alone without anyone to help, she turns to comfort from men on the internet.', 'Xiao Lan''s first sexual experience is on the beach with a football jock from her school. When the boy leaks a photo of her in a sexually compromising position online, Xiao Lan''s entire world collapses. Alone without anyone to help, she turns to comfort from men on the internet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9rt0zD3hIbW36PBTeaxZOcTMcF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975575'),
  ('315995478451531281', 'Little Bone Lodge', 2023, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'Matthias Hoene', 'Neil Linpow', 'Joely Richardson, Sadie Soverall, Neil Linpow, Harry Cadby, Roger Ajogbe, Euan Bennet, Cameron Jack, Sharon Young', 'R', 'During a stormy night in the Scottish Highlands, two criminal brothers on the run seek refuge in a desolate farmhouse. But after taking the resident family captive, they find the house holds even darker secrets of its own.', 'During a stormy night in the Scottish Highlands, two criminal brothers on the run seek refuge in a desolate farmhouse. But after taking the resident family captive, they find the house holds even darker secrets of its own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BwerQH4tZvHU6zUlC77aDw7pLt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1075335'),
  ('610133441661562560', 'Little Book of Love', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Sandra Werneck, Walter Carvalho', 'Paulo Halm, José Roberto Torero', 'Andréa Beltrão, Daniel Dantas, Mônica Torres, Tony Ramos, Glória Pires, José Wilker, Marcos Winter, Cristina Ferro', null, 'Luiza is an architect who just got out of a ruinous relationship. Gabriel is a biologist and he has finished a long marriage with divorce. When they both meet, chances that they can do well together are not that big. But they will try to, even if their friends Barata (a convict bachelor totally skeptical when it comes to love) and Marta (a mathematic analyst who wishes that human relations were just as exact as numbers are) think otherwise.', 'Luiza is an architect who just got out of a ruinous relationship. Gabriel is a biologist and he has finished a long marriage with divorce. When they both meet, chances that they can do well together are not that big. But they will try to, even if their friends Barata (a convict bachelor totally skeptical when it comes to love) and Marta (a mathematic analyst who wishes that human relations were just as exact as numbers are) think otherwise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Tggbw9vEFjR4g09zpme3nfdlgw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215301'),
  ('186329290939618929', 'Little Boxes', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tom Richmond, Rob Meyer', 'Annie J. Howell', 'Melanie Lynskey, Nelsan Ellis, Armani Jackson, Oona Laurence, Janeane Garofalo, Nadia Dajani, Veanne Cox, Miranda McKeon', null, 'It''s the summer before 6th grade, and Clark is the new-in-town biracial kid in a sea of white. Discovering that to be cool he needs to act ''more black,'' he fumbles to meet expectations, while his urban intellectual parents Mack and Gina also strive to adjust to small-town living. Equipped for the many inherent challenges of New York, the tight-knit family are ill prepared for the drastically different set of obstacles that their new community presents, and soon find themselves struggling to understand themselves and each other in this new suburban context.', 'It''s the summer before 6th grade, and Clark is the new-in-town biracial kid in a sea of white. Discovering that to be cool he needs to act ''more black,'' he fumbles to meet expectations, while his urban intellectual parents Mack and Gina also strive to adjust to small-town living. Equipped for the many inherent challenges of New York, the tight-knit family are ill prepared for the drastically different set of obstacles that their new community presents, and soon find themselves struggling to understand themselves and each other in this new suburban context.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MARwPALPBlLUN9OyBqvDdeSenQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390407'),
  ('920040897934806111', 'Little Boy', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Alejandro Monteverde, Garrett Warren, Marco Niro', 'Alejandro Monteverde, Pepe Portillo', 'Jakob Salvati, Emily Watson, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Michael Rapaport, David Henrie, Ben Chaplin, Eduardo Verástegui, Ted Levine', 'PG-13', 'An eight-year-old boy is willing to do whatever it takes to end World War II so he can bring his father home. The story reveals the indescribable love a father has for his little boy and the love a son has for his father.', 'An eight-year-old boy is willing to do whatever it takes to end World War II so he can bring his father home. The story reveals the indescribable love a father has for his little boy and the love a son has for his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAU9pgq3niI6sFemcKm4FGGmrnW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256962'),
  ('612543327851136955', 'Little Boy Blue', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Antonio Tibaldi, Ron Hagen', 'Michael Boston', 'Ryan Phillippe, Nastassja Kinski, John Savage, Shirley Knight, Tyrin Turner, Jenny Lewis, Brent Jennings, John Doman', null, 'Living in rural Texas is a dysfunctional family: an abusive dad, a Vietnam vet with a war wound that''s left him impotent; a compliant wife and a son of about 20, two small sons who look a lot like their brother. The dad harbors a secret, and he goes to murderous lengths to keep it hidden. The young man, Jimmy, who has suspicions, but little comes out until a Yankee woman comes to town.', 'Living in rural Texas is a dysfunctional family: an abusive dad, a Vietnam vet with a war wound that''s left him impotent; a compliant wife and a son of about 20, two small sons who look a lot like their brother. The dad harbors a secret, and he goes to murderous lengths to keep it hidden. The young man, Jimmy, who has suspicions, but little comes out until a Yankee woman comes to town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8A9DICuchF1woO13mvUb9dmUIj8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20064'),
  ('1143024101832359547', 'Little Boy Boo', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Elvia Allman, Gladys Holland', null, 'Foghorn Leghorn, shivering at the thought of another cold winter in his dilapidated roost, decides to court the well-to-do Miss Prissy, but Prissy won''t marry him unless he can prove he''ll be a good father to her son, a bespectacled egghead genius who, by scientific means, bests Foghorn in every game they play.', 'Foghorn Leghorn, shivering at the thought of another cold winter in his dilapidated roost, decides to court the well-to-do Miss Prissy, but Prissy won''t marry him unless he can prove he''ll be a good father to her son, a bespectacled egghead genius who, by scientific means, bests Foghorn in every game they play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dy9Cv5P4bmqwSNRJ8Y8hhYDUcnv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147907'),
  ('191324671618080952', 'Little Brother', 2005, 'Drama', 'Lim Tai-hyung, Kim Yeong-ho', 'Kim Eun-jeong', 'Park Ji-bin, Bae Jong-ok, Park Won-sang, Seo Dae-han, Choi Woo-hyuk, Jeon Hye-jin, Oh Ji-hye, Choi Jin-ho', null, 'Nine-year-old Hani is a troublemaker who isn''t afraid of anything. A precocious punk, his school friends are all his underlings, and even his family members are under his control. He especially considers his elder brother, HanByul, who often complains of being sick, his greatest target. Until one fateful day, HanByul collapses at home and is rushed to the emergency room and the worst nightmare for any parents becomes a reality - he is diagnosed with cancer. The film is based on a true story.', 'Nine-year-old Hani is a troublemaker who isn''t afraid of anything. A precocious punk, his school friends are all his underlings, and even his family members are under his control. He especially considers his elder brother, HanByul, who often complains of being sick, his greatest target. Until one fateful day, HanByul collapses at home and is rushed to the emergency room and the worst nightmare for any parents becomes a reality - he is diagnosed with cancer. The film is based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MR642q4n2ldirHK5U2GJFVLv36.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159189'),
  ('428916607854905588', 'Little Brothers', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jacques Doillon, Manuel Teran', 'Jacques Doillon', 'Stéphanie Touly, Iliès Sefraoui, Mustapha Goumane, Nassim Izem, Rachid Mansouri', null, 'Talia runs away from home taking her beloved dog with her. When her dog is stolen Talia enlists the help of a gang of boys to help her find her pet.', 'Talia runs away from home taking her beloved dog with her. When her dog is stolen Talia enlists the help of a gang of boys to help her find her pet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vQKua7tteplTSsIfyze1qgleoA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37558'),
  ('764444067498648977', 'Little Brownie Kuzya 2', 2026, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Animation', 'Viktor Lakisov, Kirill Zotkin', 'Aleksey Gravitskiy, Tatyana Aleksandrova, Gayk Asatryan, Andrey Gavrilov, Yerziya Yertles', 'Ilya Shuvalov, Ekaterina Stulova, Polina Gagarina, Ivan Okhlobystin', null, 'Kuzya continues to live with Natasha and her family. Baba Yaga has finally moved into the human world and is trying to be useful, becoming an unexpected helper for others. Everything seems calm, but a mysterious Tikhonya comes to their house, which begins a new wave of magical and dangerous events. Everyone will have to unite again to protect the world from Koshchei and keep the world of fairy tales as magical and bright.', 'Kuzya continues to live with Natasha and her family. Baba Yaga has finally moved into the human world and is trying to be useful, becoming an unexpected helper for others. Everything seems calm, but a mysterious Tikhonya comes to their house, which begins a new wave of magical and dangerous events. Everyone will have to unite again to protect the world from Koshchei and keep the world of fairy tales as magical and bright.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FsD6VwC0wj1B39EVFX1sovLN5lUh.jpg', 'plex:movie:little-brownie-kuzya-2'),
  ('583718740986551685', 'Little Buddha', 1993, 'Drama, History', 'Bernardo Bertolucci, Vittorio Storaro, Andrew Sanders', 'Rudy Wurlitzer, Mark Peploe', 'Keanu Reeves, Bridget Fonda, Chris Isaak, Ruocheng Ying, Alex Wiesendanger, Raju Lal, Greishma Makar Sing, Sogyal Rinpoche', 'PG', 'After the death of Lama Dorje, Tibetan Buddhist monks find three children — one American and two Nepalese — who may be the rebirth of their great teacher.', 'After the death of Lama Dorje, Tibetan Buddhist monks find three children — one American and two Nepalese — who may be the rebirth of their great teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xy70xtdoKZ3PxlKkakwdhL3UFDQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1689'),
  ('744902812359328926', 'Little by Little', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean Rouch, Jean Rouch', 'Jean Rouch', 'Damouré Zika, Lam Ibrahim Dia, Illo Goudal, Safi Faye, Ariane Bruneton, Jacques Chabot, Moustapha Alassane', null, 'An African travels to Paris to learn about the construction of tall buildings, but is soon taken up with the oddities of French life.', 'An African travels to Paris to learn about the construction of tall buildings, but is soon taken up with the oddities of French life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KV4YRv8cdgEJxurgZSddFVSOhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162991'),
  ('136966495063878228', 'Little Caesar', 1931, 'Drama, Crime, Action', 'Tony Gaudio, Mervyn LeRoy, Percy Ikerd', 'Francis Edward Faragoh, Robert N. Lee', 'Edward G. Robinson, Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Glenda Farrell, William Collier Jr., Sidney Blackmer, Ralph Ince, Thomas E. Jackson, Stanley Fields', 'NR', 'A small-time hood shoots his way to the top, but how long can he stay there?', 'A small-time hood shoots his way to the top, but how long can he stay there?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1K3Q1tAHHA5Sdtja2pPALBQevA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27899'),
  ('200390850574818766', 'Little Cheung', 1999, 'Drama', 'Fruit Chan, Sammi Chan, Lau Kwok-Wai', 'Fruit Chan', 'Yiu Yuet-Ming, Wai-Fan Mak, Yuet-Man Mak, Gary Lai, Teoh Chang, Tony Ho, Sam Lee, Jo Kok Cho-Lam', null, 'In 1997, Little Cheung is a street-wise nine-year-old boy living in a bustling neighbourhood of Hong Kong, just before the reunification with China.', 'In 1997, Little Cheung is a street-wise nine-year-old boy living in a bustling neighbourhood of Hong Kong, just before the reunification with China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJKDO9AD6pV5t6qDHaC1T83FfKa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18822'),
  ('168961260784812763', 'Little Children', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Antonio Calvache, Todd Field', 'Todd Field, Tom Perrotta', 'Kate Winslet, Patrick Wilson, Jennifer Connelly, Gregg Edelman, Sadie Goldstein, Ty Simpkins, Noah Emmerich, Jackie Earle Haley', 'R', 'The lives of two lovelorn spouses from separate marriages, a registered sex offender, and a disgraced ex-police officer intersect as they struggle to resist their vulnerabilities and temptations.', 'The lives of two lovelorn spouses from separate marriages, a registered sex offender, and a disgraced ex-police officer intersect as they struggle to resist their vulnerabilities and temptations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2wTSP0Ifo9vY03nJEfkFBbT2S9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1440'),
  ('647755299672600345', 'Little Criminals', 1995, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Stephen Surjik', 'Dennis Foon', 'Brendan Fletcher, Myles Ferguson, Adam Harrison, Jordan Clarke, London Sam Baergen, John Nguyen, Loc Vo, Mimi Kuzyk', null, 'Des is an eleven year old kid who has had a really bad deal in life. Crime and mischief are the main staples of his life and he and his friends cruise around the city and do things like vandalize, steal, light fires, and mug people. He thinks that he is untouchable because he cannot be charged until he is twelve. Cory becomes Des'' best friend and they carry on like nothing can stop them; however, Des ends up at an assessment centre for troubled youths and may begin a new life without crime.', 'Des is an eleven year old kid who has had a really bad deal in life. Crime and mischief are the main staples of his life and he and his friends cruise around the city and do things like vandalize, steal, light fires, and mug people. He thinks that he is untouchable because he cannot be charged until he is twelve. Cory becomes Des'' best friend and they carry on like nothing can stop them; however, Des ends up at an assessment centre for troubled youths and may begin a new life without crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXbnOWpe6kQimNjEIihvE7jjmVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70374'),
  ('112958613972607737', 'Little Crumb', 1999, 'Drama', 'Rob Blomkwist, Arjan Eekels, Erno Das', 'Maria Peters', 'Ruud Feltkamp, Hugo Haenen, Rick Engelkes, Yannick van de Velde, Jack Wouterse, Jan Decleir, Thekla Reuten, Sacha Bulthuis', null, 'The film is based on the popular Dutch childrens book by Chris van Abkoude. In a Dutch port in 1921 lives a 10-year-old orphan boy known to everyone simply as Little Crumb. His poverty-stricken mother Lize van Dien filled with shame was forced to turn him over to Mrs. Koster soon after he was born. Foster mother Mrs. Koster, who has cared for him since he was a baby, is very poor too, unable to support him by herself and proves to be a cruel taskmaster who insists Crumb bring her money before shell feed him. Somehow he must earn his keep out on the streets and can only go home after he has earned enough money. Crumb becomes an urchin stealing from the streets barrows and the shops to stay alive, sleeping in churches or huddled in doorways. Sometimes he has to run off from the police and he has earned the enmity of the most grownups around him.', 'The film is based on the popular Dutch childrens book by Chris van Abkoude. In a Dutch port in 1921 lives a 10-year-old orphan boy known to everyone simply as Little Crumb. His poverty-stricken mother Lize van Dien filled with shame was forced to turn him over to Mrs. Koster soon after he was born. Foster mother Mrs. Koster, who has cared for him since he was a baby, is very poor too, unable to support him by herself and proves to be a cruel taskmaster who insists Crumb bring her money before shell feed him. Somehow he must earn his keep out on the streets and can only go home after he has earned enough money. Crumb becomes an urchin stealing from the streets barrows and the shops to stay alive, sleeping in churches or huddled in doorways. Sometimes he has to run off from the police and he has earned the enmity of the most grownups around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQAlAVpgYIi0fhnd1wJIy1ej5Zv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39772'),
  ('439293367214390578', 'Little Darlings', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ronald F. Maxwell, Bedřich Baťka, Michael Daves', 'Kimi Peck, Dalene Young', 'Tatum O''Neal, Kristy McNichol, Armand Assante, Matt Dillon, Margaret Blye, Nicolas Coster, Krista Errickson, Alexa Kenin', 'R', 'Two 15-year-old girls from different sides of the tracks compete to see who will be first to lose their virginity while at camp.', 'Two 15-year-old girls from different sides of the tracks compete to see who will be first to lose their virginity while at camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fplTWhJxdghnnplXoiwZjYxMnFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27458'),
  ('129374842970598600', 'Little Dead Rotting Hood', 2016, 'Horror', 'Jared Cohn, Laura Beth Love, Christopher Read', 'Gabriel Campisi', 'Eric Balfour, Bianca A. Santos, Patrick Muldoon, Heather Tom, Brendan Wayne, M.J. Brackin, Romeo, Amy Argyle', 'NR', 'The residents of a small town discover that something more sinister than killer wolves is lurking in the backwoods: first the wolves start turning up dead...then people.', 'The residents of a small town discover that something more sinister than killer wolves is lurking in the backwoods: first the wolves start turning up dead...then people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19IlmRCJYb7kOmtYouAOUxIesnn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376311'),
  ('814572548788032724', 'Little Deaths', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller, Romance', 'Milton Kam, Sean Hogan, Simon Rumley', 'Sean Hogan, Simon Rumley, Andrew Parkinson', 'Luke de Lacey, Holly Lucas, Siubhan Harrison, James Oliver Wheatley, Jodie Jameson, Daniel Brocklebank, Brendan Gregory, Christopher Fairbank', 'R', 'Composed of three disturbingly sensual and terrifying short narratives, unified by the twin themes of sex and death.', 'Composed of three disturbingly sensual and terrifying short narratives, unified by the twin themes of sex and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1g6JR23PMVPiInXkKwy3GxXkjOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66164'),
  ('491684454753670963', 'Little Dieter Needs to Fly', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Herbert Golder, Peter Zeitlinger', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Dieter Dengler, Eugene Deatrick', null, 'Three decades after German-American pilot Dieter Dengler was shot down over Laos, he returns to the places where he was held prisoner during the early years of the Vietnam War. Accompanied by director Werner Herzog, Dengler describes in unusually candid detail his captivity, the friendships he made, and his daring escape. Not willing to stop there, Herzog even persuades his subject to re-enact certain tortures, with the help of some willing local villagers.', 'Three decades after German-American pilot Dieter Dengler was shot down over Laos, he returns to the places where he was held prisoner during the early years of the Vietnam War. Accompanied by director Werner Herzog, Dengler describes in unusually candid detail his captivity, the friendships he made, and his daring escape. Not willing to stop there, Herzog even persuades his subject to re-enact certain tortures, with the help of some willing local villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sLpyYytu0Dbymzs3skxOCRHKkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57976'),
  ('309601141790314876', 'Little Dixie', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'John Swab, Will Stone', 'John Swab', 'Frank Grillo, Eric Dane, Annabeth Gish, Mercedes Mason, Peter Greene, Beau Knapp, Thomas Dekker, Maurice Compte', 'R', 'Erstwhile Special Forces operative Doc Alexander is asked to broker a truce with the Mexican drug cartel in secrecy. When Oklahoma Governor Richard Jeffs celebrates the execution of a high-ranking cartel member on TV, his Chief of Staff and Doc inform him about the peace he just ended. But it’s too late, as Cuco, the cartel’s hatchet man, has set his vengeful sights on Doc’s daughter Dixie.', 'Erstwhile Special Forces operative Doc Alexander is asked to broker a truce with the Mexican drug cartel in secrecy. When Oklahoma Governor Richard Jeffs celebrates the execution of a high-ranking cartel member on TV, his Chief of Staff and Doc inform him about the peace he just ended. But it’s too late, as Cuco, the cartel’s hatchet man, has set his vengeful sights on Doc’s daughter Dixie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmWTZj9zzT9KFt3XyL0gssL7Ig8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058949'),
  ('53001615725648149', 'Little Dorrit', 1987, 'Drama', 'Christine Edzard, Bruno de Keyzer', 'Christine Edzard', 'Derek Jacobi, Joan Greenwood, Max Wall, Patricia Hayes, Luke Duckett, Alec Guinness, Cyril Cusack, Sarah Pickering', null, 'Amy Dorrit spends her days earning money for the family and looking after her proud father who is a long term inmate of Marshalsea debtors'' prison in London. Amy and her family''s world is transformed when her employer''s son, Arthur Clennam, returns from overseas to solve his family''s mysterious legacy and discovers that their lives are interlinked.', 'Amy Dorrit spends her days earning money for the family and looking after her proud father who is a long term inmate of Marshalsea debtors'' prison in London. Amy and her family''s world is transformed when her employer''s son, Arthur Clennam, returns from overseas to solve his family''s mysterious legacy and discovers that their lives are interlinked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61uclYiDIhkbV3o8XsjqUK0jbXD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47282'),
  ('315443327515062349', 'Little Dragon Maiden', 1983, 'Action, Romance', 'Hua Shan, Wen Yun Huang', 'Ning Tam, Tsai Nai-Pin', 'Leslie Cheung, Yung Jing-Jing, Chen Kuan-Tai, Leanne Liu, Tanny Tien-Ni, Lung Tien-hsiang, Eddie Koo Koon Chung, Ku Feng', null, 'Seeking to improve his combat skills, a young man falls in love with a woman with mystical powers but his past stands in the way of their union.', 'Seeking to improve his combat skills, a young man falls in love with a woman with mystical powers but his past stands in the way of their union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKyCL1MxcoQU5w6981iEPlBnRzv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66171'),
  ('1043354657442001550', 'Little England', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pantelis Voulgaris, Simos Sarketzis, Κώστας Ραυτόπουλος', 'Ioanna Karystiani', 'Penelope Tsilika, Sofia Kokkali, Anneza Papadopoulou, Andreas Konstantinou, Maximos Moumouris, Vasilis Vasilakis, Christos Kalavrouzos, Evangelia Adreadaki', null, 'Τwo sisters from the island of Andros, dubbed Little England because of its affluence, are both in love with the same man. Set in the Greek Civil War period and ending in the 1950s, the movie is based on the homonymous novel by Ioanna Karystiani.', 'Τwo sisters from the island of Andros, dubbed Little England because of its affluence, are both in love with the same man. Set in the Greek Civil War period and ending in the 1950s, the movie is based on the homonymous novel by Ioanna Karystiani.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecjDCMBNVhRL2AS61JmJfb7R88V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228339'),
  ('531324105076799414', 'Little Evil', 2017, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Eli Craig, Matthew Clark', 'Eli Craig', 'Adam Scott, Evangeline Lilly, Owen Atlas, Bridget Everett, Donald Faison, Chris D''Elia, Kyle Bornheimer, Clancy Brown', null, 'Gary, who has just married Samantha, the woman of his dreams, discovers that her six-year-old son may be the Antichrist.', 'Gary, who has just married Samantha, the woman of his dreams, discovers that her six-year-old son may be the Antichrist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/na7hmXernwsm59rEBwewJ0mf53m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346671'),
  ('904817643339225187', 'Little Fauss and Big Halsy', 1970, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sidney J. Furie, Terry Morse Jr., Ralph Woolsey', 'Charles Eastman', 'Robert Redford, Michael J. Pollard, Lauren Hutton, Noah Beery Jr., Lucille Benson, Ray Ballard, Linda Gaye Scott, Erin O''Reilly', 'R', 'The friendship between two Arizona dirt bike racers is tested when they both lust for an attractive runaway young woman who joins them on the racing circuit.', 'The friendship between two Arizona dirt bike racers is tested when they both lust for an attractive runaway young woman who joins them on the racing circuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHj9GJwIzpIIWGK4CJKUFackRNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44721'),
  ('1069506246404033445', 'Little Fish', 2005, 'Drama, Crime', 'Rowan Woods, Danny Ruhlmann, John Martin', 'Jacquelin Perske', 'Cate Blanchett, Sam Neill, Hugo Weaving, Martin Henderson, Noni Hazlehurst, Joel Tobeck, Susie Porter, Dustin Nguyễn', 'R', 'Set in the Little Saigon district outside of Sydney, a woman trying to escape her past becomes embroiled in a drug deal.', 'Set in the Little Saigon district outside of Sydney, a woman trying to escape her past becomes embroiled in a drug deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3ohsAq0DO5z5nTWVkEkzVg48DK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9993'),
  ('388515076263690510', 'Little Fish', 2021, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Chad Hartigan, Sean McElwee, Dale Bredeson', 'Mattson Tomlin', 'Olivia Cooke, Jack O''Connell, Soko, Raúl Castillo, David Lennon, Mackenzie Cardwell, Ross Wirtanen, Heather Decksheimer', 'NR', 'A couple fights to hold their relationship together as a memory loss virus spreads and threatens to erase the history of their love and courtship.', 'A couple fights to hold their relationship together as a memory loss virus spreads and threatens to erase the history of their love and courtship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AYQ7vyUI2HVLEKH7niFvJ1AdZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586791'),
  ('486224098065302236', 'Little Fish, Strange Pond', 2009, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Gregory Dark, Gavin Kelly', 'Robert Dean Klein', 'Matthew Modine, Callum Blue, Adam Baldwin, Paul Adelstein, Zach Galifianakis, Don McManus, Liza Weil, Brooke Newton', 'R', 'Mr. Jack and Sweet Stephen cruise aimlessly through the streets of LA speculating about life, death, divine will and the force of power that predetermines their existence. Mr. Jack attempts to illustrate to his sidekick the delicate and natural forces of the universe. Sweet Stephen''s superficial charm and bloodsucking lifestyle sends him and Mr. Jack on a voyage that is relentless, engaging, and darkly hilarious.', 'Mr. Jack and Sweet Stephen cruise aimlessly through the streets of LA speculating about life, death, divine will and the force of power that predetermines their existence. Mr. Jack attempts to illustrate to his sidekick the delicate and natural forces of the universe. Sweet Stephen''s superficial charm and bloodsucking lifestyle sends him and Mr. Jack on a voyage that is relentless, engaging, and darkly hilarious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4l4yTy9WihabZ4rSdzintWTCQgb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49848'),
  ('428914274272407689', 'Little Fockers', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Weitz, Gary Marcus, Paula Case', 'Larry Stuckey, John Hamburg', 'Robert De Niro, Ben Stiller, Owen Wilson, Dustin Hoffman, Barbra Streisand, Blythe Danner, Teri Polo, Jessica Alba', 'PG-13', 'It has taken 10 years, two little Fockers with wife Pam and countless hurdles for Greg to finally get in with his tightly wound father-in-law, Jack. After the cash-strapped dad takes a job moonlighting for a drug company, Jack''s suspicions about his favorite male nurse come roaring back. When Greg and Pam''s entire clan descends for the twins'' birthday party, Greg must prove to the skeptical Jack that he''s fully capable as the man of the house.', 'It has taken 10 years, two little Fockers with wife Pam and countless hurdles for Greg to finally get in with his tightly wound father-in-law, Jack. After the cash-strapped dad takes a job moonlighting for a drug company, Jack''s suspicions about his favorite male nurse come roaring back. When Greg and Pam''s entire clan descends for the twins'' birthday party, Greg must prove to the skeptical Jack that he''s fully capable as the man of the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90mwPRNMmX9RUGVgKMJMJNQnYX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39451'),
  ('481178628264111622', 'Little Forest', 2018, 'Drama', 'Yim Soon-rye, Kim Hae-il, Lee Seung-hun', 'Hwang Sung-goo', 'Kim Tae-ri, Moon So-ri, Ryu Jun-yeol, Jin Ki-joo, Jeon Guk-hyang, Park Won-sang, Jung Jun-won, Jeon Sang-jin', null, 'A young woman leaves the city to return to her hometown in the countryside. Seeking to escape the hustle and bustle of the city, she becomes self-sufficient in a bid to reconnect with nature.', 'A young woman leaves the city to return to her hometown in the countryside. Seeking to escape the hustle and bustle of the city, she becomes self-sufficient in a bid to reconnect with nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKmPuyjmALswSQUF94PWXoAvkKM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448491'),
  ('542825344001924463', 'Little Forest: Summer/Autumn', 2014, 'Drama', 'Junichi Mori, Yukihiro Onodera', 'Junichi Mori', 'Ai Hashimoto, Takahiro Miura, Mayu Matsuoka, Yoichi Nukumizu, Karen Kirishima, Momone Shinokawa', null, 'Fleeing heartbreak in the big city, Ichiko returns to Komori, her rural hometown. She battles summer''s rain and humidity, bakes her own bread, grows hothouse tomatoes and tills the fields. During autumn, the time for pickling and preserving fish and sweet potatoes, Ichiko begins reaping rice and recalls her departure five years before.', 'Fleeing heartbreak in the big city, Ichiko returns to Komori, her rural hometown. She battles summer''s rain and humidity, bakes her own bread, grows hothouse tomatoes and tills the fields. During autumn, the time for pickling and preserving fish and sweet potatoes, Ichiko begins reaping rice and recalls her departure five years before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8O5h2aSJsJCLeHM6O8jZYGvzdHd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294682'),
  ('633278243457661141', 'Little Forest: Winter/Spring', 2015, 'Drama', 'Junichi Mori, Yukihiro Onodera, Megumu Sawada', 'Junichi Mori', 'Ai Hashimoto, Takahiro Miura, Mayu Matsuoka, Yoichi Nukumizu, Karen Kirishima, Momone Shinokawa', null, 'Ichiko bakes a cake for an end-of-year party with her friends. In the depths of winter, making mochi and curry keeps the people of Komori warm. Later, spring brings thoughts of her absent mother as well as rice planting and sakura, and she begins to think of leaving Komori behind again.', 'Ichiko bakes a cake for an end-of-year party with her friends. In the depths of winter, making mochi and curry keeps the people of Komori warm. Later, spring brings thoughts of her absent mother as well as rice planting and sakura, and she begins to think of leaving Komori behind again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9T2DUtp2yUJnG0go0lIF9tTd8kG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336026'),
  ('196722264132033523', 'Little Frick and the Fiddle', 1952, 'Animation', 'Ivo Caprino', null, null, null, 'Meet the cheeky, but kind-hearted, Little Frick and his fiddle as he works for three years for three shillings and compassionately gives them away to every vagabond he meets. But the reward is immense.', 'Meet the cheeky, but kind-hearted, Little Frick and his fiddle as he works for three years for three shillings and compassionately gives them away to every vagabond he meets. But the reward is immense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWmuC5H8CQiiY1PAWLnDImw0XxY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62840'),
  ('482647934520222727', 'Little Fugitive', 1953, 'Drama, Family', 'Ray Ashley, Ruth Orkin, Morris Engel', 'Ray Ashley, Ruth Orkin, Morris Engel', 'Richie Andrusco, Richard Brewster, Winifred Cushing, Jay Williams, Will Lee, Charlie Moss, Tommy DeCanio, Ruth Orkin', null, 'After a prank makes Joey Norton believe he killed his older brother, he runs away from home and spends the day at Coney Island while his brother tries to find him before their mother gets home.', 'After a prank makes Joey Norton believe he killed his older brother, he runs away from home and spends the day at Coney Island while his brother tries to find him before their mother gets home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bb1zkuqfxGT8xSJu3mVYIT5xO4u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52620'),
  ('280018176716627082', 'Little Funny Guy', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Juan Gelpí, Gastone Di Giovanni', 'Sabatino Ciuffini, Pasquale Festa Campanile, Massimo Franciosa', 'Adriano Celentano, Claudia Mori, Lino Toffolo, José Calvo, Manuel Zarzo, Tommaso Bianco, Isa Danieli, Ria De Simone', null, 'Movie starts with a small boy watching his father boarding a ship to America. Years later, all grown up and in colour, Pippolo Cavallo (Adriano Celentano) takes the same route (dressed as a woman) to search for his father and begin a new life.', 'Movie starts with a small boy watching his father boarding a ship to America. Years later, all grown up and in colour, Pippolo Cavallo (Adriano Celentano) takes the same route (dressed as a woman) to search for his father and begin a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsjahoCuB6bO3OnyNJg1LwClzTb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50194'),
  ('476818853485550477', 'Little Gay Boy, Christ is Dead', 2012, 'Drama, Horror', 'Antony Hickling, Amaury Grisel, Amaury Grisel', 'Antony Hickling', 'Gaëtan Vettier, Biño Sauitzvy, Amanda Dawson, François Brunet, Axel Sourisseau, Alvaro Lombard, Stephen Shagov, Hervé Joseph Lebrun', null, 'Jean-Christophe lives with his mother, an English prostitute, in Paris. He dreams of becoming a model. Over the course of a day, he endures a series of abusive encounters that will change him forever. He goes from innocence to experience as he, and his dreams, are destroyed by those around him. The violence of the film is accentuated by the use of BDSM, Performance Art and Dance.', 'Jean-Christophe lives with his mother, an English prostitute, in Paris. He dreams of becoming a model. Over the course of a day, he endures a series of abusive encounters that will change him forever. He goes from innocence to experience as he, and his dreams, are destroyed by those around him. The violence of the film is accentuated by the use of BDSM, Performance Art and Dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8fsbTmsY4N8kAcSsuqRb4ssTV3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355884'),
  ('797083890879429895', 'Little Germans', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Frank Geiger, Mohammad Farokhmanesh', null, null, null, 'LITTLE GERMANS combines animation and documentary film to tell the story of children that are born into extreme right-wing families. From a young age on they are trained to hate everything that seems ''foreign''. How does it feel to grow up in a world, where empathy is subsidiary and ''the nation'' stands above everything? And who do those ''little Germans'' become once they grow up?', 'LITTLE GERMANS combines animation and documentary film to tell the story of children that are born into extreme right-wing families. From a young age on they are trained to hate everything that seems ''foreign''. How does it feel to grow up in a world, where empathy is subsidiary and ''the nation'' stands above everything? And who do those ''little Germans'' become once they grow up?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oP8PS7FfY1Je0fIx6BH7sycgSaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584804'),
  ('309002931068208805', 'Little Ghost', 1997, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Dan Alexandru, Linda Shayne', 'James W. McLaughlin, Timothy Michaels', 'Kristina Wayborn, Jim Fitzpatrick, Sally Kirkland, Laura Bruneau, Luc Leestemaker, Jameson Baltes, Trishalee Hardy', 'G', 'While on location in a spooky Italian villa with his Hollywood big-shot mom and her dorky boyfriend, twelve-year-old Kevin befriends a Renaissance-era girl ghost who helps him cause unrest on the set.', 'While on location in a spooky Italian villa with his Hollywood big-shot mom and her dorky boyfriend, twelve-year-old Kevin befriends a Renaissance-era girl ghost who helps him cause unrest on the set.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAYEBiLx8UilGEBUcqanMyERfll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64313'),
  ('246001234729500616', 'Little Giant', 1946, 'Comedy', 'William A. Seiter, Charles Van Enger, Edgar Fairchild', 'Walter DeLeon', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Jacqueline deWit, Brenda Joyce, George Cleveland, Elena Verdugo, Mary Gordon, Pierre Watkin', 'NR', 'Lou Costello plays a country bumpkin vacuum-cleaner salesman, working for the company run by the crooked Bud Abbott. To try to keep him under his thumb, Abbott convinces Costello that he''s a crackerjack salesman. This comedy is somewhat like "The Time of Their Lives," in that Abbott and Costello don''t have much screen time together and there are very few vaudeville bits woven into the plot.', 'Lou Costello plays a country bumpkin vacuum-cleaner salesman, working for the company run by the crooked Bud Abbott. To try to keep him under his thumb, Abbott convinces Costello that he''s a crackerjack salesman. This comedy is somewhat like "The Time of Their Lives," in that Abbott and Costello don''t have much screen time together and there are very few vaudeville bits woven into the plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyVF2tsQQfMji6vbDrwWHA8qHQc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36706'),
  ('1135093935633389497', 'Little Giants', 1994, 'Comedy, Family', 'Duwayne Dunham, Janusz Kamiński, Michael D. Moore', 'Michael J. Wilson', 'Rick Moranis, Ed O''Neill, Devon Sawa, Shawna Waldron, Todd Bosley, Michael Zwiener, Danny Pritchett, Troy Simmons', 'PG', 'When Danny O''Shea''s daughter is cut from the Peewee football team just for being a girl, he decides to form his own team, composed of other ragtag players who were also cut. Can his team really learn enough to beat the elite team, coached by his brother, a former pro player?', 'When Danny O''Shea''s daughter is cut from the Peewee football team just for being a girl, he decides to form his own team, composed of other ragtag players who were also cut. Can his team really learn enough to beat the elite team, coached by his brother, a former pro player?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkfXNOeKgJSOD08StGd0599auiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20726'),
  ('350679711383786392', 'Little Girl', 2010, 'Drama', 'Tizza Covi, Rainer Frimmel', 'Tizza Covi', 'Patrizia Gerardi, Tairo Caroli, Walter Saabel, Asia Crippa, Tailor Intruglio, Pierino Atzeni, Gigliola Crippa, Mirco Crippa', null, 'Abandoned in a park, the two-year-old girl Asia is found by Patty, a circus woman living with her husband Walter in a trailer park in San Basilio on the outskirts of Rome. With the help of Tairo, a teenager who lives with his grandma in an adjacent container, Patti gives the girl a new home for an uncertain period of time. However, Walter is concerned that they may be accused of kidnapping the girl, and he plans to report Asia''s presence to the police. . Patty receives a letter from the mother in which she announces that she will collect the girl two days later. They have a farewell party, but the mother does not show up.', 'Abandoned in a park, the two-year-old girl Asia is found by Patty, a circus woman living with her husband Walter in a trailer park in San Basilio on the outskirts of Rome. With the help of Tairo, a teenager who lives with his grandma in an adjacent container, Patti gives the girl a new home for an uncertain period of time. However, Walter is concerned that they may be accused of kidnapping the girl, and he plans to report Asia''s presence to the police. . Patty receives a letter from the mother in which she announces that she will collect the girl two days later. They have a farewell party, but the mother does not show up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8MAuNfOBxT8EHGZ76mLouhsQxJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109455'),
  ('803221404174311055', 'Little Girl', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Adélaïde Mauvernay, Philippe Thiollier, Sébastien Lifshitz', 'Sébastien Lifshitz', null, null, '7-year-old Sasha has always known that she is a girl. Sasha’s family has recently accepted her gender identity, embracing their daughter for who she truly is while working to confront outdated norms and find affirmation in a small community of rural France.', '7-year-old Sasha has always known that she is a girl. Sasha’s family has recently accepted her gender identity, embracing their daughter for who she truly is while working to confront outdated norms and find affirmation in a small community of rural France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kciAX2iBP09RfZ9d2ldLjgHiL2u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656274'),
  ('1099332463553672862', 'Little Girl Blue', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Mona Achache, Martin Bertier, Noé Bach', 'Mona Achache', 'Marion Cotillard, Mona Achache, Marie Bunel, Marie-Christine Adam, Pierre Aussedat, Jacques Boudet, Didier Flamand, Brigitte Sy', 'NR', 'In 2016, French writer and photographer Carole Achache took her own life. After Carole''s death, her daughter Mona Achache, a film director, discovers thousands of photos, letters and recordings that Carole left behind, but these buried secrets make her disappearance even more of an enigma. Through the power of filmmaking and the beauty of incarnation with the help of actress Marion Cotillard, the director brings her mother back to life to retrace her journey and find out who she really was.', 'In 2016, French writer and photographer Carole Achache took her own life. After Carole''s death, her daughter Mona Achache, a film director, discovers thousands of photos, letters and recordings that Carole left behind, but these buried secrets make her disappearance even more of an enigma. Through the power of filmmaking and the beauty of incarnation with the help of actress Marion Cotillard, the director brings her mother back to life to retrace her journey and find out who she really was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeBTKZjkcT5ETeknExFw9ojTac1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1095873'),
  ('705067020905059924', 'Little Girl Lost: The Delimar Vera Story', 2008, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Paul A. Kaufman, Mathias Herndl, Blair Freeman-Marsh', 'Christopher Canaan, Maria Nation', 'Judy Reyes, Ana Ortiz, Hector Luis Bustamante, Marlene Forte, A Martinez, Jillian Bruno, Mark Humphrey, Eli Gabay', null, 'Luzaida Cuevas spent years doubting that her infant daughter Delimar had died in a fire. When she spots a girl resembling Delimar, Luzaida battles skeptics to prove the child is hers.', 'Luzaida Cuevas spent years doubting that her infant daughter Delimar had died in a fire. When she spots a girl resembling Delimar, Luzaida battles skeptics to prove the child is hers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ye1relk04Z3KOoS8T0OBUl0bdEk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159753'),
  ('378689344940273089', 'Little Gray Neck', 1948, 'Family, Animation', 'Vladimir Polkovnikov, Leonid Amalrik, Nikolay Voinov', 'Georgiy Beryozko', 'Lidiya Kazmina, Fyodor Kurikhin, Vera Yenyutina, Valentina Telegina, Viktoriya Ivanova, Vladimir Popov', null, 'Defending a friend, duckling is attacked by fox and must learn to survive.', 'Defending a friend, duckling is attacked by fox and must learn to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nt5VLvcpRg5BFlU4lQWULWtTgzd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306042'),
  ('843580574338401664', 'Little Hamlet', 1960, 'Drama', 'Jerzy Skolimowski, Jacek Stachlewski', null, 'Zdzisław Leśniak, Elżbieta Czyżewska, Wiesław Gołas, Hanna Skarżanka, Ryszard Ostałowski', null, 'Hamlet suspects his uncle has murdered his father to claim the throne of Denmark and the hand of Hamlet''s mother, but the prince cannot decide whether or not he should take vengeance.', 'Hamlet suspects his uncle has murdered his father to claim the throne of Denmark and the hand of Hamlet''s mother, but the prince cannot decide whether or not he should take vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5HejACmCvLsHBcFvaUxOJIZ7wD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49467'),
  ('171974452262058019', 'Little Hands', 2018, 'Drama', 'Kinan Massarani, Rémi Allier, Lucien Keller', 'Julien Guetta, Gilles Monnat', 'Emile Moulron Lejeune, Jan Hammenecker, Steve Driesen, Sandrine Blancke, Pascal Bernagaud, Frédéric Guerbert, Paul Laurent, Mario Dragunsky', null, 'Léo is the two-year old, son of the acting manager of a factory on the brink of closing. When employees discover the news, Bruno, a more radical Worker who is willing to fight for his job, abducts Léo.', 'Léo is the two-year old, son of the acting manager of a factory on the brink of closing. When employees discover the news, Bruno, a more radical Worker who is willing to fight for his job, abducts Léo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zS8X3soYWXj5CCXE3S54sq89bd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478812'),
  ('966402866045056740', 'Little Hearts', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Sai Marthand, Suriya Balaj', 'Sai Marthand', 'Mouli, Shivani Nagaram, Rajiv Kanakala, S. S. Kanchi, Anitha Chowdary, Satya Krishnan, Jai Krishna, Nikhil Abburi', null, 'Akhil, when failed in EAMCET exam, is forced into long-term coaching after heartbreak teaches him the difference between true and shallow love. At the center, he meets Katyayani and falls for her, only to be rejected for a strange reason. Determined not to lose her, his humorous and transformative journey to win her heart becomes the soul of the story.', 'Akhil, when failed in EAMCET exam, is forced into long-term coaching after heartbreak teaches him the difference between true and shallow love. At the center, he meets Katyayani and falls for her, only to be rejected for a strange reason. Determined not to lose her, his humorous and transformative journey to win her heart becomes the soul of the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDTHRLgYTUAZimgNsmG6t2Saabz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1440700'),
  ('980028942757200188', 'Little Hiawatha', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Hand', null, 'Sally Noble, Mary Rosetti, Millie Walters, Gayne Whitman', 'NR', 'The "fearless warrior" of the poem is a very small child whose pants keep falling down. He tries to shoot a grasshopper with his arrow, but the grasshopper spits in his eye. He tries to shoot a bunny rabbit, but the rabbit is too cute and pathetic. He tracks a bear, and runs after its cub and right into the mother. But the rest of the animals, thankful for him saving the rabbit, come to his rescue.', 'The "fearless warrior" of the poem is a very small child whose pants keep falling down. He tries to shoot a grasshopper with his arrow, but the grasshopper spits in his eye. He tries to shoot a bunny rabbit, but the rabbit is too cute and pathetic. He tracks a bear, and runs after its cub and right into the mother. But the rest of the animals, thankful for him saving the rabbit, come to his rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7aTe62Ga86jLXBppKmS1KXeGBA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58160'),
  ('680843949644449827', 'Little House on the Prairie', 1974, 'Western, Family, Drama, TV Movie', 'Michael Landon, Ted Voigtlander', 'Blanche Hanalis', 'Michael Landon, Karen Grassle, Melissa Gilbert, Melissa Sue Anderson, Lindsay Greenbush, Sidney Greenbush, Victor French, Victor Mohica', null, 'The story of the Ingalls family who left their house in Wisconsin and moved to the west, wanting to find a new place for home.', 'The story of the Ingalls family who left their house in Wisconsin and moved to the west, wanting to find a new place for home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msWuQkDPAz06rDO7FeZ76OHHkMY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:792754'),
  ('774581909050329843', 'Little House: Bless All the Dear Children', 1983, 'Family, Drama', 'Victor French, Haskell B. Boggs', 'Chris Abbott', 'Melissa Gilbert, Dean Butler, Richard Bull, Victor French, Kevin Hagen, Allison Balson, Stan Ivar, Pamela Roylance', null, 'During preparation for Christmas baby Rose Wilder is kidnapped by the woman who recently lost her child. Looking for her Laura, Almanzo and Mr Edwards meet lonely orphan boy, who finally stays with that woman.', 'During preparation for Christmas baby Rose Wilder is kidnapped by the woman who recently lost her child. Looking for her Laura, Almanzo and Mr Edwards meet lonely orphan boy, who finally stays with that woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NkW8lXLo5lHbfJOMALnKLYpXRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368088'),
  ('419234882725219786', 'Little House: Look Back to Yesterday', 1983, 'Western, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Victor French, Brianne Murphy', 'Vince Gutierrez', 'Melissa Gilbert, Dean Butler, Richard Bull, Victor French, Kevin Hagen, Dabbs Greer, Jonathan Gilbert, Allison Balson', 'PG', 'Albert Quinn Ingalls wants to be a doctor. But soon he discovers that he is fatally ill. He decides to spend the rest of his life in Walnut Grove. Meanwhile children from school are preparing for their traditional climbing of the mountain.', 'Albert Quinn Ingalls wants to be a doctor. But soon he discovers that he is fatally ill. He decides to spend the rest of his life in Walnut Grove. Meanwhile children from school are preparing for their traditional climbing of the mountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVqtdwp6S2wEIRoQXtc8EUjaxjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441785'),
  ('947354417166093985', 'Little House: The Last Farewell', 1984, 'Western, Drama', 'Michael Landon, Ted Voigtlander', 'Michael Landon', 'Melissa Gilbert, Dean Butler, James Karen, Richard Bull, Victor French, Kevin Hagen, Dabbs Greer, Jonathan Gilbert', null, 'While Charles and Caroline are visiting Walnut Grove, the townspeople learn that a land development tycoon has acquired title to all the land in Hero Township. They are inspired by Laura to vent their anger at this injustice.', 'While Charles and Caroline are visiting Walnut Grove, the townspeople learn that a land development tycoon has acquired title to all the land in Hero Township. They are inspired by Laura to vent their anger at this injustice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85ymymFvoCPK1WxXjCrcbGnqQD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472797'),
  ('574557947960803022', 'Little Indian, Big City', 1994, 'Adventure, Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Hervé Palud, Fabio Conversi', 'Hervé Palud', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Patrick Timsit, Ludwig Briand, Miou-Miou, Arielle Dombasle, Sonia Vollereaux, Tolsty, Jackie Berroyer', 'PG', 'Stephen, an international trader, tracks down his ex-wife Patricia in some Amazonian backwater. He needs her consent to a divorce so that he can marry Charlotte. Unfortunately, he discovers a son he didn’t know he had – Mimi-Siku. The young jungle boy yearns to see Paris so Stephen reluctantly agrees to take him back home with him for a few days. How will Mimi-Siku react to life in the great metropolis?', 'Stephen, an international trader, tracks down his ex-wife Patricia in some Amazonian backwater. He needs her consent to a divorce so that he can marry Charlotte. Unfortunately, he discovers a son he didn’t know he had – Mimi-Siku. The young jungle boy yearns to see Paris so Stephen reluctantly agrees to take him back home with him for a few days. How will Mimi-Siku react to life in the great metropolis?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUFHWv42GRJcjLTQa5IYBEuVzmK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11479'),
  ('1073833519892850853', 'Little Italy', 1978, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Bruno Corbucci, Marcello Masciocchi, Roberto Tatti', 'Mario Amendola, Bruno Corbucci', 'Tomas Milian, Enzo Cannavale, Margherita Fumero, Bombolo, Massimo Vanni, Francesco Anniballi, Enzo Pulcrano, Roberto Messina', null, 'Undercover cop Nico Giraldi travels to New York and Las Vegas to find a crooked cop who gave his squadron back in Italy a bad name.', 'Undercover cop Nico Giraldi travels to New York and Las Vegas to find a crooked cop who gave his squadron back in Italy a bad name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVVideWKV2Fm68rJArNMqDN6kaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52913'),
  ('887021174612706272', 'Little Italy', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Donald Petrie, Thom Best', 'Steve Galluccio, Vinay Virmani', 'Emma Roberts, Hayden Christensen, Alyssa Milano, Danny Aiello, Andrea Martin, Jane Seymour, Gary Basaraba, Adam Ferrara', 'R', 'Former childhood pals Leo and Nikki are attracted to each other as adults—but will their feuding parents'' rival pizzerias put a chill on their sizzling romance?', 'Former childhood pals Leo and Nikki are attracted to each other as adults—but will their feuding parents'' rival pizzerias put a chill on their sizzling romance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwlB4kHXK6IDhZMTALNOfohnr00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523773'),
  ('1002160954352765175', 'Little Jaffna', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Maxence Lemonnier, Lawrence Valin, Hélèna Cotinier', 'Arthur Beaupère, Malysone Bovorasmy, Marlène Poste', 'Lawrence Valin, Puviraj Raveendran, Vela Ramamoorthy, Radikaa Sarathkumar, Kawsie Chandra, Marilou Aussilloux, Aswina Vinotharuban, Nirojan Nallathamby', null, 'The district of ''Little Jaffna'' in Paris is the heart of a vibrant Tamil community, where Michael, a young police officer, is assigned to infiltrate a criminal group known for extortion and money laundering for the benefit of separatist rebels in Sri-Lanka. But as he works his way deeper into the heart of the organization, his loyalty will be tested, in a relentless pursuit against one of Paris'' most hidden and powerful gangs.', 'The district of ''Little Jaffna'' in Paris is the heart of a vibrant Tamil community, where Michael, a young police officer, is assigned to infiltrate a criminal group known for extortion and money laundering for the benefit of separatist rebels in Sri-Lanka. But as he works his way deeper into the heart of the organization, his loyalty will be tested, in a relentless pursuit against one of Paris'' most hidden and powerful gangs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdn61bN25IKO1mVj7ycgJ73wHZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1193692'),
  ('240303146702963244', 'Little Joe', 2019, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Jessica Hausner, Martin Gschlacht, Heidi Gower', 'Géraldine Bajard, Jessica Hausner', 'Emily Beecham, Ben Whishaw, Kerry Fox, Kit Connor, David Wilmot, Phénix Brossard, Sebastian Hülk, Lindsay Duncan', 'NR', 'Alice, a single mother who is more dedicated to her work as a genetic engineer than to her teenage son Joe, develops a new variety of flower that is supposed to have the ability to make its owner happy thanks to its special chemical properties.', 'Alice, a single mother who is more dedicated to her work as a genetic engineer than to her teenage son Joe, develops a new variety of flower that is supposed to have the ability to make its owner happy thanks to its special chemical properties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4VMyavCoXxN9U8AONE2YryQDVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504585'),
  ('1128164655102903171', 'Little Johnny Jet', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Daws Butler, June Foray', 'G', 'A veteran B-29 propeller plane, struggling to find work after the war, is upset after his wife gives birth to a little jet. When he tries to compete with modern planes in an around-the-world race, Junior comes to his aid. This short is virtually identical in plot terms and other items to One Cab''s Family (1952), but this time around, it concerns a family of aeroplanes, and the problems Mom and Pop have with Junior, whose obsession with speed leads him to acquire a jet engine.', 'A veteran B-29 propeller plane, struggling to find work after the war, is upset after his wife gives birth to a little jet. When he tries to compete with modern planes in an around-the-world race, Junior comes to his aid. This short is virtually identical in plot terms and other items to One Cab''s Family (1952), but this time around, it concerns a family of aeroplanes, and the problems Mom and Pop have with Junior, whose obsession with speed leads him to acquire a jet engine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSFNVW8fnQoRG7jFrm1k75Eehab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84899'),
  ('1046919310695511746', 'Little Lady', 2012, 'TV Movie, Family', 'Gernot Roll', 'Chris Boyle', 'Stefania Rocca, Veronica Ferres, Philippa Schöne, Christiane Hörbiger, Christiane Filangieri, Xaver Hutter, Wolfgang Hinze, Paul Alhäuser', null, 'Nine-year-old streetwalker Emily lives with her widowed mother in 19th century New York. Her life changes abruptly when she learns that she has been appointed sole heiress by an aging, wealthy Austrian countess. It is not only an heiress who causes turbulence, but also the countess''s attempt to raise Emily as a member of the aristocracy.', 'Nine-year-old streetwalker Emily lives with her widowed mother in 19th century New York. Her life changes abruptly when she learns that she has been appointed sole heiress by an aging, wealthy Austrian countess. It is not only an heiress who causes turbulence, but also the countess''s attempt to raise Emily as a member of the aristocracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiQOUtjxbi8p3Iv7QlBTcx9mFVy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154562'),
  ('463049100878912480', 'Little Lies', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance, Thriller', 'Sebastián Schindel, Lucio Bonelli', 'Sebastián Schindel, Leonel D''Agostino', 'Lucas Akoskin, Leonor Varela, Florencia Peña, Benjamín Vicuña, Coca Guazzini, Germán Baudino, Flor Vigna, Agustina Suásquita', null, 'Amidst the problems in their childless marriage, Matías and Eva try their hand at matchmaking, setting up their friend Barbara with the man who seems perfect, Julián. Once they realize that Julian is not what he seems, they try to warn Barbara away, but she may already be too infatuated.', 'Amidst the problems in their childless marriage, Matías and Eva try their hand at matchmaking, setting up their friend Barbara with the man who seems perfect, Julián. Once they realize that Julian is not what he seems, they try to warn Barbara away, but she may already be too infatuated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxj8ZIfqQ1zR3SqxvXCa0yBKyoW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833950'),
  ('1136787846920574942', 'Little Lili', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claude Miller, Gérard de Battista, Denis Bergonhe', 'Julien Boivent, Claude Miller', 'Nicole Garcia, Robinson Stévenin, Ludivine Sagnier, Bernard Giraudeau, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Julie Depardieu, Yves Jacques, Anne Le Ny', null, 'This film, loosely inspired by Anton Chekov''s The Seagull, weaves a story about sex, family and the business of making films. When the young and overly sensitive filmmaker Julien screens his new DV art-film starring his girlfriend Lili (Swimming Pool''s Ludivine Sagnier) --a sexy young local girl--to his famous actress mother Mado, and her lover Brice, an accomplished film director, an unraveling of the delicate peace in their house begins. The graceful beauty Lili, who dreams of becoming a famous actress like Mado, is immediately fascinated by Brice, who gladly falls prey to her charms.', 'This film, loosely inspired by Anton Chekov''s The Seagull, weaves a story about sex, family and the business of making films. When the young and overly sensitive filmmaker Julien screens his new DV art-film starring his girlfriend Lili (Swimming Pool''s Ludivine Sagnier) --a sexy young local girl--to his famous actress mother Mado, and her lover Brice, an accomplished film director, an unraveling of the delicate peace in their house begins. The graceful beauty Lili, who dreams of becoming a famous actress like Mado, is immediately fascinated by Brice, who gladly falls prey to her charms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a310dwedBi2MwT2QpvOtVJQBEIQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51865'),
  ('562399925263794214', 'Little Lion', 2013, 'Drama', 'Samuel Collardey', 'Catherine Paillé, Samuel Collardey, Nadège Trébal', 'Marc Barbé, Mytri Attal, Anne Coesens, Marc Berman, Jean-François Stévenin', null, 'A Senegalese teenager is recruited to pursue his dream of playing professional soccer in Europe.', 'A Senegalese teenager is recruited to pursue his dream of playing professional soccer in Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EdedGxnSiKh0c8uA6w4QsjFROe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156173'),
  ('486146211034561672', 'Little Lips', 1978, 'Drama', 'Mimmo Cattarinich, Sandro Mancori, Graziella Marsetti', 'Mimmo Cattarinich, Daniele Sánchez', 'Pierre Clémenti, Katya Berger, Ugo Bologna, Bárbara Rey, Michele Soavi, Maria Monti, Raf Baldassarre, Tom Felleghy', null, 'A writer returns home to his estate after service in World War I. He has developed a very bad case of depression due to a war wound concerning his genitalia. He contemplates suicide, but recovers after becoming interested in his caretaker''s 12 year-old war orphan niece, who now lives in the manor.', 'A writer returns home to his estate after service in World War I. He has developed a very bad case of depression due to a war wound concerning his genitalia. He contemplates suicide, but recovers after becoming interested in his caretaker''s 12 year-old war orphan niece, who now lives in the manor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKhJiY9u2L4LInLd7Xdwry1YTdA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26550'),
  ('466669744110929388', 'Little Lise', 1930, 'Drama', 'Jean Grémillon, Jean Bachelet, René Colas', 'Charles Spaak', 'Nadia Sibirskaïa, Pierre Alcover, Julien Bertheau, Joe Alex, Alex Bernard, Raymond Cordy, Lucien Hector, Alexandre Mihalesco', null, 'Victor Berthier, a good man but also a very jealous one, killed his wife in a fit of jealousy. After serving a few years in a chain gang, he is released for good behavior. He feels very happy to be able to return to Paris and to meet Lise, his daughter, again. But, to his dismay, he finds that Lise, through the fault of André, her lover and pimp, has unwillingly committed a murder.', 'Victor Berthier, a good man but also a very jealous one, killed his wife in a fit of jealousy. After serving a few years in a chain gang, he is released for good behavior. He feels very happy to be able to return to Paris and to meet Lise, his daughter, again. But, to his dismay, he finds that Lise, through the fault of André, her lover and pimp, has unwillingly committed a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OfyuooFBiXLhtQJVqfyMEaiXsX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153832'),
  ('173618394438672884', 'Little Longnose', 2003, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Ilya Maksimov', 'Aleksandr Boyarsky', 'Albert Asadullin, Igor Shibanov, Yevgeniya Igumnova, Elena Shulman, Tatyana Ivanova, Ivan Krasko, Aleksey Gurev, Yelena Solovyova', null, 'When he refused to support power-hungry witch, the good shoemaker''s boy, Jacob is transformed into a hunchbacked dwarf with overlong nose. Of their mother no longer recognized, mocked by the people of the city and driven away, Jacob runs one day a goose on the road. Together with the spring animal - in fact the king''s daughter Greta enchanted - Jacob is now trying to make the transformation to reverse and put the wicked witch craft.', 'When he refused to support power-hungry witch, the good shoemaker''s boy, Jacob is transformed into a hunchbacked dwarf with overlong nose. Of their mother no longer recognized, mocked by the people of the city and driven away, Jacob runs one day a goose on the road. Together with the spring animal - in fact the king''s daughter Greta enchanted - Jacob is now trying to make the transformation to reverse and put the wicked witch craft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ULJpVro6x6mHIuMAmWyC1KMzEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51349'),
  ('994062472405553541', 'Little Lord Fauntleroy', 1921, 'Drama', 'Jack Pickford, Alfred E. Green, Charles Rosher', 'Bernard McConville', 'Mary Pickford, Claude Gillingwater, Joseph J. Dowling, James A. Marcus, Kate Price, Fred Malatesta, Rose Dione, Arthur Thalasso', null, 'An American boy turns out to be the long-lost heir of a British fortune. He is sent to live with the cold and unsentimental lord who oversees the trust.', 'An American boy turns out to be the long-lost heir of a British fortune. He is sent to live with the cold and unsentimental lord who oversees the trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dGPDwry1BlM7Q2tQ2MBRQhIXT0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175330'),
