  ('1128624579503655545', 'Little Lord Fauntleroy', 1980, 'Family, Drama, TV Movie', 'Jack Gold, Arthur Ibbetson', 'Blanche Hanalis', 'Rick Schroder, Alec Guinness, Eric Porter, Colin Blakely, Connie Booth, Rachel Kempson, Gerry Cowper, Barry Jackson', null, 'Young Cedric Errol and his widowed mother live in genteel poverty in 1880s Brooklyn after the death of his father. Cedric''s grandfather, the Earl of Dorincourt, has long ago disowned his son for marrying an American. But after the death of the Earl''s remaining son, he decides to accept Cedric as his heir.', 'Young Cedric Errol and his widowed mother live in genteel poverty in 1880s Brooklyn after the death of his father. Cedric''s grandfather, the Earl of Dorincourt, has long ago disowned his son for marrying an American. But after the death of the Earl''s remaining son, he decides to accept Cedric as his heir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rLhBRseh1ZVNMQIFUxhy9IcWvi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38602'),
  ('1131207883217701102', 'Little Loves', 2024, 'Drama', 'Santiago Racaj, Celia Rico Clavellino, Pau Balagué', 'Celia Rico Clavellino', 'Adriana Ozores, María Vázquez, Miguel Ángel González, Aimar Vega, Pep Muñoz, Camille Figuereo, Laura Gaja, Júlia Morella', null, 'Teresa changes her vacation plans to spend the summer with Ani, her mother. Living together day and night after so many years is not easy for either of them. Accustomed to living alone, it is difficult for them to agree on even the small things of daily life. However, the forced coexistence will also bring revealing moments for both.', 'Teresa changes her vacation plans to spend the summer with Ani, her mother. Living together day and night after so many years is not easy for either of them. Accustomed to living alone, it is difficult for them to agree on even the small things of daily life. However, the forced coexistence will also bring revealing moments for both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FtUzjC3mKXVeRAkd08YKJ8OwC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088851'),
  ('273574156582998241', 'Little Malcolm and His Struggle Against the Eunuchs', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stuart Cooper, John Alcott, Kip Gowans', 'David Halliwell', 'John Hurt, John McEnery, Raymond Platt, Rosalind Ayres, David Warner', null, 'An art student is thrown out of college. Depressed, he comes up with the Party of Dynamic Erection, a near fascist "party" that promotes male sexual dominance and which attracts a couple of other unsavoury confused characters.', 'An art student is thrown out of college. Depressed, he comes up with the Party of Dynamic Erection, a near fascist "party" that promotes male sexual dominance and which attracts a couple of other unsavoury confused characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hMlBbgXNe6gaiFY3m3xavKBKQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82921'),
  ('409572079995620316', 'Little Man', 2006, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans, Steven Bernstein, Jim Brebner', 'Shawn Wayans, Marlon Wayans, Keenen Ivory Wayans', 'Marlon Wayans, Shawn Wayans, Kerry Washington, John Witherspoon, Tracy Morgan, Lochlyn Munro, Rob Schneider, David Alan Grier', 'PG-13', 'After leaving prison, dwarf criminal Calvin Sims joins his moron brother Percy in stealing an expensive huge diamond from a jewelry store for the mobster Walken. They are chased by the police, and Calvin hides the stone in the purse of executive Vanessa Edwards, whose husband Darryl Edwards wants to have a baby. Percy convinces Calvin to dress like a baby and be left in front of the Edwards'' house to get inside the house and retrieve the diamond. Darryl and Vanessa keep Calvin for the weekend and decide to adopt him, while Walken threatens Darryl to get the stone back.', 'After leaving prison, dwarf criminal Calvin Sims joins his moron brother Percy in stealing an expensive huge diamond from a jewelry store for the mobster Walken. They are chased by the police, and Calvin hides the stone in the purse of executive Vanessa Edwards, whose husband Darryl Edwards wants to have a baby. Percy convinces Calvin to dress like a baby and be left in front of the Edwards'' house to get inside the house and retrieve the diamond. Darryl and Vanessa keep Calvin for the weekend and decide to adopt him, while Walken threatens Darryl to get the stone back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KzPw1VN0pMBnq1KIqBaLI8LAB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9072'),
  ('362651939717920187', 'Little Man Tate', 1991, 'Drama, Family', 'Jodie Foster, Mike Southon, Gregory Jacobs', 'Scott Frank', 'Jodie Foster, Dianne Wiest, Adam Hann-Byrd, Harry Connick Jr., David Hyde Pierce, Debi Mazar, P.J. Ochlan, Michael Shulman', 'PG', 'Dede is a sole parent trying to bring up her son Fred. When it is discovered that Fred is a genius, she is determined to ensure that Fred has all the opportunities that he needs, and that he is not taken advantage of by people who forget that his extremely powerful intellect is harboured in the body and emotions of a child.', 'Dede is a sole parent trying to bring up her son Fred. When it is discovered that Fred is a genius, she is determined to ensure that Fred has all the opportunities that he needs, and that he is not taken advantage of by people who forget that his extremely powerful intellect is harboured in the body and emotions of a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXf4xhJEc9c2NElBrExmiWFe4Pz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11521'),
  ('379287783204599195', 'Little Man Tom', 2022, 'Drama', 'Fabienne Berthaud', 'Fabienne Berthaud, Barbara Constantine', 'Nadia Tereszkiewicz, Félix Maritaud, Tanguy Mercier, Mohamed Makhtoumi, Samir Arab, Claudine Acs, Stanley Weber, Mathieu Morel', null, 'Tom, 11 years old, lives in a trailer home on the edge of the woods with Joss, his young mother. The two of them support each other and show unwavering optimism. While Joss is away working small jobs, Tom keeps himself occu- pied. One day, a young man fresh out of prison breaks into their home and their lives, and disrupts the equilibrium.', 'Tom, 11 years old, lives in a trailer home on the edge of the woods with Joss, his young mother. The two of them support each other and show unwavering optimism. While Joss is away working small jobs, Tom keeps himself occu- pied. One day, a young man fresh out of prison breaks into their home and their lives, and disrupts the equilibrium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1B1sb6SxwPI55yugPsQdm7ghlIn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892511'),
  ('391349185080320341', 'Little Man, What Now?', 1934, 'Drama, Romance', 'Frank Borzage, Arthur Kay, Lew Borzage', 'William Anthony McGuire', 'Margaret Sullavan, Douglass Montgomery, Alan Hale, Catherine Doucet, DeWitt Jennings, G.P. Huntley, Muriel Kirkland, Fred Kohler', 'NR', 'A young couple struggling against poverty must keep their marriage a secret in order for the husband to keep his job, as his boss doesn''t like to hire married men.', 'A young couple struggling against poverty must keep their marriage a secret in order for the husband to keep his job, as his boss doesn''t like to hire married men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bluJR4muRUVK69wb3cqPQtKCMSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118854'),
  ('884409938967432370', 'Little Manhattan', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Levin, Tim Orr', 'Jennifer Flackett', 'Josh Hutcherson, Charlie Ray, Bradley Whitford, Cynthia Nixon, Willie Garson, J. Kyle Manzay, Josh Pais, John Dossett', 'PG', 'Ten-year-old Gabe Burton is just an average kid growing up in Manhattan until Rosemary Telesco walks into his karate class. But before Gabe can tell Rosemary how he feels, she reveals that she won''t be going to public school any more. Gabe has a lot more to learn about life, love, and girls.', 'Ten-year-old Gabe Burton is just an average kid growing up in Manhattan until Rosemary Telesco walks into his karate class. But before Gabe can tell Rosemary how he feels, she reveals that she won''t be going to public school any more. Gabe has a lot more to learn about life, love, and girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0RNI1NMtsvLsuTo1rWZfNHVs1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16553'),
  ('941360266188302205', 'Little Men', 2016, 'Drama', 'Ira Sachs, Óscar Durán', 'Mauricio Zacharias, Ira Sachs', 'Greg Kinnear, Jennifer Ehle, Paulina García, Michael Barbieri, Theo Taplitz, Talia Balsam, Maliq Johnson, Anthony A. Flamminio', 'PG', 'Jake is a quiet, sensitive middle schooler with dreams of being an artist. He meets the affably brash Tony at his grandfather''s funeral, and the unlikely pair soon hit it off. The budding friendship is put at risk, however, when a rent dispute between Jake''s father, Brian, and Tony''s mother, Leonor, threatens to become contentious.', 'Jake is a quiet, sensitive middle schooler with dreams of being an artist. He meets the affably brash Tony at his grandfather''s funeral, and the unlikely pair soon hit it off. The budding friendship is put at risk, however, when a rent dispute between Jake''s father, Brian, and Tony''s mother, Leonor, threatens to become contentious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMmXSUZ66XoxmT4zdkUkVDdU8Mu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373473'),
  ('833332702118809481', 'Little Miss Broadway', 1938, 'Drama, Family, Music', 'Irving Cummings, Arthur C. Miller', 'Harry Tugend, Jack Yellen', 'Shirley Temple, George Murphy, Jimmy Durante, Phyllis Brooks, Edna May Oliver, George Barbier, Edward Ellis, Jane Darwell', 'NR', 'An orphan is provisionally adopted by the manager of a hotel populated by show business people. The hotel''s owner doesn''t like the entertainers and wants the girl returned to the orphanage.', 'An orphan is provisionally adopted by the manager of a hotel populated by show business people. The hotel''s owner doesn''t like the entertainers and wants the girl returned to the orphanage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAy3KU35GoM1KpUSxj6c3yAOhnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38769'),
  ('771262729311366625', 'Little Miss Dolittle', 2018, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Crime', 'Joachim Masannek', 'Matthias Dinter, Antonia Rothe-Liermann, Katrin Milhahn', 'Malu Leicher, Christoph Maria Herbst, Tom Beck, Aylin Tezel, Meret Becker, Peri Baumeister, Aaron Kissiov, Yoran Leicher', null, 'An eleven year old girl can talk to animals. When a thief causes trouble in the local zoo, she comes to the rescue.', 'An eleven year old girl can talk to animals. When a thief causes trouble in the local zoo, she comes to the rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlSeZqSFojm6Hh2fxTdvU9XCRGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505204'),
  ('712595712759635407', 'Little Miss Marker', 1934, 'Comedy, Family', 'Alexander Hall, Alfred Gilks', 'William R. Lipman, Sam Hellman, Gladys Lehman', 'Shirley Temple, Adolphe Menjou, Charles Bickford, Dorothy Dell, Warren Hymer, Lynne Overman, Sam Hardy, John Kelly', null, 'Big Steve Halloway, gambler and proprietor of New York''s Horseshoe Cabaret, is in desperate need of money. He arranges for his fellow bookies, especially Sorrowful Jones, to each pay him $1,000 for his racehorse, Dream Prince, to lose. With all bets being placed at the window, Sorrowful encounters a gambler, having lost $500, wanting to place his bet but unable to come up with $20. Instead, he places his little girl, Marthy Jane, as security, or in bookie''s terms a "marker". "Marky", as she comes to be known, winds up under the care of Sorrowful Jones and his lady friend, singer Bangles Carson.', 'Big Steve Halloway, gambler and proprietor of New York''s Horseshoe Cabaret, is in desperate need of money. He arranges for his fellow bookies, especially Sorrowful Jones, to each pay him $1,000 for his racehorse, Dream Prince, to lose. With all bets being placed at the window, Sorrowful encounters a gambler, having lost $500, wanting to place his bet but unable to come up with $20. Instead, he places his little girl, Marthy Jane, as security, or in bookie''s terms a "marker". "Marky", as she comes to be known, winds up under the care of Sorrowful Jones and his lady friend, singer Bangles Carson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLt4sYP6fJLkac7ETgy9lL5Kl6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43150'),
  ('180649973323095648', 'Little Miss Marker', 1980, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Walter Bernstein, Philip H. Lathrop', 'Walter Bernstein', 'Walter Matthau, Julie Andrews, Tony Curtis, Bob Newhart, Lee Grant, Brian Dennehy, Kenneth McMillan, Andrew Rubin', 'PG', 'Sorrowful Jones is a cheap bookie in the 1930s. When a gambler leaves his daughter as a marker for a bet, he gets stuck with her. His life will change a great deal with her arrival and his sudden love for a woman also involved in gambling operations.', 'Sorrowful Jones is a cheap bookie in the 1930s. When a gambler leaves his daughter as a marker for a bet, he gets stuck with her. His life will change a great deal with her arrival and his sudden love for a woman also involved in gambling operations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clqmOwegCW2YeIxxl6Aoo1omQMq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47876'),
  ('884771726342927096', 'Little Miss Millions', 1993, 'Family, Comedy', 'Jim Wynorski, Brendan Broderick, Tony Steinberg', 'R.J. Robertson, Jim Wynorski', 'Jennifer Love Hewitt, Howard Hesseman, Anita Morris, James Avery, Pat Brady, Robert Fieldsteel, Steve Landesberg, Terri Treas', 'PG', 'Private detective Nick is hired to bring back Heather, who ran away from her stepmother to find her real mother.', 'Private detective Nick is hired to bring back Heather, who ran away from her stepmother to find her real mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VNyAdloCmHdPrG9UIFoUfx3Cyg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149553'),
  ('937029925660395465', 'Little Miss Sunshine', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Valerie Faris, Tim Suhrstedt, Jonathan Dayton', 'Michael Arndt', 'Greg Kinnear, Toni Collette, Steve Carell, Paul Dano, Abigail Breslin, Alan Arkin, Bryan Cranston, Beth Grant', 'R', 'A family loaded with quirky, colorful characters piles into an old van and road trips to California for little Olive to compete in a beauty pageant.', 'A family loaded with quirky, colorful characters piles into an old van and road trips to California for little Olive to compete in a beauty pageant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niNdhTpPHSgw22tK0PLjQMV640v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:773'),
  ('1018146016294221873', 'Little Mix: LM5: The Tour Film', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', 'Laurence Warder', null, 'Perrie Edwards, Jesy Nelson, Leigh-Anne Pinnock, Jade Thirlwall, Stormzy, Kamille', null, 'Following the release of their fifth studio album ‘LM5’, Perrie Edwards, Jesy Nelson, Leigh-Anne Pinnock and Jade Thirlwall embarked on ‘LM5 The Tour’ in 2019, taking in 40 arenas across Europe, including Spain, Italy, Germany, Netherlands, Belgium, France, UK and Ireland. They sold over 400,000 tickets including an almighty 5 sold out shows at the 02 London. This film was recorded at the final show of the tour at London’s iconic 02 arena. In a career spanning set of nineteen songs the group perform hits such as ‘Shout Out to My Ex’, ‘Woman Like Me’, ‘Wings’ and ‘Touch’ to a crowd of over 15,000.', 'Following the release of their fifth studio album ‘LM5’, Perrie Edwards, Jesy Nelson, Leigh-Anne Pinnock and Jade Thirlwall embarked on ‘LM5 The Tour’ in 2019, taking in 40 arenas across Europe, including Spain, Italy, Germany, Netherlands, Belgium, France, UK and Ireland. They sold over 400,000 tickets including an almighty 5 sold out shows at the 02 London. This film was recorded at the final show of the tour at London’s iconic 02 arena. In a career spanning set of nineteen songs the group perform hits such as ‘Shout Out to My Ex’, ‘Woman Like Me’, ‘Wings’ and ‘Touch’ to a crowd of over 15,000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKWw6hmF8TTrAa5Dooty9BYa47v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752340'),
  ('1063348251332061089', 'Little Monsters', 1989, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Dick Bush, Liz Ryan, Harry V. Bring', 'Ted Elliott, Terry Rossio', 'Fred Savage, Howie Mandel, Daniel Stern, Margaret Whitton, Rick Ducommun, Frank Whaley, Ben Savage, William Murray Weiss', 'PG', 'A young boy is scared of the monster under his bed. He asks his 6th grade brother to swap rooms for the night as a bet that the monster really exists. Soon the brother becomes friends with the monster and discovers a whole new world of fun and games under his bed where pulling pranks on kids and other monsters is the main attraction.', 'A young boy is scared of the monster under his bed. He asks his 6th grade brother to swap rooms for the night as a bet that the monster really exists. Soon the brother becomes friends with the monster and discovers a whole new world of fun and games under his bed where pulling pranks on kids and other monsters is the main attraction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynQT9NA4SBfoswIRkyrwqHe4aBz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15138'),
  ('979076976509186217', 'Little Monsters', 2019, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Lachlan Milne, Abe Forsythe, Betty Fotofili', 'Abe Forsythe', 'Lupita Nyong''o, Alexander England, Josh Gad, Diesel La Torraca, Kat Stewart, Nadia Townsend, Charlie Whitley, Chris Bunton', 'R', 'A washed-up musician teams up with a teacher and a kids show personality to protect young children from a sudden outbreak of zombies.', 'A washed-up musician teams up with a teacher and a kids show personality to protect young children from a sudden outbreak of zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQvUq7UmumBTcAnvgFLFvegY47d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503125'),
  ('227897722307230168', 'Little Mountain Boy', 2015, 'Family, Adventure', 'Xavier Koller, Felix von Muralt', 'Xavier Koller, Stefan Jäger', 'Jonas Hartmann, Julia Jeker, Laurin Michael, Marcus Signer, Tonia Maria Zindel, Martin Rapold, Sarah Sophia Meyer, Andrea Zogg', null, 'A boy must brave deep winter snow to obtain an important family keepsake. Before he can even start this difficult journey he must first help his family survive financial ruin, rescue his beloved pet goat, and with his best friend, outwit a bratty bully who seems out to get him at every turn. Will he make it back to the village in time to celebrate the end-of-winter holiday of Chalandamarz?', 'A boy must brave deep winter snow to obtain an important family keepsake. Before he can even start this difficult journey he must first help his family survive financial ruin, rescue his beloved pet goat, and with his best friend, outwit a bratty bully who seems out to get him at every turn. Will he make it back to the village in time to celebrate the end-of-winter holiday of Chalandamarz?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEAWfs8FEMIODp1zFvfSkijfEjF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338072'),
  ('1032786404575132329', 'Little Murders', 1971, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alan Arkin, Gordon Willis, Larry Y. Albucher', 'Jules Feiffer', 'Elliott Gould, Marcia Rodd, Vincent Gardenia, Elizabeth Wilson, Jon Korkes, John Randolph, Doris Roberts, Lou Jacobi', 'PG', 'A young nihilistic New Yorker copes with pervasive urban violence, obscene phone calls, rusty water pipes, electrical blackouts, paranoia, and ethnic-racial conflict during a typical summer of the 1970s.', 'A young nihilistic New Yorker copes with pervasive urban violence, obscene phone calls, rusty water pipes, electrical blackouts, paranoia, and ethnic-racial conflict during a typical summer of the 1970s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2QOxh6pwgy1MUF4bBYDVdPwbWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27459'),
  ('208965647657403083', 'Little Nemo', 1911, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Winsor McCay, J. Stuart Blackton', 'Winsor McCay', 'Winsor McCay, John Bunny, Maurice Costello, George McManus', null, 'Cartoon figures announce, via comic strip balloons, that they will move - and move they do, in a wildly exaggerated style. Also known as "Winsor McCay, the Famous Cartoonist of the N.Y. Herald and His Moving Comics".', 'Cartoon figures announce, via comic strip balloons, that they will move - and move they do, in a wildly exaggerated style. Also known as "Winsor McCay, the Famous Cartoonist of the N.Y. Herald and His Moving Comics".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fscB6epsfOSvrtW1nSDkX71Pt0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100247'),
  ('684125453839207213', 'Little Nemo: Adventures in Slumberland', 1989, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Masami Hata, William T. Hurtz, Kazuhide Tomonaga', 'Ray Bradbury', 'Takuma Gono, Chikao Ohtsuka, Chikao Ohtsuka, Hiroko Kasahara, Kenji Utsumi, Taro Ishida, Tessyo Genda, Mari Yokoo', 'G', 'A little boy whose dreams transcend reality is sucked into his own fantasy, which is everything he has dreamed of, until he unleashes an old secret that may not only destroy this perfect dream world but reality itself.', 'A little boy whose dreams transcend reality is sucked into his own fantasy, which is everything he has dreamed of, until he unleashes an old secret that may not only destroy this perfect dream world but reality itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVyqRtRaIGrHJvfxImrHHFaQNxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22611'),
  ('885110907034046894', 'Little Nicholas', 2009, 'Comedy, Family', 'Laurent Tirard, Denis Rouden, Gérard Moulévrier', 'Grégoire Vigneron, Laurent Tirard', 'Maxime Godart, Valérie Lemercier, Kad Merad, Sandrine Kiberlain, François-Xavier Demaison, Michel Duchaussoy, Daniel Prévost, Michel Galabru', 'G', 'Nicolas has a happy existence, parents who love him, a great group of friends with whom he has great fun, and all he wants is that nothing changes. However, one day, he overhears a conversation that leads him to believe that his life might change forever, his mother is pregnant! He panics and envisions the worst.', 'Nicolas has a happy existence, parents who love him, a great group of friends with whom he has great fun, and all he wants is that nothing changes. However, one day, he overhears a conversation that leads him to believe that his life might change forever, his mother is pregnant! He panics and envisions the worst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOsPAIRyknuPhYpFV0nTzbVLlgM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31203'),
  ('397040373646038943', 'Little Nicholas: Happy as Can Be', 2022, 'Animation, Family', 'Benjamin Massoubre, Amandine Fredon', 'Michel Fessler, Anne Goscinny', 'Alain Chabat, Laurent Lafitte, Simon Faliu, Alban Aumard, Alicia Hava, Aurélien de Branche, Claire Dumas, Delphine Baril', null, 'Somewhere between Montmartre and Saint-Germain-des-Prés, Jean-Jacques Sempé and René Goscinny lean over a large white sheet of paper and bring to life a mischievous and endearing boy, Little Nicolas. From schoolyard games and fights to summer camp pranks and camaraderie, Nicolas lives a merry and enriching childhood – and brings friendship and newfound life to his creators, too.', 'Somewhere between Montmartre and Saint-Germain-des-Prés, Jean-Jacques Sempé and René Goscinny lean over a large white sheet of paper and bring to life a mischievous and endearing boy, Little Nicolas. From schoolyard games and fights to summer camp pranks and camaraderie, Nicolas lives a merry and enriching childhood – and brings friendship and newfound life to his creators, too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTsaoXtBndypAQJj5C16d3Zmfxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893366'),
  ('373811285636493646', 'Little Nicholas'' Treasure', 2021, 'Family, Comedy', 'Julien Rappeneau', 'Julien Rappeneau, Mathias Gavarry', 'Ilan Debrabant, Jean-Paul Rouve, Audrey Lamy, Pierre Arditi, Grégory Gadebois, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Adeline D''Hermy, Noémie Lvovsky', null, 'In the peaceful world of Little Nicholas, there is Daddy, Mommy, the school, but above all, his band of friends. They are called The Invincibles, but above all they are inseparable. At least they think so. But when Dad gets a promotion and announces that the family is moving to the south of France, Nicolas'' world falls apart. How can he imagine life without his best friends?', 'In the peaceful world of Little Nicholas, there is Daddy, Mommy, the school, but above all, his band of friends. They are called The Invincibles, but above all they are inseparable. At least they think so. But when Dad gets a promotion and announces that the family is moving to the south of France, Nicolas'' world falls apart. How can he imagine life without his best friends?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZA6f7z6N8hTmPFFYSR0k5aNvMo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:740844'),
  ('525425842546683890', 'Little Nicky', 2000, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Steven Brill, Theo van de Sande, Alexandra K. Browne', 'Tim Herlihy, Adam Sandler, Steven Brill', 'Adam Sandler, Patricia Arquette, Harvey Keitel, Rhys Ifans, Tommy Lister Jr., Rodney Dangerfield, Allen Covert, Peter Dante', 'PG-13', 'After the lord of darkness decides he will not cede his throne to any of his three sons, the two most powerful of them escape to Earth to create a kingdom for themselves. This action closes the portal filtering sinful souls to Hell and causes Satan to wither away. He must send his most weak but beloved son, Little Nicky, to Earth to return his brothers to Hell.', 'After the lord of darkness decides he will not cede his throne to any of his three sons, the two most powerful of them escape to Earth to create a kingdom for themselves. This action closes the portal filtering sinful souls to Hell and causes Satan to wither away. He must send his most weak but beloved son, Little Nicky, to Earth to return his brothers to Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AudA8gnTWSBWXBHSBHnr3HHUXXM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9678'),
  ('1098230427556631653', 'Little Nights, Little Love', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Rikiya Imaizumi, Yuta Tsukinaga, Yoichi Nakzato', 'Kenichi Suzuki', 'Haruma Miura, Mikako Tabe, Shihori Kanjiya, Taizo Harada, Yuma Yamoto, Erika Mori, Yuri Tsunematsu, Riku Hagiwara', null, 'Sato is an employee conducting a survey in front of Sendai Station. Saki takes the survey and the two ultimately become a couple. 10 years later, Sato proposes to Saki on the occasion of their 10th anniversary.', 'Sato is an employee conducting a survey in front of Sendai Station. Saki takes the survey and the two ultimately become a couple. 10 years later, Sato proposes to Saki on the occasion of their 10th anniversary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIhw6fhw97IMmvjosw6CDbeid5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523869'),
  ('106867342774159557', 'Little Nikita', 1988, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'László Kovács, Richard Benjamin, Dennis Maguire', 'Bo Goldman, John Hill', 'Sidney Poitier, River Phoenix, Richard Jenkins, Caroline Kava, Lucy Deakins, Richard Bradford, Richard Lynch, Jerry Hardin', 'PG', 'An FBI agent works to uncover an all-American family as Soviet sleeper agents, and gets caught up in friendship with their oblivious teenage son.', 'An FBI agent works to uncover an all-American family as Soviet sleeper agents, and gets caught up in friendship with their oblivious teenage son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdzugDI6avIlba05pstUFqh2mI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12505'),
  ('267894065160066477', 'Little Nothings', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Cédric Klapisch, Dominique Colin', 'Cédric Klapisch, Jackie Berroyer', 'Fabrice Luchini, Daniel Berlioux, Marc Berman, Antoine Chappey, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Aurélie Guichard, Billy Komg, Odette Laure', null, 'Lepetit, an ambitious and determined man, is named the new CEO of a department store. His mission is to improve the store''s financial position. He decides that the human factor will be his catchword and introduces new methods, which he also applied to himself. But tensions slowly arise between members of the staff.', 'Lepetit, an ambitious and determined man, is named the new CEO of a department store. His mission is to improve the store''s financial position. He decides that the human factor will be his catchword and introduces new methods, which he also applied to himself. But tensions slowly arise between members of the staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOglcTyKLUD1dEOt2VKjqyzeWvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69896'),
  ('738429399097037170', 'Little Odessa', 1994, 'Drama, Crime', 'Steve Apicella, David M. Cox, David ''Wex'' Wechsler', 'James Gray', 'Tim Roth, Edward Furlong, Moira Kelly, Vanessa Redgrave, Paul Guilfoyle, Natalya Andreychenko, Maximilian Schell, David Vadim', 'R', 'Long separated from his family, hitman Joshua returns to Brighton Beach for a contract killing for the Russian Mafia. His abusive father, Arkady, banned him from returning after Joshua committed his first murder. He takes up residence in a hotel, and soon everyone knows he has returned. He goes home to visit his dying mother, Irina, and prepares for the assassination, getting drawn back into the criminal community he left behind.', 'Long separated from his family, hitman Joshua returns to Brighton Beach for a contract killing for the Russian Mafia. His abusive father, Arkady, banned him from returning after Joshua committed his first murder. He takes up residence in a hotel, and soon everyone knows he has returned. He goes home to visit his dying mother, Irina, and prepares for the assassination, getting drawn back into the criminal community he left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80zDn3oanRMWDSDX1cPKZVIi8OO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47504'),
  ('122391209447416597', 'Little Old New York', 1923, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sidney Olcott, Ira H. Morgan, Gilbert Warrenton', 'Luther Reed', 'Marion Davies, Harrison Ford, Courtenay Foote, Mahlon Hamilton, Norval Keedwell, Louis Wolheim, J.M. Kerrigan, Harry Watson', 'NR', 'An Irish girl comes to America disguised as a boy to claim a fortune left to her brother who has died.', 'An Irish girl comes to America disguised as a boy to claim a fortune left to her brother who has died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nJDvyGCaIqxaw1fAAe0h9oo0A7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175693'),
  ('949597970407841260', 'Little Ones', 2023, 'Drama', 'Julie Lerat-Gersant, Nina Boussad, Maurice Hermet', 'Julie Lerat-Gersant, François Roy', 'Pili Groyne, Romane Bohringer, Victoire du Bois, Lauréna Thellier, Lucie Charles-Alfred, Suzanne Roy-Lerat, Bilel Chegrani, Shirel Nataf', null, 'Camille a 16 years old pregnant girl was placed in a maternal center by the Judge. She became friends with Alison, an immature young mother, and fought against the authority of Nadine, an educator as passionate as she was disillusioned.', 'Camille a 16 years old pregnant girl was placed in a maternal center by the Judge. She became friends with Alison, an immature young mother, and fought against the authority of Nadine, an educator as passionate as she was disillusioned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UceYcrYOFkqTaZKTKqq0cspLg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978024'),
  ('829508909291215353', 'Little Orphan Airedale', 1947, 'Animation', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Charlie Dog, looking for a good home and some easy living, thinks he''s found the perfect sap in Porky Pig. He tries to ingratiate himself with the pig, all the way avoiding Porky''s attempts to get rid of the dead-beat dog.', 'Charlie Dog, looking for a good home and some easy living, thinks he''s found the perfect sap in Porky Pig. He tries to ingratiate himself with the pig, all the way avoiding Porky''s attempts to get rid of the dead-beat dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TpZXOzzbnDdAhXaBIdyl49S0Ws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237089'),
  ('456366303986962700', 'Little Otik', 2001, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror, Animation', 'Jan Švankmajer, Juraj Galvánek, Martin Kublák', 'Jan Švankmajer', 'Veronika Žilková, Jan Hartl, Jaroslava Kretschmerová, Pavel Nový, Kristina Adamcová, Dagmar Stríbrná, Zdeněk Kozák, Gustav Vondráček', null, 'When a childless couple learn that they cannot have children, it causes great distress. To ease his wife''s pain, the man finds a piece of root in the backyard and chops it and varnishes it into the shape of a child. However the woman takes the root as her baby and starts to pretend that it is real.', 'When a childless couple learn that they cannot have children, it causes great distress. To ease his wife''s pain, the man finds a piece of root in the backyard and chops it and varnishes it into the shape of a child. However the woman takes the root as her baby and starts to pretend that it is real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86uoXmcgXKZQa35V1AsKVXY3NvX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18939'),
  ('65962084434669349', 'Little Pancho Vanilla', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Little Pancho Vanilla dreams of becoming a bullfighter, but his mother tells him that''s impossible. The greatest bullfighter in Mexico, Don Jose, is coming to town; Pancho tells the local women he''s better, so he goes to the amateur tryout, but he gets thrown out because he''s so small. The bull quickly disposes of the other amateurs, sending one over the fence, where he catapults Pancho into the ring right on top of the bull, knocking out the bull to great acclaim from the crowd.', 'Little Pancho Vanilla dreams of becoming a bullfighter, but his mother tells him that''s impossible. The greatest bullfighter in Mexico, Don Jose, is coming to town; Pancho tells the local women he''s better, so he goes to the amateur tryout, but he gets thrown out because he''s so small. The bull quickly disposes of the other amateurs, sending one over the fence, where he catapults Pancho into the ring right on top of the bull, knocking out the bull to great acclaim from the crowd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXw77LMZA9ZelO31h8yLfUgT0Ik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160611'),
  ('367367361230899519', 'Little Peach', 1958, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Masazumi Kawanishi, Masao Tamai', 'Mikio Naruse, Sumie Tanaka', 'Kyōko Kagawa, So Yamamura, Isao Kimura, Daisuke Katō, Keiju Kobayashi, Shizue Natsukawa, Hiroshi Tachikawa, Yū Fujiki', null, 'Anzukko (Little Peach) is the daughter of a successful writer. She turns down each one of her suitors, until she marries a beginning writer named Ryokichi. Their life quickly sinks into despair.', 'Anzukko (Little Peach) is the daughter of a successful writer. She turns down each one of her suitors, until she marries a beginning writer named Ryokichi. Their life quickly sinks into despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVTFaqiuW55thXEH8q06XF1B5rM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256777'),
  ('719305307317128570', 'Little Pioneers', 1968, 'Documentary', 'Želimir Žilnik', 'Želimir Žilnik', 'Piroška Čapko', null, 'Filmed in 1968, "Little Pioneers" examines the gap between socialist rhetoric and social reality by focusing on children excluded from state protection. Through close, unembellished observation, Želimir Žilnik documents young people living in slum conditions and surviving through informal and illegal means, using the film’s ironic title to underscore the contrast between official ideology and everyday life.', 'Filmed in 1968, "Little Pioneers" examines the gap between socialist rhetoric and social reality by focusing on children excluded from state protection. Through close, unembellished observation, Želimir Žilnik documents young people living in slum conditions and surviving through informal and illegal means, using the film’s ironic title to underscore the contrast between official ideology and everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpOrNZ0u6QaqaofJwfXyYu1DxIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341022'),
  ('981460680082804483', 'Little Q', 2019, 'Drama, Family', 'Chan Chi-Ying, Law Wing-Cheong', 'Susan Chan Suk-Yin, Alex Pao', 'Simon Yam, Gigi Leung Wing-Kei, Lo Chung-Him, Charlie Yeung Choi-Nei, Roger Kwok Chun-On, Frankie Lam, Pudding, JJ Jia', null, 'Little Q is an aspiring guide dog, training to be a guide for the blind. Soon Little Q is partnered with Bo-ting, a renowned pastry chef who’s losing his sight. But Bo-ting is irritable and reluctant, constantly losing his temper at those around him and rejecting Little Q. Eventually, dog and owner bond as Little Q wins Bo-ting over with its unwavering loyalty. However, as Little Q gets older and Bo-ting’s health suffers, the two of them face an unwilling separation...', 'Little Q is an aspiring guide dog, training to be a guide for the blind. Soon Little Q is partnered with Bo-ting, a renowned pastry chef who’s losing his sight. But Bo-ting is irritable and reluctant, constantly losing his temper at those around him and rejecting Little Q. Eventually, dog and owner bond as Little Q wins Bo-ting over with its unwavering loyalty. However, as Little Q gets older and Bo-ting’s health suffers, the two of them face an unwilling separation...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GayeewWQCSr3mzgquPRPTGhHBC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603772'),
  ('878899155501522479', 'Little Quacker', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Red Coffey, William Hanna', 'NR', 'Tom steals an egg from a mother duck''s nest, but soon the resultant hatchling runs away from the cat and into a mouse hole, where it finds an able protector in Jerry.', 'Tom steals an egg from a mother duck''s nest, but soon the resultant hatchling runs away from the cat and into a mouse hole, where it finds an able protector in Jerry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nxv7N1190tW4ksZYU4QZjAnIoT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72669'),
  ('665726764491924413', 'Little Red Flowers', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Zhang Yuan, Tao Yang, Miao Li', 'Zhang Yuan, Dai Ning', 'Bowen Dong, Ning Yuanyuan, Li Xinyun, Chen Manyuan, Rui Zhao', null, 'Qiang a rebellious 4-year-old is put in boarding school where he causes havoc by defying the teachers and principal who try to impose some discipline on him.', 'Qiang a rebellious 4-year-old is put in boarding school where he causes havoc by defying the teachers and principal who try to impose some discipline on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yg7AfgmCXmZIj1yjbXmi61mAdCf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36615'),
  ('622709015431143006', 'Little Red Riding Hood', 1922, 'Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Walt Disney', 'Charles Parrault, Walt Pfeiffer', null, null, 'Mother is making donuts: She throws up a circle of dough, and a cat shoots a hole in it. Later, he fishes them out of the oil with a fishing line; he eats one, and loses all 9 lives. Mother puts together a basket for Red to take to granny. Red uses her cart, which is pushed by her little dog; the cart gets a flat tire, and she inflates a donut to replace it. A wolf (a human lothario) drives by in a flivver, and dashes off to grandma''s house, where he finds a note saying she''s gone to the movies. He shrinks his car and stashes it in his pocket, then waits for Red, who stopped to watch a dancing flower. Red arrives, and they go into the house, where he attempts to have his way with her. The dog rushes off and gets help from an airplane pilot, who uses a skyhook to remove the house and, ultimately, lift the wolf in his car and drop him in the lake. Written by Jon Reeves', 'Mother is making donuts: She throws up a circle of dough, and a cat shoots a hole in it. Later, he fishes them out of the oil with a fishing line; he eats one, and loses all 9 lives. Mother puts together a basket for Red to take to granny. Red uses her cart, which is pushed by her little dog; the cart gets a flat tire, and she inflates a donut to replace it. A wolf (a human lothario) drives by in a flivver, and dashes off to grandma''s house, where he finds a note saying she''s gone to the movies. He shrinks his car and stashes it in his pocket, then waits for Red, who stopped to watch a dancing flower. Red arrives, and they go into the house, where he attempts to have his way with her. The dog rushes off and gets help from an airplane pilot, who uses a skyhook to remove the house and, ultimately, lift the wolf in his car and drop him in the lake. Written by Jon Reeves', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alrtrjbQGTfZp8T0V5jTNsDopqL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106109'),
  ('229904923410352807', 'Little Red Riding Hood', 1959, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy, Drama', 'Roberto Rodríguez, Sergio Guerrero, Mario Llorca', 'Fernando Morales Ortiz', 'María Gracia, Manuel Valdés, Prudencia Grifell, Eugenia Avendaño, Santanón, Irma Torres, Guillermo Álvarez Bianchi, Beatriz Aguirre', 'G', 'The classic story of the Red Riding Hood spiced up by a couple of funny characters like the dog Duke, companion to the girl in her adventures, and the stinky Skunk, henchman to the Wolf.', 'The classic story of the Red Riding Hood spiced up by a couple of funny characters like the dog Duke, companion to the girl in her adventures, and the stinky Skunk, henchman to the Wolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOy6ZhSTO1ZBM6rMOUNCCb085K7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290350'),
  ('165328131309234406', 'Little Red Riding Hood', 1962, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Helmut Bergmann, Götz Friedrich', 'Hans Rodenberg', 'Blanche Kommerell, Werner Dissel, Harald Engelmann, Helga Raumer, Horst Kube, Friedel Nowack, Jochen Bley, Ernst-Georg Schwill', null, 'Little Red Riding-Hood lives together with her parents in a house on the edge of the forest. Her friends are a bunny, a squirrel and a bear. The little girl is always prepared to help, friendly, innocent and even unsuspecting, for she does not hold anyone capable of doing anything bad. Little Red Riding-Hood often visits her grandmother who lives in the depths of the forest. But her way there is a dangerous one: the wolf and its lackey, the fox, terrorize everyone with their evil deeds. One day, Little Red Riding-Hood is caught in their net.', 'Little Red Riding-Hood lives together with her parents in a house on the edge of the forest. Her friends are a bunny, a squirrel and a bear. The little girl is always prepared to help, friendly, innocent and even unsuspecting, for she does not hold anyone capable of doing anything bad. Little Red Riding-Hood often visits her grandmother who lives in the depths of the forest. But her way there is a dangerous one: the wolf and its lackey, the fox, terrorize everyone with their evil deeds. One day, Little Red Riding-Hood is caught in their net.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BjM9t54oV5FxFP1ShcGEF6wf5j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5598'),
  ('704205415563365546', 'Little Red Riding Hood', 1995, 'Family, Animation', 'Toshiyuki Hiruma, Takashi Masunaga', 'Toshiyuki Hiruma, George Arthur Bloom', 'Andrea Libman, Terry Klassen, Ellen Kennedy, Jesse Moss', null, 'Little Red Riding Hood, named so because of the red riding hood she wears, loves her granny. She''s asked by her kind mother to take a basket of cakes and jam to her ill grandmother, who lives at the other side of the big woods.', 'Little Red Riding Hood, named so because of the red riding hood she wears, loves her granny. She''s asked by her kind mother to take a basket of cakes and jam to her ill grandmother, who lives at the other side of the big woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aILYBuiGnPZd3KwqDJpmzeQKMe2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186117'),
  ('575414221031088396', 'Little Red Riding Hood', 1997, 'Comedy', 'David Kaplan', 'David Kaplan', 'Christina Ricci, Timour Bourtasenkov, Evelyn Solann, Quentin Crisp', null, 'A black comedy version of the classic tale.', 'A black comedy version of the classic tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZ7WXlE0eN0cSBCQF1oKseNI0eo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44515'),
  ('784434309169240178', 'Little Red Riding Hood and Tom Thumb vs. the Monsters', 1962, 'Music, Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Roberto Rodríguez, Rosalío Solano', 'Fernando Morales Ortiz, Adolfo Torres Portillo', 'María Gracia, Cesáreo Quezadas ''Pulgarcito'', José Elías Moreno, Manuel Valdés, Santanón, Ofelia Guilmáin, Magda Donato', null, 'The film follows adventures of Little Red Riding Hood (Maria Gracia) and Tom Thumb (Cesaro Quezadas) and their friends, fighting against the wicked Witch Queen (Ofelia Guilmáin) and her band of monsters. The film starts at the meeting of the evil monsters in the castle in the Haunted Forest, heart of the Devil''s dominion, during which the Vampire (Quintín Bulnes) accuses the Wolf (Manuel Valdés) and the Ogre (José Elías Moreno) of betraying the Witch Queen (La Reina Bruja, renamed Queen of Badness in the English dub), who orders them to ber executed. Their friend Stinky the Skunk (Santanón) however escapes and informs Little Red Riding Hood and Tom Thumb, who promise to help. Meanwhile, the Queen and her sister the Old Witch cast a terrible curse, turning villagers into monkeys and mice for trying to defy her magic. The rest of the story details the heroes'' quest to conquer evil.', 'The film follows adventures of Little Red Riding Hood (Maria Gracia) and Tom Thumb (Cesaro Quezadas) and their friends, fighting against the wicked Witch Queen (Ofelia Guilmáin) and her band of monsters. The film starts at the meeting of the evil monsters in the castle in the Haunted Forest, heart of the Devil''s dominion, during which the Vampire (Quintín Bulnes) accuses the Wolf (Manuel Valdés) and the Ogre (José Elías Moreno) of betraying the Witch Queen (La Reina Bruja, renamed Queen of Badness in the English dub), who orders them to ber executed. Their friend Stinky the Skunk (Santanón) however escapes and informs Little Red Riding Hood and Tom Thumb, who promise to help. Meanwhile, the Queen and her sister the Old Witch cast a terrible curse, turning villagers into monkeys and mice for trying to defy her magic. The rest of the story details the heroes'' quest to conquer evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9ENYq9OWbPpKYLuei71no1A2Gc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108748'),
  ('1144876378248938001', 'Little Red Riding Rabbit', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'Bugs, the Wolf and bobby-soxer Red chase each other around while Grandma is off working at Lockheed aircraft.', 'Bugs, the Wolf and bobby-soxer Red chase each other around while Grandma is off working at Lockheed aircraft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2d8AwmEohMg6voQXL2cXPn2CiGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100318'),
  ('1046009370822246400', 'Little Red Riding Wolf', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Chus Gutiérrez', 'Marta González de Vega', 'Marta González de Vega, Berto Romero, Elena Irureta, José Mota, Antonio Resines, Santiago Segura, David Guapo, Martita de Graná', null, 'A wolf is a little hood that has learned to laugh at herself. And that is the greatest superpower that exists because when we convert to humor there is nothing that can harm us. A story that shows us that we are all pathetic in love but that learning to laugh at it automatically turns drama into comedy. And therefore Little Red Riding Hood as a wolf. The conversion process of Marta, our protagonist, will take her several years and several "uncles", from when she decides to become a wolf until she achieves it, because she will have to learn that laughter is not reached by avoiding the forest of drama but by going through it until the bottom. Submitting to the "oyster-essay" method, he will go through a lot of pathetic situations until he learns to abandon self-deception and face reality, discovering that laughter springs from drama and laughter springs... power.', 'A wolf is a little hood that has learned to laugh at herself. And that is the greatest superpower that exists because when we convert to humor there is nothing that can harm us. A story that shows us that we are all pathetic in love but that learning to laugh at it automatically turns drama into comedy. And therefore Little Red Riding Hood as a wolf. The conversion process of Marta, our protagonist, will take her several years and several "uncles", from when she decides to become a wolf until she achieves it, because she will have to learn that laughter is not reached by avoiding the forest of drama but by going through it until the bottom. Submitting to the "oyster-essay" method, he will go through a lot of pathetic situations until he learns to abandon self-deception and face reality, discovering that laughter springs from drama and laughter springs... power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKyDT9x6Cgx0e7kflbCOxlqIAaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1051800'),
  ('1032950508351099474', 'Little Red Rodent Hood', 1952, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'An elderly mouse tells the bedtime story of Little Red Riding Hood to her grandson, who visualizes the tale in cat-and-mouse terms, with himself as Red and Sylvester as the Big Bad Wolf.', 'An elderly mouse tells the bedtime story of Little Red Riding Hood to her grandson, who visualizes the tale in cat-and-mouse terms, with himself as Red and Sylvester as the Big Bad Wolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFbC6axAl6ezns7f5USQnkNh7kZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188751'),
  ('935098561974556137', 'Little Red Walking Hood', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Mel Blanc, Elvia Allman, Tedd Pierce', null, 'Red walks past a pool hall; the wolf sees her and pursues her, but, she is oblivious to his come-ons.', 'Red walks past a pool hall; the wolf sees her and pursues her, but, she is oblivious to his come-ons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFIJMiSh3wEuoYIlrGkiPib53c0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219551'),
  ('263964508007610067', 'Little Richard - I Am Everything', 2023, 'Documentary, Music', 'Lisa Cortés, Keith Walker, Graham Willoughby', null, 'Little Richard, John Waters, Mick Jagger, Billy Porter, Tom Jones, Paul McCartney, Nona Hendryx, Valerie June', 'R', 'The story of the black, gay origins of rock n'' roll. It explodes the whitewashed canon of American pop music to reveal the innovator – the originator – Richard Penniman. Through a wealth of archive and performance that brings us into Richard''s complicated inner world, the film unspools the icon''s life story with all its switchbacks and contradictions.', 'The story of the black, gay origins of rock n'' roll. It explodes the whitewashed canon of American pop music to reveal the innovator – the originator – Richard Penniman. Through a wealth of archive and performance that brings us into Richard''s complicated inner world, the film unspools the icon''s life story with all its switchbacks and contradictions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5u5kkH6ux1wHHJHLePAR1xMgSv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053718'),
  ('751706523919020708', 'Little Runaway', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, null, 'NR', 'A baby seal escapes from the circus and ends up in Jerry''s backyard pool. Tom finds out soon enough, and when the circus offers a $10,000 reward, his goal is clear.', 'A baby seal escapes from the circus and ends up in Jerry''s backyard pool. Tom finds out soon enough, and when the circus offers a $10,000 reward, his goal is clear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWSe94Bsvy6ty6XfumfIvOe3wG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72675'),
  ('1045643810960106759', 'Little Rural Riding Hood', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Daws Butler, Colleen Collins, Pinto Colvig, Imogene Lynn', 'NR', 'The last of Tex Avery''s variations on "Red Hot Riding Hood" (1943), in which the country wolf visits his city cousin, who tries to teach him the rudiments of civilized behavior when watching girls in nightclubs - without, it has to be said, a great deal of success...', 'The last of Tex Avery''s variations on "Red Hot Riding Hood" (1943), in which the country wolf visits his city cousin, who tries to teach him the rudiments of civilized behavior when watching girls in nightclubs - without, it has to be said, a great deal of success...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuExm7iQMS1IPik0wETt3wB9UYm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86730'),
  ('955330055437623246', 'Little Saints', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alejandro Springall', null, 'Dolores Heredia, Demián Bichir, Roberto Cobo, Ana Bertha Espín, Regina Orozco, Maya Zapata, Alberto Estrella, José Sefami', null, 'After St. Jude appears in Esperanza''s oven, she sets out to find her daughter, who died under mysterious circumstances. The journey forces Esperanza to challenge her own beliefs and face her fears in order to be reunited with her beloved daughter.', 'After St. Jude appears in Esperanza''s oven, she sets out to find her daughter, who died under mysterious circumstances. The journey forces Esperanza to challenge her own beliefs and face her fears in order to be reunited with her beloved daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPUqoCmGLwfDqiK9dVG2b8bzQMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46835'),
  ('971603709040124662', 'Little School Mouse', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, null, 'NR', 'Professor Jerry teaches a course in how to outwit cats, but his pupil seems to know more than Jerry.', 'Professor Jerry teaches a course in how to outwit cats, but his pupil seems to know more than Jerry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIHH1BbhEyXu8QvjHiMQuXBe7VX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72679'),
  ('11924186000159001', 'Little Secrets', 2002, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Blair Treu, Brian Sullivan', 'Jessica Barondes', 'Evan Rachel Wood, Michael Angarano, David Gallagher, Danielle Chuchran, Vivica A. Fox, Jan Broberg Felt, Rick Macy, Paul Kiernan', 'PG', 'Emily is a plucky preteen who is entrusted with her young neighbors'' most private and cherished secrets. Every Wednesday, Emily sets up a booth in her backyard that regularly attracts the guilty young souls of the neighborhood. These include Philip, whose clumsiness and his interest in Emily make him a challenging client. But complications ensue when she suddenly finds it difficult to keep all of her neighbors'' secrets to herself.', 'Emily is a plucky preteen who is entrusted with her young neighbors'' most private and cherished secrets. Every Wednesday, Emily sets up a booth in her backyard that regularly attracts the guilty young souls of the neighborhood. These include Philip, whose clumsiness and his interest in Emily make him a challenging client. But complications ensue when she suddenly finds it difficult to keep all of her neighbors'' secrets to herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dm2cljvMFrZZHwmWckhso2WkIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50573'),
  ('649370378719525503', 'Little Sharks', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Gernot Roll, Sönke Wortmann', 'Sönke Wortmann, Jürgen Egger', 'Jürgen Vogel, Kai Wiesinger, Gedeon Burkhard, Meret Becker, Armin Rohde, Michael Mendl, Katharina Abt, Michael Kessler', null, 'When dishwasher Ingo, whose girl-friend has just left him, returns a borrowed bar stool to the Folkwang Acting School in Essen, he stumbles into the audition for next year''s new students. He lets Johannes, the broke and unsuccessful applicant, stay with him. Ingo decides to go to Munich with Johannes, where he wants to try his luck once again. Hitchhiking, they get rides with very different drivers on the autobahn. They meet up with the smooth-talking Ali in the wayside dinner "Raststätte Spessart". Arriving in Munich, the trio tries to find cheap sleeping accommodation. They enter Ingo into the audition at Munich acting school. Moreover, Johannes falls in love with street artist Herta from Berlin. Written by emkarpf', 'When dishwasher Ingo, whose girl-friend has just left him, returns a borrowed bar stool to the Folkwang Acting School in Essen, he stumbles into the audition for next year''s new students. He lets Johannes, the broke and unsuccessful applicant, stay with him. Ingo decides to go to Munich with Johannes, where he wants to try his luck once again. Hitchhiking, they get rides with very different drivers on the autobahn. They meet up with the smooth-talking Ali in the wayside dinner "Raststätte Spessart". Arriving in Munich, the trio tries to find cheap sleeping accommodation. They enter Ingo into the audition at Munich acting school. Moreover, Johannes falls in love with street artist Herta from Berlin. Written by emkarpf', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHfoWOpIkaUrnLs5pfpVyQ6SMCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9617'),
  ('441457474932374604', 'Little Shop of Horrors', 1986, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Frank Oz, Robert Paynter, Bran Ferren', 'Roger Corman, Charles B. Griffith', 'Rick Moranis, Ellen Greene, Vincent Gardenia, Levi Stubbs, Steve Martin, Tichina Arnold, Michelle Weeks, Tisha Campbell', 'PG-13', 'Seymour Krelborn is a nerdy orphan working at Mushnik''s; a flower shop in urban Skid Row. He harbors a crush on fellow co-worker, Audrey Fulquard, and is berated by Mr. Mushnik daily. One day, Seymour finds a very mysterious unidentified plant which he calls Audrey II. The plant seems to have a craving for blood and soon begins to sing for it’s supper.', 'Seymour Krelborn is a nerdy orphan working at Mushnik''s; a flower shop in urban Skid Row. He harbors a crush on fellow co-worker, Audrey Fulquard, and is berated by Mr. Mushnik daily. One day, Seymour finds a very mysterious unidentified plant which he calls Audrey II. The plant seems to have a craving for blood and soon begins to sing for it’s supper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKkbN17OmFosaW6asCNZTTsyvpu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10776'),
  ('444978149655906949', 'Little Siberia', 2025, 'Comedy, Thriller, Drama', 'Dome Karukoski, Peter Flinckenberg', 'Dome Karukoski, Minna Panjanen', 'Eero Ritala, Malla Malmivaara, Tommi Korpela, Rune Temte, Martti Suosalo, Jenni Banerjee, Severi Saarinen, Teemu Aromaa', 'R', 'A pastor''s faith turns upside down when a meteorite lands in his small Finnish town, its impact stirring up chaos and criminal intentions.', 'A pastor''s faith turns upside down when a meteorite lands in his small Finnish town, its impact stirring up chaos and criminal intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQuoiOMbkjGw3rjGnyXFAVjVIBH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1362608'),
  ('272957440157493802', 'Little Sister', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Jimmy Zeilinger, Thomas Del Ruth', 'Jimmy Zeilinger', 'Alyssa Milano, Tia Carrere, Jonathan Silverman, George Newbern, Michele Matheson, Leilani Sarelle, Jesse Dabson, Christine Healy', null, 'Bobby is a college freshman and as part of a fraternity prank, he poses as Roberta and becomes pledged into a sorority. There he falls madly in love with Diana. As the game escalates, Bobby finds it increasingly hard to keep his twin identities separate...', 'Bobby is a college freshman and as part of a fraternity prank, he poses as Roberta and becomes pledged into a sorority. There he falls madly in love with Diana. As the game escalates, Bobby finds it increasingly hard to keep his twin identities separate...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLY94UGFGDnen5S3N8V4PpF9yK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282624'),
  ('1115577766309102885', 'Little Sister', 1995, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Robert Jan Westdijk, Bert Pot', 'Robert Jan Westdijk, Jos Driessen', 'Kim van Kooten, Romijn Conen, Hugo Metsers, Roeland Fernhout, Ganna Veenhuysen, Hannah Risselada, Michael Münninghoff, Herman Brood', null, 'After several years without contact, Martijn visits his sister Daantje, who just started to live on her own in Amsterdam. He tells her he is going to make a documentary from her life, and enters her home life with a video camera.', 'After several years without contact, Martijn visits his sister Daantje, who just started to live on her own in Amsterdam. He tells her he is going to make a documentary from her life, and enters her home life with a video camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfieSjmRZOfmwihLrTjHBgZlBDq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42746'),
  ('4008436458872958', 'Little Sister', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Zach Clark, Daryl Pittman', 'Zach Clark', 'Addison Timlin, Ally Sheedy, Keith Poulson, Peter Hedges, Barbara Crampton, Alex Karpovsky, Kristin Slaysman, Rhonda Hansome', 'NR', 'After returning to her childhood home, young nun Colleen finds her old room exactly how she left it: painted black and covered in goth and metal posters. Her parents are happy enough to see her, but her brother is living as a recluse in the guesthouse since returning home from the Iraq war.', 'After returning to her childhood home, young nun Colleen finds her old room exactly how she left it: painted black and covered in goth and metal posters. Her parents are happy enough to see her, but her brother is living as a recluse in the guesthouse since returning home from the Iraq war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsE4ApQf4by53uG7QOdypQRakp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381069'),
  ('744966202605562299', 'Little Solange', 2022, 'Drama', 'Axelle Ropert, Sébastien Buchmann, Julie Gouet', 'Axelle Ropert', 'Jade Springer, Léa Drucker, Philippe Katerine, Grégoire Montana-Haroche, Chloé Astor, Marthe Léon, Léo Ferreira, Benjamin Esdraffo', 'NR', 'A sensitive 13-year-old watches her parents’ marriage unravel and struggles to keep her family together, clinging to the impossible hope that love will never end.', 'A sensitive 13-year-old watches her parents’ marriage unravel and struggles to keep her family together, clinging to the impossible hope that love will never end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjJuATf3K68AEuEKaWLoZda6PVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749107'),
  ('969330312862432638', 'Little Spies', 1986, 'Adventure, Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Greg Beeman, Isidore Mankofsky', null, 'Mickey Rooney, Robert Costanzo, Peter Smith, Candace Cameron Bure, Adam Carl, Sean Hall, Jason Hervey, Sarah Jo Martin', 'PG', 'When a runaway stray dog is rescued by the local neighborhood kids, they discover a nearby gang is involved.', 'When a runaway stray dog is rescued by the local neighborhood kids, they discover a nearby gang is involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hU1I7KRrcgeMR9URJLn0bbtynV2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298948'),
  ('845866716635262895', 'Little Spirou', 2017, 'Comedy, Family', 'Nicolas Bary, Vincent Gallot', 'Laurent Turner, Nicolas Bary, Nicolas Bary', 'Sacha Pinault, Natacha Régnier, Pierre Richard, François Damiens, Philippe Katerine, Armelle, Gwendolyn Gourvenec, Lila Poulet-Berenfeld', null, 'Petit Spirou, like all his family before him, has a career destiny all traced. When his mother announces that he will integrate the bellhop school at the beginning of the new school year, Petit Spirou, with the help of his friends, will take advantage of his last days of class to declare his love to Suzette. And no matter how. They decide to live an extraordinary adventure.', 'Petit Spirou, like all his family before him, has a career destiny all traced. When his mother announces that he will integrate the bellhop school at the beginning of the new school year, Petit Spirou, with the help of his friends, will take advantage of his last days of class to declare his love to Suzette. And no matter how. They decide to live an extraordinary adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnofxR6iKomeHJIrKxWbeeBPaR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398947'),
  ('321074639511434094', 'Little Stabs at Happiness', 1963, null, 'Ken Jacobs', null, 'Jerry Sims, Jack Smith', null, 'Little Stabs at Happiness is a collection of silent shorts Jacobs shot from the period of 1959-1963. Jaunty tunes (and a somber reflection) accompany the footage.', 'Little Stabs at Happiness is a collection of silent shorts Jacobs shot from the period of 1959-1963. Jaunty tunes (and a somber reflection) accompany the footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/891nzgyomJYtaOMzAEHioEBlnC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145502'),
  ('693269699068965053', 'Little Stomper', 1964, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Fyodor Khitruk, Boris Kotov', 'Fyodor Khitruk', 'Elena Ponsova', null, 'A bear cub who has trouble sleeping during winter sneaks out of the house and makes a new friend.', 'A bear cub who has trouble sleeping during winter sneaks out of the house and makes a new friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eKZJ11fA9eGNwx7WJr1K99tZNT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77559'),
  ('193492801061563570', 'Little Swee''pea', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer, Seymour Kneitel', null, 'Jack Mercer, Mae Questel, Gus Wicke', null, 'Popeye takes Swee''pea to the zoo and spends most of his time rescuing the tot from the various animals.', 'Popeye takes Swee''pea to the zoo and spends most of his time rescuing the tot from the various animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91KEZDwTWTumEws6ME5ZL19ibfi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201984'),
  ('891461007432058013', 'Little Tailor', 2010, 'Romance, Drama', 'Louis Garrel, Léo Hinstin', 'Louis Garrel', 'Arthur Igual, Léa Seydoux, Albert Igual, Sylvain Creuzevault, Lolita Chammah, Evelyne Lequesne, Laurent Laffargue, Gilbert Beugniot', null, 'Arthur is twenty five years old, he is an apprentice tailor in Albert''s workshop, Albert is eighty. Albert loves Arthur as his son, who returns these feelings, he will soon retire. He chose Arthur as his successor. But one evening, Arthur is taken to the theater by his friend Sylvain. He falls deeply in love with Marie-Julie, the main actress of the play.', 'Arthur is twenty five years old, he is an apprentice tailor in Albert''s workshop, Albert is eighty. Albert loves Arthur as his son, who returns these feelings, he will soon retire. He chose Arthur as his successor. But one evening, Arthur is taken to the theater by his friend Sylvain. He falls deeply in love with Marie-Julie, the main actress of the play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sxxcdJB0zUzLa6hYJOqUMvSdsL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152961'),
  ('183289878788716092', 'Little Thirteen', 2012, 'Drama', 'Christian Klandt, Andreas Hartmann', 'Catrin Lüth', 'Muriel Wimmer, Antonia Putiloff, Isabell Gerschke, Joseph Bundschuh, Philipp Kubitza, Gerdy Zint, Gisa Flake, Chiron Elias Krase', null, 'The everyday lives of teenagers, coming from various social backgrounds. For them, sexuality has become a substitute for love, resulting from emotional neglect.', 'The everyday lives of teenagers, coming from various social backgrounds. For them, sexuality has become a substitute for love, resulting from emotional neglect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8soOp2XFbOyeFybl6pghZjXJXw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138735'),
  ('560564017584709959', 'Little Tich and His Funny Feet', 1900, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Harry Relph', null, '"This funny individual will make you laugh until your sides ache. He is funny in all his actions, yet when he puts on his shoes you can imagine the noise he can make when he dances an ordinary clog. The shoes referred to are made of some elastic material which enables Little Tich to bow almost to the floor without bending his legs, the spring in the shoes carrying him down and up again. He places his hat on the floor and, leaning over on the toes of his wonderful shoes, dips his head into the hat and comes up without having to move from the spot or to bend his legs. He is a comical looking sight at best, being made up to suit the part, and he will make you laugh whether you want to or not."', '"This funny individual will make you laugh until your sides ache. He is funny in all his actions, yet when he puts on his shoes you can imagine the noise he can make when he dances an ordinary clog. The shoes referred to are made of some elastic material which enables Little Tich to bow almost to the floor without bending his legs, the spring in the shoes carrying him down and up again. He places his hat on the floor and, leaning over on the toes of his wonderful shoes, dips his head into the hat and comes up without having to move from the spot or to bend his legs. He is a comical looking sight at best, being made up to suit the part, and he will make you laugh whether you want to or not."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nffY22GR3Y2L5peXlVLokD6xg9e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221880'),
  ('451305538386469195', 'Little Tickles', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pierre Aïm, Eric Métayer, Andréa Bescond', 'Andréa Bescond, Eric Métayer', 'Andréa Bescond, Karin Viard, Clovis Cornillac, Pierre Deladonchamps, Grégory Montel, Carole Franck, Gringe, Ariane Ascaride', null, 'Odette is a 8-yr-old girl who loves to dance and draw. Once she has become an adult, Odette realizes she was abused, and immerses herself body and soul in her career as a dancer while trying to deal with her past.', 'Odette is a 8-yr-old girl who loves to dance and draw. Once she has become an adult, Odette realizes she was abused, and immerses herself body and soul in her career as a dancer while trying to deal with her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDEbvbal7kmap5oxyekJ05EsNdi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484747'),
  ('1100745736760321894', 'Little Tito and the Aliens', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Gianluca Mazzella, Roberto Forza, Michele Iorio', 'Massimo Gaudioso, Laura Lamanda', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Clémence Poésy, Luca Esposito, Chiara Stella, Miguel Herrera, John Keogh, Gianfelice Imparato, Natalie Spencer', null, 'Professor Biondi is a depressed scientist. After his wife''s death, he lives isolated from the world in the Nevada desert, near Area 51. He supposedly works on a top-secret project for the US government, but in actuality, he spends his days on the couch, listening to the sound of the Universe. His only contact with the outside world is Stella, who organizes alien-themed weddings for tourists on the prowl for extra-terrestrials. One day the Professor receives a message from Naples: his dying brother is entrusting him with his two children, so that they may live with him in America.', 'Professor Biondi is a depressed scientist. After his wife''s death, he lives isolated from the world in the Nevada desert, near Area 51. He supposedly works on a top-secret project for the US government, but in actuality, he spends his days on the couch, listening to the sound of the Universe. His only contact with the outside world is Stella, who organizes alien-themed weddings for tourists on the prowl for extra-terrestrials. One day the Professor receives a message from Naples: his dying brother is entrusting him with his two children, so that they may live with him in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjqGlVG8tvtuZkZvvHNprdgCB1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485346'),
  ('1023698600510404271', 'Little Tony', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alex van Warmerdam', 'Alex van Warmerdam', 'Alex van Warmerdam, Annet Malherbe, Ariane Schluter, Sebastiaan te Wierik', null, 'Married to an illiterate Dutch farmer, Keet yearns for a child. She sets matters on course by arranging for a smart city girl, Lena, to live in and teach the slow-witted Brand. She encourages the developing affair between them, accepting secondary status in the household when Lena has a child. But her plans to eliminate the competition demand decisive action from Brand.', 'Married to an illiterate Dutch farmer, Keet yearns for a child. She sets matters on course by arranging for a smart city girl, Lena, to live in and teach the slow-witted Brand. She encourages the developing affair between them, accepting secondary status in the household when Lena has a child. But her plans to eliminate the competition demand decisive action from Brand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlOaddRXFM4UM1u3C0iAzfacJ4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74464'),
  ('43746698845346338', 'Little Tough Guy', 1938, 'Crime, Drama', 'Harold Young', 'Gilson Brown, Brenda Weisberg', 'Robert Wilcox, Helen Parrish, Marjorie Main, Jackie Searl, Peggy Stewart, Helen MacKellar, Edward Pawley, Olin Howland', 'NR', 'The son of a man sentenced to death for a murder he didn''t commit vows to become a criminal himself. He starts his own street gang, and their crime spree is financed by a mysterious young man--who turns out to be the son of the District Attorney who sent the boy''s father to the electric chair.', 'The son of a man sentenced to death for a murder he didn''t commit vows to become a criminal himself. He starts his own street gang, and their crime spree is financed by a mysterious young man--who turns out to be the son of the District Attorney who sent the boy''s father to the electric chair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kR9I0AsTUG6GJO3IZUfPkLUooaq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187581'),
  ('21668986204112784', 'Little Toys', 1933, 'Drama', 'Sun Yu, Ke Zhou', 'Sun Yu', 'Ruan Lingyu, Li Lili, Congmei Yuan, Peng Luo, Tianxiu Tang, Jiqun Liu, Han Lan-Gen, Zhenyu Miao', null, 'Sister Ye lives in a rural village, where everyone makes traditional toys. When Sister Ye''s husband dies of an unknown illness, and while Ye is attending to him, her son is kidnapped and sold to a wealthy lady in the city of Shanghai. Shortly after, the village is destroyed during an attack between rival warlords, forcing the villagers move to the city, where they continue to make toys. Ten years pass, and Ye''s daughter Zhu''er has become a toy designer. While helping the Nationalist army at the rear, Zhu''er is killed in an attack by the Japanese. On New Year''s Eve, Sister Ye is dressed in rags, sitting on the curb, selling toys. A young boy buys toys from her, and it is none other than her son, whom she does not recognize.', 'Sister Ye lives in a rural village, where everyone makes traditional toys. When Sister Ye''s husband dies of an unknown illness, and while Ye is attending to him, her son is kidnapped and sold to a wealthy lady in the city of Shanghai. Shortly after, the village is destroyed during an attack between rival warlords, forcing the villagers move to the city, where they continue to make toys. Ten years pass, and Ye''s daughter Zhu''er has become a toy designer. While helping the Nationalist army at the rear, Zhu''er is killed in an attack by the Japanese. On New Year''s Eve, Sister Ye is dressed in rags, sitting on the curb, selling toys. A young boy buys toys from her, and it is none other than her son, whom she does not recognize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGIFDrKJ7W772cRGzdCU8GAgo49.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141906'),
  ('453890426149647467', 'Little Tragedies', 1980, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mikhail Agranovich, Mikhail Shveitser', 'Mikhail Shveitser', 'Georgi Taratorkin, Sergei Yursky, Valeriy Zolotukhin, Leonid Kuravlyov, Nikolay Burlyaev, Natalya Belokhvostikova, Vladimir Vysotsky, Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy', null, 'Based on Pushkin''s "Little Tragedies" ("The Miserly Knight", "Mozart and Salieri", "The Stone Guest", "A Feast in the Time of Plague").', 'Based on Pushkin''s "Little Tragedies" ("The Miserly Knight", "Mozart and Salieri", "The Stone Guest", "A Feast in the Time of Plague").', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqM7QCpZ9PmYLDzfXMYpx80gTiG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139579'),
  ('194770632720967762', 'Little Trapeze Angels', 1959, null, 'Agustín P. Delgado', null, 'Gaspar Henaine, Marco Antonio Campos, Anabel Gutiérrez, Maricruz Olivier, Cesáreo Quezadas ''Pulgarcito'', Arturo Castro ''Bigotón''', null, 'Comics Viruta and Capulina as circus performers.', 'Comics Viruta and Capulina as circus performers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdSECPb9E0IY9GqXATIRqw0PFWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365322'),
  ('385250957452941294', 'Little Vampire', 1968, 'Drama', 'Roland Klick, Robert van Ackeren', 'Roland Klick', 'Alexander Kekulé, Sieghardt Rupp, Edith Volkmann, Renate Roland, Jürgen Jung, Hubert Suschka, Elisabeth Ackermann, Ulrich Beiger', null, 'In a german suburb a babysitter is too busy with her own teenage business and leaves a boy with his little sister alone. Then the girl is missing. The only way the family and society are able to deal with the horror is to ignore it and hide the truth in the closet.', 'In a german suburb a babysitter is too busy with her own teenage business and leaves a boy with his little sister alone. Then the girl is missing. The only way the family and society are able to deal with the horror is to ignore it and hide the truth in the closet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiPbUXGkHdgpLAfmWAchjO85z98.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118395'),
  ('1019353528393048494', 'Little Vampire', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Joann Sfar, Adrien Gromelle', 'Sandrina Jardel, Joann Sfar', 'Louise Lacoste, Camille Cottin, Alex Lutz, Jean-Paul Rouve, Claire de la Rüe du Can, Quentin Faure, Joann Sfar, Ricardo Lo Giudice', null, 'Little Vampire lives in a haunted house with a merry group of monsters, but he is bored stiff! One night, he secretly sneaks out of the manor along with his trusted bulldog, Phantomato, on a quest to find some new friends.', 'Little Vampire lives in a haunted house with a merry group of monsters, but he is bored stiff! One night, he secretly sneaks out of the manor along with his trusted bulldog, Phantomato, on a quest to find some new friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLd9FVJTwnPO3ERv82ea5IZo6Hl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589972'),
  ('408178695312927878', 'Little Vera', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Vasili Pichul, A. Kuptsova, Oleg Sorokin', 'Mariya Khmelik', 'Natalya Negoda, Andrey Sokolov, Yuriy Nazarov, Lyudmila Zaytseva, Aleksandr Negreba, Aleksandra Tabakova, Andrey Fomin, Aleksandr Mironov', null, 'Vera is a troubled teenager fresh out of school feeling trapped in her provincial port town during the turbulent times of perestroika. Her days and nights are filled with drinking, sex, and family dysfunction.', 'Vera is a troubled teenager fresh out of school feeling trapped in her provincial port town during the turbulent times of perestroika. Her days and nights are filled with drinking, sex, and family dysfunction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9QbLsoNCga9cZHr4B6UDJXukVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41961'),
  ('451359511254368558', 'Little Voice', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Mark Herman, Andy Collins, Jo Graysmark', 'Jim Cartwright', 'Brenda Blethyn, Michael Caine, Ewan McGregor, Jane Horrocks, Jim Broadbent, Annette Badland, Philip Jackson, Adam Fogerty', null, 'After the death of her father, Little Voice or LV becomes a virtual recluse, never going out and hardly ever saying a word. She just sits in her bedroom listening to her father''s collection of old records of Shirley Bassey, Marilyn Monroe and various other famous female singers. But at night time, LV sings, imitating these great singers with surprising accuracy. One night she is overheard by one of her mother''s boyfriends, who happens to be a talent agent. He manages to convince her that her talent is special and arranges for her to perform at the local night club, but several problems arise.', 'After the death of her father, Little Voice or LV becomes a virtual recluse, never going out and hardly ever saying a word. She just sits in her bedroom listening to her father''s collection of old records of Shirley Bassey, Marilyn Monroe and various other famous female singers. But at night time, LV sings, imitating these great singers with surprising accuracy. One night she is overheard by one of her mother''s boyfriends, who happens to be a talent agent. He manages to convince her that her talent is special and arranges for her to perform at the local night club, but several problems arise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VxdMxSa3BEAvGl5nLvsgpBwrZH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8545'),
  ('503084231692896662', 'Little White Dove', 1992, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Raúl Ruiz, Sergio Trabucco, Silvio Caiozzi', 'Raúl Ruiz', 'Beatriz Lapido, Rodrigo Ureta, Mónica Echeverría, Luis Alarcón, Marcial Edwards, Bélgica Castro, Felisa González, Rodrigo Maturana', null, 'A young working class girl falls in love with an upper class boy who is part of the plot to assassinate General Schneider, head of the Chilean Army. The film was shot in 1973 over six weeks with a budget of $170,000. As a result of the 1973 Chilean coup d''état and military dictatorship (1973–1990), the film was presumed lost for many years and not released until 1992.', 'A young working class girl falls in love with an upper class boy who is part of the plot to assassinate General Schneider, head of the Chilean Army. The film was shot in 1973 over six weeks with a budget of $170,000. As a result of the 1973 Chilean coup d''état and military dictatorship (1973–1990), the film was presumed lost for many years and not released until 1992.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWwwtXoKFRq9Bky6fnbo2MIfNRH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238268'),
  ('445369118037633726', 'Little White Lie', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Tomás Alzamora Muñoz, Pablo Calisto, Gabriela Sobarzo', 'Tomás Alzamora Muñoz', 'Rodrigo Salinas, Catalina Saavedra, Ernesto Meléndez, Daniel Antivilo, Jonas Sanche, Daniel Candia, Alejandra Yañez', null, 'A small-town journalist in southern Chile realizes he just run out of good news so that he starts making gossips and fake stories in order to keep his job in the local newspaper he works for.', 'A small-town journalist in southern Chile realizes he just run out of good news so that he starts making gossips and fake stories in order to keep his job in the local newspaper he works for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odaMKuCirLucPXPc7srGLSrjrJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464043'),
  ('480473619796103880', 'Little White Lies', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Guillaume Canet, Christophe Offenstein', 'Guillaume Canet', 'François Cluzet, Marion Cotillard, Benoît Magimel, Gilles Lellouche, Jean Dujardin, Valérie Bonneton, Joël Dupuch, Laurent Lafitte', null, 'Despite a traumatic event, a group of friends decide to go ahead with their annual beach vacation. Their relationships, convictions, sense of guilt and friendship are sorely tested. They are finally forced to own up to the little white lies they''ve been telling each other.', 'Despite a traumatic event, a group of friends decide to go ahead with their annual beach vacation. Their relationships, convictions, sense of guilt and friendship are sorely tested. They are finally forced to own up to the little white lies they''ve been telling each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djypJtQfUxeEMh6kc0aRzIoN9UR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48034'),
  ('761491188575898774', 'Little White Lies 2', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Guillaume Canet, Christophe Offenstein', 'Guillaume Canet, Rodolphe Lauga', 'François Cluzet, Marion Cotillard, Gilles Lellouche, Laurent Lafitte, Benoît Magimel, Pascale Arbillot, Valérie Bonneton, José Garcia', null, 'The sequel to Little White Lies ("Les petits mouchoirs"), set 7 years later. The group of friends, which had separated, reunites for the surprise birthday party organized for Max.', 'The sequel to Little White Lies ("Les petits mouchoirs"), set 7 years later. The group of friends, which had separated, reunites for the surprise birthday party organized for Max.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xS1863lQOAS3EkkEWkFENMI6bdY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542830'),
  ('831250660677298727', 'Little Wing', 2024, 'Drama', 'Dean Israelite, Devan Linforth, Jeff Cutter', 'John Gatins', 'Brooklynn Prince, Che Tafari, Brian Cox, Kelly Reilly, Simon Khan, Trinity Jo-Li Bliss, Melanie Nicholls-King, Jeanine Jackson', 'PG-13', 'For 13-year-old Kaitlyn, her world threatens to collapse when she learns that her parents want to get a divorce, especially because it threatens the loss of the house they shared in Portland, which had always been Kaitlyn''s home. The teenage girl has dark thoughts and lost interest in life. The breeding pigeons given to her by her mother''s police colleague don''t make things any better. What should she do with the birds? Then her best friend Adam gives her an idea: they could steal the very valuable racing pigeon named Granger from the local breeder Jaan Vari, sell it and use the proceeds to pay off the mortgage on her family''s home. The plan initially works, but then everything seems to go wrong and Kaitlyn loses her footing even more. But surprisingly, the old man who was robbed takes care of the girl and a bond develops between the two, which ultimately leads her to a new outlook on life.', 'For 13-year-old Kaitlyn, her world threatens to collapse when she learns that her parents want to get a divorce, especially because it threatens the loss of the house they shared in Portland, which had always been Kaitlyn''s home. The teenage girl has dark thoughts and lost interest in life. The breeding pigeons given to her by her mother''s police colleague don''t make things any better. What should she do with the birds? Then her best friend Adam gives her an idea: they could steal the very valuable racing pigeon named Granger from the local breeder Jaan Vari, sell it and use the proceeds to pay off the mortgage on her family''s home. The plan initially works, but then everything seems to go wrong and Kaitlyn loses her footing even more. But surprisingly, the old man who was robbed takes care of the girl and a bond develops between the two, which ultimately leads her to a new outlook on life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEMc5IK3rkAtKCMhzBe3CX2Wpds.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1170000'),
  ('166348976816028243', 'Little Witch Academia', 2013, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Yoh Yoshinari, Yoh Yoshinari, Toyonori Yamada', 'Masahiko Otsuka', 'Megumi Han, Fumiko Orikasa, Michiyo Murase, Yoko Hikasa, Noriko Hidaka, Chinatsu Akasaki, Eri Nakao, Hisako Kyoda', null, 'Inspired by a magician named Shiny Chariot, the lively Akko Kagari enters the Little Witch Academy with the dream of one day becoming as cool as her idol.', 'Inspired by a magician named Shiny Chariot, the lively Akko Kagari enters the Little Witch Academy with the dream of one day becoming as cool as her idol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVVNRF8bX48vrWAVUoCzDBBbhuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182131'),
  ('43693887843182190', 'Little Witch Academia: The Enchanted Parade', 2015, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Yoh Yoshinari, Jun Watanabe, Yoh Yoshinari', 'Michiru Shimada', 'Megumi Han, Fumiko Orikasa, Michiyo Murase, Yoko Hikasa, Noriko Hidaka, Arisa Shida, Rie Murakawa, Reina Ueda', null, 'In Enchanted Parade, Akko, Lotte and Sucy, having gotten in trouble yet again, are forced to team up with three other troublemakers; Amanda O''Neill, Constance Braunschweig Albrechtsburger and Jasmineka Antonenko, and must make an annual witch parade a success or else face expulsion.', 'In Enchanted Parade, Akko, Lotte and Sucy, having gotten in trouble yet again, are forced to team up with three other troublemakers; Amanda O''Neill, Constance Braunschweig Albrechtsburger and Jasmineka Antonenko, and must make an annual witch parade a success or else face expulsion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubsZEiUtegc8dfVTsFQc9nvpHSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347413'),
  ('23354588642275644', 'Little Witches', 1996, 'Drama, Horror', 'Ron Turowski, Jane Simpson, Todd Grodnick', 'Brian DiMuccio, Dino Vindeni', 'Mimi Rose, Sheeri Rappaport, Zelda Rubinstein, Jack Nance, Eric Pierpoint, Zoe Alexander, Clea DuVall, Tommy Stork', 'R', 'When an ancient book of spells transforms 6 naughty Catholic school girls into a sexy coven of witches, all hell breaks loose. Witness the evil craft of Little Witches as the execute their devilish deeds.', 'When an ancient book of spells transforms 6 naughty Catholic school girls into a sexy coven of witches, all hell breaks loose. Witness the evil craft of Little Witches as the execute their devilish deeds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX8gPqlnhJYGtMwQ3IeLk5ffJ8r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33990'),
