  ('486255997823188466', 'Live Is Life', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Wolfgang Murnberger', 'Uli Brée', 'Jan Josef Liefers, Ursula Strauss, Bibiana Zeller, Joachim Fuchsberger, Hans-Michael Rehberg, Libgart Schwarz, Petra Morzé, Michael Schönborn', null, 'A greater-Vienna seniors'' home is run like a prison by the stuck-up female executive and staff. Hippie-type rebel Rochus ''Rocco'' Siwak incurs a community service to be spent there as orderly. Sympathizing with seniors who still aspire to some dignity and self-realization, he helps them get around the rules, such as smuggling in contraband, and ends up inspiring them to form a rock band and enter a free podium competition. But it doesn''t square with his own last shot as band guitarist.—KGF Vissers', 'A greater-Vienna seniors'' home is run like a prison by the stuck-up female executive and staff. Hippie-type rebel Rochus ''Rocco'' Siwak incurs a community service to be spent there as orderly. Sympathizing with seniors who still aspire to some dignity and self-realization, he helps them get around the rules, such as smuggling in contraband, and ends up inspiring them to form a rock band and enter a free podium competition. But it doesn''t square with his own last shot as band guitarist.—KGF Vissers', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsQV1efLygYtI595B2uKpXj4LMD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90499'),
