  ('769470599292192686', 'Living', 2022, 'Drama', 'Jamie D. Ramsay, Georgina Devine, Adam Marshall', 'Akira Kurosawa, Shinobu Hashimoto, Hideo Oguni', 'Bill Nighy, Aimee Lou Wood, Alex Sharp, Tom Burke, Adrian Rawlins, Oliver Chris, Hubert Burton, Zoe Boyle', 'PG-13', 'London, 1953. Mr. Williams, a veteran civil servant, is an important cog within the city''s bureaucracy as it struggles to rebuild in the aftermath of World War II. Buried under paperwork at the office and lonely at home, his life has long felt empty and meaningless. Then a devastating medical diagnosis forces him to take stock, and to try and grasp some fulfilment before it passes permanently beyond reach.', 'London, 1953. Mr. Williams, a veteran civil servant, is an important cog within the city''s bureaucracy as it struggles to rebuild in the aftermath of World War II. Buried under paperwork at the office and lonely at home, his life has long felt empty and meaningless. Then a devastating medical diagnosis forces him to take stock, and to try and grasp some fulfilment before it passes permanently beyond reach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUJcp0rpUqp2GSk7t9jvAiZsXtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760099'),
  ('1005835890968369967', 'Living & Dying', 2007, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jon Keeyes, Samy Inayeh', 'Jon Keeyes', 'Edward Furlong, Bai Ling, Arnold Vosloo, Yelda Reynaud, Michael Madsen, Curtis Wayne, Trent Haaga, Jordana Spiro', 'R', 'Four desperate bank robbers are forced to abandon their lucrative heist plans and become the reluctant heroes when two of their hostages turn out to be psychotic killers who won''t stop until everyone in the bank has been ruthlessly slaughtered. As the police surround the building and the killers begin methodically executing the hostages.', 'Four desperate bank robbers are forced to abandon their lucrative heist plans and become the reluctant heroes when two of their hostages turn out to be psychotic killers who won''t stop until everyone in the bank has been ruthlessly slaughtered. As the police surround the building and the killers begin methodically executing the hostages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6fnlbV9jeNbwBvGJsmW3ZGFug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17954'),
  ('157586715020616310', 'Living and Knowing You Are Alive', 2019, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Alain Cavalier', 'Emmanuèle Bernheim, Alain Cavalier', 'Emmanuèle Bernheim, Teymour Al Attar, Jean-Louis Faure, Saïd Shayestehkia, Alexandre Badaoui, Alain Cavalier', null, 'Novelist and screenwriter Emmanuèle Bernheim and filmmaker Alain Cavalier have been friends for 30 years. They are preparing a film based on the former’s autobiography, “Tout s’est bien passé” (Everything Went Fine). In it, she tells how her father asked her to “end it” in the wake of a heart attack. Cavalier suggests that she plays herself, and that he plays her father. One winter morning, Emmanuèle calls Alain; they will have to postpone the shoot until the spring, as she needs an urgent operation.', 'Novelist and screenwriter Emmanuèle Bernheim and filmmaker Alain Cavalier have been friends for 30 years. They are preparing a film based on the former’s autobiography, “Tout s’est bien passé” (Everything Went Fine). In it, she tells how her father asked her to “end it” in the wake of a heart attack. Cavalier suggests that she plays herself, and that he plays her father. One winter morning, Emmanuèle calls Alain; they will have to postpone the shoot until the spring, as she needs an urgent operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CpMf6ofjaN8aRwhHgkLbJ21FwM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584256'),
  ('1064704995428021760', 'Living and Loving', 1980, 'Drama', 'Cheng-ying Lai', 'Kao Kuang-te, Cho Hsin-chen', 'Barbara Wang, Chang Kuo-Chu, Fu Lei, Liu Yin-Shang, Ma Chi-Chun, Viola Ku, Liu Ching-min', null, 'A stormy night, Chou Hung Yieh, a dress designer, saved a pregnant woman on the road. When he went to search for a doctor, he lost his life in a car accident. The woman soon gave birth to a baby girl, Ting Ting. Then she vanished leaving the baby to Chou''s wife, Tang Ching Ju...', 'A stormy night, Chou Hung Yieh, a dress designer, saved a pregnant woman on the road. When he went to search for a doctor, he lost his life in a car accident. The woman soon gave birth to a baby girl, Ting Ting. Then she vanished leaving the baby to Chou''s wife, Tang Ching Ju...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9Z3k0JcMajRh93ILHkVQJRzbfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393820'),
  ('32328956847214008', 'Living Dangerously', 1987, 'Drama, War, History, Romance', 'Fernando Pérez', 'Jesús Díaz', 'Luis Alberto García, Isabel Cristina Santos Téllez, Miguel Gutiérrez, Susana Pérez, Francisco Fonseca, Rolando Tarajano, Pedro Fernández, Eduardo Ricardo', null, 'In 1950s Havana, a romance blooms between two young revolutionaries whose clandestine printing press publishes pamphlets meant to stir up rebellion against the dictatorship of Fulgencio Batista. As their popularity grows, so, too, does their revolutionary zeal and their desire to mobilize other urban guerilla units.', 'In 1950s Havana, a romance blooms between two young revolutionaries whose clandestine printing press publishes pamphlets meant to stir up rebellion against the dictatorship of Fulgencio Batista. As their popularity grows, so, too, does their revolutionary zeal and their desire to mobilize other urban guerilla units.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TIIlDmHTtW11jy5ssaGNnNQr4Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312030'),
  ('385256446302640755', 'Living Death', 2006, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Erin Berry', 'Leo Scherman', 'Greg Bryk, Kristy Swanson, Joshua Peace, Kelsey Matheson, Neil Foster, Marc Hickox, Vik Sahay', 'NR', 'Torture is the ultimate seduction when Victor, a powerful and dangerous millionaire, discovers that his beautiful wife Elizabeth (Kristy Swanson) is having a steamy affair with his best friend. And when the lovers'' risky plan to get rid of him backfires, Victor''s relentless anger and terrifying rage sends him over the edge on a shockingly sadistic quest for total revenge.', 'Torture is the ultimate seduction when Victor, a powerful and dangerous millionaire, discovers that his beautiful wife Elizabeth (Kristy Swanson) is having a steamy affair with his best friend. And when the lovers'' risky plan to get rid of him backfires, Victor''s relentless anger and terrifying rage sends him over the edge on a shockingly sadistic quest for total revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OxSFjIOONJTHh5r7zMd4bS2QSE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48587'),
  ('963490702160956595', 'Living Doll', 1990, 'Horror', 'Colin Munn, George Dugdale, Peter Mackenzie Litten', 'George Dugdale, Mark Ezra', 'Mark Jax, Katie Orgill, Eartha Kitt, Gary Martin, Freddie Earlle, Alison Jenkins, Heather Robbins, Sean Aita', null, 'Howard, a shy morgue worker, falls in love with a girl who ends up in the morgue, but he doesn''t let that stop him. Howard has a secret - he is in love with Christine. There''s only one problem, Christine is DEAD! A grave was no place for Christine, the only place for her was at Howard''s side. At last she was his, his to dress, his to feed and to care for.', 'Howard, a shy morgue worker, falls in love with a girl who ends up in the morgue, but he doesn''t let that stop him. Howard has a secret - he is in love with Christine. There''s only one problem, Christine is DEAD! A grave was no place for Christine, the only place for her was at Howard''s side. At last she was his, his to dress, his to feed and to care for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5trPs5TihkN3JYWS8g4cmaMtaJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67730'),
  ('64447182891269212', 'Living Hell', 2008, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Richard Jefferies', null, 'Johnathon Schaech, Erica Leerhsen, James McDaniel, Jason Wiles, Terence Jay, Joshua Rollins', 'R', 'In a top secret Cold War military project an unstoppable, malignant organism who feeds on light and energy is unleashed threatening to destroy everything in its path.', 'In a top secret Cold War military project an unstoppable, malignant organism who feeds on light and energy is unleashed threatening to destroy everything in its path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9wvCa5ycdK24GOHrGRxrq2tUyk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14192'),
  ('1097769859160413189', 'Living in a Reversed World', 1958, 'Documentary', 'Theodor Wrismann, Ivo Kohler', null, 'James J. Gibson', null, 'Fascinating -- and unintentionally funny -- experiments at Austria''s famed Institute for Experimental Psychology involve a subject who for several weeks wears special glasses that reverse right and left and up and down. Unexpectedly, these macabre and somehow surrealist experiments reveal that our perception of these aspects of vision is not of an optical nature and cannot be relied on, while the unfortunate, Kafkaesque subject stubbornly struggles through a morass of continuous failures.', 'Fascinating -- and unintentionally funny -- experiments at Austria''s famed Institute for Experimental Psychology involve a subject who for several weeks wears special glasses that reverse right and left and up and down. Unexpectedly, these macabre and somehow surrealist experiments reveal that our perception of these aspects of vision is not of an optical nature and cannot be relied on, while the unfortunate, Kafkaesque subject stubbornly struggles through a morass of continuous failures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHj5OJYCDorlJTZu7JAWkEyYrkg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247345'),
  ('147138621209163161', 'Living in Oblivion', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Frank Prinzi, Tom DiCillo, Jeffrey Lazar', 'Tom DiCillo', 'Steve Buscemi, Catherine Keener, Dermot Mulroney, Danielle von Zerneck, James Le Gros, Peter Dinklage, Rica Martens, Kevin Corrigan', 'R', 'Low-budget independent filmmaker Nick Reve tries to keep everything together as his production is plagued with an insecure actress, a megalomaniac star, a pretentious beret-wearing director of photography, and lousy catering.', 'Low-budget independent filmmaker Nick Reve tries to keep everything together as his production is plagued with an insecure actress, a megalomaniac star, a pretentious beret-wearing director of photography, and lousy catering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b54xDk98oWtEtAso9sj1wjaZDDH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9071'),
  ('430096613720329423', 'Living in Paradise', 1999, 'Drama', 'Bourlem Guerdjou, Georges Lechaptois', 'Olivier Douyère, Bourlem Guerdjou, Olivier Lorelle', 'Roschdy Zem, Fadila Belkebla, Omar Bekhaled, Hiam Abbass, Farida Rahouadj, Ramzi Brari, Sabrina Jellassi, Pierre Berriau', null, 'Set in France in 1961-1962 during the Algerian War, Living in Paradise is a thought-provoking examination of the lives of North African immigrants trying to find a place in the social system of Western Europe.', 'Set in France in 1961-1962 during the Algerian War, Living in Paradise is a thought-provoking examination of the lives of North African immigrants trying to find a place in the social system of Western Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fS7tjJufPRLNYQ17YGne7So3DYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167639'),
  ('913769626034337171', 'Living in Peril', 1997, 'Thriller, Comedy, Drama', 'Jack Ersgard, Ross Berryman', 'Patrik Ersgård, Jack Ersgard, Jesper Ersgård', 'Rob Lowe, Jim Belushi, Dean Stockwell, Dana Wheeler-Nicholson, Alex Meneses, Richard Moll, Tony Longo, Patrik Ersgård', 'R', 'An architect is plagued by a series of mysterious accidents after arriving in L.A. to design an eccentric client''s home.', 'An architect is plagued by a series of mysterious accidents after arriving in L.A. to design an eccentric client''s home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abodM3cAuQuRKXNfv0elRlc8G0M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166897'),
  ('16185962974625470', 'Living in the Cemetery', 2026, 'Crime', 'Kehinde Odunowo', 'Kehinde Odunowo', 'Larayia Gaston, Myiesha Freeman, Juan Carlos Montoya', null, 'A mother haunted by trauma becomes overprotective of her daughter, but when the daughter falls in love, their bond fractures. As buried secrets emerge, both must confront whether forgiveness can heal old wounds before it''s too late.', 'A mother haunted by trauma becomes overprotective of her daughter, but when the daughter falls in love, their bond fractures. As buried secrets emerge, both must confront whether forgiveness can heal old wounds before it''s too late.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fye2K4Kl8AQLx94XFjuyrpHy3FmH.jpg', 'plex:movie:living-in-the-cemetery'),
  ('905581438966556883', 'Living Is Easy with Eyes Closed', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'David Trueba, Daniel Vilar, Sara Mazkiarán', 'David Trueba', 'Javier Cámara, Natalia de Molina, Francesc Colomer, Ramon Fontserè, Rogelio Fernández, Jorge Sanz, Ariadna Gil, Violeta Rodríguez', null, 'Spain, 1966. An English teacher who travels to Almería when he hears that John Lennon is making a film there befriends with a 16-year-old boy who has run away from home and a young girl who also seems to be running away from something.', 'Spain, 1966. An English teacher who travels to Almería when he hears that John Lennon is making a film there befriends with a 16-year-old boy who has run away from home and a young girl who also seems to be running away from something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iT8hZ8bXFMtqUpOTdoK6dUww28M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209415'),
  ('679400525582396409', 'Living Is What Matters', 1987, 'Romance, Drama', 'Luis Alcoriza', 'Janet Alcoriza, Luis Alcoriza', 'María Rojo, Gonzalo Vega, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Loló Navarro, Alejandro Parodi, Justo Martínez, Eduardo Borja, Bruno Rey', null, 'A drifter named Candelario asks to spend the night at the hacienda of Don Lazaro. Once there, he gets the offer to stay and work as a laborer with a fixed salary. Over time, Candelario is gaining the confidence of his employer, and becomes indispensable. The situation will change radically when Don Lazarus discovers that Candelario is having a love affair with his wife.', 'A drifter named Candelario asks to spend the night at the hacienda of Don Lazaro. Once there, he gets the offer to stay and work as a laborer with a fixed salary. Over time, Candelario is gaining the confidence of his employer, and becomes indispensable. The situation will change radically when Don Lazarus discovers that Candelario is having a love affair with his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7bqZGm19S7ineWeLmbmymuOa0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176881'),
  ('999730953807222521', 'Living It Up', 1954, 'Comedy, Music', 'Norman Taurog, Clem Jones, Daniel L. Fapp', 'Jack Rose, Melville Shavelson', 'Jerry Lewis, Dean Martin, Janet Leigh, Edward Arnold, Fred Clark, Sheree North, Sammy White, Sid Tomack', 'NR', 'Homer Flagg is a railroad worker in the small New Mexico town of Desert Hole. One day, he finds an abandoned automobile at an old atomic proving ground. His doctor and best friend, Steve Harris, diagnoses him with radiation poisoning and gives Homer three weeks to live. A big city reporter hears of Homer''s plight and convinces her editor to provide an all-expenses paid trip to New York.', 'Homer Flagg is a railroad worker in the small New Mexico town of Desert Hole. One day, he finds an abandoned automobile at an old atomic proving ground. His doctor and best friend, Steve Harris, diagnoses him with radiation poisoning and gives Homer three weeks to live. A big city reporter hears of Homer''s plight and convinces her editor to provide an all-expenses paid trip to New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4rc8vwJs0DHbhw9oN4coaHKTzx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39016'),
  ('740264318588584186', 'Living It Up', 1994, 'Drama', 'Paolo Virzì, Paolo Carnera, Alessandra Fornari', 'Paolo Virzì, Francesco Bruni', 'Claudio Bigagli, Sabrina Ferilli, Massimo Ghini, Giorgio Algranti, Emanuele Barresi, Paola Tiziana Cruciani, Ugo Bencini, Raffaella Lebboroni', null, 'A recently laid off steel mill worker in a little seaside town starts losing his wife to a local TV anchor.', 'A recently laid off steel mill worker in a little seaside town starts losing his wife to a local TV anchor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHy6UAwg7oK9WvmUiMLQMDL9cUZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76992'),
  ('100639221372852103', 'Living It Up', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Antonio Cuadri', 'Fernando León de Aranoa, Carlos Asorey', 'Salma Hayek Pinault, Carmelo Gómez, Tito Valverde, Alicia Agut', 'R', 'Lola, a Mexican waitress working in Madrid, befriends a 30-year-old suicidal man who has borrowed $1,000,000 to spend on his last day on Earth, knowing he will be killed anyway if he fails to return the money. After meeting Lola, however, he decides that life might be worth living after all.', 'Lola, a Mexican waitress working in Madrid, befriends a 30-year-old suicidal man who has borrowed $1,000,000 to spend on his last day on Earth, knowing he will be killed anyway if he fails to return the money. After meeting Lola, however, he decides that life might be worth living after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Svz2C0Yn58ODjJQXOH23BNtslv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34704'),
  ('1123386437444986894', 'Living Marble', 1910, 'Comedy', 'Johann Schwarzer, Johann Schwarzer', null, null, null, 'Four gentlemen are talking in a beer-garden; during a short absence of one of them, who pretends to be an art lover, the others decide to make a prank on him. When he comes back, one them invites the "square" bourgeois to his home, pretexting to show him an art catalog. The men pay their drinks and leave, but the three friends convene later, and they have paid a young female model to be there, too.', 'Four gentlemen are talking in a beer-garden; during a short absence of one of them, who pretends to be an art lover, the others decide to make a prank on him. When he comes back, one them invites the "square" bourgeois to his home, pretexting to show him an art catalog. The men pay their drinks and leave, but the three friends convene later, and they have paid a young female model to be there, too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0dSHEbb0EiYt6NPYrnkyR0uj7U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193972'),
  ('82969601589412238', 'Living on Love Alone', 2010, 'Romance, Drama', 'Isabelle Czajka, Crystel Fournier', 'Isabelle Czajka', 'Anaïs Demoustier, Pio Marmaï, Laurent Poitrenaux, Jean-Louis Coulloc''h, Manuel Vallade, Adélaïde Leroux, Christine Brücher, Océane Mozas', null, 'Julie Bataille is fed up with student jobs. At 23, with a 5-years university degree, she wants to work for real. She meets Ben by chance at a job interview. He''s a guy who chose to live by the day, getting by with whatever crosses his path and small-time trafficking. Ben asks her to come and spend the summer with him in the South. Julie declines. Then one day, on an impulse, she leaves everything behind and joins him.', 'Julie Bataille is fed up with student jobs. At 23, with a 5-years university degree, she wants to work for real. She meets Ben by chance at a job interview. He''s a guy who chose to live by the day, getting by with whatever crosses his path and small-time trafficking. Ben asks her to come and spend the summer with him in the South. Julie declines. Then one day, on an impulse, she leaves everything behind and joins him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9usMIU8nB8F9U30ESYVkBuMwO1X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53485'),
  ('153695812785695739', 'Living on One Dollar', 2013, 'Drama, Documentary, Adventure', 'Zach Ingrasci, Sean Leonard, Chris Temple', null, 'Chris Temple, Ryan Christoffersen, Zach Ingrasci, Sean Leonard', 'NR', 'How do 1.1 billion people around the world live on less than one dollar a day? Four young friends set out to research and live this reality. Armed with only a video camera and a desire to understand, they spend just 56 dollars each for 56 days in rural Pena Blanca, Guatemala. They battle E.Coli, financial stress, and the realization that there are no easy answers. Yet, the generosity and strength of their neighbors, Rosa, Anthony and Chino gives them resilient hope. They return home transformed and embark on a mission to share their new found understanding with other students, inspiring and challenging their generation to make a difference.', 'How do 1.1 billion people around the world live on less than one dollar a day? Four young friends set out to research and live this reality. Armed with only a video camera and a desire to understand, they spend just 56 dollars each for 56 days in rural Pena Blanca, Guatemala. They battle E.Coli, financial stress, and the realization that there are no easy answers. Yet, the generosity and strength of their neighbors, Rosa, Anthony and Chino gives them resilient hope. They return home transformed and embark on a mission to share their new found understanding with other students, inspiring and challenging their generation to make a difference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1w9MQn2itNBaWPZdtsDHIYmo6l6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229768'),
  ('618135924893618286', 'Living Out Loud', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Richard LaGravenese, John Bailey, Douglas Aarniokoski', 'Richard LaGravenese', 'Holly Hunter, Danny DeVito, Queen Latifah, Martin Donovan, Richard Schiff, Elias Koteas, Suzanne Shepherd, Mariangela Pino', 'R', 'Judith Moore is suddenly single after discovering her husband of fifteen years, a successful doctor, has been having an affair with a younger woman. Judith stews, plans, plots and fantasizes, but she can''t decide what to do with her life until she goes out to a night club to see singer Liz Bailey, who is full of advice on life and love. While out on the town, Judith is suddenly kissed by a total stranger, which opens her eyes to new possibilities... which is when she notices Pat, the elevator operator in her building.', 'Judith Moore is suddenly single after discovering her husband of fifteen years, a successful doctor, has been having an affair with a younger woman. Judith stews, plans, plots and fantasizes, but she can''t decide what to do with her life until she goes out to a night club to see singer Liz Bailey, who is full of advice on life and love. While out on the town, Judith is suddenly kissed by a total stranger, which opens her eyes to new possibilities... which is when she notices Pat, the elevator operator in her building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uegG68vP7leUDQbG8fP4ihgTo0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46889'),
  ('541974231400909686', 'Living Sculptures: Film Study for Screen Artist', 1903, 'Documentary', 'Oskar Messter', null, null, null, 'A nude couple pose in an art studio on a square rug, while the camera does a circular traveling around them; the woman has her right knee on the floor and her right arm raised in front of her face, holding the man''s thighs with her right, while the man is bent forward, as if looking in the distance.', 'A nude couple pose in an art studio on a square rug, while the camera does a circular traveling around them; the woman has her right knee on the floor and her right arm raised in front of her face, holding the man''s thighs with her right, while the man is bent forward, as if looking in the distance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYvro20gzhvWPoL6WbYXR9xITUg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195958'),
  ('366599340769741298', 'Living Skeleton', 1968, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'Hiroshi Matsuno, Masayuki Kato, Masami Rissen', 'Kyuzo Kobayashi, Kikuma Shimoiizaka', 'Kikko Matsuoka, Yasunori Irikawa, Masumi Okada, Asao Uchida, Asao Koike, Toshihiko Yamamoto, Keijiro Kikyo, Hitoshi Takagi', null, 'A ship is attacked at sea for its cargo by a group of thieves who murder a newlywed doctor and rape his wife. Three years later her twin sister is kidnapped by the same pirates, who begin to die strange deaths...', 'A ship is attacked at sea for its cargo by a group of thieves who murder a newlywed doctor and rape his wife. Three years later her twin sister is kidnapped by the same pirates, who begin to die strange deaths...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35bFVo9yYUzLeZpyskOl2wN63FE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124423'),
  ('667891550878142448', 'Living Still Life', 2014, 'Science Fiction', 'Bertrand Mandico, Pascale Granel', 'Bertrand Mandico', 'Elina Löwensohn, Jean-Marc Montmont, Claudine Deborde', null, 'In a world in decay, a woman collects her dead animals and restores them to life by filming them images by image.', 'In a world in decay, a woman collects her dead animals and restores them to life by filming them images by image.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eFKqwuZUcjfTbTWszz2xpwIsRL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323666'),
  ('240825713868458995', 'Living the Utopia', 1997, 'Documentary, History', 'Francesc Ríos, Francesc Ríos, Mariona Roca', 'Mariona Roca, Mitzi Kotnik, Juan A. Gamero', 'Maribel Sánchez-Maroto, Manuel Carvajal', null, 'A retrospective look at the anarcho-syndicalist and anarcho-communist experience in Spain from 1930 until the end of the Civil War in 1939.', 'A retrospective look at the anarcho-syndicalist and anarcho-communist experience in Spain from 1930 until the end of the Civil War in 1939.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTRZ3Qq4hQjJrviw9fvuZOdcKjY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240123'),
  ('96336496770906393', 'Living Together', 1973, 'Drama', 'Anna Karina, Jean-François Dunac, Patrick Schulmann', 'Anna Karina', 'Anna Karina, Michel Lancelot, Monique Morelli, Viviane Blassel, Bob Asklöf, Jean Aurel, Gérard Pereira, Raphael Mattei', null, 'A stodgy, married schoolteacher has a chance encounter with a free spirited young woman who loosens him up and introduces him to a hippie lifestyle.', 'A stodgy, married schoolteacher has a chance encounter with a free spirited young woman who loosens him up and introduces him to a hippie lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIB1FhZBJgIEhQSq7Twm0EKmaqm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163967'),
  ('51966037384669208', 'Living with Chucky', 2022, 'Documentary, Horror', 'Kyra Elise Gardner, Scott Marino, Brian Davis', 'Jason Strickland, Kyra Elise Gardner', 'Kyra Elise Gardner, Brad Dourif, Fiona Dourif, Alex Vincent, Jennifer Tilly, Don Mancini, Christine Elise, Billy Boyd', 'NR', 'A filmmaker who grew up alongside Chucky the killer doll seeks out the other families surrounding the Child''s Play films as they recount their experiences working on the ongoing franchise and what it means to be a part of the, "Chucky" family.', 'A filmmaker who grew up alongside Chucky the killer doll seeks out the other families surrounding the Child''s Play films as they recount their experiences working on the ongoing franchise and what it means to be a part of the, "Chucky" family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iATJr3eQF7DMnLaBxgw0avaFR0X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926762'),
  ('33794159504067780', 'Living with Leopards', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Brad Bestelink, Alex Parkinson, Brad Bestelink', null, 'Alex Parkinson, Brad Bestelink', 'PG', 'A film crew follows two leopard cubs as they make the fascinating journey from infancy into adulthood in this up-close-and-personal nature documentary.', 'A film crew follows two leopard cubs as they make the fascinating journey from infancy into adulthood in this up-close-and-personal nature documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4I9CClpKze9rwW78fuMSluq2OvE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1255187'),
  ('898041060078368868', 'Living with Michael Jackson: A Tonight Special', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Julie Shaw, Rupert Binsley', null, 'Michael Jackson, Martin Bashir, Prince Jackson, Paris Jackson, Bigi Jackson, Gavin Arvizo, Boris Becker', null, 'Martin Bashir conducts a rare interview with Michael Jackson and is given unprecedented access to the reclusive performer''s private life over a span of eight months, from May 2002 to January 2003.', 'Martin Bashir conducts a rare interview with Michael Jackson and is given unprecedented access to the reclusive performer''s private life over a span of eight months, from May 2002 to January 2003.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jP3GV0E3r3xtbwYCcJqXoRTFvyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106006'),
  ('337581204246268329', 'Living with the Dead', 2002, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Stephen Gyllenhaal, Jeffrey Jur', 'John Pielmeier', 'Mary Steenburgen, Diane Ladd, Ted Danson, Queen Latifah, Jack Palance, Michael Moriarty, Kavan Smith, Joel Palmer', 'PG-13', 'A man begins to have disturbing visions of dead people, among whom are his mother and victims of a local serial killer. All telling their story of how they died, and how their murderer is still out there. The detective investigating the murders looks to him for help in solving the case.', 'A man begins to have disturbing visions of dead people, among whom are his mother and victims of a local serial killer. All telling their story of how they died, and how their murderer is still out there. The detective investigating the murders looks to him for help in solving the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32ubEy7XDB8OO3M39QtVc9c6mrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57012'),
  ('811935967964923650', 'Living With Wolves', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Michel Bertrand', 'Jean-Michel Bertrand', 'Jean-Michel Bertrand', null, 'Soon, there will be wolves everywhere in France again. People have to learn to cohabit with them.', 'Soon, there will be wolves everywhere in France again. People have to learn to cohabit with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VY1KQabjzp3FEFDhdjRC4EQ7KR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1201052'),
  ('871093899915353874', 'Livraison à domicile', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Delahaye, Philippe Guilbert', 'Pierre Courrège, Marie-Pierre Huster, Margot Volnay', 'Thierry Frémont, Bruno Solo, Barbara Schulz, Alexandra Lamy, Agnès Soral, Philippe Duquesne, Michel Scotto di Carlo, Jo Prestia', null, 'A pizza delivery guy decides to expand his job and now delivers anything, even a car.', 'A pizza delivery guy decides to expand his job and now delivers anything, even a car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iY3A8pIMReadweYKdhWD9Yi0cW6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53993'),
  ('460114607295660032', 'Liz & Dick', 2012, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Lloyd Kramer, Paula Huidobro', 'Christopher Monger', 'Lindsay Lohan, Grant Bowler, Theresa Russell, David Hunt, Bruce Nozick, Tanya Franks, Charles Shaughnessy, David Eigenberg', 'PG-13', 'On the set of Cleopatra, Hollywood''s most beautiful star, Elizabeth Taylor, fell into the arms of one of the world''s greatest actors, Richard Burton - and she didn''t leave. Their subsequent white-hot, scandalous love affair gave rise to the paparazzi and they became the most hunted and photographed couple on earth. Their rocky, passionate, relationship, born in front of the cameras, was subsequently captured in a series of films, including The V.I.P.s and Who''s Afraid of Virginia Woolf? The last of the great, extravagant stars, flaunting diamonds, yachts and private planes, they continually seized the headlines. They even divorced and married again - only to divorce again - but remain in each other''s hearts. This Elizabeth Taylor - Richard Burton story is a no-holds barred account of their undying, but impossible love.', 'On the set of Cleopatra, Hollywood''s most beautiful star, Elizabeth Taylor, fell into the arms of one of the world''s greatest actors, Richard Burton - and she didn''t leave. Their subsequent white-hot, scandalous love affair gave rise to the paparazzi and they became the most hunted and photographed couple on earth. Their rocky, passionate, relationship, born in front of the cameras, was subsequently captured in a series of films, including The V.I.P.s and Who''s Afraid of Virginia Woolf? The last of the great, extravagant stars, flaunting diamonds, yachts and private planes, they continually seized the headlines. They even divorced and married again - only to divorce again - but remain in each other''s hearts. This Elizabeth Taylor - Richard Burton story is a no-holds barred account of their undying, but impossible love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zB6dpl7otnzzgJN5iXP5NNJAGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130358'),
  ('54925953697699910', 'Liz and the Blue Bird', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Music', 'Yuki Tsunoda, Tatsunari Maruko, Tatsuya Ishihara', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Atsumi Tanezaki, Nao Toyama, Ayaka Asai, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Chika Anzai, Yuichi Nakamura, Conomi Fujimura, Takahiro Sakurai', null, 'In their last year of high school, two girls in the brass band club perform a song inspired by a fairy tale that parallels their friendship.', 'In their last year of high school, two girls in the brass band club perform a song inspired by a fairy tale that parallels their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xRIkqWJy4cNpUxPo5aZ24O0Tyx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482150'),
  ('1003565186505959153', 'Liz in September', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fina Torres, Celiana Cárdenas, Rolo Pulpeiro', 'Fina Torres', 'Patricia Velásquez, Eloísa Maturén, Mimí Lazo, Elba Escobar, Danay García, Arlette Torres, Karina Velásquez, Sheila Monterola', null, 'A shocking secret, ex-lovers and the arrival of an outsider shake things up for Liz as she celebrates her birthday at a lesbian-owned resort.', 'A shocking secret, ex-lovers and the arrival of an outsider shake things up for Liz as she celebrates her birthday at a lesbian-owned resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJvlvZCqz0bTYgYHCYYztklcOQh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288129'),
  ('58485149496205301', 'Liza', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Marco Ferreri, Mario Vulpiani', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Ennio Flaiano, Marco Ferreri', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Catherine Deneuve, Corinne Marchand, Claudine Berg, Dominique Marcas, Luigi Antonio Guerra, Valérie Stroh, Pascal Laperrousaz', null, 'Liza meets the artist Giorgio and falls in love with him. She dreams of becoming the wife of Giorgio, but he is married. She dreams of being a close friend to him, but he has a favorite dog. Liza is ready for any sacrifice for the sake of her love. She kills Giorgio''s dog and takes her place. Now she is a woman who always and everywhere follows her master.', 'Liza meets the artist Giorgio and falls in love with him. She dreams of becoming the wife of Giorgio, but he is married. She dreams of being a close friend to him, but he has a favorite dog. Liza is ready for any sacrifice for the sake of her love. She kills Giorgio''s dog and takes her place. Now she is a woman who always and everywhere follows her master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsJa2ibtGSx1ZRbzOV4sA3ZQSQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63176'),
  ('313878007822849356', 'Liza with a Z', 1972, 'Music, TV Movie', 'Bob Fosse, Owen Roizman', 'Fred Ebb', 'Liza Minnelli, Ann Reinking, Gwen Verdon, Lorna Luft, Kay Thompson', null, 'Liza Minnelli stars in a television concert directed and choreographed by Bob Fosse. She performs her songs such as the title number and a medley of songs from the film Cabaret (1972).', 'Liza Minnelli stars in a television concert directed and choreographed by Bob Fosse. She performs her songs such as the title number and a medley of songs from the film Cabaret (1972).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zatZeSijq2NSBD9sXkJB6BS56Zz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88496'),
  ('365949764422950275', 'Liza, the Fox-Fairy', 2015, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Károly Ujj Mészáros, Péter Szatmári', 'Bálint Hegedűs, Károly Ujj Mészáros', 'Mónika Balsai, David Sakurai, Szabolcs Bede-Fazekas, Zoltán Schmied, Gábor Reviczky, Piroska Molnár, Antal Cserna, Győző Szabó', null, 'Liza is a naïve, lonely 30-year-old nurse who wants to fall in love. Her only company is a long-dead Japanese pop star, who turns her into a fox-fairy out of jealousy. Now, every man who desires Liza shall die horribly. Can she overcome the curse?', 'Liza is a naïve, lonely 30-year-old nurse who wants to fall in love. Her only company is a long-dead Japanese pop star, who turns her into a fox-fairy out of jealousy. Now, every man who desires Liza shall die horribly. Can she overcome the curse?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0nP7HDejKeuiJumJpR5S5GOnG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326333'),
  ('1009617291074303808', 'Lizzie', 1957, 'Drama', 'Hugo Haas, Paul Ivano', 'Mel Dinelli', 'Eleanor Parker, Richard Boone, Joan Blondell, Hugo Haas, Ric Roman, Dorothy Arnold, John Reach, Marion Ross', null, 'A psychiatrist treats a woman of three faces: neurotic Elizabeth, wanton Lizzie, and charming Beth.', 'A psychiatrist treats a woman of three faces: neurotic Elizabeth, wanton Lizzie, and charming Beth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqVG0hVCnk7kPgn4bJxfBFDGwQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116780'),
  ('529353034566513745', 'Lizzie', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Craig William Macneill, Noah Greenberg, Yann Sobezynski', 'Bryce Kass', 'Chloë Sevigny, Kristen Stewart, Jamey Sheridan, Fiona Shaw, Kim Dickens, Denis O''Hare, Jeff Perry, Jody Matzer', 'R', 'Massachusetts, 1892. An unmarried woman of 32 and a social outcast, Lizzie lives a claustrophobic life under her father''s cold and domineering control. When Bridget Sullivan, a young maid, comes to work for the family, Lizzie finds a sympathetic, kindred spirit, and a secret intimacy soon blossoms into a wicked plan.', 'Massachusetts, 1892. An unmarried woman of 32 and a social outcast, Lizzie lives a claustrophobic life under her father''s cold and domineering control. When Bridget Sullivan, a young maid, comes to work for the family, Lizzie finds a sympathetic, kindred spirit, and a secret intimacy soon blossoms into a wicked plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2iuBcwznen3kC9z4LeOzBSz1BB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460071'),
  ('91930503285341842', 'Lizzie Borden Took an Ax', 2014, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nick Gomez, Steve Cosens', 'Stephen Kay', 'Christina Ricci, Clea DuVall, Gregg Henry, Stephen McHattie, Shawn Doyle, Sara Botsford, Hannah Emily Anderson, Andrea Runge', 'PG-13', 'Lizzie Borden Took An Ax chronicles the scandal and enduring mystery surrounding Lizzie Borden, who was tried in 1892 for axing her parents to death. As the case rages on, the courtroom proceedings fuel an enormous amount of sensationalized stories and headlines in newspapers throughout the country, forever leaving Lizzie Borden’s name in infamy.', 'Lizzie Borden Took An Ax chronicles the scandal and enduring mystery surrounding Lizzie Borden, who was tried in 1892 for axing her parents to death. As the case rages on, the courtroom proceedings fuel an enormous amount of sensationalized stories and headlines in newspapers throughout the country, forever leaving Lizzie Borden’s name in infamy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uFVWUQsKPVSA11QXh4X8pSSKGC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243568'),
  ('672642903982555954', 'Llenos de gracia', 2022, 'Comedy, Family', 'Roberto Bueso, Víctor Entrecanales', null, 'Carmen Machi, Paula Usero, Doroftei Anis, Nuria González, Pablo Chiapella, Manolo Solo, Dairon Tallon, Adrián López', null, 'Sister Marina, a very unorthodox nun, is sent during the summer of 1994 to El Parral, a boarding school for boys threatened to be closed soon. Even though the kids welcome Marina with all kinds of pranks, they will, little by little, become something very close to the family they never had.', 'Sister Marina, a very unorthodox nun, is sent during the summer of 1994 to El Parral, a boarding school for boys threatened to be closed soon. Even though the kids welcome Marina with all kinds of pranks, they will, little by little, become something very close to the family they never had.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPz9EByDWOqcNQ9IbDMkhif5fnj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:954748'),
  ('336085659671627310', 'Lloyd', 2001, 'Comedy, Family', 'Hector Barron, Michael Orefice', 'Hector Barron', 'Todd Bosley, Brendon Ryan Barrett, Mary Mara, Sammy Elliott, Elliott Arcelis, Michael Orefice, Andrew Neustrom', 'PG', 'A boy learns that confidence and self-esteem are the greatest gifts.', 'A boy learns that confidence and self-esteem are the greatest gifts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2B1PErRoVK4gtbgYtxRryPOsYJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56750'),
  ('936800278131255256', 'Lloyd''s of London', 1936, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Henry King, Bert Glennon, Robert D. Webb', 'W.P. Lipscomb', 'Freddie Bartholomew, Madeleine Carroll, Guy Standing, Tyrone Power, C. Aubrey Smith, Virginia Field, Douglas Scott, George Sanders', null, 'Norfolk, England, 1770. The nephew of an innkeeper and the son of a reverend maintain a very close friendship until, after living a great adventure, they must separate their paths. The former will head his footsteps to London and bound his destiny to Lloyd''s, a thriving insurance company; the latter will eventually become one of the greatest heroes in the history of the British Empire.', 'Norfolk, England, 1770. The nephew of an innkeeper and the son of a reverend maintain a very close friendship until, after living a great adventure, they must separate their paths. The former will head his footsteps to London and bound his destiny to Lloyd''s, a thriving insurance company; the latter will eventually become one of the greatest heroes in the history of the British Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Fg6Kcgrbw3Ek6SCK6DYDp4Y0OT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81687'),
  ('21148408241985113', 'Lmno', 1978, 'Animation', 'Robert Breer', null, null, null, 'Conceivably the best of all of Breer’s films to date – has more to do with figuration, according to Breer’s formulation regarding titles with letters or numbers. This becomes clear right away as the title letters are intercut with a flurry of fish swimming past the frame lines, which are made all the more literal through the associative chain established by a snippet of Schubert’s Trout Quintet heard on the soundtrack, along with footsteps – which continue over a profusion of other shapes, colors, and objects, including the title letters again. -- Jonathan Rosenbaum', 'Conceivably the best of all of Breer’s films to date – has more to do with figuration, according to Breer’s formulation regarding titles with letters or numbers. This becomes clear right away as the title letters are intercut with a flurry of fish swimming past the frame lines, which are made all the more literal through the associative chain established by a snippet of Schubert’s Trout Quintet heard on the soundtrack, along with footsteps – which continue over a profusion of other shapes, colors, and objects, including the title letters again. -- Jonathan Rosenbaum', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RSHiuccUhXH7AEif1foOW4nuGx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132171'),
  ('81645774877906540', 'Lo', 2009, 'Romance, Comedy, Horror', 'Travis Betz, Joshua Reis', 'Travis Betz', 'Jeremiah Birkett, Sarah Lassez, Ward Roberts, Devin Barry, Liz Loza, Aaron Gaffey, Sarah Larissa Deckert, John Karyus', null, 'Love presents many challenges to couples...but none so daunting as the one Justin faces with his girlfriend April...', 'Love presents many challenges to couples...but none so daunting as the one Justin faces with his girlfriend April...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ma6gQjFaEEDWCtr1h7uXXcHhNtC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36628'),
  ('750242310845599066', 'Lo and Behold: Reveries of the Connected World', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Peter Zeitlinger', 'Werner Herzog', 'Elon Musk, Lawrence Krauss, Werner Herzog, Lucianne Walkowicz, Leonard Kleinrock, Ted Nelson, Bob Kahn, Danny Hillis', 'PG-13', 'Werner Herzog''s exploration of the Internet and the connected world.', 'Werner Herzog''s exploration of the Internet and the connected world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yv9ecMFec43ReHGy1fDntPF4FS2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360030'),
  ('36902786069710536', 'Lo Invisible', 2021, 'Drama', 'Daniel Andrade, Javier Andrade', 'Javier Andrade, Anahí Hoeneisen', 'Anahí Hoeneisen, Gerson Guerra, Matilde Lagos, Juan Lorenzo Barragán, Leidy Gómez Roldán, Paola Navarrete, Cristina Marchán, Pablo Terán', null, 'When Luisa, 45, returns from a psychiatric clinic after a bout with severe postpartum depression, she enters a new confinement in her dazzling home, surrounded by family members and a brigade of servants who expect her struggles to remain invisible. Unable to continue playing the role of the perfect housewife, Luisa''s only escape is to waltz elegantly into madness.', 'When Luisa, 45, returns from a psychiatric clinic after a bout with severe postpartum depression, she enters a new confinement in her dazzling home, surrounded by family members and a brigade of servants who expect her struggles to remain invisible. Unable to continue playing the role of the perfect housewife, Luisa''s only escape is to waltz elegantly into madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJwYURMc0v4z3ex8Y84FtjW5x0G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664697'),
  ('934968633531612859', 'Lo más sencillo es complicarlo todo', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Rene Bueno, Alberto Lee', 'Rene Bueno', 'Danna Paola, Marjorie de Sousa, Alosian Vivancos, Daniela Wong, Eduardo Tanús, Paulina Matos, Xabiani Ponce de León, Fernando Sarfatti', null, 'When a 17-year-old learns the TV news host she pines for is engaged, she and her best friend launch an elaborate plan to prevent his marriage.', 'When a 17-year-old learns the TV news host she pines for is engaged, she and her best friend launch an elaborate plan to prevent his marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQPR4Xvpk7YktiXr9MwWQdFIv2T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439961'),
  ('395451003394352233', 'Lo que no se perdona', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Cristian Maximiliano Barrozo, Luis Millán Pastori', 'Malen Azzam', 'Ángel Collante, Carolina Guerrero, Álvaro Massafra, Roly Serrano', null, 'Leandro is a troubled and withdrawn teenager. The breakdown of his family structure forces him to find solace in the streets. He slowly begins to descend into delinquency and crime. His relationship with Chachota, his closest accomplice, has deteriorated, and Leandro is certain that Chachota betrayed him to the police. He also implicates him in a series of robberies, which link him to "Gordo" Ovalle, a shadowy criminal whom the police have long targeted.', 'Leandro is a troubled and withdrawn teenager. The breakdown of his family structure forces him to find solace in the streets. He slowly begins to descend into delinquency and crime. His relationship with Chachota, his closest accomplice, has deteriorated, and Leandro is certain that Chachota betrayed him to the police. He also implicates him in a series of robberies, which link him to "Gordo" Ovalle, a shadowy criminal whom the police have long targeted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncrK9b2zK34bFG7DPrr4HEetTYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619334'),
