  ('420371760131075706', 'Lo que vendrá', 1988, 'Science Fiction', 'Gustavo Mosquera R., Javier Miquelez, Mauro Bedendo', 'Gustavo Mosquera R.', 'Hugo Soto, Juan Leyrado, Charly García, Rosario Bléfari, Aldo Braga, Osvaldo Flores, Roxana Randón, Luis Minces', null, 'In a city of the too near future, a city designated for desolation, aggression, and political instability, Miguel Galvan (Hugo Soto) is shot accidentally during a demonstration. This time and space provides a back drop to an intriguing sequence of events where three characters try desperately to survive: the wounded Miguel, an antagonistic policeman (Juan Leyrado), and a foolish vigilante smartly acted by cult rock star Charly Garcia of Sui Generis and Serú Girán fame, who also composed the film''s score.', 'In a city of the too near future, a city designated for desolation, aggression, and political instability, Miguel Galvan (Hugo Soto) is shot accidentally during a demonstration. This time and space provides a back drop to an intriguing sequence of events where three characters try desperately to survive: the wounded Miguel, an antagonistic policeman (Juan Leyrado), and a foolish vigilante smartly acted by cult rock star Charly Garcia of Sui Generis and Serú Girán fame, who also composed the film''s score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXDSi6PGvURjVlKYhFk0i5dsZU9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446190'),
  ('982099241698322574', 'Lo scocciatore', 1953, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Leopoldo Trieste, Sandro Marino, Giorgio Bianchi', 'Fede Arnaud, Giorgio Bianchi, Leopoldo Trieste', 'Peppino De Filippo, Giulietta Masina, Alberto Sordi, Carlo Dapporto, Arlette Poirier, Leopoldo Trieste, Ada Dondini, Lidia Martora', null, 'A bored civil servant accepts an invitation to visit a glamorous young lady. When she doesn''t answer the door, then is later found murdered he panics!', 'A bored civil servant accepts an invitation to visit a glamorous young lady. When she doesn''t answer the door, then is later found murdered he panics!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZR9sApJRVY3wtIr9aMPNYKXUMy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82833'),
