  ('963584481792567703', 'Loaded', 1994, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Anna Campion', 'Anna Campion', 'Oliver Milburn, Catherine McCormack, Thandiwe Newton, Danny Cunningham, Dearbhla Molloy, Nick Patrick, Bridget Hodson', 'R', 'A group of young friends convene in the countryside to shoot a horror movie. But an experiment with LSD sees normal boundaries between them collapsing, and tragedy subsequently striking.', 'A group of young friends convene in the countryside to shoot a horror movie. But an experiment with LSD sees normal boundaries between them collapsing, and tragedy subsequently striking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4r5rgcUDYv8qMeQ8wzOPZsycjxY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54850'),
