  ('651837145783623460', 'Loading a Boiler', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'A stationary camera placed amidships looks toward the round end of a 10- or 12-foot boiler that''s been loaded onto the open deck. Three men climb down from atop the boiler and then remove their ladder. Four or five other workers tie the boiler down to the deck. Their pace is leisurely. In the background is a busy harbor.', 'A stationary camera placed amidships looks toward the round end of a 10- or 12-foot boiler that''s been loaded onto the open deck. Three men climb down from atop the boiler and then remove their ladder. Four or five other workers tie the boiler down to the deck. Their pace is leisurely. In the background is a busy harbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eqG0zMZFegxmr2afFivtPoO1I4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152454'),
  ('241025923450905245', 'Loafing and Camouflage', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Nikos Perakis, Stavros Kaplanidis, Maria Powell', 'Nikos Perakis', 'Nikos Kalogeropoulos, Giorgos Kimoulis, Stavros Xenidis, Andreas Filippides, Takis Spyridakis, Tania Kapsali, Hristos Valavanidis, Antonis Theodorakopoulos', null, 'A group of Greek soldiers are assigned to run the Cinematographic Unit of the army in the midst of political unrest.', 'A group of Greek soldiers are assigned to run the Cinematographic Unit of the army in the midst of political unrest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNDZ9jirhexRUWzd8YpJ50s9s2V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58865'),
  ('1057499504972431876', 'Loan Shark', 1952, 'Crime, Drama', 'Joseph F. Biroc, Seymour Friedman', 'Eugene Ling, Martin Rackin', 'George Raft, Dorothy Hart, Paul Stewart, John Hoyt, Helen Westcott, Henry Slate, Russell Johnson, Margia Dean', 'NR', 'A vicious loan shark ring has been preying on factory workers. When several workers at a tire factory suffer violence at the hands of the loan sharkers, a union leader and the factory owner try to recruit ex-con Joe Gargan to infiltrate to the gang. At first Joe does not want to get involved, but changes his mind when his brother-in-law dies at the hands of a savage loan shark hood. Joe works his way into the mob, but in order to keep his cover, Joe can''t tell anyone what he is up to. This results in him being disowned by his sister and girl friend.', 'A vicious loan shark ring has been preying on factory workers. When several workers at a tire factory suffer violence at the hands of the loan sharkers, a union leader and the factory owner try to recruit ex-con Joe Gargan to infiltrate to the gang. At first Joe does not want to get involved, but changes his mind when his brother-in-law dies at the hands of a savage loan shark hood. Joe works his way into the mob, but in order to keep his cover, Joe can''t tell anyone what he is up to. This results in him being disowned by his sister and girl friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sPhgo59wszKz2KCDKmWdXv4yAz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72529'),
  ('841689664645063923', 'Lobster Cop', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Li Xinyun', 'Li Xinyun', 'Wang Qianyuan, Yuan Shanshan, Liu Hua, Zhou You, Teng Shen, Zhou Yunpeng, Emotion Cheung Kam-Ching, Lee Kin-Yan', 'NR', 'Four police officers open up a lobster restaurant as a cover in order to catch a notorious drug dealer, only to find their secret recipe is more popular than they expect. When they get caught up in their new business venture, they find a bigger conspiracy at work.', 'Four police officers open up a lobster restaurant as a cover in order to catch a notorious drug dealer, only to find their secret recipe is more popular than they expect. When they get caught up in their new business venture, they find a bigger conspiracy at work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTiLm0fa8ZjuWlcLv6ejiAHuBjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:527415'),
  ('393288729647226383', 'Lobster for Breakfast', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Capitani, Carlo Carlini', 'Franco Marotta, Laura Toscano, Guy Lionel', 'Enrico Montesano, Claude Brasseur, Janet Ågren, Claudine Auger, Silvia Dionisio, Adriana Innocenti, Franca Scagnetti, Cesare Gelli', null, 'Marco is married to Carla, a rich businesswoman. She''s off to Geneva for two days; he has a tryst with Monique, a Swedish air hostess. Carla''s flight is canceled, so she heads home about to catch Mario en flagrant. Mario''s salvation is Enrico, an old school mate and hapless salesman who shows up to beg Mario to buy toilets so he won''t lose his job. Mario signs an order in exchange for Enrico''s posing as Monique''s husband. Carla invites them to stay overnight and join a business dinner party catered by Enrico''s wife, Matilde. Enrico spends the evening trying to avoid her, Mario spends it chasing the willing Monique, and Carla wants to close a deal. Can this farce end happily?', 'Marco is married to Carla, a rich businesswoman. She''s off to Geneva for two days; he has a tryst with Monique, a Swedish air hostess. Carla''s flight is canceled, so she heads home about to catch Mario en flagrant. Mario''s salvation is Enrico, an old school mate and hapless salesman who shows up to beg Mario to buy toilets so he won''t lose his job. Mario signs an order in exchange for Enrico''s posing as Monique''s husband. Carla invites them to stay overnight and join a business dinner party catered by Enrico''s wife, Matilde. Enrico spends the evening trying to avoid her, Mario spends it chasing the willing Monique, and Carla wants to close a deal. Can this farce end happily?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ejY4S5YxGNAwXr2LBW7658WvyJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127609'),
  ('283573723803393557', 'Lobster Man from Mars', 1990, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Stanley Sheff, Gerry Lively, Paul N. Martin', 'Bob Greenberg, Stanley Sheff', 'Deborah Foreman, Dean Jacobson, S.D. Nemeth, Anthony Hickox, Tony Curtis, Patrick Macnee, Phil Proctor, Bobby Pickett', 'PG', 'A young film student tries to sell his weird movie to a desperate film producer who is in need of a tax write-off. The producer screens the film "Lobster Man From Mars", and what follows is a bizarre sci-fi film-within-a-film: Mars suffers from an air leakage, and send the dreaded Lobster Man to Earth to steal its air. The plot is foiled by a mad scientist, a girl, and an army colonel.', 'A young film student tries to sell his weird movie to a desperate film producer who is in need of a tax write-off. The producer screens the film "Lobster Man From Mars", and what follows is a bizarre sci-fi film-within-a-film: Mars suffers from an air leakage, and send the dreaded Lobster Man to Earth to steal its air. The plot is foiled by a mad scientist, a girl, and an army colonel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20ljcUzzd38xq93Cnb2FTuqrye7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64342'),
  ('535706412764077247', 'LOC: Kargil', 2003, 'Action, War, History', 'J. P. Dutta', 'J. P. Dutta', 'Sanjay Dutt, Ajay Devgn, Saif Ali Khan, Suniel Shetty, Sanjay Kapoor, Abhishek Bachchan, Akshaye Khanna, Nagarjuna Akkineni', null, 'This film dramatizes events that occurred as the hostility between India and Pakistan over Kashmir came to a head in 1999, when more than 1,000 men crossed the "Line of Control" that separates the two locations. Taliban and Pakistani soldiers took over the area, blocking the main road that linked the regions. Standing their ground, Indian soldier drove them away, but not without losing more than 400 of their own men first.', 'This film dramatizes events that occurred as the hostility between India and Pakistan over Kashmir came to a head in 1999, when more than 1,000 men crossed the "Line of Control" that separates the two locations. Taliban and Pakistani soldiers took over the area, blocking the main road that linked the regions. Standing their ground, Indian soldier drove them away, but not without losing more than 400 of their own men first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rwlGnSWgLJlveO4OoOJ2n2YZyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71920'),
  ('204663759137713614', 'Local Color', 2008, 'Drama', 'Michael Negrin, George Gallo', 'George Gallo', 'Armin Mueller-Stahl, Trevor Morgan, Ray Liotta, Samantha Mathis, Ron Perlman, Nancy Casemore, Julie Lott Gallo, Taso Papadakis', null, 'A successful artist looks back with loving memories on the summer of his defining year, 1974. A talented but troubled 18-year-old aspiring artist befriends a brilliant elderly alcoholic painter who has turned his back on not only art but life. The two form what appears to be at first a tenuous relationship. The kid wants to learn all the secrets the master has locked away inside his head and heart. Time has not been kind to the old master. His life appears pointless to him until the kid rekindles his interest in his work and ultimately gives him the will to live. Together, they give one another a priceless gift. The kid learns to see the world through the master''s eyes. And the master learns to see life through the eyes of innocence again. This story is based on a real life experience.', 'A successful artist looks back with loving memories on the summer of his defining year, 1974. A talented but troubled 18-year-old aspiring artist befriends a brilliant elderly alcoholic painter who has turned his back on not only art but life. The two form what appears to be at first a tenuous relationship. The kid wants to learn all the secrets the master has locked away inside his head and heart. Time has not been kind to the old master. His life appears pointless to him until the kid rekindles his interest in his work and ultimately gives him the will to live. Together, they give one another a priceless gift. The kid learns to see the world through the master''s eyes. And the master learns to see life through the eyes of innocence again. This story is based on a real life experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/919NfleqwFRc59DcLbtfOza7m8r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2324'),
  ('172911738049628314', 'Local Hero', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bill Forsyth, Chris Menges, Jonathan Benson', 'Bill Forsyth', 'Burt Lancaster, Peter Riegert, Denis Lawson, Fulton Mackay, Peter Capaldi, Jennifer Black, Jenny Seagrove, Norman Chancer', 'PG', 'An American oil company sends a man to Scotland to buy up an entire village where they want to build a refinery. But things don''t go as expected.', 'An American oil company sends a man to Scotland to buy up an entire village where they want to build a refinery. But things don''t go as expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqxD0H9a1rg5bXftsm6gsNOjt4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11235'),
  ('249357612444060464', 'Loch Ness', 1996, 'Family', 'John Henderson, Clive Tickner', 'John Fusco', 'Ted Danson, Joely Richardson, Ian Holm, Kirsty Graham, James Frain, Keith Allen, Nick Brimble, Wolf Kahler', 'PG', 'Dr. Dempsey, an American scientist, is sent to Scotland to disprove the existence of the Loch Ness Monster. He is shocked when Laura, an inn-keeper, introduces him to a small family of Nessie-dinosaurs.', 'Dr. Dempsey, an American scientist, is sent to Scotland to disprove the existence of the Loch Ness Monster. He is shocked when Laura, an inn-keeper, introduces him to a small family of Nessie-dinosaurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMXL9o1N150SK0z6Sk6aXnC4oEB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51043'),
  ('763615541834118966', 'Lock Up', 1989, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Flynn, Donald E. Thorin, Newt Arnold', 'Richard Smith, Jeb Stuart, Henry Rosenbaum', 'Sylvester Stallone, Donald Sutherland, John Amos, Sonny Landham, Tom Sizemore, Frank McRae, Darlanne Fluegel, William Allen Young', 'R', 'Frank Leone is nearing the end of his prison term for a relatively minor crime. Just before he is paroled, however, Warden Drumgoole takes charge. Drumgoole was assigned to a hell-hole prison after his administration was publicly humiliated by Leone, and has now arrived on the scene to ensure that Leone never sees the light of day.', 'Frank Leone is nearing the end of his prison term for a relatively minor crime. Just before he is paroled, however, Warden Drumgoole takes charge. Drumgoole was assigned to a hell-hole prison after his administration was publicly humiliated by Leone, and has now arrived on the scene to ensure that Leone never sees the light of day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WihoHaU9yvhhdoSqDAhiIlNN8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9972'),
  ('392939803075641584', 'Lockdown', 2000, 'Drama, Thriller', 'John Luessenhop, Chris Chomyn', 'Preston A. Whitmore II', 'Gabriel Casseus, De''Aundre Bonds, Melissa De Sousa, Clifton Powell, Paulette Braxton, Richard T. Jones, Chrystale Wilson, Tait Fletcher', 'R', 'Avery (Jones) returns to college as a competitive swimmer after getting his life back on track. But his life takes another unexpected turn when he and his two friends (Bonds, Casseus) are wrongly accused of murder and end up in prison.', 'Avery (Jones) returns to college as a competitive swimmer after getting his life back on track. But his life takes another unexpected turn when he and his two friends (Bonds, Casseus) are wrongly accused of murder and end up in prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nWDXa8zOK0Jf2dVjBtUgmsw8fs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50380'),
  ('683799625576276880', 'Lockdown', 2018, 'Thriller', 'Bogdana Vera Lorenz, Peter Fuchs, Verena Barros de Oliveira', 'Bogdana Vera Lorenz, Max Permantier', 'Alice Dwyer, Götz Schulte, Max Bretschneider, Jeff Wilbusch, Melanie Kogler', null, 'Liv wakes up in a locked room next to her injured boyfriend. The man who arrests her claims there was a bio weapons attack and he saved her. But the stranger knows too well about the young couple, and Liv becomes suspicious. The couple is not sure if they can believe his story.', 'Liv wakes up in a locked room next to her injured boyfriend. The man who arrests her claims there was a bio weapons attack and he saved her. But the stranger knows too well about the young couple, and Liv becomes suspicious. The couple is not sure if they can believe his story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9MOQM87sZb68gNaAe2yCoDazRB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481627'),
  ('3243317513569145', 'Lockdown all''italiana', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Claudio Zamarion, Enrico Vanzina', 'Enrico Vanzina', 'Ezio Greggio, Ricky Memphis, Paola Minaccioni, Martina Stella, Maria Luisa Jacobelli, Romina Pierdomenico, Harmail Kumar, Riccardo Rossi', null, 'The film follows the story of two couples in crisis who are about to break up but who, due to the Lockdown, imposed to stop the spread of the coronavirus, will instead be forced into a forced coexistence. The protagonists, through smartkworking, household chores and sports activities, will find themselves living under the same roof, giving life to a comedy full of laughter but also of reflections.', 'The film follows the story of two couples in crisis who are about to break up but who, due to the Lockdown, imposed to stop the spread of the coronavirus, will instead be forced into a forced coexistence. The protagonists, through smartkworking, household chores and sports activities, will find themselves living under the same roof, giving life to a comedy full of laughter but also of reflections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKLI0CjVa7Bo4KLsFNVZYqcMGtX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743888'),
  ('785208682587846500', 'Locke', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Steven Knight, Haris Zambarloukos, Martin Harrison', 'Steven Knight', 'Tom Hardy, Ruth Wilson, Andrew Scott, Olivia Colman, Tom Holland, Ben Daniels, Bill Milner, Alice Lowe', 'R', 'Ivan Locke has worked hard to craft a good life for himself. Tonight, that life will collapse around him. On the eve of the biggest challenge of his career, Ivan receives a phone call that sets in motion a series of events that will unravel his family, job, and soul.', 'Ivan Locke has worked hard to craft a good life for himself. Tonight, that life will collapse around him. On the eve of the biggest challenge of his career, Ivan receives a phone call that sets in motion a series of events that will unravel his family, job, and soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTREq5tTyYwmSLDRMhybJ82zXcX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210479'),
  ('1029916592096362105', 'Locke the Superman', 1984, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Hiroshi Fukutomi, Itaru Saito, Yuji Moriyama', 'Yuki Hijiri, Atsushi Yamatoya', 'Keiichi Nanba, Keiko Han, Taeko Nakanishi, Toshiko Fujita, Yoshito Yasuhara, Banjo Ginga, Daisuke Gori, Eiko Yamada', null, 'When the villainous Lady Kahn starts building an army of super-powerful espers, Colonel Ryu Yamaki is dispatched to recruit the most powerful superhuman in the known universe to help oppose her. Unfortunately, the esper known only as Locke has either never heard the "with great powers come great responsibilities" speech or he simply doesn''t care, and he refuses to leave his peaceful civilian life herding sheep. However, when Lady Kahn makes a preemptive move to take Locke and Ryu out of the picture, the irritated superbeing quickly changes his mind. Now the bad guys are about to learn that starting a fight with someone with super powers that include teleportation, a nearly indestructible force field and space martial arts was a very big mistake!', 'When the villainous Lady Kahn starts building an army of super-powerful espers, Colonel Ryu Yamaki is dispatched to recruit the most powerful superhuman in the known universe to help oppose her. Unfortunately, the esper known only as Locke has either never heard the "with great powers come great responsibilities" speech or he simply doesn''t care, and he refuses to leave his peaceful civilian life herding sheep. However, when Lady Kahn makes a preemptive move to take Locke and Ryu out of the picture, the irritated superbeing quickly changes his mind. Now the bad guys are about to learn that starting a fight with someone with super powers that include teleportation, a nearly indestructible force field and space martial arts was a very big mistake!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhjHuyRBocTkJPd3lIewmDH0jg3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123951'),
  ('541615560409531191', 'Locked', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Sandra-Ken Freeman, Fiona Winning, Pierre Henry', 'Michael Arlen Ross, Mariano Cohn, Gastón Duprat', 'Bill Skarsgård, Anthony Hopkins, Ashley Cartwright, Michael Eklund, Navid Charkhi, Sofia Tesema, Emma Kombe, Gabrielle Walsh', 'R', 'When Eddie breaks into a luxury SUV, he steps into a deadly trap set by William, a self-proclaimed vigilante delivering his own brand of twisted justice. With no means of escape, Eddie must fight to survive in a ride where escape is an illusion, survival is a nightmare, and justice shifts into high gear.', 'When Eddie breaks into a luxury SUV, he steps into a deadly trap set by William, a self-proclaimed vigilante delivering his own brand of twisted justice. With no means of escape, Eddie must fight to survive in a ride where escape is an illusion, survival is a nightmare, and justice shifts into high gear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhkiqXpfpufwxVrdSftzeKIANl3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1083968'),
  ('522976375632940928', 'Locked Down', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Dan Channing-Williams, Sam Barry-Parker, Doug Liman', 'Steven Knight', 'Anne Hathaway, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Stephen Merchant, Dulé Hill, Jazmyn Simon, Ben Kingsley, Ben Stiller, Mindy Kaling', 'R', 'During a COVID-19 lockdown, sparring couple Linda and Paxton call a truce to attempt a high-risk jewellery heist at one of the world''s most exclusive department stores, Harrods.', 'During a COVID-19 lockdown, sparring couple Linda and Paxton call a truce to attempt a high-risk jewellery heist at one of the world''s most exclusive department stores, Harrods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svHelD0Hb3TXPAQoPsoBwdDMTvf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741228'),
  ('731584263596620119', 'Locked In', 2021, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Joe Narode, Carlos V. Gutierrez, Sam Brave', 'Carlos V. Gutierrez', 'Mena Suvari, Jeff Fahey, Manny Perez, Costas Mandylor, Bruno Bichir, Jasper Polish, Natalie Smith, James Biberi', 'R', 'A single mother must protect her daughter and herself during a heist gone wrong at a high-tech storage facility.', 'A single mother must protect her daughter and herself during a heist gone wrong at a high-tech storage facility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34lLv6C7Pq6ypBSEPRqWceIW8oA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633342'),
  ('412808960841022177', 'Locked In', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Alexander Holt, Stephen Carney, Nour Wazzi', 'Rowan Joffé', 'Famke Janssen, Rose Williams, Alex Hassell, Finn Cole, Anna Friel, Georgia Thorne, Toby Ryan, Karl Collins', 'R', 'A kindly nurse tries to unlock the secrets of a coma patient''s injuries — and discovers the bitter rivalry, infidelity, betrayal and murder behind them.', 'A kindly nurse tries to unlock the secrets of a coma patient''s injuries — and discovers the bitter rivalry, infidelity, betrayal and murder behind them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blQaj6biyBMLo34cuFKKwbgjIBz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064024'),
  ('307976342440743695', 'Locked in Society', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Sönke Wortmann, Jo Heim', 'Jan Weiler', 'Florian David Fitz, Anke Engelke, Justus von Dohnányi, Nilam Farooq, Thomas Loibl, Torben Kessler, Thorsten Merten, Serkan Kaya', null, 'On a Friday afternoon, there was an unexpected knock on the door of the staff room of a city high school. An ambitious father is willing to go to extremes to get his son admitted to high school. The six teachers who are still at school so shortly before the start of the weekend now have to find out the hard way. After some unexpected twists and embarrassing revelations, true abysses open up for everyone involved...', 'On a Friday afternoon, there was an unexpected knock on the door of the staff room of a city high school. An ambitious father is willing to go to extremes to get his son admitted to high school. The six teachers who are still at school so shortly before the start of the weekend now have to find out the hard way. After some unexpected twists and embarrassing revelations, true abysses open up for everyone involved...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhCc7kLUjEN4k1rD6E8vZfOWrtw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916563'),
  ('363083412238815087', 'Locked on You', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Kıvanç Baruönü', 'Ata Demirer', 'Ata Demirer, Demet Akbağ, Gonca Vuslateri, İlker Aksum, Hakan Salınmış, Tarık Ünlüoğlu, Erkan Can, İştar Gökseven', null, 'A meatball seller gets into trouble so flees Istanbul to find a new life on a beautiful island.', 'A meatball seller gets into trouble so flees Istanbul to find a new life on a beautiful island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJupNNaXSAVKGrjHfC6djjh62jD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566067'),
  ('377219025140221290', 'Locked Out', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Albert Dupontel, Benoît Debie', 'Guillaume Laurant, Albert Dupontel', 'Albert Dupontel, Claude Perron, Nicolas Marié, Hélène Vincent, Yolande Moreau, Bouli Lanners, Bruno Lochet, Serge Riaboukine', null, 'Once upon a time, somewhere... a homeless guy finds a policeman''s uniform...', 'Once upon a time, somewhere... a homeless guy finds a policeman''s uniform...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PgKhKkyXYh9WR36O2jYu7jFHkR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13728'),
  ('421391322223986990', 'Locked Up', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Jörg Andreas', 'Peter Oehl, Jörg Andreas', 'Marcel Schlutt, Nelson Keys, Ralf Steel, David Parik, Pedro Sobisch, Ulrike Schirm, Michael Busch, Andreas Bernhardt', null, 'Dennis is a new inmate. Mike is an older black inmate. Together the two face hostile prison officals and inmates in their attempts to become a loving couple.', 'Dennis is a new inmate. Mike is an older black inmate. Together the two face hostile prison officals and inmates in their attempts to become a loving couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wT84VDo47hvfQc8NtQhJ2XnMfRW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47645'),
  ('198131247331183464', 'Lockout', 2012, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Stephen St. Leger, Frank Walsh, James Mather', 'Luc Besson, Stephen St. Leger, James Mather', 'Guy Pearce, Maggie Grace, Vincent Regan, Joseph Gilgun, Lennie James, Peter Stormare, Jacky Ido, Tim Plester', 'PG-13', 'Set in the near future, Lockout follows a falsely convicted ex-government agent , whose one chance at obtaining freedom lies in the dangerous mission of rescuing the President''s daughter from rioting convicts at an outer space maximum security prison.', 'Set in the near future, Lockout follows a falsely convicted ex-government agent , whose one chance at obtaining freedom lies in the dangerous mission of rescuing the President''s daughter from rioting convicts at an outer space maximum security prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5QfNIcg6hc327IWUerea0EczP4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81796'),
  ('58439843949740207', 'Locksmith’s Debt', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Bedran Güzel, Veli Kuzlu', 'İbrahim Büyükak, Zeynep Koçak', 'İbrahim Büyükak, Zeynep Koçak, Gupse Özay, Cengiz Bozkurt, Erdal Tosun, Cezmi Baskın, Olgun Toker, Ünal Yeter', null, 'After his father’s death, poor Berhudar is left dealing with his father’s huge debt to the mob. In one of his many attempts to find a way out of his problem, he meets Ezel. He hopes she will help him get out of the mess he is in. Little does he know the she’s dealing with a very similar trouble...', 'After his father’s death, poor Berhudar is left dealing with his father’s huge debt to the mob. In one of his many attempts to find a way out of his problem, he meets Ezel. He hopes she will help him get out of the mess he is in. Little does he know the she’s dealing with a very similar trouble...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3KvLx4SugUpyi71wP7zXaQ2m7m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391649'),
  ('565770757565817608', 'Loco Fever', 2001, 'Drama', 'Andrés Wood, M.I. Littin-Menz', 'Gilberto Villarroel, Andrés Wood, René Arcos', 'Tamara Acosta, Mariana Loyola, Patricia López, Carmen Barros, Chamila Rodríguez, Pablo Striano, Emilio Bardi, Cristián Chaparro', null, 'When the Chilean officials lift the ban on harvesting the shellfish "el loco" (which purportedly is an aphrodisiac) in the seaside village of Puerto Gala greed and lust take hold. Greed is embodied by Carlos Maldonato, "El Canuto," who attempts to buy all of the shellfish for a Japanese company, and by a traveling band of prostitutes that accompany the influx of fishermen. El Canuto also wrangles to get into good stead with an old flame, Sonia, who is now the proprietor of "La Pincoya," a local restaurant. But "el loco" proves more effective, and more damaging, than anyone could have guessed.', 'When the Chilean officials lift the ban on harvesting the shellfish "el loco" (which purportedly is an aphrodisiac) in the seaside village of Puerto Gala greed and lust take hold. Greed is embodied by Carlos Maldonato, "El Canuto," who attempts to buy all of the shellfish for a Japanese company, and by a traveling band of prostitutes that accompany the influx of fishermen. El Canuto also wrangles to get into good stead with an old flame, Sonia, who is now the proprietor of "La Pincoya," a local restaurant. But "el loco" proves more effective, and more damaging, than anyone could have guessed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzNjQ3BmevZL9RAttLMp48ocrWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44517'),
  ('24843038587850445', 'Loco Love', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'José Luis Gutiérrez, Héctor Maeshiro, Fernando Sariñana', 'Diego Gutiérrez', 'Evan Deverian, Melany Bennett, Jordan Wilson, Adan Rocha, Jaime Aymerich, Natasha Esca, Ethan Martin Estrada, Alexa Mansour', null, 'A young man and woman fall in love but are threatened to be torn apart by the tensions between their Latino and Caucasian communities in Arizona.', 'A young man and woman fall in love but are threatened to be torn apart by the tensions between their Latino and Caucasian communities in Arizona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pODwJjfNqEwBuqheZ3yVFMah5J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488446'),
  ('766675864671760278', 'Loco por vos', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Diego Jimenez Tafur, Felipe Martínez Amador', 'Mateo Stivelberg, Camilo Fonseca, Valeria Gómez', 'Laura Londoño, Roberto Urbina, Raúl Ocampo, Monica Lopera, Julián Arango', null, 'Lucas and Simón, friends who work in a creative agency in Bogotá, throw a party as a favor to their boss, Johana. There, Lucas meets Lina, Johana''s paisa cousin who travels to Bogotá to get a visa and go to study fashion design in the United States. Madly in love, Lucas travels to Medellin to try to conquer Lina, where he will realize that Before conquering her, she will have to conquer her paisa family.', 'Lucas and Simón, friends who work in a creative agency in Bogotá, throw a party as a favor to their boss, Johana. There, Lucas meets Lina, Johana''s paisa cousin who travels to Bogotá to get a visa and go to study fashion design in the United States. Madly in love, Lucas travels to Medellin to try to conquer Lina, where he will realize that Before conquering her, she will have to conquer her paisa family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCknM93iXmPorUxb51cGn0qTxnd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661095'),
  ('251870067623879912', 'Locos por el sexo', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Javier Rebollo Fernández', null, 'Jordi Vilches, Karra Elejalde, Inma del Moral, Guillermo Montesinos, Manuel Manquiña, Mónica Naranjo', null, 'Nono is a young schizophrenic who believes himself destined to stop the global arms race. He has always lived alone with his overwhelming mother, now he meets crazy Ramon.', 'Nono is a young schizophrenic who believes himself destined to stop the global arms race. He has always lived alone with his overwhelming mother, now he meets crazy Ramon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73vSxvLiCypoV26dcDAjSNmsclo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339761'),
  ('955995375230615404', 'Locura de amor', 1948, 'Drama, History', 'Juan de Orduña, Sebastián Almeida, Fortunato Bernal', 'Carlos Blanco, Manuel Tamayo Castro, Alfredo Echegaray', 'Aurora Bautista, Fernando Rey, Sara Montiel, Jorge Mistral, Jesús Tordesillas, Manuel Luna, Juan Espantaleón, Ricardo Acero', null, 'The passion that Joan of Castile, daughter of the Catholic Kings and heir to the throne, feels for her husband, Philip the Handsome, sovereign of the Netherlands and son of Maximilian of Austria and Mary of Burgundy, is not reciprocated. Her temperament, her jealousy and an unexpected tragedy will throw Joan into the dark realm of madness and obsession with death, the only realm where she will be a true queen…', 'The passion that Joan of Castile, daughter of the Catholic Kings and heir to the throne, feels for her husband, Philip the Handsome, sovereign of the Netherlands and son of Maximilian of Austria and Mary of Burgundy, is not reciprocated. Her temperament, her jealousy and an unexpected tragedy will throw Joan into the dark realm of madness and obsession with death, the only realm where she will be a true queen…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKTLT0p8EPjDB1t1CyuQOoVg802.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209899'),
  ('337597165005196450', 'Locust', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Egor Baranov, Mikhail Alekseev, Anton Safronov', 'Oleg Malovichko', 'Pyotr Fyodorov, Paulina Andreeva, Dmitriy Shevchenko, Ekaterina Volkova, Evgeniya Dmitrieva, Evgeniy Stychkin, Oleksiy Horbunov, Aleksandr Golubkov', 'R', 'The innocent summer affair began as a love story between two young people. Lera and Artem could not break it off, as well as they didn`t have enough of faith, patience and desire to overcome all the obstacles on their life path. The Locust Generation wants to have all at once. The Locust generation will sweep everything on its way. The affair began as a naive young love and passion will turn into a series of bloody assassinations.', 'The innocent summer affair began as a love story between two young people. Lera and Artem could not break it off, as well as they didn`t have enough of faith, patience and desire to overcome all the obstacles on their life path. The Locust Generation wants to have all at once. The Locust generation will sweep everything on its way. The affair began as a naive young love and passion will turn into a series of bloody assassinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyNuAe2lyKfdxPdAz8MsoqPTtxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371507'),
  ('270617315963876636', 'Locusts: The 8th Plague', 2005, 'Drama, Horror', 'Ian Gilmour, Lorenzo Senatore', 'D.R. Rosen', 'Dan Cortese, Julie Benz, David Keith, Kirk B.R. Woller, Jeff Fahey, Atanas Srebrev, Hristo Mitzkov, Mariana Stansheva', 'R', 'A group of scientists try to stop a swarm of flesh-eating locusts that escape from a top secret government lab in the USA Midwest.', 'A group of scientists try to stop a swarm of flesh-eating locusts that escape from a top secret government lab in the USA Midwest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qh1Unq8GP1u8LSD3ORKSd3lFUuO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49877'),
  ('915274084198830548', 'Loev', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sudhanshu Saria', null, 'Shiv Panditt, Dhruv Ganesh, Rishab Chadha, Siddharth Menon', null, 'When hot shot, Wall Street dealmaker Jai thinks of putting some pleasure into his 48 hour business trip to Mumbai, Sahil, his young, music-producer friend, drops everything, including his reckless boyfriend Alex, to help him execute the perfect getaway. Hiking the hills and canyons of Maharashtra, amidst half-attempted conversations and sudden silences, business calls and old jokes, the friends discover there is more than just time-zones keeping them apart. Things take another turn when Alex shows up with a new male-companion at his side, throwing up old conflicts and bringing unanswered questions to the fore.', 'When hot shot, Wall Street dealmaker Jai thinks of putting some pleasure into his 48 hour business trip to Mumbai, Sahil, his young, music-producer friend, drops everything, including his reckless boyfriend Alex, to help him execute the perfect getaway. Hiking the hills and canyons of Maharashtra, amidst half-attempted conversations and sudden silences, business calls and old jokes, the friends discover there is more than just time-zones keeping them apart. Things take another turn when Alex shows up with a new male-companion at his side, throwing up old conflicts and bringing unanswered questions to the fore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8joulbNy1LlJpT9xrGvS8KgjAC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381070'),
  ('82936928507016719', 'Loft', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Yasutaka Mori, Akiko Ashizawa', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Miki Nakatani, Etsushi Toyokawa, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Yumi Adachi, Sawa Suzuki, Haruhiko Kato, Noriko Eguchi, Ren Osugi', null, 'A writer retreats to a secluded suburban house to work on her new novel. But her attention is instead occupied by her archaeologist neighbor''s newly discovered mummy and a ghostly presence in her house.', 'A writer retreats to a secluded suburban house to work on her new novel. But her attention is instead occupied by her archaeologist neighbor''s newly discovered mummy and a ghostly presence in her house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTCLWAwriIn66jseKQwGBd838nk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40592'),
  ('173362856815278125', 'Loft', 2008, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Erik Van Looy, Danny Elsen, Senne Dehandschutter', 'Bart De Pauw', 'Koen De Bouw, Filip Peeters, Matthias Schoenaerts, Bruno Vanden Broecke, Veerle Baetens, Koen De Graeve, Marie Vinck, Tine Reymer', null, 'Five close friends, all of them married, share a loft to meet their mistresses. One day they find the body of a young woman in the loft. Since there are only five keys to the loft, the five men begin to suspect each other of murder.', 'Five close friends, all of them married, share a loft to meet their mistresses. One day they find the body of a young woman in the loft. Since there are only five keys to the loft, the five men begin to suspect each other of murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbFwIV5cxwMD3qUPiU91kfALTjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17845'),
  ('321168800490323347', 'Loft', 2010, 'Thriller', 'Antoinette Beumer, Danny Elsen, Anne Mevissen', 'Bart De Pauw', 'Fedja van Huêt, Barry Atsma, Jeroen van Koningsbrugge, Gijs Naber, Marwan Kenzari, Anna Drijver, Sallie Harmsen, Kim van Kooten', null, 'Five best friends, all married, decide to share a loft apartment. In this loft they meet their mistresses and conquests. Everything seems perfect, until one morning the body of an unknown young woman is found in the loft. The group of friends begin to suspect each other and it soon becomes clear that they know far less about each other than they had initially thought.', 'Five best friends, all married, decide to share a loft apartment. In this loft they meet their mistresses and conquests. Everything seems perfect, until one morning the body of an unknown young woman is found in the loft. The group of friends begin to suspect each other and it soon becomes clear that they know far less about each other than they had initially thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhqmSGgVKsQskcBHcudkzBXoujx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57059'),
  ('728784445441692375', 'Logan', 2017, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'James Mangold, John Mathieson, Chris Farmer', 'Michael Green, Scott Frank, James Mangold', 'Hugh Jackman, Dafne Keen, Patrick Stewart, Elizabeth Rodriguez, Boyd Holbrook, Stephen Merchant, Richard E. Grant, Stephen Dunlevy', 'R', 'In the near future, a weary Logan cares for an ailing Professor X in a hideout on the Mexican border. But Logan''s attempts to hide from the world and his legacy are upended when a young mutant arrives, pursued by dark forces.', 'In the near future, a weary Logan cares for an ailing Professor X in a hideout on the Mexican border. But Logan''s attempts to hide from the world and his legacy are upended when a young mutant arrives, pursued by dark forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnbjcRDYn6YviCcePDnGdyAkYsB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263115'),
