  ('518584251985264898', 'Logout', 2025, 'Thriller', 'Amit Golani, Pooja S Gupte, Vaibhav Vishant', 'Biswapati Sarkar', 'Babil Khan, Gandharv Dewan, Nimisha Nair, Rasika Dugal, Bhuvan Bam', null, 'Pratyush, a social media influencer who is about to reach his biggest milestone in terms of followers to land a deal with a brand, loses his phone to a fan obsessed with him. Trapped in his own house without his phone, Pratyush must find a way to reclaim his identity and his career.', 'Pratyush, a social media influencer who is about to reach his biggest milestone in terms of followers to land a deal with a brand, loses his phone to a fan obsessed with him. Trapped in his own house without his phone, Pratyush must find a way to reclaim his identity and his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBM6DqjVbuY5y44d96mb9QVcAqr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1386801'),
