  ('89045915001879744', 'Lokah Chapter 1: Chandra', 2025, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Dominic Arun, Nimish Ravi, Vivek Anirudh', 'Dominic Arun, Santhy Balachandran', 'Kalyani Priyadarshan, Naslen K. Gafoor, Sandy, Chandu Salimkumar, Arun Kurian, Vijayaraghavan, Sarath Sabha, Bibin Perumbily', 'NR', 'The story follows Chandra , a mysterious, goth-influenced woman who has just moved to Bangalore and begins working night shifts at a café. Across the road from her apartment live Sunny and Venu, two aimless bachelors. Sunny becomes infatuated with Chandra, observing her odd routines, strange visitors, and reclusive nature. Their dynamic changes when Sunny gets a glimpse of Chandra in her act.', 'The story follows Chandra , a mysterious, goth-influenced woman who has just moved to Bangalore and begins working night shifts at a café. Across the road from her apartment live Sunny and Venu, two aimless bachelors. Sunny becomes infatuated with Chandra, observing her odd routines, strange visitors, and reclusive nature. Their dynamic changes when Sunny gets a glimpse of Chandra in her act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRn6is4m5sikO1rSoCoRT2rYtXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290190'),
  ('342576649913903727', 'Loki: Arnaldo Baptista', 2009, 'Documentary, Music', 'Marco Moreira, Paulo Henrique Fontenelle', 'Paulo Henrique Fontenelle', 'Arnaldo Baptista, Rita Lee, Sérgio Dias, Os Mutantes, Tom Zé, Lobão, Aluizer Malab, Lucinha Barbosa', null, 'Loki brings the trajectory of Arnaldo Baptista from childhood, passing through the most successful phase as leader of the Mutantes, marriage to singer Rita Lee and then separation. He also goes through the depression that devastated his life after the group ended and that led him to attempt suicide, his solo career, rapprochement with his brother and member of the Mutantes, Sérgio Dias, culminating in the band''s return in 2006.', 'Loki brings the trajectory of Arnaldo Baptista from childhood, passing through the most successful phase as leader of the Mutantes, marriage to singer Rita Lee and then separation. He also goes through the depression that devastated his life after the group ended and that led him to attempt suicide, his solo career, rapprochement with his brother and member of the Mutantes, Sérgio Dias, culminating in the band''s return in 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYl39kCMjP37e39CbJqxWHvf1ez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62717'),
  ('1026523148668362287', 'Lokillo: Nothing''s the Same', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Yedinson Flórez, Julián Gaviria', 'Yedinson Flórez', 'Yedinson Flórez', null, 'Through songs and puns, comedian Lokillo Florez hilariously reviews how Latin Americans have adjusted to a new world where no-hugging policies prevail.', 'Through songs and puns, comedian Lokillo Florez hilariously reviews how Latin Americans have adjusted to a new world where no-hugging policies prevail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aq0a9qdBVgWKVCy2OlFdZOCj3Iw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:857910'),
  ('907915454052384946', 'Lokis: A Manuscript of Professor Wittembach', 1970, 'Fantasy, Horror, History', 'Janusz Majewski, Halina Garus, Mirosław Salicki', 'Janusz Majewski', 'Józef Duriasz, Edmund Fetting, Gustaw Lutkiewicz, Małgorzata Braunek, Zofia Mrozowska, Hanna Stankówna, Władysław Dewoyno, Witold Holtz', null, 'A pastor and ethnographer visits a remote corner of 19th-century Lithuania where folk customs associated with the area''s pagan past still have a hold on the population.', 'A pastor and ethnographer visits a remote corner of 19th-century Lithuania where folk customs associated with the area''s pagan past still have a hold on the population.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGXPYRMAUjUOY3iMpWAmH3GQvzU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83193'),
  ('312738178530332083', 'LOL', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Joe Swanberg, Joe Swanberg', 'Kevin Bewersdorf, Joe Swanberg, C. Mason Wells', 'Joe Swanberg, Greta Gerwig, Tipper Newton, C. Mason Wells, Kevin Bewersdorf, Brigid Reagan, Kate Winterich, Mike Hagan', null, 'The relationships of three men are examined through their use of technology.', 'The relationships of three men are examined through their use of technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNlTN77u8XVzXCnxRl8lVpWUdYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44434'),
  ('837984036897645540', 'LOL', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Lisa Azuelos, Jolian Blevins, Yann Sobezynski', 'Lisa Azuelos, Nans Delgado', 'Miley Cyrus, Demi Moore, Douglas Booth, Ashley Greene, Ashley Hinshaw, Thomas Jane, Nora Dunn, Jay Hernandez', 'PG-13', 'In a world connected by YouTube, iTunes, and Facebook, Lola and her friends navigate the peer pressures of high school romance and friendship while dodging their sometimes overbearing and confused parents. When Lola''s mom, Anne, "accidentally" reads her teenage daughter''s racy journal, she realizes just how wide their communication gap has grown.', 'In a world connected by YouTube, iTunes, and Facebook, Lola and her friends navigate the peer pressures of high school romance and friendship while dodging their sometimes overbearing and confused parents. When Lola''s mom, Anne, "accidentally" reads her teenage daughter''s racy journal, she realizes just how wide their communication gap has grown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlnBUoKzzPnczrzzxuh0SYwDa3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80271'),
  ('1131650982776754385', 'LOL (Laughing Out Loud)', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Lisa Azuelos, Nathaniel Aron, Sébastien Deux', 'Nans Delgado, Lisa Azuelos', 'Sophie Marceau, Christa Théret, Jérémy Kapone, Marion Chabassol, Lou Lesage, Émile Bertherat, Félix Moati, Louis Sommer', 'NR', 'Lola is a striking teenaged girl who is on the cusp of adulthood and longs to rush into the adult world of independence, freedom and sexual exploits, but is tenaciously held back by her mother.', 'Lola is a striking teenaged girl who is on the cusp of adulthood and longs to rush into the adult world of independence, freedom and sexual exploits, but is tenaciously held back by her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqAlMlnCh2pTaM7us9bO2WlODEY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21861'),
  ('418613764265574905', 'LOL 2.0: Anne’s Golden Hour', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Lisa Azuelos, Gilles Porte, Lionel Mathis', 'Lisa Azuelos, Frédéric Da, Thaïs Alessandrin', 'Sophie Marceau, Thaïs Alessandrin, Vincent Elbaz, Alexandre Astier, Françoise Fabian, Victor Belmondo, Jérémy Kapone, Théo Delincak', null, 'At 55, Anne is finally enjoying her freedom after her children leave home. But everything changes when her 23-year-old daughter, Louise, moves back in with her after a professional and romantic failure. And to make matters worse, her son, Théo, announces that she''s going to be a grandmother! Anne realizes that life never goes as planned and that, at any age, we are still learning to grow up.', 'At 55, Anne is finally enjoying her freedom after her children leave home. But everything changes when her 23-year-old daughter, Louise, moves back in with her after a professional and romantic failure. And to make matters worse, her son, Théo, announces that she''s going to be a grandmother! Anne realizes that life never goes as planned and that, at any age, we are still learning to grow up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8b4pjaQTspOOacfB6bGYFy8BCda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1477170'),
  ('818249179594087649', 'LOL Surprise: The Movie', 2021, 'Animation, Family', 'Alex Kamb', 'Julia Prescott', 'Ayla Rae Neal, Sonya Krueger, Ashley Angione, Tickwanya Jones, Paris Anderson, Sabrina Fest, Sarah J. Bartholomew, Tommi Rose', 'G', 'Dazzling doll sisters Queen Bee and Royal Bee make their first movie with help from their fashionable friends in this one-of-a-kind magical adventure.', 'Dazzling doll sisters Queen Bee and Royal Bee make their first movie with help from their fashionable friends in this one-of-a-kind magical adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbc8H3SR3BM6TZkJw6UBN4ekdjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:882206'),
  ('1013119157753267824', 'Lola', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Demy, Bernard Toublanc-Michel, Denis Mornet', 'Jacques Demy', 'Anouk Aimée, Marc Michel, Jacques Harden, Alan Scott, Élina Labourdette, Margo Lion, Annie Duperoux, Catherine Lutz', 'PG-13', 'A bored young man meets with his former girlfriend, now a cabaret dancer and single mother, and soon finds himself falling back in love with her.', 'A bored young man meets with his former girlfriend, now a cabaret dancer and single mother, and soon finds himself falling back in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVLkdkTVV10fLrTPyOCBE6alwLD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40641'),
  ('962612155554014544', 'Lola', 1964, 'Drama', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Nikos Kavoukidis, Pantelis Voulgaris', 'Ilias Lyberopoulos', 'Jenny Karezi, Nikos Kourkoulos, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Pantelis Zervos, Nikos Fermas, Spyros Kalogirou, Giannis Vogiatzis, Anestis Vlahos', null, 'Aris, Nikos Kourkoulos, is released from prison after three years, and he turns up at Troumpa, a slum area in Piraeus. His purpose is not to settle his own accounts but to find out if Lola (Tzeni Karezi), a young woman who works at Stelios’ cabaret, was among the ones who betrayed him. Aris loves and cares about Lola and wants to get her out of there, but Stelios, who is also in love with her, assigns a thug to kill Aris.', 'Aris, Nikos Kourkoulos, is released from prison after three years, and he turns up at Troumpa, a slum area in Piraeus. His purpose is not to settle his own accounts but to find out if Lola (Tzeni Karezi), a young woman who works at Stelios’ cabaret, was among the ones who betrayed him. Aris loves and cares about Lola and wants to get her out of there, but Stelios, who is also in love with her, assigns a thug to kill Aris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1h19uIzMGu8e8V5yuljKGToP2F8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276623'),
  ('1043289981887782487', 'Lola', 1981, 'Drama', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Xaver Schwarzenberger, Karin Viesel', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Pea Fröhlich, Peter Märthesheimer', 'Barbara Sukowa, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Mario Adorf, Matthias Fuchs, Helga Feddersen, Karin Baal, Ivan Desny, Elisabeth Volkmann', null, 'Germany in the autumn of 1957: Lola, a seductive cabaret singer-prostitute exults in her power as a temptress of men, but she wants out—she wants money, property, and love. Pitting a corrupt building contractor against the new straight-arrow building commissioner, Lola launches an outrageous plan to elevate herself in a world where everything, and everyone, is for sale. Shot in childlike candy colors, Fassbinder’s homage to Josef von Sternberg’s classic The Blue Angel stands as a satiric tribute to capitalism.', 'Germany in the autumn of 1957: Lola, a seductive cabaret singer-prostitute exults in her power as a temptress of men, but she wants out—she wants money, property, and love. Pitting a corrupt building contractor against the new straight-arrow building commissioner, Lola launches an outrageous plan to elevate herself in a world where everything, and everyone, is for sale. Shot in childlike candy colors, Fassbinder’s homage to Josef von Sternberg’s classic The Blue Angel stands as a satiric tribute to capitalism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZqgDP5kRqh2eaPj5uLzYEbWz40.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2264'),
  ('1095612409546491246', 'Lola', 1986, 'Drama', 'Bigas Luna, Josep M. Civit, Alexandra Palau', 'Bigas Luna, Luis Herce, Enrique Viciano', 'Ángela Molina, Féodor Atkine, Assumpta Serna, Patrick Bauchau, Constantino Romero, Pepa López, Ariadna Gil, Marta Almirall', null, 'Lola is a young woman who works in a factory. She lives a violent and tormented love with Mario. To get away from him, Lola moved to Barcelona. There he met Robert, CEO of a major company, with whom she starts a relationship.', 'Lola is a young woman who works in a factory. She lives a violent and tormented love with Mario. To get away from him, Lola moved to Barcelona. There he met Robert, CEO of a major company, with whom she starts a relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sychqupIHyMDDBiOqKjVxo36CFX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96201'),
  ('801042424439322950', 'Lola', 2024, 'Drama', 'Madeline Leach, Nicola Peltz Beckham', 'Nicola Peltz Beckham', 'Nicola Peltz Beckham, Virginia Madsen, Luke David Blumm, Raven Goodwin, Richie Merritt, Trevor Long, Will Peltz, James Aaron Oliver', null, '19-year-old Lola James is trying to work to save enough money to get her beloved little brother, Arlo, out of their toxic home. Until one tragic night, when her whole world gets uprooted. From that moment on, nothing will ever be the same.', '19-year-old Lola James is trying to work to save enough money to get her beloved little brother, Arlo, out of their toxic home. Until one tragic night, when her whole world gets uprooted. From that moment on, nothing will ever be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCc3u1NXeHIgT8NyIOoZuoPUIxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818861'),
  ('573422457668518866', 'LOLA', 2023, 'Drama, Science Fiction, War', 'Andrew Legge, Oona Menges, Sarah Beth Moylan', 'Andrew Legge, Angeli Macfarlane', 'Emma Appleton, Stefanie Martini, Rory Fleck-Byrne, Aaron Monaghan, Theodora Brabazon Legge, Francesca Brabazon Legge, Eva O''Brien, Chacha Seigne', null, 'Sussex, England, 1938. Shortly before the outbreak of World War II, Thomasina and Martha Hanbury, two ingenious sisters, create LOLA, a miraculous machine.', 'Sussex, England, 1938. Shortly before the outbreak of World War II, Thomasina and Martha Hanbury, two ingenious sisters, create LOLA, a miraculous machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IQEDnHKMvzforhtQW9mwW5kSHB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:941019'),
  ('521139283853987564', 'Lola and Billy the Kid', 1999, 'Drama', 'Chris Squires, Kutluğ Ataman', 'Kutluğ Ataman', 'Baki Davrak, Gandi Mukli, Erdal Yıldız, Michael Gerber, Murat Yılmaz, Inge Keller, Celal Perk, Mesut Ozdemir', null, 'Lola is part of “The Migrant Workers”, a Turkish drag queen troupe who perform to great acclaim. Lola’s gay little brother Murat, on the other hand, is just beginning his search for an identity. An intense family drama set in “Anatolian” Berlin-Kreuzberg.', 'Lola is part of “The Migrant Workers”, a Turkish drag queen troupe who perform to great acclaim. Lola’s gay little brother Murat, on the other hand, is just beginning his search for an identity. An intense family drama set in “Anatolian” Berlin-Kreuzberg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hgHYisTryPMx6GIG2o5BUXURUt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162234'),
  ('793837175119902503', 'Lola and Her Brothers', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Léonard Vindry, Christophe Offenstein', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, David Foenkinos', 'Ludivine Sagnier, José Garcia, Jean-Paul Rouve, Ramzy Bedia, Pauline Clément, Marion Ploquin, Pierre Diot, Aurore Broutin', null, 'Lola has two brothers: Benoit, who is getting married for the third time, and Pierre, who shows up late for the wedding. Excuses, reproaches, arguments, misunderstandings... beneath it all, they''re just doing their best to live their own lives. Benoit is about to become a father, but he''s not ready yet. Lola meets Zoher while she''s still going through her divorce. Pierre''s professional problems take a turn for the worse. Though everything in their lives seems to be pulling them apart, the three of them stick together - an inseparable trio.', 'Lola has two brothers: Benoit, who is getting married for the third time, and Pierre, who shows up late for the wedding. Excuses, reproaches, arguments, misunderstandings... beneath it all, they''re just doing their best to live their own lives. Benoit is about to become a father, but he''s not ready yet. Lola meets Zoher while she''s still going through her divorce. Pierre''s professional problems take a turn for the worse. Though everything in their lives seems to be pulling them apart, the three of them stick together - an inseparable trio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQBNI6atiQdSkym9R5ewIkDeKbv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543633'),
  ('1056206467526161148', 'Lola and the Sea', 2019, 'Drama', 'Laurent Micheli, Olivier Boonjing', 'Laurent Micheli', 'Mya Bollaers, Benoît Magimel, Els Deceukelier, Sami Outalbali, Jeremie Zagba, Anemone Valcke, Adriana Da Fonseca, Delphine Bibet', null, 'Just when Lola, 18 years old and transgender, learns that she can finally have surgery, her mother, who is her only financial support, passes away. Abiding by her mother’s last wishes, Lola and her father, who are permanently in conflict and have not seen each other for two years, undertake a journey all the way to the Belgian coast. They realize the outcome of the journey may not be the one they were both expecting...', 'Just when Lola, 18 years old and transgender, learns that she can finally have surgery, her mother, who is her only financial support, passes away. Abiding by her mother’s last wishes, Lola and her father, who are permanently in conflict and have not seen each other for two years, undertake a journey all the way to the Belgian coast. They realize the outcome of the journey may not be the one they were both expecting...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dEpGBHc274ml9nyBHd1JK1dicr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617299'),
  ('304195922180569704', 'Lola Montès', 1955, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Max Ophüls, Jacques Météhen, Marcel Ophüls', 'Max Ophüls, Jacques Natanson, Franz Geiger', 'Martine Carol, Peter Ustinov, Anton Walbrook, Henri Guisol, Lise Delamare, Paulette Dubost, Oskar Werner, Jean Galland', null, 'Lola Montes, previously a great adventuress, is reduced to being the attraction of a circus after having been the lover of various important men.', 'Lola Montes, previously a great adventuress, is reduced to being the attraction of a circus after having been the lover of various important men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycePcddfSvqaalyPxMvFYT5D8wV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35987'),
  ('255111744647143955', 'Lola Pater', 2017, 'Drama', 'Nadir Moknèche, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Nadir Moknèche', 'Fanny Ardant, Tewfik Jallab, Nadia Kaci, Véronique Dumont, Bruno Sanches, Lucie Debay, Lubna Azabal, Lawrence Valin', null, 'When his mother dies, Zino decides to look for his father, Farid. But twenty-five years ago, Farid became Lola.', 'When his mother dies, Zino decides to look for his father, Farid. But twenty-five years ago, Farid became Lola.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jx24P8XkkCsLVxaQmTuIJBMX2q5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446037'),
  ('464759282681153064', 'Lola the Truck Driver', 1983, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Raúl Fernández', 'Rolando Fernández, Carlos Valdemar', 'Rosa Gloria Chagoyán, Rolando Fernández, Irma Serrano, Emilio Fernández, Edna Bolkan, Milton Rodríguez, Carlos East, Famie Kaufman', null, 'Lola finds herself into the world of violence and drug trafficking when her father is murdered for refusing to put his truck to the service of a powerful cartel, with protections at high police levels. Knowing the local officials will not serve out justice, she takes matters into her own hands. Armed with a machine gun, she''ll attempt to get revenge by her own hands - but the enemy has more firepower than her.', 'Lola finds herself into the world of violence and drug trafficking when her father is murdered for refusing to put his truck to the service of a powerful cartel, with protections at high police levels. Knowing the local officials will not serve out justice, she takes matters into her own hands. Armed with a machine gun, she''ll attempt to get revenge by her own hands - but the enemy has more firepower than her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SvIBQhVGz5tWXJe1xn2u5cij8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295152'),
  ('195910190763076515', 'Lola the Truck Driver 3', 1991, 'Crime, Action, Comedy', 'Raúl Fernández Jr.', 'Rolando Fernández, Raúl Fernández Jr.', 'Rosa Gloria Chagoyán, Manuel ''Flaco'' Ibáñez, Luis Aguilar, David Fuentes, Rolando Fernández, Frank Moro', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nD62QZJwha3DsQw76Qdju3PeUTY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403053'),
  ('209190760496031702', 'Lola Versus', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Daryl Wein, Jakob Ihre', 'Zoe Lister-Jones, Daryl Wein', 'Greta Gerwig, Joel Kinnaman, Zoe Lister-Jones, Hamish Linklater, Bill Pullman, Debra Winger, Maria Dizzia, Jonathan Sale', 'R', 'Just three weeks before her wedding, Lola''s longtime fiance, Luke, dumps her. With her 30th birthday looming and being forced to re-enter the New York City dating scene, she feels adrift in a cold world. She leans on her friends for support but, after a series of romantic humiliations, professional blunders and boozy antics, Lola realizes that she alone is in charge of her fate.', 'Just three weeks before her wedding, Lola''s longtime fiance, Luke, dumps her. With her 30th birthday looming and being forced to re-enter the New York City dating scene, she feels adrift in a cold world. She leans on her friends for support but, after a series of romantic humiliations, professional blunders and boozy antics, Lola realizes that she alone is in charge of her fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnPAvlWX3HhHC8HlQWKJHgLrwVD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100529'),
  ('905743069275989885', 'Lola: The Movie', 2007, 'Drama, Family', 'Miguel Hermoso', 'Antonio Onetti', 'Gala Évora, José Luis García Pérez, Carlos Hipólito, Ana Fernández, Alfonso Begara, Álvaro Morte', null, 'The rise to stardom of Lola Flores, one of Spain''s most prestigious Flamenco singers and dancers, who died in 1995.', 'The rise to stardom of Lola Flores, one of Spain''s most prestigious Flamenco singers and dancers, who died in 1995.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csAl3sIApWOSHCmXTH5J1zXLCxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156253'),
