  ('366962679540813478', 'Lolida 2000', 1998, 'Science Fiction', 'Cybil Richards, Andrea V. Rossotto, Franklin A. Vallette', 'Cybil Richards', 'Jacqueline Lovell, David Squires, Sky Nicholas, Robert John, Heather James, Eric Acsell, Gabriella Hall, Taylor St. Claire', 'NR', 'Sex is banned but Lolita becomes a sexual rebel and broadcasts erotic adventures throughout the universe while satisfying her own forbidden fantasies.', 'Sex is banned but Lolita becomes a sexual rebel and broadcasts erotic adventures throughout the universe while satisfying her own forbidden fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAbNmF13b8WFjGSlU6eSzCUkuJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156659'),
  ('1146945140781064483', 'Lolita', 1962, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Oswald Morris, Stanley Kubrick, René Dupont', 'Vladimir Nabokov', 'James Mason, Shelley Winters, Sue Lyon, Gary Cockrell, Jerry Stovin, Diana Decker, Lois Maxwell, Cec Linder', 'NR', 'Humbert Humbert is a middle-aged British novelist who is both appalled by and attracted to the vulgarity of American culture. When he comes to stay at the boarding house run by Charlotte Haze, he soon becomes obsessed with Lolita, the woman''s teenaged daughter.', 'Humbert Humbert is a middle-aged British novelist who is both appalled by and attracted to the vulgarity of American culture. When he comes to stay at the boarding house run by Charlotte Haze, he soon becomes obsessed with Lolita, the woman''s teenaged daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Puqbeh0D95DpXFWep1rmH78btu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802'),
