  ('45329925351226314', 'Lolita: Vibrator Torture', 1987, 'Crime, Horror', 'Hisayasu Satō, Toshihiko Uryu, Takaaki Hashiguchi', 'Shirō Yumeno', 'Sayaka Kimura, Rio Yanagawa, Kiyomi Itō, Yutaka Ikejima, Yûko Suwano, Ayako Toyama, Takeshi Itō, Shūji Kataoka', null, 'High school student Kozue spreads flyers in search of her missing classmate. A psychopath lures her to his place, where he imprisons her. The psychopath gets his kicks by raping his victims with a chrome vibrator, poisoning them then photographing them as they die. However, when Kozue doesn’t act like his typical victims they start up a strange and twisted relationship.', 'High school student Kozue spreads flyers in search of her missing classmate. A psychopath lures her to his place, where he imprisons her. The psychopath gets his kicks by raping his victims with a chrome vibrator, poisoning them then photographing them as they die. However, when Kozue doesn’t act like his typical victims they start up a strange and twisted relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0GU6CNcUMhoZlx2GZVjNc83Ehe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105621'),
  ('154149661368929434', 'Lolita''s Club', 2007, 'Drama', 'Vicente Aranda, José Luis Alcaine', 'Vicente Aranda', 'Eduardo Noriega, Flora Martínez, Belén Fabra, Héctor Colomé, Sonia Madrid, Vicente Gil, Yunet Guerra, Andrea Gara', null, 'The divergent lives of twin brothers, Raúl, a violent policeman, and Valentín, a mentally handicapped man, cross paths again when the former decides to visit his family.', 'The divergent lives of twin brothers, Raúl, a violent policeman, and Valentín, a mentally handicapped man, cross paths again when the former decides to visit his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tK6egrcJog7SRicbitU9Wl8K4Ce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25482'),
  ('430543565942183818', 'LolliLove', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Micah Gallo, Jenna Fischer, Peter Alton', 'Jenna Fischer, Peter Alton', 'Jenna Fischer, James Gunn, Peter Alton, Sarah Sido, Linda Cardellini, Jason Segel, Joan Blair, Larry Fitzgibbon', null, 'A hip, misguided Southern California couple decide to make a difference in the lives of the homeless by giving them lollipops with a cheery slogan on the wrapper.', 'A hip, misguided Southern California couple decide to make a difference in the lives of the homeless by giving them lollipops with a cheery slogan on the wrapper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GIE8Td9CG7x6uDnCdd3JDJsQ57.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19719'),
  ('986398429160528627', 'Lollipop Monster', 2011, 'Drama', 'Ziska Riemann, Hannes Hubach', 'Luci Van Org, Ziska Riemann', 'Jella Haase, Sarah Horváth, Nicolette Krebitz, Thomas Wodianka, Sandra Borgmann, Rainer Sellien, Fritz Hammel, Janusz Kocaj', null, 'Ari and Oona go to the same school. Lolita-like Ari, is blonde, pouting and lives in a world of bright colours, frustrated by her mother still treating her as a child, while arty Oona dresses in black and is treated as an adult by her artist father. When Oona’s father commits suicide after his wife has an affair with his brother Lukas, Oona starts to self-harm, but finds and unlikely friendship with Ari. Ari’s enthusiasm for exerting her sexuality rebounds when she starts an affair with Oona’s uncle, who has recently moved in with Oona’s mother.', 'Ari and Oona go to the same school. Lolita-like Ari, is blonde, pouting and lives in a world of bright colours, frustrated by her mother still treating her as a child, while arty Oona dresses in black and is treated as an adult by her artist father. When Oona’s father commits suicide after his wife has an affair with his brother Lukas, Oona starts to self-harm, but finds and unlikely friendship with Ari. Ari’s enthusiasm for exerting her sexuality rebounds when she starts an affair with Oona’s uncle, who has recently moved in with Oona’s mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vrh4gZ8yRvf7blrbf3VwIj234V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91973'),
  ('3948589879964553', 'Lolly-Madonna XXX', 1973, 'Drama', 'Richard C. Sarafian, Philip H. Lathrop, Mike Moder', 'Rodney Carr-Smith', 'Rod Steiger, Robert Ryan, Jeff Bridges, Scott Wilson, Season Hubley, Katherine Squire, Tresa Hughes, Timothy Scott', 'PG', 'In the early 1970s, a young woman passing through rural Tennessee unintentionally gets caught in a feud between two local neighboring clans, the Feathers and the Gutshalls.', 'In the early 1970s, a young woman passing through rural Tennessee unintentionally gets caught in a feud between two local neighboring clans, the Feathers and the Gutshalls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYiZVe0cgzMnnSs1KBXR6IZ1dLT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114953'),
  ('1014256030270133174', 'Lolo', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Thierry Arbogast, Julie Delpy, Alan Corno', 'Eugénie Grandval, Julie Delpy', 'Dany Boon, Julie Delpy, Vincent Lacoste, Karin Viard, René-Alban Fleury, Antoine Lounguine, Christophe Vandevelde, Elise Larnicol', null, 'On holiday in the south of France, chic Parisian sophisticate Violette meets life-loving IT geek Jean-René. Against all odds, there’s a real chemistry between them and at the end of the summer, Jean-René wastes no time in joining his beloved in Paris. But there’s trouble in paradise, and a third party swiftly appears to shatter the couple’s idyll: Lolo, Violette’s ultra-possessive 19-year-old son, who is determined to get rid of his mother’s lover, whatever it takes…', 'On holiday in the south of France, chic Parisian sophisticate Violette meets life-loving IT geek Jean-René. Against all odds, there’s a real chemistry between them and at the end of the summer, Jean-René wastes no time in joining his beloved in Paris. But there’s trouble in paradise, and a third party swiftly appears to shatter the couple’s idyll: Lolo, Violette’s ultra-possessive 19-year-old son, who is determined to get rid of his mother’s lover, whatever it takes…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEAJTNMEkytGhO35sitUDGMx34s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341392'),
  ('984551017325194808', 'Lolo and the Kid', 2024, 'Drama, Family', 'Benedict Mique, Mark Joseph Cosico', 'Benedict Mique', 'Euwenn Mikaell, Joel Torre, Juan Karlos Labajo, Iza Calzado, Meryll Soriano, Joem Bascon, Nico Antonio, Markki Stroem', null, 'A hustler and the child he took in routinely con the wealthy — but a life-changing opportunity could end their inseparable bond.', 'A hustler and the child he took in routinely con the wealthy — but a life-changing opportunity could end their inseparable bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1Eubtd5zCISRsGxpd3CiAYkBao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1317887'),
  ('185071027856709622', 'Loma', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Risto Jarva, Antti Peippo', 'Risto Jarva, Kullervo Kukkasjärvi, Jussi Kylätasku', 'Antti Litja, Tuula Nyman, Eija Pokkinen, Jukka Sipilä, Helena Notkonen, Marja-Sisko Aimonen, Juhani Niemelä, Martti Pennanen', null, 'After a mixup at the check-in, Aimo Niemi boards a charter plane bound for the sunny island of Rhodes, Greece, instead of the Innsbruck Winter Olympics he''s packed for. It''s the early days of package tourism, and he is too shy and clueless to really sort out any of his problems — a suitcase filled with women''s clothes, a flirtatious female roommate, and no money to buy food since he was prepared for full room & board in Austria.', 'After a mixup at the check-in, Aimo Niemi boards a charter plane bound for the sunny island of Rhodes, Greece, instead of the Innsbruck Winter Olympics he''s packed for. It''s the early days of package tourism, and he is too shy and clueless to really sort out any of his problems — a suitcase filled with women''s clothes, a flirtatious female roommate, and no money to buy food since he was prepared for full room & board in Austria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgHaHLZFbru8xh33a4Xe4hcPTOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140036'),
  ('518120449815944834', 'Lommbock', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Christian Zübert, Philip Peschlow', 'Christian Zübert', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Lucas Gregorowicz, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Antoine Monot Jr., Alexandra Neldel, Melanie Winiger, Louis Hofmann, Mavie Hörbiger', null, 'Sequel to Lammbock. Stefan and Kai meet again after years. Stefan became a successful lawyer in Dubai while Kai is stuck in their home town. Kai has relationship issues and is trying hard to get in touch with his step son who is getting in serious trouble with some drug dealers. Can Kai and Stefan solve his problems? And what happened to their old friend Frank?', 'Sequel to Lammbock. Stefan and Kai meet again after years. Stefan became a successful lawyer in Dubai while Kai is stuck in their home town. Kai has relationship issues and is trying hard to get in touch with his step son who is getting in serious trouble with some drug dealers. Can Kai and Stefan solve his problems? And what happened to their old friend Frank?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVWcpJDmN3rudl2OKUE4DACzQS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409520'),
  ('42290458201370457', 'LOMO: The Language of Many Others', 2018, 'Drama', 'Michał Grabowski, Julia Langhof', 'Julia Langhof, Thomas Gerhold', 'Jonas Dassler, Lucie Hollmann, Eva Nürnberg, Marie-Lou Sellem, Peter Jordan, Barbara Philipp, Rainer Sellien, Karl Alexander Seidel', null, 'Karl, a 17-year-old boy who spends most of his time collecting pictures and videos for his blog, finds a new purpose when he falls in love with his fellow student Doro.', 'Karl, a 17-year-old boy who spends most of his time collecting pictures and videos for his blog, finds a new purpose when he falls in love with his fellow student Doro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/om4rN8twhffvjFqIlIBKbCaiuEi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379280'),
  ('973489621917368308', 'London', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Patrick Keiller', 'Patrick Keiller', 'Paul Scofield', null, 'A psycho-geographic journey through London and its history, as undertaken by an unseen narrator and his companion, Robinson, at the time of the 1992 general election.', 'A psycho-geographic journey through London and its history, as undertaken by an unseen narrator and his companion, Robinson, at the time of the 1992 general election.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulDAxhlzmQRfu18z3RvLHqy8ig8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121655'),
  ('978840050773274238', 'London', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hunter Richards, Jo Willems', 'Hunter Richards', 'Jessica Biel, Chris Evans, Jason Statham, Joy Bryant, Kelli Garner, Isla Fisher, Louis C.K., Jeff Wolfe', 'R', 'London is a drug laden adventure that centers on a party in a New York loft where a young man is trying to win back his ex-girlfriend.', 'London is a drug laden adventure that centers on a party in a New York loft where a young man is trying to win back his ex-girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qiIZ1udEo46Fnv0XpmPden8pG8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7515'),
  ('626826088993723175', 'London 2012 Olympic Opening Ceremony: Isles of Wonder', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Danny Boyle', 'Danny Boyle, Frank Cottrell Boyce', 'Elizabeth II of the United Kingdom, Mike Oldfield, Kenneth Branagh, J.K. Rowling, Paul McCartney, Rowan Atkinson, Daniel Craig, David Beckham', null, 'The London 2012 Olympic Games Opening Ceremony took place at 9pm on 27 July 2012. Titled ''Isles of Wonder'', the Ceremony welcomed the finest athletes from more than 200 nations for the start of the London 2012 Olympic Games, marking an historic third time the capital has hosted the world’s biggest and most important sporting event. The Opening Ceremony reflected the key themes and priorities of the London 2012 Games, based on sport, inspiration, youth and urban transformation. It was a Ceremony ''for everyone'' and celebrated contributions the UK has made to the world through innovation and revolution, as well as the creativity and exuberance of British people.', 'The London 2012 Olympic Games Opening Ceremony took place at 9pm on 27 July 2012. Titled ''Isles of Wonder'', the Ceremony welcomed the finest athletes from more than 200 nations for the start of the London 2012 Olympic Games, marking an historic third time the capital has hosted the world’s biggest and most important sporting event. The Opening Ceremony reflected the key themes and priorities of the London 2012 Games, based on sport, inspiration, youth and urban transformation. It was a Ceremony ''for everyone'' and celebrated contributions the UK has made to the world through innovation and revolution, as well as the creativity and exuberance of British people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZGn8dMhGsGLEX8G8CRdRxFT6eK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123024'),
  ('601061668073227725', 'London After Midnight', 1927, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Tod Browning, Merritt B. Gerstad', 'Waldemar Young', 'Lon Chaney, Marceline Day, Henry B. Walthall, Percy Williams, Conrad Nagel, Polly Moran, Edna Tichenor, Claude King', null, 'The abandoned Balfour House, the owner of which was found dead five years earlier, comes back to life with the arrival of two suspicious sinister-looking tenants. This film was lost in the 1965 MGM vault fire; only a few stills exist.', 'The abandoned Balfour House, the owner of which was found dead five years earlier, comes back to life with the arrival of two suspicious sinister-looking tenants. This film was lost in the 1965 MGM vault fire; only a few stills exist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDgG0R5XDai0960ICbk4GOMltlw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64852'),
  ('839680830729465132', 'London Belongs to Me', 1948, 'Drama', 'Sidney Gilliat, Wilkie Cooper', 'Sidney Gilliat, J.B. Williams', 'Richard Attenborough, Alastair Sim, Fay Compton, Stephen Murray, Wylie Watson, Susan Shaw, Hugh Griffith, Joyce Carey', 'NR', 'Classic British drama about the residents of a large terrace house in London between Christmas 1938 and September 1939. Percy Boon lives with his mother in a shared rented house with an assortment of characters in central London. Although well intentioned, he becomes mixed up with gangsters and murder. The story focuses on the effects this has on Percy and the other residents.', 'Classic British drama about the residents of a large terrace house in London between Christmas 1938 and September 1939. Percy Boon lives with his mother in a shared rented house with an assortment of characters in central London. Although well intentioned, he becomes mixed up with gangsters and murder. The story focuses on the effects this has on Percy and the other residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSMBmAE1KmT2ZtdzeUrr4ffuWxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130649'),
  ('85792693409218231', 'London Boulevard', 2010, 'Drama, Crime', 'William Monahan, Chris Menges', 'William Monahan', 'Colin Farrell, Keira Knightley, David Thewlis, Anna Friel, Ben Chaplin, Ray Winstone, Eddie Marsan, Sanjeev Bhaskar', 'R', 'A parolee falls for a reclusive movie star while trying to evade a ruthless gangster.', 'A parolee falls for a reclusive movie star while trying to evade a ruthless gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naQKmThKMtlur92CDgCP6b9aoQE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48838'),
  ('312452924942109107', 'London Calling', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Allan Ungar, Alexander Chinnici', 'Omer Levin Menekse, Quinn Wolfe', 'Josh Duhamel, Aidan Gillen, Jeremy Ray Taylor, Rick Hoffman, Arnold Vosloo, Daniel Lasker, Daniah De Villiers, Nathan Castle', 'R', 'After fleeing the UK from a job gone wrong, a down on his luck hitman is forced to babysit the son of his new crime boss and show him how to become a man.', 'After fleeing the UK from a job gone wrong, a down on his luck hitman is forced to babysit the son of his new crime boss and show him how to become a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpQ4VxBJO7vGV3IUdKzSNf4tH9V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1217602'),
  ('438493201944014723', 'London Can Take It!', 1940, 'Documentary, War', 'Humphrey Jennings, Harry Watt, H.E. Fowle', 'Quentin Reynolds', 'Quentin Reynolds, King George VI of the United Kingdom, Queen Elizabeth the Queen Mother', null, 'A tribute to the courage and resiliency of Britons during the darkest days of the London Blitz.', 'A tribute to the courage and resiliency of Britons during the darkest days of the London Blitz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgarbivm4WIflUdLHzE5Rt5keQM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145011'),
  ('1083286988131949205', 'London Dreams', 2009, 'Drama', 'Vipul Amrutlal Shah, Carolyn McLeod, Sejal Shah', 'Suresh Nair', 'Ajay Devgn, Salman Khan, Aditya Roy Kapur, Rannvijay Singha, Asin Thottumkal, Om Puri', null, 'When famous musician Arjun (Ajay Devgan) invites his childhood friend Mannu (Salman Khan) to join his band and tour Europe, jealousy and betrayal threaten to destroy the lives and dreams of both men.', 'When famous musician Arjun (Ajay Devgan) invites his childhood friend Mannu (Salman Khan) to join his band and tour Europe, jealousy and betrayal threaten to destroy the lives and dreams of both men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7oolzGDi0e9KNN2zGXsFYzJizR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25511'),
  ('656149598397882849', 'London Fields', 2018, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Mathew Cullen, Guillermo Navarro', 'Martin Amis, Roberta Hanley', 'Amber Heard, Theo James, Jim Sturgess, Billy Bob Thornton, Johnny Depp, Cara Delevingne, Jaimie Alexander, Jason Isaacs', 'R', 'Clairvoyant femme fatale Nicola Six has been living with a dark premonition of her impending death by murder. She begins a tangled love affair with three uniquely different men — one of whom she knows will be her murderer.', 'Clairvoyant femme fatale Nicola Six has been living with a dark premonition of her impending death by murder. She begins a tangled love affair with three uniquely different men — one of whom she knows will be her murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OfQVm5GexlAREp8FoR4ILxp35T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220882'),
  ('47972614532985404', 'London Has Fallen', 2016, 'Action, Thriller', 'Aaron Hartley, Babak Najafi, Kess Bonnet', 'Christian Gudegast, Katrin Benedikt, Creighton Rothenberger', 'Gerard Butler, Aaron Eckhart, Angela Bassett, Morgan Freeman, Melissa Leo, Robert Forster, Sean O''Bryan, Radha Mitchell', 'R', 'In London for the Prime Minister''s funeral, Mike Banning discovers a plot to assassinate all the attending world leaders.', 'In London for the Prime Minister''s funeral, Mike Banning discovers a plot to assassinate all the attending world leaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEbLkYzyiUdOKNK4WNBFyGH7r2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267860'),
  ('203367826666026404', 'London Kills Me', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hanif Kureishi, Edward Lachman', 'Hanif Kureishi', 'Justin Chadwick, Steven Mackintosh, Emer McCourt, Roshan Seth, Fiona Shaw, Brad Dourif, Naveen Andrews, Marianne Jean-Baptiste', 'R', 'For want of a nail a shoe was lost, for want of a shoe... a young man''s life is almost lost, which is exactly what this film is all about: a man barely twenty who wants desperately to pull out of London''s drug world by taking a job as a waiter in a ''normal'' restaurant. But to do this he must come up with a "sensible" pair of shoes, an item that his homeless meanderings hasn''t provided him.', 'For want of a nail a shoe was lost, for want of a shoe... a young man''s life is almost lost, which is exactly what this film is all about: a man barely twenty who wants desperately to pull out of London''s drug world by taking a job as a waiter in a ''normal'' restaurant. But to do this he must come up with a "sensible" pair of shoes, an item that his homeless meanderings hasn''t provided him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5crZR8BcehJ8leebQrabEG1taP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253129'),
  ('646912338473360998', 'London River', 2009, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Rachid Bouchareb, Jérôme Alméras', 'Rachid Bouchareb, Zoé Galeron, Olivier Lorelle', 'Brenda Blethyn, Sotigui Kouyaté, Sami Bouajila, Roschdy Zem, Francis Magee, Bernard Blancan, Marc Baylis, Gareth Randall', null, 'After traveling to London to check on their missing children in the wake of the 2005 terror attacks on the city, two strangers come to discover their respective children had been living together at the time of the attacks', 'After traveling to London to check on their missing children in the wake of the 2005 terror attacks on the city, two strangers come to discover their respective children had been living together at the time of the attacks', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5csgIwwoMzZYsFkV9c5A18DGIA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39358'),
  ('554513175263584016', 'London to Brighton', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Paul Andrew Williams, Christopher Ross, Sarah Mooney', 'Paul Andrew Williams', 'Georgia Groome, Johnny Harris, Sam Spruell, Lorraine Stanley, Alexander Morton, Nathan Constance, Jamie Kenna, Chloe Bale', 'R', 'It''s 3:07am and two girls burst into a run down London toilet. Joanne is crying her eyes out and her clothing is ripped. Kelly''s face is bruised and starting to swell. Duncan Allen lies in his bathroom bleeding to death. Duncan''s son finds his father and wants answers. Derek – Kelly''s pimp – needs to find Kelly or it will be him who pays.', 'It''s 3:07am and two girls burst into a run down London toilet. Joanne is crying her eyes out and her clothing is ripped. Kelly''s face is bruised and starting to swell. Duncan Allen lies in his bathroom bleeding to death. Duncan''s son finds his father and wants answers. Derek – Kelly''s pimp – needs to find Kelly or it will be him who pays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIWaX9DXgUVesbiJceitZirTyj2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14823'),
  ('101762233966498128', 'London to Brighton in Four Minutes', 1952, 'Documentary', 'Don Smith', null, 'David Lloyd James', null, 'London to Brighton in Four Minutes is a short film produced by the BBC Film Unit. The camera was manually undercranked to produce a ''fast-motion'' film-- the journey lasted only four minutes instead of the actual time the trip took, around an hour.', 'London to Brighton in Four Minutes is a short film produced by the BBC Film Unit. The camera was manually undercranked to produce a ''fast-motion'' film-- the journey lasted only four minutes instead of the actual time the trip took, around an hour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noBxNeSgUC0S7lKoRQYzSBQFfgt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147601'),
  ('899867041965695968', 'London, Cinematography Entry', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Charles Moisson', null, null, null, 'The facade and the traffic in front of the Cinematographe in London, close to the large ensign of the historical Empire Theatre, in London.', 'The facade and the traffic in front of the Cinematographe in London, close to the large ensign of the historical Empire Theatre, in London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f58qBgyPvIHR0z6Q3zPtouboxuv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190566'),
  ('73683039279296674', 'Lone and Angry Man', 1965, 'Western', 'Mario Caiano, Angelo Sangermano, Juan Antonio Isasi', 'Guido Malatesta, David Moreno Mingote', 'Anthony Steffen, Eduardo Fajardo, Fulvia Franco, Luciana Gilli, George Rigaud, Armando Calvo, Arturo Dominici, Lucio De Santis', null, 'Shenandoah (Steffen) works his way into a band of highwaymen led by Rojo (Armando Calvo). His initiation consists of hunting down and killing a member of the gang who has 12 bullets while he is only given 2 bullets. When the bandits attempt to rob a wealthy rancher, whom Shenandoah knows, he warns him. The outlaws begin to suspect they were betrayed and commence to rough Shenandoah up. Shenandoah then reveals his true reason for joining the gang; one of them killed his wife and he is there for retribution.', 'Shenandoah (Steffen) works his way into a band of highwaymen led by Rojo (Armando Calvo). His initiation consists of hunting down and killing a member of the gang who has 12 bullets while he is only given 2 bullets. When the bandits attempt to rob a wealthy rancher, whom Shenandoah knows, he warns him. The outlaws begin to suspect they were betrayed and commence to rough Shenandoah up. Shenandoah then reveals his true reason for joining the gang; one of them killed his wife and he is there for retribution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sr6G4cjmvlUleQYu09Xa0dZq7bL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149736'),
  ('693745444355715483', 'Lone Star', 1952, 'Western', 'Vincent Sherman, Harold Rosson', 'Borden Chase', 'Clark Gable, Ava Gardner, Broderick Crawford, Lionel Barrymore, Beulah Bondi, Ed Begley, James Burke, William Farnum', 'PG', 'Cattle baron Devereaux Burke is enlisted by an aging Andrew Jackson to dissuade Sam Houston from establishing Texas as a republic. Burke must fight state senator Thomas Craden, in the process winning the heart of Craden''s newspaper-editor girlfriend Martha Ronda.', 'Cattle baron Devereaux Burke is enlisted by an aging Andrew Jackson to dissuade Sam Houston from establishing Texas as a republic. Burke must fight state senator Thomas Craden, in the process winning the heart of Craden''s newspaper-editor girlfriend Martha Ronda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4AMTdBJpApUz55HqVbZBS5GNQa6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37593'),
  ('307820790470389201', 'Lone Star', 1996, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'John Sayles, Stuart Dryburgh, John Powditch', 'John Sayles', 'Chris Cooper, Elizabeth Peña, Kris Kristofferson, Clifton James, Miriam Colon, Ron Canada, Joe Morton, Matthew McConaughey', 'R', 'When the skeleton of his murdered predecessor is found, Sheriff Sam Deeds unearths many other long-buried secrets in his Texas border town.', 'When the skeleton of his murdered predecessor is found, Sheriff Sam Deeds unearths many other long-buried secrets in his Texas border town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBxY8znsRoqa9Dy2NCe8I6GPsRm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26748'),
  ('855513603621922243', 'Lone Star State of Mind', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime', 'David Semel, Michael Barrett', 'Trevor Munson', 'Joshua Jackson, Jaime King, Matthew Davis, Ryan Hurst, John Mellencamp, Thomas Haden Church, DJ Qualls, Ellar Coltrane', 'PG-13', 'Earl and Baby, two young lovers with a plan to escape their small Texas town. But when Baby''s dim-witted cousin Junior gets tangled up in a whole heap of trouble, Earl has just 48 hours to save the day, rescue Junior and keep his promise to get his Baby to Los Angeles in time for sweeps.', 'Earl and Baby, two young lovers with a plan to escape their small Texas town. But when Baby''s dim-witted cousin Junior gets tangled up in a whole heap of trouble, Earl has just 48 hours to save the day, rescue Junior and keep his promise to get his Baby to Los Angeles in time for sweeps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWCFRsPrld9wcyf6251G06mLDJ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35225'),
  ('722118118373422057', 'Lone Survivor', 2013, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Peter Berg, Tobias A. Schliessler, Eric Heffron', 'Peter Berg', 'Mark Wahlberg, Taylor Kitsch, Emile Hirsch, Ben Foster, Eric Bana, Ali Suliman, Alexander Ludwig, Jerry Ferrara', 'R', 'Four Navy SEALs on a covert mission to neutralize a high-level Taliban operative must make an impossible moral decision in the mountains of Afghanistan that leads them into an enemy ambush. As they confront unthinkable odds, the SEALs must find reserves of strength and resilience to fight to the finish.', 'Four Navy SEALs on a covert mission to neutralize a high-level Taliban operative must make an impossible moral decision in the mountains of Afghanistan that leads them into an enemy ambush. As they confront unthinkable odds, the SEALs must find reserves of strength and resilience to fight to the finish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlT3RSPO6GlSyb5QrLrFcDmhrQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193756'),
  ('859844067941535344', 'Lone Wolf', 1972, 'Family, Drama', 'Obrad Gluščević, Nenad Jovičić', 'Stjepan Perović, Obrad Gluščević', 'Slavko Štimac, Željko Mataija, Ivan Štimac, Boro Ivanišević, Smiljan Čičić, Finka Pavičić-Budak, Edo Peročević, Dragomir Felba', null, 'The film follows a young boy named Ranko who discovers a large German Shepherd in the mountains, a remnant of the recent war. After freeing the dog from a trap, Ranko befriends the animal and, based on an inscription on its collar, names him Hund. However, the local villagers mistake the dog for a dangerous wolf, a "lone wolf," and resolve to kill it. Fearing for his new companion''s safety, Ranko secretly brings food to Hund in the mountains. In a turn of events, the dog saves Ranko from a real wolf attack. The villagers, convinced that this "lone wolf" is responsible for killing sheep, organize a hunt. In a climactic moment, Ranko manages to save his loyal friend from the hunting party, solidifying their bond.', 'The film follows a young boy named Ranko who discovers a large German Shepherd in the mountains, a remnant of the recent war. After freeing the dog from a trap, Ranko befriends the animal and, based on an inscription on its collar, names him Hund. However, the local villagers mistake the dog for a dangerous wolf, a "lone wolf," and resolve to kill it. Fearing for his new companion''s safety, Ranko secretly brings food to Hund in the mountains. In a turn of events, the dog saves Ranko from a real wolf attack. The villagers, convinced that this "lone wolf" is responsible for killing sheep, organize a hunt. In a climactic moment, Ranko manages to save his loyal friend from the hunting party, solidifying their bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbI3ihesZTiCIDP92ojOKZfQnNE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276711'),
  ('214496170591353050', 'Lone Wolf', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'John Callas', 'Michael Krueger', 'Dyan Brown, Kevin Hart, Jamie Newcomb, Ann Douglas, Siren, Jeff Harms, James Ault, Michael Parker', 'R', 'A struggling rock band and other college students cope with the trials and tribulations of their young lives and find themselves in the role of determining what exactly is behind the recent full-moon killings which have been attributed to wild dogs.', 'A struggling rock band and other college students cope with the trials and tribulations of their young lives and find themselves in the role of determining what exactly is behind the recent full-moon killings which have been attributed to wild dogs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJBfeTZ9H7caPVksoXpLosP7Xg0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103607'),
  ('824536981045310067', 'Lone Wolf and Cub: Baby Cart at the River Styx', 1972, 'Action, Drama, Adventure, Thriller', 'Kenji Misumi, Chikashi Makiura, Toshihiro Inagaki', 'Kazuo Koike', 'Tomisaburō Wakayama, Kayo Matsuo, Minoru Ōki, Akiji Kobayashi, Shin Kishida, Shogen Nitta, Kappei Matsumoto, Takashi Ebata', null, 'Ogami Itto battles a group of female ninja in the employ of the Yagyu clan and must eliminate a traitor who plans to sell his clan''s secrets to the Shogunate.', 'Ogami Itto battles a group of female ninja in the employ of the Yagyu clan and must eliminate a traitor who plans to sell his clan''s secrets to the Shogunate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47PwbebnjjTcGM4CzwJfhZXK6bB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17810'),
  ('688834280142755966', 'Lone Wolf and Cub: Baby Cart in Peril', 1972, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Kazuo Miyagawa, Buichi Saitō, Haruo Ueda', 'Kazuo Koike', 'Tomisaburō Wakayama, Yoichi Hayashi, Michi Azuma, Akihiro Tomikawa, Asao Koike, Hiroshi Tanaka, Tatsuo Endō, Asao Uchida', null, 'Ogami Itto is hired to kill a tattooed female assassin and battles Retsudo, head of the Yagyu clan, and his son Gunbei.', 'Ogami Itto is hired to kill a tattooed female assassin and battles Retsudo, head of the Yagyu clan, and his son Gunbei.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80dPE18baHbnB8mrl6wWtGXEyCP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41477'),
  ('1119605033683440577', 'Lone Wolf and Cub: Baby Cart in the Land of Demons', 1973, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Adventure', 'Kenji Misumi, Fujio Morita, Umeo Minamino', 'Tsutomu Nakamura, Kazuo Koike', 'Tomisaburō Wakayama, Michiyo Yasuda, Akihiro Tomikawa, Shingo Yamashiro, Tomomi Satō, Akira Yamanouchi, Hideji Ōtaki, Fujio Suga', null, 'Ogami Itto is challenged by a quintet of warriors, each armed with one fifth of Ogami''s assassin fee and one fifth of the information he needs to complete his assignment.', 'Ogami Itto is challenged by a quintet of warriors, each armed with one fifth of Ogami''s assassin fee and one fifth of the information he needs to complete his assignment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GVtFK1lVfQLHL1uPl2Sqy3Hz3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41482'),
  ('1093750270326315281', 'Lone Wolf and Cub: Baby Cart to Hades', 1972, 'Drama, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Kenji Misumi, Chikashi Makiura, Toshihiro Nabei', 'Kazuo Koike', 'Tomisaburō Wakayama, Gō Katō, Yūko Hamada, Isao Yamagata, Michitarō Mizushima, Ichirō Nakatani, Akihiro Tomikawa, Sayoko Katō', 'R', 'Ogami Itto volunteers to be tortured by Yakuza in order to save a prostitute and is hired by their leader to kill an evil chamberlain.', 'Ogami Itto volunteers to be tortured by Yakuza in order to save a prostitute and is hired by their leader to kill an evil chamberlain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a33RihlBiOhNi4YffwofJxVqIzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41474'),
  ('364969562450860520', 'Lone Wolf and Cub: Sword of Vengeance', 1972, 'Drama, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Kenji Misumi, Chikashi Makiura, Mitsuaki Tsuji', 'Kazuo Koike', 'Tomisaburō Wakayama, Fumio Watanabe, Tomoko Mayama, Shigeru Tsuyuguchi, Asao Uchida, Taketoshi Naitō, Yoshi Katō, Reiko Kasahara', null, 'Official Shogunate executioner Ogami Itto has been framed for disloyalty to the Shogunate by the Yagyu clan, against whom he now is waging a one-man war, along with his infant son, Daigoro.', 'Official Shogunate executioner Ogami Itto has been framed for disloyalty to the Shogunate by the Yagyu clan, against whom he now is waging a one-man war, along with his infant son, Daigoro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxJJIzw3lDM0RbFQMQsTTRyFO2D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41471'),
  ('71497492071908083', 'Lone Wolf and Cub: The Final Conflict', 1993, 'Action, Thriller', 'Akira Inoue, Haishi Ryuutarou, Saburo Fujiwara', 'Tsutomu Nakamura', 'Masakazu Tamura, Tatsuya Nakadai, Yushi Shoda, Shiho Fujimura, Isao Hashizume, Kimiko Ikegami, Renji Ishibashi, Shima Iwashita', null, 'A noble samurai serving the Shogun as ''Kogi Kaishaku-nin'' (Official Executioner) is the target of a plot by the evil Yagyu Clan to take away his position and replace him with a member of their own family. When his wife is murdered and evidence is produced that he was plotting against the Shogun the Code of Bushido calls for him and his son to commit sepuku. Instead he defies the Shogun''s orders and takes up arms against his enemies, becoming an assassin for hire.', 'A noble samurai serving the Shogun as ''Kogi Kaishaku-nin'' (Official Executioner) is the target of a plot by the evil Yagyu Clan to take away his position and replace him with a member of their own family. When his wife is murdered and evidence is produced that he was plotting against the Shogun the Code of Bushido calls for him and his son to commit sepuku. Instead he defies the Shogun''s orders and takes up arms against his enemies, becoming an assassin for hire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haded1cZ9oukwZp6OVGZYc0IVPC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361605'),
  ('159640867382646651', 'Lone Wolf and Cub: White Heaven in Hell', 1974, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Drama, Thriller', 'Yoshiyuki Kuroda, Chikashi Makiura, Yoji Ogura', 'Tsutomu Nakamura', 'Tomisaburō Wakayama, Akihiro Tomikawa, Junko Hitomi, Gorō Mutsumi, Daigo Kusano, Jiro Miyaguchi, Renji Ishibashi, Teruo Ishiyama', null, 'With most of his family already dead at Ogami Itto''s hands, Retsudo launches one final plot to destroy him, and when that fails, unleashes the fury of every remaining member of the Yagyu clan.', 'With most of his family already dead at Ogami Itto''s hands, Retsudo launches one final plot to destroy him, and when that fails, unleashes the fury of every remaining member of the Yagyu clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRBOXoQDvcApwVWyY80G813qzHd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41486'),
  ('491822331913090050', 'Lone Wolf Isazo', 1968, 'Action, Drama', 'Kazuo Ikehiro, Hiroshi Imai', 'Kinya Naoi', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Mayumi Ogawa, Isamu Nagato, Kaneko Iwasaki, Akio Hasegawa, Shōzō Nanbu, Yatsuko Tan''ami, Asao Koike', null, 'Isazo is a traveling gambler and living legend in the world of yakuza, known for his swordsmanship and bravery, his impeccable manners, and his brilliant talent in gambling. One late fall at an inn in Kiso Fukushima, Isazo befriends a young boy whose mother turns out to be his old love Yoshino, with whom he was not unable to consummate a marriage due to the class differences between them.', 'Isazo is a traveling gambler and living legend in the world of yakuza, known for his swordsmanship and bravery, his impeccable manners, and his brilliant talent in gambling. One late fall at an inn in Kiso Fukushima, Isazo befriends a young boy whose mother turns out to be his old love Yoshino, with whom he was not unable to consummate a marriage due to the class differences between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9plQHajEdxetO3hTmtP3U6clCXs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191523'),
  ('959298239156791341', 'Lone Wolf McQuade', 1983, 'Action, Crime', 'Steve Carver, Roger Shearman Jr., Todd Corman', 'B.J. Nelson', 'Chuck Norris, David Carradine, Barbara Carrera, Leon Isaac Kennedy, Robert Beltran, L.Q. Jones, Dana Kimmell, R.G. Armstrong', 'PG', 'The archetypical renegade Texas Ranger wages war against a drug kingpin with automatic weapons, his wits and martial arts after a gun battle leaves his partner dead. All of this inevitably culminates in a martial arts showdown between the drug lord and the ranger, and involving the woman they both love.', 'The archetypical renegade Texas Ranger wages war against a drug kingpin with automatic weapons, his wits and martial arts after a gun battle leaves his partner dead. All of this inevitably culminates in a martial arts showdown between the drug lord and the ranger, and involving the woman they both love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLVegSmoFM5ekThmUauuhnAOejb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14854'),
  ('302613137417038559', 'Lonely are the Brave', 1962, 'Drama, Western', 'David Miller, Philip H. Lathrop, David Silver', 'Dalton Trumbo', 'Kirk Douglas, Gena Rowlands, Walter Matthau, Michael Kane, Carroll O''Connor, William Schallert, George Kennedy, Karl Swenson', null, 'A fiercely independent cowboy arranges to have himself locked up in jail in order to then escape with an old friend who has been sentenced to the penitentiary.', 'A fiercely independent cowboy arranges to have himself locked up in jail in order to then escape with an old friend who has been sentenced to the penitentiary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6wKfhwGPsKgPI77ZiLhL6argMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43002'),
  ('923312514343204254', 'Lonely Boy', 1962, 'Documentary', 'Wolf Koenig, Roman Kroitor, Wolf Koenig', null, 'Paul Anka, Jules Podell', null, 'This short film portrays the story of singer Paul Anka, who rose from obscurity to become the idol of millions of adolescent fans around the world. Taking a candid look at both sides of the footlights, this film examines the marketing machine behind a generation of pop singers. Interviews with Anka and his manager reveal their perspective on the industry.', 'This short film portrays the story of singer Paul Anka, who rose from obscurity to become the idol of millions of adolescent fans around the world. Taking a candid look at both sides of the footlights, this film examines the marketing machine behind a generation of pop singers. Interviews with Anka and his manager reveal their perspective on the industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52812VUBjdCTTWxWY83E3T0yFam.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119210'),
  ('1067240628066717721', 'Lonely Castle in the Mirror', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Keiichi Hara, Keigo Sasaki, Yohei Miyawaki', 'Miho Maruo', 'Ami Touma, Takumi Kitamura, Sakura Kiryu, Rihito Itagaki, Naho Yokomizo, Minami Takayama, Yuki Kaji, Aoi Miyazaki', 'PG', 'Shy outcast Kokoro has been avoiding school for weeks when she discovers a portal in her bedroom mirror. She reaches through and finds herself transported to an enchanting castle where she is joined by six other students. When a girl in a wolf mask explains that they have been invited to play a game, the teens must work together to uncover the mysterious connection that unites them. However, anyone who breaks the rules will be eaten by a wolf.', 'Shy outcast Kokoro has been avoiding school for weeks when she discovers a portal in her bedroom mirror. She reaches through and finds herself transported to an enchanting castle where she is joined by six other students. When a girl in a wolf mask explains that they have been invited to play a game, the teens must work together to uncover the mysterious connection that unites them. However, anyone who breaks the rules will be eaten by a wolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPV2etoFUkgQLWqKduWxXAeP4Oe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942881'),
  ('666958612902807751', 'Lonely Heart', 1985, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Yoshitaka Sakamoto', 'Wataru Kenmotsu, Tadashi Naitô, Nobuhiko Obayashi', 'Yasuko Tomita, Toshinori Omi, Yumiko Fujita, Nenji Kobayashi, Makoto Satō, Ittoku Kishibe, Nao Asuka, Masae Hayashi', null, 'Lonely and love-stricken high-school student Hiroki pursues a girl, but another one mysteriously appears in his life. Is she a figment of his psyche, or is she real?', 'Lonely and love-stricken high-school student Hiroki pursues a girl, but another one mysteriously appears in his life. Is she a figment of his psyche, or is she real?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/108Zwrypb4uTvHwiY4ZDgsTplER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261525'),
  ('459317402939101373', 'Lonely Hearts', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Todd Robinson, Peter Levy', 'Todd Robinson', 'John Travolta, James Gandolfini, Jared Leto, Salma Hayek Pinault, Scott Caan, Laura Dern, Michael Gaston, Dan Byrd', 'R', 'In the late 1940s, a murderous couple known as the ''The Lonely Hearts Killers'' kills close to a dozen people. Two detectives try to nab the duo who find their targets via the personals in the paper.', 'In the late 1940s, a murderous couple known as the ''The Lonely Hearts Killers'' kills close to a dozen people. Two detectives try to nab the duo who find their targets via the personals in the paper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnQK4JUwEUFDKt7dSMY2fJmhv2f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1252'),
  ('9154658608797449', 'Lonely Planet', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Susannah Grant, Ali Cherkaoui, Martina Götthansova', 'Susannah Grant', 'Laura Dern, Liam Hemsworth, Diana Silvers, Bellina Logan, Sami Fekkak, Gustav Dyekjær Giese, Rachida Brakni, Younès Boucif', 'R', 'At an idyllic writers retreat in Morocco, a newly single novelist finds an unexpected connection with a younger man who''s reevaluating his life choices.', 'At an idyllic writers retreat in Morocco, a newly single novelist finds an unexpected connection with a younger man who''s reevaluating his life choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sH7Orig1yqa6ojMLIzLDxA2GRkH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:959429'),
  ('770209866782766158', 'Lonely Road', 1984, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Jesús Franco, Jesús Franco, Lina Romay', 'Jesús Franco', 'Antonio Mayans, Lina Romay, Ricardo Palacios, Carmen Carrión, José Llamas, Flavia Hervás, Jesús Franco, Juana de la Morena', null, 'Private detective Alfredo Pereira is hired by eccentric couple Raden and Eve to find their missing sister, Adriana. Despite his limitations, Pereira soon finds the woman, but foreplay between characters complicates things.', 'Private detective Alfredo Pereira is hired by eccentric couple Raden and Eve to find their missing sister, Adriana. Despite his limitations, Pereira soon finds the woman, but foreplay between characters complicates things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrsGbeeTSc1crbNS5Wgi1VVy4Y3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347995'),
  ('92862758971903216', 'Lonely Wives', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Hubert Frank, Günther Knuth', 'Oliver Freistadt, Hubert Frank', 'Barbara Nielsen, Ingeborg Steinbach, Ewa Strömberg, Ingrid Steeger, Marlene Rahn, Eva Garden, Frank Glaubrecht, Anna Kristina', null, 'An oft-naked male reporter decides to do an expose on "sexual widows", housewives who are neglected by their busy husbands. - This cheaper sex film is disguised as a report about green widows.', 'An oft-naked male reporter decides to do an expose on "sexual widows", housewives who are neglected by their busy husbands. - This cheaper sex film is disguised as a report about green widows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zb1PZvhvLlo46tyHVdzmTmTjUQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70519'),
  ('14949586400679036', 'Lonely Woman Seeks Life Companion', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Viacheslav Kryshtofovych, Vasyl Trushkovskyi', 'Viktor Merezhko', 'Irina Kupchenko, Aleksandr Zbruev, Yelena Solovey, Marianna Vertinskaya, Margarita Krinitsyna, Valeriy Sheptekita, Neonila Hnepovska, Alicia Omelchuk', null, 'Klava, a lonely woman who is bored with her life, posts an advertisement seeking a male companion. Valentin, a retired circus performer, responds to her message and the two enter a dubious relationship.', 'Klava, a lonely woman who is bored with her life, posts an advertisement seeking a male companion. Valentin, a retired circus performer, responds to her message and the two enter a dubious relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0ElH4g8dqIW9QmrJy9l28RXLNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183236'),
  ('461186813865498113', 'Lonelyhearts', 1959, 'Drama, Romance', 'Vincent J. Donehue, John Alton, Clarence Eurist', 'Dore Schary', 'Montgomery Clift, Robert Ryan, Myrna Loy, Dolores Hart, Maureen Stapleton, Jackie Coogan, Mike Kellin, Onslow Stevens', 'NR', 'Burdened by a family secret, Adam White lands a job as a newspaper advice columnist. Little does he realize that it''s all part of a nasty desire by cynical editor William Shrike to crush the souls of his underlings. Adam feels his readers'' pain, and eventually, he takes an assignment to meet with Faye Doyle, who is exasperated by her crippled husband. When Faye tries to seduce Adam, he must choose between his job and his girl.', 'Burdened by a family secret, Adam White lands a job as a newspaper advice columnist. Little does he realize that it''s all part of a nasty desire by cynical editor William Shrike to crush the souls of his underlings. Adam feels his readers'' pain, and eventually, he takes an assignment to meet with Faye Doyle, who is exasperated by her crippled husband. When Faye tries to seduce Adam, he must choose between his job and his girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5q8FZ3uNTgcJdPWz0EP4MWYy1Gq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95402'),
  ('647186495719901068', 'Loner', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Park Jae-sik', 'Park Jae-sik', 'Go Eun-ah, Chae Min-seo, Jung You-seok, Jung Young-sook, Lim Dae-ho, Lee Da-in-IV, Lee Yeon-su', null, 'A student becomes a recluse in response to her best friend''s suicide and locks herself in her room. She believes that someone is in the room with her. Her alarmed family hires a psychologist to intervene.', 'A student becomes a recluse in response to her best friend''s suicide and locks herself in her room. She believes that someone is in the room with her. Her alarmed family hires a psychologist to intervene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4leCuJV2uBQwPtAJotP3Keumqg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91237'),
  ('1017837565248937919', 'Loners', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Ondříček, Kryštof Michal, Serdjan Simeonović', 'Petr Zelenka', 'Jitka Schneiderová, Saša Rašilov, Jiří Macháček, Labina Mitevska, Ivan Trojan, Dana Sedláková, Mikuláš Křen, Tatiana Dyková', null, 'Robert works for a travel agency and helps to arrange scenes from the everyday lives of "ordinary" Czech families as an attraction for Japanese tourists. He also works as a kind of matchmaker and occasionally helps to put together some of his friends. He helps to separate his friend Hanka from Peter, an announcer for an independent radio station who tries to capture "real" life by recording the moments from "reality" and playing them over the air. Vesna, came to Prague from Macedonia because it is according to her the best place for UFOs to land, but her real reason for coming is somewhat different... Hanka is followed by the crazy Ondrej, until then a respected brain surgeon, and married with two kids. Through him she meets Jacob, who uses copious amounts of weed in order to be constructive in this gloomy world. On the other hand, this destroys his short-term memory - and he forgets that he already has a girlfriend...', 'Robert works for a travel agency and helps to arrange scenes from the everyday lives of "ordinary" Czech families as an attraction for Japanese tourists. He also works as a kind of matchmaker and occasionally helps to put together some of his friends. He helps to separate his friend Hanka from Peter, an announcer for an independent radio station who tries to capture "real" life by recording the moments from "reality" and playing them over the air. Vesna, came to Prague from Macedonia because it is according to her the best place for UFOs to land, but her real reason for coming is somewhat different... Hanka is followed by the crazy Ondrej, until then a respected brain surgeon, and married with two kids. Through him she meets Jacob, who uses copious amounts of weed in order to be constructive in this gloomy world. On the other hand, this destroys his short-term memory - and he forgets that he already has a girlfriend...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOg3WTC9X2uDZoEEUUfWt6G4Zfu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31321'),
  ('155595650564864584', 'Lonesome', 1928, 'Romance, Drama', 'Pál Fejős, Gilbert Warrenton', 'Edward T. Lowe Jr., Tom Reed', 'Barbara Kent, Glenn Tryon, Fay Holderness, Gusztáv Pártos, Eddie Phillips, Andy Devine, Henry Armetta, Edgar Dearing', null, 'Two lonely people in the big city meet and enjoy the thrills of an amusement park, only to lose each other in the crowd after spending a great day together. Will they ever see each other again?', 'Two lonely people in the big city meet and enjoy the thrills of an amusement park, only to lose each other in the crowd after spending a great day together. Will they ever see each other again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctxscU1tJ4nFRP4Q6n3Rngp9od1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101482'),
  ('193859765784782445', 'Lonesome Cowboys', 1968, 'Western, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Andy Warhol, Paul Morrissey', 'Paul Morrissey', 'Viva, Tom Hompertz, Louis Waldon, Eric Emerson, Taylor Mead, Joe Dallesandro, Francis Francine, Julian Burrough', null, 'Five lonesome cowboys get all hot and bothered at home on the range after confronting Ramona Alvarez and her nurse.', 'Five lonesome cowboys get all hot and bothered at home on the range after confronting Ramona Alvarez and her nurse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxq2P6FBJtaxZMGW4wmxZC7znsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8372'),
  ('136415799411655578', 'Lonesome Ghosts', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror', 'Burt Gillett', 'Dick Friel', 'Walt Disney, Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher, Pinto Colvig, Don Brodie, Jack Bergman, Harry Stanton', 'NR', 'On a dark and stormy night, four bored ghosts decide to have some fun by calling the Ajax Ghost Exterminators.', 'On a dark and stormy night, four bored ghosts decide to have some fun by calling the Ajax Ghost Exterminators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydAWe33OKMxkwd4piuQdKDVr3qO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32428'),
  ('1023616218993275403', 'Lonesome Jim', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Steve Buscemi, Phil Parmet', 'Jim Strouse', 'Casey Affleck, Kevin Corrigan, Liv Tyler, Mary Kay Place, Seymour Cassel, Rachel Strouse, Sarah Strouse, Rick Duplissie', 'R', 'After failing to find success as a writer in New York City, Jim slinks back to his family''s home in the Midwest to lick his wounds. But his visit is quickly complicated when his angst spreads to his brother, Tim, who promptly decides to drive his car straight into a tree. Under the shadow of his sibling''s injurious actions, Jim strikes up an unlikely friendship with Anika, whose centered small-town wisdom gradually rubs off on him.', 'After failing to find success as a writer in New York City, Jim slinks back to his family''s home in the Midwest to lick his wounds. But his visit is quickly complicated when his angst spreads to his brother, Tim, who promptly decides to drive his car straight into a tree. Under the shadow of his sibling''s injurious actions, Jim strikes up an unlikely friendship with Anika, whose centered small-town wisdom gradually rubs off on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5wh9kFxpqC6bKB7TUx7j6X7BOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7301'),
  ('682725561261188809', 'Lonesome Lenny', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Tex Avery, Sara Berner, Wally Maher', null, 'Screwy Squirrel becomes the playmate of Lenny, a lonesome, dopey, but strong dog, in this broad parody of John Steinbeck''s "Of Mice and Men".', 'Screwy Squirrel becomes the playmate of Lenny, a lonesome, dopey, but strong dog, in this broad parody of John Steinbeck''s "Of Mice and Men".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxcxqbyBUFApUPhTUnpo3F9OntJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86731'),
  ('320104520395482452', 'Long Arm of the Law', 1984, 'Action, Crime', 'Johnny Mak Tong-Hung, Johnny Koo Kwok-Wah, Billy Chan Wui-Ngai', 'Philip Chan Yan-Kin', 'David Lam Wai, Wong Kin, Chiang Lung, Chan Ging, Lee Ying-Git, Lam Seung-Sam, Yeung Ming, Lau On-Kei', null, 'A group of desperate Chinese criminals hope to make a quick, effortless score in Hong Kong. Things go afoul, and the gang must hide out until the heat dies down, besmirched with the blood of an undercover cop.', 'A group of desperate Chinese criminals hope to make a quick, effortless score in Hong Kong. Things go afoul, and the gang must hide out until the heat dies down, besmirched with the blood of an undercover cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJT7VIl329hk6mXsO7jQNibb1Uy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69599'),
  ('145143911325108971', 'Long Arm of the Law II', 1987, 'Action, Crime', 'Michael Mak Tong-Kit, Johnny Koo Kwok-Wah', 'Philip Chan Yan-Kin', 'Alex Man Chi-Leung, Pauline Wong, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Ben Lam Kwok-Bun, Yuen Yat-Choh, Stephen Chan Tak-Gwong, Kong Lung, Lee Ying-Git', null, 'This sequel to the critically-acclaimed box-office winner Long Arm of the Law maintains the same stark realism of the original. In Saga Two, the Royal Hong Kong Police put into operation a new plan to counteract the problem of increasing violent crimes committed by new arrivals from across the border in China. In agreement with Chinese authorities, three Hong Kong detectives go undercover as illegal immigrants in order to infiltrate the powerful gang that is organizing the crime wave. The action is tough and graphic, reminiscent of The French Connection, Hong Kong style.', 'This sequel to the critically-acclaimed box-office winner Long Arm of the Law maintains the same stark realism of the original. In Saga Two, the Royal Hong Kong Police put into operation a new plan to counteract the problem of increasing violent crimes committed by new arrivals from across the border in China. In agreement with Chinese authorities, three Hong Kong detectives go undercover as illegal immigrants in order to infiltrate the powerful gang that is organizing the crime wave. The action is tough and graphic, reminiscent of The French Connection, Hong Kong style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/subtaCMbqJHXHiUm0BG1XrOeteX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221536'),
  ('1118160025079001527', 'Long Arm of the Law IV Underground Express', 1990, 'Action, Crime', 'Michael Mak Tong-Kit, Eric Chu Kwok-Fai', 'Johnny Mak Tong-Hung', 'Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Chan Ging, Ronny Ching Siu-Lung, Frankie Chan Chi-Leung, Jacqueline Ng Suet-Man, Kan Sek-Ming, Dang Suk-Yee, Wong Ching-Ho', null, 'The final entry in Michael and Johnny Mak''s Long Arm of the Law series, Underground Express once again tells a story of gangsters versus police, focusing on the difference between how both factions act depending if they''re coming from Hong Kong or Mainland China.', 'The final entry in Michael and Johnny Mak''s Long Arm of the Law series, Underground Express once again tells a story of gangsters versus police, focusing on the difference between how both factions act depending if they''re coming from Hong Kong or Mainland China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Zj74OyuaKbqirQWp2QS21vzJFX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234227'),
  ('386337797561069498', 'Long Day''s Journey Into Night', 1962, 'Drama', 'Sidney Lumet, Boris Kaufman', 'Eugene O''Neill', 'Katharine Hepburn, Ralph Richardson, Dean Stockwell, Jason Robards, Jeanne Barr', null, 'An Irish miser, his morphine addicted wife, their debauched older son, and a gravely ill younger son. A quiet Connecticut vacation home on one foggy day in August 1912 becomes the backdrop for domestic decline.', 'An Irish miser, his morphine addicted wife, their debauched older son, and a gravely ill younger son. A quiet Connecticut vacation home on one foggy day in August 1912 becomes the backdrop for domestic decline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7cu92b2sAJix1WFiLZiHSkZY1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43004'),
  ('76453811385842842', 'Long Day''s Journey Into Night', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Shixue Yu, Bi Gan, Yao Hung-i', 'Bi Gan', 'Tang Wei, Huang Jue, Sylvia Chang, Lee Hong-chi, Chen Yongzhong, Chloe Maayan, Duan Chun-hao, Bi Yanmin', 'NR', 'Luo Hongwu returns to Kaili, the hometown from which he fled many years ago. He begins the search for the woman he loved and whom he has never been able to forget.', 'Luo Hongwu returns to Kaili, the hometown from which he fled many years ago. He begins the search for the woman he loved and whom he has never been able to forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wUxYW7v2sahnFwipwzjRo8Z3sP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486898'),
  ('480985902623246144', 'Long Days of Vengeance', 1967, 'Drama, Western', 'Florestano Vancini, Francisco Marín', 'Augusto Caminito, Fernando Di Leo', 'Giuliano Gemma, Francisco Rabal, Conrado San Martín, Gabriella Giorgelli, Manuel Muñiz, Nieves Navarro, Franco Cobianchi, Pedro "Pedrucho" Basauri', null, 'After suffering three years of hard labor in a prison camp, former sheriff Ted Barnett escapes. Now he seeks revenge.', 'After suffering three years of hard labor in a prison camp, former sheriff Ted Barnett escapes. Now he seeks revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4K0jf8PfzXFd3pzF1ftF0VryJpZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103160'),
  ('921224791910777711', 'Long Distance', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Action', 'Will Speck, Josh Gordon, Cliff Lanning', 'Spenser Cohen', 'Anthony Ramos, Naomi Scott, Kristofer Hivju, Zachary Quinto, Izzy Jones, Leon Nurse-Joseph, Milan Walls-Smith, Paisley Roemer', 'PG-13', 'After crash-landing on an alien planet, an asteroid miner must contend with the challenges of his new surroundings, while making his way across the harsh terrain to the only other survivor – a woman who is trapped in her escape pod.', 'After crash-landing on an alien planet, an asteroid miner must contend with the challenges of his new surroundings, while making his way across the harsh terrain to the only other survivor – a woman who is trapped in her escape pod.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5NKltgQqqyoWJNuK18IqEGRG7J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605722'),
  ('874039443312685090', 'Long Distance Wireless Photography', 1908, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Fernande Albany, Georges Méliès', null, 'Into a photography studio full of large fantastic machines steps an elderly couple. The bearded proprietor explains the equipment and gives them a demonstration: he starts machines whirring, and projects a painting of three women onto a large screen; suddenly the women begin to move. The customers are impressed. First the women sits in the special seat: she''s projected onto the screen, and her good nature comes out in the laughing image. Then it''s the man''s turn, but the machine discloses a vastly different nature in him. Will his reaction threaten our proprietor''s inventions?', 'Into a photography studio full of large fantastic machines steps an elderly couple. The bearded proprietor explains the equipment and gives them a demonstration: he starts machines whirring, and projects a painting of three women onto a large screen; suddenly the women begin to move. The customers are impressed. First the women sits in the special seat: she''s projected onto the screen, and her good nature comes out in the laughing image. Then it''s the man''s turn, but the machine discloses a vastly different nature in him. Will his reaction threaten our proprietor''s inventions?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPcPAiJG3tIP3Hjl1cPqOhchUxp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188080'),
  ('841041904628526224', 'Long Dream', 2000, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Higuchinsky', 'Higuchinsky, Kyoichi Nanatsuki', 'Eriko Hatsune, Masami Horiuchi, Shuji Kashiwabara, Kenjiro Tsuda, Tsugumi', null, 'Strange things lurk in dreams. For Mukoda Tetsurou and the doctors tending to him, things have begun to get stranger as Mukoda begins having longer and longer dreams every night. Can one dream infinity in the span of a night?', 'Strange things lurk in dreams. For Mukoda Tetsurou and the doctors tending to him, things have begun to get stranger as Mukoda begins having longer and longer dreams every night. Can one dream infinity in the span of a night?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPybZzzu80fljFVLx9ByWDbej8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86008'),
  ('495651019704570114', 'Long Gone', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Robert Elswit, Martin Davidson', null, 'William Petersen, Virginia Madsen, Dermot Mulroney, Henry Gibson, Neil DeGroot, Katy Boyer, Teller, Robert Easton', null, 'Story of the Tampico Stogies, a low minor-league baseball team, and its star player and manager, Stud'' Cantrell, as they battle for the league championship amidst the corruption and racism of the American south.', 'Story of the Tampico Stogies, a low minor-league baseball team, and its star player and manager, Stud'' Cantrell, as they battle for the league championship amidst the corruption and racism of the American south.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlxOYZuvTUVokfnpfNndZ3lD7ky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88231'),
  ('1062377428607554220', 'Long Gone Heroes', 2024, 'Action, War, Crime, Thriller', 'John Swab, Brandon Cox', 'John Swab', 'Frank Grillo, Josh Hutcherson, Melissa Leo, Beau Knapp, Andy Garcia, Eden Brolin, Wendy Moniz, Mekhi Phifer', 'R', 'Gunner, a special forces soldier who has witnessed the darkest side of country and combat, is forced back into the field of battle to save his niece, who is being held in South America. As the fight intensifies, Gunner and his team discover that her disappearance is part of a corrupt private operation that hits way too close to home.', 'Gunner, a special forces soldier who has witnessed the darkest side of country and combat, is forced back into the field of battle to save his niece, who is being held in South America. As the fight intensifies, Gunner and his team discover that her disappearance is part of a corrupt private operation that hits way too close to home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ENAa0K2Qqm6VNf4eZoR4TaLDSn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1276825'),
  ('1070767159242983259', 'Long John Silver', 1954, 'Adventure, Action', 'Byron Haskin', 'Martin Rackin', 'Robert Newton, Connie Gilchrist, Lloyd Berrell, Grant Taylor, Rod Taylor, Harvey Adams, Muriel Steinbeck, Henry Gilbert', null, 'In this sequel to Treasure Island, Long John hopes to rescue his friend Jim from a rival pirate and return for more treasure.', 'In this sequel to Treasure Island, Long John hopes to rescue his friend Jim from a rival pirate and return for more treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3AAoKQCPt61wPrYPiF650yq6uU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23115'),
  ('471816054665637669', 'Long Live Death', 1971, 'Drama, War', 'Fernando Arrabal, Jean-Marc Ripert', 'Claudine Lagrive, Fernando Arrabal', 'Mohamed Bellasoued, Anouk Ferjac, Núria Espert, Mahdi Chaouch, Ivan Henriques, Jazia Klibi, Suzanne Comte, Víctor García', null, 'At the end of the Spanish civil war, Fando, a boy of about ten, tries to make sense of war and his father''s arrest. His mother is religious, sympathetic to the Fascists; his father is accused of being a Red. Fando discovers that his mother may have aided in his father''s arrest. Sometimes we witness Fando imagining explanations for what''s going on; sometimes we see him at play, alone or with his friend Thérèse. Oedipal fantasies and a lad''s natural curiosity about sex and death mix with his search for his mother''s nature and his father''s fate. Will Fando survive the search?', 'At the end of the Spanish civil war, Fando, a boy of about ten, tries to make sense of war and his father''s arrest. His mother is religious, sympathetic to the Fascists; his father is accused of being a Red. Fando discovers that his mother may have aided in his father''s arrest. Sometimes we witness Fando imagining explanations for what''s going on; sometimes we see him at play, alone or with his friend Thérèse. Oedipal fantasies and a lad''s natural curiosity about sex and death mix with his search for his mother''s nature and his father''s fate. Will Fando survive the search?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/G6pItVZarazu876GpMPu7EnCon.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42528'),
  ('1140437020222916370', 'Long Live Freedom', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roberto Andò, Maurizio Calvesi, Gianluca Mazzella', 'Angelo Pasquini, Roberto Andò', 'Toni Servillo, Valerio Mastandrea, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Michela Cescon, Anna Bonaiuto, Gianrico Tedeschi, Eric Nguyen, Andrea Renzi', null, 'Elections are approaching and things don''t look too good for the opposition. Their leader can''t stand the pressure and disappears. To avoid a scandal, the upper echelons of the party concoct a risky plan: to replace him with his identical twin, a philosopher with BPD, whose eclectic ideas and direct approach unexpectedly make the party surge in the polls.', 'Elections are approaching and things don''t look too good for the opposition. Their leader can''t stand the pressure and disappears. To avoid a scandal, the upper echelons of the party concoct a risky plan: to replace him with his identical twin, a philosopher with BPD, whose eclectic ideas and direct approach unexpectedly make the party surge in the polls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6UFJbhBG0sStPle9RoWC07s0K0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167221'),
  ('1136595399258317679', 'Long Live Ghosts!', 1977, 'Family, Comedy, Music, Fantasy', 'Oldřich Lipský, Milada Mikešová, Martin Mahdal', 'Zdeněk Svěrák, Jiří Melíšek, Oldřich Lipský', 'Jiří Sovák, Vlastimil Brodský, Dana Vávrová, Jiří Procházka, Lubomír Lipský, Věra Tichánková, Jiří Bruder, Petr Starý', null, 'A trespassing gang of boys encounter a ghost in the ruins of a castle. When they rescue the ghost who is caught in a trapset, they become allies in a fight to prevent ruins from being turned into mushroom farm by the city authorities.', 'A trespassing gang of boys encounter a ghost in the ruins of a castle. When they rescue the ghost who is caught in a trapset, they become allies in a fight to prevent ruins from being turned into mushroom farm by the city authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHSWQuSh846LTNykbatsp6No2Nu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46632'),
  ('876400717815139627', 'Long Live Life', 1984, 'Thriller, Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Claude Lelouch, Bernard Lutic', 'Jérôme Tonnerre, Claude Lelouch', 'Charlotte Rampling, Michel Piccoli, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Évelyne Bouix, Charles Aznavour, Laurent Malet, Tanya Lopert, Raymond Pellegrin', null, 'The movie starts with an interview with director Claude Lelouch. He pleads viewers not to disclose the plot of the movie after leaving the projection room. Even the movie''s trailer shows only a long sequence of faces gazing speechlessly in space. "Like all my movies, this one is about a man and a woman", says Lelouch in the interview.', 'The movie starts with an interview with director Claude Lelouch. He pleads viewers not to disclose the plot of the movie after leaving the projection room. Even the movie''s trailer shows only a long sequence of faces gazing speechlessly in space. "Like all my movies, this one is about a man and a woman", says Lelouch in the interview.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGG9uqAGVCucMjEaAcdSISCxWJN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127994'),
  ('818820328515500908', 'Long Live Love!', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Mayanee Chadavipoo, Songphon Jantharasom, Piyakarn Butprasert', 'Piyakarn Butprasert, Pongsuang Choop', 'Sunny Suwanmethanon, Araya A. Hargate, Becky Armstrong, Niti Chaichitathorn, Nopachai Jayanama, Sadanont Durongkhaweroj, Munin Kangsathien, Pannawit Phattanasiri', 'R', 'A story about a party-animal Sati, a man whose attitude has left a broken family at home. Meta, his wife, is preparing to leave him. At age 15, his daughter, Namo is already jaded from a lifetime of broken promises.', 'A story about a party-animal Sati, a man whose attitude has left a broken family at home. Meta, his wife, is preparing to leave him. At age 15, his daughter, Namo is already jaded from a lifetime of broken promises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyduWrJmYZ8XFiEMdzp7sXPQ7T7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026961'),
  ('228724940395366719', 'Long Live Robin Hood', 1971, 'Adventure', 'Giorgio Ferroni, Filiberto Fiaschi, Giuseppe Pinori', 'Giorgio Stegani, André Tranché, Manuel Torres Larrodé', 'Giuliano Gemma, Mark Damon, Luis Dávila, Silvia Dionisio, Mario Adorf, Daniele Dublino, Nello Pazzafini, Manuel Zarzo', null, 'John Lackland seizes the English throne, believing the rightful ruler, his brother Richard the Lionheart, to be dead. When he learns that Richard is being held captive by the German emperor and can be ransomed for a large sum of money, he refuses to pay and orders the messengers, including Sir Henry of Nottingham, to be killed. Sir Henry escapes to Sherwood Forest, which belongs to his estates. There he joins forces with a group of Anglo-Saxons and fights under the name Robin Hood against the regime of the king''s traitors...', 'John Lackland seizes the English throne, believing the rightful ruler, his brother Richard the Lionheart, to be dead. When he learns that Richard is being held captive by the German emperor and can be ransomed for a large sum of money, he refuses to pay and orders the messengers, including Sir Henry of Nottingham, to be killed. Sir Henry escapes to Sherwood Forest, which belongs to his estates. There he joins forces with a group of Anglo-Saxons and fights under the name Robin Hood against the regime of the king''s traitors...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBU7AWm2uKwrIp2a4YCBbUYCbPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280028'),
  ('9769487958480488', 'Long Live the Bride and Groom', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Luis García Berlanga, Aurelio G. Larraya, Carlos Aured', 'Luis García Berlanga', 'José Luis López Vázquez, Laly Soldevila, José María Prada, Manuel Alexandre, Luis Ciges, Víctor Israel, Xavier Vivé, Teresa Gisbert', null, 'Leo Pozas, native from Burgos and high bank clerk, arrives to a town on the Costa Brava, with his mother to marry Loli. Unexpectedly, Leo''s mother died. This may mean the suspension of the wedding, a year of mourning and, perhaps, another relief, so that Leo and Loli hide the corpse of the old betrothal until after the wedding...', 'Leo Pozas, native from Burgos and high bank clerk, arrives to a town on the Costa Brava, with his mother to marry Loli. Unexpectedly, Leo''s mother died. This may mean the suspension of the wedding, a year of mourning and, perhaps, another relief, so that Leo and Loli hide the corpse of the old betrothal until after the wedding...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FNutPRA9X4x3ACzNmmTd45ktg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110200'),
  ('784491897854863117', 'Long Live the King', 2019, 'Action, Crime, Comedy', 'Kang Yun-sung, Kim Tae-soo, Lee Sang-yong', 'Ryu Kyoung-sun', 'Kim Rae-won, Won Jin-ah, Jin Sun-kyu, Choi Gwi-hwa, Choi Moo-seong, Ju Jin-mo, Lim Hyung-jun, Choi Jae-hwan', null, 'Jang Se-chool is the boss of a gang. He has been in love with Kang So-hyun for the past 3 years, even though she constantly rejects him and tries to push him away. Having had enough, she tells him that she can''t be with him because she wants to be the first lady of Korea.', 'Jang Se-chool is the boss of a gang. He has been in love with Kang So-hyun for the past 3 years, even though she constantly rejects him and tries to push him away. Having had enough, she tells him that she can''t be with him because she wants to be the first lady of Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lARxGpQx4aQWDaobjgVnj0t00vZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575602'),
  ('137708405709272099', 'Long Live the Lady!', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Ermanno Olmi, Maurizio Zaccaro, Ermanno Olmi', 'Ermanno Olmi', 'Marco Esposito, Simona Brandalise, Stafania Busarello, Simone Dalla Rosa, Tarcisio Tosi, Marisa Abbate, Franco Aldighieri, Giorgio Ambrosini', null, 'The Lady (or Signora) of the title is a mysterious matron who lives in a crumbling mansion. Six catering trainees are brought to the castle upon its conversion into a resort hotel. They are ordered to prepare a special meal for the old lady, whom none of them have ever seen for more than an instant. As the caterers grow in wisdom and sophistication, we learn that the lady may very well be an urbane ghost rather than a flesh-and-blood entity.', 'The Lady (or Signora) of the title is a mysterious matron who lives in a crumbling mansion. Six catering trainees are brought to the castle upon its conversion into a resort hotel. They are ordered to prepare a special meal for the old lady, whom none of them have ever seen for more than an instant. As the caterers grow in wisdom and sophistication, we learn that the lady may very well be an urbane ghost rather than a flesh-and-blood entity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QDgTFcqfAI6X44n4YwDxPY8YlO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131787'),
  ('560202169525731827', 'Long Live the Queen', 1995, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Esmé Lammers', 'Esmé Lammers', 'Maya van den Broecke, Lisa De Rooy, Cas Enklaar, Derek de Lint, Rudolf Lucieer, Pieter Lutz, Serge-Henri Valcke, Monique van de Ven', null, 'A fairytale about a young girl who learns to play chess and at the same time finds her father.', 'A fairytale about a young girl who learns to play chess and at the same time finds her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYV51vZWenD6QE7ov16HiGdIBnF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85115'),
  ('297993400475338328', 'Long Live the Republic', 1965, 'War, Drama', 'Karel Kachyňa, František Sádek, Lubomír Břinčil', 'Karel Kachyňa, Jan Procházka', 'Zdeněk Lstibůrek, Naděžda Gajerová, Vlado Müller, Gustáv Valach, Yuriy Nazarov, Iva Janžurová, Jindra Rathová, Jaroslava Vysloužilová', null, 'Oldrich is the runt of his village, beaten by his father, bullied by the other boys. But he has imagination on his side, and a wiry toughness they can’t defeat. The village is in turmoil, because the Nazi occupiers have just retreated and the Red Army is advancing. Oldrich dodges amid the mayhem and panic, taking his share of blows but always managing to stay one step ahead.', 'Oldrich is the runt of his village, beaten by his father, bullied by the other boys. But he has imagination on his side, and a wiry toughness they can’t defeat. The village is in turmoil, because the Nazi occupiers have just retreated and the Red Army is advancing. Oldrich dodges amid the mayhem and panic, taking his share of blows but always managing to stay one step ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEhbbGhq6N5er7vbaEtjrkxKRSr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247446'),
  ('302200722482856571', 'Long Live the Republic', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Éric Rochant, Christophe Pollock, Olivier Genet', 'Éric Rochant', 'Hippolyte Girardot, Antoine Chappey, Gad Elmaleh, Atmen Kelif, Aure Atika, Florence Pernel, Mathilde Seigner, Roschdy Zem', null, 'A group of young unemployed people from Le Mans (France) decide to create a new political party.', 'A group of young unemployed people from Le Mans (France) decide to create a new political party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VHn9yYsr5IKif8updE5SUqekyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369584'),
  ('407526505608996151', 'Long Live the Seal', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Nando Cicero, Giorgio Di Battista, Maria Pia Rocco', 'Francesco Milizia, Nando Cicero, Stefano Sudriè', 'Lory Del Santo, Michela Miti, Riccardo Billi, Dagmar Lassander, Bombolo, Fabio Grossi, Victor Cavallo, Franco Bracardi', null, 'Andrea, a nice girl, move from Veneto (north of Italy) to Roma. She is employed as a nurse in a medical practice. She soon is involved in a never-ending game of misunderstanding, couples exchange, sexual seductions.', 'Andrea, a nice girl, move from Veneto (north of Italy) to Roma. She is employed as a nurse in a medical practice. She soon is involved in a never-ending game of misunderstanding, couples exchange, sexual seductions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehFKpF7wnQvjqPZ9ldz0lGJcuRf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56793'),
  ('1025202654877258700', 'Long Lost Christmas', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Robison, Dan Dumouchel', 'John Kilby', 'Taylor Cole, Benjamin Ayres, Camille Mitchell, Jacqueline Ann Steuart, Grant Vlahovic, Stefania Indelicato, Liza Huget, Malcolm Anthony Clarke', 'G', 'Hayley is an interior designer who plans to surprise her recently widowed mother Patricia with the perfect holiday present: the extended family she knows her mom yearns for.', 'Hayley is an interior designer who plans to surprise her recently widowed mother Patricia with the perfect holiday present: the extended family she knows her mom yearns for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ep92klyhq5ePnHxsm7Psn6UPDF8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028539'),
