  ('323662653386712669', 'Long Night in ''43', 1960, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Renzo Ragazzi, Florestano Vancini, Marco Leto', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Ennio De Concini, Florestano Vancini', 'Belinda Lee, Enrico Maria Salerno, Gabriele Ferzetti, Andrea Checchi, Nerio Bernardi, Isa Querio, Gino Cervi, Raffaella Carrà', null, '1943. The affair between Anna, unhappily married to wheelchair-bound Pino, and deserter Franco unfolds in foggy Ferrara, intertwining with the power struggle taking place within local Fascist ranks that culminates in a massacre of civilians, including Franco''s father – Pino sees it all from his window, but will he tell anyone?', '1943. The affair between Anna, unhappily married to wheelchair-bound Pino, and deserter Franco unfolds in foggy Ferrara, intertwining with the power struggle taking place within local Fascist ranks that culminates in a massacre of civilians, including Franco''s father – Pino sees it all from his window, but will he tell anyone?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k51j6ibNFJidET1Yk1GNSDX6hk2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62365'),
  ('1024552284714061604', 'Long Pants', 1927, 'Comedy', 'Frank Capra, Glenn Kershner, Elgin Lessley', 'Tay Garnett', 'Harry Langdon, Gladys Brockwell, Alan Roscoe, Priscilla Bonner, Alma Bennett, Betty Francisco, Billy Aikin, Betty Baker', null, 'Harry Shelby has been kept in knee pants for years by his overprotective parents, but the day finally comes when Harry is given his first pair of long pants. Almost immediately, he is expected to marry his childhood sweetheart Priscilla... but instead, Harry''s first heady whiff of manhood has got him panting after Bebe, a "fast" woman from the big city. Mistakenly thinking that Bebe fancies him too, Harry risks everything to help her out when she lands in jail, only to end up in hot water himself. Through it all, sweet Priscilla waits for her man to come to his senses.', 'Harry Shelby has been kept in knee pants for years by his overprotective parents, but the day finally comes when Harry is given his first pair of long pants. Almost immediately, he is expected to marry his childhood sweetheart Priscilla... but instead, Harry''s first heady whiff of manhood has got him panting after Bebe, a "fast" woman from the big city. Mistakenly thinking that Bebe fancies him too, Harry risks everything to help her out when she lands in jail, only to end up in hot water himself. Through it all, sweet Priscilla waits for her man to come to his senses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYcZxuiHvpo0JXa9lxc4oIaiAFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128229'),
  ('444509869424726427', 'Long Pigs', 2007, 'Crime, Horror', 'Chris Power, Nathan Hynes', 'Nathan Hynes, Chris Power', 'Anthony Alviano, Jean-Marc Fontaine, Paul Fowles, Shane Harbinson, Roger King, Kelly McIntosh, Brad Mittelman, John Terranova', null, 'Two desperate filmmakers began a documentary about a cannibalistic serial killer. What follows is their actual footage.', 'Two desperate filmmakers began a documentary about a cannibalistic serial killer. What follows is their actual footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmCUMTikcaA6a5JHwkK3wGHoTKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74727'),
  ('543931051595039576', 'Long Road in the Dunes', 1982, 'Romance, Family, TV Movie', 'Aloiz Brench, Janis Murnieks', 'Dmitri Vasiliu, Oleg Rudnev', 'Lilita Ozoliņa, Juozas Kiselius, Romualdas Ramanauskas, Eduards Pavuls, Karlis Trencis, Arijs Geikins, Lidija Freimane, Aare Laanemets', null, 'The action of the film takes place in Latvia and spans the period from 1939 to the early 1970s. The events that occurred in the country had various effects on the fates of the characters. But throughout it all, love guided them — it scattered and gathered, made them suffer terribly, and made them the happiest people in the world...', 'The action of the film takes place in Latvia and spans the period from 1939 to the early 1970s. The events that occurred in the country had various effects on the fates of the characters. But throughout it all, love guided them — it scattered and gathered, made them suffer terribly, and made them the happiest people in the world...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aI91wr6RWkcWJeHOgiCvsOtl0ig.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285411'),
  ('549390935050906354', 'Long Shot', 2017, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Adam Newport-Berra, Gus Sacks, Jacob LaMendola', null, 'Juan Catalan, Alma Oseguera, Todd Melnik, Sam Fernández, Tim Gibbons, Larry David, Kym Whitley, Robert Gajic', 'PG-13', 'When Juan Catalan is arrested for a murder he insists he didn''t commit, he builds his case for innocence around unexpected raw footage.', 'When Juan Catalan is arrested for a murder he insists he didn''t commit, he builds his case for innocence around unexpected raw footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LDeHrG8RBluJ7IkPgBaOMkU3fl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477331'),
  ('749016609566101108', 'Long Shot', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sarah Lachance, Zoe Sakellaropoulo, Hélène Camirand', 'Dan Sterling, Liz Hannah', 'Charlize Theron, Seth Rogen, O''Shea Jackson Jr., June Diane Raphael, Ravi Patel, Andy Serkis, Bob Odenkirk, Alexander Skarsgård', 'R', 'Journalist Fred Flarsky reunites with his childhood crush, Charlotte Field, now one of the most influential women in the world. As she prepares to make a run for the Presidency, Charlotte hires Fred as her speechwriter — much to the dismay of her trusted advisers.', 'Journalist Fred Flarsky reunites with his childhood crush, Charlotte Field, now one of the most influential women in the world. As she prepares to make a run for the Presidency, Charlotte hires Fred as her speechwriter — much to the dismay of her trusted advisers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1F9AItQ6fhrfhBVQlmC8ReOQAFG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459992'),
  ('489621281580953652', 'Long Story Short', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Matt Toll, Bokkie Robertson, Ruby Lennon', 'Josh Lawson', 'Rafe Spall, Zahra Newman, Ronny Chieng, Dena Kaplan, Noni Hazlehurst, Josh Lawson', 'R', 'Teddy wakes up the morning after his wedding to discover that he''s jumped forward a year in his life to his first anniversary. Trapped in an endless cycle of time jumps, transported another year ahead every few minutes, he is faced with a race against time as his life crumbles around him.', 'Teddy wakes up the morning after his wedding to discover that he''s jumped forward a year in his life to his first anniversary. Trapped in an endless cycle of time jumps, transported another year ahead every few minutes, he is faced with a race against time as his life crumbles around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAJ95mBgB0yAKCS5a3Tw5UxjLEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763532'),
  ('480337870693972506', 'Long Story Short', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Dietl, Holly Fink', 'Elena Senft', 'Laura Tonke, Jasmin Shakeri, Annette Frier, Nicholas Ofczarek, Henning Flüsloh, Trystan Pütter, Ronald Zehrfeld, Katia Fellin', null, 'A group of close friends celebrate parties over an extended period of time. They experience a lot of fun together, but also tragic moments that prove that love and friendship are the most important gifts of all our lives.', 'A group of close friends celebrate parties over an extended period of time. They experience a lot of fun together, but also tragic moments that prove that love and friendship are the most important gifts of all our lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQwLUXz3SyTsbeRntYX53oqqNXf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1318535'),
  ('587084026777049067', 'Long Time Dead', 2002, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Marcus Adams, Nic Morris, Joe Geary', 'Andy Day, Chris Baker, Eitan Arrusi', 'Joe Absolom, Lara Belmont, Melanie Gutteridge, Lukas Haas, James Hillier, Alec Newman, Mel Raido, Marsha Thomason', 'R', 'A group of British students embark on summoning spirits on a Ouija board after a night of clubbing. But someone breaks the link before they have finished and now a demon is trapped in their world and the only way to banish it, is for all the people who summoned it to die.', 'A group of British students embark on summoning spirits on a Ouija board after a night of clubbing. But someone breaks the link before they have finished and now a demon is trapped in their world and the only way to banish it, is for all the people who summoned it to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2t90uhX9AYzAMX7Xzo2x7Tefpx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27259'),
  ('961339770201861131', 'Long Way Home', 2019, 'Drama', 'André Novais Oliveira, Wilssa Esser, Marianne Macedo Martins', 'André Novais Oliveira', 'Grace Passô, Russo Apr, Rejane Faria, Hélio Ricardo, Juliana Abreu, Janderlane Souza, Sinara Teles, Renato Novaes', null, 'In order to take a new job as an employee in the public sanitation department, Juliana moves from the inner city of Itaúna to the metropolitan town of Contagem in Brazil. While waiting for her husband to join her, she adapts to her new life, meeting people and discovering new horizons, trying to overcome her past.', 'In order to take a new job as an employee in the public sanitation department, Juliana moves from the inner city of Itaúna to the metropolitan town of Contagem in Brazil. While waiting for her husband to join her, she adapts to her new life, meeting people and discovering new horizons, trying to overcome her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0FnuCnfEVMuCeh1sfQPOOcSVO1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535348'),
  ('247588013179248309', 'Long Way North', 2015, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama, Family', 'Rémi Chayé, Liane-cho Han, Slaven Reese', 'Claire Paoletti, Patricia Valeix, Patricia Valeix', 'Christa Théret, Féodor Atkine, Audrey Sablé, Thomas Sagols, Rémi Caillebot, Loïc Houdré, Fabien Briche, Rémi Bichet', null, 'In 1892 Saint Petersburg, when her explorer grandfather''s failure to return from his latest expedition brings dishonour to her aristocratic family, a resilient teenager runs away to follow in his trail in search of his famed ship.', 'In 1892 Saint Petersburg, when her explorer grandfather''s failure to return from his latest expedition brings dishonour to her aristocratic family, a resilient teenager runs away to follow in his trail in search of his famed ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nh3ModvEfZhSzfylPFsPaxt2CjG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345775'),
  ('188218292982751264', 'Long Weekend', 1979, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Colin Eggleston, Vincent Monton, Tom Burstall', 'Everett De Roche', 'John Hargreaves, Briony Behets, Mike McEwen, Roy Day, Michael Aitkens, Sue Kiss von Soly, Colin Eggleston', null, 'When a suburban couple goes camping for the weekend at a remote beach, they discover that nature isn''t in an accommodating mood.', 'When a suburban couple goes camping for the weekend at a remote beach, they discover that nature isn''t in an accommodating mood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roZ7DGi30lA1O4zhtPwBh6q8JV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39995'),
  ('1000685399619450949', 'Long Weekend', 2009, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Jamie Blanks, Vincent Monton, Vincent Monton', 'Everett De Roche', 'Jim Caviezel, Claudia Karvan, Robert Taylor, John Brumpton, Roger Ward, Lara Robinson, Gordon Waddell, Jude Beaumont', 'R', 'Peter and Carla, a couple whose marriage is faltering, decide to go on a camping weekend. When they become lost, the pair sets up camp on a remote beach that doesn''t seem to be on any map. At first the trip is the romantic getaway they imagined – then slowly things begin to go wrong. After Peter disrespects the unspoiled habitat, it seems as if the surroundings are exacting revenge on the couple, as insects, animals, and then nature itself become the enemy.', 'Peter and Carla, a couple whose marriage is faltering, decide to go on a camping weekend. When they become lost, the pair sets up camp on a remote beach that doesn''t seem to be on any map. At first the trip is the romantic getaway they imagined – then slowly things begin to go wrong. After Peter disrespects the unspoiled habitat, it seems as if the surroundings are exacting revenge on the couple, as insects, animals, and then nature itself become the enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szfiY3ycr0SBAjb81og8tIzKgGj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20323'),
  ('28276199767869362', 'Long Weekend', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Taweewat Wantha, Jiradech Samniangsanor, Wanida Sangboonkird', 'Sommai Lertulan, Adirek Watleela, Taweewat Wantha', 'Chinawut Indracusin, Sheranut Yusananda, Sean Jindachot, Akkaranat Ariyaritwikul, Natpassara Adulyamethasiri, Kitlapat Korasudraiwon, Chamaiporn Jaturaput, Anchalee Saisoontorn', null, 'A group of friends sets off for a weekend getaway on Friday the 13th to challenge a supernatural belief only to realise that some things are not to be messed with.', 'A group of friends sets off for a weekend getaway on Friday the 13th to challenge a supernatural belief only to realise that some things are not to be messed with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KLiNiak9vpluLqc7CwLsmJAmNV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196798'),
  ('898121991224965995', 'Long Weekend', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Stephen Basilone, Kate Geller, Felipe Vara de Rey', 'Stephen Basilone', 'Finn Wittrock, Casey Wilson, Damon Wayans Jr., Wendi McLendon-Covey, Zoë Chao, Jim Rash, Jennifer Irwin, Steve Basilone', 'R', 'Bart''s chance encounter with the enigmatic Vienna leads to a whirlwind weekend together. The two fall fast and hard, but both carry secrets that could be their undoing or the chance for a fresh start.', 'Bart''s chance encounter with the enigmatic Vienna leads to a whirlwind weekend together. The two fall fast and hard, but both carry secrets that could be their undoing or the chance for a fresh start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OyKfblQX6SR2rL6R26g5eYCLHq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635012'),
