  ('1145861580019055221', 'Look Away', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Reid A. Dunlop, Liam Karp, Kenny Chaplin', 'Assaf Bernstein', 'India Eisley, Jason Isaacs, Mira Sorvino, Penelope Mitchell, John C. MacDonald, Harrison Gilbertson, Kristen Harris, Kiera Johnson', 'R', 'A timid and socially alienated 17-year-old high school student''s life is turned upside down when she switches places with her sinister mirror image.', 'A timid and socially alienated 17-year-old high school student''s life is turned upside down when she switches places with her sinister mirror image.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WTEFOwFBx0mHurnEfv27I0FOe2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526051'),
  ('882270712184689048', 'Look Back', 2024, 'Animation, Drama', 'Kiyotaka Oshiyama, Eriko Kimura, Kazuto Izumita', 'Kiyotaka Oshiyama', 'Yuumi Kawai, Mizuki Yoshida, Yoichiro Saito, Kota Oka, Kureha Maki, Koya Yoshihashi, Takeshi Miyajima, Daisuke Takahashi', 'NR', 'Popular, outgoing Fujino is celebrated by her classmates for her funny comics in the class newspaper. One day, her teacher asks her to share the space with Kyomoto, a truant recluse whose beautiful artwork sparks a competitive fervor in Fujino. What starts as jealousy transforms when Fujino realizes their shared passion for drawing.', 'Popular, outgoing Fujino is celebrated by her classmates for her funny comics in the class newspaper. One day, her teacher asks her to share the space with Kyomoto, a truant recluse whose beautiful artwork sparks a competitive fervor in Fujino. What starts as jealousy transforms when Fujino realizes their shared passion for drawing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4f2EcNkp1Mvp9wE5w7HKxcmACWg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244492'),
