  ('921165342590256347', 'Look Both Ways', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sarah Watt, Ray Argall, Laurie McInnes', 'Sarah Watt', 'William McInnes, Justine Clarke, Anthony Hayes, Lisa Flanagan, Andrew S. Gilbert, Daniela Farinacci, Andreas Sobik, Maggie Dence', null, 'During one unusually hot weekend, four friends struggle after hearing some life-changing news.', 'During one unusually hot weekend, four friends struggle after hearing some life-changing news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHjIvyJJw2FKP1wXTGdcaQ77g28.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16151'),
  ('999825171130072634', 'Look Both Ways', 2022, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Wanuri Kahiu, Alan Caudillo, Amy Lynn', 'April Prosser', 'Lili Reinhart, Danny Ramirez, David Corenswet, Aisha Dee, Andrea Savage, Luke Wilson, Nia Long, Sahara Ale', 'PG-13', 'On the night of her college graduation, Natalie''s life splits into parallel realities after she takes a pregnancy test. What will life and love bring?', 'On the night of her college graduation, Natalie''s life splits into parallel realities after she takes a pregnancy test. What will life and love bring?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jq8IGJgg16mJ95a5OPyS7eGJaam.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805327'),
  ('130528590863918610', 'Look for a Star', 2009, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Ho Yiu-Leung, Ng Man-Ching', 'Cindy Tang, James Yuen Sai-Sang', 'Andy Lau, Shu Qi, Zhang Hanyu, Denise Ho Wan-Si, Zhang Xinyi, David Chiang Da-Wei, George Lam Tsz-Cheung, Rebecca Pan', null, 'Wealthy construction mogul Sam Ching and cabaret dancer Milan Sit fall madly in love with one another despite the class differences that would keep many couples apart. However, what Sit doesn''t know is that Ching is the man responsible for razing a building representing cherished memories from her childhood.', 'Wealthy construction mogul Sam Ching and cabaret dancer Milan Sit fall madly in love with one another despite the class differences that would keep many couples apart. However, what Sit doesn''t know is that Ching is the man responsible for razing a building representing cherished memories from her childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZswHq8hoFnNH3LxFNhY7KeynD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41544'),
  ('512385111650196279', 'Look for a Woman', 1982, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Alla Surikova, Mikhail Agranovich, Vladimir Mazurov', 'Svetlana Volodina', 'Sofiko Chiaureli, Leonid Kuravlyov, Sergei Yursky, Yelena Solovey, Aleksandr Abdulov, Lyudmila Dmitrieva, Leonid Yarmolnik, Elena Denisova-Radzinskaya', null, 'The story begins when Alice Postique, who had to stay late at work, discovers her boss Roche with a knife in his back. When the police detective arrives, Alice recognizes him as her old friend.', 'The story begins when Alice Postique, who had to stay late at work, discovers her boss Roche with a knife in his back. When the police detective arrives, Alice recognizes him as her old friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVUBuc6yQqW5EhmUc9OyvI0dCMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59475'),
  ('166747912306056907', 'Look Out, Officer!', 1990, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Fantasy', 'Lau Shut-Yue, Nico Wong Man-Wan', 'Jing-Kang Tsui', 'Stephen Chow, Bill Tung Biu, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Sunny Fang Kang, Vivian Chen, Amy Yip Chi-Mei, Cutie Mui Siu-Wai, Mak Yan-Wa', null, 'After police officer Piao is murdered, his soul cannot be at rest for his murder has been written off as a suicide. Therefore the heavens send him back to Earth as a spirit to find his ''savior'' who will help him clear his name. Hsing, a rookie officer, is the savior and in return for finding Piao''s killer, Piao must get him a girlfriend and a promotion.', 'After police officer Piao is murdered, his soul cannot be at rest for his murder has been written off as a suicide. Therefore the heavens send him back to Earth as a spirit to find his ''savior'' who will help him clear his name. Hsing, a rookie officer, is the savior and in return for finding Piao''s killer, Piao must get him a girlfriend and a promotion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7YkKy2vM5Zkcs8vEcQF7bN4DBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138960'),
  ('139607177725454474', 'Look to the Sky', 1993, 'Drama, History', 'Enrico De Bernart, Tatiana Zareva, János Kende', 'Filippo Ottoni, Hugh Fleetwood', 'Jean-Hugues Anglade, Juliet Aubrey, Jenner Del Vecchio, Luke Petterson, Francesca De Sapio, Djoko Rosic', null, 'A Jewish boy living in Amsterdam at the onset of World War II is taken to a concentration camp with his parents. Based on the memoir of Holocaust survivor Jona Oberski.', 'A Jewish boy living in Amsterdam at the onset of World War II is taken to a concentration camp with his parents. Based on the memoir of Holocaust survivor Jona Oberski.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vReBBMKMK9W31WBXZlPoZSxC39P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57250'),
  ('187647718448087788', 'Look What''s Happened to Rosemary''s Baby', 1976, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Sam O''Steen, John A. Alonzo, Ken Swor', 'Anthony Wilson', 'Stephen McHattie, Patty Duke, Broderick Crawford, Ruth Gordon, Lloyd Haynes, David Huffman, Tina Louise, George Maharis', 'NR', 'Baby Adrian is now all grown up and separated from his mother, wrestling with the occult influences that plague him, and trying to outrun Satan himself.', 'Baby Adrian is now all grown up and separated from his mother, wrestling with the occult influences that plague him, and trying to outrun Satan himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jd6uKpLv7FRkBMr9IuuZz89cQP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117258'),
  ('1046077539355353205', 'Look Who''s Back', 2015, 'Comedy', 'David Wnendt, Hanno Lentz', 'David Wnendt, Mizzi Meyer', 'Oliver Masucci, Fabian Busch, Katja Riemann, Christoph Maria Herbst, Franziska Wulf, Lars Rudolph, Roberto Blanco, Stephan Grossmann', null, 'When Adolf Hitler reawakens at the site of his former bunker in present-day Berlin, he is mistaken for a comedian and quickly becomes a media phenomenon.', 'When Adolf Hitler reawakens at the site of his former bunker in present-day Berlin, he is mistaken for a comedian and quickly becomes a media phenomenon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CxZWytSiCzZiZA5k0AiLUFtQNA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318917'),
  ('724374210316414740', 'Look Who''s Talking', 1989, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Amy Heckerling, Thomas Del Ruth', 'Amy Heckerling', 'John Travolta, Kirstie Alley, Olympia Dukakis, George Segal, Abe Vigoda, Bruce Willis, Twink Caplan, Jason Schaller', 'PG-13', 'After a single, career-minded woman is left on her own to give birth to the child of a married man, she finds a new romantic chance in a cab driver. Meanwhile, the point-of-view of the newborn baby is narrated through voice-over.', 'After a single, career-minded woman is left on her own to give birth to the child of a married man, she finds a new romantic chance in a cab driver. Meanwhile, the point-of-view of the newborn baby is narrated through voice-over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVM0D7Q6U9H6xMSZmMdfwECih5h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9494'),
  ('155810907939038023', 'Look Who''s Talking Now!', 1993, 'Romance, Comedy, Family', 'Tom Ropelewski, Oliver Stapleton', 'Leslie Dixon, Tom Ropelewski', 'John Travolta, Kirstie Alley, Olympia Dukakis, Lysette Anthony, David Gallagher, Tabitha Lupien, Danny DeVito, Diane Keaton', 'PG-13', 'When high-powered executive Samantha LeBon hatches a scheme to spend a romantic Christmas with her new employee – the unsuspecting, blithesome James – his wife, their kids and their two dogs, Rocks and Daphne, must rescue him before he makes a terrible mistake.', 'When high-powered executive Samantha LeBon hatches a scheme to spend a romantic Christmas with her new employee – the unsuspecting, blithesome James – his wife, their kids and their two dogs, Rocks and Daphne, must rescue him before he makes a terrible mistake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73JahFiizkMVsrrslXInmNK54nC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11982'),
  ('236932012152857837', 'Look Who''s Talking Too', 1990, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Thomas Del Ruth, Amy Heckerling, Judy Slattery', 'Amy Heckerling, Neal Israel', 'John Travolta, Kirstie Alley, Olympia Dukakis, Elias Koteas, Twink Caplan, Bruce Willis, Roseanne Barr, Damon Wayans', 'PG-13', 'Mollie and James are together and raising a family, which now consists of an older Mikey and his baby sister, Julie. Tension between the siblings arises, and as well with Mollie and James when Mollie''s brother Stuart moves in. Mikey is also learning how to use the toilet for the first time.', 'Mollie and James are together and raising a family, which now consists of an older Mikey and his baby sister, Julie. Tension between the siblings arises, and as well with Mollie and James when Mollie''s brother Stuart moves in. Mikey is also learning how to use the toilet for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m409mVHmvDOZJltNzHJYigUthsW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9356'),
  ('1121498764692840558', 'Look, Up in the Sky! The Amazing Story of Superman', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Kevin Burns', 'Steven C. Smith, James Grant Goldin', 'Kevin Spacey, Richard Donner, Bryan Singer, Stan Lee, Brandon Routh, Dean Cain, Margot Kidder, Lesley Ann Warren', null, 'The history of the comic book superhero, Superman, in his various media incarnations.', 'The history of the comic book superhero, Superman, in his various media incarnations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njxYrHZYfYHQ1gia19t2Nt5Bxfp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24479'),
  ('688669381940815476', 'Looker', 1981, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Michael Crichton, Paul Lohmann', 'Michael Crichton', 'Albert Finney, James Coburn, Susan Dey, Leigh Taylor-Young, Dorian Harewood, Tim Rossovich, Darryl Hickman, Kathryn Witt', 'PG', 'Plastic surgeon Larry Roberts performs a series of minor alterations on a group of models who are seeking perfection. The operations are a resounding success. But when someone starts killing his beautiful patients, Dr. Roberts becomes suspicious and starts investigating. What he uncovers are the mysterious - and perhaps murderous - activities of a high-tech computer company called Digital Matrix.', 'Plastic surgeon Larry Roberts performs a series of minor alterations on a group of models who are seeking perfection. The operations are a resounding success. But when someone starts killing his beautiful patients, Dr. Roberts becomes suspicious and starts investigating. What he uncovers are the mysterious - and perhaps murderous - activities of a high-tech computer company called Digital Matrix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQtdfoA0HKyI3YDHCngx6Rp8ePy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21874'),
  ('278195018295032290', 'Lookin'' to Get Out', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Hal Ashby, Haskell Wexler', 'Jon Voight, Al Schwartz', 'Jon Voight, Ann-Margret, Burt Young, Bert Remsen, Jude Farese, Allen Keller, Richard Bradford, Stacey Pickren', 'R', 'Two gamblers must leave New York City after one loses a lot of money. Doing what all gamblers in trouble would do, they hurry to the gambling capital Las Vegas to turn their luck around.', 'Two gamblers must leave New York City after one loses a lot of money. Doing what all gamblers in trouble would do, they hurry to the gambling capital Las Vegas to turn their luck around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcfuDnWoGBFqdqDRoJrfj21jAhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47878'),
  ('759915929869662428', 'Looking Back at it All: The Dragon Ball Z Year-End Show!', 1993, 'Action, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Masako Nozawa', null, 'This movie is very different from the previous TV specials (Dragon Ball Z: Bardock - The Father of Goku and Dragon Ball Z: The History of Trunks), as it is a look back at what had happened in Dragon Ball Z in 1993. In this film, which is believed to take place some time around the 25th World Martial Arts Tournament, Gohan and Goten are having a hot bath outside in the middle of winter. Goku (who is still dead) suddenly appears in front of his sons with the help of his Instant Transmission, and joins them in the tub. While there, the three Saiyans reflect back on the events that occurred during the Cell Games. Inside the house after Chi-Chi appeared, Goku tells his sons about Pikkon and the Other World Tournament. Later, the four members of the Son family appear dressed nicely. Gohan says that the adult division of the Tournament will begin this next year (in 1994), and the special comes to an end.', 'This movie is very different from the previous TV specials (Dragon Ball Z: Bardock - The Father of Goku and Dragon Ball Z: The History of Trunks), as it is a look back at what had happened in Dragon Ball Z in 1993. In this film, which is believed to take place some time around the 25th World Martial Arts Tournament, Gohan and Goten are having a hot bath outside in the middle of winter. Goku (who is still dead) suddenly appears in front of his sons with the help of his Instant Transmission, and joins them in the tub. While there, the three Saiyans reflect back on the events that occurred during the Cell Games. Inside the house after Chi-Chi appeared, Goku tells his sons about Pikkon and the Other World Tournament. Later, the four members of the Son family appear dressed nicely. Gohan says that the adult division of the Tournament will begin this next year (in 1994), and the special comes to an end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOtvIOc65gmDdrAk3Eg01oH4gZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371370'),
  ('742816124857875772', 'Looking for Alexander', 2004, 'Drama', 'Francis Leclerc, Steve Asselin', 'Francis Leclerc, Marcel Beaulieu', 'Roy Dupuis, Rosa Zacharie, Nathalie Coupal, Karine Lagueux, Guy Thauvette, Maka Kotto, Stéphane Archambault, Robert Lalonde', null, 'Disturbing and violent memories haunt a man after he emerges from a lengthy coma.', 'Disturbing and violent memories haunt a man after he emerges from a lengthy coma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5PQJRPr6TYMUU5Ml1JZqxYbNOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108907'),
  ('303125063451650332', 'Looking for Alibrandi', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Kate Woods, Deborah Antoniou, James McTeigue', 'Melina Marchetta', 'Pia Miranda, Greta Scacchi, Anthony LaPaglia, Kick Gurry, Elena Cotta, Matthew Newton, Kerry Walker, Leanne Carlow', null, 'Josie Alibrandi is 17 and doesn''t know where she belongs. This year, however, everything is going to change. Josie will face her fears, uncover secrets, and even discover the true identity of her father.', 'Josie Alibrandi is 17 and doesn''t know where she belongs. This year, however, everything is going to change. Josie will face her fears, uncover secrets, and even discover the true identity of her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w95G4yuCBwRAhHl0ATRxSrPobNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25069'),
  ('54927115700596365', 'Looking for Cheyenne', 2005, 'Romance, Drama', 'Stephan Massis, Valérie Minetto', 'Cécile Vargaftig, Valérie Minetto', 'Mila Dekker, Aurélia Petit, Malik Zidi, Luc Leclerc du Sablon, Christine Dory, Guilaine Londez, Pierre Hiessler, Laurence Côte', null, 'Cheyenne, a journalist, decides to leave Paris after being laid off and to settle down in the middle of nowhere, far from the society she hates. The trouble is that she leaves Sonia, her true love, behind. The latter, a teacher who loves her job, refuses to give up everything - including her comfort - to follow her. Sonia makes all the efforts in the world to forget Cheyenne, whether in the arms of Pierre, a charming anarchist, or in those of Béatrice, a gay woman who soon proves perverse and dangerous, only to realize that her heart belongs to Cheyenne and nobody else.', 'Cheyenne, a journalist, decides to leave Paris after being laid off and to settle down in the middle of nowhere, far from the society she hates. The trouble is that she leaves Sonia, her true love, behind. The latter, a teacher who loves her job, refuses to give up everything - including her comfort - to follow her. Sonia makes all the efforts in the world to forget Cheyenne, whether in the arms of Pierre, a charming anarchist, or in those of Béatrice, a gay woman who soon proves perverse and dangerous, only to realize that her heart belongs to Cheyenne and nobody else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFQkLzjTtVqpi1EYoDbweD31MN7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12807'),
  ('152628241163293275', 'Looking for Comedy in the Muslim World', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Albert Brooks, Thomas E. Ackerman', 'Albert Brooks', 'Albert Brooks, Amy Ryan, Sheetal Sheth, Fred Thompson, Penny Marshall, Victoria Burrows, John Carroll Lynch, Jon Tenney', null, 'To improve its relations with Muslim countries, the United States government sends comedian Albert Brooks to south Asia to write a report on what makes followers of Islam laugh.', 'To improve its relations with Muslim countries, the United States government sends comedian Albert Brooks to south Asia to write a report on what makes followers of Islam laugh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7U1stA5Jr2PjGKu21mIA3mHnohl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25890'),
  ('140258932392004477', 'Looking for Eric', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ken Loach, Barry Ackroyd, Kahleen Crawford', 'Paul Laverty', 'Éric Cantona, Steve Evets, Stephanie Bishop, John Henshaw, Gerard Kearns, Stefan Gumbs, Lucy-Jo Hudson, Justin Moorhouse', null, 'A man trying to put his life back on track gets some advice from an unexpected benefactor -- the ex-footballer Eric Cantona.', 'A man trying to put his life back on track gets some advice from an unexpected benefactor -- the ex-footballer Eric Cantona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTHUY0E1FYMFKiQ8UDKx793LtW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18898'),
  ('1071831761655667106', 'Looking for Gilles Caron', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Hélène Louvart, Karine Aulnette, Mariana Otero', 'Jérôme Tonnerre, Mariana Otero', null, null, 'Gilles Caron was at the height of his career as a brilliant photojournalist when he went missing in Cambodia in 1970. He was just 30 years old. Through his iconic photographs, and the gaps between them, this film, constructed like an investigation, aims to restore the photographer’s presence, recount the story of his gaze, and how he managed to cover every high profile conflict of his day in such a short period of time.', 'Gilles Caron was at the height of his career as a brilliant photojournalist when he went missing in Cambodia in 1970. He was just 30 years old. Through his iconic photographs, and the gaps between them, this film, constructed like an investigation, aims to restore the photographer’s presence, recount the story of his gaze, and how he managed to cover every high profile conflict of his day in such a short period of time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3W5fsqJTN3CydJrklhnRTIexuaf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656573'),
  ('364459087041531926', 'Looking for Her', 2016, 'Drama', 'Ounie Lecomte, Caroline Champetier', 'Ounie Lecomte, Agnès de Sacy', 'Céline Sallette, Anne Benoît, Françoise Lebrun, Elyes Aguis, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Catherine Mouchet, Micha Lescot, Pascal Elso', null, 'Elisa, on a verge of divorce, leaves Paris with her son Noe to settle in her hometown of Dunkerque to find the biological mother who gave her up for adoption 30 years before.', 'Elisa, on a verge of divorce, leaves Paris with her son Noe to settle in her hometown of Dunkerque to find the biological mother who gave her up for adoption 30 years before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rbfvXjEAEBeyNyupIVIF2STTrV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361255'),
  ('20471742037367696', 'Looking for Her', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Alexandra Swarens, Lucas Pitassi', 'Alexandra Swarens', 'Olivia Buckle, Alexandra Swarens, Michelle Hakala Wolf, Sophie Arrick, Robert Artz, Adrienne Ogle, Cecily Breaux, Elizabeth Manning', 'NR', 'Taylor is headed home for the holidays and her family is finally ready to meet her girlfriend "Jess". The only problem is, Jess isn''t really her girlfriend. Taylor holds open auditions for someone to play the part for the holidays.', 'Taylor is headed home for the holidays and her family is finally ready to meet her girlfriend "Jess". The only problem is, Jess isn''t really her girlfriend. Taylor holds open auditions for someone to play the part for the holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPvVZYfNY0xZPCcrP4zR5b4vGDt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1038157'),
  ('66293982720404582', 'Looking for Hortense', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Romain Winding', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Agnès de Sacy', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Kristin Scott Thomas, Isabelle Carré, Marin Orcand Tourres, Arthur Igual, Jackie Berroyer, Masahiro Kashiwagi, Jérôme Beaujour', null, 'Damien, a Chinese civilization professor, lives with his wife, Iva, a stage director, and their son Noé. The couple''s relationship has drifted into routine that has drained it of love. Damien finds himself trapped one day by Iva, who orders him to ask his father, a senior member of the French Council of State, for help in preventing Zorica, a woman Iva knows, from being deported. But Damien and his father don''t get on and are barely ever in touch with each other. This dangerous mission throws Damien into a spiral that will turn his life upside down.', 'Damien, a Chinese civilization professor, lives with his wife, Iva, a stage director, and their son Noé. The couple''s relationship has drifted into routine that has drained it of love. Damien finds himself trapped one day by Iva, who orders him to ask his father, a senior member of the French Council of State, for help in preventing Zorica, a woman Iva knows, from being deported. But Damien and his father don''t get on and are barely ever in touch with each other. This dangerous mission throws Damien into a spiral that will turn his life upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckvQYBxjl9ophpqgWKVpXcmKpcu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130055'),
  ('1042218004464268112', 'Looking for Jackie', 2009, 'Action, Comedy, Family', 'Jiang Ping, Fang Gangliang', null, 'Zhang Yishan, Jackie Chan, Jiang Hongbo, Yan Bingyan, Wu Jun, Yuan Wenting, Yu Nan, Tian Hua', null, 'Jackie Chan is the undefeated Kung Fu Master who dishes out the action in traditional Jackie Chan style. When a young boy sets out to learn how to fight from the Master himself, he not only witnesses some spectacular fights, but learns some important life lessons along the way.', 'Jackie Chan is the undefeated Kung Fu Master who dishes out the action in traditional Jackie Chan style. When a young boy sets out to learn how to fight from the Master himself, he not only witnesses some spectacular fights, but learns some important life lessons along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ds8xP7319zuPMa09kxzkIPBsHVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45682'),
  ('508864607690448170', 'Looking for Langston', 1989, 'Drama', 'Isaac Julien, Nina Kellgren', 'Isaac Julien', 'Ben Ellison, Matthew Baidoo, Akim Mogaji, John Wilson, Dencil Williams, Guy Burgess, Dublin James Wahlberg, Harry Donaldson', 'NR', 'A black and white, fantasy-like recreation of high-society gay men during the Harlem Renaissance, with archival footage and photographs intercut with a story. A wake is going on, with mourners gathered around a coffin. Downstairs is an elegant bar where tuxedoed men dance and talk. One of them has a dream in which he comes upon Beauty, who seems to reject him, although when he awakes, Beauty is sleeping beside him. His story and his visits to the jazz and dance club are framed by voices reading from the poetry and essays of Hughes and others. The text is rarely explicit, but the freedom of gay Black men in the 1920s in Harlem is suggested and celebrated visually.', 'A black and white, fantasy-like recreation of high-society gay men during the Harlem Renaissance, with archival footage and photographs intercut with a story. A wake is going on, with mourners gathered around a coffin. Downstairs is an elegant bar where tuxedoed men dance and talk. One of them has a dream in which he comes upon Beauty, who seems to reject him, although when he awakes, Beauty is sleeping beside him. His story and his visits to the jazz and dance club are framed by voices reading from the poetry and essays of Hughes and others. The text is rarely explicit, but the freedom of gay Black men in the 1920s in Harlem is suggested and celebrated visually.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzrBH6tU5xSeFZc9UqsdxdXrH8s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32329'),
  ('622330204307296872', 'Looking for Magical Doremi', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Shoko Nakamura, Junichi Sato, Haruka Kamatani', 'Takashi Yamada', 'Aoi Morikawa, Rena Matsui, Kanako Momota, Kenta Hamano, Shohei Miura, Akira Ishida, Chiemi Chiba, Nami Miyahara', null, 'Three women – 27 year old Tokyo office worker Mire Yoshizuki, 22 year old fourth-year college student Sora Nagase, and 20 year old boyish, part-time Hiroshima okonomiyaki shop worker and freelancer Reika Kawatani – are drawn together by a magic gem.', 'Three women – 27 year old Tokyo office worker Mire Yoshizuki, 22 year old fourth-year college student Sora Nagase, and 20 year old boyish, part-time Hiroshima okonomiyaki shop worker and freelancer Reika Kawatani – are drawn together by a magic gem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttIIyat5PkVLTPE8bySAwjwAAqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532961'),
  ('629057194243251010', 'Looking for Melania Trump', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Laura Haïm', null, 'Melania Trump, Donald Trump', null, 'Melania is both an ideal symbol of a conservative America and the evil embodiment of limitless ambition. Political journalist Laurence Haïm has observed her for the past years and is able to reveal a much more complex part of the personality and life of the mysterious lady. For some, Melania Trump is an unscrupulous trophy wife on the arm of the most powerful man in the world. For others, the First Lady embodies with distinction the conservative woman, the unwavering wife in the service of her husband. For all, she remains inaccessible and secretive, a woman whose public appearances are heavily prepared and scripted. In the time of ‘Me too’, let us take a dive into conservative America, discover another side of feminism impersonated by none other than Melania Trump.', 'Melania is both an ideal symbol of a conservative America and the evil embodiment of limitless ambition. Political journalist Laurence Haïm has observed her for the past years and is able to reveal a much more complex part of the personality and life of the mysterious lady. For some, Melania Trump is an unscrupulous trophy wife on the arm of the most powerful man in the world. For others, the First Lady embodies with distinction the conservative woman, the unwavering wife in the service of her husband. For all, she remains inaccessible and secretive, a woman whose public appearances are heavily prepared and scripted. In the time of ‘Me too’, let us take a dive into conservative America, discover another side of feminism impersonated by none other than Melania Trump.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vWIvuOWbgPN0OR6mfPKIFONcL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752730'),
  ('92574473449959276', 'Looking for Miguel', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Edgar Gil, Juan Fisher', 'Tomislav Novakovic', 'Laura García, Julián Román, Hernán Méndez, Blas Jaramillo, Marcela Carvajal, Luis Fernando Montoya, Luis Fernando Bohórquez, Ana María Kamper', null, 'A wealthy Columbian politician blinded by his own privilege is forced to walk a mile in the shoes of the people he despises most after falling victim to a violent attack and subsequently losing his memory. Miguel was a man of fine stock, a politician who has led a charmed life since the day he was born. But Miguel has no appreciation for his lot in life, and scoffs at the everyday people who must struggle just to survive. One day, after being assaulted on the street and left for dead, Miguel awakens with no memory of the past. He has forgotten his distain for the dumpster divers, petty thieves, and wandering transients who crowd the city streets, and now their warmth and solidarity is the only thing keeping him alive. As Miguel forges a friendship with a pious but promiscuous drag queen, the fragments of the past gradually become illuminated in his mind, prompting him on a desperate quest to reclaim his identity and atone for the sins of his past.', 'A wealthy Columbian politician blinded by his own privilege is forced to walk a mile in the shoes of the people he despises most after falling victim to a violent attack and subsequently losing his memory. Miguel was a man of fine stock, a politician who has led a charmed life since the day he was born. But Miguel has no appreciation for his lot in life, and scoffs at the everyday people who must struggle just to survive. One day, after being assaulted on the street and left for dead, Miguel awakens with no memory of the past. He has forgotten his distain for the dumpster divers, petty thieves, and wandering transients who crowd the city streets, and now their warmth and solidarity is the only thing keeping him alive. As Miguel forges a friendship with a pious but promiscuous drag queen, the fragments of the past gradually become illuminated in his mind, prompting him on a desperate quest to reclaim his identity and atone for the sins of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lcYfrYFgNmE876xGGYWcnMC267.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327500'),
  ('143877683911899251', 'Looking for Mr. Goodbar', 1977, 'Drama, Crime', 'Richard Brooks, William A. Fraker, Alan Brimfeld', 'Richard Brooks', 'Diane Keaton, Tuesday Weld, William Atherton, Richard Kiley, Richard Gere, Alan Feinstein, Tom Berenger, Priscilla Pointer', 'R', 'A short, unhappy affair with a married man leads a dedicated schoolteacher into the alcohol-and-drug fueled underworld of singles’ bars, where she begins to engage in a pattern of dangerous sexual activity.', 'A short, unhappy affair with a married man leads a dedicated schoolteacher into the alcohol-and-drug fueled underworld of singles’ bars, where she begins to engage in a pattern of dangerous sexual activity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1qKNKRvDEhnl0PQS26PirNF81v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37749'),
  ('2056319599994450', 'Looking for Richard', 1996, 'Documentary', 'Al Pacino, Robert Leacock, Stephen C. Confer', 'Al Pacino, Frederic Kimball', 'Al Pacino, Winona Ryder, Kevin Spacey, Alec Baldwin, Aidan Quinn, Harris Yulin, Penelope Allen, Kenneth Branagh', 'PG-13', 'Al Pacino''s deeply-felt rumination on Shakespeare''s significance and relevance to the modern world through interviews and an in-depth analysis of "Richard III."', 'Al Pacino''s deeply-felt rumination on Shakespeare''s significance and relevance to the modern world through interviews and an in-depth analysis of "Richard III."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iEgEoMP1S2YWKkYkwm8cgg2bBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42314'),
  ('1096058216453471784', 'Looking for Simon', 2011, 'Drama', 'Bernadette Paaßen, Jan Krüger', 'Jan Krüger', 'Corinna Harfouch, Nico Rogner, Mehdi Dehbi, Valérie Leroy, Trystan Pütter, Mireille Perrier, Toby Ashraf', null, 'Simon, a young German doctor who lives and works in Marseille, goes missing. His appartment is empty. His mother Valérie is desperate. She doesn''t understand the reason of his disappearance. Therefore she asks Jens, Simon''s former boyfriend, to come to Marseille and help her find him.', 'Simon, a young German doctor who lives and works in Marseille, goes missing. His appartment is empty. His mother Valérie is desperate. She doesn''t understand the reason of his disappearance. Therefore she asks Jens, Simon''s former boyfriend, to come to Marseille and help her find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nYSAlA5h45EVS8HiWESsHCC07b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179404'),
  ('618450601341753835', 'Looking for Teddy', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Julien Hervé, Philippe Mechelen, Stéphane Le Parc', 'Philippe Mechelen, Julien Hervé, Nessim Chikhaoui', 'Kad Merad, Malik Bentalha, Guy Marchand, Ludovic Berthillot, Avant Strangel, Enya Baroux, Romain Lancry, David Salles', null, 'A father enlists the help of an airport employee on a quest to find his daughter''s teddy.', 'A father enlists the help of an airport employee on a quest to find his daughter''s teddy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxG6Z6Dk6dLfONwYkNlsZDZX8Mm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486520'),
  ('747957716357287981', 'Looking Glass', 2018, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Tim Hunter, Patrick Cady, Brent Geisler', 'Jerry Rapp, Matthew Wilder', 'Nicolas Cage, Robin Tunney, Marc Blucas, Ernie Lively, Jacque Gray, Bill Bolender, Barry Jay Minoff, Kassia Conway', 'R', 'A psycho- sexual thriller following a couple that buys an old motel in the desert looking for a new beginning, but what seemed at first as an escape is soon a thrilling ride through a mysterious world when Ray discovers a two way mirror and witnesses a horrifying murder. In a twisted game of cat and mouse, Ray must race to save his wife and himself from a gruesome secret connected to the motel and the strange people who visit there.', 'A psycho- sexual thriller following a couple that buys an old motel in the desert looking for a new beginning, but what seemed at first as an escape is soon a thrilling ride through a mysterious world when Ray discovers a two way mirror and witnesses a horrifying murder. In a twisted game of cat and mouse, Ray must race to save his wife and himself from a gruesome secret connected to the motel and the strange people who visit there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zSzaUmoUCwII2pGTqX1jaX8F0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437375'),
  ('741526559125552283', 'Looking Up', 2019, 'Family, Drama', 'Deng Chao, Yu Baimei, Max Da-Yung Wang', 'Yu Baimei', 'Deng Chao, Bai Yu, Ren Suxi, Liang Chao, Wu Jing, Wang Xi, Li Jianyi, Sun Xilun', null, 'In the vast space, the astronauts lost connection with the ground. He recalled his greatest father in the most desperate situation. Father and son run across time, guarding love and family. The story is full of joy, warmth, tears and wonders.', 'In the vast space, the astronauts lost connection with the ground. He recalled his greatest father in the most desperate situation. Father and son run across time, guarding love and family. The story is full of joy, warmth, tears and wonders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGBUeEFacHLZiAtTxvnH6mgLpsS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603765'),
  ('637948708199570266', 'Looking: The Movie', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Andrew Haigh, Xavier Grobet', 'Andrew Haigh, Michael Lannan', 'Jonathan Groff, Frankie J. Alvarez, Murray Bartlett, Lauren Weedman, Russell Tovey, Raúl Castillo, Daniel Franzese, O-T Fagbenle', null, 'Patrick returns to San Francisco for the first time in almost a year to celebrate a momentous event with his old friends. In the process, he must face the unresolved relationships he left behind and make difficult choices about what’s important to him.', 'Patrick returns to San Francisco for the first time in almost a year to celebrate a momentous event with his old friends. In the process, he must face the unresolved relationships he left behind and make difficult choices about what’s important to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQdda275rJqNi6Ifrf3ntWBsXDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371738'),
  ('39087228488440698', 'Lookout', 2025, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Stefan Colson, Sam Wilkerson', 'Brandon Cahela', 'Meghan Carrasquillo, Trent Culkin, John Marrs, Mitch Tellez, Robert Clark, Jim Round, Braden McCawley, Cara Leoni', 'NR', 'Seeking peace away from her turbulent life, a young woman accepts a job as a fire lookout at a remote wilderness tower. As she settles into her new role, eerie disturbances and strange occurrences begin to unfold, and she must uncover the chilling secrets that disrupt her isolation before it’s too late.', 'Seeking peace away from her turbulent life, a young woman accepts a job as a fire lookout at a remote wilderness tower. As she settles into her new role, eerie disturbances and strange occurrences begin to unfold, and she must uncover the chilling secrets that disrupt her isolation before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puQMWEXZ9wpqwniz9ac3MTAe6BB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1530127'),
  ('208203408769229831', 'Looks and Smiles', 1981, 'Drama', 'Ken Loach, Paul Morrison, Chris Menges', 'Barry Hines', 'Graham Green, Carolyn Nicholson, Tony Pitts, Roy Haywood, Phil Askham, Pam Darrell, Tracey Goodlad, Patti Nicholls', null, 'Thatcherism and the Irish troubles provide the backdrop for this study of Mick, a well-meaning youth in Sheffield, who has, unlike Dickens'' Pip, no expectations. Mick lives with his parents, works on his motorbike, looks for work, and every two weeks gets his check from the dole. There are no jobs. His best mate Alan joins the army to fix tanks and is sent to Belfast to quell Catholics. At a disco, Mick meets Karen, who works at a shoe shop and lives with her recently-separated mom. Karen misses her dad. She offers Mick emotional stability and a route to adulthood; Alan pitches the army. Does Mick have a future?', 'Thatcherism and the Irish troubles provide the backdrop for this study of Mick, a well-meaning youth in Sheffield, who has, unlike Dickens'' Pip, no expectations. Mick lives with his parents, works on his motorbike, looks for work, and every two weeks gets his check from the dole. There are no jobs. His best mate Alan joins the army to fix tanks and is sent to Belfast to quell Catholics. At a disco, Mick meets Karen, who works at a shoe shop and lives with her recently-separated mom. Karen misses her dad. She offers Mick emotional stability and a route to adulthood; Alan pitches the army. Does Mick have a future?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nPFkUkZD77boMxurjPZUE5QPyJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92711'),
  ('1131197219806684342', 'Looks That Kill', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Damian Horan, Kellen Moore', 'Kellen Moore', 'Brandon Flynn, Julia Goldani Telles, Ki Hong Lee, Annie Mumolo, Peter Scolari, Priscilla Lopez, Susan James Berger, Monique Kim', 'NR', 'A teenager lives out the hilarious and often tragic consequences of being lethally attractive, until he meets a girl with a congenital defect.', 'A teenager lives out the hilarious and often tragic consequences of being lethally attractive, until he meets a girl with a congenital defect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41qVwAz4ZCc8g7YQETQih8fpB8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610290'),
  ('291050434549108905', 'Looney Tunes 50th Anniversary', 1986, 'Documentary, Animation, History, TV Movie', 'Gary Weis, Dick Weiss', 'Max Pross, Tom Gammill, Greg Ford', 'Eve Arden, Candice Bergen, Mel Blanc, David Bowie, George Burns, Chevy Chase, Cher, Kirk Douglas', 'G', 'Some of the biggest stars in show business pay a fun tribute to Bugs Bunny and the rest of the Looney Tunes to mark their 50th anniversary.', 'Some of the biggest stars in show business pay a fun tribute to Bugs Bunny and the rest of the Looney Tunes to mark their 50th anniversary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6738UaAZVnI1tgpoNGUad91U9Js.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503354'),
  ('272339865545742086', 'Looney Tunes: Back in Action', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Dean Cundey, Joe Dante, Eric Goldberg', 'Roger S.H. Schulman', 'Brendan Fraser, Jenna Elfman, Steve Martin, Joe Alaskey, Jeff Bennett, Timothy Dalton, Billy West, Heather Locklear', 'PG', 'Fed up with all the attention going to Bugs Bunny, Daffy Duck quits Hollywood, teams up with recently-fired stuntman Damien Drake Jr. and embarks on a round-the-world adventure, along with Bugs and The VP of Warner Bros. Their mission? Find Damien''s father, and the missing blue diamond... and stay one step ahead of The Acme Corp., who wants the diamond for their own purposes.', 'Fed up with all the attention going to Bugs Bunny, Daffy Duck quits Hollywood, teams up with recently-fired stuntman Damien Drake Jr. and embarks on a round-the-world adventure, along with Bugs and The VP of Warner Bros. Their mission? Find Damien''s father, and the missing blue diamond... and stay one step ahead of The Acme Corp., who wants the diamond for their own purposes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0kntpdsHA0QdYjpQdNBqrVTdQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10715'),
  ('850837628352897270', 'Looney Tunes: Rabbits Run', 2015, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Jeff Siergey', null, 'Jeff Bergman, Billy West, Bob Bergen, Fred Armisen, Jim Rash, Rachel Ramras, Jess Harnell, Maurice LaMarche', 'G', 'Lola Bunny invents a perfume with the adverse effect of turning people invisible, sending her and cab driver Bugs Bunny on the run from the FBI, while another shady group seeks the formula.', 'Lola Bunny invents a perfume with the adverse effect of turning people invisible, sending her and cab driver Bugs Bunny on the run from the FBI, while another shady group seeks the formula.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEzGg81jV0OBjy3rxQtfU9WMlOt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349045'),
