  ('871220003357023539', 'Looop Lapeta', 2022, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Yash Khanna, Aakash Bhatia, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Arnav Vepa Nanduri, Ketan Pedgaonkar, Aakash Bhatia', 'Taapsee Pannu, Tahir Raj Bhasin, Shreya Dhanwanthary, Dibyendu Bhattacharya, Rajendra Chawla, K.C. Shankar, Suresh Triveni, Manik Papneja', 'R', 'When her boyfriend loses a mobster''s cash, Savi races against the clock to save the day — if only she can break out of a curious cycle of dead ends.', 'When her boyfriend loses a mobster''s cash, Savi races against the clock to save the day — if only she can break out of a curious cycle of dead ends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onGdT8sYi89drvSJyEJnft97rOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783461'),
  ('887592203146844874', 'Loop', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Bruno Bini, Magali Heinze, Júnior Malta', 'Bruno Bini', 'Bruno Gagliasso, Bia Arantes, Branca Messina, Zécarlos Machado, Roberto Birindelli, Nikolas Antunes, Betânia Franco', null, 'After his girlfriend''s murder, Daniel, a physics student becomes obsessed with the idea of going back in time to stop the tragedy. He lets himself be consumed by his own obsession until after years of isolation, he finds the solution. Daniel then gives up his future and returns to the past. However, he is not the same man.', 'After his girlfriend''s murder, Daniel, a physics student becomes obsessed with the idea of going back in time to stop the tragedy. He lets himself be consumed by his own obsession until after years of isolation, he finds the solution. Daniel then gives up his future and returns to the past. However, he is not the same man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvy0aLY1Pidl8UsBQfzx8INsl34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610203'),
  ('370973455075106201', 'Loop', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Drama', 'Erica Milsom, Danielle Feinberg, Sylvia Gray Wong', 'Erica Milsom', 'Madison Bandy, Christiano "Chachi" Delgado, Louis Gonzales, Asher Brodkey', 'PG', 'A non-verbal, autistic girl and a chatty boy are partnered on a canoeing trip. To complete their journey across an urban lake, they must both learn how the other experiences the world.', 'A non-verbal, autistic girl and a chatty boy are partnered on a canoeing trip. To complete their journey across an urban lake, they must both learn how the other experiences the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vK8QmJpKK8gRzJ7NFQ26K5nMpm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574089'),
  ('705246812789897959', 'Loop Track', 2023, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Tom Sainsbury, Milon Tesiram', 'Tom Sainsbury', 'Tom Sainsbury, Hayden J. Weal, Tawanda Manyimo, Noa Campbell, Kate Simmonds, Bianca Seinafo, Gaby Solomona', null, 'A four-day journey turns into a fight for survival. This is a psychological thriller about Ian, who wants to get as far away from humanity as possible, into the New Zealand bush. Some other individuals get attached to him. And he has the feeling that they are being followed. Is that real though?', 'A four-day journey turns into a fight for survival. This is a psychological thriller about Ian, who wants to get as far away from humanity as possible, into the New Zealand bush. Some other individuals get attached to him. And he has the feeling that they are being followed. Is that real though?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cCztHZK3VKCECAV9YRDq1yAOP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1147236'),
  ('612473780276624306', 'Looper', 2012, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Rian Johnson, Steve Yedlin, Jaron Presant', 'Rian Johnson', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Bruce Willis, Emily Blunt, Paul Dano, Noah Segan, Piper Perabo, Jeff Daniels, Pierce Gagnon', 'R', 'In the year 2044, time travel has not yet been invented but in 30 years it will have been. When the mob wants to get rid of someone, they will send their target into the past where a looper, a hired gun, like Joe is waiting to mop up. Joe is getting rich and life is good until the day the mob decides to close the loop, sending back Joe''s future self for assassination.', 'In the year 2044, time travel has not yet been invented but in 30 years it will have been. When the mob wants to get rid of someone, they will send their target into the past where a looper, a hired gun, like Joe is waiting to mop up. Joe is getting rich and life is good until the day the mob decides to close the loop, sending back Joe''s future self for assassination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNjL6SqErDBE8OUZlrDLkexfsCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59967'),
  ('262033811656904281', 'Loophole', 1954, 'Crime', 'Harold D. Schuster, William A. Sickner', 'Warren Douglas', 'Barry Sullivan, Dorothy Malone, Charles McGraw, Don Haggerty, Mary Beth Hughes, Don Beddoe, Dayton Lummis, Joanne Jordan', 'NR', 'Bank teller Mike Donovan (Barry Sullivan) takes the first step on the road to Perdition when he fails to report a $49,000 shortage. Accused of theft, Donovan is fired from his job. He is then prevented from finding other employment by Javert-like insurance investigator Gus Slavin (Charles McGraw). Despite many setbacks, Donovan attempts to clear his muddied name.', 'Bank teller Mike Donovan (Barry Sullivan) takes the first step on the road to Perdition when he fails to report a $49,000 shortage. Accused of theft, Donovan is fired from his job. He is then prevented from finding other employment by Javert-like insurance investigator Gus Slavin (Charles McGraw). Despite many setbacks, Donovan attempts to clear his muddied name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sww9BNCjNiPpQh3IFF6KzpabMNA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26948'),
  ('167447433657082768', 'Loophole', 1981, 'Crime, Drama, Adventure', 'John Quested, Michael Reed, Jimmy Komisarjevsky', 'Jonathan Hales', 'Albert Finney, Martin Sheen, Susannah York, Jonathan Pryce, Colin Blakely, Robert Morley, Alfred Lynch, Tony Doyle', null, 'When architect Stephen Booker loses his partnership, he finds jobs hard to come by, and with money in short supply, he unwittingly becomes involved in a daring scheme to rob one of London''s biggest bank vaults.', 'When architect Stephen Booker loses his partnership, he finds jobs hard to come by, and with money in short supply, he unwittingly becomes involved in a daring scheme to rob one of London''s biggest bank vaults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqOPDPz0WfvvUDsocHEGSdg8NWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141824'),
  ('903652870589535319', 'Looping', 2016, 'Drama', 'Leonie Krippendorff, Jieun Yi', 'Leonie Krippendorff', 'Jella Haase, Lana Cooper, Marie-Lou Sellem, Markus Hering, Luisa-Céline Gaffron, Maximilian Klas, Christian Kuchenbuch, Joseph Bundschuh', null, 'Three women, three different stories, one room in a psychiatric clinic. A strong and tumultuous relationship erupts among them, evolving into an energetic, honest and erotic bond. This takes them to a point where their hopes may be fulfilled… in very different ways.', 'Three women, three different stories, one room in a psychiatric clinic. A strong and tumultuous relationship erupts among them, evolving into an energetic, honest and erotic bond. This takes them to a point where their hopes may be fulfilled… in very different ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZhbIBBFhJIc5btrnc5fPNrTNpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393411'),
  ('717658014223307607', 'Loops', 1940, 'Animation', 'Norman McLaren', null, null, null, 'An experimental film in which both sound and visuals were created entirely by McLaren drawing directly upon the film with ordinary pen and ink. The titles are in eight languages. Rereleased with multilingual titles in 1949.', 'An experimental film in which both sound and visuals were created entirely by McLaren drawing directly upon the film with ordinary pen and ink. The titles are in eight languages. Rereleased with multilingual titles in 1949.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGft7ZWjGyyWesZPxPp8jYIgAIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152999'),
  ('173643278182331493', 'Loose Cannons', 1990, 'Comedy, Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Colin D. Irwin, Bob Clark, Reginald H. Morris', 'Richard Christian Matheson, Richard Matheson, Bob Clark', 'Gene Hackman, Dan Aykroyd, Dom DeLuise, Ronny Cox, Nancy Travis, Robert Prosky, Paul Koslo, Dick O''Neill', 'R', 'Mac, the two-fisted, savvy cop finds that he''s being saddled with a new partner, a known burnout, to work with him on a new and difficult case. The new partner is Ellis, an amazing detective, one who puts Sherlock Holmes to shame with his lightning-fast deductions. But he keeps assuming the personalities of entire casts of Television shows. This can be a problem when people begin shooting at them.', 'Mac, the two-fisted, savvy cop finds that he''s being saddled with a new partner, a known burnout, to work with him on a new and difficult case. The new partner is Ellis, an amazing detective, one who puts Sherlock Holmes to shame with his lightning-fast deductions. But he keeps assuming the personalities of entire casts of Television shows. This can be a problem when people begin shooting at them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezzfFY9S8r4PkhXLqw9x7gAaStd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24558'),
  ('139613047306170741', 'Loose Cannons', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Maurizio Calvesi, Gaia Filardo', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Ivan Cotroneo', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Nicole Grimaudo, Alessandro Preziosi, Ennio Fantastichini, Lunetta Savino, Ilaria Occhini, Bianca Nappi, Carmine Recano', null, 'Tommaso is the youngest son of the Cantones, a large, traditional southern Italian family operating a pasta-making business since the 1960s. On a trip home from Rome, where he studies literature and lives with his boyfriend, Tommaso decides to tell his parents the truth about himself. But when he is finally ready to come out in front of the entire family, his older brother Antonio ruins his plans.', 'Tommaso is the youngest son of the Cantones, a large, traditional southern Italian family operating a pasta-making business since the 1960s. On a trip home from Rome, where he studies literature and lives with his boyfriend, Tommaso decides to tell his parents the truth about himself. But when he is finally ready to come out in front of the entire family, his older brother Antonio ruins his plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYSXvD0sB2MRXF5YreSWtdcW4Jv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40794'),
  ('404781854230063626', 'Loose Change', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Dylan Avery', 'Dylan Avery', 'Dylan Avery, Marcel Bernard', null, '2nd Edition of Loose Change documentary. What if...September 11th was not a surprise attack on America, but rather, a cold and calculated genocide by our own government?We were told that the twin towers were hit by commercial jetliners and subsequently brought down by jet fuel. We were told that the Pentagon was hit by a Boeing 757. We were told that flight 93 crashed in Shanksville, Pennsylvania. We were told that nineteen Arabs from halfway across the globe, acting under orders from Osama Bin Laden, were responsible. What you will see here will prove without a shadow of a doubt that everything you know about 9/11 is a complete fabrication. Conspiracy theory? It''s not a theory if you can prove it.Written and narrated by Dylan Avery, this film presents a rebuttal to the official version of the September 11, 2001 terrorist attacks and the 9/11 Commission Report.', '2nd Edition of Loose Change documentary. What if...September 11th was not a surprise attack on America, but rather, a cold and calculated genocide by our own government?We were told that the twin towers were hit by commercial jetliners and subsequently brought down by jet fuel. We were told that the Pentagon was hit by a Boeing 757. We were told that flight 93 crashed in Shanksville, Pennsylvania. We were told that nineteen Arabs from halfway across the globe, acting under orders from Osama Bin Laden, were responsible. What you will see here will prove without a shadow of a doubt that everything you know about 9/11 is a complete fabrication. Conspiracy theory? It''s not a theory if you can prove it.Written and narrated by Dylan Avery, this film presents a rebuttal to the official version of the September 11, 2001 terrorist attacks and the 9/11 Commission Report.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrXbySlCrL5ODrLckuOBBabh2AA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14277'),
  ('13753055552048569', 'Loose Change 9/11: An American Coup', 2009, 'Documentary, Drama, History', 'Dylan Avery', 'Dylan Avery', 'Daniel Sunjata, Johnelle Bryant, Laura Bush, George W. Bush, Dick Cheney, Aukai Collins', 'NR', 'With the departure of the Bush Administration and the arrival of an “era of transparency,” opportunities are arising for the disclosure of new information that may shed more light on the events that took place before and after 9/11/2001. Loaded with powerful, new footage and in-depth interviews this documentary presents a wide array of evidence both known and unknown…until now.', 'With the departure of the Bush Administration and the arrival of an “era of transparency,” opportunities are arising for the disclosure of new information that may shed more light on the events that took place before and after 9/11/2001. Loaded with powerful, new footage and in-depth interviews this documentary presents a wide array of evidence both known and unknown…until now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76ZLA1VIVny7iJB2sshfgUIqDdy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23116'),
  ('794937149488333901', 'Loose Change: Final Cut', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Dylan Avery', 'Dylan Avery', 'Richard Shelby, Thomas Kean', 'PG-13', 'Loose Change Final Cut is the third installment of the documentary that asks the tough questions about the 9/11 attacks and related events. This movie hopes to be the catalyst for a new independent investigation, in which the family members receive answers to their questions, and the TRUE PERPETRATORS of this horrendous crime are PROSECUTED and PUNISHED.', 'Loose Change Final Cut is the third installment of the documentary that asks the tough questions about the 9/11 attacks and related events. This movie hopes to be the catalyst for a new independent investigation, in which the family members receive answers to their questions, and the TRUE PERPETRATORS of this horrendous crime are PROSECUTED and PUNISHED.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSW1EoRMNFOeasNscCRCa35JDf8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22887'),
  ('325239406884862563', 'Loose in the Trigger', 1967, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Louis Grospierre', 'René Havard', 'Bernard Blier, Jean Lefebvre, Gastone Moschin, Francis Blanche, Marc Lawrence, Corinne Marchand, Michel Serrault, Carlo Cioccolanti', null, 'Nicolas Pappas and Léon Dubois, two particularly calamitous killers, arrive in Paris, where a gangster boss in need of "staff", Jo Laguerre, hires them to cover the escape of the perpetrators of a hold-up. They get away with it as best they can and then find themselves in charge of liquidating a certain "Magnum"...', 'Nicolas Pappas and Léon Dubois, two particularly calamitous killers, arrive in Paris, where a gangster boss in need of "staff", Jo Laguerre, hires them to cover the escape of the perpetrators of a hold-up. They get away with it as best they can and then find themselves in charge of liquidating a certain "Magnum"...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDEwp1pmSxox6wVTAYkwXyZct60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95232'),
  ('268695930629989441', 'Loose Screws', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Rafal Zielinski, Robin Miller, Bill Cummings', 'Michael Cory', 'Bryan Genesse, Lance Van Der Kolk, Alan Deveau, Jason Warren, Cynthia Belliveau, Mike MacDonald, Karen Wood, Annie McAuley', 'R', 'What happens when four high school screw-ups are forced to attend an academy summer school to graduate? They turn their scholastic sentence into a wacky game of trying to improve their scores... with the women. The ultimate conquest for the 100-point prize is the sexy new French teacher, but she proves to be a bigger challenge than their failing grades. The unforgiving principal foils every scheme, and their sidesplitting last chance is the academy''s anniversary celebration.', 'What happens when four high school screw-ups are forced to attend an academy summer school to graduate? They turn their scholastic sentence into a wacky game of trying to improve their scores... with the women. The ultimate conquest for the 100-point prize is the sexy new French teacher, but she proves to be a bigger challenge than their failing grades. The unforgiving principal foils every scheme, and their sidesplitting last chance is the academy''s anniversary celebration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUYuorrNoVvEmee8SPtATKnWqvd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44191'),
  ('892149623325356968', 'Loose Shoes', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Ira Miller', 'Varley Smith, Ira Miller, Ian Praiser', 'Royce D. Applegate, Lewis Arquette, Dorothy Van, J.J. Barry, Bill Murray, Buddy Hackett, Sid Haig, Howard Hesseman', 'R', 'Broad satire and buffoonery presented as a series of movie trailers. Among the titles and subjects are: "The Howard Huge Story", "Skate-boarders from Hell", "The Invasion of the Penis Snatchers", Woody Allen (pre-Mia), movie trailer come-ons, Charlie Chaplin, war movies, Billy Jack. The source of the title is presented about an hour into the film.', 'Broad satire and buffoonery presented as a series of movie trailers. Among the titles and subjects are: "The Howard Huge Story", "Skate-boarders from Hell", "The Invasion of the Penis Snatchers", Woody Allen (pre-Mia), movie trailer come-ons, Charlie Chaplin, war movies, Billy Jack. The source of the title is presented about an hour into the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTDHp15vDI5wfVzLZSuE03cGYVF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44805'),
  ('711995424270121913', 'Loosies', 2012, 'Crime, Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Corrente, Sam Fleischner', 'Peter Facinelli', 'Peter Facinelli, Jaimie Alexander, Michael Madsen, Vincent Gallo, William Forsythe, Marianne Leone Cooper, Christy Carlson Romano, Joe Pantoliano', 'PG-13', 'A young pickpocket in the New York subways, living a fast, free, lifestyle is confronted by a woman whom he had a one night affair with, she informs him that she is now pregnant with his child, he must now choose between continuing the lifestyle he lead or take responsibility for his actions.', 'A young pickpocket in the New York subways, living a fast, free, lifestyle is confronted by a woman whom he had a one night affair with, she informs him that she is now pregnant with his child, he must now choose between continuing the lifestyle he lead or take responsibility for his actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjQHb11UOj0ms0d6EYk4Qm48yeB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79465'),
  ('651681439689980923', 'Loot', 1970, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Austin Dempster, Silvio Narizzano', 'Alan Simpson, Ray Galton', 'Richard Attenborough, Lee Remick, Hywel Bennett, Milo O''Shea, Roy Holder, Dick Emery, Joe Lynch, John Cater', 'R', 'Two bank robbers, Dennis and Hal, are on the run from the police after a successful heist. Needing somewhere to hide the loot, they turn to a funeral parlour where they stash the cash in Hal''s recently-deceased mother''s coffin. Taking the coffin, they turn to Hal''s father and hide it in the bathroom of his hotel. Before long the hotel is host to the eccentric Inspector Truscott.', 'Two bank robbers, Dennis and Hal, are on the run from the police after a successful heist. Needing somewhere to hide the loot, they turn to a funeral parlour where they stash the cash in Hal''s recently-deceased mother''s coffin. Taking the coffin, they turn to Hal''s father and hide it in the bathroom of his hotel. Before long the hotel is host to the eccentric Inspector Truscott.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMOaKS5IEKtazHuELLfzd0rXGYo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198652'),
  ('194995783820252978', 'Lootcase', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Sanu John Varghese, Abhishek Banerjee, Anmol Ahuja', 'Rajesh Krishnan, Kapil Sawant', 'Kunal Khemu, Rasika Dugal, Ranvir Shorey, Gajraj Rao, Vijay Raaz, Aakash Dabhade, Aryan Prajapati, Sadanand Yadav', null, 'Nandan, a middle-class man, finds a suitcase full of money near his workplace and steals it. However, he is soon chased by a police officer, a notorious gangster and a corrupt politician.', 'Nandan, a middle-class man, finds a suitcase full of money near his workplace and steals it. However, he is soon chased by a police officer, a notorious gangster and a corrupt politician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4F4T7fSxSaak4XQHrskRPcqL9yz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635503'),
