  ('893161785035549934', 'Lord of War', 2005, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Andrew Niccol, Amir Mokri, Matthew Penry-Davey', 'Andrew Niccol', 'Nicolas Cage, Bridget Moynahan, Jared Leto, Ethan Hawke, Eamonn Walker, Ian Holm, Sammi Rotibi, Tanit Phoenix', 'R', 'Yuri Orlov is a globetrotting arms dealer and, through some of the deadliest war zones, he struggles to stay one step ahead of a relentless Interpol agent, his business rivals and even some of his customers who include many of the world''s most notorious dictators. Finally, he must also face his own conscience.', 'Yuri Orlov is a globetrotting arms dealer and, through some of the deadliest war zones, he struggles to stay one step ahead of a relentless Interpol agent, his business rivals and even some of his customers who include many of the world''s most notorious dictators. Finally, he must also face his own conscience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MGQD4yXokufNlW1AyRXdiy7ytP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1830'),
