  ('823257167439086981', 'Lords of Dogtown', 2005, 'Drama, Action', 'Catherine Hardwicke, Elliot Davis, Stephen P. Del Prete', 'Stacy Peralta', 'John Robinson, Emile Hirsch, Rebecca De Mornay, William Mapother, Julio Oscar Mechoso, Victor Rasuk, Nikki Reed, Heath Ledger', 'PG-13', 'The radical true story behind three teenage surfers from Venice Beach, California, who took skateboarding to the extreme and changed the world of sports forever. Stacy Peralta, Tony Alva and Jay Adams are the Z-Boys, a bunch of nobodies until they create a new style of skateboarding that becomes a worldwide phenomenon. But when their hobby becomes a business, the success shreds their friendship.', 'The radical true story behind three teenage surfers from Venice Beach, California, who took skateboarding to the extreme and changed the world of sports forever. Stacy Peralta, Tony Alva and Jay Adams are the Z-Boys, a bunch of nobodies until they create a new style of skateboarding that becomes a worldwide phenomenon. But when their hobby becomes a business, the success shreds their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2NiPfydLSwmk28C6qpvpJPuqtq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9787'),
  ('690461547011053858', 'Lords of Scam', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Guillaume Nicloux', null, 'Marco Mouly , Arnaud Mimran', 'R', 'This documentary traces the rise and crash of scammers who conned the EU carbon quota system and pocketed millions before turning on one another.', 'This documentary traces the rise and crash of scammers who conned the EU carbon quota system and pocketed millions before turning on one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPcrO8DJAP0lPeoTiQHRsNBD2EC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888917'),
  ('1021133606399965588', 'Lords of the Deep', 1989, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Adventure', 'Mary Ann Fisher, Jonathan Winfrey', null, 'Bradford Dillman, Priscilla Barnes, Daryl Haney, Mel Ryane, Eb Lottimer, Gregory Sobeck, Richard Young, Stephen Davies', 'PG-13', 'Man has finally conquered the ocean. America''s first self-contained undersea laboratory is the pride of the nation, and expectations are high for an elaborate undersea mining operation. What wasn''t expected was the inhabitants of an undiscovered world.', 'Man has finally conquered the ocean. America''s first self-contained undersea laboratory is the pride of the nation, and expectations are high for an elaborate undersea mining operation. What wasn''t expected was the inhabitants of an undiscovered world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCxcVt1FMCc7dXckfuNCndgZ5zw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222323'),
