  ('610818566283061607', 'Lorna, the Exorcist', 1974, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Étienne Rosenfeld, Richard Bigotini', 'Jesús Franco, Robert de Nesle, Nicole Guettard', 'Pamela Stanford, Guy Delorme, Lina Romay, Jacqueline Laurent, Richard Bigotini, Catherine Lafferière, Howard Vernon, Jesús Franco', 'R', 'Twenty years after seducing a businessman, a demonic temptress lays claim to the man''s daughter.', 'Twenty years after seducing a businessman, a demonic temptress lays claim to the man''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAlLmBvWdEobyBv9klN8dMSXele.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87246'),
  ('1043949798459742961', 'Lorna''s Silence', 2008, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne, Alain Marcoen', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne', 'Arta Dobroshi, Jérémie Renier, Fabrizio Rongione, Alban Ukaj, Morgan Marinne, Anton Yakovlev, Olivier Gourmet, Grigori Manoukov', null, 'Lorna is a young Albanian woman in a marriage of convenience with Claudy, a heroin addict. Just as Lorna is about to be granted Belgian citizenship, Claudy finds the strength to detox; this presents a problem not only for Lorna, but for the criminal who brokered the deal.', 'Lorna is a young Albanian woman in a marriage of convenience with Claudy, a heroin addict. Just as Lorna is about to be granted Belgian citizenship, Claudy finds the strength to detox; this presents a problem not only for Lorna, but for the criminal who brokered the deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwQPg2DgFygbZjdupJcedPEm0JN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8899'),
  ('259253884810918234', 'Loro', 2018, 'Drama', 'Paolo Sorrentino, Luca Bigazzi, Jacopo Bonvicini', 'Paolo Sorrentino, Umberto Contarello', 'Toni Servillo, Elena Sofia Ricci, Riccardo Scamarcio, Kasia Smutniak, Euridice Axén, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Roberto De Francesco, Dario Cantarelli', null, 'Internationally released Director''s Cut of "Loro 1" and "Loro 2", which were released separately as two movies in Italy. The film talks about the group of businessmen and politicians – the Loro (Them) from the title – who live and act near to media tycoon and politician Silvio Berlusconi in the years between 2006 and 2009.', 'Internationally released Director''s Cut of "Loro 1" and "Loro 2", which were released separately as two movies in Italy. The film talks about the group of businessmen and politicians – the Loro (Them) from the title – who live and act near to media tycoon and politician Silvio Berlusconi in the years between 2006 and 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAogxeovs5HpzhD4UbrDsSybtp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541660'),
  ('686969021204703673', 'Loro 1', 2018, 'Drama', 'Paolo Sorrentino, Luca Bigazzi', 'Paolo Sorrentino, Umberto Contarello', 'Toni Servillo, Elena Sofia Ricci, Riccardo Scamarcio, Kasia Smutniak, Ricky Memphis, Euridice Axén, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Roberto De Francesco', null, '"Loro", in two parts, is a period movie that chronicles, as a fiction story, events likely happened in Italy (or even made up) between 2006 and 2010. "Loro" wants to suggest in portraits and glimps, through a composite constellation of characters, a moment in history, now definitively ended, which can be described in a very summary picture of the events as amoral, decadent but extraordinarily alive. Additionally, "Loro" wishes to tell the story of some Italians, fresh and ancient people at the same time: souls from a modern imaginary Purgatory who, moved by heterogeneous intents like ambition, admiration, affection, curiosity, personal interests, establish to try and orbit around the walking Paradise that is the man named Silvio Berlusconi.', '"Loro", in two parts, is a period movie that chronicles, as a fiction story, events likely happened in Italy (or even made up) between 2006 and 2010. "Loro" wants to suggest in portraits and glimps, through a composite constellation of characters, a moment in history, now definitively ended, which can be described in a very summary picture of the events as amoral, decadent but extraordinarily alive. Additionally, "Loro" wishes to tell the story of some Italians, fresh and ancient people at the same time: souls from a modern imaginary Purgatory who, moved by heterogeneous intents like ambition, admiration, affection, curiosity, personal interests, establish to try and orbit around the walking Paradise that is the man named Silvio Berlusconi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGuYfMTTz3oWLGF5zjE9Bhk5Yxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417670'),
