  ('920035078568375348', 'Los 3 reyes magos', 1976, 'Family, Animation', 'Fernando Ruiz, Adolfo Torres Portillo', 'Emilio Carballido, Adolfo Torres Portillo', 'Carlos David Ortigoza, Jorge Sánchez Fogarty, Azucena Rodríguez, José Lavat, Gloria Rocha, Manuel de la Llata, Alberto Gavira, Armando Coria', null, 'The Three Wise Men, Melchior, Gaspar, and Balthazar, set off for Bethlehem to worship the newborn Jesus, but the devil, in the guise of Prince Olbaid, decides to hinder the Kings'' journey with the help of the devil Murcio, creating problems at every turn.', 'The Three Wise Men, Melchior, Gaspar, and Balthazar, set off for Bethlehem to worship the newborn Jesus, but the devil, in the guise of Prince Olbaid, decides to hinder the Kings'' journey with the help of the devil Murcio, creating problems at every turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRDiCra7CoslT7zlEGJk4AbvMNQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347143'),
