  ('416339631054235479', 'Los hijos de María Morales', 1952, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Fernando de Fuentes, Ignacio Torres', 'Fernando Méndez', 'Pedro Infante, Antonio Badú, Andrés Soler, Irma Dorantes, Emma Roldán, Carmelita González, Verónica Loyo, Tito Novaro', null, 'Two brothers known in town for their womanizing, drinking and rowdiness meet their matches when two girls who like them decide to tame the two machos.', 'Two brothers known in town for their womanizing, drinking and rowdiness meet their matches when two girls who like them decide to tame the two machos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ux4SrScqJrsYnlVOVFOjQrFRwPH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314097'),
  ('313030711760353752', 'Los hombres sólo piensan en eso', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Víctor Hugo Caula, Enrique Cahen Salaberry', 'Héctor Maselli, Oscar Viale', 'Alberto Olmedo, Jorge Porcel, Susana Giménez, Susana Traverso, Patricia Dal, Virgilio Galindo, Luis Calderón, Julio López', null, 'Alberto and Jorge are two typical "chantas", who are dedicated to deceiving people along with another friend, nicknamed "Palomita". One day "Palomita" is awarded a prize consisting of dollars and two tickets to Caracas, but it turns out that this decomposes and dies. His last wish communicated to his friends Alberto and Jorge is that they take care of his sister. Upon meeting her, she turns out to be a very beautiful girl, with whom they both get involved. Then together with her they get into trouble with a group of criminals and must leave the country, taking a flight to Caracas, where they arrive posing as an Argentine vedette and her two representatives.', 'Alberto and Jorge are two typical "chantas", who are dedicated to deceiving people along with another friend, nicknamed "Palomita". One day "Palomita" is awarded a prize consisting of dollars and two tickets to Caracas, but it turns out that this decomposes and dies. His last wish communicated to his friends Alberto and Jorge is that they take care of his sister. Upon meeting her, she turns out to be a very beautiful girl, with whom they both get involved. Then together with her they get into trouble with a group of criminals and must leave the country, taking a flight to Caracas, where they arrive posing as an Argentine vedette and her two representatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyRvZKHEM0Ake0DBt6Lo5stVwp2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316077'),
  ('813873018003659589', 'Los Hongos', 2014, 'Drama', 'Oscar Ruiz Navia, Julián Laguna, Sofia Oggioni', 'César Augusto Acevedo, Oscar Ruiz Navia', 'Jovan Alexis Marquinez, Calvin Buenaventura, Atala Estrada, Gustavo Ruiz Montoya, María Elvira Solis, Dominique Tonnelier, Angela García, Diego David Lozano', null, 'Ras is a graffiti artist from the city of Cali who works in construction, he works during the day and paints walls at night. One day he is caught stealing cans of paint from the construction site where he works, for which he is fired. With no money, he will look for Calvin, another popular urban artist. Both will circulate through the streets without a fixed destination, spreading their art to every corner.', 'Ras is a graffiti artist from the city of Cali who works in construction, he works during the day and paints walls at night. One day he is caught stealing cans of paint from the construction site where he works, for which he is fired. With no money, he will look for Calvin, another popular urban artist. Both will circulate through the streets without a fixed destination, spreading their art to every corner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEPn0LcXzABcURCXQCT3J45CsZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287529'),
