  ('428539601285649941', 'Los mánagers', 2006, 'Comedy, Music', 'Fernando Guillén Cuervo', 'Joaquín Górriz, Fernando Guillén Cuervo, Miguel Ángel Fernández', 'Fran Perea, Paco León, Enrique Villén, Manuel Tallafé, Sancho Gracia, Manuel Manquiña, María Jiménez, Álex O''Dogherty', null, 'Two jobless Forty-somethings: Maca and Rena are in serious need of a financial stroke of luck. When they spot an ad for a TV contest looking for the next Pop Idol, they decide to turn themselves into the MANAGERS of two young hopefuls: Pipo and David. While launching their careers with performances in bars, bingo clubs and other such dives they encounter Rota, a shady old singer who arranges for them to tour the Costa del Sol. Thus begins a frenetic road movie where dreams of success turn into a nightmare inhabited by strange creatures: Tom Jones clones, porn stars, enlightened arabs, psychopathic marines, kitch TV presenters, corrupt politicians and even extra-terrestrials.', 'Two jobless Forty-somethings: Maca and Rena are in serious need of a financial stroke of luck. When they spot an ad for a TV contest looking for the next Pop Idol, they decide to turn themselves into the MANAGERS of two young hopefuls: Pipo and David. While launching their careers with performances in bars, bingo clubs and other such dives they encounter Rota, a shady old singer who arranges for them to tour the Costa del Sol. Thus begins a frenetic road movie where dreams of success turn into a nightmare inhabited by strange creatures: Tom Jones clones, porn stars, enlightened arabs, psychopathic marines, kitch TV presenters, corrupt politicians and even extra-terrestrials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8bTZbPf2EnfMpUlHoy4QOiifkE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101414'),
