  ('522822919588097159', 'Lost and Beautiful', 2015, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Pietro Marcello, Salvatore Landi, Pietro Marcello', 'Maurizio Braucci, Pietro Marcello', 'Tommaso Cestrone, Sergio Vitolo, Gesuino Pittalis, Elio Germano, Claudio Casadio, Anna Redi, Raffaele Montesarchio, Teresa Montesarchio', null, 'Pulcinella, a foolish servant, is sent from the depths of Mt. Vesuvius to present-day Campania to grant the last wish of poor shepherd Tommaso, who spent his whole life looking after a crumbling Bourbon estate: his mission is to save a young buffalo named Sarchiapone. Pulcinella takes the buffalo north and the two servants, man and beast, travel through a beautiful and lost Italy.', 'Pulcinella, a foolish servant, is sent from the depths of Mt. Vesuvius to present-day Campania to grant the last wish of poor shepherd Tommaso, who spent his whole life looking after a crumbling Bourbon estate: his mission is to save a young buffalo named Sarchiapone. Pulcinella takes the buffalo north and the two servants, man and beast, travel through a beautiful and lost Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90mT4OdgvBYjQOQodwNHusHHAZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350904'),
