  ('1016503167785961680', 'Lost and Found', 2008, 'Family, Animation', 'Philip Hunt', 'Oliver Jeffers', 'Jim Broadbent', 'G', 'A magical tale of friendship and loneliness, which tells the story of a little boy who one day finds a penguin on his doorstep. Although at first he is unsure what to do, the boy becomes determined to help the penguin find his way back home... even if that means rowing all the way to the South Pole!', 'A magical tale of friendship and loneliness, which tells the story of a little boy who one day finds a penguin on his doorstep. Although at first he is unsure what to do, the boy becomes determined to help the penguin find his way back home... even if that means rowing all the way to the South Pole!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNUDcAuNjB26oUeWjpBs8NBkwLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33572'),
