  ('575465642336445581', 'Lost Angels', 1989, 'Drama', 'Hugh Hudson, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'Michael Weller', 'Donald Sutherland, Adam Horovitz, Amy Locane, Don Bloomfield, Celia Weston, Graham Beckel, Patricia Richardson, Ron Frazier', 'R', 'Rich L.A. party brat Tim spins into a cycle of despair after his parents divorce, and trying to fill the void with drugs and trouble only buys him a ticket to an asylum. But with the help of a psychiatrist who has taken an interest in him, will Tim try to pull himself out of the muck of teenage rebellion and ennui?', 'Rich L.A. party brat Tim spins into a cycle of despair after his parents divorce, and trying to fill the void with drugs and trouble only buys him a ticket to an asylum. But with the help of a psychiatrist who has taken an interest in him, will Tim try to pull himself out of the muck of teenage rebellion and ennui?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAzUbWzWsAw7WCAtezpqwe8jtZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43990'),
  ('164598575066311141', 'Lost Boundaries', 1949, 'Drama', 'Alfred L. Werker, William Miller', 'Eugene Ling, Virginia Shaler', 'Beatrice Pearson, Mel Ferrer, Susan Douglas, Robert A. Dunn, Richard Hylton, Grace Coppin, Carleton Carpenter, Canada Lee', null, 'A light-skinned African-American family are "passing" in an all-white New England town. When the truth comes out, the more prejudiced neighbors demand their expulsion from the community.', 'A light-skinned African-American family are "passing" in an all-white New England town. When the truth comes out, the more prejudiced neighbors demand their expulsion from the community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2SsOErhrmOBtAbKIFEJQeQuFOj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113237'),
  ('604241856350128221', 'Lost Boys', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Sadri Cetinkaya, Joonas Neuvonen', 'Venla Varha, Sadri Cetinkaya, Joonas Neuvonen', 'Joonas Neuvonen, Jani Raappana, Pekka Strang', null, 'Lost Boys tells the true, undisguised story of what happened ten years ago, after group of friends continued their eternal afterparty following the success of their movie premiere, Reindeerspotting: Escape From Santaland, which depicted group of drug users from Rovaniemi, Finland. The partying ends when friends of Joonas goes missing and Jani dies violently in Phnom Penh, Cambodia. Joonas takes his camera and sets out to find out what happened to his friend. Was it all about drugs, women and money or do the traces lead somewhere deeper?', 'Lost Boys tells the true, undisguised story of what happened ten years ago, after group of friends continued their eternal afterparty following the success of their movie premiere, Reindeerspotting: Escape From Santaland, which depicted group of drug users from Rovaniemi, Finland. The partying ends when friends of Joonas goes missing and Jani dies violently in Phnom Penh, Cambodia. Joonas takes his camera and sets out to find out what happened to his friend. Was it all about drugs, women and money or do the traces lead somewhere deeper?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w60EUIDDGV0inli7jZZuReIprLo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583020'),
  ('1050935997695822801', 'Lost Boys: The Thirst', 2010, 'Horror, Action, Comedy', 'Stefano Morcaldo, Dario Piana', 'Evan Charnov, Hans Rodionoff', 'Corey Feldman, Jamison Newlander, Tanit Phoenix, Casey B. Dolan, Sean Cameron Michael, Joe Vaz, Matthew Dylan Roberts, Hennie Bosman', 'R', 'A mysterious fiend uses a designer drug to turn partiers at an all-night rave into his personal army of never-say-die bloodsuckers.', 'A mysterious fiend uses a designer drug to turn partiers at an all-night rave into his personal army of never-say-die bloodsuckers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKeaELcJyoCFzU5QeiIhjbNagIN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46812'),
