  ('936229532556892207', 'Lost Bullet', 2020, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Thierry Mauvoisin, Guillaume Pierret', 'Guillaume Pierret', 'Alban Lenoir, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Rod Paradot, Ramzy Bedia, Stéfi Celma, Arthur Aspaturian, Sébastien Lalanne, Patrick Médioni', null, 'A small time delinquent, turned police mechanic for a go fast task force, is forced to defend his innocence when his mentor is killed by dirty cops.', 'A small time delinquent, turned police mechanic for a go fast task force, is forced to defend his innocence when his mentor is killed by dirty cops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnlChF8U4diiykXQYs1miigGy7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706503'),
  ('1122461488142599929', 'Lost Bullet 2', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Sybil Rerat, Cheyenne Corre, Sarah Schneider', 'Guillaume Pierret', 'Alban Lenoir, Stéfi Celma, Pascale Arbillot, Sébastien Lalanne, Diego Martín, Jérôme Niel, Anne Serra, Quentin D''Hainaut', 'R', 'Having cleared his name, genius mechanic Lino has only one goal in mind: getting revenge on the corrupt cops who killed his brother and his mentor.', 'Having cleared his name, genius mechanic Lino has only one goal in mind: getting revenge on the corrupt cops who killed his brother and his mentor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAeZI1JJbLPq7Bu5dziH7emHeu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:948276'),
  ('118831638308762596', 'Lost City Raiders', 2008, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Jean de Segonzac, Giulio Biccari', null, 'James Brolin, Ian Somerhalder, Bettina Zimmermann, Jamie Thomas King, Elodie Frenck, Ben Cross, Michael Mendl, Jeremy Crutchley', null, 'The year is 2048, and global warming has flooded much of Earth''s land areas. A father and his two sons try to salvage treasures from sunken buildings when they are given an important assignment by the New Vatican.', 'The year is 2048, and global warming has flooded much of Earth''s land areas. A father and his two sons try to salvage treasures from sunken buildings when they are given an important assignment by the New Vatican.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6tBlrlrPEaCPxfJ8zK44CaQy5C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31201'),
  ('1035949777564707293', 'Lost Colony: The Legend of Roanoke', 2007, 'TV Movie, Horror, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Matt Codd, Anton Bakarski, Rafael Jordan', 'Rafael Jordan', 'Adrian Paul, Frida Farrell, Rhett Giles, Michael Teh, Mari Mascaro, Alex McArthur, Rafael Jordan', 'R', 'English colonists arriving on Roanoke Island in 1587 find the fort built years before deserted. Soon after, members of the colony begin to die in horrible ways. Before returning to England for provisions, leader John White puts his son-in-law Ananais Dare in charge, and Dare realizes the island is haunted by Norse spirits. Enlisting the aid of a friendly Native American, Dare attempts to free the spirits from their earthly captivity before the entire colony is lost.', 'English colonists arriving on Roanoke Island in 1587 find the fort built years before deserted. Soon after, members of the colony begin to die in horrible ways. Before returning to England for provisions, leader John White puts his son-in-law Ananais Dare in charge, and Dare realizes the island is haunted by Norse spirits. Enlisting the aid of a friendly Native American, Dare attempts to free the spirits from their earthly captivity before the entire colony is lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OZh4upE5dBsqRmATBpQjmvOTHH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24643'),
  ('653267795070850005', 'Lost Command', 1966, 'Action, War', 'Mark Robson, Robert Surtees, John Quested', 'Nelson Gidding', 'Anthony Quinn, Alain Delon, George Segal, Michèle Morgan, Maurice Ronet, Claudia Cardinale, Grégoire Aslan, Jean Servais', null, 'After being freed from a Vietnamese war prison, French Lt. Col. Pierre Raspeguy is sent to help quell resistance forces in Algeria. With the help of the Capt. Esclavier, who has grown weary of war, and Capt. Boisfeuras, who lives for it, Raspeguy attempts to convert a rugged band of soldiers into a formidable fighting unit, with the promise of marrying a beautiful countess if he''s made a general.', 'After being freed from a Vietnamese war prison, French Lt. Col. Pierre Raspeguy is sent to help quell resistance forces in Algeria. With the help of the Capt. Esclavier, who has grown weary of war, and Capt. Boisfeuras, who lives for it, Raspeguy attempts to convert a rugged band of soldiers into a formidable fighting unit, with the promise of marrying a beautiful countess if he''s made a general.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDC55I2v1WbtK3V0E7sTW1Hn0a9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41057'),
