  ('413122671097908333', 'Lost in Paris', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Fiona Gordon, Dominique Abel', 'Fiona Gordon, Dominique Abel', 'Fiona Gordon, Dominique Abel, Emmanuelle Riva, Pierre Richard, Emmy Boissard Paumelle, Céline Laurentie, Charlotte Dubery, David Palatino', null, 'Fiona visits Paris for the first time to assist her myopic Aunt Martha. Catastrophes ensue, mainly involving Dom, a homeless man who has yet to have an emotion or thought he was afraid of expressing.', 'Fiona visits Paris for the first time to assist her myopic Aunt Martha. Catastrophes ensue, mainly involving Dom, a homeless man who has yet to have an emotion or thought he was afraid of expressing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XVNkOslnv5Atxy47RfPUtTDBkH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413778'),
  ('455076922132967750', 'Lost in Perfection', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sung Hsin-Yin, Chen Chi-wen', 'Sung Hsin-Yin', 'Ivy Shao, Rhydian Vaughan, Lin Mei-shiu, Figaro Tseng, Mark Lee, Ven Kao, Chen Chia-kuei, Yu Chia-hsuan', null, 'Mei is a beautiful and successful woman in many ways. However, her romantic relationships never go well. One day, Mei’s widowed father tells her he will marry Lan, an ugly and obese murder suspect. Even more shocking is that Lan is accused of being the “Poisonous Widow” who lives a luxurious life by killing her rich husbands. Mei begins to investigate Lan’s background to save her father from being a victim. Bit by bit, Mei is subconsciously influenced by Lan’s twisted views on love, money, and sex.', 'Mei is a beautiful and successful woman in many ways. However, her romantic relationships never go well. One day, Mei’s widowed father tells her he will marry Lan, an ugly and obese murder suspect. Even more shocking is that Lan is accused of being the “Poisonous Widow” who lives a luxurious life by killing her rich husbands. Mei begins to investigate Lan’s background to save her father from being a victim. Bit by bit, Mei is subconsciously influenced by Lan’s twisted views on love, money, and sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sf7Vfqxt1kiORqlczHeYAR1bh7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1047003'),
  ('170091577463265153', 'Lost in Russia', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yizeng Liu, Zhao Nan, Xu Zheng', 'Yihe He, He Keke, Xu Zheng', 'Xu Zheng, Huang Meiying, Yuan Quan, Jia Bing, Teng Shen, Guo Jingfei, Godfrey Gao, Johnny Huang', null, 'A story of a businessman who accidentally boards a train bound for Russia with his mother and has to overcome difficulties with his mother and problems in his family life.', 'A story of a businessman who accidentally boards a train bound for Russia with his mother and has to overcome difficulties with his mother and problems in his family life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1j8aaQV5t44wwwkMTmwZOitWfm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603770'),
  ('134706531362245433', 'Lost in Siberia', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Aleksandr Mitta, Vladimir Shevtsik', 'Aleksandr Mitta, Valeri Frid, James Brabazon', 'Anthony Andrews, Vladimir Ilin, Elena Mayorova, Valentin Gaft, Aleksei Zharkov, Natalya Gundareva, Zinoviy Gerdt, Ivan Bortnik', null, 'The political drama is set in the Stalin''s Soviet Union after the Second World War. A British archaeologist Andrei Miller is working in Iran. He is mistakenly kidnapped and arrested by the KGB. He is falsely accused of spying and wrongfully sentenced to a Gulag prison-camp in Siberia.', 'The political drama is set in the Stalin''s Soviet Union after the Second World War. A British archaeologist Andrei Miller is working in Iran. He is mistakenly kidnapped and arrested by the KGB. He is falsely accused of spying and wrongfully sentenced to a Gulag prison-camp in Siberia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/702fWefy2Vp1QuAeuBQjW0h5VJN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111992'),
  ('744357296259761468', 'Lost in Siberia', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Ralf Huettner, Stefan Ciupek', 'Michael Ebmeyer, Minu Barati, Ralf Huettner', 'Joachim Król, Vladimir Burlakov, Julya Men, Svetlana Tsvichenko, Katja Riemann, Armin Rohde, Michael Degen, Zoya Buryak', null, 'Matthias Bleuel, a logistician of a german mail order company is send to Kemorovo in Siberia to teach some russian subsidiary company the german work flow system. But soon this land changes him and everything for him.', 'Matthias Bleuel, a logistician of a german mail order company is send to Kemorovo in Siberia to teach some russian subsidiary company the german work flow system. But soon this land changes him and everything for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9D1eW6AVJTisnGJTylV03LnVJOX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107445'),
  ('847581365903108056', 'Lost in Space', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Peter Levy, Stephen Hopkins, Keith Pain', 'Akiva Goldsman, Irwin Allen', 'William Hurt, Matt LeBlanc, Mimi Rogers, Heather Graham, Gary Oldman, Lacey Chabert, Jack Johnson, Jared Harris', 'PG-13', 'The prospects for continuing life on Earth in the year 2058 are grim. So the Robinsons are launched into space to colonize Alpha Prime, the only other inhabitable planet in the galaxy. But when a stowaway sabotages the mission, the Robinsons find themselves hurtling through uncharted space.', 'The prospects for continuing life on Earth in the year 2058 are grim. So the Robinsons are launched into space to colonize Alpha Prime, the only other inhabitable planet in the galaxy. But when a stowaway sabotages the mission, the Robinsons find themselves hurtling through uncharted space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCocPDUFuKswY2GxDdfYsT9BXMd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2157'),
  ('123566614705557935', 'Lost In Space Forever', 1998, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Kevin Burns', 'Kevin Burns, Bill Mumy, Brian Anthony', 'John Larroquette, Mark Goddard, Angela Cartwright, Jonathan Harris, William Hurt, Marta Kristen, Matt LeBlanc, June Lockhart', 'G', 'Host John Larroquette takes viewers on a nostalgic trip through the 1965-1968 sci-fi comedy series. The disc''s rare footage include Guy Williams''s screen test, extended clips from the 1965 pilot, bloopers and the original clips CBS network sales presentation. Viewers also get to go behind the scenes of the 1998 big-screen version. To top it off, Billy Mumy (Will), Jonathan Harris (Dr. Smith) and the robot reunite for a special tribute.', 'Host John Larroquette takes viewers on a nostalgic trip through the 1965-1968 sci-fi comedy series. The disc''s rare footage include Guy Williams''s screen test, extended clips from the 1965 pilot, bloopers and the original clips CBS network sales presentation. Viewers also get to go behind the scenes of the 1998 big-screen version. To top it off, Billy Mumy (Will), Jonathan Harris (Dr. Smith) and the robot reunite for a special tribute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SkQVIb9dvLc1OLSfBY5UniHwDk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59286'),
  ('1029164145168277184', 'Lost in Starlight', 2025, 'Animation, Romance, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Han Ji-won, Park Hong-yeol, An Je-yoon', 'Han Ji-won, Kang Hyun-joo', 'Kim Tae-ri, Hong Kyung, Sharon Kwon, Kang Ku-han, An Young-mi, Jang Mi, Yoon Ah-young, Choi Han', 'PG', 'When an astronaut leaves Earth for Mars, the vast infinite space divides star-crossed lovers in this animated romance that crosses the cosmos.', 'When an astronaut leaves Earth for Mars, the vast infinite space divides star-crossed lovers in this animated romance that crosses the cosmos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXlUIfwejWa9YvugU9V773dUASY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1165642'),
  ('147826835937953228', 'Lost in Thailand', 2012, 'Comedy, Adventure, Drama', 'Xu Zheng, Song Xiaofei', 'Ding Ding, Shu Huan', 'Wang Baoqiang, Xu Zheng, Huang Bo, Tao Hong, Fan Bingbing, Xie Nan, Saichia Wongwirot, Chen Zhixi', null, 'The story of two rival business managers, Xu and Bo, who are fighting over a revolutionary new in-house technology for control of their company. If Xu wins, his future will be secured.', 'The story of two rival business managers, Xu and Bo, who are fighting over a revolutionary new in-house technology for control of their company. If Xu wins, his future will be secured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBaEx0Szrd73zBCcN9p7AhI7htW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151743'),
  ('500471312831077306', 'Lost in the Moonlight', 2016, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'Kim Hyun-joo', 'Kim Hyun-joo', 'Kim Seo-young, Lee Hanee, Kwon Yul, Kim Seul-gi, Shin Yong-woo, Lee Jang-won, Si Young Joon, Lee Sang-beom', 'PG', '13 year-old girl Hyunjuli participates in a children’s Korean traditional play rehearsal in Changdeokgung Palace and accidentally falls into another world – the Moonlit Palace. The Moonlit Palace is a fantasy world of mysterious spirits and gods, where a dragon or talking mushrooms are nothing out of ordinary. Meeting new friends, Mr. Squirrel and the warrior Won, Hyunjuli explores this strange yet wonderful world to find a way back home. However, due to the trick of the Blossom Lady, who tries to rule this Moonlit World, Hyunjuli and friends fall into trouble. Will Hyunjuli be able to help her new friends to save their world and return home safely?', '13 year-old girl Hyunjuli participates in a children’s Korean traditional play rehearsal in Changdeokgung Palace and accidentally falls into another world – the Moonlit Palace. The Moonlit Palace is a fantasy world of mysterious spirits and gods, where a dragon or talking mushrooms are nothing out of ordinary. Meeting new friends, Mr. Squirrel and the warrior Won, Hyunjuli explores this strange yet wonderful world to find a way back home. However, due to the trick of the Blossom Lady, who tries to rule this Moonlit World, Hyunjuli and friends fall into trouble. Will Hyunjuli be able to help her new friends to save their world and return home safely?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kY7oXja73YYCrBGW3mK7uNZwr51.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419645'),
  ('55231604700030519', 'Lost in the Mountains', 2009, 'Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Jung Yu-mi, Lee Sun-kyun, Moon Sung-keun, Eun Hee-kyung, Kim Jin-kyoung', null, 'Hong Sang-soo''s Lost in the Mountains depicts Mi-sook''s suffering when she discovers her friend Jin-young has been secretly sleeping with her lover.', 'Hong Sang-soo''s Lost in the Mountains depicts Mi-sook''s suffering when she discovers her friend Jin-young has been secretly sleeping with her lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOkm8li0ya9QMS7rPPTjhzaidAA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222463'),
  ('838120050557721805', 'Lost in the Night', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Adrian Durazo, Amat Escalante', 'Amat Escalante', 'Juan Daniel Garcia Treviño, Ester Expósito, Bárbara Mori, Fernando Bonilla, Maria Fernanda Osio, Jero Medina, Mayra Hermosillo, Vicky Araico', null, 'A young man from a small mining town embroils himself with a wealthy family with a dubious past.', 'A young man from a small mining town embroils himself with a wealthy family with a dubious past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gB2itwKca8jKk0SAkWV3NUkzmYu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605542'),
  ('761309441571335262', 'Lost in the Pacific', 2016, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Vincent Zhou, Craig Borden, Scott Winig', 'Vincent Zhou, Peter Cameron', 'Brandon Routh, Zhang Yuqi, Russell Wong, Bernice Liu Bik-Yee, Jiang Mengjie, Kaiwi Lyman, Vincent M. Ward, Tazito Garcia', null, 'The passengers of a luxury airliner become stranded on a remote, mysterious island after an emergency landing. They soon realize the island holds a dark, deadly secret.', 'The passengers of a luxury airliner become stranded on a remote, mysterious island after an emergency landing. They soon realize the island holds a dark, deadly secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tegfhjfMKuZrs3WhHR1hiluvMiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398792'),
  ('768411236337463650', 'Lost in the Stars', 2023, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Liu Xiang, Cui Rui, He Shan', 'Yin Yixiong, Gu Shuyi, Chen Sicheng', 'Zhu Yilong, Ni Ni, Janice Man Wing-San, Du Jiang, Huang Ziqi, Supattarapong Yangpimai, Liu Er-jin, Krajangphalakorn Chanidapha', null, 'He Fei''s wife, Li Muzi, disappears during their anniversary trip. When she reappears, he insists that she is not his wife. As Chen Mai, a top lawyer gets involved in this bizarre case, more mysteries start to emerge.', 'He Fei''s wife, Li Muzi, disappears during their anniversary trip. When she reappears, he insists that she is not his wife. As Chen Mai, a top lawyer gets involved in this bizarre case, more mysteries start to emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88zdJKhD42Mpnd3if4RXYyILT9P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1108211'),
  ('939752680488402470', 'Lost in the Sun', 2015, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Trey Nelson', 'Trey Nelson', 'Josh Duhamel, Josh Wiggins, Lynn Collins, Emma Fuhrmann, Larry Jack Dotson, Mylinda Royer, Luis Olmeda, Margaret Bowman', null, 'A small time crook and a newly-orphaned teenage boy team up to perform a string of robberies.', 'A small time crook and a newly-orphaned teenage boy team up to perform a string of robberies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hANP0oWUR1B0uiHB7no2jsjhsoN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360203'),
  ('637299991811689', 'Lost in Time', 2003, 'Drama', 'Derek Yee, Venus Keung, Jimmy Wong', 'Jessica Fong Ching, James Yuen Sai-Sang', 'Cecilia Cheung, Daichi Harashima, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Louis Koo, Paul Chun Pui, Nina Paw Hei-Ching, Elena Kong Mei-Yee, Johnny Lu', null, 'Sui Wai lost her fiance Ah Man in a car accident. With the obligations of life sitting heavy on her shoulders, she lives on only to find herself confiding in her beloved through a phone call. Dai Fai. a mini-bus driver who witnessed Ah Man''s death, is always there offering her attentive encouragement and support, yet he himself also lives in the shadow of his last relationship. When Siu Wai strives to face the future without the man she loves, Dai Fai finds himself steadily falling in love with her.', 'Sui Wai lost her fiance Ah Man in a car accident. With the obligations of life sitting heavy on her shoulders, she lives on only to find herself confiding in her beloved through a phone call. Dai Fai. a mini-bus driver who witnessed Ah Man''s death, is always there offering her attentive encouragement and support, yet he himself also lives in the shadow of his last relationship. When Siu Wai strives to face the future without the man she loves, Dai Fai finds himself steadily falling in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9udkHT8mwdg6lUK2l62QZC5rvIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61676'),
  ('393601680690568690', 'Lost in Yonkers', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Martha Coolidge, Johnny E. Jensen', 'Neil Simon', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Mercedes Ruehl, Irene Worth, Brad Stoll, Mike Damus, David Strathairn, Robert Miranda, Jack Laufer', 'PG', 'In the summer of 1942 two young boys are sent to stay with their stern grandmother Kurnitz and their childlike aunt Bella in Yonkers, New York.', 'In the summer of 1942 two young boys are sent to stay with their stern grandmother Kurnitz and their childlike aunt Bella in Yonkers, New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9COy4RAhPzOw1ICecKMYQCexTgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27224'),
  ('211601834424935931', 'Lost Ladies', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Kiran Rao, Vikash Nowlakha, Rakesh E. Nair', 'Sneha Desai', 'Nitanshi Goel, Pratibha Ranta, Sparsh Shrivastava, Ravi Kishan, Chhaya Kadam, Geeta Agrawal Sharma, Pankaj Sharma, Abeer Sandeep Jain', null, 'In 2001, somewhere in rural India, two young brides get accidentally swapped on a train. In the ensuing chaos, they both encounter a host of colourful characters, resulting in hilarious and unexpected consequences.', 'In 2001, somewhere in rural India, two young brides get accidentally swapped on a train. In the ensuing chaos, they both encounter a host of colourful characters, resulting in hilarious and unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGG5hCwPnMvuKzvUBnxo5y3DcVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1163194'),
  ('889495815657799117', 'Lost Love', 2003, 'Drama', 'Franco Battiato', 'Manlio Sgalambro, Franco Battiato', 'Corrado Fortuna, Donatella Finocchiaro, Lucia Sardo, Antonino Bruschetta, Tiziana Lodato, Gabriele Ferzetti, Nicole Grimaudo, Rada Rassimov', null, 'Ettore, a young boy in Sicily in the 50''s, is surrounded by women and is always surprised by what is happening around him. In Milan a few years later Ettore is once again the center of attention and the hip crowd.', 'Ettore, a young boy in Sicily in the 50''s, is surrounded by women and is always surprised by what is happening around him. In Milan a few years later Ettore is once again the center of attention and the hip crowd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nH0vYuZOpjIBIJy1ae8GSJjH58s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80375'),
  ('787597602739943126', 'Lost on a Mountain in Maine', 2024, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Andrew Kightlinger, Idan Menin', 'Luke Paradise', 'Luke David Blumm, Paul Sparks, Caitlin FitzGerald, Ethan Slater, Griffin Wallace Henkel, Dean Neistat, Bates Wilder, Mason Cufari', 'PG', 'When twelve-year-old Donn Fendler gets tired of waiting for his father and brothers to join him on the summit of Maine''s highest peak, he decides to find his own way back to camp. But Donn doesn''t count on a fast-moving fog that obscures the path. He doesn''t count on falling down an embankment that hides him from sight. And he doesn''t count on taking a turn that leaves him alone to wander aimlessly for nearly two weeks in the empty mountain wilderness.', 'When twelve-year-old Donn Fendler gets tired of waiting for his father and brothers to join him on the summit of Maine''s highest peak, he decides to find his own way back to camp. But Donn doesn''t count on a fast-moving fog that obscures the path. He doesn''t count on falling down an embankment that hides him from sight. And he doesn''t count on taking a turn that leaves him alone to wander aimlessly for nearly two weeks in the empty mountain wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elKEzHpbdoTMkK0IpUKcK6x1Ttl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1197619'),
  ('407287054665018715', 'Lost on Everest', 2020, 'Documentary, Mystery', 'Matt Irving, Renan Öztürk, Drew Pulley', null, 'George Mallory, Andrew Irvine', 'PG-13', 'Reaching 29,029 feet, Mount Everest has long captivated mountaineers of all stripes. But a peak that draws athletes and mountaineers to new heights isn’t without danger — or a dark side. Perhaps the peak’s greatest mystery is the missing body of Andrew “Sandy” Irvine who disappeared alongside George Leigh Mallory in 1924 just 800 vertical feet from the summit. In Lost on Everest, we follow along as a team of elite climbers with new intel on the location of his missing body set out to solve what may be mountaineering’s great mystery. Along with the body, the team hopes to find Irvine’s camera and the footage that could rewrite history.', 'Reaching 29,029 feet, Mount Everest has long captivated mountaineers of all stripes. But a peak that draws athletes and mountaineers to new heights isn’t without danger — or a dark side. Perhaps the peak’s greatest mystery is the missing body of Andrew “Sandy” Irvine who disappeared alongside George Leigh Mallory in 1924 just 800 vertical feet from the summit. In Lost on Everest, we follow along as a team of elite climbers with new intel on the location of his missing body set out to solve what may be mountaineering’s great mystery. Along with the body, the team hopes to find Irvine’s camera and the footage that could rewrite history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nI8ZnMvlVtbXZcZN55baRDbGPn3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:704854'),
  ('1054618939800923853', 'Lost on Journey', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Raymond Yip Wai-Man', null, 'Xu Zheng, Wang Baoqiang, Li Man, Li Xiaolu, Zuo Xiaoqing, Zhang Xinyi, Ma Jian, Huang Xiaolei', null, 'A boss of a toy corporation, Chenggong Li, tries to head back to Chan Sar to celebrate the Chinese New Year with his family. However, plans don''t go as smoothly after he crosses paths with a stranger, Geng Niu.', 'A boss of a toy corporation, Chenggong Li, tries to head back to Chan Sar to celebrate the Chinese New Year with his family. However, plans don''t go as smoothly after he crosses paths with a stranger, Geng Niu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afGsGhnndLRoMmt7wvRnIyauGLw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51306'),
  ('1051441467714746224', 'Lost Ones', 2018, 'Drama', 'Felix Hassenfratz, Bernhard Keller', 'Felix Hassenfratz', 'Maria Dragus, Anna Bachmann, Clemens Schick, Enno Trebs, Meira Durand, Anne Weinknecht', null, 'The only time Maria feels liberated is when she is playing the organ. Bach’s music is something you feel in your gut. At home she bears the brunt of responsibility – both for her rebellious sister Hannah, two years her junior, who is busy planning her escape from the village, and for her father, Johann.', 'The only time Maria feels liberated is when she is playing the organ. Bach’s music is something you feel in your gut. At home she bears the brunt of responsibility – both for her rebellious sister Hannah, two years her junior, who is busy planning her escape from the village, and for her father, Johann.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dihp0cikMV5fLANNV9BoE3CSpcJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498064'),
  ('1105410450634412695', 'Lost Paradise', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yoshimitsu Morita, Hiroshi Takase', 'Kyoko Morinaga', 'Koji Yakusho, Hitomi Kuroki, Akira Terao, Toshio Shiba, Tomoko Hoshino, Yoshino Kimura, Kazuya Kosaka, Morio Agata', null, 'Kuki is a veteran newspaper reporter who has been shuffled off to a book-development branch and finds escape in an illicit relationship with Rinko. Together they find the passion no longer present in their marriages.', 'Kuki is a veteran newspaper reporter who has been shuffled off to a book-development branch and finds escape in an illicit relationship with Rinko. Together they find the passion no longer present in their marriages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPQzMQoYu9PgF9osb1QnlbTanpZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68606'),
  ('585237993683267783', 'Lost Paradise', 2012, 'Drama', 'Ève Deboise, Pascal Auffray', 'Ève Deboise, Nadine Lamari', 'Pauline Étienne, Olivier Rabourdin, Florence Thomassin, Cédric Vieira, Ouassini Embarek, Tilla Perez-Houis', null, 'Lucie and her father Hugo have grown closer since Lucie''s mother left unexpectedly a year prior. When her mother returns, Hugo becomes jealous and angry.', 'Lucie and her father Hugo have grown closer since Lucie''s mother left unexpectedly a year prior. When her mother returns, Hugo becomes jealous and angry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2XJVq0RPi1m4w5IGMmGps9gLuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141687'),
  ('528238809627731645', 'Lost Paradise', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Humberto Hinojosa, Guillermo Garza', 'Humberto Hinojosa, Antón de Goenechea', 'Ana Claudia Talancón, lván Sánchez, Andrés Almeida, Raúl Briones', null, 'Mexican Caribbean islands are famous for their spectacular beauty. The vast distance where them are found, has transformed them into dens of heartless men, prepared to whatever they need to do in order to remain anonymous. Three young people decide to visit one of these islands, without knowing that there is something inside that can separate them forever.', 'Mexican Caribbean islands are famous for their spectacular beauty. The vast distance where them are found, has transformed them into dens of heartless men, prepared to whatever they need to do in order to remain anonymous. Three young people decide to visit one of these islands, without knowing that there is something inside that can separate them forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQdmxH4EezBOZu9mWJjA4nzZtTi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346013'),
  ('72079738452388171', 'Lost Paradise: Riding Habit Harakiri', 1990, 'Horror', 'Masami Akita', null, 'Asako Mochizuki, Yuuri Sunohara, Chimuo Nureki, Toshiro Hasegawa', null, 'Directed by Masami Akita,who is also one of Japan''s leading noise musicians under the name Merzbow. With a soundtrack by the director himself, this intense and ultra-gory seppuku film shows a young woman taking her own life by an act of ritual harakiri.', 'Directed by Masami Akita,who is also one of Japan''s leading noise musicians under the name Merzbow. With a soundtrack by the director himself, this intense and ultra-gory seppuku film shows a young woman taking her own life by an act of ritual harakiri.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNvlVDKmNEQsfs537NXj0T6j3XD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106138'),
  ('916424977634672023', 'Lost Place', 2013, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Thorsten Klein, Andreas Thalhammer, Xiaosu Han', 'Lena Vurma, Thorsten Klein', 'François Goeske, Anatole Taubman, Josefine Preuß, Jytte-Merle Böhrnsen, Pit Bukowski, Björn Bugri, Georg Kammerer, Rike Eckermann', null, 'While on a GPS treasure hunt in the Palatinate forest four teenagers come across an old US military radio tower station. Back in the days of the Cold War it was part of a secret military program that produced horrific side effects, but has long since abandoned. Until now, when the station is mysteriously powered up again.', 'While on a GPS treasure hunt in the Palatinate forest four teenagers come across an old US military radio tower station. Back in the days of the Cold War it was part of a secret military program that produced horrific side effects, but has long since abandoned. Until now, when the station is mysteriously powered up again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mODicswbT5J5q0AORvs5B09CwO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79067'),
  ('485781366820276639', 'Lost River', 2015, 'Drama, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Ryan Gosling, Benoît Debie, Mariela Comitini', 'Ryan Gosling', 'Christina Hendricks, Iain De Caestecker, Saoirse Ronan, Eva Mendes, Matt Smith, Ben Mendelsohn, Reda Kateb, Barbara Steele', 'R', 'Billy, a single mother of two, is led into a macabre underworld while her teenage son, Bones, discovers a secret road leading to an underwater town. Both Billy and Bones must dive deep into the mystery if their family is to survive.', 'Billy, a single mother of two, is led into a macabre underworld while her teenage son, Bones, discovers a secret road leading to an underwater town. Both Billy and Bones must dive deep into the mystery if their family is to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z00sPSV2Fue6tDPAhtn1mehOHc2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167810'),
  ('558474470535692081', 'Lost Seamen', 2003, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Claire Devers, Serge Dell''Amico, Christophe Pollock', 'Jean-Pol Fargeau, Claire Devers', 'Bernard Giraudeau, Marie Trintignant, Audrey Tautou, Darry Cowl, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Nozha Khouadra, Bakary Sangaré', null, 'Based on a novel by Jean-Claude Izzo, this melancholic movie focuses on three sailors being the last remaining crew members on their ship which is aground in the harbor of Marseille. After the owner has sold the "Aldébaran", only the Lebanese captain Aziz, the Greek Diamantis and the Turk Nelim are stuck on the boat for a lack of prospects. Aziz doesn''t want to return to his wife, Diamantis tries to find a girl he left at the age of 20 and Nelim, young and foolish, just wants to have fun...', 'Based on a novel by Jean-Claude Izzo, this melancholic movie focuses on three sailors being the last remaining crew members on their ship which is aground in the harbor of Marseille. After the owner has sold the "Aldébaran", only the Lebanese captain Aziz, the Greek Diamantis and the Turk Nelim are stuck on the boat for a lack of prospects. Aziz doesn''t want to return to his wife, Diamantis tries to find a girl he left at the age of 20 and Nelim, young and foolish, just wants to have fun...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKjZE6odpAo7Cnm4Nxwq0umq8mu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58747'),
  ('291562621671019702', 'Lost Signal', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brian McNamara', 'Robert Egan, Graham Silver', 'Al Santos, Sandra McCoy, Brian McNamara, Ella Joyce, Alex Boyd', null, 'New Years Eve, 2004- Kevin Healy(Santos) and Tiffany Matthews(McCoy) head out to celebrate the New Year and a new beginning in their 7-year relationship. In the midst of the celebration the young couple decide to mark the occasion by experimenting with Crystal Meth. Unbeknown to them, town bad boy Randy Martin slips LSD in their drinks, setting into motion a night of life altering events which will leave one dead and the other forever scarred. The young couple leave the party and quickly begin to realize that they are not alone, or so they think. After a car accident the two run into the woods to escape their stalker, with no protection from the elements. Attempts to call for help are futile when they realize that their cell phone signal is lost. Alone in the woods with the delusions of being chased the couple slowly begin to turn on each other.', 'New Years Eve, 2004- Kevin Healy(Santos) and Tiffany Matthews(McCoy) head out to celebrate the New Year and a new beginning in their 7-year relationship. In the midst of the celebration the young couple decide to mark the occasion by experimenting with Crystal Meth. Unbeknown to them, town bad boy Randy Martin slips LSD in their drinks, setting into motion a night of life altering events which will leave one dead and the other forever scarred. The young couple leave the party and quickly begin to realize that they are not alone, or so they think. After a car accident the two run into the woods to escape their stalker, with no protection from the elements. Attempts to call for help are futile when they realize that their cell phone signal is lost. Alone in the woods with the delusions of being chased the couple slowly begin to turn on each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXxrfGT0ZhxkMkpGZa5l7cePM5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56860'),
  ('879798583313073097', 'Lost Sofia', 2023, 'Romance, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Katherine Chediak Putnam, Jacob Solitrenick, Dean Law', 'Dean Law, Katherine Chediak Putnam, Karol Bueno', 'Giovanna Grigio, Bruno Montaleone, Nathália Falcão, Bia Arantes, Luciana Paes, Emira Sophia, Hélio de la Peña, Sergio Malheiros', null, 'A modern and independent girl, but when it comes to love, the only novels in her life are those from Jane Austen''s literary universe. After using a borrowed cell phone, something mysterious happens and she is transported to a different world, which resembles the 19th century. Sofia is taken in by the family of the charming Ian Clarke, while desperately trying to find a way to return to her life. What she didn''t know is that her heart had other plans.', 'A modern and independent girl, but when it comes to love, the only novels in her life are those from Jane Austen''s literary universe. After using a borrowed cell phone, something mysterious happens and she is transported to a different world, which resembles the 19th century. Sofia is taken in by the family of the charming Ian Clarke, while desperately trying to find a way to return to her life. What she didn''t know is that her heart had other plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYVLZgee1MpLGAB4YMneCdWLpEq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977592'),
  ('918364893747599882', 'Lost Soul', 1977, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Dino Risi, Claudio Risi, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Bernardino Zapponi, Dino Risi', 'Vittorio Gassman, Catherine Deneuve, Danilo Mattei, Anicée Alvina, Ester Carloni, Michele Capnist, Gino Cavalieri, Angelo Boscariol', null, 'Bizarre events keep occurring in an old mansion, and it''s soon become obvious that something mysterious is up in the attic.', 'Bizarre events keep occurring in an old mansion, and it''s soon become obvious that something mysterious is up in the attic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8c9ktbl0mKPbZOVhNGdtiIwAX6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42768'),
  ('234758007218733383', 'Lost Soul: The Doomed Journey of Richard Stanley''s Island of Dr. Moreau', 2014, 'Documentary', 'David Gregory, Jim Kunz', 'David Gregory', 'Richard Stanley, Kier-La Janisse, Michael Gingold, Graham Humphreys, Edward R. Pressman, Robert Shaye, Tim Sullivan, Tim Zinnemann', null, 'The story of the insane scandals related to the remake of “Island of Dr. Moreau” —originally a novel by H. G. Wells—, which was brought to the big screen in 1996. How director Richard Stanley spent four years developing the project just to find an abrupt end to his work while leading actor Marlon Brando pulled the strings in the shadows. Now for the first time, the living key players recount what really happened and why it all went so spectacularly wrong.', 'The story of the insane scandals related to the remake of “Island of Dr. Moreau” —originally a novel by H. G. Wells—, which was brought to the big screen in 1996. How director Richard Stanley spent four years developing the project just to find an abrupt end to his work while leading actor Marlon Brando pulled the strings in the shadows. Now for the first time, the living key players recount what really happened and why it all went so spectacularly wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rySKp5esmRPVDMm33mr4szxR6IU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279992'),
  ('735999278041890101', 'Lost Souls', 1980, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Mou Tun-Fei, Luk Ching', 'Yip Tung-Yau', 'Aan Hung, Eric Chan Ga-Kei, Chan Shen, Chai Fung, Jenny Liang, Keung Hon, Wan Seung-Lam, Chow Kin-Ping', null, 'Determined to escape from the harsh regime of China to the freedom of Hong Kong, three youths are captured by Mr. Hok, a sadistic human smuggler who subjects them to an unrelenting assault of degradation. Pushed to the limits of human endurance, the prisoners must fight for their lives in an unforgettable, action-packed climax.', 'Determined to escape from the harsh regime of China to the freedom of Hong Kong, three youths are captured by Mr. Hok, a sadistic human smuggler who subjects them to an unrelenting assault of degradation. Pushed to the limits of human endurance, the prisoners must fight for their lives in an unforgettable, action-packed climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maJpGhcNbHGTlFe1FCay1Xf7ApI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140985'),
  ('818216844564348009', 'Lost Souls', 2000, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Janusz Kamiński, Doug Coleman, Mauro Fiore', 'Pierce Gardner', 'Winona Ryder, Ben Chaplin, Sarah Wynter, Anna Gunn, Philip Baker Hall, John Hurt, K.K. Dodds, Elias Koteas', 'R', 'A young woman becomes aware of a conspiracy to enable the Devil to walk the Earth in human form. To defeat the prophesy, she must convince a respected New York crime journalist, who is devoid of faith, that he is in fact the target of the conspiracy.', 'A young woman becomes aware of a conspiracy to enable the Devil to walk the Earth in human form. To defeat the prophesy, she must convince a respected New York crime journalist, who is devoid of faith, that he is in fact the target of the conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DOq3KqGrNbqa3z5M8iDJ2wuaxJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10383'),
  ('976016924249383486', 'Lost Souvenirs', 1950, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Christian-Jaque', 'Pierre Prévert, Jacques Prévert, Jacques Companéez', 'François Périer, Suzy Delair, Pierre Brasseur, Edwige Feuillère, Gérard Philipe, Gilberte Géniat, Bernard Blier, Yolande Laffon', null, 'Suppose lost and found objects could talk... But they can! At least four of them... : -A statuette of Osiris remembers how two ex-lovers, a model and a good for nothing who claimed to be an Egyptologist, met again one Christmas Eve. -A violin has things to say about Raoul, a humble policeman who lost Solange, a widowed grocer he loved, to a god-dam seducing busker also named Raoul. -A scarf was witness to an eerie romance between a young madman and girl he had saved from suicide. -A funeral wreath lets us know how it caused a young woman to believe her lover dead. After having told their respective story, the objects return to their customary stillness.', 'Suppose lost and found objects could talk... But they can! At least four of them... : -A statuette of Osiris remembers how two ex-lovers, a model and a good for nothing who claimed to be an Egyptologist, met again one Christmas Eve. -A violin has things to say about Raoul, a humble policeman who lost Solange, a widowed grocer he loved, to a god-dam seducing busker also named Raoul. -A scarf was witness to an eerie romance between a young madman and girl he had saved from suicide. -A funeral wreath lets us know how it caused a young woman to believe her lover dead. After having told their respective story, the objects return to their customary stillness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Yc9zEfZjsd67qa1nm3kz2Y8F6i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77507'),
  ('777382653275097609', 'Lost Things', 2004, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Martin Murphy, Justine Kerrigan', 'Stephen Sewell', 'Leon Ford, Charlie Garber, Lenka Kripac, Steve Le Marquand, Alexandra Vaughan', 'R', 'Four teenagers; Gary (Leon Ford), Brad (Chalie Garber), Emily (Lenka Kripac) and Tracey (Alex Vaughan) travel to a desert paradisiacal beach and spend the weekend together. When they arrive, they meet the older Zippo (Steve Le Marquand), and experience a sense of Déjà vu with weird events, feeling that they had previously been in that place. That Saturday, they start to realize that they are actually trapped in a nightmare.', 'Four teenagers; Gary (Leon Ford), Brad (Chalie Garber), Emily (Lenka Kripac) and Tracey (Alex Vaughan) travel to a desert paradisiacal beach and spend the weekend together. When they arrive, they meet the older Zippo (Steve Le Marquand), and experience a sense of Déjà vu with weird events, feeling that they had previously been in that place. That Saturday, they start to realize that they are actually trapped in a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mh6MX0AFXexw4w0ADh2i9fkbFFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43545'),
  ('897586745286564146', 'Lost Transmissions', 2020, 'Drama', 'Katharine O''Brien, Arnau Valls Colomer, Bryan Lake', 'Katharine O''Brien', 'Juno Temple, Simon Pegg, Rebecca Hazlewood, Daisy Bishop, Jamie Harris, Grant Harvey, Danny Ramirez, Robert Schwartzman', null, 'When an acclaimed music producer goes off his medication for schizophrenia, his friends chase him though the LA music scene to help commit him to a psychiatric hospital, revealing the troubling inadequacies of the mental health care system.', 'When an acclaimed music producer goes off his medication for schizophrenia, his friends chase him though the LA music scene to help commit him to a psychiatric hospital, revealing the troubling inadequacies of the mental health care system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pqvbXqkruyyt1u4TWUtxZw59et.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535987'),
  ('961890944721403899', 'Lost Transport', 2022, 'Drama, War, History', 'Saskia Diesing, Aage Hollander', 'Saskia Diesing', 'Hanna van Vliet, Anna Bachmann, Eugenie Anselin, Bram Suijker, Konstantin Frolov, Frieda Barnhard, Billy de Walle, Edda Lina Janz', null, 'In the spring of 1945, a train deporting hundreds of Jewish prisoners gets stranded near a small German village occupied by the Red Army. Condemned to each other and in a context of deep mistrust, desperation and revenge, an unexpected friendship emerges between Russian sniper Vera, village girl Winnie and Jewish-Dutch woman Simone.', 'In the spring of 1945, a train deporting hundreds of Jewish prisoners gets stranded near a small German village occupied by the Red Army. Condemned to each other and in a context of deep mistrust, desperation and revenge, an unexpected friendship emerges between Russian sniper Vera, village girl Winnie and Jewish-Dutch woman Simone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Fd2TrecBtZwPJNatWvaxB3dSQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915892'),
  ('1010873217853902828', 'Lost Voyage', 2001, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Christian McIntire, Todd Barron, Courtney King', 'Christian McIntire, Patrick Phillips', 'Judd Nelson, Janet Gunn, Jeff Kober, Mark Sheppard, Richard Gunn, Lance Henriksen, Ray Laska, Robert Pine', null, 'Twenty five years ago, the SS Corona Queen disappeared in the region known as, "The Bermuda Triangle". Now, it has returned. Seven people go on board to learn the truth behind her disappearance but the ship did not return alone...', 'Twenty five years ago, the SS Corona Queen disappeared in the region known as, "The Bermuda Triangle". Now, it has returned. Seven people go on board to learn the truth behind her disappearance but the ship did not return alone...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmGotAxSQDwgoRlwYytu3mJIWZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52878'),
  ('546431499541792325', 'Lost Youth', 1948, 'Drama', 'Pietro Germi, Enzo Provenzale, Lidia C. Ripandelli', 'Pietro Germi, Mario Monicelli, Antonio Pietrangeli', 'Carla Del Poggio, Massimo Girotti, Jacques Sernas, Franca Maresa, Diana Borghese, Nando Bruno, Leo Garavaglia, Dino Maronetto', null, 'In impoverished post-war Rome, a gang of young thieves is lead by Stefano, the son of an illustrious professor. The police suspects that the criminals are actually university students; inspector Mariani, a young World War II veteran, enrolls and tries to find out more. He falls for a pretty fellow student, Luisa, but she is the sister of the gang leader...', 'In impoverished post-war Rome, a gang of young thieves is lead by Stefano, the son of an illustrious professor. The police suspects that the criminals are actually university students; inspector Mariani, a young World War II veteran, enrolls and tries to find out more. He falls for a pretty fellow student, Luisa, but she is the sister of the gang leader...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3hOtFBdBQ3IFy23nlC6qyn1iHt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242240'),
  ('577217878708518920', 'Lost, Found', 2018, 'Drama, Family', 'Lü Yue', 'Qin Haiyan', 'Yao Chen, Ma Yili, Wu Haochen, Yuan Wenkang, Qi Huan, Gao Ye, Wang Zichen, Tao Xinran', null, 'Li Jie, a lawyer, is taking divorce proceedings to try to get custody of her daughter. As she is working hard to earn a better life for her daughter, she hires a baby sitter, Sun Fang, to watch her child. One day, Li comes home only to find her child and Sun have disappeared. Unfortunately, Li is suspected by both her family and the police, and must lean on herself to trace Sun alone.', 'Li Jie, a lawyer, is taking divorce proceedings to try to get custody of her daughter. As she is working hard to earn a better life for her daughter, she hires a baby sitter, Sun Fang, to watch her child. One day, Li comes home only to find her child and Sun have disappeared. Unfortunately, Li is suspected by both her family and the police, and must lean on herself to trace Sun alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffKHJGSjw4ycHTNjf7ysQr50CnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531542'),
  ('972738956184745384', 'Lost, Lost, Lost', 1976, 'Documentary', 'Jonas Mekas', 'Jonas Mekas', 'Peter Beard, Ed Emshwiller, Ken Jacobs, Adolfas Mekas, Jonas Mekas, Tiny Tim, Peter Bogdanovich, Allen Ginsberg', null, 'Drawn from footage shot between 1949 and 1963, Jonas Mekas’s autobiographical diary film chronicles his early years in exile, capturing the struggle to build a new life in New York and his gradual discovery of a vibrant artistic community.', 'Drawn from footage shot between 1949 and 1963, Jonas Mekas’s autobiographical diary film chronicles his early years in exile, capturing the struggle to build a new life in New York and his gradual discovery of a vibrant artistic community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsPlsjF4xxh36IGKNEdJdbV3yQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148807'),
  ('860508991016429194', 'Lot in Sodom', 1933, 'Drama', 'James Sibley Watson, Melville Webber, James Sibley Watson', 'James Sibley Watson, Melville Webber', 'Friedrich Haak, Hildegarde Watson, Dorthea House, Lewis Whitbeck', null, 'Lot in Sodom is a sensual depiction of the Sodom and Gomorrah story filled with sinewy and semi-clad bodies, delirious bacchanals devoted to physical pleasure, and a searing, cataclysmic finale depicting the fall of a city devoted to sins of the flesh.', 'Lot in Sodom is a sensual depiction of the Sodom and Gomorrah story filled with sinewy and semi-clad bodies, delirious bacchanals devoted to physical pleasure, and a searing, cataclysmic finale depicting the fall of a city devoted to sins of the flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xb29kC7B0VvBYrI7tvCJHqWTdYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47503'),
  ('305571837306472533', 'Lotna', 1959, 'Drama, War', 'Sylwester Chęciński, Janusz Morgenstern, Andrzej Wajda', 'Andrzej Wajda, Wojciech Żukrowski', 'Jerzy Pichelski, Adam Pawlikowski, Jerzy Moes, Mieczysław Łoza, Bożena Kurowska, Bronisław Dardziński, Adam Dzieszyński, Wiesław Gołas', null, 'Set in the beginning of Wold War II, when the Polish cavalry still fought with lances against German troops. LOTNA is about a white thoroughbred horse that passed through various hands in a military outfit.', 'Set in the beginning of Wold War II, when the Polish cavalry still fought with lances against German troops. LOTNA is about a white thoroughbred horse that passed through various hands in a military outfit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIWAqoIOlIFmRW6uQJ9RkNE2r3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270728'),
  ('70427339824653524', 'Lotoman', 2011, 'Family, Comedy', 'Archie Lopez', null, 'Raymond Pozo, Miguel Céspedes, Olga Buccarelli, Elizabeth Ruíz, Chelsy García, Sarah Jorge León, Alfonso Rodríguez Zorrilla', null, 'Modesto and Manuel are brothers whose lives change by wining the lottery.', 'Modesto and Manuel are brothers whose lives change by wining the lottery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9MFs8C5FkEl30H0KKDv6uHLAXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58651'),
  ('16381432649751948', 'Lotoman 003', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Archie Lopez', 'Martín Diaz Bello', 'Miguel Céspedes, Raymond Pozo, Fausto Mata, Fernando Carrillo, Julián Gil, Elizabeth Ruíz, Dalisa Alegría, Sergio Carlo', null, 'Manuel and Modesto accept an unexpected proposal and, in doing so, discover the exciting world of the Secret Agents! But during the mission their integrity is tested ... And the Lotoman realizes that sometimes it is difficult to do the right thing.', 'Manuel and Modesto accept an unexpected proposal and, in doing so, discover the exciting world of the Secret Agents! But during the mission their integrity is tested ... And the Lotoman realizes that sometimes it is difficult to do the right thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfsP5x64mO5oAl0sr1qu5jKY4oy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258910'),
  ('707025941940881072', 'Lotoman 2.0', 2012, 'Family, Comedy', 'Archie Lopez', null, 'Miguel Céspedes, Raymond Pozo, Dalisa Alegría, Elizabeth Ruíz, Olga Buccarelli, Chelsy García, Edilsy Vargas, Fernando Carrillo', null, 'The Marchena family is living a great moment, but no happiness is complete. Manuel suffers from the cravings of Sobeida’s pregnancy and Modesto seeks the Woman of his Life. Susanita faces great danger and Mama Susana is diagnosed with a deadly disease. Because in life, money is not everything----will they be so lucky as to live in a united family?', 'The Marchena family is living a great moment, but no happiness is complete. Manuel suffers from the cravings of Sobeida’s pregnancy and Modesto seeks the Woman of his Life. Susanita faces great danger and Mama Susana is diagnosed with a deadly disease. Because in life, money is not everything----will they be so lucky as to live in a united family?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAfTul4Q921MrRVjpPkBiimN5ov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211706'),
  ('860879135941623763', 'Lots of Ice and a Little Bit of Water', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Daniel Filho, Nonato Estrela', 'Alexandre Machado, Fernanda Young', 'Mariana Ximenes, Palomma Duarte, Ângelo Paes Leme, Laura Cardoso, Thiago Lacerda, Carla Daniel, Aílton Graça, Matheus Costa', null, 'Roberta and Suzana are two sisters, both in their thirties, of totally different beauty and life styles, united by a common goal: to take revenge on their grandmother, a mean old woman who, in the past, turned the little girls'' lives into hell, with her strict educational concepts. Since they were very young, the two sisters plan to kidnap the grandmother and now is the long awaited moment. Before Roberta and Suzana leave to the beach house, the setting of their grandmother''s terrorist practices, Roberta, while waiting for Suzana at a restaurant, meets Renato, an extremely proper guy who ends up involved in this unexpected adventure. The two sisters'' departure leaves Suzana''s husband, Francisco, bewildered and he ends up being also part of a parallel mad adventure.', 'Roberta and Suzana are two sisters, both in their thirties, of totally different beauty and life styles, united by a common goal: to take revenge on their grandmother, a mean old woman who, in the past, turned the little girls'' lives into hell, with her strict educational concepts. Since they were very young, the two sisters plan to kidnap the grandmother and now is the long awaited moment. Before Roberta and Suzana leave to the beach house, the setting of their grandmother''s terrorist practices, Roberta, while waiting for Suzana at a restaurant, meets Renato, an extremely proper guy who ends up involved in this unexpected adventure. The two sisters'' departure leaves Suzana''s husband, Francisco, bewildered and he ends up being also part of a parallel mad adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bayKfqni4E0qYywozN6H80d116.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88053'),
  ('79495868884419464', 'Lots of Kids, a Monkey and a Castle', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Gustavo Salmerón', 'Gustavo Salmerón, Raúl de Torres, Beatriz Montañez', 'Julita Salmerón, Gustavo Salmerón', null, 'Julita expressed her three greatest wishes shortly after getting married: lots of children, a monkey and a castle she can call her own. That all of these wishes have become a reality is probably down to the immense stubbornness of this charismatic and equally hilarious matriarch who has a weakness for collecting crazy objects. When financial circumstances force the family to sell their castle, her adult children are left sifting through a lifetime of peculiarities in search of a few lost bones… Spanish actor and neo director Gustavo Salmerón paints a deliciously absurd family portrait that just happens to reveal a lot about Spain, Catholicism and the economic crisis.', 'Julita expressed her three greatest wishes shortly after getting married: lots of children, a monkey and a castle she can call her own. That all of these wishes have become a reality is probably down to the immense stubbornness of this charismatic and equally hilarious matriarch who has a weakness for collecting crazy objects. When financial circumstances force the family to sell their castle, her adult children are left sifting through a lifetime of peculiarities in search of a few lost bones… Spanish actor and neo director Gustavo Salmerón paints a deliciously absurd family portrait that just happens to reveal a lot about Spain, Catholicism and the economic crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IXufNFOPhRvOnng1f3ElkwxGCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473176'),
  ('1021554397301626534', 'Lotta Leaves Home', 1993, 'Family', 'Johanna Hald, Olof Johnson', 'Johanna Hald', 'Grete Havnesköld, Linn Gloppestad, Martin Andersson, Beatrice Järås, Claes Malmberg, Margreth Weivers, Gunvor Pontén, Sten Ljunggren', null, 'A feisty five-year-old girl Lotta decides to move away from home. And no, she doesn''t want to put on the stupid sweater.', 'A feisty five-year-old girl Lotta decides to move away from home. And no, she doesn''t want to put on the stupid sweater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYXzfVRjgLtwlORBIVrlI21IEzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27599'),
  ('473559378113478683', 'Lotta on Rascal Street', 1992, 'Comedy, Family', 'Johanna Hald, Olof Johnson, Jesper Danielsson', 'Astrid Lindgren', 'Grete Havnesköld, Linn Gloppestad, Martin Andersson, Beatrice Järås, Claes Malmberg, Margreth Weivers, Ulla Lopez, Anna Nyman', null, 'Lotta is a five old girl living in Sweden with her mother, father, brother and sister. She is living the very normal life of all children of her age...', 'Lotta is a five old girl living in Sweden with her mother, father, brother and sister. She is living the very normal life of all children of her age...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbUYWbZllF7nWwX2fToAkVVMETb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27600'),
  ('161861917827896623', 'Lotte', 2016, 'Drama', 'Julius Schultheiß, Martin Neumeyer', 'Julius Schultheiß', 'Karin Hanczewski, Zita Aretz, Paul Matzke, Marc Ben Puch, Christine Knispel, Manfred Schulz, Matthias Lamp', null, 'Lotte is impulsive, rough around the edges and leads a colourful life on the streets of Berlin, stumbling from man to man, flat to flat and bar to bar. A brief encounter with a young girl, Greta, turns her life upside down. Lotte realises she will not be able to run away this time.', 'Lotte is impulsive, rough around the edges and leads a colourful life on the streets of Berlin, stumbling from man to man, flat to flat and bar to bar. A brief encounter with a young girl, Greta, turns her life upside down. Lotte realises she will not be able to run away this time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bM0zQkYnGp0HaJvrqhFVqCS389d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381452'),
  ('951099372226543492', 'Lottery Ticket', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Erik White, Patrick Cady, H.H. Cooper', 'Abdul Williams', 'Shad Moss, Brandon T. Jackson, Naturi Naughton, Loretta Devine, Teairra Mari, Ice Cube, Keith David, Terry Crews', 'PG-13', 'Kevin Carson is a young man living in the projects who has to survive a three-day weekend after his opportunistic neighbors find out he''s holding a winning lottery ticket worth $370 million.', 'Kevin Carson is a young man living in the projects who has to survive a three-day weekend after his opportunistic neighbors find out he''s holding a winning lottery ticket worth $370 million.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Eg93S0cMHLMFkeunqpmMkzs10A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41382'),
  ('348470581317836200', 'Lottovoittaja UKK Turhapuro', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Ere Kokkonen, Kari Sohlberg', 'Spede Pasanen', 'Vesa-Matti Loiri, Marjatta Raita, Tapio Hämäläinen, Marita Nordberg, Spede Pasanen, Seppo Laine, Simo Salminen, Seela Sella', null, 'It is the first anniversary of Uuno and Elisabet. Uuno has placed a bet with his friend Härski-Hartikainen a year ago, that if Uuno can take just one year of marriage with Elisabet, Hartikainen will treat him a festive dinner. However, Hartikainen buys a lottery ticket for Uuno, who agrees to deduct it from his debt – and the festive dinner is reduced to a can of milk and half a sausage. As it happens, Uuno becomes the lottery winner of 1.5 million marks, only to soon realize he doesn''t own a single penny yet. Mister Tossavainen arrives and offers to finance Uuno before he actually gets the jackpot. Thus, Uuno gets to live a rich live on credit. He buys a raccoon fur, leopard swimming trunks and a couple of Mercedes-Benzes. Women begin to fancy Uuno and so does his father-in-law. As time goes by it is revealed, though, that Uuno is not actually a lottery winner, and so he has to escape the anger of others to Härski''s car repair shop.', 'It is the first anniversary of Uuno and Elisabet. Uuno has placed a bet with his friend Härski-Hartikainen a year ago, that if Uuno can take just one year of marriage with Elisabet, Hartikainen will treat him a festive dinner. However, Hartikainen buys a lottery ticket for Uuno, who agrees to deduct it from his debt – and the festive dinner is reduced to a can of milk and half a sausage. As it happens, Uuno becomes the lottery winner of 1.5 million marks, only to soon realize he doesn''t own a single penny yet. Mister Tossavainen arrives and offers to finance Uuno before he actually gets the jackpot. Thus, Uuno gets to live a rich live on credit. He buys a raccoon fur, leopard swimming trunks and a couple of Mercedes-Benzes. Women begin to fancy Uuno and so does his father-in-law. As time goes by it is revealed, though, that Uuno is not actually a lottery winner, and so he has to escape the anger of others to Härski''s car repair shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzhEqATNTa0FBiYdbceYQmh8jBf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36766'),
  ('641238779063355071', 'Lotus Lantern', 1999, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Chang Guangxi', 'Wang Dawei', 'Yang Shuo, Yu Pengfei, Jiang Wen, Xu Fan, Chen Peisi, Ning Jing, Nie Xiaozhe, Cui Jie', null, 'A young boy named Chen Xiang uses a magical lotus lantern to search for and rescue his mother, a goddess, from the cruel punishment she received from her brother, the king of the gods, for falling in love with a mortal man.', 'A young boy named Chen Xiang uses a magical lotus lantern to search for and rescue his mother, a goddess, from the cruel punishment she received from her brother, the king of the gods, for falling in love with a mortal man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMeMxuT4J6HhAdpaount4pEYkmS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331253'),
  ('843149194530394718', 'Lou', 2017, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Mullins, Adam Habib', 'Dave Mullins', null, 'G', 'A Pixar short about a lost-and-found box and the unseen monster within.', 'A Pixar short about a lost-and-found box and the unseen monster within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4l9wSwvabTefMJ3TkXnh9evzmVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433471'),
  ('953154623572479429', 'Lou', 2022, 'Action, Thriller', 'Michael McDonough, Anna Foerster, Robyn Ledoux', 'Maggie Cohn, Jack Stanley', 'Allison Janney, Jurnee Smollett, Logan Marshall-Green, Ridley Asha Bateman, Matt Craven, Greyston Holt, Daniel Bernhardt, RJ Fetherstonhaugh', 'R', 'A young girl is kidnapped during a powerful storm. Her mother joins forces with her mysterious neighbour to set off in pursuit of the kidnapper. Their journey will test their limits and expose the dark secrets of their past.', 'A young girl is kidnapped during a powerful storm. Her mother joins forces with her mysterious neighbour to set off in pursuit of the kidnapper. Their journey will test their limits and expose the dark secrets of their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djM2s4wSaATn4jVB33cV05PEbV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429473'),
  ('248061228421227514', 'Lou Andreas-Salomé, The Audacity to be Free', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Cordula Kablitz-Post', 'Cordula Kablitz-Post, Susanne Hertel', 'Katharina Lorenz, Julius Feldmeier, Nicole Heesters, Merab Ninidze, Carl Achleitner, Katharina Schüttler, Peter Simonischek, Liv Lisa Fries', null, 'Lou Andreas-Salomé, the woman who enraptured 19th century Europe’s greatest minds, recounts her life to Ernst Pfeiffer in this German film directed by Cordula Kablitz-Post. A published novelist, poet and essayist, Salomé’s desire to live a life free from convention scandalized society but spurred genius and passion in others, including Friedrich Nietzsche, Paul Rée and her lover, the poet Rainer Maria Rilke. Under the tutelage of Sigmund Freud, she became the first female psychoanalyst.', 'Lou Andreas-Salomé, the woman who enraptured 19th century Europe’s greatest minds, recounts her life to Ernst Pfeiffer in this German film directed by Cordula Kablitz-Post. A published novelist, poet and essayist, Salomé’s desire to live a life free from convention scandalized society but spurred genius and passion in others, including Friedrich Nietzsche, Paul Rée and her lover, the poet Rainer Maria Rilke. Under the tutelage of Sigmund Freud, she became the first female psychoanalyst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAGvYiti3pW39zRcwpIlX7WnNhq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379691'),
  ('148536666184336874', 'Lou!', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Julien Neel, Pierre Milon, Hiroshi Shimizu', 'Julien Neel', 'Ludivine Sagnier, Kyan Khojandi, Lola Lasseron, Nathalie Baye, Julie Ferrier, Léa Nataf, Lily Taïeb, Joshua Mazé', null, 'Lou, a creative and dreamy 12-year-old girl, lives alone with her mother in an orange building with tons of little balconies that give access to the roof. Mina has been her best friend since kindergarten, and Lou has been in love with Tristan, one of her neighbors, since elementary school. Her mother has relinquished her own personal happiness of late so as to devote herself to her daughter, but their little bubble bursts when Mom meets a man and Lou at last dares speak to Tristan.', 'Lou, a creative and dreamy 12-year-old girl, lives alone with her mother in an orange building with tons of little balconies that give access to the roof. Mina has been her best friend since kindergarten, and Lou has been in love with Tristan, one of her neighbors, since elementary school. Her mother has relinquished her own personal happiness of late so as to devote herself to her daughter, but their little bubble bursts when Mom meets a man and Lou at last dares speak to Tristan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9BiIFPSwzgSeKcc95LSLWHD6CM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294463'),
  ('936189989391102893', 'Loucas pra Casar', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Santucci, Jully Irie, Mariana Melga', 'Júlia Spadaccini, Marcelo Saback', 'Ingrid Guimarães, Márcio Garcia, Tatá Werneck, Suzana Pires, Fabiana Karla, Edmilson Filho, Guida Vianna, Bryan Ruffo', null, 'Malu, Lúcia and Maria found the ideal man to marry. Until they discover that in reality this man is the same person: Samuel, who was dating all of them over the past years. The three will have to decide if they will fight amongst each other for exclusivity or will unite in revenge.', 'Malu, Lúcia and Maria found the ideal man to marry. Until they discover that in reality this man is the same person: Samuel, who was dating all of them over the past years. The three will have to decide if they will fight amongst each other for exclusivity or will unite in revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a85dJjBuHVmWTByJYml525i5U4l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261461'),
  ('585451563432476237', 'Loud Connection', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Mikhail Milashin, Alexey Nuzhnyy, Denis Veykhman', 'Rolando Ravello, Paolo Genovese, Paola Mammini', 'Leonid Barats, Irina Gorbacheva, Rostislav Khait, Mariya Mironova, Kamil Larin, Anastasiya Ukolova, Aleksandr Demidov, Veronika Kornienko', null, 'Gathered together in a country house, seven friends play an entertaining game, in which participants have to read aloud all of their incoming text messages, and can only answer their calls using loudspeaker mode. They can’t even imagine what stunning surprises about each other they will discover.', 'Gathered together in a country house, seven friends play an entertaining game, in which participants have to read aloud all of their incoming text messages, and can only answer their calls using loudspeaker mode. They can’t even imagine what stunning surprises about each other they will discover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CBaUCPsjXgQUsaoQngb1zLrRrm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570657'),
  ('503312355301007956', 'Louder Than Bombs', 2015, 'Drama', 'Joachim Trier, Jakob Ihre', 'Eskil Vogt, Joachim Trier', 'Gabriel Byrne, Isabelle Huppert, Jesse Eisenberg, Devin Druid, Amy Ryan, Ruby Jerins, Megan Ketch, David Strathairn', 'R', 'Three years after his wife, acclaimed photographer Isabelle Reed, dies in a car crash, Gene keeps everyday life going with his shy teenage son, Conrad. A planned exhibition of Isabelle’s photographs prompts Gene''s older son, Jonah, to return to the house he grew up in - and for the first time in a very long time, the father and the two brothers are living under the same roof.', 'Three years after his wife, acclaimed photographer Isabelle Reed, dies in a car crash, Gene keeps everyday life going with his shy teenage son, Conrad. A planned exhibition of Isabelle’s photographs prompts Gene''s older son, Jonah, to return to the house he grew up in - and for the first time in a very long time, the father and the two brothers are living under the same roof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tEtGPnolE93wlsj9g1fg9zR3dk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157827'),
  ('685603004713383686', 'LOUDER! Can''t Hear What You''re Singin'', Wimp!', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Daisuke Soma, Satoshi Miki', 'Satoshi Miki', 'Sadao Abe, Riho Yoshioka, Yudai Chiba, Kumiko Aso, Eiji Kotoge, Yuki Katayama, Yuko Nakamura, Shoko Ikezu', null, 'Sin is a rock star. He has an amazingly loud voice with a range of four octaves. His secret is that he has created his voice through a method of vocal cord doping. His voice is now teetering on the edge, due to side effects from the vocal cord doping. Around this time, Sin meets Fūka, who is a street musician. When Fūka sings, her voice is so small. Due to Fūka, Sin looks back upon his past.', 'Sin is a rock star. He has an amazingly loud voice with a range of four octaves. His secret is that he has created his voice through a method of vocal cord doping. His voice is now teetering on the edge, due to side effects from the vocal cord doping. Around this time, Sin meets Fūka, who is a street musician. When Fūka sings, her voice is so small. Due to Fūka, Sin looks back upon his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hu7IomsatORkZ1InKv7TvlGrzEH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523750'),
  ('275200372296277290', 'loudQUIETloud: A Film About the Pixies', 2006, 'Documentary, Music', 'Matthew Galkin, Steven Cantor', null, 'Frank Black, Kim Deal, David Lovering, Joey Santiago', 'NR', 'When college rock darlings the Pixies broke up in 1992, their fans were shocked and dismayed. When they reunited in 2004, those same fans and legions of new listeners were ecstatic and filled with high hopes. loudQUIETloud follows the rehearsals and live shows of the band as they struggle through the reunion tour "Sell Out"', 'When college rock darlings the Pixies broke up in 1992, their fans were shocked and dismayed. When they reunited in 2004, those same fans and legions of new listeners were ecstatic and filled with high hopes. loudQUIETloud follows the rehearsals and live shows of the band as they struggle through the reunion tour "Sell Out"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haTQZD2MWhC1QoiJT6VgxaEVK2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22485'),
  ('571554875435494844', 'Loue-moi !', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Coline Assous, Virginie Schwartz, Mathieu Czernichow', null, 'Déborah François, Alison Wheeler, Charlotte de Turckheim, Kev Adams, Marc Ruchmann, Bernard Ménez, Arié Elmaleh, Louise Coldefy', null, 'Lea opens an agency where anybody can rent her to play the part the clients need: a daughter, a girlfriend, a customer, you name it...', 'Lea opens an agency where anybody can rent her to play the part the clients need: a daughter, a girlfriend, a customer, you name it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rjnwQDp6aEWHE228RgWbufHZ8e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446040'),
  ('860953504094954590', 'Louie Bluie', 1985, 'Documentary, Music', 'Terry Zwigoff', null, 'Howard Armstrong, Ted Bogan, Jay Lynch, Yank Rachell, Ikey Robinson', null, 'Crumb director Terry Zwigoff’s first film is a true treat: a documentary about the obscure country-blues musician and idiosyncratic visual artist Howard “Louie Bluie” Armstrong, member of the last known black string band in America. As beguiling a raconteur as he is a performer, Louie makes for a wildly entertaining movie subject, and Zwigoff honors him with an unsentimental but endlessly affectionate tribute. Full of infectious music and comedy, Louie Bluie is a humane evocation of the kind of pop-cultural marginalia that Zwigoff would continue to excavate in the coming years.', 'Crumb director Terry Zwigoff’s first film is a true treat: a documentary about the obscure country-blues musician and idiosyncratic visual artist Howard “Louie Bluie” Armstrong, member of the last known black string band in America. As beguiling a raconteur as he is a performer, Louie makes for a wildly entertaining movie subject, and Zwigoff honors him with an unsentimental but endlessly affectionate tribute. Full of infectious music and comedy, Louie Bluie is a humane evocation of the kind of pop-cultural marginalia that Zwigoff would continue to excavate in the coming years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pdAoyw04eXprKh0mpGvAomS3KC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87065'),
  ('857786343423249709', 'Louis Armstrong''s Black & Blues', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Sacha Jenkins, Edward Lachman', null, 'Louis Armstrong, Nas, Wynton Marsalis, Dwight D. Eisenhower, Orson Welles, Archie Shepp, Count Basie, Lucille Armstrong', 'R', 'Never-before-heard personal recordings and archival footage tell the story of Louis Armstrong''s life from his perspective. From musical phenom to civil rights activist to world-renowned artist, this illuminating film shows sides of Armstrong few have seen.', 'Never-before-heard personal recordings and archival footage tell the story of Louis Armstrong''s life from his perspective. From musical phenom to civil rights activist to world-renowned artist, this illuminating film shows sides of Armstrong few have seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7Bol8Tdm0S8GVNXgbQSOS5AVpD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1014890'),
  ('339179679097248018', 'Louis C.K. 2017', 2017, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Louis C.K., Dave Lilling', 'Louis C.K.', 'Louis C.K.', null, 'Louis C.K. muses on religion, eternal love, giving dogs drugs, email fights, teachers and more in a live performance from Washington, D.C.', 'Louis C.K. muses on religion, eternal love, giving dogs drugs, email fights, teachers and more in a live performance from Washington, D.C.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUa2qgwOXIgEoMatz5UpmxevgG7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449674'),
  ('616065565008949923', 'Louis C.K.: Chewed Up', 2008, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Louis C.K., Shannon Hartman', 'Louis C.K.', 'Louis C.K.', null, 'Profane, vulgar and obscenely funny, Louis C.K. insists on telling the truth, whether you like it or not! Join the Emmy Award-winning stand-up comic and TV star (Lucky Louie) as he shares his thoughts on the stuff everyone thinks about -- male bodily fluids, the joys of being white, the difference between women and girls -- but never has the nerve to say. It''s Louis C.K. at his risk-taking best: fearless, honest and totally outrageous! Nominated for the 2009 Emmy for Outstanding Writing for a Variety, Music or Comedy Special', 'Profane, vulgar and obscenely funny, Louis C.K. insists on telling the truth, whether you like it or not! Join the Emmy Award-winning stand-up comic and TV star (Lucky Louie) as he shares his thoughts on the stuff everyone thinks about -- male bodily fluids, the joys of being white, the difference between women and girls -- but never has the nerve to say. It''s Louis C.K. at his risk-taking best: fearless, honest and totally outrageous! Nominated for the 2009 Emmy for Outstanding Writing for a Variety, Music or Comedy Special', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJpTrCHb4ETP2zzjA5RQgJHBxed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30969'),
  ('122488038868400718', 'Louis C.K.: Live at the Beacon Theater', 2011, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Paul Koestner, Louis C.K.', 'Louis C.K.', 'Louis C.K.', null, 'Recorded November 10th, 2011 as part of the New York Comedy Festival, and only available for purchase online, Louis C.K. follows up his 2010 concert film Hilarious with a new hour’s worth of shrewdly observed and periodically profane material. He starts with making his own kind of please-turn-off-your-cell-phone announcement, as well as a warning not to text or tweet during the show: “Just live your life,” he asks. Whether he’s talking about a unique way to drop a rental car off at an airport or describing why a man in his 40s should not smoke dope, it’s terrific, humane, carried-to-crazed-extremes stuff.', 'Recorded November 10th, 2011 as part of the New York Comedy Festival, and only available for purchase online, Louis C.K. follows up his 2010 concert film Hilarious with a new hour’s worth of shrewdly observed and periodically profane material. He starts with making his own kind of please-turn-off-your-cell-phone announcement, as well as a warning not to text or tweet during the show: “Just live your life,” he asks. Whether he’s talking about a unique way to drop a rental car off at an airport or describing why a man in his 40s should not smoke dope, it’s terrific, humane, carried-to-crazed-extremes stuff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGntW92XqJ66EIQdBeseee1Q7Um.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80379'),
  ('635482523341067904', 'Louis C.K.: Live at The Comedy Store', 2015, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Louis C.K.', 'Louis C.K.', 'Louis C.K., Jay London', 'NR', 'This material was developed and prepared over the last year or so, mostly in comedy clubs. This special kind of goes back to when he used to just make noises and be funny for no particular reason. It felt right to him to shoot this special in a club to give it that live immediate intimate feeling. The show is about an hour long. The opening act, who is seen at the beginning (good place for an opening act) is Jay London. One of his favorite club comics going way back to the late 80s when he first started in working in New York.', 'This material was developed and prepared over the last year or so, mostly in comedy clubs. This special kind of goes back to when he used to just make noises and be funny for no particular reason. It felt right to him to shoot this special in a club to give it that live immediate intimate feeling. The show is about an hour long. The opening act, who is seen at the beginning (good place for an opening act) is Jay London. One of his favorite club comics going way back to the late 80s when he first started in working in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ULqaND2rzNFL4OAxCbSrY7UWem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321594'),
  ('733823148635881267', 'Louis C.K.: Oh My God', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Louis C.K.', 'Louis C.K.', 'Louis C.K.', null, 'Filmed at the Celebrity Theatre in Phoenix, AZ on February 15th and 16th, 2013, Oh My God is Louis C.K.''s fifth stand-up special, his first for HBO since 2007''s Shameless, and his first since winning a Emmy Award for writing on his acclaimed show on FX, Louie. Performed in the round in front of a live audience, he discusses such topics as the food chain, animals, divorce, strange anecdotes, broken morality, murder and mortality.', 'Filmed at the Celebrity Theatre in Phoenix, AZ on February 15th and 16th, 2013, Oh My God is Louis C.K.''s fifth stand-up special, his first for HBO since 2007''s Shameless, and his first since winning a Emmy Award for writing on his acclaimed show on FX, Louie. Performed in the round in front of a live audience, he discusses such topics as the food chain, animals, divorce, strange anecdotes, broken morality, murder and mortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMiRDSnFRpKicYbikKa8aO1QKbU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185574'),
  ('410120601667556714', 'Louis C.K.: Shameless', 2007, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Steven J. Santos', 'Louis C.K.', 'Louis C.K.', null, 'Louis C.K. is back on HBO in an ALL-NEW hour of raw no-holds-barred stand-up comedy! The creator and star of the 2006 comedy series Lucky Louie, performs in front of a live audience in LA at the Henry Fonda Theater. Louis C.K. covers issues near and dear to his heart like marriage, lying to your spouse, having kids and losing your privacy, and obligatory sex among husbands and wives.', 'Louis C.K. is back on HBO in an ALL-NEW hour of raw no-holds-barred stand-up comedy! The creator and star of the 2006 comedy series Lucky Louie, performs in front of a live audience in LA at the Henry Fonda Theater. Louis C.K. covers issues near and dear to his heart like marriage, lying to your spouse, having kids and losing your privacy, and obligatory sex among husbands and wives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSAKi7kvolRwrV5vGM5aMLdhYnX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24447'),
  ('808564957016754063', 'Louis C.K.: Sorry', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Louis C.K.', 'Louis C.K.', 'Louis C.K.', null, 'Louis C.K.''s stand-up comedy special that discusses sex, society, the Boy Scouts, pandemics, and other topics.', 'Louis C.K.''s stand-up comedy special that discusses sex, society, the Boy Scouts, pandemics, and other topics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRVx2QaNLQB3YHVADhy2hlLCZTn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1318297'),
  ('369594723950213169', 'Louis Cyr: The Strongest Man in the World', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Daniel Roby, Nicolas Bolduc', 'Sylvain Guy', 'Antoine Bertrand, Guillaume Cyr, Rose-Maïté Erkoreka, Gilbert Sicotte, Gil Bellows, Cliff Saunders, Amélie Grenier, Éliane Gagnon', null, 'Biopic of Louis Cyr, strongest man in the world at the end of the 19th Century.', 'Biopic of Louis Cyr, strongest man in the world at the end of the 19th Century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMRwnR9wXgV8VFZXZDAiCqiCJbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209293'),
  ('1074984192557274861', 'Louis de Funès Forever', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Grégory Monro', 'Grégory Monro', 'Jamel Debbouze, Alexandre Astier, Guillaume Gallienne, Éric Toledano, Olivier Nakache, Marcel Rufo, Claude Zidi, Louis de Funès', null, 'A moving and very funny portrait of the personal and professional life of the magnificent French comedian Louis de Funès (1914-83), as well as a detailed analysis of his masterful acting technique.', 'A moving and very funny portrait of the personal and professional life of the magnificent French comedian Louis de Funès (1914-83), as well as a detailed analysis of his masterful acting technique.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dHzPNCAzVB4uAauecbxj2JIRvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245484'),
  ('538454585882257680', 'Louis Lumière', 1968, 'Documentary', 'Éric Rohmer, Jacques Lacourie, Jean-Pierre About', null, 'Jean Renoir, Henri Langlois, Éric Rohmer', null, 'Eric Rohmer leads a conversation with Jean Renoir and Henri Langlois on the art of filmmaker Louis Lumière.', 'Eric Rohmer leads a conversation with Jean Renoir and Henri Langlois on the art of filmmaker Louis Lumière.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evtvyPYuwBCDaytiXLndjwuRoNU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255929'),
  ('36525061845864358', 'Louis Theroux: A Place for Paedophiles', 2009, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Emma Cooper', 'Louis Theroux', 'Louis Theroux', null, 'Louis has gained access to Coalinga Mental Hospital in California, which houses more than 500 of the most disturbed criminals in America, convicted paedophiles. Most have already served lengthy prison sentences, but have been deemed unsafe for release. Instead, they have been sent here for an indefinite time. Spending time with those undergoing treatment, Louis wrestles with whether he can ever allow himself to believe men whose whole history is defined by deception and deceit.', 'Louis has gained access to Coalinga Mental Hospital in California, which houses more than 500 of the most disturbed criminals in America, convicted paedophiles. Most have already served lengthy prison sentences, but have been deemed unsafe for release. Instead, they have been sent here for an indefinite time. Spending time with those undergoing treatment, Louis wrestles with whether he can ever allow himself to believe men whose whole history is defined by deception and deceit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUWG7azWzr3ZfWvxUx5fS09U33F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68208'),
  ('239680725998517633', 'Louis Theroux: America''s Most Hated Family in Crisis', 2011, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Emma Cooper', 'Louis Theroux', 'Louis Theroux, Fred Phelps, Shirley Phelps-Roper, Lauren Drain, Steve Drain, Betty Phelps, Jael Phelps, Libby Phelps', null, 'Following up on his 2007 documentary, The Most Hated Family in America, Louis Theroux returns to Topeka, Kansas, for a week-long visit with the Westboro Baptist Church. He again joins the Phelps family on their controversial pickets where they try to antagonise communities with offensive slogans and anti-gay placards. But four years on from Louis''s last visit, there are signs of disarray in the Phelps clan. A series of defections of family members has shaken up the church.', 'Following up on his 2007 documentary, The Most Hated Family in America, Louis Theroux returns to Topeka, Kansas, for a week-long visit with the Westboro Baptist Church. He again joins the Phelps family on their controversial pickets where they try to antagonise communities with offensive slogans and anti-gay placards. But four years on from Louis''s last visit, there are signs of disarray in the Phelps clan. A series of defections of family members has shaken up the church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwhHpR1gEc0tcHOPEBPIZrpgh4K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206953'),
  ('703422587102806565', 'Louis Theroux: Behind Bars', 2008, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Stuart Cabb', 'Louis Theroux', 'Louis Theroux', null, 'For two weeks, Theroux visits the San Quentin State Prison.', 'For two weeks, Theroux visits the San Quentin State Prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5qaKmEC3QZYpJji1Tiam621UTy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112722'),
  ('1117850019538235377', 'Louis Theroux: Gambling in Las Vegas', 2007, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Stuart Cabb', 'Louis Theroux', 'Louis Theroux', null, 'Louis heads to Las Vegas, to reveal the world behind the myths of casino culture. Among the people he meets are two of the casino''s ''high-rollers'' and an employee who looks after them as well as a retired doctor who says she has gambled away $4million in seven years.', 'Louis heads to Las Vegas, to reveal the world behind the myths of casino culture. Among the people he meets are two of the casino''s ''high-rollers'' and an employee who looks after them as well as a retired doctor who says she has gambled away $4million in seven years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXAEQBRhgs78TJDTeRKTZSyudPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210250'),
  ('619648483283650580', 'Louis Theroux: Inside the Manosphere', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Adrian Choa, Niall Kenny, Nancy Strang', null, 'Louis Theroux, HSTikkyTokky, Myron Gaines, Sneako, Justin Waller, Ed Matthews, Elaine Sullivan, Kacey May', 'R', 'With rare access and no holds barred, the acclaimed documentarian investigates a growing ultra-masculine network and its controversial influencers.', 'With rare access and no holds barred, the acclaimed documentarian investigates a growing ultra-masculine network and its controversial influencers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouOvRvsgF37yEx3D6ZLWyuxZFjE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1633264'),
  ('573361401459198646', 'Louis Theroux: Law and Disorder in Johannesburg', 2008, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Paddy Wivell', 'Louis Theroux', 'Louis Theroux', null, 'Louis Theroux travels to Johannesburg, where the residents find themselves increasingly besieged by crime as he looks at the issue of law and disorder.', 'Louis Theroux travels to Johannesburg, where the residents find themselves increasingly besieged by crime as he looks at the issue of law and disorder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUhKXqi5XtTO53UfHMFjAOdZTxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241620'),
