  ('564956553317409988', 'Louis Theroux: Louis and the Brothel', 2003, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Geoffrey O''Connor, Geoffrey O''Connor', 'Louis Theroux', 'Louis Theroux', null, 'Louis stays with the residents of a soon to open brothel in Nevada for a few weeks.', 'Louis stays with the residents of a soon to open brothel in Nevada for a few weeks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ECg9X4SGpzP86Xx0CyogRUQiKd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143481'),
  ('664927887896922589', 'Louis Theroux: Louis and the Nazis', 2003, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Stuart Cabb, Stuart Cabb', 'Louis Theroux', 'Louis Theroux, Tom Metzger, April Gaede', null, 'Louis Theroux travels to California to meet the man dubbed "the most dangerous racist in America"; Tom Metzger. Louis meets him, his family and his publicity manager as well as following him to skinhead rallies and on a visit to Mexico.', 'Louis Theroux travels to California to meet the man dubbed "the most dangerous racist in America"; Tom Metzger. Louis meets him, his family and his publicity manager as well as following him to skinhead rallies and on a visit to Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAVIoWdYmDxYIaD1qH5LbPf3WIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171711'),
  ('866239432973606839', 'Louis Theroux: The Most Hated Family in America', 2007, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Geoffrey O''Connor, Geoffrey O''Connor', 'Louis Theroux', 'Louis Theroux, Fred Phelps, Shirley Phelps-Roper', null, 'Louis meets the Phelps family — the people at the heart of the controversial Westboro Baptist Church. The Phelps have rabid anti-homosexual beliefs, and often campaign at the funerals of American soldiers. They believe that every tragedy in the world is God''s punishment for homosexuality.', 'Louis meets the Phelps family — the people at the heart of the controversial Westboro Baptist Church. The Phelps have rabid anti-homosexual beliefs, and often campaign at the funerals of American soldiers. They believe that every tragedy in the world is God''s punishment for homosexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aTeydMIjlzZkhTl7LANlhoErPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63581'),
  ('7024101688656656', 'Louis Theroux: The Settlers', 2025, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Sophie Ardern, Joshua Baker', 'Louis Theroux', 'Louis Theroux, Itamar Ben Gvir, Matan Cohen, Ari Abramowitz, Issa Amro, Mohammad Hureini, Daniella Weiss', null, '14 years after his first visit, Louis Theroux meets some of the growing community of religious-nationalist Israelis who have settled in the occupied West Bank.', '14 years after his first visit, Louis Theroux meets some of the growing community of religious-nationalist Israelis who have settled in the occupied West Bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iT1J9zYzEY069wF546RJmuYO5m4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1466013'),
  ('399333396232876651', 'Louis Theroux: Under the Knife', 2007, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Emma Cooper', 'Louis Theroux', 'Louis Theroux, Stuart Linder', null, 'Louis Theroux: Under the Knife is a TV documentary written and presented by Louis Theroux about the people and doctors involved in plastic surgery operations. Filmed mostly in the USA, in the programme, Louis himself ends up getting liposuction.', 'Louis Theroux: Under the Knife is a TV documentary written and presented by Louis Theroux about the people and doctors involved in plastic surgery operations. Filmed mostly in the USA, in the programme, Louis himself ends up getting liposuction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puy9CWRe7pWzY4h6e2jtiR4ikZm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182979'),
  ('544583779686187380', 'Louis Theroux''s African Hunting Holiday', 2008, 'TV Movie, Documentary', 'Paddy Wivell', 'Louis Theroux', 'Louis Theroux', null, 'Louis goes to South Africa where American tourists pay to hunt wild animals in privately owned reserves.', 'Louis goes to South Africa where American tourists pay to hunt wild animals in privately owned reserves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1h4TXgxBCwTHIb4AAJpCX9Ky5mR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143431'),
  ('630855336381881327', 'Louis Tomlinson: All of Those Voices', 2023, 'Documentary, Music', 'Charlie Lightening', null, 'Louis Tomlinson, Oliver Wright, Matt Vines, Helene Hørlyck, Lottie Tomlinson, Daisy Tomlinson, Phoebe Tomlinson, Len Poulston', 'NR', 'Ditching the typical glossy sheen of celebrity documentaries, this film gives audiences an intimate and unvarnished view of Louis Tomlinson''s life and career. Through never-before-seen home movie footage and behind the scenes access to Louis’ sell-out 2022 World Tour, the documentary offers a unique perspective on what it''s like to be a musician in today''s fast-paced world.', 'Ditching the typical glossy sheen of celebrity documentaries, this film gives audiences an intimate and unvarnished view of Louis Tomlinson''s life and career. Through never-before-seen home movie footage and behind the scenes access to Louis’ sell-out 2022 World Tour, the documentary offers a unique perspective on what it''s like to be a musician in today''s fast-paced world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctYglXhhUh0Nhd99GRbeKZlakGJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084072'),
  ('320611384869992805', 'Louis van Beethoven', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'Niki Stein, David Marlow', 'Niki Stein', 'Tobias Moretti, Colin Pütz, Anselm Bresgott, Ulrich Noethen, Ronald Kukulies, Cornelius Obonya, Silke Bodenbender, Caroline Hellwig', null, '1779. Eight-year-old Ludwig van Beethoven, called "Louis", is already known as a musical prodigy. He learns to go his own way - much to the dismay of the people around him. Some years later, he meets Mozart during times of political upheaval. The unconventional genius and French Revolution are sparking a fire in Louis'' heart; he doesn''t want to serve a master - only the arts. Facing times of family tragedies and unrequited love, he almost gives up. However, Louis makes it to Vienna to study under Haydn in 1792, and the rest is history. Who was this man, whose music has since touched countless hearts and minds? At the end of his life, the master is isolated by loss of loved ones and hearing. Surely though, he was way ahead of his times.', '1779. Eight-year-old Ludwig van Beethoven, called "Louis", is already known as a musical prodigy. He learns to go his own way - much to the dismay of the people around him. Some years later, he meets Mozart during times of political upheaval. The unconventional genius and French Revolution are sparking a fire in Louis'' heart; he doesn''t want to serve a master - only the arts. Facing times of family tragedies and unrequited love, he almost gives up. However, Louis makes it to Vienna to study under Haydn in 1792, and the rest is history. Who was this man, whose music has since touched countless hearts and minds? At the end of his life, the master is isolated by loss of loved ones and hearing. Surely though, he was way ahead of his times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2f4B8DTmes5HMFpRqHvSERaPkUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:761772'),
  ('885192319120063191', 'Louis-Ferdinand Céline', 2016, 'Drama', 'Marie Spencer, Emmanuel Bourdieu', 'Marcia Romano, Emmanuel Bourdieu', 'Denis Lavant, Géraldine Pailhas, Philip Desmeules, Rick Hancke, Marijke Pinoy, Vanja Maria Godee, Simon Bergulf, Kim Vetting', null, '1948 - Louis-Ferdinand Céline in Denmark, in exile, accused of collaboration with the Nazis during the occupation of the France. He is accompanied by Lucette, his wife and his cat Bebert.', '1948 - Louis-Ferdinand Céline in Denmark, in exile, accused of collaboration with the Nazis during the occupation of the France. He is accompanied by Lucette, his wife and his cat Bebert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KlQsoskJTLKfuRbRsJNRAYXaWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387715'),
  ('961369820999873242', 'Louis, the Child King', 1993, 'War, Drama, History', 'Roger Planchon, Gérard Simon', 'Roger Planchon', 'Carmen Maura, Maxime Mansion, Paolo Graziosi, Jocelyn Quivrin, Brigitte Catillon, Serge Dupire, Hervé Briaux, Irina Dalle', null, 'January 1649: Since the death of his father, the young Louis XIV must undergo the hard apprenticeship of royal power. He must face the intrigues of the great ones of the kingdom who lead La Fronde, the agreements and the betrayals of those close to him. He is helped in this by his mother Anne of Austria and by the Cardinal Mazarin.', 'January 1649: Since the death of his father, the young Louis XIV must undergo the hard apprenticeship of royal power. He must face the intrigues of the great ones of the kingdom who lead La Fronde, the agreements and the betrayals of those close to him. He is helped in this by his mother Anne of Austria and by the Cardinal Mazarin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jYgDAGe6mDz0izWo6TazMBQT1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198441'),
  ('261613655230191388', 'Louisa', 1950, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alexander Hall, Maury Gertsman', 'Stanley Roberts', 'Ronald Reagan, Ruth Hussey, Spring Byington, Charles Coburn, Edmund Gwenn, Piper Laurie, Scotty Beckett, Jimmy Hunt', 'NR', 'Architect Hal Norton and wife Meg invite his widowed mother Louisa to move in with them, only to discover the sweet elderly lady is romantically involved with what seems to be every old coot in town.', 'Architect Hal Norton and wife Meg invite his widowed mother Louisa to move in with them, only to discover the sweet elderly lady is romantically involved with what seems to be every old coot in town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCKk9zNsULb9FufeLGgFq0gCYfj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99492'),
  ('808312416363791044', 'Louise', 2022, 'Animation, Drama', 'Constance Bertoux, Camille Bozec, Pauline Guitton', 'Constance Bertoux, Camille Bozec, Pauline Guitton', 'Alice Orsat, Clara Quilichini, Victoria Grosbois, Lilly Caruso, Jean-Christophe Lebert, Bernard Métreaux, Marion Boisrond', null, 'Louise, ballerina at the Garnier Opera in 1895, rushes home after a show but is stopped by a friend asking for money. Louise knows what to do in order to repay her.', 'Louise, ballerina at the Garnier Opera in 1895, rushes home after a show but is stopped by a friend asking for money. Louise knows what to do in order to repay her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dzDQ1OgncaDaYY8bcVO31VRTRr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899487'),
  ('65800073547989469', 'Louise by the Shore', 2016, 'Animation', 'Jean-François Laguionie, Lionel Chauvin', 'Jean-François Laguionie, Anik Leray', 'Dominique Frot, Jean-François Laguionie, Diane Dassigny, Antony Hickling, Piera Degli Esposti', null, 'On the last day of summer in a small seaside resort town, an older woman named Louise realizes that the last train has departed without her. She finds herself alone in the town, abandoned by everyone. As the weather turns for the worse and with no one to keep her company, louise must rely on her past to help her survive the present.', 'On the last day of summer in a small seaside resort town, an older woman named Louise realizes that the last train has departed without her. She finds herself alone in the town, abandoned by everyone. As the weather turns for the worse and with no one to keep her company, louise must rely on her past to help her survive the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjgfIldVv0380ohpptbbtE27VW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413927'),
  ('981578128149768113', 'Louise Wimmer', 2011, 'Drama', 'Cyril Mennegun, Thomas Letellier', 'Cyril Mennegun', 'Corinne Masiero, Jérôme Kircher, Anne Benoît, Marie Kremer, Jean-Marc Roulot, Frédéric Gorny, Cécile Rebboah, Annie-France Poli', null, 'The middle-aged titular heroine (Masiero) of this bare-bones, Dardenne-esque debut has certainly fallen on hard times: Living between her car and a storage shed, working a part-time job as a hotel chambermaid, and trying against all odds to obtain public housing, Louise scrapes by on a day-to-day subsistence that’s only a few Euros away from skid row.', 'The middle-aged titular heroine (Masiero) of this bare-bones, Dardenne-esque debut has certainly fallen on hard times: Living between her car and a storage shed, working a part-time job as a hotel chambermaid, and trying against all odds to obtain public housing, Louise scrapes by on a day-to-day subsistence that’s only a few Euros away from skid row.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuOADW1ed1TDyFfSvpdVdxNWFNO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99508'),
  ('72387101385067424', 'Louise-Michel', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Gustave Kervern, Benoît Delépine', 'Benoît Delépine, Gustave Kervern', 'Yolande Moreau, Bouli Lanners, Benoît Poelvoorde, Albert Dupontel, Mathieu Kassovitz, Joseph Dahan, Kafka, Miss Ming', null, 'In this radical and endearing black comedy, a group of retrenched female factory workers decide to pool their compensation money… and hire a hit man to liquidate their boss.', 'In this radical and endearing black comedy, a group of retrenched female factory workers decide to pool their compensation money… and hire a hit man to liquidate their boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVBndYreVtlBhIb0K4uSwmnGVSf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21145'),
  ('181448512444886181', 'Louisiana Purchase', 1941, 'Comedy, Music', 'Irving Cummings, Harry Hallenberger, Robert Emmett Dolan', 'Jerome Chodorov, Joseph Fields', 'Bob Hope, Vera Zorina, Victor Moore, Irène Bordoni, Dona Drake, Raymond Walburn, Maxie Rosenbloom, Phyllis Ruth', 'NR', 'A bumbling senator investigating graft in Louisiana is the target of a scheme involving a Viennese beauty.', 'A bumbling senator investigating graft in Louisiana is the target of a scheme involving a Viennese beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyH0aA3nbipy4ylAIW7TbhxsRPj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97818'),
  ('1030164041626126311', 'Louisiana Story', 1948, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Robert Flaherty, Serge Roullet, Richard Leacock', null, 'Joseph Boudreaux, Lionel Le Blanc, E. Bienvenu, Frank Hardy, C.P. Guedry', null, 'The idyllic life of a young Cajun boy and his pet raccoon is disrupted when the tranquility of the bayou is broken by an oil well drilling near his home.', 'The idyllic life of a young Cajun boy and his pet raccoon is disrupted when the tranquility of the bayou is broken by an oil well drilling near his home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwEbsHAvdY9G2gJKRKYmxJ6IB6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70447'),
  ('1032746932027925899', 'Loulou', 1980, 'Drama, Romance', 'Maurice Pialat, Pierre-William Glenn, Patrick Grandperret', 'Maurice Pialat', 'Isabelle Huppert, Gérard Depardieu, Guy Marchand, Humbert Balsan, Christian Boucher, Bernard Tronczak, Frédérique Cerbonnet, Jacqueline Dufranne', null, 'A bored wife leaves her husband for an unemployed, petty criminal.', 'A bored wife leaves her husband for an unemployed, petty criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTujCgEaVs9SkZxKOMkDH1t23ji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39415'),
  ('995812664567106759', 'Louloute', 2021, 'Drama', 'Alice Desplat, Hubert Viel', 'Hubert Viel', 'Alice Henri, Laure Calamy, Bruno Clairefond, Erika Sainte, Hannah Castel Chiche, Rémi Baranger, Olivier Saladin, Cyril Texier', null, 'Louise revisits her childhood when her family decides to sell their farm. 20 years ago, she was Louloute, a mischievous and exuberant little girl, helping her father with their farm, fighting with her siblings and worrying her mother… When the family''s debts accumulate and overwhelm them, tender childhood moments become intertwined with the harsh adult reality of a disappearing rural world.', 'Louise revisits her childhood when her family decides to sell their farm. 20 years ago, she was Louloute, a mischievous and exuberant little girl, helping her father with their farm, fighting with her siblings and worrying her mother… When the family''s debts accumulate and overwhelm them, tender childhood moments become intertwined with the harsh adult reality of a disappearing rural world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pG5RONvwUwHS9kGa3zOKkhknkgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745980'),
  ('1075762557675190494', 'Louma - Familie ist kein Kinderspiel', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Mark Monheim, Markus Schott, Frank A. Schneider, Silke Koch', 'Christian Schnalke, Franziska Lutz', 'Trystan Pütter, Timur Isik, Marie Nasemann, Lola Höller, Noèl Gabriel Kipp', null, 'Louma leaves behind four children by two fathers: Tristan and Mo have only one thing in common: they were married to the same woman. What should happen to the children now?', 'Louma leaves behind four children by two fathers: Tristan and Mo have only one thing in common: they were married to the same woman. What should happen to the children now?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FiDsyKBg4cP7z9pAaeAwyhkLnVkp.jpg', 'plex:movie:louma-familie-ist-kein-kinderspiel'),
  ('92706188336662649', 'Loup', 2009, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Nicolas Vanier, Laurent Charbonnier, Thierry Machado', 'Ariane Fert, Nicolas Vanier', 'Nicolas Brioudes, Pom Klementieff, Min Man Ma, Vantha Talisman, Bernard Wong, Gurgon Kyap, Kaveil Kem, Garasim Vasilev', null, 'Sixteen year old Sergei is the son of Boris, the head of the Batagi clan of reindeer breeders. Awarded the title of herdsman, with the clan''s largest herd, he joins the Evenk tribe for the first time as they begin their summer cattle drive across the pastures of the Siberian mountains. As the tribe''s only source of income, these reindeer are their pride and joy and they will stop at nothing to protect them from their most bitter enemy, the Wolf. Written by American Film Market.', 'Sixteen year old Sergei is the son of Boris, the head of the Batagi clan of reindeer breeders. Awarded the title of herdsman, with the clan''s largest herd, he joins the Evenk tribe for the first time as they begin their summer cattle drive across the pastures of the Siberian mountains. As the tribe''s only source of income, these reindeer are their pride and joy and they will stop at nothing to protect them from their most bitter enemy, the Wolf. Written by American Film Market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebSPR5PQ32Q0Q82PeT6gEEqjjOe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48009'),
  ('774458449228177054', 'Loups=Garous', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Animation, Horror', 'Junichi Fujisaku, Tsuyoshi Shimura, Hitomi Matsuura', 'Sayaka Harada, Midori Goto', 'Kanae Oki, Hiromi Igarashi, Marina Inoue, Miyuki Sawashiro, Kana Uetake, Yutaka Aoyama, Eriko Hirata, Haruo Satou', null, 'Virtual reality. Murder. Werewolves. And teen girls! In a future where nothing is as it seems, can old legends come true? In the near future, humans will communicate almost exclusively through monitors, making real interaction a rarefied and weak occurrence for those living in a near totalitarian society. In this new world of communication, children are only allowed to interact personally on school grounds. So when a serial killer starts slaughtering junior high children the communication routes go under further surveillance. And despite all the safeguards put in place to avoid physical interaction, the killer''s latest victim turns out to have been in contact with three young girls: Tsuzki Mio, a certified prodigy; Matsuno Hatsuki, a quiet but opinionated classmate; and Kouno Ayumi, her best friend. And as the girls get caught up in trying to quell curiosity under such terrorist scrutiny, Hatsuki learns that there is much more than meets the eye of their monitored communications.', 'Virtual reality. Murder. Werewolves. And teen girls! In a future where nothing is as it seems, can old legends come true? In the near future, humans will communicate almost exclusively through monitors, making real interaction a rarefied and weak occurrence for those living in a near totalitarian society. In this new world of communication, children are only allowed to interact personally on school grounds. So when a serial killer starts slaughtering junior high children the communication routes go under further surveillance. And despite all the safeguards put in place to avoid physical interaction, the killer''s latest victim turns out to have been in contact with three young girls: Tsuzki Mio, a certified prodigy; Matsuno Hatsuki, a quiet but opinionated classmate; and Kouno Ayumi, her best friend. And as the girls get caught up in trying to quell curiosity under such terrorist scrutiny, Hatsuki learns that there is much more than meets the eye of their monitored communications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KSWUx4HNxfT2Klyl8lUpm1AVl7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56362'),
  ('906574230885183909', 'Lourdes', 2009, 'Drama', 'Jessica Hausner, Martin Gschlacht', 'Jessica Hausner', 'Sylvie Testud, Léa Seydoux, Elina Löwensohn, Bruno Todeschini, Gilette Barbier, Gerhard Liebmann, Linde Prelog, Heidi Baratta', 'NR', 'In order to escape her isolation, wheelchair-bound Christine makes a life changing journey to Lourdes, the iconic site of pilgrimage in the Pyrenees Mountains.', 'In order to escape her isolation, wheelchair-bound Christine makes a life changing journey to Lourdes, the iconic site of pilgrimage in the Pyrenees Mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HhppIyMPutZyOFTdFVdXdwCXde.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41123'),
  ('570524045959795665', 'Lourdes', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Thierry Demaizière, Alban Teurlai, Alban Teurlai', null, null, 'NR', 'LOURDES, a small village where the Virgin Mary appeared to a young girl about 150 years ago. Still today LOURDES is more alive than ever. And Our Lady remains active and attentive to each of her children. About 6 million people visit it every year. After the pandemic, her devotion is increasing. The multitudinous processions of people seeking a miracle feed a small army of caregivers (nurses, volunteers, hospitalists) who accompany them. These pilgrims are an amazing display of humanity: accident victims, the terminally ill, an overweight teenager being bullied at school, a group of prostitutes and trans people from Paris, etc. LOURDES is an insightful meditation on the human capacity for empathy and hope, and especially a journey into the mystery of religious faith in the face of life''s profound tribulations.', 'LOURDES, a small village where the Virgin Mary appeared to a young girl about 150 years ago. Still today LOURDES is more alive than ever. And Our Lady remains active and attentive to each of her children. About 6 million people visit it every year. After the pandemic, her devotion is increasing. The multitudinous processions of people seeking a miracle feed a small army of caregivers (nurses, volunteers, hospitalists) who accompany them. These pilgrims are an amazing display of humanity: accident victims, the terminally ill, an overweight teenager being bullied at school, a group of prostitutes and trans people from Paris, etc. LOURDES is an insightful meditation on the human capacity for empathy and hope, and especially a journey into the mystery of religious faith in the face of life''s profound tribulations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQPwpdAaL51nt7h1fTPJ8OoMFuA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589939'),
