  ('200955791597495246', 'Love', 1971, 'Drama', 'Károly Makk, János Tóth, János Ujhelyi', 'Péter Bacsó', 'Mari Törőcsik, Lili Darvas, Iván Darvas, Erzsi Orsolya, László Mensáros, Tibor Bitskey, András Ambrus, József Almási', null, 'Luca, who regularly visits her bedridden mother-in-law, hides from her the fact that János, his son, has been arrested on a trumped up political charge.', 'Luca, who regularly visits her bedridden mother-in-law, hides from her the fact that János, his son, has been arrested on a trumped up political charge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjTpEIC3BBrE61hNFluExkjH7Nf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42516'),
  ('17777095973457396', 'Love', 1982, 'Drama', 'Nancy Dowd, Mai Zetterling, Annette Cohen', 'Mai Zetterling, Liv Ullmann, Nancy Dowd', 'Maureen Fitzgerald, Gordon Thomson, Joni Mitchell, Winston Rekert, Dixie Seatle, Benjamin Gordon, Bob Dermer, Margaret Dragu', null, 'A unique anthology of six short vignettes on the subject of love, all of them written, directed and produced by women.', 'A unique anthology of six short vignettes on the subject of love, all of them written, directed and produced by women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Rl69IGFFroA5Bs3raSR7N8nqI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488659'),
  ('125318410699572598', 'Love', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Valery Todorovsky, Gleb Kravetsky, Ilya Dyomin', 'Valery Todorovsky', 'Evgeny Mironov, Natalya Petrova, Dmitriy Maryanov, Tatyana Skorokhodova, Natalya Vilkina, Inna Slobodskaya, Vija Artmane, Lev Durov', null, 'Two Moscow students are mostly concerned with scoring with women but their lives change radically when one of them falls for a Jewish girl whose family is being persecuted by anonymous anti-Semites and is preparing to emigrate to Israel.', 'Two Moscow students are mostly concerned with scoring with women but their lives change radically when one of them falls for a Jewish girl whose family is being persecuted by anonymous anti-Semites and is preparing to emigrate to Israel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vzm1NfMC26vv596Fjn36LV53qt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83549'),
  ('512152217703933071', 'Love', 2011, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'William Eubank, William Eubank', 'William Eubank', 'Gunner Wright, Wesley Sellick, Corey Richardson, Bradley Horne, Nancy Stelle, Roger E. Fanter, Jesse Hotchkiss, Troy Mittleider', 'NR', 'After losing contact with Earth, Astronaut Lee Miller becomes stranded in orbit alone aboard the International Space Station. As time passes and life support systems dwindle, Lee battles to maintain his sanity - and simply stay alive. His world is a claustrophobic and lonely existence, until he makes a strange discovery aboard the ship.', 'After losing contact with Earth, Astronaut Lee Miller becomes stranded in orbit alone aboard the International Space Station. As time passes and life support systems dwindle, Lee battles to maintain his sanity - and simply stay alive. His world is a claustrophobic and lonely existence, until he makes a strange discovery aboard the ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghKqC61MuwJIY8Wh61258fxpcRV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54320'),
  ('545568746450532318', 'Love', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Doze Niu Cheng-Tse, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', null, 'Shu Qi, Mark Chao You-Ting, Vicky Zhao, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Ivy Chen, Ethan Juan, Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Doze Niu Cheng-Tse', null, 'Eight people try to end their loneliness by searching for that one person to love, who can make their life complete.', 'Eight people try to end their loneliness by searching for that one person to love, who can make their life complete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDvYtfQYCw0BEVCzrd7yfOaLM4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95919'),
  ('1125614044639140269', 'Love', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Igor Tverdokhlebov, Mark Ziselson', 'Yakov Sivchenko, Sergey Svetlakov, Said Davdiev', 'Sergey Svetlakov, Timur Batrutdinov, Yan Tsapnik, Kamil Larin, Anatoliy Belyy, Mariya Mironova, Kseniya Sobchak, Elena Valyushkina', null, 'Love Hotel. The best place to spend your holiday on February 14th. So this time the doors of the hotel are open for everyone who wants to make Valentine''s Day special, wants to believe in love again, or at least not be alone on this day. Former classmates meet at a restaurant in honor of the 40th anniversary of graduation and old feelings flare up with renewed vigor. A jealous man tries to enter all the rooms on the floor to find his missing wife. A private detective and his attractive client arrange a spy show with wiretaps to bring out the scoundrel husband. An immigrant maid from Uzbekistan chooses between love for her young boy and money from his mother, given for her immediate flight home. And the life of a humble student who dreams of becoming a man in just one hour will never be the same after meeting the most talkative night butterfly in the city ...', 'Love Hotel. The best place to spend your holiday on February 14th. So this time the doors of the hotel are open for everyone who wants to make Valentine''s Day special, wants to believe in love again, or at least not be alone on this day. Former classmates meet at a restaurant in honor of the 40th anniversary of graduation and old feelings flare up with renewed vigor. A jealous man tries to enter all the rooms on the floor to find his missing wife. A private detective and his attractive client arrange a spy show with wiretaps to bring out the scoundrel husband. An immigrant maid from Uzbekistan chooses between love for her young boy and money from his mother, given for her immediate flight home. And the life of a humble student who dreams of becoming a man in just one hour will never be the same after meeting the most talkative night butterfly in the city ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hS2eFigVGchssBaRlbt4hkRs09e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768702'),
  ('1002117749051339299', 'Love', 2024, 'Animation', 'İlhami Tunç Gencer', 'İlhami Tunç Gencer', null, null, 'A strange wire-fingered homunculus navigates through his dreams of different faces and faces, traversing a subliminal and endless variety. They are all different faces, but all have huge eyes that are questioned as to what keeps them apart, perhaps left broken by an impossible love.', 'A strange wire-fingered homunculus navigates through his dreams of different faces and faces, traversing a subliminal and endless variety. They are all different faces, but all have huge eyes that are questioned as to what keeps them apart, perhaps left broken by an impossible love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tlee9BAuFgm8O1MdzEC6FEorvO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1316954'),
  ('1106529682135175230', 'Love ''Em and Weep', 1927, 'Comedy', 'Fred Guiol, Floyd Jackman', 'Fred Guiol, Stan Laurel, Hal Roach', 'Mae Busch, Stan Laurel, James Finlayson, Oliver Hardy, Charlotte Mineau, Vivien Oakland, Ed Brandenburg, Clara Guiol', null, 'Titus Tillsbury is a successful businessman who is visited by a blackmailing old flame. He enlists a friend to keep her away from his home and wife.', 'Titus Tillsbury is a successful businessman who is visited by a blackmailing old flame. He enlists a friend to keep her away from his home and wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0mvUBij3Ps6NXX8evKSOZpM3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50930'),
  ('1008964348080064772', 'Love & Basketball', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Gina Prince-Bythewood, Reynaldo Villalobos', 'Gina Prince-Bythewood', 'Sanaa Lathan, Omar Epps, Chris Warren, Kyla Pratt, Alfre Woodard, Regina Hall, Glenndon Chatman, Jess Willard', 'PG-13', 'Monica Wright and Quincy McCall grew up in the same neighborhood and have known each other since childhood. As they grow into adulthood, they fall in love, but they also share another all-consuming passion: basketball. As Quincy and Monica struggle to make their relationship work, they follow separate career paths though high school and college basketball and, they hope, into stardom in big-league professional ball.', 'Monica Wright and Quincy McCall grew up in the same neighborhood and have known each other since childhood. As they grow into adulthood, they fall in love, but they also share another all-consuming passion: basketball. As Quincy and Monica struggle to make their relationship work, they follow separate career paths though high school and college basketball and, they hope, into stardom in big-league professional ball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNZWNX19FZ5QyedprVM0ldsXFiP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14736'),
  ('920966686029716878', 'Love & Friendship', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Whit Stillman, Richard Van Oosterhout, Julien Benoiton', 'Whit Stillman', 'Kate Beckinsale, Xavier Samuel, Morfydd Clark, Emma Greenwell, Tom Bennett, James Fleet, Jemma Redgrave, Justin Edwards', 'PG-13', 'From Jane Austen’s novella, the beautiful and cunning Lady Susan Vernon visits the estate of her in-laws to wait out colorful rumors of her dalliances and to find husbands for herself and her daughter. Two young men, handsome Reginald DeCourcy and wealthy Sir James Martin, severely complicate her plans.', 'From Jane Austen’s novella, the beautiful and cunning Lady Susan Vernon visits the estate of her in-laws to wait out colorful rumors of her dalliances and to find husbands for herself and her daughter. Two young men, handsome Reginald DeCourcy and wealthy Sir James Martin, severely complicate her plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptpdUQiRjeHgE1dmpCd38N64ENV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296360'),
  ('718620448919773307', 'Love & Gelato', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Alessandro Paris, Brandon Camp, Giulio Cupperi', 'Brandon Camp', 'Susanna Skaggs, Tobia De Angelis, Owen McDonnell, Valentina Lodovini, Saul Nanni, Anjelika Washington, Alex Boniello, Luca Seta', 'PG-13', 'Lina is about to graduate high school and has her sights set on her future at MIT. But when her mom gets sick, she encourages Lina to follow in her footsteps and have “the summer of a lifetime” in Rome. Using her mom’s old diary as a guide, she explores the romantic and magical city, where she just might find love... and gelato, of course.', 'Lina is about to graduate high school and has her sights set on her future at MIT. But when her mom gets sick, she encourages Lina to follow in her footsteps and have “the summer of a lifetime” in Rome. Using her mom’s old diary as a guide, she explores the romantic and magical city, where she just might find love... and gelato, of course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbGBTH3bWaiJpjCOJ9RSoQ9NPRT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:968438'),
  ('1062461869791859776', 'Love & Human Remains', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Denys Arcand, Paul Sarossy', 'Brad Fraser', 'Thomas Gibson, Ruth Marshall, Cameron Bancroft, Mia Kirshner, Joanne Vannicola, Matthew Ferguson, Rick Roberts, Aidan Devine', 'R', 'In a Canadian metropolis, failed actor David shares a place with the bookish Candy, whom he dated before coming out as gay. While David, who now waits tables, pursues an aimless romance with a younger coworker, Candy dabbles in both same-sex and heterosexual affairs. As David and Candy''s odd assortment of friends — including a telepathic sex worker and an ill-tempered yuppie — pass in and out of their beds, a serial murder stalks the city''s women.', 'In a Canadian metropolis, failed actor David shares a place with the bookish Candy, whom he dated before coming out as gay. While David, who now waits tables, pursues an aimless romance with a younger coworker, Candy dabbles in both same-sex and heterosexual affairs. As David and Candy''s odd assortment of friends — including a telepathic sex worker and an ill-tempered yuppie — pass in and out of their beds, a serial murder stalks the city''s women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QVw6cPXfsjr4PncE1TeWudeLmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15730'),
  ('52180279401547978', 'Love & Irony', 2026, 'Comedy', 'John Biesack', 'John Biesack', 'Christine Donlon, Pat Reidy, Adam Peacock', null, 'On his quest to live an "authentic" life, an existential bike mechanic encounters a beguiling photojournalist, who ironically leads him to question the real meaning of life, love and being your true self.', 'On his quest to live an "authentic" life, an existential bike mechanic encounters a beguiling photojournalist, who ironically leads him to question the real meaning of life, love and being your true self.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F7%2Fgracenote%2F77f9b559965cc03d25424e286071f626.jpg', 'plex:movie:love-and-irony'),
  ('1035968516672823493', 'Love & Mercy', 2015, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Bill Pohlad, Robert D. Yeoman, Thomas Patrick Smith', 'Michael A. Lerner', 'Paul Dano, John Cusack, Elizabeth Banks, Paul Giamatti, Jake Abel, Kenny Wormald, Brett Davern, Graham Rogers', 'PG-13', 'In the late 1960s, the Beach Boys'' Brian Wilson stops touring, produces "Pet Sounds" and begins to lose his grip on reality. By the 1980s, under the sway of a controlling therapist, he finds a savior in Melinda Ledbetter.', 'In the late 1960s, the Beach Boys'' Brian Wilson stops touring, produces "Pet Sounds" and begins to lose his grip on reality. By the 1980s, under the sway of a controlling therapist, he finds a savior in Melinda Ledbetter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jn0hDsl6lsv4qEc7aiLlgbaIjo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271714'),
  ('79572928581265267', 'Love & Money', 1981, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Toback, Fred Schuler', 'James Toback', 'Ray Sharkey, Ornella Muti, Klaus Kinski, Armand Assante, King Vidor, Susan Heldfond, William Prince, Tony Sirico', 'R', 'An investment planner, bored with his job and his girlfriend, is given the opportunity to help open a new firm in South America. Once in the new country, he finds himself dealing with dictators and revolutionaries during a time of intense political upheaval, and to complicate his life further, he begins an affair with his new employer''s wife.', 'An investment planner, bored with his job and his girlfriend, is given the opportunity to help open a new firm in South America. Once in the new country, he finds himself dealing with dictators and revolutionaries during a time of intense political upheaval, and to complicate his life further, he begins an affair with his new employer''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vM2z2e8FwuYw8yPf8V86vxAuqj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66183'),
  ('712403103261362948', 'Love & Other Drugs', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Edward Zwick, Francesco Tignini, Darin Rivetti', 'Charles Randolph, Edward Zwick, Marshall Herskovitz', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Anne Hathaway, Oliver Platt, Hank Azaria, Josh Gad, Gabriel Macht, Judy Greer, Jill Clayburgh', 'R', 'Maggie is an alluring free spirit who won''t let anyone – or anything – tie her down. But she meets her match in Jamie, whose relentless and nearly infallible charm serves him well with the ladies and the cutthroat world of pharmaceutical sales. Maggie and Jamie''s evolving relationship takes them both by surprise, as they find themselves under the influence of the ultimate drug: love.', 'Maggie is an alluring free spirit who won''t let anyone – or anything – tie her down. But she meets her match in Jamie, whose relentless and nearly infallible charm serves him well with the ladies and the cutthroat world of pharmaceutical sales. Maggie and Jamie''s evolving relationship takes them both by surprise, as they find themselves under the influence of the ultimate drug: love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZLM2uKJRYNchLmiCIjosX0rXy8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43347'),
  ('466014112043917375', 'Love & Passion', 1987, 'Drama', 'Tinto Brass, Silvano Ippoliti, Emanuela Lucidi', 'Tinto Brass', 'Nicola Warren, Francesca Dellera, Andy J. Forest, Luigi Laezza, Vittorio Caprioli, Isabella Biagini, Venantino Venantini, Sherry Buchanan', null, 'After the renewed flings with their former lovers prove to be disastrously unlike the romantic memories, an unfaithful couple returns to each other.', 'After the renewed flings with their former lovers prove to be disastrously unlike the romantic memories, an unfaithful couple returns to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jmE1e9sGIgNhFcs0u6RG78lR56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50268'),
  ('338208709464510067', 'Love & Peace', 2015, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Drama', 'Sion Sono, Shinya Kimura', 'Sion Sono', 'Hiroki Hasegawa, Kumiko Aso, Toshiyuki Nishida, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Makita Sports, Motoki Fukami, Toru Tezuka, Eita Okuno', null, 'A man, who once dreamed of becoming a punk rocker, is working as a low salaryman at a musical instrument parts company. He''s secretly in love with his colleague. One day, he finds a little turtle on the rooftop, naming it Pikadon.', 'A man, who once dreamed of becoming a punk rocker, is working as a low salaryman at a musical instrument parts company. He''s secretly in love with his colleague. One day, he finds a little turtle on the rooftop, naming it Pikadon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psc3LUO03rt01JA8knBwTJdrOwa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336776'),
  ('536180435852282433', 'Love & Pop', 1998, 'Drama', 'Hideaki Anno, Shinkichi Mitsumune, Tsuyoshi Sugino', 'Akio Satsukawa, Hideaki Anno', 'Asumi Miwa, Kirari, Hirono Kudo, Yukie Nakama, Mitsuru Hirata, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Moro Morooka, Toru Tezuka', 'NR', 'Tokyo schoolgirl Hiromi and her friends engage in a practice known as enjo kosai, or "compensated dating", where older men pay young girls for dates. Hiromi plunges deeper into this world to raise money for an expensive ring.', 'Tokyo schoolgirl Hiromi and her friends engage in a practice known as enjo kosai, or "compensated dating", where older men pay young girls for dates. Hiromi plunges deeper into this world to raise money for an expensive ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5TMd9ldthwyMAd6HDcrJcZIIDx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70846'),
  ('643939344891884288', 'Love & Revolution', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alejandro Marín', 'Alejandro Marín, Carmen Garrido Vacas', 'Ana Wagener, Omar Banana, Alba Flores, Alex de la Croix, Lola Buzón, La Dani, Carmen Orellana, Jesús Carroza', null, 'Seville, 1977. At a time when homosexuality is a crime, Reme, a traditional mother moved by the love of her son, an adolescent aspiring artist, will become involved in the Andalusian LGBTQ+ movement, paradoxically born in the bosom of the Church.', 'Seville, 1977. At a time when homosexuality is a crime, Reme, a traditional mother moved by the love of her son, an adolescent aspiring artist, will become involved in the Andalusian LGBTQ+ movement, paradoxically born in the bosom of the Church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnqYFlavB1RXCO9ACeoXnTbgbLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1045862'),
  ('490725085818393025', 'Love & Sex', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Valerie Breiman, Adam Kane', 'Valerie Breiman', 'Famke Janssen, Jon Favreau, Noah Emmerich, Ann Magnuson, Cheri Oteri, Josh Hopkins, Robert Knepper, Will Rothhaar', 'R', 'When her rather explicit copy is rejected, magazine journalist Kate is asked by her editor to come up with an article on loving relationships instead, and to do so by the end of the day. This gets Kate thinking back over her own various experiences, and to wondering if she is in much of a position to write on the subject.', 'When her rather explicit copy is rejected, magazine journalist Kate is asked by her editor to come up with an article on loving relationships instead, and to do so by the end of the day. This gets Kate thinking back over her own various experiences, and to wondering if she is in much of a position to write on the subject.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4pnZxarc6VbkSv19Rfoio4yNmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25128'),
  ('99399749730483537', 'Love & Sex (Sappho 1963)', 1964, 'Drama, Romance', 'Luis Alcoriza', 'Fernando Galiana, Julio Porter', 'María Félix, Julio Alemán, Augusto Benedico, José Gálvez, Fernando Luján, Rogelio Guerra, Dolores Camarillo, Julio Aldama', null, 'Independently-wealthy woman tries to break free of repressive, conservative cultural constraints.', 'Independently-wealthy woman tries to break free of repressive, conservative cultural constraints.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xr3XFZoNGOCXkGBVVhFHUOci8v9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367712'),
  ('250287375295354488', 'Love & Slaps', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Castellitto, Gian Filippo Corticelli, Federica Ciciarelli', 'Margaret Mazzantini', 'Sergio Castellitto, Laura Morante, Enzo Jannacci, Marco Giallini, Barbora Bobuľová, Gianfelice Imparato, Nina Torresi, Emanuela Grimalda', null, 'A comedy about generational conflict between two parents who do not want to grow old and a seventeen year old daughter who wants to become an adult. During a weekend with some friends in their country house in Tuscany, Marcello and Marina, relieved that the love affair of their teenage daughter Rose with another boy, Luke, is over, prepare to meet their daughter''s new boyfriend. The problem is that the two adults, who still feel pretty young, do not know what to expect, and what they are about to discover will leave them speechless ...', 'A comedy about generational conflict between two parents who do not want to grow old and a seventeen year old daughter who wants to become an adult. During a weekend with some friends in their country house in Tuscany, Marcello and Marina, relieved that the love affair of their teenage daughter Rose with another boy, Luke, is over, prepare to meet their daughter''s new boyfriend. The problem is that the two adults, who still feel pretty young, do not know what to expect, and what they are about to discover will leave them speechless ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekgVsOpuLneBOzQoYpaQpD9VEAF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58204'),
  ('532664281097978221', 'Love 65', 1965, 'Drama', 'Bo Widerberg, Bruno Rådström, Jan Lindeström', 'Bo Widerberg', 'Keve Hjelm, Ann-Marie Gyllenspetz, Inger Taube, Evabritt Strandberg, Ben Carruthers, Björn Gustafson, Kent Andersson, Thommy Berggren', null, 'A filmmaker has problems coping with his wife and marriage, with his daughter being their only connecting link. Seeking a meaningful connection and intimacy elsewhere, a married woman becomes his short-term partner.', 'A filmmaker has problems coping with his wife and marriage, with his daughter being their only connecting link. Seeking a meaningful connection and intimacy elsewhere, a married woman becomes his short-term partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35JrTa64kT34zjEdfOzaq8nM2pe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46994'),
