  ('49202561487913104', 'Love Addict', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Bellocq, Thierry Arbogast', 'Frank Bellocq', 'Kev Adams, Mélanie Bernier, Marc Lavoine, Michael Madsen, Sveva Alviti, Claude Perron, Stéphane Debac, Maxime Gasteuil', null, 'Gabriel can''t resist a beautiful woman. But his womanizing attitude is taking a toll on his career and social life. He decides to hire a life coach to help him.', 'Gabriel can''t resist a beautiful woman. But his womanizing attitude is taking a toll on his career and social life. He decides to hire a life coach to help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Fqa4rMCqY39YgKNxrGdOvkobUY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462148'),
  ('160293004327028182', 'Love Affair', 1939, 'Drama, Romance', 'Leo McCarey, James H. Anderson, Rudolph Maté', 'Delmer Daves, Donald Ogden Stewart', 'Irene Dunne, Charles Boyer, Maria Ouspenskaya, Lee Bowman, Astrid Allwyn, Maurice Moscovitch, Mary Bayless, Scotty Beckett', 'NR', 'A French playboy and an American former nightclub singer fall in love aboard a ship. They arrange to reunite six months later, if neither has changed their mind.', 'A French playboy and an American former nightclub singer fall in love aboard a ship. They arrange to reunite six months later, if neither has changed their mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bKxlYgwKRQidS8S9DSPjpITPlv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43739'),
  ('835181463890127833', 'Love Affair', 1994, 'Drama, Romance', 'Glenn Gordon Caron, Conrad Hall, James Simons', 'Leo McCarey, Delmer Daves, Donald Ogden Stewart', 'Warren Beatty, Annette Bening, Katharine Hepburn, Garry Shandling, Chloe Webb, Pierce Brosnan, Kate Capshaw, Paul Mazursky', null, 'Ex-football star Mike Gambril meets Terry McKay on a flight to Sydney, which is forced to land on a small atoll. They become romantic on board a ship sent to take them to a larger island. They agree to meet in New York three months later to see if the attraction is real. One shows up but the other doesn''t. However, a chance meeting brings them together again.', 'Ex-football star Mike Gambril meets Terry McKay on a flight to Sydney, which is forced to land on a small atoll. They become romantic on board a ship sent to take them to a larger island. They agree to meet in New York three months later to see if the attraction is real. One shows up but the other doesn''t. However, a chance meeting brings them together again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPEh48HZN9qqewkF2Hsi9BD6oz7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43742'),
  ('132344475671453671', 'Love Affair', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kim Jung-hwan', 'Kim Jung-hwan', 'Han Se-Ah, Jeon Ju-ho, Jung Wook, Ryu Sung-hyun, 손인아, Jo Hye-in, Cho Yoon-ji, Jo Eun-seo', null, 'Ga-hee appeared in front of Seong-min who was bored running a book store after retiring. Ga-hee runs a ballet school and wasn"t on very good terms with her husband, which led to her and Seong-min falling madly in love together. They know they shouldn"t be together, but that"s what makes everything even better. Later on, their love reaches the point of destruction...', 'Ga-hee appeared in front of Seong-min who was bored running a book store after retiring. Ga-hee runs a ballet school and wasn"t on very good terms with her husband, which led to her and Seong-min falling madly in love together. They know they shouldn"t be together, but that"s what makes everything even better. Later on, their love reaches the point of destruction...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nGRaQV5MoVs2AGUP3qyf3BXuuz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302945'),
  ('69985391497858191', 'Love Affair, or the Case of the Missing Switchboard Operator', 1967, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dušan Makavejev, Aleksandar Petković', 'Dušan Makavejev, Branko Vučićević', 'Eva Ras, Slobodan Aligrudić, Ružica Sokić, Miodrag Andrić, Aleksandar Kostić, Živojin Aleksić, Dragan Obradović, Rade Ljubisavljević', null, 'After many adventures, a young female switchboard operator starts a love relationship with a serious young man. But while he''s away on business, she gets lonely and succumbs to her colleague''s passes.', 'After many adventures, a young female switchboard operator starts a love relationship with a serious young man. But while he''s away on business, she gets lonely and succumbs to her colleague''s passes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMt9UFVIiTfX5PIZNHzA5uE1uKw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42696'),
  ('841704775698651055', 'Love Affair(s)', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emmanuel Mouret, Laurent Desmet, Juliette Maillard', 'Emmanuel Mouret', 'Camélia Jordana, Niels Schneider, Vincent Macaigne, Émilie Dequenne, Jenna Thiam, Guillaume Gouix, Julia Piaton, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing', null, 'Vacations in the French countryside. Daphne, three months pregnant, finds herself alone to welcome Maxime, her boyfriend François’ cousin. François had to leave in a hurry for Paris to cover for a sick colleague. For four days, while waiting for his return, Daphne and Maxime get to know each other and share very intimate stories that bring them closer...', 'Vacations in the French countryside. Daphne, three months pregnant, finds herself alone to welcome Maxime, her boyfriend François’ cousin. François had to leave in a hurry for Paris to cover for a sick colleague. For four days, while waiting for his return, Daphne and Maxime get to know each other and share very intimate stories that bring them closer...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LenuIIbbOFzl0fTs0PjP8i3xvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661935'),
  ('925472666835093675', 'Love After Death', 1968, 'Horror', 'Glauco del Mar, Peter Palian', 'Antonio Velázquez', 'Guillermo De Córdova, Roberto Maurano, Carmin O''Neal, Ángelo Ramírez, Gloris García, Yolanda Signorelli, Cherie Winters, Jennifer Welles', null, 'During a cataleptic fit, Montel is buried alive, a burial plotted by his greedy wife Sofia with several men, including her lover, Montel''s doctor. Exiting his grave, Montel goes on a sexual rampage.', 'During a cataleptic fit, Montel is buried alive, a burial plotted by his greedy wife Sofia with several men, including her lover, Montel''s doctor. Exiting his grave, Montel goes on a sexual rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/568Z4rZnyvPto3R8ZrOa6xJG71H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27407'),
  ('353888358056174538', 'Love After Love', 1992, 'Romance, Drama', 'Diane Kurys, Fabio Conversi', 'Diane Kurys, Antoine Lacomblez', 'Isabelle Huppert, Bernard Giraudeau, Hippolyte Girardot, Lio, Yvan Attal, Judith Reval, Ingrid Held, Laure Killing', null, 'Lola is an independent woman, a professional writer with 2 men on a string. Both men are married with children. When the men, and Lola, face having to make choices, Lola''s comfortable life becomes less appealing.', 'Lola is an independent woman, a professional writer with 2 men on a string. Both men are married with children. When the men, and Lola, face having to make choices, Lola''s comfortable life becomes less appealing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozePS1wvbIHfaOALPJsaSOIWKi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171213'),
  ('383774798338319018', 'Love After Love', 2021, 'Drama', 'Ann Hui, Christopher Doyle', 'Anyi Wang', 'Ma Sichun, Yu Feihong, Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Janine Chang Chun-Ning, Fan Wei, Isabella Leong Lok-Sze, Karlina Zhang, Yin Fang', null, 'The film tells the story of a young girl who travels from Shanghai to Hong Kong in pursuit of education, but ends up working for her aunt seducing rich and powerful men.', 'The film tells the story of a young girl who travels from Shanghai to Hong Kong in pursuit of education, but ends up working for her aunt seducing rich and powerful men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMeg2foOwZVB67J7SA6vF291uZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660002'),
  ('852902562665026182', 'Love Again', 2023, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Andrew Dunn, Astrid Sieben, Mark Cockren', 'Karoline Herfurth', 'Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Sam Heughan, Céline Dion, Sofia Barclay, Russell Tovey, Lydia West, Steve Oram, Omid Djalili', 'PG-13', 'Mira Ray, dealing with the loss of her fiancé, John, sends a series of romantic texts to his old cell phone number… not realizing the number was reassigned to Rob Burns'' new work phone. Rob, a journalist, is captivated by the honesty in the beautifully confessional texts. When he’s assigned to write a profile of megastar Céline Dion, he enlists her help in figuring out how to meet Mira in person and win her heart.', 'Mira Ray, dealing with the loss of her fiancé, John, sends a series of romantic texts to his old cell phone number… not realizing the number was reassigned to Rob Burns'' new work phone. Rob, a journalist, is captivated by the honesty in the beautifully confessional texts. When he’s assigned to write a profile of megastar Céline Dion, he enlists her help in figuring out how to meet Mira in person and win her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koswMk0y7jGcyofV1sBccnNtY0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758336'),
  ('422839888234813158', 'Love All Over Your Face', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gerald B. Fillmore, Nicola Raggi', 'Gerald B. Fillmore, Gerald B. Fillmore', 'Gerald B. Fillmore, Vanessa Benavente, Tito Valverde, William Miller, Mela Green, Carlos Santos, Beau Bowker, Laura Patalano', null, 'Dani, a Spaniard with an English mother, and Ana, an American woman with Mexican parents, are friends with benefits. Dani travels to Spain, but cannot return to the USA, so he has to communicate through video calls.', 'Dani, a Spaniard with an English mother, and Ana, an American woman with Mexican parents, are friends with benefits. Dani travels to Spain, but cannot return to the USA, so he has to communicate through video calls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cRSlgUeXJcQZAMRbOQAsf8xfpP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1285801'),
  ('724336863058048709', 'Love Always, Santa', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Akis Konstantakopoulos, Brian Herzlinger', 'Jay Black, Brian Herzlinger', 'Marguerite Moreau, Mike Faiola, Brady Smith, Robert Jason Black, Isadora Swann, Meghan Duffy', null, 'After losing her husband Bradley three years ago on Christmas Day, Celia Banks never thought she’d fall in love again. Now, her entire world revolves around taking care of her daughter, Lilly. Lilly writes a letter to Santa with one wish – for her mommy to be happy and find love again.', 'After losing her husband Bradley three years ago on Christmas Day, Celia Banks never thought she’d fall in love again. Now, her entire world revolves around taking care of her daughter, Lilly. Lilly writes a letter to Santa with one wish – for her mommy to be happy and find love again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RXu0jaDXzxzqjtVDYLW5BbGuiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421629'),
  ('75092331693795433', 'Love Among the Ruins', 1976, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie, Comedy', 'George Cukor, Brian Ackland-Snow, Colin M. Brewer', 'James Costigan', 'Katharine Hepburn, Laurence Olivier, Richard Pearson, Colin Blakely, Joan Sims, Leigh Lawson, Gwen Nelson, Robert Harris', null, 'An aging actress and socialite, Jessica Medlicott has ended her engagement with a younger man and is now being sued by her former fiancé. Esteemed barrister Sir Arthur Glanville-Jones is assigned to represent Jessica in the lawsuit, and he also happens to be an old suitor of hers from decades earlier. While Jessica claims not to remember him, and Arthur still smarts from her earlier rejection, the two form a close bond during the case.', 'An aging actress and socialite, Jessica Medlicott has ended her engagement with a younger man and is now being sued by her former fiancé. Esteemed barrister Sir Arthur Glanville-Jones is assigned to represent Jessica in the lawsuit, and he also happens to be an old suitor of hers from decades earlier. While Jessica claims not to remember him, and Arthur still smarts from her earlier rejection, the two form a close bond during the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8aVb0GgTFYse3A8NwT75rLW4kzO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115507'),
  ('693409135493867428', 'Love and a .45', 1994, 'Crime, Thriller', 'C.M. Talkington, Tom Richmond', 'C.M. Talkington', 'Gil Bellows, Renée Zellweger, Rory Cochrane, Jeffrey Combs, Jace Alexander, Peter Fonda, Ann Wedgeworth, Jack Nance', 'R', 'Small-time criminal Watty Watts attempts to rob a convenience store with his drug-addict buddy, Billy Mack Black. The robbery, however, leads to murder, and soon Watty leaves Billy behind and goes on the run with his beloved girlfriend, Starlene. Heading toward Mexico, the fugitive couple gets plenty of media coverage, until there are even more people on their trail. Can Watty and Starlene make it south of the border without getting caught?', 'Small-time criminal Watty Watts attempts to rob a convenience store with his drug-addict buddy, Billy Mack Black. The robbery, however, leads to murder, and soon Watty leaves Billy behind and goes on the run with his beloved girlfriend, Starlene. Heading toward Mexico, the fugitive couple gets plenty of media coverage, until there are even more people on their trail. Can Watty and Starlene make it south of the border without getting caught?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xz7rXuL1lkc6tkt1rS0N05rxtRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15477'),
  ('296663868157458497', 'Love and Anarchy', 1973, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Lina Wertmüller, Donatella Luttazzi, Alain Katz', 'Lina Wertmüller', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Mariangela Melato, Lina Polito, Eros Pagni, Pina Cei, Elena Fiore, Giuliana Calandra, Isa Bellini', null, 'Set in Fascist Italy before the outbreak of World War II, the story centers on Tunin, a farmer turned anarchist who stays in a brothel while preparing to kill Benito Mussolini.', 'Set in Fascist Italy before the outbreak of World War II, the story centers on Tunin, a farmer turned anarchist who stays in a brothel while preparing to kill Benito Mussolini.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zetWdE3pHy06T4QYF9k8KZH5sft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65332'),
  ('966449269527399843', 'Love and Anger', 1969, 'Drama', 'Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Ugo Piccone, Alain Levent', 'Bernardo Bertolucci, Carlo Lizzani, Marco Bellocchio', 'Tom Baker, Julian Beck, Jim Anderson, Judith Malina, Giulio Cesare Castello, Adriano Aprà, Fernaldo Di Giammatteo, Petra Vogt', null, 'Five short stories with contemporary settings. In New York, people are indifferent to derelicts sleeping on sidewalks, to a woman''s assault in front of an apartment building, and to a couple injured in a car crash. A man, stripped of his identity, dies in bed with actors expressing his agony. A cheerful, innocent young man walking a city street in a time of war pays a price for this innocence. A couple talks about cinema while it watches another couple talk of love and truth on the eve of one character''s return to Cuba. Striking students take over a university classroom; an argument follows about revolution or incremental change.', 'Five short stories with contemporary settings. In New York, people are indifferent to derelicts sleeping on sidewalks, to a woman''s assault in front of an apartment building, and to a couple injured in a car crash. A man, stripped of his identity, dies in bed with actors expressing his agony. A cheerful, innocent young man walking a city street in a time of war pays a price for this innocence. A couple talks about cinema while it watches another couple talk of love and truth on the eve of one character''s return to Cuba. Striking students take over a university classroom; an argument follows about revolution or incremental change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Zjd6dwTpmIyg0rLZ3zCBzbpYpr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49456'),
  ('457028724496516653', 'Love and Bruises', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lou Ye, Nelson Yu Lik-wai', 'Liu Jie Falin, Lou Ye', 'Tahar Rahim, Corinne Yam, Jalil Lespert, Vincent Rottiers, Sifan Shao, Patrick Mille, Zhang Songwen, Adèle Ado', null, 'Hua, a woman in her late twenties, goes against her family to become a teacher in Paris. She falls in love with men who physically abuse her. Will she ever find her true love?', 'Hua, a woman in her late twenties, goes against her family to become a teacher in Paris. She falls in love with men who physically abuse her. Will she ever find her true love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFlcn2lTDj6RFJyfglxrwp12iti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94219'),
  ('424293947618818520', 'Love and Bullets', 1979, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Stuart Rosenberg, Fred J. Koenekamp, Anthony B. Richmond', 'John Crowther, John Melson, Wendell Mayes', 'Charles Bronson, Jill Ireland, Rod Steiger, Henry Silva, Strother Martin, Bradford Dillman, Michael V. Gazzo, Paul Koslo', 'PG', 'Jackie Pruit is the girlfriend of notorious gangster Joe Bomposa. When it looks as if Bomposa''s goons are threatening Jackie''s life, the FBI moves in to protect her, hoping that she''ll have incriminating evidence. Veteran agent Charlie Congers is assigned to watch over Jackie, and while it soon becomes apparent that she knows almost nothing about Bomposa that would be of any use to the FBI, he falls in love with her. Bomposa decides it would be more convenient to have Jackie out of the way, ordering her to be executed. Bomposa''s henchmen slip through FBI security and murder her, but now they have to answer the angry and vengeful Congers.', 'Jackie Pruit is the girlfriend of notorious gangster Joe Bomposa. When it looks as if Bomposa''s goons are threatening Jackie''s life, the FBI moves in to protect her, hoping that she''ll have incriminating evidence. Veteran agent Charlie Congers is assigned to watch over Jackie, and while it soon becomes apparent that she knows almost nothing about Bomposa that would be of any use to the FBI, he falls in love with her. Bomposa decides it would be more convenient to have Jackie out of the way, ordering her to be executed. Bomposa''s henchmen slip through FBI security and murder her, but now they have to answer the angry and vengeful Congers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdKxBSl1BEjHTRa8ERLXnZLr8oU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38082'),
  ('1009512003474677084', 'Love and Bullets', 2017, 'Music, Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Michela Fornaci, Francesca Amitrano, Antonio Manetti', 'Antonio Manetti, Marco Manetti, Michelangelo La Neve', 'Giampaolo Morelli, Serena Rossi, Claudia Gerini, Carlo Buccirosso, Raiz, Franco Ricciardi, Antonio Buonomo, Ivan Granatino', null, 'A Mafia boss fakes his own death aiming at a fresh start, but a nurse happens to see him alive and well after the funeral. A hitman is promptly sent to get rid of her, only to find out she''s his first and unforgotten love.', 'A Mafia boss fakes his own death aiming at a fresh start, but a nurse happens to see him alive and well after the funeral. A hitman is promptly sent to get rid of her, only to find out she''s his first and unforgotten love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjgTPRxVWpqHBa1dNRSfaiVDxWp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468302'),
