  ('184128038785270854', 'Love and Crime', 1969, 'Crime, Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Teruo Ishii, Motoya Washio, Tomoomi Yoda', 'Masahiro Kakefuda, Shizuo Nonami, Teruo Ishii', 'Teruo Yoshida, Rika Fujie, Kenjirō Ishiyama, Mitsuko Aoi, Takashi Fujiki, Yukie Kagawa, Sada Abe, Kichijirō Ueda', null, 'A series of short stories about bizarre crimes committed by females in the Meiji, Taisho, and Showa Eras. Discover 4 famous Japanese murderers: Takahashi Oden, the last woman beheaded in Japan, Sada Abe, a crazy lover, Kunihiko Kodaira, a rapist-killer and finally, the Toyokaku case, a woman who did everything to own a hotel.', 'A series of short stories about bizarre crimes committed by females in the Meiji, Taisho, and Showa Eras. Discover 4 famous Japanese murderers: Takahashi Oden, the last woman beheaded in Japan, Sada Abe, a crazy lover, Kunihiko Kodaira, a rapist-killer and finally, the Toyokaku case, a woman who did everything to own a hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wEWJB7wweDjIxsS8GNU2Niix00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108747'),
  ('949292843873603252', 'Love and Dance', 2009, 'Music, Drama, Comedy', 'Bruce Parramore, Bartosz Prokopowicz', 'Maciej Kowalewski, Joanna Wilczewska', 'Izabella Miko, Mateusz Damięcki, Katarzyna Figura, Katarzyna Herman, Jacek Koman, Wojciech Mecwaldowski, Anna Bosak, Krzysztof Globisz', 'PG-13', 'Hania is a young journalist who suddenly discovers that she is more connected with dancing than she could ever imagine ...', 'Hania is a young journalist who suddenly discovers that she is more connected with dancing than she could ever imagine ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HoTgtkOLTK3tJ7drtRk5Z2bQZy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36781'),
  ('148288780856456089', 'Love and Death', 1975, 'Comedy, History', 'Woody Allen, Ghislain Cloquet, Paul Feyder', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Diane Keaton, Harold Gould, Olga Georges-Picot, Zvee Scooler, Despo Diamantidou, Sol Frieder, Jessica Harper', 'PG', 'In czarist Russia, a neurotic soldier and his distant cousin formulate a plot to assassinate Napoleon.', 'In czarist Russia, a neurotic soldier and his distant cousin formulate a plot to assassinate Napoleon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJXFd1UHZoOQ1UtoLxbyBLGJDox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11686'),
  ('24508322161238025', 'Love and Death in the Garden of the Gods', 1972, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery', 'Sauro Scavolini, Michele Brancato', 'Sauro Scavolini', 'Erika Blanc, Peter Lee Lawrence, Ezio Marano, Rosario Borelli, Orchidea De Santis, Franz von Treuberg, Vittorio Duse, Bruno Boschetti', null, 'An old professor rents a mysterious old villa, and finds a tape recorded by a previous occupant, detailing her debauched lifestyle and the events leading to her murder.', 'An old professor rents a mysterious old villa, and finds a tape recorded by a previous occupant, detailing her debauched lifestyle and the events leading to her murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xp0YGRsBLVKbrA1OfsE9hAjE9ps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121030'),
  ('35081840735031104', 'Love and Death on Long Island', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Oliver Curtis, Richard Kwietniowski', 'Richard Kwietniowski', 'John Hurt, Jason Priestley, Fiona Loewi, Sheila Hancock, Harvey Atkin, Maury Chaykin, Gawn Grainger, Elizabeth Quinn', 'PG-13', 'Curmudgeonly author Giles De''Ath, a widower with a marked distaste for modern popular culture, attempts to buy a ticket for a film adaptation of an E.M. Forster novel, but instead finds himself watching a tacky teen sex comedy. Yet when the beautiful Ronnie Bostock appears on the movie screen, Giles finds himself caught in a whirlwind of unanswered questions about both his own sexuality and his place in late 20th-century society.', 'Curmudgeonly author Giles De''Ath, a widower with a marked distaste for modern popular culture, attempts to buy a ticket for a film adaptation of an E.M. Forster novel, but instead finds himself watching a tacky teen sex comedy. Yet when the beautiful Ronnie Bostock appears on the movie screen, Giles finds himself caught in a whirlwind of unanswered questions about both his own sexuality and his place in late 20th-century society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jCmP9j43QXy48oQFpzM4oaYRc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47452'),
  ('143299031355779266', 'Love and Fear', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Margarethe von Trotta, Giuseppe Lanci', 'Dacia Maraini, Margarethe von Trotta', 'Fanny Ardant, Greta Scacchi, Valeria Golino, Peter Simonischek, Sergio Castellitto, Agnès Soral, Paolo Hendel, Ralph Schicha', null, 'Three sisters, played by Fanny Ardant, Greta Scacchi and Valeria Golino, struggle with their illusions, goals and desires in Margarethe von Trotta’s film adaptation of Anton Chekhov’s play.', 'Three sisters, played by Fanny Ardant, Greta Scacchi and Valeria Golino, struggle with their illusions, goals and desires in Margarethe von Trotta’s film adaptation of Anton Chekhov’s play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u50XiQopt28JAn0gmnKjkB0Zksz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161812'),
  ('1031307249591598728', 'Love and Honor', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yoji Yamada, Mutsuo Naganuma', 'Ichiro Yamamoto, Yoji Yamada, Emiko Hiramatsu', 'Takuya Kimura, Rei Dan, Takashi Sasano, Kaori Momoi, Nenji Kobayashi, Ken Ogata, Bandō Mitsugorō X, Makoto Akatsuka', 'R', 'A look at the relationship between a young blind samurai and his wife, who will make a sacrifice in order to defend her husband''s honor.', 'A look at the relationship between a young blind samurai and his wife, who will make a sacrifice in order to defend her husband''s honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTzeKY4YzAlGtWq7zHs2cCoI2YV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20527'),
  ('989333429005338677', 'Love and Honor', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Danny Mooney, Theo van de Sande', 'Jim Burnstein, Garrett K. Schiff', 'Liam Hemsworth, Austin Stowell, Teresa Palmer, Aimee Teegarden, Chris Lowell, Wyatt Russell, Max Adler, Chris Newman', 'PG-13', 'When a young soldier in Vietnam gets dumped by his hometown girl, he and his best friend decide to go AWOL and return to the States to win her back.', 'When a young soldier in Vietnam gets dumped by his hometown girl, he and his best friend decide to go AWOL and return to the States to win her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QWC9cluFEf7TM6fNU8q1VClhJT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140222'),
  ('807095110515392108', 'Love and Larceny', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Lù Leone, Massimo Dallamano', 'Ettore Scola, Sandro Continenza, Ruggero Maccari', 'Vittorio Gassman, Anna Maria Ferrero, Fosco Giachetti, Luigi Pavese, Dorian Gray, Mario Carotenuto, Alberto Bonucci, Nando Bruno', null, 'Gerardo, an aspiring actor, trying unsuccessfully to cross over from comedy to tragedy, is involved, due to his ability to mimic dialects of Italy, in a scam concocted by Lallo against a rich cloth-merchant.', 'Gerardo, an aspiring actor, trying unsuccessfully to cross over from comedy to tragedy, is involved, due to his ability to mimic dialects of Italy, in a scam concocted by Lallo against a rich cloth-merchant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nTgewDL2iiAorYV0v6gLpHwtgF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82368'),
  ('384789343258558466', 'Love and Leashes', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Lee Seung-ho, Lee Hyung-bin, Park Hyun-jin', 'Park Hyun-jin, Lee Da-hye', 'Seohyun, Lee Jun-young, Lee El, Seo Hyun-woo, Kim Han-na, Ahn Seung-gyun, Lee Suk-hyeong, Kim Bo-ra', 'R', 'Love never hurt so good for two co-workers who enter a contractual relationship as partners in consensual play, pleasure and pain.', 'Love never hurt so good for two co-workers who enter a contractual relationship as partners in consensual play, pleasure and pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQgGYiHUoDYeA4TbYlghpA5lmKH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760517'),
  ('31541286655635870', 'Love and Lies', 2017, 'Romance', 'Takeshi Furusawa', 'Erika Yoshida', 'Aoi Morikawa, Takumi Kitamura, Kanta Sato, Yoshimi Tokui, Nana Asakawa, Momoko Tanabe, Shozo Endo, Rieko Miura', null, 'The Japanese government carries out a program to increase the birth rate in the country. Their program analyzes gene information from its residents and selects a marriage partner for them. Aoi Nisaka is a high school student. She is in a love triangle with childhood friend Yuto Shiba and Sosuke Takachiho. Sosuke Takachiho is appointed by the government to become her husband.', 'The Japanese government carries out a program to increase the birth rate in the country. Their program analyzes gene information from its residents and selects a marriage partner for them. Aoi Nisaka is a high school student. She is in a love triangle with childhood friend Yuto Shiba and Sosuke Takachiho. Sosuke Takachiho is appointed by the government to become her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHC6wpxadclnatQa6hla1dSrVCX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458456'),
  ('261521921941733156', 'Love and Magnets', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yves Pelletier, Pierre Jodoin', 'Yves Pelletier', 'Emmanuel Bilodeau, Isabelle Blais, Isabelle Cyr, Josée Deschênes, Stéphane Gagnon, Sylvie Moreau, Geneviève Laroche, David Savard', null, 'Back in Montréal after spending five years in Guatemala, Julie moves in with her elder sister, Jeanne, a chronic liar and woman of rather loose sexual morals... Disillusioned with love, Jeanne is nevertheless engaged to Noël. However, Jeanne and Noël lead separate lives, and only communicate by leaving each other messages on the fridge.Everything suddenly becomes very complicated. Jeanne compels Julie to take up with Noël so she can have a fling with a passionate musician. Noël, meanwhile, sets Julie up with Michel -- without Jeanne''s knowledge. Julie mixes things up even further. Egged on by her friend Marie-Ève, she alters the contents of the messages on the fridge in an attempt to breathe new life into Jeanne and Noël''s relationship. Along the way, she also begins to fall for the seductive Michel. The tables are turned on everyone... In the game of love and truth, illusion leads to betrayal, but love conquers all.', 'Back in Montréal after spending five years in Guatemala, Julie moves in with her elder sister, Jeanne, a chronic liar and woman of rather loose sexual morals... Disillusioned with love, Jeanne is nevertheless engaged to Noël. However, Jeanne and Noël lead separate lives, and only communicate by leaving each other messages on the fridge.Everything suddenly becomes very complicated. Jeanne compels Julie to take up with Noël so she can have a fling with a passionate musician. Noël, meanwhile, sets Julie up with Michel -- without Jeanne''s knowledge. Julie mixes things up even further. Egged on by her friend Marie-Ève, she alters the contents of the messages on the fridge in an attempt to breathe new life into Jeanne and Noël''s relationship. Along the way, she also begins to fall for the seductive Michel. The tables are turned on everyone... In the game of love and truth, illusion leads to betrayal, but love conquers all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfrAPx5MlLlx5DmOAquiaLBJ1Io.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16423'),
  ('696602360472031124', 'Love and Monsters', 2020, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'James McGrady, Joanne Pearce, Eugene Intas', 'Brian Duffield, Matthew Robinson', 'Dylan O''Brien, Jessica Henwick, Michael Rooker, Dan Ewing, Ariana Greenblatt, Ellen Hollman, Tre Hale, Pacharo Mzembe', 'PG-13', 'Seven years since the Monsterpocalypse began, Joel Dawson has been living underground in order to survive. But after reconnecting over radio with his high school girlfriend Aimee, Joel decides to venture out to reunite with her, despite all the dangerous monsters that stand in his way.', 'Seven years since the Monsterpocalypse began, Joel Dawson has been living underground in order to survive. But after reconnecting over radio with his high school girlfriend Aimee, Joel decides to venture out to reunite with her, despite all the dangerous monsters that stand in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/718NnyxyQuBQcGWt9sdelA1Zc3h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590223'),
  ('239909575361210954', 'Love and Other Catastrophes', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Emma-Kate Croghan, Justin Brickle', 'Helen Bandis, Yael Bergman, Emma-Kate Croghan', 'Frances O''Connor, Alice Garner, Matt Day, Matthew Dyktynski, Radha Mitchell, Kim Gyngell, Suzi Dougherty, Suzanne Dowling', 'R', 'Over the course of one frantic day, five university students try to keep their heads above water.', 'Over the course of one frantic day, five university students try to keep their heads above water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38v256eDGv8XN6bHAEzCzKYULyV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76996'),
  ('686061838500625454', 'Love and Other Cults', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eiji Uchida, Maki Ito', 'Eiji Uchida', 'Sairi Ito, Kenta Suga, Anthony, Kaito Yoshimura, Hanae Kan, Ami Tomite, Hana Matsumoto, Nanami Kawakami', null, 'Ai''s mother sends her to live with a cult commune, where she remains for seven years. After the cult is broken up by the police, Ai struggles to fit in with society.', 'Ai''s mother sends her to live with a cult commune, where she remains for seven years. After the cult is broken up by the police, Ai struggles to fit in with society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLIMpDVyF8uFDEnyXZxgAfqsEds.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442842'),
  ('451187242850702284', 'Love and Other Curiosities', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Miguel Santesmases, Aitor Mantxola', 'Miguel Santesmases', 'Pilar Punzano, Rosa Mariscal, Silvia Marsó, Guillaume Depardieu, Guillermo Toledo, Nancho Novo, Esther Ortega, Paz Gómez', null, 'Cristina is a young literature student who works at night in a bar, Rosa is a brilliant executive in his thirties, and Anna is married and has one son. All three are sisters, and every one thinks her life is worthwhile and that their sisters have taken the wrong way. But it is time to recognize their dissatisfaction, and perhaps they are needed more than they are willing to admit ...', 'Cristina is a young literature student who works at night in a bar, Rosa is a brilliant executive in his thirties, and Anna is married and has one son. All three are sisters, and every one thinks her life is worthwhile and that their sisters have taken the wrong way. But it is time to recognize their dissatisfaction, and perhaps they are needed more than they are willing to admit ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssNJ7G5VOtec39SwnuDYXZ6oFv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97126'),
  ('989756432363587497', 'Love and Other Disasters', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pierre Morel, Alek Keshishian', 'Alek Keshishian', 'Brittany Murphy, Matthew Rhys, Santiago Cabrera, Catherine Tate, Jamie Sives, Stephanie Beacham, Gwyneth Paltrow, Orlando Bloom', 'R', 'Flighty Emily "Jacks" Jackson works for the British edition of Vogue magazine. Rather than pursue a relationship, Jacks regularly hooks up with her devoted ex-boyfriend, James Wildstone, and lives with Peter Simon, a gay screenwriter. When Jacks meets Argentinian photographer''s assistant Paolo Sarmiento, she assumes he is gay and tries to bring him and Peter together, unaware that Paolo is straight and in love with her.', 'Flighty Emily "Jacks" Jackson works for the British edition of Vogue magazine. Rather than pursue a relationship, Jacks regularly hooks up with her devoted ex-boyfriend, James Wildstone, and lives with Peter Simon, a gay screenwriter. When Jacks meets Argentinian photographer''s assistant Paolo Sarmiento, she assumes he is gay and tries to bring him and Peter together, unaware that Paolo is straight and in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0bXqv83sOVBnDyFGQCDeEWb0Os.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6641'),
  ('1092255762769932381', 'Love and Pigeons', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Vladimir Menshov, Yuriy Nevskiy, Vanda Rylach', 'Vladimir Gurkin', 'Aleksandr Mikhaylov, Nina Doroshina, Lyudmila Gurchenko, Sergei Yursky, Natalya Tenyakova, Yanina Lisovskaya, Igor Lyakh, Lada Sizonenko', null, 'In a remote Siberian village, a work injury sends Vasily Kuziakin on a paid trip to a Black Sea resort as compensation. There, he meets femme fatale Raisa Zaharovna and decides to stay with her. Such is the beginning of a new life for him, exciting and strange, but lacking his home, his wife and children, and his pigeons.', 'In a remote Siberian village, a work injury sends Vasily Kuziakin on a paid trip to a Black Sea resort as compensation. There, he meets femme fatale Raisa Zaharovna and decides to stay with her. Such is the beginning of a new life for him, exciting and strange, but lacking his home, his wife and children, and his pigeons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njP3HZQpCyI9vDyVAHjYqMKdYNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32334'),
  ('97073176245231970', 'Love and the City', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Maryus Vaysberg, Irek Hartowicz, Scott Lazar', 'Maryus Vaysberg', 'Vera Brezhneva, Anastasiya Zadorozhnaya, Volodymyr Zelenskyy, Filipp Kirkorov, Ville Haapasalo, Aleksey Chadov, Alika Smekhova, Svetlana Khodchenkova', null, 'Three Russian friends work in New York, party hard and chase women. It''s great times until they get cursed by a drunken Russian night club owner, who turns out to be Saint Valentine. St. Valentine''s curse is simple - the guys lose all their manly powers until they find their true love. It turns out to be harder than it sounds - our boys have a lot of growing up to do. Fast.', 'Three Russian friends work in New York, party hard and chase women. It''s great times until they get cursed by a drunken Russian night club owner, who turns out to be Saint Valentine. St. Valentine''s curse is simple - the guys lose all their manly powers until they find their true love. It turns out to be harder than it sounds - our boys have a lot of growing up to do. Fast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHy4EMorlJKhawStHPQYcxd9qO7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24686'),
  ('659300517129779709', 'Love and the Frenchwoman', 1960, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Robert Lefebvre, Michel Boisrond, Jean-Paul Le Chanois', 'Félicien Marceau, Annette Wademant, Jacques Robert', 'Jacqueline Porel, Darry Cowl, Micheline Dax, Paulette Dubost, Jacques Duby, Pierre-Jean Vaillard, Noël Roquevert, Marline Lambert', null, 'The seven stages in the life of the modern Frenchwomen are disclosed by seven directors in a witty way: 1 - Childhood, 2 - Adolescence, 3 - Virginity, 4 - Marriage, 5 - Adultery, 6 - Divorce, 7 - The Single Woman.', 'The seven stages in the life of the modern Frenchwomen are disclosed by seven directors in a witty way: 1 - Childhood, 2 - Adolescence, 3 - Virginity, 4 - Marriage, 5 - Adultery, 6 - Divorce, 7 - The Single Woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9WAW5M83IWEOdhwNsr0h33q1z0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98302'),
  ('540350230050573860', 'Love and...', 2015, 'Drama', 'Zhang Lu, Cho Young-jik, Jung Hoon', 'Zhang Lu', 'Park Hae-il, Ahn Sung-ki, Han Ye-ri, Moon So-ri, Nam Myung-ryeol, Bek Hyun-jin, Kim Hak-seon, Kwak Ja-hyung', null, 'People have varying perceptions and definitions of love and movies. One must overcome differing opinions and disregard insignificant factors in order to achieve the end product in each aspect. However, it is these trivial features that matter in the end and leave their imprint on our souls. Whether it is for love or for movies, we must continue to question and attend to the subtle inscriptions upon our emotions.', 'People have varying perceptions and definitions of love and movies. One must overcome differing opinions and disregard insignificant factors in order to achieve the end product in each aspect. However, it is these trivial features that matter in the end and leave their imprint on our souls. Whether it is for love or for movies, we must continue to question and attend to the subtle inscriptions upon our emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIeQOr8Gs4dcM4d7hHsDvy0pXPy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364505'),
  ('823669385302603432', 'Love Apprentices', 1972, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ernst Hofbauer, Klaus Werner', 'Werner P. Zibaso', 'Marina Blümel, Carmen Jäckel, Astrid Boner, Elisabeth Volkmann, Sascha Hehn, Hilde Brandt, Johannes Buzalski, Jürgen Feindt', null, 'One of the many German "report" sexploitation films from the early 1970s, with the only distinction that it focuses on female apprentices instead of schoolgirls.', 'One of the many German "report" sexploitation films from the early 1970s, with the only distinction that it focuses on female apprentices instead of schoolgirls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65hf3jtIQ5FMzLzwFm1qjprWmCV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264986'),
  ('680500955752779879', 'Love Around the Corner', 1986, 'Drama', 'Alberto Cortés, Guillermo Navarro', 'José Agustín, Alberto Cortés', 'Gabriela Roel, Alonso Echánove, Martha Papadimitriou, Leonor Llausás, Juan Carlos Colombo, Emilio Cortés, Daniel González, Alberto Rodríguez', null, 'Maria escapes from prison. On the run, she breaks her ankle. Julian, a truck driver, finds her sitting at the roadside, crying. He picks her up and takes her to a hospital. On her first chance, Maria flees again and goes to a hotel, where she ends up as a prostitute. She frequents bars and saloons, commits some robberies, but neither sex, nor the tequila, can replace love.', 'Maria escapes from prison. On the run, she breaks her ankle. Julian, a truck driver, finds her sitting at the roadside, crying. He picks her up and takes her to a hospital. On her first chance, Maria flees again and goes to a hotel, where she ends up as a prostitute. She frequents bars and saloons, commits some robberies, but neither sex, nor the tequila, can replace love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8eMSdjg42rEzuRKakmQiGXmgQr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240591'),
  ('204177132179507549', 'Love at First Bite', 1979, 'Romance, Comedy, Horror', 'Michael McLean, Stan Dragoti, Edward Rosson', 'Robert Kaufman', 'George Hamilton, Susan Saint James, Richard Benjamin, Dick Shawn, Arte Johnson, Sherman Hemsley, Isabel Sanford, Barry Gordon', 'PG', 'Dracula and Renfield relocate to ''70s era New York in search of Cindy Sondheim, the reincarnation of Dracula''s one true love, Mina Harker. "Trouble adjusting" is a wild understatement for the Count as he battles Cindy''s psychiatrist, Jeffrey Rosenberg, a descendant of Van Helsing, who may be in love with Cindy too.', 'Dracula and Renfield relocate to ''70s era New York in search of Cindy Sondheim, the reincarnation of Dracula''s one true love, Mina Harker. "Trouble adjusting" is a wild understatement for the Count as he battles Cindy''s psychiatrist, Jeffrey Rosenberg, a descendant of Van Helsing, who may be in love with Cindy too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4RDjX46zJ0sfh5wZW1rrKkezXJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18966'),
  ('751953731566043100', 'Love at First Child', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Anne Giafferi, Stéphane Cami', 'Anne Giafferi, Anne Le Ny', 'Isabelle Carré, Patrick Bruel, Laurent Stocker, Alice de Lencquesaing, Thomas Solivérès, Carole Franck, Satya Dusaugey, Mélanie Robert', null, 'Gabriell is a single mother, her 17-year-old daughter Claire is pregnant, however the child''s father Simon has no desire to be involved with his future baby. When Gabrielle takes matters into her own hands and asks Simon''s father Ange for help, an unexpected relationship begins.', 'Gabriell is a single mother, her 17-year-old daughter Claire is pregnant, however the child''s father Simon has no desire to be involved with his future baby. When Gabrielle takes matters into her own hands and asks Simon''s father Ange for help, an unexpected relationship begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mdZtXNfhACXv6ai0dppq9Hh82i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360994'),
  ('49626991999189855', 'Love at First Fight', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Thomas Cailley, David Cailley', 'Thomas Cailley, Claude Le Pape', 'Adèle Haenel, Kévin Azaïs, Antoine Laurent, Brigitte Roüan, William Lebghil, Thibaut Berducat, Nicolas Wanczycki, Frédéric Pellegeay', null, 'Arnaud, facing an uncertain future and a dearth of choices in a small French coastal town, meets and falls for the apocalyptic-minded Madeleine, who joins an army boot camp to learn military and survival skills to prepare for the upcoming environmental collapse. Intrigued and excited by Madeleine’s wild ideas, Arnaud signs up for the boot camp himself. They soon realize that the boot camp is harder than they’d imagined, but the experience nonetheless cements them together as the couple continues to explore their young love.', 'Arnaud, facing an uncertain future and a dearth of choices in a small French coastal town, meets and falls for the apocalyptic-minded Madeleine, who joins an army boot camp to learn military and survival skills to prepare for the upcoming environmental collapse. Intrigued and excited by Madeleine’s wild ideas, Arnaud signs up for the boot camp himself. They soon realize that the boot camp is harder than they’d imagined, but the experience nonetheless cements them together as the couple continues to explore their young love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xC0QDynS4kQm2F3cQHWcR1Fx1lI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270343'),
  ('589532779370615261', 'Love at First Glance', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Michael P. May, Kevin Connor, Ryan McDowell', 'Kathy Kloves', 'Amy Smart, Adrian Grenier, Jonathan Bennett, Kelly Thiebaud, Richard Riehle, Lee Purcell, Ted King, Brandon Ray Olive', null, 'After journalist Mary Landers is assigned to write a Valentine''s Day story about "The Meaning of Love," her long-time boyfriend breaks up with her. On her train ride home, she finds herself trading glances with a handsome stranger who, as he exits the train, leaves his phone behind.', 'After journalist Mary Landers is assigned to write a Valentine''s Day story about "The Meaning of Love," her long-time boyfriend breaks up with her. On her train ride home, she finds herself trading glances with a handsome stranger who, as he exits the train, leaves his phone behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6IbL3Teve159BSGDaUsZ2HNoBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437667'),
  ('1135372620999402499', 'Love at First Hiccough', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Tomas Villum Jensen, Henning Sprogøe, Dirk Brüel', 'Søren Frellesen, Dennis Jürgensen', 'Sofie Lassen-Kahlke, Robert Hansen, Sebastian Jessen, Rasmus Albeck, Karl Bille, Jonas Gülstorff, Joachim Knop, Mira Wanting', null, 'Anja is a beautiful and very well proportioned high school senior... and still a virgin. She insists that she wants her first time to be with a guy, who knows what it''s about. Her rich (and arrogant, pretentious and obnoxious) boyfriend Peter serves the purpose, and he''s more than willing. In fact, he''s pushing forward as much as he can, but Victor, a freshman who has a serious crush on Anja, has other plans. Her first time should definitely not be with this buffoon, and he''s ready to take it VERY far!', 'Anja is a beautiful and very well proportioned high school senior... and still a virgin. She insists that she wants her first time to be with a guy, who knows what it''s about. Her rich (and arrogant, pretentious and obnoxious) boyfriend Peter serves the purpose, and he''s more than willing. In fact, he''s pushing forward as much as he can, but Victor, a freshman who has a serious crush on Anja, has other plans. Her first time should definitely not be with this buffoon, and he''s ready to take it VERY far!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OCRb2AxrCXmrtNCXftvMyb68B9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23289'),
  ('85845821215537858', 'Love at First Hiccup', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Barbara Topsøe-Rothenborg, Steven Bernstein', 'Søren Frellesen, Dennis Jürgensen', 'Devon Werkheiser, Scout Taylor-Compton, Tania Verafield, Ken Luckey, Adam J. Bernstein, Nicholas Braun, Sean Marquette, Ray Wise', 'R', 'Victor, a bumbling and gullible high school freshman, has caught a serious case of Anya-itis—an acute, incurable crush on hot senior Anya. Too bad she dates the most popular guy in school and doesn''t have a clue that Victor exists. After a string of awkward run-ins, his chances of scoring a date with Anya seem to go from hardly any to, well, zero. But his shy and goofy charm—and an elaborate scheme to win the girl of his dreams—just might do the trick.', 'Victor, a bumbling and gullible high school freshman, has caught a serious case of Anya-itis—an acute, incurable crush on hot senior Anya. Too bad she dates the most popular guy in school and doesn''t have a clue that Victor exists. After a string of awkward run-ins, his chances of scoring a date with Anya seem to go from hardly any to, well, zero. But his shy and goofy charm—and an elaborate scheme to win the girl of his dreams—just might do the trick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdYxRQKpFQhqFBo3k87vw18m7Ov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42306'),
  ('355700261810744271', 'Love at First Kiss', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Alauda Ruiz de Azúa', 'Adolfo Valor, Cristóbal Garrido', 'Álvaro Cervantes, Silvia Alonso, Gorka Otxoa, Susana Abaitua, Pilar Castro, Fabia Castro, Ninton Sánchez, Lara Oliete', null, 'The story of Javier who, at the age of 16, while kissing a girl for the first time, realized that he had a gift of romantic clairvoyance. Javier can see the future... and he finally knows who the love of his life is.', 'The story of Javier who, at the age of 16, while kissing a girl for the first time, realized that he had a gift of romantic clairvoyance. Javier can see the future... and he finally knows who the love of his life is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5buE7Bepg2rJhPaNCSzFc5kQ0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818648'),
  ('1100021064797242458', 'Love at First Sight', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Alice Caronna, Luke Goodrich, Liam Saint-Pierre', 'Katie Lovejoy', 'Haley Lu Richardson, Ben Hardy, Rob Delaney, Katrina Nare, Jameela Jamil, Tom Taylor, Dexter Fletcher, Sally Phillips', 'PG-13', 'Hadley and Oliver begin falling in love on a flight from New York to London, but when they lose each other at customs, can they defy all odds to reunite?', 'Hadley and Oliver begin falling in love on a flight from New York to London, but when they lose each other at customs, can they defy all odds to reunite?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCMGlarDrcmhclBmnYoH7JUCDuA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353577'),
  ('265538163625169878', 'Love at Large', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Alan Rudolph, Ricardo Méndez Matta, Michael-McCloud Thompson', 'Alan Rudolph', 'Tom Berenger, Elizabeth Perkins, Anne Archer, Kate Capshaw, Annette O''Toole, Ted Levine, Ann Magnuson, Kevin J. O''Connor', 'R', 'Inept private investigator Harry Dobbs meets vampish new client Miss Dolan, who wants him to follow her abusive lover. But Dobbs sets about tailing a different person entirely – a mysterious character leading a double life. Harry, however, discovers that he himself is being followed by a distaff gumshoe.', 'Inept private investigator Harry Dobbs meets vampish new client Miss Dolan, who wants him to follow her abusive lover. But Dobbs sets about tailing a different person entirely – a mysterious character leading a double life. Harry, however, discovers that he himself is being followed by a distaff gumshoe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2l54MDhZjc2aD6sQPB7IeRAJjt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32035'),
  ('897450969871903195', 'Love At Last', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Doğa Can Anafarta', 'Melis Civelek, Zeynep Gür', 'Eda Ece, Kaan Yıldırım, Pelin Uluksar, Devrim Yakut, Tamer Levent, Seren Şirince, Kürşat Demir, Onur Gözeten', null, 'The funny story of Aslı, an advertising executive who doesn''t want to be alone on Valentine''s Day.', 'The funny story of Aslı, an advertising executive who doesn''t want to be alone on Valentine''s Day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnBW7o8ycDi8WotGeRkGoDxrNMd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1582328'),
  ('961108767707986273', 'Love At Least', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Toyotarô Shigemori, Kosai Sekine', 'Kosai Sekine', 'Shuri, Masaki Suda, Riisa Naka, Tetsushi Tanaka, Naomi Nishida, Yutaka Matsushige, Shizuka Ishibashi, Lisa Oda', null, 'For Yasuko every day is a challenge. Due to her mental illness and hypersomnia, simple things like household chores and holding a job seem impossible. Added to the mix is an indifferent, almost distant boyfriend and an ex-girlfriend with plans to win him back.', 'For Yasuko every day is a challenge. Due to her mental illness and hypersomnia, simple things like household chores and holding a job seem impossible. Added to the mix is an indifferent, almost distant boyfriend and an ex-girlfriend with plans to win him back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjFKgo55XJmYIjcKtwzCODZJ9Vn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543755'),
  ('157097225919548261', 'Love at Look Lodge', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Max McGuire', 'Claire Ross Dunn', 'Jonathan Keltz, Clark Backo, Chris Violette, Gabrielle Jennings, Tim Progosh, Kathryn Kohut, Erin Eldershaw, Evert Houston', null, 'Lily dreams of being a hotel event coordinator and is thrilled when she''s given the chance to do so by helping Noah, a hotel guest, finish planning his sister Justine''s wedding at a remote lodge.', 'Lily dreams of being a hotel event coordinator and is thrilled when she''s given the chance to do so by helping Noah, a hotel guest, finish planning his sister Justine''s wedding at a remote lodge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yW6c7lyJIhfiklmsqBfpugHHywS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:702701'),
  ('356422988973506056', 'Love at Lookout Lake', 2026, 'Romance', 'Jonathan Stoddard, Kiki Simmons, Troy Bakewell', 'Jenna Brister', 'Cait Moira, Gena Lashay, Kelsey Risher, Michael Sigler, Timothy Sutton', null, 'Two people who fell in love as teenagers meet again in their hometown. Tyler still has strong feelings for Sierra, but she''s too focused on her career to let love back in.', 'Two people who fell in love as teenagers meet again in their hometown. Tyler still has strong feelings for Sierra, but she''s too focused on her career to let love back in.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F9%2Fgracenote%2F9bfc2569c5ab2d1fdada5f5529f14128.jpg', 'plex:movie:love-at-lookout-lake'),
  ('453085825753490066', 'Love at Sea', 1965, 'Romance, Drama', 'Guy Gilles, Jean-Pierre Desfosse, Olivier Reichenbach', 'Guy Gilles', 'Daniel Moosmann, Geneviève Thénier, Josette Krieff, Guy Gilles, Simone Paris, Lili Bontemps, Bernard Verley, Jean-Pierre Léaud', null, 'During her holiday in Brest, a young Parisian falls in love with a sailor. But autumn comes and the two lovers have to part. They write to each other. Will their love resist at a distance, each living his life, him in Brest with his friends, she in Paris who keeps waiting for him? An impossible love story and the cross-portrait of two cities, Paris and Brest, between the realism of the color images and the poetry infused by the sepia black and white images, lives to the rhythm of the nostalgia of the two lovers...', 'During her holiday in Brest, a young Parisian falls in love with a sailor. But autumn comes and the two lovers have to part. They write to each other. Will their love resist at a distance, each living his life, him in Brest with his friends, she in Paris who keeps waiting for him? An impossible love story and the cross-portrait of two cities, Paris and Brest, between the realism of the color images and the poetry infused by the sepia black and white images, lives to the rhythm of the nostalgia of the two lovers...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mefCpa8xmDdtHrZ1OxnWfPOdKV8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294896'),
