  ('1006259151470161337', 'Love at Stake', 1987, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Horror', 'John Moffitt, Mark Irwin, Stanzi Stokes', 'Lanier Laney, Terry Sweeney', 'Patrick Cassidy, Kelly Preston, Georgia Brown, Barbara Carrera, Bud Cort, Annie Golden, Norma MacMillan, Dave Thomas', null, 'Salem, 1692. The mayor and judge are accusing land owner of witchery in order to grab their land. No one knows that are handsome stranger is a real witch and has evil plans for the town.', 'Salem, 1692. The mayor and judge are accusing land owner of witchery in order to grab their land. No one knows that are handsome stranger is a real witch and has evil plans for the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NljKwWQ4xJJCRoeRIw7cQhuVyF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87395'),
  ('74116318549865798', 'Love at Sunset Terrace', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Andy Hodgson, Matthew Tincey, C. Damon Harper', 'John Dion', 'Ellen Woglom, Carlo Marks, Erica Tremblay, Meghan Heffern, Nathan Witte, Alison Matthews, Brad Harder, Carolyn Yonge', null, 'Exhausted from her marketing job, Sophie rents an Airbnb with a widowed father and his daughter to wind down. However, the daughter is set on making her father fall in love once more, with her sight set on Sophie.', 'Exhausted from her marketing job, Sophie rents an Airbnb with a widowed father and his daughter to wind down. However, the daughter is set on making her father fall in love once more, with her sight set on Sophie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpOrZGKbrdk9L0tfMk22o3zCkvz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:690741'),
