  ('380029514609747414', 'Love at the End of the World', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kim In-shik', null, 'Han Da-gam, Cho Dong-hyuk, Kong Ye-ji, Lee Hee-jin, Choi Ki-hoon, Kim Seong-beom, Oh Seong-hyun', null, 'Ja-young lost her husband 3 years ago. One day, Dong-ha appears in front of Ja-young and her daughter Yoo-jin. Ja-young falls in love with Dong-ha who is tender. She begins to dream of happy life with Dong-ha. Meanwhile, Yoo-jin feels lonely since her mother is always busy with work. She begins to have feelings for Dong-ha.', 'Ja-young lost her husband 3 years ago. One day, Dong-ha appears in front of Ja-young and her daughter Yoo-jin. Ja-young falls in love with Dong-ha who is tender. She begins to dream of happy life with Dong-ha. Meanwhile, Yoo-jin feels lonely since her mother is always busy with work. She begins to have feelings for Dong-ha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mc6Chti9JeEtgbajuSsJPnMrV6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370232'),
  ('704233537736521974', 'Love at the Ranch', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'David I. Strasser, Dave T. Nall', 'Alikona Bradford, Lindsay Hartley', 'Laura Mitchell, Jon Cor, Erin Boyes, Michael Denis, P. Lynn Johnson, Dolores Drake, Joanne Wilson, David Parent', null, 'Allison Sawyer is the go-to reporter at Metropolis Post, known for breaking high-profile stories. Her next story is writing a profile piece on one of her favourite authors Annabelle Lee. Annabelle based all her romantic novels on the timelessly beautiful Clybourne Ranch, far away from city life.', 'Allison Sawyer is the go-to reporter at Metropolis Post, known for breaking high-profile stories. Her next story is writing a profile piece on one of her favourite authors Annabelle Lee. Annabelle based all her romantic novels on the timelessly beautiful Clybourne Ranch, far away from city life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cleLiTpYiSo4zYOeT7i954RwE0w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778994'),
  ('445225282490454702', 'Love at the Top', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michel Deville, Claude Lecomte', 'Christopher Frank', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Romy Schneider, Jane Birkin, Jean-François Balmer, Florinda Bolkan, Mary Marquet, Dominique Constanza', 'R', 'A shy bank employee unexpectedly invites a young woman to a café, leading to a one-night stand. When he shares this with his disillusioned friend, the writer helps him navigate a dazzling social ascent.', 'A shy bank employee unexpectedly invites a young woman to a café, leading to a one-night stand. When he shares this with his disillusioned friend, the writer helps him navigate a dazzling social ascent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFSkffvu07hHnVYj1aCu4PlI26Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60430'),
  ('157814527085390094', 'Love at Twenty', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'François Truffaut, Andrzej Wajda, Shintarō Ishihara', 'Jerzy Stefan Stawiński, François Truffaut, Yvon Samuel', 'Jean-Pierre Léaud, Marie-France Pisier, Patrick Auffay, Rosy Varte, François Darbon, Jean-François Adam, Pierre Schaeffer, Cristina Gaïoni', null, 'Love at Twenty unites five directors from five different countries to present their different perspectives on what love really is at the age of 20. The episodes are united with the score of Georges Delerue and still photos of Henri Cartier-Bresson.', 'Love at Twenty unites five directors from five different countries to present their different perspectives on what love really is at the age of 20. The episodes are united with the score of Georges Delerue and still photos of Henri Cartier-Bresson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aup2QCYCsyEeQfpboXy0f4uj8aE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8773'),
  ('927504464239752621', 'Love Battles', 2013, 'Drama', 'Jacques Doillon, Laurent Fénart, Laurent Chalet', 'Jacques Doillon', 'Sara Forestier, James Thierrée, Louise Szpindel, Mahault Mollaret, Bill Leyshon', null, 'A couple’s verbal sparring intensifies with shoving, punching and wrestling, escalating to the point where their frequent fighting sessions become real love battles…', 'A couple’s verbal sparring intensifies with shoving, punching and wrestling, escalating to the point where their frequent fighting sessions become real love battles…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dis6aW0GH4ZzwGDMb7rDiSScJh2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167668'),
  ('820386146053911526', 'Love Bavarian Style', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Sigi Rothemund', 'Erich Tomek', 'Elisabeth Volkmann, Alexander Grill, Rinaldo Talamonti, Marie Ekorre, Jürgen Schilling, Dorothea Rau, Elisabeth Felchner, Raoul Retzer', null, 'Vittorio pretends to be gay so he can chaperone a rich man''s daughter on vacation in Germany. Unfortunately his driver really is gay and Vittorio has a problem.', 'Vittorio pretends to be gay so he can chaperone a rich man''s daughter on vacation in Germany. Unfortunately his driver really is gay and Vittorio has a problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGVX8r5Am1YNiC2lY3jUzRELFRI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81591'),
  ('374636027275714991', 'Love Beats', 2019, 'Drama', 'Roberto Bueso, Víctor Entrecanales', 'Roberto Bueso', 'Gonzalo Fernández, Charlotte Vega, Pepo Llopís, Xavi Giner, Hugo Rubert, Imma Sancho, Enric Benavent, Carlo Blanco', null, 'After a year living in London, Edu backs out of an audition for the British Music Academy, and returns home to his sleepy hometown outside Valencia feeling doubtful, reserved and depressed. In a matter of days his brother will be married and amidst all the excitement he is unwilling to admit to his family and friends his cowardice. In the days leading to the impending nuptials, Edu will reconnect with old friends, strike up with his old band and longingly pine for the gorgeous Alicia. The catch is that Alicia also happens to be the girlfriend of Edu’s best friend Juanma. But anything and everything can happen in a short period of time, and as each day passes, Edu’s perceptions change as he learns that those closest to him also hold secrets of their own.', 'After a year living in London, Edu backs out of an audition for the British Music Academy, and returns home to his sleepy hometown outside Valencia feeling doubtful, reserved and depressed. In a matter of days his brother will be married and amidst all the excitement he is unwilling to admit to his family and friends his cowardice. In the days leading to the impending nuptials, Edu will reconnect with old friends, strike up with his old band and longingly pine for the gorgeous Alicia. The catch is that Alicia also happens to be the girlfriend of Edu’s best friend Juanma. But anything and everything can happen in a short period of time, and as each day passes, Edu’s perceptions change as he learns that those closest to him also hold secrets of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uz8Zt7Qk7ptwMOEH3DBgYuHNojM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589457'),
  ('276842547749316815', 'Love Beats Rhymes', 2017, 'Drama, Music', 'RZA', 'Nicole Jefferson Asher', 'Azealia Banks, Common, Jill Scott, Lorraine Toussaint, Hana Mae Lee, Lucien Laviscount, John David Washington, Mary Christina Brown', 'R', 'A young woman dreams of making it big in the world of hip hop, but her parents demand that she finish her university degree. She dutifully agrees to complete her education, but her spoken word proves to have a powerful impact in the classroom.', 'A young woman dreams of making it big in the world of hip hop, but her parents demand that she finish her university degree. She dutifully agrees to complete her education, but her spoken word proves to have a powerful impact in the classroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPqzTaS905V3ZUbc5297YrWEPAd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376658'),
  ('377197051937830032', 'Love Before Breakfast', 1936, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Walter Lang, Ted Tetzlaff, Franz Waxman', 'Gertrude Purcell, Doris Malloy, Harry Clork', 'Carole Lombard, Preston Foster, Cesar Romero, Janet Beecher, Betty Lawford, Forrester Harvey, Richard Carle, Joyce Compton', null, 'Scott is a very rich businessman who hangs out with a snooty, silly Countess, but has the hots for Kay who is already engaged to Bill. Scott pursues Kay like crazy, going so far as to buy Bill''s oil company so that he can banish him to Japan, leaving Kay unmoored.', 'Scott is a very rich businessman who hangs out with a snooty, silly Countess, but has the hots for Kay who is already engaged to Bill. Scott pursues Kay like crazy, going so far as to buy Bill''s oil company so that he can banish him to Japan, leaving Kay unmoored.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcghIJtNdRFd1ZEtXQke4oQcKJr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114888'),
  ('788911229091572909', 'Love Between Teachers and Students', 2018, 'Romance', 'Choi Min', null, 'Lee Chae-dam, Kim Ji-yeon, shin yeon yoo, Han Jae-kyung', null, 'Two successful, beautiful women compete for status by involving a handsome student. Will they succeed in their games and seduction?', 'Two successful, beautiful women compete for status by involving a handsome student. Will they succeed in their games and seduction?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OL6bN9jUV6lKYjAyIEO802h1E4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538338'),
  ('495534265069984692', 'Love Between the Raindrops', 1980, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Karel Kachyňa, Josef Sandr, Stanislava Hutková', 'Karel Kachyňa, Jan Otčenášek, Vladimír Kalina', 'Vladimír Menšík, Lukáš Vaculík, Jan Hrušínský, Zlata Adamovská, Tereza Pokorná-Herzová, Rudolf Hrušínský, David Vlček, Michal Dlouhý', null, 'Set in Prague during the years leading up to World War II, this family saga tells the story of a cobbler named Vincenc Bursik (Vladimir Mensik), who uproots his clan from the country to the city, only to suffer the loss of his wife and the failure of his shoe business within months. When his daughter moves away to go live with a wealthy businessman as his mistress, Vincenc is left to take care of his two sons, who spend their days in a secret garden vying for the affections of a teenage girl.', 'Set in Prague during the years leading up to World War II, this family saga tells the story of a cobbler named Vincenc Bursik (Vladimir Mensik), who uproots his clan from the country to the city, only to suffer the loss of his wife and the failure of his shoe business within months. When his daughter moves away to go live with a wealthy businessman as his mistress, Vincenc is left to take care of his two sons, who spend their days in a secret garden vying for the affections of a teenage girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGSOUjvJ2M8ztLVMDwmb0pM67sS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341544'),
  ('790322234000685215', 'Love Bite', 2012, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Andy de Emmony, Tat Radcliffe', 'Ronan Blaney, Cris Cole', 'Ed Speleers, Jessica Szohr, Timothy Spall, Luke Pasqualino, Kierston Wareing, Robert Pugh, Robin Morrissey, Daniel Kendrick', 'R', 'Four teenaged lads set off to get laid in order to stay alive. However, the boys have to attract the girls first in order to complete their mission. Otherwise, they will be hunted and killed by a vicious Werewolf which only seems interested in Virgins.', 'Four teenaged lads set off to get laid in order to stay alive. However, the boys have to attract the girls first in order to complete their mission. Otherwise, they will be hunted and killed by a vicious Werewolf which only seems interested in Virgins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gViFAWWSkEKVJRbFdxdxUemp14.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142591'),
  ('388792935070812128', 'Love Bites', 1993, 'Horror, Romance, Comedy', 'Malcolm Marmorstein, Phil Robinson, Stephen Lighthill', 'Malcolm Marmorstein', 'Adam Ant, Kimberly Foster, Michelle Forbes, Roger Rose, Philip Bruns, Judy Tenuta, Jacqueline Schultz, Rhonda Dorton', null, 'Story about a vampire who falls in love with a woman and tries to "re-humanize" himself in order to be with her.', 'Story about a vampire who falls in love with a woman and tries to "re-humanize" himself in order to be with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1N2gvpnpS2ZQNBdMBDIKhmQzDPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95820'),
  ('179362598010279735', 'Love Bites', 2001, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Antoine de Caunes, Frédérique Moidon, Ophélie Gelber', null, 'Guillaume Canet, Asia Argento, Gérard Lanvin, José Garcia, Vincent Perez, Jean-Marie Winling, Orazio Massaro, Frédéric Pellegeay', null, 'Antoine is a social wannabe who drops an elusive aristocrat''s name to get into an exclusive party. The name - Jordan - gets him whisked by two burly bodyguards into the office of the host, von Bulow, who won''t accept Antoine''s admission of lying, gives him $100,000, and promises $900,000 more when led to Jordan. Enticed by the money, Antoine, with the help of his friend Étienne, begins his search. He follows trails through Paris''s night scene, gets beaten up and bitten, and meets Jordan''s sister, Violaine. After a surreal night, he''s hooked on her charms but leery of continuing his pursuit of Jordan. Von Bulow insists. Can he find Jordan, get his reward, and attract Violaine?', 'Antoine is a social wannabe who drops an elusive aristocrat''s name to get into an exclusive party. The name - Jordan - gets him whisked by two burly bodyguards into the office of the host, von Bulow, who won''t accept Antoine''s admission of lying, gives him $100,000, and promises $900,000 more when led to Jordan. Enticed by the money, Antoine, with the help of his friend Étienne, begins his search. He follows trails through Paris''s night scene, gets beaten up and bitten, and meets Jordan''s sister, Violaine. After a surreal night, he''s hooked on her charms but leery of continuing his pursuit of Jordan. Von Bulow insists. Can he find Jordan, get his reward, and attract Violaine?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMpv1xRfetTLsIsjUpDLSxfKqf6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56229'),
