  ('577324044673379017', 'Love Comes Softly', 2003, 'Drama, Romance, Western, Family, TV Movie', 'Michael Landon Jr., James W. Wrenn', null, 'Katherine Heigl, Dale Midkiff, Skye McCole Bartusiak, Corbin Bernsen, Theresa Russell, Oliver Macready, Tiffany Amber Knight, Adam Loeffler', null, 'Nineteen year old pioneer woman Marty has recently married. She goes west with her husband Clem, hoping to start a new life. But Clem unexpectedly dies, and Marty finds herself alone, two months pregnant. Widower Clark offers her a marriage of convenience: she needs food and money, and he needs someone to take care of his daughter Missie. She accepts his proposal as a temporary solution.', 'Nineteen year old pioneer woman Marty has recently married. She goes west with her husband Clem, hoping to start a new life. But Clem unexpectedly dies, and Marty finds herself alone, two months pregnant. Widower Clark offers her a marriage of convenience: she needs food and money, and he needs someone to take care of his daughter Missie. She accepts his proposal as a temporary solution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shyGlG9BJtb8k201XP6R17niKU5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16250'),
