  ('177078364472895663', 'Love Education', 2017, 'Drama', 'Sylvia Chang, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Sylvia Chang, You Xiaoling', 'Sylvia Chang, Tian Zhuangzhuang, Lang Yueting, Song Ningfeng, Wu Yanshu, Geng Le, Sitar Tan, René Liu', null, 'When Huiying hears that her mother''s dying wish is to be buried next to her husband, she discovers that his remains are in the countryside and cared for by his first wife. A conflict ensues, and Huiying''s daughter, an intrepid reporter, breaks the story as the three women search for proof of love.', 'When Huiying hears that her mother''s dying wish is to be buried next to her husband, she discovers that his remains are in the countryside and cared for by his first wife. A conflict ensues, and Huiying''s daughter, an intrepid reporter, breaks the story as the three women search for proof of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvFy72XV4n1YHmaMK7o19beJpnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482590'),
  ('92265901587845451', 'Love Everlasting', 1913, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mario Caserini, Angelo Scalenghe', 'Emiliano Bonetti, G. Monleone', 'Lyda Borelli, Mario Bonnard, Gian Paolo Rosmino, Vittorio Rossi Pianelli, Dante Cappelli, Maria Caserini, Camillo De Riso, Emilio Petacci', null, 'Grand Duchy of Wallenstein. Elsa Holbein is the young beautiful daughter of General Julius, the Chief of the General Staff. After a spy named Moise Sthar steals military documents, Julius is accused of betrayal. He kills himself while Elsa is forced to leave. Homeless, she begins wandering the streets until, on the Riviera, she starts her performing career under the pseudonym of Diana Cadouleur and becomes a successful actress and singer. One day, in a small church, she meets an elegant young man and she falls in love with him. But during a tour on the Lucarno Lake she runs into Sthar who, rejected by Elena, spreads rumors about Prince Massimiliano’s behavior.', 'Grand Duchy of Wallenstein. Elsa Holbein is the young beautiful daughter of General Julius, the Chief of the General Staff. After a spy named Moise Sthar steals military documents, Julius is accused of betrayal. He kills himself while Elsa is forced to leave. Homeless, she begins wandering the streets until, on the Riviera, she starts her performing career under the pseudonym of Diana Cadouleur and becomes a successful actress and singer. One day, in a small church, she meets an elegant young man and she falls in love with him. But during a tour on the Lucarno Lake she runs into Sthar who, rejected by Elena, spreads rumors about Prince Massimiliano’s behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSvxJWcgu7ttMNQY2vVNwfocEWr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225763'),
  ('911778912705248334', 'Love Everlasting', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Rob Diamond', 'Rob Diamond, Robert Conder, Landon Henneman', 'Lucky Blue Smith, Christie Burke, Emily Procter, Madison Bontempo, Brock McKinney, Gabriel Monroe Eckert, Cal Nguyen, Shawn Stevens', 'PG', 'Bridger is a young outsider who''s always wanted more. He and his mother flee an abusive home, eventually finding a small town in the middle of nowhere. Once there, Bridger finds true acceptance with another misfit.', 'Bridger is a young outsider who''s always wanted more. He and his mother flee an abusive home, eventually finding a small town in the middle of nowhere. Once there, Bridger finds true acceptance with another misfit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQeaB97z2g0vdu0tvu0T9me1aJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426203'),
  ('677221962066622532', 'Love Exists', 1960, 'Documentary', 'Maurice Pialat, Gilbert Sarthre', null, 'Jean-Loup Reynold', null, 'An essay film critiquing post-war France''s urban developments- Pialat states that modernity and suburban convenience have limited Parisian freedom and widened class gaps.', 'An essay film critiquing post-war France''s urban developments- Pialat states that modernity and suburban convenience have limited Parisian freedom and widened class gaps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbpsr3Si6LbErmdOxDOtPVTu2Co.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162320'),
  ('952677819081026935', 'Love Fiction', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jeon Gye-soo, Kim Young-min, Chu In-sik', 'Jeon Gye-soo', 'Ha Jung-woo, Gong Hyo-jin, Yoo In-na, Jo Hee-bong, Lee Byung-joon, Ji Jin-hee, Kwak Do-won, Seo Hyun-woo', null, 'A writer looking for inspiration finds a perfect muse in a girl. After much work, he makes her his girlfriend. But then he starts to get tired of her.', 'A writer looking for inspiration finds a perfect muse in a girl. After much work, he makes her his girlfriend. But then he starts to get tired of her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/leTKpykQNYAENaIqj4ozfPk97Ea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107434'),
  ('402298951854918239', 'Love Field', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ralf D. Bode, Jonathan Kaplan', 'Don Roos', 'Michelle Pfeiffer, Dennis Haysbert, Stephanie McFadden, Brian Kerwin, Louise Latham, Peggy Rea, Beth Grant, Johnny Ray McGhee', 'PG-13', 'Dallas housewife Lurene Hallett''s life revolves around the doings of Jacqueline Kennedy. She is devastated when President Kennedy is shot a few hours after she sees him arrive in Dallas. Despite her husband Ray''s prohibition, she decides to attend the funeral in Washington, D.C. Forced to travel by bus, she befriends Jonell, the young black daughter of Paul Couter. Sensing something wrong, her good intentioned interference leads the mixed race threesome on an increasingly difficult journey to Washington with both the police and Ray looking for them.', 'Dallas housewife Lurene Hallett''s life revolves around the doings of Jacqueline Kennedy. She is devastated when President Kennedy is shot a few hours after she sees him arrive in Dallas. Despite her husband Ray''s prohibition, she decides to attend the funeral in Washington, D.C. Forced to travel by bus, she befriends Jonell, the young black daughter of Paul Couter. Sensing something wrong, her good intentioned interference leads the mixed race threesome on an increasingly difficult journey to Washington with both the police and Ray looking for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0qV3fFXWM6yGMlaqz3EWNSodB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66599'),
  ('946005832317506976', 'Love Finds A Home', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, Western, Family, Action, TV Movie', 'David S. Cass Sr., Dane Peterson', 'Donald Davenport', 'Sarah Jones, Haylie Duff, Jordan Bridges, Patty Duke, Courtney Halverson, Michael Trevino, Jeffrey Muller, Dahlia Salem', null, 'In this sequel, Lillian has been adopted and it''s several years later. Annie, married and pregnant, visits her fellow doctor friend, Dr. Owen. Dr Owen desperately wants a baby, but seems unable to become pregnant. Lillian finds a love interest, an assistant to her adoptive dad, the latter has become quite overprotective.', 'In this sequel, Lillian has been adopted and it''s several years later. Annie, married and pregnant, visits her fellow doctor friend, Dr. Owen. Dr Owen desperately wants a baby, but seems unable to become pregnant. Lillian finds a love interest, an assistant to her adoptive dad, the latter has become quite overprotective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgFi7OtOeMmvH3stWJSpazJGaSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25182'),
