  ('556726000992619159', 'Love Finds You in Charm', 2015, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Terry Cunningham, Adam N. White', 'Bryar Freed', 'Trevor Donovan, Danielle Chuchran, Drew Fuller, Tiffany Dupont, Meg Wittman, Rohn Thomas, Kaitlyn Sapp', 'PG', 'A young Amish woman, who isn''t satisfied with her path at home, visits a cousin for the summer. Over the summer, she is exposed to another world, finds friendship and more. Soon she must choose and come to terms with the life she wants.', 'A young Amish woman, who isn''t satisfied with her path at home, visits a cousin for the summer. Over the summer, she is exposed to another world, finds friendship and more. Soon she must choose and come to terms with the life she wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGWw4foAzmPvtr6DSd3XIgzbEpC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343369'),
  ('631547441965921656', 'Love Finds You in Valentine', 2016, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Terry Cunningham', null, 'Michaela McManus, Diogo Morgado, Ed Asner, Lindsay Wagner, Hunter Cross, James Kisicki, Kellen Boyle, John Eby', 'G', 'Kennedy Blaine, a Californian girl, inherits a ranch in the small town of Valentine in Nebraska. Before she sells the property, she decides to spend the summer in her house and learn more about her family.', 'Kennedy Blaine, a Californian girl, inherits a ranch in the small town of Valentine in Nebraska. Before she sells the property, she decides to spend the summer in her house and learn more about her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezne6rc2Zm4EQn86kjoZ2VIJZTN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383256'),
  ('544843428843666391', 'Love for an Idiot', 1967, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yasuzō Masumura, Setsuo Kobayashi', 'Ichirō Ikeda', 'Michiyo Yasuda, Shoichi Ozawa, Masakazu Tamura, Isao Kuraishi, Sachiko Murase, Yuka Konno, Tamae Kiyokawa, Yūzō Hayakawa', null, 'A middle-aged factory engineer trains, marries, and ultimately loses a teenage bride after she enslaves him to her whims.', 'A middle-aged factory engineer trains, marries, and ultimately loses a teenage bride after she enslaves him to her whims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDMsFOD3ZMFyt0BCXiTAlrFVULc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188273'),
  ('837025360533394201', 'Love for Beginners', 2012, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Takeshi Furusawa', 'Taeko Asano', 'Emi Takei, Tori Matsuzaka, Fumino Kimura, Sho Aoyagi, Kento Yamazaki, Yua Shinkawa, Rin Takanashi, Erina Dawkins', null, 'Hibino Tsubaki is a young teenage girl with a talent for styling other people''s hair. Yet, Tsubaki suffers from low self-esteem and isn''t very comfortable styling her own hair. She also has a tendency to dress old-fashioned. She''s teased at high school because of this. One day, popular male student Tsubaki Kyota targets Tsubaki for teasing. Tsubaki Kyota holds sway over the entire classroom and is quite a playboy. Inexplicably they fall in love. Meanwhile, Tsubaki Kyota has commitment issues...', 'Hibino Tsubaki is a young teenage girl with a talent for styling other people''s hair. Yet, Tsubaki suffers from low self-esteem and isn''t very comfortable styling her own hair. She also has a tendency to dress old-fashioned. She''s teased at high school because of this. One day, popular male student Tsubaki Kyota targets Tsubaki for teasing. Tsubaki Kyota holds sway over the entire classroom and is quite a playboy. Inexplicably they fall in love. Meanwhile, Tsubaki Kyota has commitment issues...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8HHZ7h4zHW8VfLYFc0UyoHV86X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205049'),
  ('606753753195153703', 'Love for Life', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gu Changwei, Christopher Doyle, Gu Changwei', 'Gu Changwei, Yang Weiwei', 'Zhang Ziyi, Aaron Kwok, Jiang Wenli, Pu Cunxin, Wang Baoqiang, Tao Zeru, Sun Haiying, Li Danyang', null, 'Set in a small Chinese village where HIV virus is spreading rapidly as a result of illicit blood trade, Mo shu wai zhuan revolves around De Yi and Qinqin are both estranged from their respective family because of their disease and unexpectedly find love with each other by their misfortunes.', 'Set in a small Chinese village where HIV virus is spreading rapidly as a result of illicit blood trade, Mo shu wai zhuan revolves around De Yi and Qinqin are both estranged from their respective family because of their disease and unexpectedly find love with each other by their misfortunes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atXPsIojYFnCBHqXldG6txtH1Wj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75463'),
  ('489118238863215955', 'Love for Sale', 2006, 'Drama', 'Karim Aïnouz, Walter Carvalho, Pedro Freire', 'Felipe Bragança, Karim Aïnouz, Simone Lima', 'Hermila Guedes, João Miguel, Maria Menezes, Georgina Castro, Zezita Matos, Marcélia Cartaxo, Claudio Jaborandy, Flávio Bauraqui', null, 'In northern Brazil, Hermila patiently waits for her husband. However, he has abandoned her. Sexy, restless and resolute, she raffles off "a night in paradise" with herself. This beautifully-shot portrait doesn''t shy away from the burdens of a young scarred woman, but it also celebrates her courage to live according to her own rules.', 'In northern Brazil, Hermila patiently waits for her husband. However, he has abandoned her. Sexy, restless and resolute, she raffles off "a night in paradise" with herself. This beautifully-shot portrait doesn''t shy away from the burdens of a young scarred woman, but it also celebrates her courage to live according to her own rules.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FOBw7lqYBwQiXWV9QtwzFXhNpW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95342'),
  ('559190288506370878', 'Love Forbidden', 2002, 'Drama', 'Rodolphe Marconi, Duccio Cimatti', 'Rodolphe Marconi', 'Rodolphe Marconi, Andrea Necci, Echo Danon, Hervé Brunon', null, 'Rodolphe Marconi writes, directs, and stars in the coming-out drama Défense d''Aimer (Love Forbidden). Marconi plays Bruce, a young student from Paris who accepts a fellowship in Rome. He takes a flat at the Villa Medicis and writes full time. He eventually meets Italian native Matteo (Andrea Necci) and develops feelings for the man. However, Bruce is confused because Matteo also seems interested in the American student Irene (Irene D''Agostino). Love Forbidden premiered in the U.S. at the 2003 New York Lesbian and Gay Film Festival.', 'Rodolphe Marconi writes, directs, and stars in the coming-out drama Défense d''Aimer (Love Forbidden). Marconi plays Bruce, a young student from Paris who accepts a fellowship in Rome. He takes a flat at the Villa Medicis and writes full time. He eventually meets Italian native Matteo (Andrea Necci) and develops feelings for the man. However, Bruce is confused because Matteo also seems interested in the American student Irene (Irene D''Agostino). Love Forbidden premiered in the U.S. at the 2003 New York Lesbian and Gay Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUZJt7aVFs1ajyV4evyLP207Nxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197563'),
  ('38056428625231435', 'Love Forecast', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Park Jin-pyo, Sung Seung-taek', 'Moon Hyun-suk', 'Lee Seung-gi, Moon Chae-won, Lee Seo-jin, Jung Joon-young, Go Yoon, Park Soo-young, Ryu Hwa-young, Sieun', null, 'Whenever elementary school teacher Kang Joon-soo falls in love, he always gives too much of himself to the relationship. Yet despite that, he ends up being the one getting dumped by his girlfriends. Joon-soo has been friends for 18 years with Kim Hyun-woo, a weather forecaster whose beauty belies her witty tongue and aggressive manner.', 'Whenever elementary school teacher Kang Joon-soo falls in love, he always gives too much of himself to the relationship. Yet despite that, he ends up being the one getting dumped by his girlfriends. Joon-soo has been friends for 18 years with Kim Hyun-woo, a weather forecaster whose beauty belies her witty tongue and aggressive manner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBvKRr5oS6Ao4POslwlGzIuBXdH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313628'),
  ('599963097194151471', 'Love Forever', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Staffan Lindberg, Erik Nordlund', 'Staffan Lindberg', 'Matilda Källström, Charlie Gustafsson, Kjell Bergqvist, Anja Lundqvist, Claes Malmberg, Barbro ''Babben'' Larsson, Vilhelm Blomgren, Doreen Ndagire', 'R', 'A Stockholm couple plans to get married on the gorgeous island of Gotland, where family-imposed traditions turn their most important day into a disaster.', 'A Stockholm couple plans to get married on the gorgeous island of Gotland, where family-imposed traditions turn their most important day into a disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2yAyz0PR43aIxnGjv9HJryHBys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214481'),
  ('368231248103398535', 'Love from a Stranger', 1937, 'Mystery, Thriller, Romance', 'Rowland V. Lee, Philip Tannura', 'Frances Marion', 'Ann Harding, Basil Rathbone, Binnie Hale, Bruce Seton, Jean Cadell, Bryan Powley, Joan Hickson, Donald Calthrop', null, 'Ann Harding plays a lovely but somewhat naive young woman who goes on a European vacation after winning a lottery. Swept off her feet by charming Basil Rathbone, Harding finds herself married before she is fully able to grasp the situation. Slowly but surely, Rathbone''s loving veneer crumbles; when he casually asks Harding to sign a document turning her entire fortune over to him, she deduces that her days are numbered.', 'Ann Harding plays a lovely but somewhat naive young woman who goes on a European vacation after winning a lottery. Swept off her feet by charming Basil Rathbone, Harding finds herself married before she is fully able to grasp the situation. Slowly but surely, Rathbone''s loving veneer crumbles; when he casually asks Harding to sign a document turning her entire fortune over to him, she deduces that her days are numbered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypSivSzOXrmDFNqJruIQzr4G0ip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29288'),
  ('472554815967433427', 'Love from Mother Only', 2003, 'Horror', 'Dennison Ramalho, José Roberto Eliezer', null, 'Everaldo Pontes, Débora Muniz, Vera Valdez, Rynaldo Papoy, José Salles', null, 'Filho is a miserable bastard. He''s divided between the duty of nursing his fanatic mother and his obsessive lust for Formosa - a whore of Satan . His dilemma casts him into an abyss of violence, witchcraft, death and demonic trance.', 'Filho is a miserable bastard. He''s divided between the duty of nursing his fanatic mother and his obsessive lust for Formosa - a whore of Satan . His dilemma casts him into an abyss of violence, witchcraft, death and demonic trance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2B3EqWwibM6yDElinjkcovFst7z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124413'),
  ('549855925592996488', 'Love Games', 2016, 'Romance, Thriller', 'Vikram Bhatt, Sameer Khan', 'Vikram Bhatt', 'Gaurav Arora, Tara Alisha Berry, Patralekhaa, Hiten Tejwani, Alisha Farrer, Rukhsar Rehman', null, 'A pair of nymphomaniacs compete in seducing couples to sleep with them.', 'A pair of nymphomaniacs compete in seducing couples to sleep with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZbfW7ZycVrruGl3tEQcrTECwBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391774'),
  ('546498661269481382', 'Love Gets a Room', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Susana García Díez, Rafael García, Rodrigo Cortés', 'Rodrigo Cortés, David Safier', 'Clara Rugaard, Ferdia Walsh-Peelo, Mark Ryder, Valentina Bellè, Jack Roth, Freya Parks, Dalit Streett Tejeda, Anastasia Hille', null, 'January 1942, in Nazi-occupied Poland during World War II. Thousands of Jews have been confined to the Warsaw ghetto for more than a year. Outside, life goes on; inside, they struggle to survive another day. Still, on a cold winter night, a group of Jewish actors manage to stage a lively musical comedy.', 'January 1942, in Nazi-occupied Poland during World War II. Thousands of Jews have been confined to the Warsaw ghetto for more than a year. Outside, life goes on; inside, they struggle to survive another day. Still, on a cold winter night, a group of Jewish actors manage to stage a lively musical comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfzXouYUfnIfEK9l7neFV3nFrjz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:875419'),
  ('81987384654876762', 'Love Ghost', 2001, 'Horror', 'Kazuyuki Shibuya, Tokushō Kikumura, Hideki Onuki', 'Naoyuki Tomomatsu', 'Risa Goto, Ryuhei Matsuda, Kumiko Akiyoshi, Asumi Miwa, Shinji Takahashi, Hitomi Miwa, Yuki Inomata, Kazusa Matsuda', null, 'Teenager Midori''s family moves back to the city where she lived as a child and is relieved to discover that her old friend Ryusuke still lives there. Her terrifying nightmares begin intersecting with her everyday life. Do her nightly dreams about an anonymous fortune-teller have anything to do with the tragedies plaguing her high school?', 'Teenager Midori''s family moves back to the city where she lived as a child and is relieved to discover that her old friend Ryusuke still lives there. Her terrifying nightmares begin intersecting with her everyday life. Do her nightly dreams about an anonymous fortune-teller have anything to do with the tragedies plaguing her high school?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hV6HKpePIUgZeu0rhOKTtgr7qtI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153420'),
  ('1041879010863634310', 'Love God', 1999, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Frank Grow, Terry Stacey', 'Frank Grow', 'Will Keenan, Shannon Burkett, Kymberli Ghee, Kerri Kenney, Yukio Yamamoto, Dale Soules, Michael Laurence, Vin Knight', null, 'Manhattan, 1996. All mental hospitals must cut their patient load by a third, and LaRue (Will Keenan) is sent out onto the streets with "chronic reading syndrome". He ends up at the Love Hotel (where most of the inmates are being held), and falls in love with a mute girl who''s obsessive mother dominates her life. To top it all off, LaRue is given a roommate with Tourette''s syndrome and is chased by a prehistoric worm that inhabits peoples bodies and mutates them.', 'Manhattan, 1996. All mental hospitals must cut their patient load by a third, and LaRue (Will Keenan) is sent out onto the streets with "chronic reading syndrome". He ends up at the Love Hotel (where most of the inmates are being held), and falls in love with a mute girl who''s obsessive mother dominates her life. To top it all off, LaRue is given a roommate with Tourette''s syndrome and is chased by a prehistoric worm that inhabits peoples bodies and mutates them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoMfCS3XNj34UtzXgXRW9Gs7YGQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112666'),
  ('1107594190958105187', 'Love Guide for Dumpees', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Lee Je-woo, Ha Ki-ho, Baek Yoon-seuk', 'Ha Ki-ho', 'Yoon Kye-sang, Han Ye-ri, Park Byung-eun, Park Hyo-ju, Jeong Soo-young, Jo Bok-rae, Kim Chang-hwan, Kim Eui-sung', null, 'Jung-hoon and Si-hoo, both fresh from breakups, make a pact to have nine casual flings. As their encounters continue, their connection intensifies, blurring the lines between friendship and love.', 'Jung-hoon and Si-hoo, both fresh from breakups, make a pact to have nine casual flings. As their encounters continue, their connection intensifies, blurring the lines between friendship and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdJqXp1cA4Mg8ZLeeTv1mQikvKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373855'),
  ('135973463421369534', 'Love Happens', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Brandon Camp, Eric Alan Edwards, John MacCarthy', 'Brandon Camp, Mike Thompson', 'Aaron Eckhart, Jennifer Aniston, Dan Fogler, Judy Greer, Martin Sheen, Deirdre Blades, John Carroll Lynch, Sasha Alexander', 'PG-13', 'Dr. Burke Ryan is a successful self-help author and motivational speaker with a secret. While he helps thousands of people cope with tragedy and personal loss, he secretly is unable to overcome the death of his late wife. It''s not until Burke meets a fiercely independent florist named Eloise that he is forced to face his past and overcome his demons.', 'Dr. Burke Ryan is a successful self-help author and motivational speaker with a secret. While he helps thousands of people cope with tragedy and personal loss, he secretly is unable to overcome the death of his late wife. It''s not until Burke meets a fiercely independent florist named Eloise that he is forced to face his past and overcome his demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijRJlhAZ7QMkTIVAUkIY8stWfk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25643'),
  ('123911758822342275', 'Love Happy', 1949, 'Comedy', 'David Miller, William C. Mellor', 'Frank Tashlin, Mac Benoff', 'Groucho Marx, Harpo Marx, Chico Marx, Ilona Massey, Vera-Ellen, Marion Hutton, Raymond Burr, Melville Cooper', 'NR', 'The Marx Brothers help young Broadway hopefuls when they get mixed up with gangsters due to a tin of sardines containing Romanoff diamonds.', 'The Marx Brothers help young Broadway hopefuls when they get mixed up with gangsters due to a tin of sardines containing Romanoff diamonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ha5gq3O5d09OihXO2siVrEWAj37.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26814'),
  ('1015595307315329359', 'Love Hard', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Shane Hurlbut, Ben Cairns, Hernán Jiménez', 'Daniel Mackey, Rebecca Ewing', 'Nina Dobrev, Jimmy O. Yang, Darren Barnet, James Saito, Rebecca Staab, Harry Shum Jr., Mikaela Hoover, Matty Finochio', null, 'An LA girl, unlucky in love, falls for an East Coast guy on a dating app and decides to surprise him for Christmas, only to discover that she''s been catfished. But the object of her affection actually lives in the same town, and the guy who duped her offers to set them up if she pretends to be his own girlfriend for the holidays.', 'An LA girl, unlucky in love, falls for an East Coast guy on a dating app and decides to surprise him for Christmas, only to discover that she''s been catfished. But the object of her affection actually lives in the same town, and the guy who duped her offers to set them up if she pretends to be his own girlfriend for the holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/issJnV3iSZCMxUHXJPnqC56d7PE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734265'),
  ('728729086491496542', 'Love Hina Christmas Special: Silent Eve', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Yoshiaki Iwasaki, Hideyuki Tanaka', 'Sho Aikawa', 'Yui Horie, Yuji Ueda, Junko Noda, Masayo Kurata, Megumi Hayashibara, Reiko Takagi, Satsuki Yukino, Yumiko Kobayashi', null, 'As another round of preliminary tests approach for Keitarō, so does Christmas. And as the first Christmas of the millennium, there is a rumor that if one confesses his love on this special eve it will come true. Keitarō has decided what he needs to do on this Christmas eve. But being a retaker, can he afford taking attention away from the tests on the same day?', 'As another round of preliminary tests approach for Keitarō, so does Christmas. And as the first Christmas of the millennium, there is a rumor that if one confesses his love on this special eve it will come true. Keitarō has decided what he needs to do on this Christmas eve. But being a retaker, can he afford taking attention away from the tests on the same day?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cNhwxu2MkKYPcfY5osTe3bwsb9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37047'),
  ('790037629411868988', 'Love Hostel', 2022, 'Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Vivek Shah, Abhishek Banerjee, Anmol Ahuja', 'Mehak Jamal, Yogi Singha', 'Vikrant Massey, Sanya Malhotra, Bobby Deol, Raj Arjun, Swaroopa Ghosh, Aditi Vasudev, Sidharth Bhardwaj, Yogi Singha', null, 'Set against the pulsating backdrop of rustic North India, Love Hostel traces the volatile journey of star-crossed lovers, being hunted by a ruthless mercenary on the orders of the area''s MLA, who also happens to be the girl''s grandmother.', 'Set against the pulsating backdrop of rustic North India, Love Hostel traces the volatile journey of star-crossed lovers, being hunted by a ruthless mercenary on the orders of the area''s MLA, who also happens to be the girl''s grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjp2tU35OCLErpIG5pKqgBc9Ch7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828901'),
  ('185444158995099664', 'Love Hotel', 1985, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shinji Sōmai, Koji Enokido, Noboru Shinoda', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Noriko Hayami, Minori Terada, Kiriko Shimizu, Nobutaka Masutomi, Rie Nakagawa, Masatô Ibu, Toshinori Omi, Koichi Sato', null, 'A call-girl named Yumi and Tetsuro, a married man with a debt to the yakuza, have a violent rendezvous in a cheap love hotel. Years later, haunted by the memory of that night, they reconnect and begin a strange love affair. Determined to finish what they started, they return to the scene of their first macabre passion.', 'A call-girl named Yumi and Tetsuro, a married man with a debt to the yakuza, have a violent rendezvous in a cheap love hotel. Years later, haunted by the memory of that night, they reconnect and begin a strange love affair. Determined to finish what they started, they return to the scene of their first macabre passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFkf5tZMnxxUoL6iwYVcEsohcbf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115788'),
  ('570280710637290798', 'Love Hurts', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Barra Grant, Alan Caso', 'Barra Grant', 'Richard E. Grant, Carrie-Anne Moss, Johnny Pacar, Jenna Elfman, Janeane Garofalo, Camryn Manheim, Caroline Aaron, Jeffrey Nordling', 'PG-13', 'After his wife leaves him, middle-aged Ben Bingham slips into a funk and refuses to change out of his pajamas. Justin, Ben''s 17-year-old son, has the cure for what ails his depressed dad: he gives Ben a makeover and pushes him out into the singles scene. Soon Ben is the most popular guy in town, but when Justin falls in love for the first time, Ben must refocus his priorities and set about trying to win back his wife.', 'After his wife leaves him, middle-aged Ben Bingham slips into a funk and refuses to change out of his pajamas. Justin, Ben''s 17-year-old son, has the cure for what ails his depressed dad: he gives Ben a makeover and pushes him out into the singles scene. Soon Ben is the most popular guy in town, but when Justin falls in love for the first time, Ben must refocus his priorities and set about trying to win back his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YKxwZMbbgwjvf9cDPgtFwyOdnJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24881'),
  ('209316457065433070', 'Love Hurts', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mirca Viola', 'Mirca Viola, Cinzia Panzettini', 'Stefania Rocca, Nicole Grimaudo, Paolo Briguglia, Diane Fleri, Claudio Bigagli, Stefano Dionisi, Giovanni Corrado, Gianmarco Pozzecco', null, 'A holiday in Sicily tests the relationship between Germana and Elisabetta, two friends in the grip of a sentimental crisis.', 'A holiday in Sicily tests the relationship between Germana and Elisabetta, two friends in the grip of a sentimental crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXRuC6NF1G7CmkL0LMPTK2anQ8x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107004'),
  ('261107747043433556', 'Love Hurts', 2025, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Jonathan Eusebio, Lisa Nelson-Fries, Bridger Nielson', 'Matthew Murray, Josh Stoddard', 'Ke Huy Quan, Ariana DeBose, Daniel Wu, Mustafa Shakir, Lio Tipton, Cam Gigandet, Rhys Darby, André Eriksen', 'R', 'A realtor is pulled back into the life he left behind after his former partner-in-crime resurfaces with an ominous message. With his crime-lord brother also on his trail, he must confront his past and the history he never fully buried.', 'A realtor is pulled back into the life he left behind after his former partner-in-crime resurfaces with an ominous message. With his crime-lord brother also on his trail, he must confront his past and the history he never fully buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skPPVeHoTTVVSJlb0Ib5vrqiuA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1226406'),
  ('151168705273382228', 'Love in 39 Degrees', 2024, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Tunç Sahin', 'Uygar Şirin', 'Ayça Ayşin Turan, Furkan Andıç, Cem Davran, Pelinsu Pir, Zeynep Oymak, Ulaşcan Kutlu, Zeynep Dinsel, Fatih Al', null, 'Fatih and Kumru, a lawyer from different cities, team up for a case involving a cheating spouse. They spend 8 hours racing around Izmir gathering evidence, unexpectedly altering their plans and lives.', 'Fatih and Kumru, a lawyer from different cities, team up for a case involving a cheating spouse. They spend 8 hours racing around Izmir gathering evidence, unexpectedly altering their plans and lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8nL536SEMBRcoHs5fipgO7991m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1387198'),
  ('167916655303141419', 'Love in a Fallen City', 1984, 'Romance, Drama, War', 'Ann Hui, Tony Hope', 'Fengcho', 'Cora Miao, Chow Yun-Fat, Keung Chung-Ping, Lisa Chiao Chiao, Helen Ma Hoi-Lun, Chung King-Fai, Eva Lai, Jovy Coudrey', null, 'Taking place in 1941, Love in a Fallen City centers on Pai, a young woman who has been ostracized by her family for divorcing her rich husband. A local match-maker, Mrs. Hsu, takes pity on Pai and decides to bring her to Hong Kong, under the guise of employing her as the Hsu''s nanny, but in reality to introduce her to Fan. Pai and Fan seem to hit it off, but Fan''s refusal to marry Pai soon sours things. However, as the Japanese begin to invade Hong Kong, the two begin to realize their true feelings for each other.', 'Taking place in 1941, Love in a Fallen City centers on Pai, a young woman who has been ostracized by her family for divorcing her rich husband. A local match-maker, Mrs. Hsu, takes pity on Pai and decides to bring her to Hong Kong, under the guise of employing her as the Hsu''s nanny, but in reality to introduce her to Fan. Pai and Fan seem to hit it off, but Fan''s refusal to marry Pai soon sours things. However, as the Japanese begin to invade Hong Kong, the two begin to realize their true feelings for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIu9GuF37L6LYEd3VPcjbFg96kx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171816'),
  ('192164686433389799', 'Love in a Puff', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Edmond Pang, Jason Kwan', 'Edmond Pang, Heiward Mak Hei-Yan', 'Miriam Yeung Chin-Wah, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Cheung Tat-Ming, Jo Kok Cho-Lam, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Charmaine Fong, Sharon Luk Sze-Wan, Roy Szeto Wai-Cheuk', null, 'When the Hong Kong government enacts a ban on smoking cigarettes indoors, hard-core smokers are driven outside and a budding romance develops between two co-workers.', 'When the Hong Kong government enacts a ban on smoking cigarettes indoors, hard-core smokers are driven outside and a budding romance develops between two co-workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1sycHWr3572ovcFH9sFzuvrMNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41993'),
  ('389934215789047651', 'Love In Andalusia', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Michaël Pierrard, Hugo Le Gourrierec, Stéphane Malhuret', 'Anne-Charlotte Kassab, Alexandre Hoffman', 'Agustín Galiana, Maud Baecker, Constance Labbé, Victoria Olloqui, Daniel Lundh, Lola Casamayor, Rodolfo De Souza, Nicolás Gaude', null, 'Claire lands in Andalusia one week ahead of her sister Laura’s wedding, and promptly finds herself falling head over heels for the handsome husband-to-be!', 'Claire lands in Andalusia one week ahead of her sister Laura’s wedding, and promptly finds herself falling head over heels for the handsome husband-to-be!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ui0OaZG45cVzfSgtMfRv56Fs6wc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637930'),
  ('678955326119367580', 'Love in Another Language', 2009, null, 'İlksen Başarır, Hayk Kirakosyan', 'İlksen Başarır, Mert Fırat', 'Mert Fırat, Saadet Işıl Aksoy, Lale Mansur, Emre Karayel, Ayten Uncuoğlu, Metin Coşkun, Şebnem Köstem, Tuğrul Tülek', null, 'Onur, who has been deaf since birth, works as a librarian. His father had left him and his mother when he was seven, and Onur has always blamed himself for this. Although being able to speak, he has chosen to stay silent because of the pitying looks of the people around him. At his friend Vedat''s engagement party, he meets Zeynep, who later finds out about Onur''s hearing disability, but is not bothered by it. She is forced by her overbearing father to leave home and gets a job at a call-center. Having to speak on the phone all day to people she doesn''t know, Zeynep finds peace with Onur, who she communicates with perfectly without speaking...', 'Onur, who has been deaf since birth, works as a librarian. His father had left him and his mother when he was seven, and Onur has always blamed himself for this. Although being able to speak, he has chosen to stay silent because of the pitying looks of the people around him. At his friend Vedat''s engagement party, he meets Zeynep, who later finds out about Onur''s hearing disability, but is not bothered by it. She is forced by her overbearing father to leave home and gets a job at a call-center. Having to speak on the phone all day to people she doesn''t know, Zeynep finds peace with Onur, who she communicates with perfectly without speaking...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svwQqtjS5VFVJza0mAXXaGoWzUL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37570'),
  ('304022279238343079', 'Love in Bloom', 2022, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Rogue Rubin, Tony O''Loughlan', 'Georgia Harrison', 'Susie Abromeit, Julian Haig, Monette Lee, Steven Tandy, Candice Hill, Melina Vidler, Jason Wilder, Lin Yin', 'G', 'When Chicago florist Amelia Hart travels to a small town in Australia to help plan her sister’s wedding, she finds new meaning in the town’s beautiful gardens, and love where she least expected.', 'When Chicago florist Amelia Hart travels to a small town in Australia to help plan her sister’s wedding, she finds new meaning in the town’s beautiful gardens, and love where she least expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GFyu4xOJGd1nV1lx4UfYNKV7WE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888816'),
  ('342193321322393705', 'Love in Bora Bora', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'David Morley', 'Daphné Chollet, Mélanie Rode', 'Laëtitia Milot, Amaury de Crayencour, Philippe Bas, Tiphaine Daviot, Laurent Brissonnaud, Teiva Tapare, Ioan Lenoir, Aurore Bazzara', null, 'Valentine is convinced she’s in love with Jérôme, her best friend and work partner. She decides to share her feelings with him while they’re away in Bora Bora on a business trip. But there’s a bad surprise in store: Jérôme’s new girlfriend, Céleste, has decided to tag along. Valentine will have to put up a real fight to win over the love of her life, under the amused gaze of Marc, their guide in the “lovers’ paradise.” But as the days roll by, Valentine realizes she was wrong about Jérôme, and discovers true love elsewhere…', 'Valentine is convinced she’s in love with Jérôme, her best friend and work partner. She decides to share her feelings with him while they’re away in Bora Bora on a business trip. But there’s a bad surprise in store: Jérôme’s new girlfriend, Céleste, has decided to tag along. Valentine will have to put up a real fight to win over the love of her life, under the amused gaze of Marc, their guide in the “lovers’ paradise.” But as the days roll by, Valentine realizes she was wrong about Jérôme, and discovers true love elsewhere…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mluRIYZSg1YapQx5xYcV4qcmLw8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521873'),
  ('799391233132509365', 'Love in Curaçao', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Johan Nijenhuis', 'Annelouise van Naerssen', 'Isa Hoes, Fedja Louman, Ghislaine van IJperen, Tarikh Janssen, Jasmine Sendar', null, 'Lars is about to marry Bella, but one thing bothers him: his mother has been single for a while. To avoid leaving her alone, he invites her on a sunny vacation to Curaçao. What he doesn''t tell her? It''s actually a solo trip for singles.', 'Lars is about to marry Bella, but one thing bothers him: his mother has been single for a while. To avoid leaving her alone, he invites her on a sunny vacation to Curaçao. What he doesn''t tell her? It''s actually a solo trip for singles.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fcj7AcmJRhPW01LtcfEypygApfyv.jpg', 'plex:movie:verliefd-op-curacao'),
  ('406579942504470991', 'Love in Disguise', 2010, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Leehom Wang, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Leehom Wang, Hung-chieh Chen, Xin Yi Du', 'Leehom Wang, Liu Yifei, Joan Chen, Hank Chen Han-Dian, Qiao Zhenyu, Zhang You, Zhang Zhihong, Gary Mak Wing-Lun', null, 'Famous from an incredibly young age, DMH (Wang Lee Hom) has only ever known a celebrity pop star existence. Yet, despite all the glamour, there is still something lacking in his charmed life - true love. With the help of fellow musician and friend WZB, DMH disguised himself as a regular Joe in the hope of finding true love. While incognito, DMH and WZB stumble across the performance of a classical Chinese orchestra and DMH is immediately captivated by the melodies of the guzheng soloist, LMQ (Crystal Liu Yi-Fei), a student at the Shanghai Conservatory, whose affections lie with the accomplished but arrogant virtuoso, ZXZ. In his attempt to spend more time with LQM, DMH promises to help LQM get together with ZXZ. As DMH and LQM grow closer, it becomes increasingly difficult to conceal his identity.', 'Famous from an incredibly young age, DMH (Wang Lee Hom) has only ever known a celebrity pop star existence. Yet, despite all the glamour, there is still something lacking in his charmed life - true love. With the help of fellow musician and friend WZB, DMH disguised himself as a regular Joe in the hope of finding true love. While incognito, DMH and WZB stumble across the performance of a classical Chinese orchestra and DMH is immediately captivated by the melodies of the guzheng soloist, LMQ (Crystal Liu Yi-Fei), a student at the Shanghai Conservatory, whose affections lie with the accomplished but arrogant virtuoso, ZXZ. In his attempt to spend more time with LQM, DMH promises to help LQM get together with ZXZ. As DMH and LQM grow closer, it becomes increasingly difficult to conceal his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKeQNaeqYtAvkzaB0ZBzu7g5pQv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49704'),
  ('1115565081047008200', 'Love in Harmony Valley', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Justin G. Dyck', 'Keith Cooper', 'Amber Marshall, Eric Hicks, Nina Kiri, Andy Yu, Paula Barrett, Martin Roach, Maya Misaljevic', 'G', 'Emma has anxiously waited to reunite with her best friend Tracey who''s been recovering after a serious accident. But Will, Tracey''s brother, won''t allow it as he blames her for the accident. When forced to work together to better their community, can Will and Emma learn to respect each other?', 'Emma has anxiously waited to reunite with her best friend Tracey who''s been recovering after a serious accident. But Will, Tracey''s brother, won''t allow it as he blames her for the accident. When forced to work together to better their community, can Will and Emma learn to respect each other?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfgYEj8XSh0f1OYLqwPy0cyiuP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:723968'),
  ('906443927553224854', 'Love in Lapland', 2017, 'TV Movie', 'David Quesemand, Arnauld Mercadier, Ludovic Escallier', 'Amanda Sthers, Patrick Renault', 'Tomer Sisley, Julie de Bona, Malonn Lévana, Giorgio Maïetto, Dorothée Jemma, Gianni Giardinelli, William Robquin, Christian Bouillette', null, 'When an administrator in Paris is sent to Sweden to close a toy company before Christmas, she meets the manager, who plays with her heartstrings.', 'When an administrator in Paris is sent to Sweden to close a toy company before Christmas, she meets the manager, who plays with her heartstrings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHe8LOC6zF8JhoZDz3Vw3WjLdIr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493108'),
  ('1099452285052955518', 'Love in Magic', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Cheon Se-hwan', 'Kim Gyoo-won', 'Park Jin-hee, Choi Sung-kook, Yeon Jeong-hun, Choi Won-young, Oh Yoon-ah, Kim Ha-eun, Haha, Park Yong-su', null, 'The story is of a playboy who has, through an unavoidable circumstance, run into a woman from his past. Woo Ji Hoon makes a living as a magician and nothing is easier for him than attracting beautiful women. He has an irresistible charm that draws all females to his side like a magnet - all but one, the charming teacher Koo Hee Won. Ji Hoon tried to make her his latest love possession but was bluntly turned down. As luck would have it both Hee Won and Ji Hoon can''t resist the temptation of arranging a blind date on the Internet setting in motion a firework of hilarious consequences.', 'The story is of a playboy who has, through an unavoidable circumstance, run into a woman from his past. Woo Ji Hoon makes a living as a magician and nothing is easier for him than attracting beautiful women. He has an irresistible charm that draws all females to his side like a magnet - all but one, the charming teacher Koo Hee Won. Ji Hoon tried to make her his latest love possession but was bluntly turned down. As luck would have it both Hee Won and Ji Hoon can''t resist the temptation of arranging a blind date on the Internet setting in motion a firework of hilarious consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogQmIcbJHGyQS5tJIa7g0bJcUYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71476'),
  ('975133533432239104', 'Love in Rome', 1960, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dino Risi, Vana Caruso, Mario Montuori', 'Ennio Flaiano', 'Mylène Demongeot, Peter Baldwin, Elsa Martinelli, Vittorio De Sica, Jacques Sernas, Claudio Gora, Maria Perschy, Umberto Orsini', null, 'A young impoverished aristocrat and struggling writer falls for the charms of an aspiring starlet, whose amoral nature and hungry curiosity drives her from one adventure to another.', 'A young impoverished aristocrat and struggling writer falls for the charms of an aspiring starlet, whose amoral nature and hungry curiosity drives her from one adventure to another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61OlF3kFd3rbGkcPbPYqUq7R25m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92586'),
  ('38676768807248371', 'Love In Separate Beds', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Massimiliano Bruno, Marco Bassano', 'Massimiliano Bruno, Andrea Bassi, Damiano Bruè', 'Edoardo Leo, Claudia Pandolfi, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Giorgio Colangeli, Benedetta Tiberi, Francesca Alati, Marco Quaglia, Federica Cifola', null, 'She hates men, he hates complications - but after one passionate night ties them together, these two irreconcilable opposites are forced to coexist... working at the same school, with a baby on the way! Can a staunch feminist and an oblivious chauvinist find common ground?', 'She hates men, he hates complications - but after one passionate night ties them together, these two irreconcilable opposites are forced to coexist... working at the same school, with a baby on the way! Can a staunch feminist and an oblivious chauvinist find common ground?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAFBd3HqOHA6lZhT0ymu1gM46qT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1397055'),
  ('1058066488990960220', 'Love in Space', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Shya Wing-Hong, Tony Chan', 'Tony Chan, Lucretia Ho', 'Aaron Kwok, Eason Chan Yik-Shun, René Liu, Gwei Lun-mei, AngelaBaby, Jing Boran, Xu Fan, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui', null, 'The film tells the stories of a mother and her three daughters about their own struggles in love. All the women had achieved progress in some way except in love. However, each of them found their own Mr.Right in the end.', 'The film tells the stories of a mother and her three daughters about their own struggles in love. All the women had achieved progress in some way except in love. However, each of them found their own Mr.Right in the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q91EUqCECVmmsKZYkjdgmzvddPa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74641'),
  ('214986653418881658', 'Love In St. Petersburg', 2019, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Reynald Capurro, Christophe Douchand', 'Cécile Lugiez, Cécile Leclere', 'Héléna Noguerra, Thierry Neuvic, Arielle Sémenoff, Leonid Glushchenko, Carolina Jurczak, Diana Rudychenko, Rodion Kosechenko', null, 'Marie is a sweet and lively single mother who gets a Christmas Day surprise - she’s inherited an estate in Saint Petersburg!', 'Marie is a sweet and lively single mother who gets a Christmas Day surprise - she’s inherited an estate in Saint Petersburg!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grUzcyZujxhB0ooWFuwOozjIO0y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644296'),
  ('1091972294604758997', 'Love in Store', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie, Drama', 'William McKnight, Paul Ziller', 'Joie Botkin', 'Alexandra Breckenridge, Robert Buckley, Lisa Chandler, Jackée Harry, Carlo Marks, Naika Toussaint, Holly Dignard, Fiona Vroom', null, 'Two rival home shopping hosts are forced together while competing for a promotion. Along the way they find their on-air chemistry kindles an off-air spark.', 'Two rival home shopping hosts are forced together while competing for a promotion. Along the way they find their on-air chemistry kindles an off-air spark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bp38RHebj0UKLy4C5cqtWcLaqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661336'),
  ('206323007143600101', 'Love in Taipei', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Arvin Chen, Jake Pollock', 'Mackenzie Dohr, Charlie Oh', 'Ashley Liao, Ross Butler, Nico Hiraga, Chelsea Zhang, Cindy Cheung, Chloe Fox, Janet Hsieh, Mason Lee', null, 'A young American woman is sent by her parents to a cultural immersion program in Taipei where she begins a new journey of self-discovery and romance.', 'A young American woman is sent by her parents to a cultural immersion program in Taipei where she begins a new journey of self-discovery and romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iQuQcGHnxlv19rb8yz9Rk8HKnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745391'),
  ('869584199592637027', 'Love in the Afternoon', 1957, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William C. Mellor, Billy Wilder, Ray Taylor Jr.', 'Billy Wilder, I. A. L. Diamond', 'Gary Cooper, Audrey Hepburn, Maurice Chevalier, John McGiver, Van Doude, Lise Bourdin, Olga Valéry, Paul Bonifas', 'NR', 'A middle-aged playboy becomes fascinated by the daughter of a private detective who has been hired to entrap him with a client''s wife.', 'A middle-aged playboy becomes fascinated by the daughter of a private detective who has been hired to entrap him with a client''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCHVviBhRQ7OkJFQfziO2N2ZJmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18299'),
  ('710694289487846324', 'Love in the Afternoon', 1972, 'Drama, Romance', 'Éric Rohmer, Néstor Almendros, Claude Bertrand', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Bernard Verley, Zouzou, Françoise Verley, Daniel Ceccaldi, Malvina Penne, Elisabeth Ferrier, Tina Michelino, Jean-Louis Livi', null, 'Frederic leads a bourgeois life; he is a partner in a small Paris office and is happily married to Helene, a teacher expecting her second child. In the afternoons, Frederic daydreams about other women, but has no intention of taking any action. One day, Chloe, who had been a mistress of an old friend, begins dropping by his office. They meet as friends, irregularly in the afternoons, till eventually Chloe decides to seduce Frederic, causing him a moral dilemma.', 'Frederic leads a bourgeois life; he is a partner in a small Paris office and is happily married to Helene, a teacher expecting her second child. In the afternoons, Frederic daydreams about other women, but has no intention of taking any action. One day, Chloe, who had been a mistress of an old friend, begins dropping by his office. They meet as friends, irregularly in the afternoons, till eventually Chloe decides to seduce Frederic, causing him a moral dilemma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRvqHfzdFST7zQkVaOe4yNsanHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12116'),
  ('1102852043044814087', 'Love in the Big City', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'E.oni, Kim Hyung-joo, Jang Deok-jae', 'Kim Na-deul', 'Kim Go-eun, Steve Sanghyun Noh, Jung Whee, Oh Dong-min, Jang Hye-jin, Lee Sang-yi, Kwak Dong-yeon, Joo Jong-hyuk', null, 'When a carefree woman learns that her closeted friend is gay, the two form an inseparable bond and find comfort in each other''s company.', 'When a carefree woman learns that her closeted friend is gay, the two form an inseparable bond and find comfort in each other''s company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBsnMMFoELfqQ445Uvr2oWxm6mT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1154154'),
  ('370685812422560110', 'Love in the Buff', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Edmond Pang, Jason Kwan', 'Edmond Pang, Luk Yee-Sum', 'Miriam Yeung Chin-Wah, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Xu Zheng, Yang Mi, Huang Xiaoming, Roy Szeto Wai-Cheuk, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Isabel Chan Yat-Ning', null, 'When old flames reunite, will it be second time''s the charm or a case of once bitten twice shy? Jimmy and Cherie, two ex-lovers from Hong Kong, cross paths in Beijing and can''t seem to forget each other, despite being involved with someone else. Torn between fidelity towards their new partners or following their hearts, they explore the struggles, doubts and fears that exist among modern young couples.', 'When old flames reunite, will it be second time''s the charm or a case of once bitten twice shy? Jimmy and Cherie, two ex-lovers from Hong Kong, cross paths in Beijing and can''t seem to forget each other, despite being involved with someone else. Torn between fidelity towards their new partners or following their hearts, they explore the struggles, doubts and fears that exist among modern young couples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTVqndmsHc3PzZ0nmVER5SsRqTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105680'),
  ('547421529418247922', 'Love in the City', 1953, 'Drama, Romance', 'Federico Fellini, Michelangelo Antonioni, Alberto Lattuada', 'Dino Risi, Cesare Zavattini, Alberto Lattuada', 'Rita Josa, Rosanna Carta, Enrico Pelliccia, Donatella Marrosu, Paolo Pacetti, Nella Bertuccioni, Lilia Nardi, Lena Rossi', 'NR', 'Six vignettes explore love and desire in Rome, from prostitution and heartache to unwed motherhood and the male gaze.', 'Six vignettes explore love and desire in Rome, from prostitution and heartache to unwed motherhood and the male gaze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCCrolo9ovoL56gVm7urL0t1Qbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31293'),
  ('667195692815074697', 'Love in the Forecast', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Mike Kam, Christie Will Wolf', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Cindy Busby, Christopher Russell, Donna Benedicto, Ryan McDonell, Jennifer Copping, Peter Graham-Gaudreau, Aason Nadjiwan, Doron Bell', 'G', 'After swearing off dating for a full year, Leah quickly learns her new commitment has made her a magnet for men.', 'After swearing off dating for a full year, Leah quickly learns her new commitment has made her a magnet for men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jM2D5NgBvl7ifSJ5PsreYAxO9vA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696817'),
  ('1110268214217350381', 'Love in the Limelight', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Graham Robbins, Ron Oliver', 'Willie Aames, Winnie Hung, Rich Tabach', 'Alexa PenaVega, Carlos PenaVega, Ivonne Coll, Rene Rivera, B Z Cullins, Robyn Kemp, Karin Argoud, Tamari Dunbar', 'G', 'Pen pals for years, Summer finally meets Nick, her former teen crush and boy band lead singer, when he comes to town for a concert. Their friendship''s set the stage for romance, and Summer''s hip grandma with a TikTok following encourages her to follow her heart.', 'Pen pals for years, Summer finally meets Nick, her former teen crush and boy band lead singer, when he comes to town for a concert. Their friendship''s set the stage for romance, and Summer''s hip grandma with a TikTok following encourages her to follow her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTMKYX0hsJDND2KQ1wQ9hwnincv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000237'),
  ('1122817320307550948', 'Love in the Maldives', 2023, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Colin Theys, Branden James Maxham', 'Juliana Wimbles', 'Jocelyn Hudon, Jake Manley, Lucy Newman-Williams, Juliana Wimbles, Patricia McKenzie, Aisha Hashma Haidar, Iker Anmaday, Ahmed Rishaan', 'G', 'A travel writer goes to the Maldives and hears about a legendary shipwreck. With the help of her underwater resort’s guest experience expert, she might discover love instead of a buried treasure.', 'A travel writer goes to the Maldives and hears about a legendary shipwreck. With the help of her underwater resort’s guest experience expert, she might discover love instead of a buried treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PprbqYxejASjE2g3ZohEc0l9bG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1091799'),
  ('402540469735225829', 'Love in the Strangest Way', 1994, 'Thriller', 'Christopher Frank', 'Christopher Frank, Jean-Marc Roberts', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Maruschka Detmers, Nadia Farès, Johann Martel, Umberto Orsini, Vincent Planchais, Patrick Timsit, Bernard Freyd', null, 'Successful Julien sees his family off on holiday and at once becomes drawn into a risky relationship with Angela, whom he spies outside the cafe opposite his office. When he later finds she is to become his son''s new nanny he rightly starts to worry there is more to the relationship than he bargained for.', 'Successful Julien sees his family off on holiday and at once becomes drawn into a risky relationship with Angela, whom he spies outside the cafe opposite his office. When he later finds she is to become his son''s new nanny he rightly starts to worry there is more to the relationship than he bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8wzzCBtjvxZxNmVSM8PwUrSSzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139874'),
  ('337660593280515936', 'Love in the Sun', 2019, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Bart Tau, Rebecca Saionz, Jacci Herman', null, 'Emeraude Toubia, Tom Maden, Shawn Christian, Betsy Graver, John William Wright, Ashley Jones, Diana Garle, Frank Oakley III', 'G', 'When successful dating app creator Alana hesitantly gets engaged, she returns to her hometown in Florida to deliver the news to her dad. Upon returning home, she crosses paths with her former flame, Kai, and finds herself falling in love with the fun and adventurous lifestyle tied to her community. As Alana and Kai work together to help her dad restore his declining property, Alana finds herself conflicted as to whether or not her current way of living makes her happier than the home and community that she always knew and loved.', 'When successful dating app creator Alana hesitantly gets engaged, she returns to her hometown in Florida to deliver the news to her dad. Upon returning home, she crosses paths with her former flame, Kai, and finds herself falling in love with the fun and adventurous lifestyle tied to her community. As Alana and Kai work together to help her dad restore his declining property, Alana finds herself conflicted as to whether or not her current way of living makes her happier than the home and community that she always knew and loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cI4NE5TM7jUKHnFEVGkAsxXy9g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594697'),
  ('546406201607731125', 'Love in the Time of Cholera', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mike Newell, Affonso Beato', 'Ronald Harwood', 'Javier Bardem, Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Benjamin Bratt, John Leguizamo, Fernanda Montenegro, Catalina Sandino Moreno, Alicia Borrachero, Liev Schreiber', 'R', 'In Colombia just after the Great War, an old man falls from a ladder; dying, he professes great love for his wife. After the funeral, a man calls on the widow - she dismisses him angrily. Flash back more than 50 years to the day Florentino Ariza, a telegraph boy, falls in love with Fermina Daza, the daughter of a mule trader.', 'In Colombia just after the Great War, an old man falls from a ladder; dying, he professes great love for his wife. After the funeral, a man calls on the widow - she dismisses him angrily. Flash back more than 50 years to the day Florentino Ariza, a telegraph boy, falls in love with Fermina Daza, the daughter of a mule trader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7y5VuS218Nqc8eVdeuOrlYWWD0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6639'),
