  ('546876691872513228', 'Love Is All There Is', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Joseph Bologna, Renée Taylor', 'Erik Shapiro, Gabriel Bologna, Joseph Bologna', 'Lainie Kazan, Paul Sorvino, Barbara Carrera, Joseph Bologna, Angelina Jolie, Nathaniel Marston, Renée Taylor, William Hickey', 'R', 'The Malacicis, a hard-working Italian family recently immigrated from Florence, open a fancy restaurant in the Bronx, N.Y., drawing the ire of another clan. Mike and Sadie Capomezzo, equally hard-working Sicilian caterers from the area, find they cannot stand Piero and Maria Malacici. But things get complicated when the Malacicis'' daughter, Gina, and the Capomezzos'' son, Rosario, fall in love.', 'The Malacicis, a hard-working Italian family recently immigrated from Florence, open a fancy restaurant in the Bronx, N.Y., drawing the ire of another clan. Mike and Sadie Capomezzo, equally hard-working Sicilian caterers from the area, find they cannot stand Piero and Maria Malacici. But things get complicated when the Malacicis'' daughter, Gina, and the Capomezzos'' son, Rosario, fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXaewq2LMjTJmZLTuKEM6LJhBo2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55058'),
