  ('677430802700535192', 'Love Is Better Than Life', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Gérard Darmon, Philippe Lellouche, Ary Abittan, Kev Adams, Elsa Zylberstein, Béatrice Dalle, Clémentine Célarié', null, 'Upon their release from prison twen­ty years ear­li­er, Gérard, Ary and Philippe asked them­selves if hon­esty was not the best rack­et of them all. Today, they are insep­a­ra­ble and scrupu­lous­ly above board. But Gérard learns he is ter­mi­nal­ly ill. Their friend’s days being num­bered, Ary and Philippe want to offer him one last love sto­ry… because, as Gérard likes to say : love is bet­ter than life.', 'Upon their release from prison twen­ty years ear­li­er, Gérard, Ary and Philippe asked them­selves if hon­esty was not the best rack­et of them all. Today, they are insep­a­ra­ble and scrupu­lous­ly above board. But Gérard learns he is ter­mi­nal­ly ill. Their friend’s days being num­bered, Ary and Philippe want to offer him one last love sto­ry… because, as Gérard likes to say : love is bet­ter than life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTCgVKi4fSDT547R2oDTdPwgE4J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874773'),
