  ('920333689311580638', 'Love Is Dead', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Éric Capitaine, Lucas Leconte', 'Éric Capitaine, François Bégaudeau, Camille Chamoux', 'Benjamin Lavernhe, Élisa Erka, Aïssa Maïga, Camille Chamoux, Fernand Dubois, François Bégaudeau, Berdine Nusselder, Antoine Gouy', null, 'Mathias Lonisse, founder of the company Love is Dead, is a breakup specialist. He is hired to break up relationships on behalf of those who, for one reason or another, prefer to avoid this often painful and delicate task. Mathias takes his job very seriously and carries out each assignment with a high degree of professionalism, until the day his mother decides to leave his father...', 'Mathias Lonisse, founder of the company Love is Dead, is a breakup specialist. He is hired to break up relationships on behalf of those who, for one reason or another, prefer to avoid this often painful and delicate task. Mathias takes his job very seriously and carries out each assignment with a high degree of professionalism, until the day his mother decides to leave his father...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5RJ3soQFc8p3Tc1poNKm8F4Wbo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427955'),
  ('62033476184156723', 'Love Is in the Air', 2005, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Rémi Bezançon, Antoine Monod', 'Rémi Bezançon', 'Vincent Elbaz, Marion Cotillard, Gilles Lellouche, Elsa Kikoïne, Didier Bezace, Cécile Cassel, Tom Novembre, Philippe Nahon', null, 'Yann Kerbec is a flight instructor: he evaluates pilots’ abilities under extreme conditions on flight simulators. But Yann has a big problem: he is so airsick since he was born in a plane, that he couldn’t even follow the love of his life when she moved to Australia. Yann is now thirty years old and remembers with both nostalgia and humour the numerous love stories he spoiled because of his phobia. Will he finally accept to become a grown up or will he keep making plans in the air?', 'Yann Kerbec is a flight instructor: he evaluates pilots’ abilities under extreme conditions on flight simulators. But Yann has a big problem: he is so airsick since he was born in a plane, that he couldn’t even follow the love of his life when she moved to Australia. Yann is now thirty years old and remembers with both nostalgia and humour the numerous love stories he spoiled because of his phobia. Will he finally accept to become a grown up or will he keep making plans in the air?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQouO8wPkHwrXOjHsWKHJhchJIa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25197'),
