  ('904262844198602526', 'Love Is Love', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Tommy Leung Ga-Shu, Chan Yuen-Kai, Chiu Wai-Kin', 'Gary Tang Tak-Hey, Kim Yip Kwong-Kim', 'Stephen Chow, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Suki Kwan Sau-Mei, Pal Sinn Lap-Man, Shing Fui-On, Pauline Kwan, Woo Fung, Angelina Lo', null, 'Shui and Ti elope off, against the wishes of Ti''s father. They live the life of a struggling young couple. Shui finds a job at a jewelry importer and his hard work is noticed by the boss lady. As Shui moves up the corporate ladder, the chasm between Shui and Ti starts to widen, and the bond between Suki and Shui tightens.', 'Shui and Ti elope off, against the wishes of Ti''s father. They live the life of a struggling young couple. Shui finds a job at a jewelry importer and his hard work is noticed by the boss lady. As Shui moves up the corporate ladder, the chasm between Shui and Ti starts to widen, and the bond between Suki and Shui tightens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hIf7PiqrubopkgphzlndD3SSjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173653'),
