  ('448722768901430274', 'Love is Not Blind', 2011, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Teng Huatao, Lin Yan, Jing Chong', 'Bao Jingjing, Teng Huatao', 'Wen Zhang, Bai Baihe, Guo Jingfei, Zhang Jiayi, David Wang, Zhang Zixuan, Jiao Junyan, Ye Yiyun', null, 'Xiaoxian''s life falls apart when she discovers her boyfriend is cheating on her with her best friend. Heartbroken, she struggles to move on, but her tough co-worker Jian steps in with a tough-love approach to help her heal.', 'Xiaoxian''s life falls apart when she discovers her boyfriend is cheating on her with her best friend. Heartbroken, she struggles to move on, but her tough co-worker Jian steps in with a tough-love approach to help her heal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcSINzV5f7TkTidfoPJY5JThLHr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79824'),
  ('951187789755895700', 'Love Is Not Perfect', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Francesca Muci, Vittorio Omodei Zorini, Gianluca Mazzella', 'Francesca Muci, Gianni Romoli', 'Anna Foglietta, Bruno Wolkowitch, Giulio Berruti, Camilla Filippi, Lorena Cacciatore', null, 'Elena is a beautiful, 35-year-old accomplished woman who has an unhealthy obsession with perfection. Elena''s well-ordered life is thrown into chaos, however, when she meets Adriana, an 18-year-old seductive young woman who offers passion and excitement, and Hector, an older man who offers Elena stability and security. Elena quickly realizes though that Adriana is too immature and too young for her, so she tries to end their romance, but for Adriana the rejection is just another game to play', 'Elena is a beautiful, 35-year-old accomplished woman who has an unhealthy obsession with perfection. Elena''s well-ordered life is thrown into chaos, however, when she meets Adriana, an 18-year-old seductive young woman who offers passion and excitement, and Hector, an older man who offers Elena stability and security. Elena quickly realizes though that Adriana is too immature and too young for her, so she tries to end their romance, but for Adriana the rejection is just another game to play', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAFZMJxHyeywzIKfxOG4cFJUvRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179319'),
  ('105475513657090526', 'Love Is Not What It Used to Be', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Gabriel Ochoa', 'Gabriel Ochoa, Rafael Cobos, Ada Hernández', 'Alberto San Juan, Blanca Romero, Nicolás Coronado, Aida Folch, Carlos Álvarez-Nóvoa, Petra Martínez, Jose Coronado', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nfljlxkJ5NH4cLitM5epgvMTS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185736'),
  ('83634860608352536', 'Love Is on the Way', 2026, 'Comedy, Mystery, Romance', 'Liu Deqiang', 'Liu Deqiang', 'Gao Xiaopan, Li Mengmeng, Li Ming, Gong Yuefei, Liu Deqiang, Zhang Yang, Zhao Ming, Jingbo Guo', null, 'A "lying flat" youth exposes a loan shark, falls in love with a "super striver," and their turbulent romance overcomes various scams and financial disasters.', 'A "lying flat" youth exposes a loan shark, falls in love with a "super striver," and their turbulent romance overcomes various scams and financial disasters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouAaqGz1aAzPXbnt7zciIVMB20E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1565586'),
  ('562171452314749993', 'Love Is Overrated', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mourad Winter, André Chemetoff, Emmanuelle Fourault', 'Mourad Winter', 'Hakim Jemili, Laura Felpin, Benjamin Tranié, Abdulah Sissoko, Alassane Diong, Steve Tientcheu, François Damiens, Saïda Jawad', null, 'Diagnosed «crap with girls» by his friends, Anis’ love life has barely a pulse. Three years after the loss of Isma, his best friend and mentor, Anis takes his courage in both hands and decides finally to get out and meet people again. And the person he meets is Madeleine. Thinking she’s way out of his league, Anis gets tangled in a web of silly lies trying to impress her. But something huge is about to start. An unexpected thing. A thing called love.', 'Diagnosed «crap with girls» by his friends, Anis’ love life has barely a pulse. Three years after the loss of Isma, his best friend and mentor, Anis takes his courage in both hands and decides finally to get out and meet people again. And the person he meets is Madeleine. Thinking she’s way out of his league, Anis gets tangled in a web of silly lies trying to impress her. But something huge is about to start. An unexpected thing. A thing called love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gbHgEfP8h64HrW3mXpurirbZLC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1071064'),
  ('913012735546480489', 'Love Is Strange', 2014, 'Drama', 'Christos Voudouris, Ira Sachs, Chris Carroll', 'Mauricio Zacharias, Ira Sachs', 'John Lithgow, Alfred Molina, Marisa Tomei, Darren E. Burrows, Charlie Tahan, Cheyenne Jackson, Manny Perez, Christina Kirk', 'R', 'After 39 years together, Ben and George finally tie the knot, but George loses his job as a result, and the newlyweds must sell their New York apartment and live apart, relying on friends and family to make ends meet.', 'After 39 years together, Ben and George finally tie the knot, but George loses his job as a result, and the newlyweds must sell their New York apartment and live apart, relying on friends and family to make ends meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nkM5aUSTMvXudUB3M0FgZ6voqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244268'),
  ('835623455978705242', 'Love Is the Devil: Study for a Portrait of Francis Bacon', 1998, 'Drama', 'John Maybury, John Mathieson, Olivia Lloyd', 'John Maybury', 'Derek Jacobi, Daniel Craig, Tilda Swinton, Anne Lambton, Adrian Scarborough, Karl Johnson, Annabel Brooks, Ulla Larson-Styles', null, 'In the 1960s, British painter Francis Bacon surprises a burglar and invites him to share his bed. The burglar, a working class man named George Dyer, accepts. After the unique beginning to their love affair, the well-connected and volatile artist assimilates Dyer into his circle of eccentric friends, as Dyer''s struggle with addiction strains their bond.', 'In the 1960s, British painter Francis Bacon surprises a burglar and invites him to share his bed. The burglar, a working class man named George Dyer, accepts. After the unique beginning to their love affair, the well-connected and volatile artist assimilates Dyer into his circle of eccentric friends, as Dyer''s struggle with addiction strains their bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zPTMTbYPhXXzAo5UQkeSpcmSMl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4975'),
  ('1083587340050816442', 'Love Is the Perfect Crime', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Arnaud Larrieu, Jean-Marie Larrieu, Guillaume Deffontaines', 'Arnaud Larrieu, Jean-Marie Larrieu', 'Mathieu Amalric, Karin Viard, Maïwenn, Sara Forestier, Denis Podalydès, Marion Duval, Damien Dorsaz, Carl Von Malaisé', null, 'Marc, in his 40s, is a professor of literature at the University of Lausanne. Still a bachelor — and still living with his sister Marianne in a huge, isolated chalet that they inherited when they were very young — he carries on one love affair after another with his students. Winter has almost ended when one of his most brilliant students, Barbara, suddenly disappears. Two days later, Marc meets Barbara’s mother, Anna, who wants to find out more about her vanished daughter.', 'Marc, in his 40s, is a professor of literature at the University of Lausanne. Still a bachelor — and still living with his sister Marianne in a huge, isolated chalet that they inherited when they were very young — he carries on one love affair after another with his students. Winter has almost ended when one of his most brilliant students, Barbara, suddenly disappears. Two days later, Marc meets Barbara’s mother, Anna, who wants to find out more about her vanished daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9AsdAQGOB2KV05l9LursBw2Z7i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214093'),
  ('790523610863299834', 'Love Jacked', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Alfons Adetuyi', 'Linda Eskeland', 'Amber Stevens West, Keith David, Lyriq Bent, Mike Epps, Marla Gibbs, Nicole Lyn, Shamier Anderson', null, 'Maya, a headstrong 28-year-old with artistic ambitions – a strong contrast to what her father Ed wants: a dutiful daughter to run the family store. Ed is shocked when Maya takes her assertions of independence a step further and decides to travel to Africa for inspiration and returns with a fiancé who is not quite what he seems.', 'Maya, a headstrong 28-year-old with artistic ambitions – a strong contrast to what her father Ed wants: a dutiful daughter to run the family store. Ed is shocked when Maya takes her assertions of independence a step further and decides to travel to Africa for inspiration and returns with a fiancé who is not quite what he seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quGrtVer6MPfAY6gEDm0JA1ugZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537406'),
  ('640141977430780681', 'Love Jones', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Theodore Witcher, Ernest Holzman, James Giovannetti Jr.', 'Theodore Witcher', 'Larenz Tate, Nia Long, Isaiah Washington, Bill Bellamy, Lisa Nicole Carson, Marie-Françoise Theodore, Khalil Kain, Leonard Roberts', 'R', 'Darius Lovehall is a young black poet in Chicago who starts dating Nina Moseley, a beautiful and talented photographer. While trying to figure out if they''ve got a "love thing" or are just "kicking it," they hang out with their friends, talking about love and sex. Then Nina tests the strength of Darius'' feelings and sets a chain of romantic complications into motion.', 'Darius Lovehall is a young black poet in Chicago who starts dating Nina Moseley, a beautiful and talented photographer. While trying to figure out if they''ve got a "love thing" or are just "kicking it," they hang out with their friends, talking about love and sex. Then Nina tests the strength of Darius'' feelings and sets a chain of romantic complications into motion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuwimPkDm7kfptKm5zlK0pIzqXM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27322'),
  ('355888571201333726', 'Love Ke Liye Kuch Bhi Karega', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Eeshwar Nivas, Venkat Prasad', null, 'Saif Ali Khan, Fardeen Khan, Aftab Shivdasani, Sonali Bendre, Twinkle Khanna, Johny Lever, Dalip Tahil, Snehal Dabi', null, 'Desperate for money, three men plot to kidnap a woman and hold her for ransom.', 'Desperate for money, three men plot to kidnap a woman and hold her for ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phYkZeowbcNpdGqKIQ14jffVEdp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142631'),
  ('911702161257176911', 'Love Lasts Three Years', 2011, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Frédéric Beigbeder, Yves Cape, David Quesemand', 'Frédéric Beigbeder', 'Louise Bourgoin, Gaspard Proust, JoeyStarr, Jonathan Lambert, Frédérique Bel, Nicolas Bedos, Valérie Lemercier, Elisa Sednaoui', null, 'A heartbroken literary critic turns his despair into creativity following a bitter divorce, only to encounter an enchanting beauty who poses a major challenge to his newfound cynicism. Marc Marronnier thought his marriage was going well until his wife deemed him immature, and left him for a high-profile writer. Devastated, he began filtering all of his heartache into a misanthropic manuscript decrying the virtues of true love. But later, when Marc falls hard for his cousin''s radiant and gorgeous wife, his entire life is turned upside down. Louise Bourgoin and Gaspard Proust star in a film by actor and author-turned-director Frederic Beigbeder.', 'A heartbroken literary critic turns his despair into creativity following a bitter divorce, only to encounter an enchanting beauty who poses a major challenge to his newfound cynicism. Marc Marronnier thought his marriage was going well until his wife deemed him immature, and left him for a high-profile writer. Devastated, he began filtering all of his heartache into a misanthropic manuscript decrying the virtues of true love. But later, when Marc falls hard for his cousin''s radiant and gorgeous wife, his entire life is turned upside down. Louise Bourgoin and Gaspard Proust star in a film by actor and author-turned-director Frederic Beigbeder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eO8O5SwT1bQMHtW6kqEPteMVeiX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85735'),
  ('696750349087883904', 'Love Laughs at Andy Hardy', 1946, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Willis Goldbeck, Robert H. Planck, Douglas Shearer', 'William Ludwig, Harry Ruskin', 'Mickey Rooney, Lewis Stone, Sara Haden, Bonita Granville, Lina Romay, Fay Holden, Dorothy Ford, Hal Hackett', 'NR', 'Andy Hardy goes to college after serving in the war and finds his sweetheart is engaged to someone else.', 'Andy Hardy goes to college after serving in the war and finds his sweetheart is engaged to someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9KOUCgJRgWEQbhHcZJaoGrwyGH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43483'),
  ('730734321375924761', 'Love Lesson', 2013, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Ko Kyeong-Ah', 'Kim Se-hwi', 'Kim Sun-young, Byun Jun-suk, Oh Cho-hee, Kim Ji-hoon, Heo Jung-min, Min Ji-Hyuk, Kim Da-bin, Nam Tae-boo', null, 'Korea''s most popular song writer Hee-soo runs into a nineteen-year-old boy in the elevator. Hee-soo is inspired by a new song watching him shake at her figure. She starts to tell him about women under the excuse that she''s teaching him music. They fall for each other but things get complicated when her life teacher, Joon-ho who taught her about life and music comes back.', 'Korea''s most popular song writer Hee-soo runs into a nineteen-year-old boy in the elevator. Hee-soo is inspired by a new song watching him shake at her figure. She starts to tell him about women under the excuse that she''s teaching him music. They fall for each other but things get complicated when her life teacher, Joon-ho who taught her about life and music comes back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUQg6yvZIRQUSyQ36TQo0Tp1gzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286687'),
  ('792608313040224774', 'Love Letter', 1953, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hiroshi Suzuki, Teruo Ishii, Kinuyo Tanaka', 'Keisuke Kinoshita', 'Masayuki Mori, Yoshiko Kuga, Jūkichi Uno, Jûzô Dôsan, Chieko Seki, Shizue Natsukawa, Kyōko Anzai, Yumi Takano', null, 'A sad and troubled man finds a new job five years after the end of WWII, where he writes love letters for other people.', 'A sad and troubled man finds a new job five years after the end of WWII, where he writes love letters for other people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kicuTbtEvWYWxUuiNGJWnwPihm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270055'),
  ('549817457768753245', 'Love Letter', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shunji Iwai, Isao Yukisada, Nobuyasu Kita', 'Shunji Iwai', 'Miho Nakayama, Etsushi Toyokawa, Miki Sakai, Takashi Kashiwabara, Bunjaku Han, Katsuyuki Shinohara, Mariko Kaga, Keiichi Suzuki', 'PG', 'Hiroko attends the memorial service of her fiancé, Itsuki Fujii, who died in a mountain-climbing incident. Although Itsuki''s mother says that their old house is gone, Hiroko records the address listed under his name in his yearbook and sends him a letter. Surprisingly, she receives a reply, and discovers it came from his old classmate, a girl who also happens to be called Itsuki Fujii.', 'Hiroko attends the memorial service of her fiancé, Itsuki Fujii, who died in a mountain-climbing incident. Although Itsuki''s mother says that their old house is gone, Hiroko records the address listed under his name in his yearbook and sends him a letter. Surprisingly, she receives a reply, and discovers it came from his old classmate, a girl who also happens to be called Itsuki Fujii.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iAgQSkt9z34DTYQfpG0M69SyiL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47002'),
  ('667339981786924555', 'Love Letter in the Sand', 1988, 'Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Hisayasu Satō, Kōichi Saitō, Takahisa Zeze', 'Shirō Yumeno', 'Maya Shiraki, Yoko Fujita, Takeshi Itō, Masahiko Sakata, Masahiko Itoh, Shigeru Sasaki, Takaaki Hashiguchi, Tetsu Sokura', null, 'During a month of unusually heavy rain in Tokyo, a mystery assailant has been brutally assaulting and killing people with a metal bat. When a handsome young man with amnesia is found outside an area hospital, the nurse who discovered him begins to suspect that he may in fact be the assailant. But her own strange erotic fixations with him, and the questionable involvement of the doctor tasked with the amnesia victim, lead them all down an increasingly twisted path of deeply-rooted trauma and violence.', 'During a month of unusually heavy rain in Tokyo, a mystery assailant has been brutally assaulting and killing people with a metal bat. When a handsome young man with amnesia is found outside an area hospital, the nurse who discovered him begins to suspect that he may in fact be the assailant. But her own strange erotic fixations with him, and the questionable involvement of the doctor tasked with the amnesia victim, lead them all down an increasingly twisted path of deeply-rooted trauma and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cY38TTfxY2I2GFJDmQDmrXypYun.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351962'),
  ('734775758603448769', 'Love Letter to Edie', 1975, 'Documentary', 'Robert Maier', 'Robert Maier', 'Edith Massey, John Waters, Pat Moran, Mink Stole, Dolores DeLuce, Vincent Peranio, Ed Peranio, Mary Vivian Pearce', null, 'A documentary about actress Edith Massey in which she talks about her life and her career in film.', 'A documentary about actress Edith Massey in which she talks about her life and her career in film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olo1SpOj4fO8txl2JU13dF8HJ4Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116180'),
  ('478367880132213204', 'Love Letters', 1945, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'William Dieterle, Lee Garmes', 'Ayn Rand', 'Jennifer Jones, Joseph Cotten, Ann Richards, Cecil Kellaway, Gladys Cooper, Anita Louise, Robert Sully, Reginald Denny', 'NR', 'When a man asks another man more facile with words to do his wooing for him, there are always complications. The man with no talent for writing marries the girl, confesses one night he didn''t write the letters and ends up with a knife in his back. The writer of the letters fell in love with the woman he wrote to and wants to become her second husband even if she did murder husband number one. Singleton doesn''t remember the murder or anything about the first 22 years of her life as Victoria Remington. Then at her second wedding she wonders why she said "I take you, Roger," instead of "I take you, Allen."', 'When a man asks another man more facile with words to do his wooing for him, there are always complications. The man with no talent for writing marries the girl, confesses one night he didn''t write the letters and ends up with a knife in his back. The writer of the letters fell in love with the woman he wrote to and wants to become her second husband even if she did murder husband number one. Singleton doesn''t remember the murder or anything about the first 22 years of her life as Victoria Remington. Then at her second wedding she wonders why she said "I take you, Roger," instead of "I take you, Allen."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jr4PYYbjRw16AL6pQEpKoVcTXOv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109881'),
  ('680545711216766683', 'Love Letters', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'Amy Holden Jones, Alec Hirschfeld, David Brisbin', 'Amy Holden Jones', 'Jamie Lee Curtis, Bonnie Bartlett, Matt Clark, James Keach, Bud Cort, Amy Madigan, Brian Wood, Philip Coccioletti', 'R', 'After discovering a box of old love letters sent to her mother by a mysterious stranger, Anna, a young radio deejay, begins a torrid affair with a married man. Burning attraction brings them together, but the reality does not come close to the passion expressed in the letters.', 'After discovering a box of old love letters sent to her mother by a mysterious stranger, Anna, a young radio deejay, begins a torrid affair with a married man. Burning attraction brings them together, but the reality does not come close to the passion expressed in the letters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pu6BqPRbEaIeKs6YmmSEFGKDiBj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75986'),
  ('579390578474623723', 'Love Letters', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alice Douard, Jacques Girault, Elodie Demey', 'Alice Douard', 'Ella Rumpf, Monia Chokri, Noémie Lvovsky, Félix Kysyl, Anne Le Ny, Julien Gaspar-Oliveri, Édouard Sulpice, Eva Huault', null, 'Céline is expecting her firstborn. But she’s not the one who’s pregnant. In three months, her wife Nadia will give birth to their daughter. Under the gaze of her friends, her mother, and the law, Céline looks for her place and sense of legitimacy.', 'Céline is expecting her firstborn. But she’s not the one who’s pregnant. In three months, her wife Nadia will give birth to their daughter. Under the gaze of her friends, her mother, and the law, Céline looks for her place and sense of legitimacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nedWOSKUvZf2J0oLjYCk44rob2l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1119537'),
  ('628921994460302967', 'Love Letters of a Portuguese Nun', 1977, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Peter Baumgartner', 'Erwin C. Dietrich', 'Susan Hemingway, Ana Zanatti, William Berger, Herbert Fux, Vítor Mendes, Herman José, José Viana, Aida Vargas', null, '16-year-old Maria is forced into Serra D''Aires convent, secretly run by Satanists.', '16-year-old Maria is forced into Serra D''Aires convent, secretly run by Satanists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VvhhALJmUfOC5r7Y1eE2eiodWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81189'),
  ('364623053246381054', 'Love Lies', 1989, 'Drama', 'Arturo Ripstein, Ángel Goded', 'Paz Alicia Garciadiego', 'Alonso Echánove, Delia Casanova, Ernesto Yáñez, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Luisa Huertas, Fernando Palavicini', null, 'Set in Mexico City, Mentiras Piadosas is the doomed love story of Clara and Israel. She is a health inspector and he is an herb merchant, who is obsessed with the construction of an enormous model of the ancient city of Tenochtitlan. They both decide to leave their respective partners to live together, however, jealousy, blackmail and guilt will become unbreakable patterns destroying their tragic relationship', 'Set in Mexico City, Mentiras Piadosas is the doomed love story of Clara and Israel. She is a health inspector and he is an herb merchant, who is obsessed with the construction of an enormous model of the ancient city of Tenochtitlan. They both decide to leave their respective partners to live together, however, jealousy, blackmail and guilt will become unbreakable patterns destroying their tragic relationship', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qCAuaux2kW3iMlE7HMQPop4PWd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384421'),
  ('789328918317733176', 'Love Lies Bleeding', 2008, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Keith Samples', 'Brian Strasmann', 'Brian Geraghty, Jenna Dewan, Christian Slater, Craig Sheffer, James Madio, Jacob Vargas, Tara Summers, Lynn Dickison', 'R', 'A struggling young couple stumbles upon a cache of dirty money after a shootout in their apartment building.', 'A struggling young couple stumbles upon a cache of dirty money after a shootout in their apartment building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LzxUu9GlIOptFM20hjsTrIxOJE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14565'),
  ('813767602287457973', 'Love Lies Bleeding', 2024, 'Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Rose Glass, Ben Fordesman, Susan E. Fiore', 'Rose Glass, Weronika Tofilska', 'Kristen Stewart, Katy O''Brian, Ed Harris, Dave Franco, Jena Malone, Anna Baryshnikov, Orion Carrington, Matthew Blood-Smyth', 'R', 'Reclusive gym manager Lou falls hard for Jackie, an ambitious bodybuilder headed through town to Las Vegas in pursuit of her dream. But their love ignites violence, pulling them deep into the web of Lou’s criminal family.', 'Reclusive gym manager Lou falls hard for Jackie, an ambitious bodybuilder headed through town to Las Vegas in pursuit of her dream. But their love ignites violence, pulling them deep into the web of Lou’s criminal family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xImj8RLe39YK0lyVu9kXv7ApN8p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:948549'),
  ('423281470897064587', 'Love Life', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Maria Schrader, Benedict Neuenfels', 'Maria Schrader, Laila Stieler', 'Netta Garti, Rade Šerbedžija, Tovah Feldshuh, Stephen Singer, Ishai Golan, Aryeh Moskona, Assi Dayan, Clara Khoury', null, 'A married young academic falls under the sexual thrall of a much older man whose air of jaded ennui conceals a secret desire for vengeance.', 'A married young academic falls under the sexual thrall of a much older man whose air of jaded ennui conceals a secret desire for vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkFUs1ShkocxtSbia5Dv7cuFhnM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4839'),
  ('611333701527431965', 'Love Life', 2022, 'Drama', 'Hideo Yamamoto, Koji Fukada, Mai Sugiyama', 'Koji Fukada', 'Fumino Kimura, Kento Nagayama, Atom Sunada, Hirona Yamazaki, Misuzu Kanno, Tomorowo Taguchi, Tetta Shimada, Natsume Mito', null, 'Taeko and her husband, Jirō, are living a peaceful existence with her young son, Keita, when a tragic accident brings the boy''s long-lost father, Park, back into her life. To cope with the pain and guilt, Taeko throws herself into helping this deaf and homeless man.', 'Taeko and her husband, Jirō, are living a peaceful existence with her young son, Keita, when a tragic accident brings the boy''s long-lost father, Park, back into her life. To cope with the pain and guilt, Taeko throws herself into helping this deaf and homeless man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OSTURpAJCFsUydL6w4JPx48SSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927594'),
  ('86041118747540233', 'Love Like Poison', 2010, 'Drama', 'Katell Quillévéré, Tom Harari', 'Katell Quillévéré, Mariette Désert', 'Clara Augarde, Lio, Stefano Cassetti, Michel Galabru, Thierry Neuvic, Youen Leboulanger-Gourvil, Philippe Duclos, Françoise Navarro', null, 'Anna, a young teenager, comes home from her Catholic boarding school for the holidays and discovers her father has left. Her mother is devastated and confined in the company of the local priest, who is also a childhood friend. Anna clings to her beloved grandfather. She also grows close to Pierre, a free-spirited teenager who cares little about God. Anna is preparing for her confirmation, but her budding desire for Pierre shakes her faith. She longs to give herself over, body and soul... but doesn''t know if it is to God, or something else?', 'Anna, a young teenager, comes home from her Catholic boarding school for the holidays and discovers her father has left. Her mother is devastated and confined in the company of the local priest, who is also a childhood friend. Anna clings to her beloved grandfather. She also grows close to Pierre, a free-spirited teenager who cares little about God. Anna is preparing for her confirmation, but her budding desire for Pierre shakes her faith. She longs to give herself over, body and soul... but doesn''t know if it is to God, or something else?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXXogVzqDpDppgH8p1pWTG3uMpi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71559'),
  ('1005378232737491466', 'Love Like the Falling Petals', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yoshihiro Fukagawa', 'Tomoko Yoshida', 'Kento Nakajima, Honoka Matsumoto, Kento Nagayama, Yuki Sakurai, Shuntaro Yanagi, Yumi Wakatsuki, Jun Kaname, Hidekazu Mashima', null, 'Haruto Asakura falls in love with hairdresser Misaki Ariake and asks her out. Watching Misaki Ariake work hard to achieve what she wants, Haruto Asakura, who almost gave up his dream to become a photographer, begins to pursue his dream again, but Misaki Ariake is diagnosed with a disease that ages her 10x faster than normal.', 'Haruto Asakura falls in love with hairdresser Misaki Ariake and asks her out. Watching Misaki Ariake work hard to achieve what she wants, Haruto Asakura, who almost gave up his dream to become a photographer, begins to pursue his dream again, but Misaki Ariake is diagnosed with a disease that ages her 10x faster than normal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8m2xnZAnMuydc87KCLS2gnUmidh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890322'),
  ('52980445629308526', 'Love Like You', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'A. Taner Elhan', 'Bedia Ceylan Güzelce', 'Burak Özçivit, Fahriye Evcen, Selim Bayraktar, Yavuz Bingöl, Kaya Akkaya, Birsen Dürülü, Burçin Işık, Şamil Kafkas', null, 'A young girl, with a troubled past, and a young boy fall in love in a small but beautiful town.', 'A young girl, with a troubled past, and a young boy fall in love in a small but beautiful town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyiIXiFnwHcdg6n9tvYxQHkn45E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320060'),
  ('960061058361980612', 'Love Likes Coincidences', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ömer Faruk Sorak, Veli Kuzlu, Ahmet Vahapoğlu', 'Nuran Evren Şit', 'Mehmet Günsür, Belçim Bilgin, Altan Erkekli, Ayda Aksel, Şebnem Sönmez, Hüseyin Avni Danyal, Yiğit Özşener, Berna Konur', null, 'Year 1977, a September morning in Ankara... Yilmaz tries to rush his pregnant wife Neriman to the hospital and he crushes into Omer''s car. This accident causes Omer''s pregnant wife Inci, who was in the back seat, to have a pre-term labor. The babies are born on the same day. They see each other for the first time... This accident is the threshold of the coincidences that bring Ozgur and Deniz together.', 'Year 1977, a September morning in Ankara... Yilmaz tries to rush his pregnant wife Neriman to the hospital and he crushes into Omer''s car. This accident causes Omer''s pregnant wife Inci, who was in the back seat, to have a pre-term labor. The babies are born on the same day. They see each other for the first time... This accident is the threshold of the coincidences that bring Ozgur and Deniz together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGGAVANrwyRILduyEl6godYCgqX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56919'),
  ('23416283954814069', 'Love Likes Coincidences 2', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ömer Faruk Sorak, Ipek Sorak', 'Nuran Evren Şit', 'Nesrin Cavadzade, Yiğit Kirazcı, Elif Doğan, Aytaç Şaşmaz, Hülya Gülşen Irmak, Levent Can, Eli Mango, Türkü Turan', null, 'An unforgettable love that overcomes all obstacles, even time, distance and falling apart.', 'An unforgettable love that overcomes all obstacles, even time, distance and falling apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIqxnTSRAmmfBvWHLZCbb0xq9A1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659764'),
  ('799965356124861731', 'Love Live! Nijigasaki High School Idol Club Final Chapter Part 2', 2025, 'Music, Animation', 'Tomoyuki Kawamura', 'Jin Tanaka', 'Hinaki Yano, Aguri Oonishi, Mayu Sagara, Kaori Maeda, Miyu Kubota, Natsumi Murakami, Akari Kito, Coco Hayashi', null, 'The second in the trilogy of Love Live! Nijigasaki Gakuen School Idol Doukoukai films that continues the story beyond season two and the OVA.', 'The second in the trilogy of Love Live! Nijigasaki Gakuen School Idol Doukoukai films that continues the story beyond season two and the OVA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJa5yhBmzJTke6LCmfbwp26ydlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1154800'),
  ('303818647201156547', 'Love Live! Sunshine!! The School Idol Movie: Over the Rainbow', 2019, 'Music, Animation, Comedy', 'Takatoshi Suzuki, Naoya Ando, Kazuo Sakai', 'Jukki Hanada', 'Anju Inami, Rikako Aida, Nanaka Suwa, Arisa Komiya, Shuka Saito, Aika Kobayashi, Kanako Takatsuki, Aina Suzuki', null, 'After the idol group Aqours has won the final Love Live! contest, its remaining members prepare to enroll at a new school only to run into some unexpected trouble while the former members go missing on the way to their graduation trip. Separated, the girls begin to realize the value of their friendships as they attempt to find a solution to their various crises.', 'After the idol group Aqours has won the final Love Live! contest, its remaining members prepare to enroll at a new school only to run into some unexpected trouble while the former members go missing on the way to their graduation trip. Separated, the girls begin to realize the value of their friendships as they attempt to find a solution to their various crises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qqVW9a2BMR3kXEnqwMKr2rvIdq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529589'),
  ('1128260733181419965', 'Love Live! The School Idol Movie', 2015, 'Animation, Music, Comedy', 'Yuki Maeda, Takahiko Kyougoku, Daichi Nogami', 'Jukki Hanada', 'Emi Nitta, Aya Uchida, Suzuko Mimori, Pile, Yurika Kubo, Riho Iida, Sora Tokui, Aina Kusuda', null, 'Although μ''s, the defending champions of the school idol tournament, plans to dissolve their group after the graduation of their senior members, they receive news that leads them to holding a concert event! The 9 girls continue to learn and grow in this new and unfamiliar world. What is the last thing that these girls can do as school idols? With the clock ticking, what kind of meaning will the μ''s members find in performing the most exciting live performance?', 'Although μ''s, the defending champions of the school idol tournament, plans to dissolve their group after the graduation of their senior members, they receive news that leads them to holding a concert event! The 9 girls continue to learn and grow in this new and unfamiliar world. What is the last thing that these girls can do as school idols? With the clock ticking, what kind of meaning will the μ''s members find in performing the most exciting live performance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niZYdH5EVKlA6ww3BEGVR8aWwEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333623'),
  ('184120602213726678', 'Love Liza', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Todd Louiso, Lisa Rinzler, Jimi Woods', 'Gordy Hoffman', 'Philip Seymour Hoffman, Jack Kehler, Sarah Koskoff, Stephen Tobolowsky, Erika Alexander, Shannon Holt, Kevin Breznahan, Daniel Farber', 'R', 'Following the unexplained suicide of his wife Liza, website designer Wilson Joel turns to huffing gasoline fumes and remote control gaming while avoiding an inevitable conflict with his mother-in-law.', 'Following the unexplained suicide of his wife Liza, website designer Wilson Joel turns to huffing gasoline fumes and remote control gaming while avoiding an inevitable conflict with his mother-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAjQy6CpYMTZ4ClrcaeJcoT3UHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15395'),
  ('1120281836754254895', 'Love Locks', 2017, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Martin Wood, Richard Ciupka, Matthew Jemus', 'John Tinker, Neal H. Dobrofsky, Tippi Dobrofsky', 'Rebecca Romijn, Jerry O''Connell, Bruce Davison, David Julian Hirsh, Jocelyn Hudon, Benjamin Sutherland, Linda E. Smith, Melissa Toussaint', 'G', 'Lindsey Wilson first found love in the romantic city of Paris when she was a university student studying art there. Now, twenty years later, she is returning to the City of Light to take her daughter on an adventure there. With a little inspiration from the city''s famed "love locks" on its scenic bridges, the adventure proves to be a journey of romance and rediscovery for the divorced Lindsey when she reconnects with her college flame in Paris and finds that her first love just might be the lasting love of her life after all.', 'Lindsey Wilson first found love in the romantic city of Paris when she was a university student studying art there. Now, twenty years later, she is returning to the City of Light to take her daughter on an adventure there. With a little inspiration from the city''s famed "love locks" on its scenic bridges, the adventure proves to be a journey of romance and rediscovery for the divorced Lindsey when she reconnects with her college flame in Paris and finds that her first love just might be the lasting love of her life after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3tn7a90Dy0QZM5cBQCdFADPkn1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428586'),
  ('1037872810084388198', 'Love Love You', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Naphat Chaithiangthum', 'Naphat Chaithiangthum', 'Atthaphan Phunsawat, Papungkorn Sakunsong, Premyuda Litdumrongkul, Suchart Rochanakee, Thanasarn Mengbua, Thanakorn Kuljarassombat, Korn Khunatipapisiri, Chanon Santinatornkul', null, 'A couple''s love is tested when one partner must move in with an attractive new student, while the other gets a surprise visitor from his past.', 'A couple''s love is tested when one partner must move in with an attractive new student, while the other gets a surprise visitor from his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmLH8DPyYpGjQDKQbmIU8RYMhLc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461612'),
  ('820978289671860381', 'Love Machine', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Anna Hawliczek, Andreas Schmied', 'Silvia Wohlmuth, Andreas Schmied', 'Thomas Stipsits, Claudia Kottal, Ulrike Beimpold, Lilian Klebow, Katharina Straßer, Barbara Schöneberger, Adele Neuhauser, Julia Jelinek', null, 'When Georgy''s music career derails and bankruptcy seems unavoidable, he discovers a profitable career opportunity as a call boy.', 'When Georgy''s music career derails and bankruptcy seems unavoidable, he discovers a profitable career opportunity as a call boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5N193KcIEHDyGvYKtY6jlnrGmm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573718'),
  ('817609920926890880', 'Love Massacre', 1981, 'Thriller, Romance, Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Patrick Tam Kar-Ming, Tina Lau Tin-Lan, William Chang Suk-Ping', 'Joyce Chan Wan-Man', 'Brigitte Lin, Chang Kuo-Chu, Charlie Chin Chiang-Lin, Tina Lau Tin-Lan, Deanie Ip, Ann Hui, Cyrus Cassells, Patrick Lung Kong', null, 'Set in San Francisco, Love Massacre follows college student Ivy as she tries to help her friend Joy recover from a breakup. Ivy soon becomes involved with Joy''s married brother Chu Chung, who spirals into senseless violence as he breaks into Ivy''s dormitory and goes on a delirious killing spree.', 'Set in San Francisco, Love Massacre follows college student Ivy as she tries to help her friend Joy recover from a breakup. Ivy soon becomes involved with Joy''s married brother Chu Chung, who spirals into senseless violence as he breaks into Ivy''s dormitory and goes on a delirious killing spree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odiQBpqJC8JwLzLutZALpieuO2K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182227'),
  ('801416833371137056', 'Love Me', 2025, 'Romance, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Zuchero, Germain McMicking, Sam Zuchero', 'Andrew Zuchero, Sam Zuchero', 'Kristen Stewart, Steven Yeun', 'R', 'In a story that spans billions of years, a buoy and a satellite meet online long after humanity’s extinction. As they learn what life was like on Earth, they discover themselves and what it means to be alive and in love.', 'In a story that spans billions of years, a buoy and a satellite meet online long after humanity’s extinction. As they learn what life was like on Earth, they discover themselves and what it means to be alive and in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX8Z3qWJ5OjV1uP7yT6yRlw9UL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881415'),
  ('46140297129255826', 'Love Me Dead', 2024, 'Thriller, Romance, Horror', 'Josh Webber', 'Josh Webber, Christopher Neil', 'RJ Mitte, Dove Cameron, Austyn Knight, Robert LaSardo, Pia Mia, Gigi Gustin, Jay Giannone, Lauren Francesca', null, 'Issac, a young reclusive mortician who inherited his stepfather''s mortuary business, meets a friendly waitress, Cassi. The two create an instant connection and after a night of terror, they pursue a revenge murder together.', 'Issac, a young reclusive mortician who inherited his stepfather''s mortuary business, meets a friendly waitress, Cassi. The two create an instant connection and after a night of terror, they pursue a revenge murder together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1HisUuEhl3NJsO157CI6qo1URV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911926'),
  ('930463500646470767', 'Love Me Deadly', 1973, 'Horror, Drama', 'Jacques Lacerte, David Aaron, Tom Doniger', 'Jacques Lacerte', 'Mary Charlotte Wilcox, Lyle Waggoner, Christopher Stone, Timothy Scott, I. William Quinn, Michael Pardue, Dassa Cates, Terri Anne Duvalis', 'R', 'A young socialite struggling to control her necrophiliac urges is torn between her affection for a kind businessman and the mortician who supplies her with bodies.', 'A young socialite struggling to control her necrophiliac urges is torn between her affection for a kind businessman and the mortician who supplies her with bodies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdWMVgAZGkDTzuaueBLvl0f9A6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91627'),
  ('858089663438980102', 'Love Me Forever or Never', 1986, 'Drama', 'Arnaldo Jabor, Lauro Escorel, Nelson Nadotti', 'Arnaldo Jabor', 'Fernanda Torres, Thales Pan Chacon', null, 'Young and recently separated couple meet in a modern house and start discussing their past relationship.', 'Young and recently separated couple meet in a modern house and start discussing their past relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9XBttfWkMvQYb6Nqtrw9YmCUUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74649'),
  ('474325523542089929', 'Love Me If You Dare', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Yann Samuell, Antoine Roch, Thomas Tréfouel', 'Yann Samuell', 'Guillaume Canet, Marion Cotillard, Thibault Verhaeghe, Joséphine Lebas-Joly, Emmanuelle Grönvold, Gérard Watkins, Julia Faure, Gilles Lellouche', null, 'As adults, best friends Julien and Sophie continue the odd game they started as children -- a fearless competition to outdo one another with daring and outrageous stunts. While they often act out to relieve one another''s pain, their game might be a way to avoid the fact that they are truly meant for one another.', 'As adults, best friends Julien and Sophie continue the odd game they started as children -- a fearless competition to outdo one another with daring and outrageous stunts. While they often act out to relieve one another''s pain, their game might be a way to avoid the fact that they are truly meant for one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvjC5LSMANKvGGDHjIWj1YomPdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8424'),
  ('853513812708260955', 'Love Me Instead', 2021, 'Drama', 'Mehmet Ada Öztekin, Benjamin Wieg', 'Mehmet Ada Öztekin', 'Sarp Akkaya, Aleyna Özgeçen, Ercan Kesal, Songül Öden, Füsun Demirel, Güner Özkul, Kaan Altay Köprülü, Ushan Çakır', null, 'Accompanied by a ward, a prisoner travels to his hometown to reconnect with his daughter and make amends, but a tragic truth mars his journey.', 'Accompanied by a ward, a prisoner travels to his hometown to reconnect with his daughter and make amends, but a tragic truth mars his journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkaQgCdWO0NAA790lgRbiIxNqhp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:889300'),
  ('710148172708686278', 'Love Me Love Me', 2026, 'Romance, Drama', 'Roger Kumble, Martina Cocco, Mirko Urania', 'Serena Tateo, Veronica Galli', 'Pepe Barroso, Mia Jenkins, Luca Melucci, Andrea Guo, Michelangelo Vizzini, Madior Fall, Vanessa Donghi, Elizabeth Kinnear', null, 'After her brother''s death, June moves to Milan for a fresh start, finding comfort in Will, the perfect honor student at her new international school. But when his troubled best friend James—hiding a dangerous life in clandestine MMA fights—sparks a rivalry that quickly turns into irresistible attraction, June must choose between safety and a love that upends everything she thought she wanted.', 'After her brother''s death, June moves to Milan for a fresh start, finding comfort in Will, the perfect honor student at her new international school. But when his troubled best friend James—hiding a dangerous life in clandestine MMA fights—sparks a rivalry that quickly turns into irresistible attraction, June must choose between safety and a love that upends everything she thought she wanted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfwHKRHRE2X4NTexdzblaioHH51.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1317672'),
  ('430629130802320350', 'Love Me No More', 2008, 'Drama', 'Jean Becker, Arthur Cloquet', 'Eric Assous, Jérôme Beaujour, Jean Becker', 'Albert Dupontel, Marie-Josée Croze, Pierre Vaneck, Alessandra Martines, François Marthouret, Cristiana Réali, Mathias Mlekuz, Claire Nebout', null, 'Antoine Méliot is around 40 years old and has everything he needs to be happy: a beautiful wife, two adorable children, friends he can count on, a pretty house in the Yvelines and money. But one day he decides to ruin everything in one weekend.', 'Antoine Méliot is around 40 years old and has everything he needs to be happy: a beautiful wife, two adorable children, friends he can count on, a pretty house in the Yvelines and money. But one day he decides to ruin everything in one weekend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7n9ax9lKXdj6w9FZCptIcC3sgW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9736'),
  ('128567230531497323', 'Love Me Not', 2006, 'Drama', 'Lee Cheol-ha', 'Seon-jeong Kim, Lee Cheol-ha, Jae-yeon Kim', 'Kim Joo-hyuk, Moon Geun-young, Jo Jae-yun, Do Ji-won, Jin Goo, Choi Sung-ho, Lee Yu-mi', null, 'Julian has lived off the money he lures from his rich female customers. But now he faces usurious debts from a hasty expansion of his business, and he will be killed unless he clears the debt in one month. The only way to save himself is to pretend to be the long-lost brother of an heiress and kill her to get her huge fortune. Min, the blind heiress, cold-hearted like Julian, slowly opens herself to him, and he, too, falls for her. But Julian has to pay his creditor and what makes it worse for him is that the illness that took Min’s eyesight relapsed, threatening her life.', 'Julian has lived off the money he lures from his rich female customers. But now he faces usurious debts from a hasty expansion of his business, and he will be killed unless he clears the debt in one month. The only way to save himself is to pretend to be the long-lost brother of an heiress and kill her to get her huge fortune. Min, the blind heiress, cold-hearted like Julian, slowly opens herself to him, and he, too, falls for her. But Julian has to pay his creditor and what makes it worse for him is that the illness that took Min’s eyesight relapsed, threatening her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vpcsqZuuOOlWuh3T2WtcSDVHXW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37840'),
  ('376993944520054451', 'Love Me Not', 2019, 'Drama', 'Lluís Miñarro', 'Lluís Miñarro, Sergi Belbel', 'Ingrid García Jonsson, Francesc Orella, Lola Dueñas, Hugo Catalán, Oliver Laxe, Luis Alberti, Nicolás Palazzolo, Fausto Alzati', null, 'A powerful international army assigns a regiment the task of guarding a mysterious man, held in a maximum security prison in the middle of the desert. Soldier Salome, daughter of Commander Antipas, becomes obsessed with him... Eros and Thanatos together reminding us that truth is based on beauty and love.', 'A powerful international army assigns a regiment the task of guarding a mysterious man, held in a maximum security prison in the middle of the desert. Soldier Salome, daughter of Commander Antipas, becomes obsessed with him... Eros and Thanatos together reminding us that truth is based on beauty and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IgP7lZyK2srOnK8J89wuwh9PEq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575562'),
  ('2983826507188102', 'Love Me or Leave Me', 1955, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Ridgeway Callow, Charles Vidor, Arthur E. Arling', 'Daniel Fuchs, Isobel Lennart', 'Doris Day, James Cagney, Cameron Mitchell, Robert Keith, Tom Tully, Harry Bellaver, Richard Gaines, Peter Leeds', 'NR', 'A fictionalized account of the career of jazz singer Ruth Etting and her tempestuous marriage to gangster Marty Snyder, who helped propel her to stardom.', 'A fictionalized account of the career of jazz singer Ruth Etting and her tempestuous marriage to gangster Marty Snyder, who helped propel her to stardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIT21pBwDQxrKyhmUiwoZCs1IFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40633'),
  ('796976893736511131', 'Love Me Strangely', 1971, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Sergio Gobbi, Daniel Diot, Silla Bettini', 'Georges Tabet, André Tabet, Sergio Gobbi', 'Virna Lisi, Helmut Berger, Charles Aznavour, Alain Noury, Françoise Brion, Édith Scob, Marc Cassot, Yves Brainville', null, 'Alain Revent, a seductive and refined man, derives a peculiar satisfaction from debasing his wives. The first, driven to the brink of despair, throws herself out of a window. Enlisting the help of an equally perverse casual acquaintance, Dino, the "handsome brute" proceeds to emotionally torture his second wife, Nathalie. The sadistic plan is picked up on by Officer Leroy who suspects the truth. Will he be able to snatch the unfortunate woman from the evil Alain''s clutches?', 'Alain Revent, a seductive and refined man, derives a peculiar satisfaction from debasing his wives. The first, driven to the brink of despair, throws herself out of a window. Enlisting the help of an equally perverse casual acquaintance, Dino, the "handsome brute" proceeds to emotionally torture his second wife, Nathalie. The sadistic plan is picked up on by Officer Leroy who suspects the truth. Will he be able to snatch the unfortunate woman from the evil Alain''s clutches?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eabJQU44q1gL3KJ7n6n8Oh3Ka4V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105097'),
  ('855115494671734198', 'Love Me Tender', 1956, 'Drama, Western, Music, Romance', 'Robert D. Webb, Leo Tover, Stanley Hough', 'Robert Buckner', 'Richard Egan, Debra Paget, Elvis Presley, Robert Middleton, William Campbell, Neville Brand, Mildred Dunnock, Bruce Bennett', 'NR', 'At the end of the Civil War, a Confederate team is ordered to rob a Union payroll train but the war ends leaving these men with their Union loot, until the Feds come looking for it.', 'At the end of the Civil War, a Confederate team is ordered to rob a Union payroll train but the war ends leaving these men with their Union loot, until the Feds come looking for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PdRIIrBN4q8H7f8yGbd0ScpTjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39833'),
  ('238560739940780268', 'Love Me Tonight', 1932, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rouben Mamoulian, George Hippard, Victor Milner', 'Samuel Hoffenstein, Waldemar Young, George Marion Jr.', 'Maurice Chevalier, Jeanette MacDonald, Charles Ruggles, Charles Butterworth, Myrna Loy, C. Aubrey Smith, Elizabeth Patterson, Ethel Griffies', 'NR', 'A Parisian tailor goes to a château to collect a bill, only to fall for an aloof young princess living there.', 'A Parisian tailor goes to a château to collect a bill, only to fall for an aloof young princess living there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wjHj3LmmezUsBHxFL8xpRdMxVX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31532'),
  ('939885244476857655', 'Love Me, Love Me Not', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Toshimasa Kuroyanagi, Yu Yamashita, Tetsuya Kawakami', 'Erika Yoshida', 'Soma Saito, Megumi Han, Marika Tachibana, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Kikuko Inoue, Hideyuki Tanaka, Aya Hisakawa, Kazuhiko Inoue', null, 'Yuna and Akari are two high school girls with very different views on love: Yuna dreams about romance through rose-coloured glasses, while Akari is down-to-earth and practical. Meanwhile, high school boys Kazuomi and Rio also have different views on love: Kazuomi is an airhead who can''t grasp the concept of love, while Rio grabs onto any confession as an opportunity—so long as the girl looks cute. Will these four classmates end up leading a youthful romance that meets their expectations?', 'Yuna and Akari are two high school girls with very different views on love: Yuna dreams about romance through rose-coloured glasses, while Akari is down-to-earth and practical. Meanwhile, high school boys Kazuomi and Rio also have different views on love: Kazuomi is an airhead who can''t grasp the concept of love, while Rio grabs onto any confession as an opportunity—so long as the girl looks cute. Will these four classmates end up leading a youthful romance that meets their expectations?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Alj0juWZHuQhmjBDvPnngbYNiEs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:624812'),
  ('901975522336191921', 'Love Me, Love My Mouse', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Washam, Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, June Foray', null, 'Tom is wooing Toots; he presents her with a present - Jerry. But Toots would rather play mother to Jerry than eat him, much to Tom''s annoyance.', 'Tom is wooing Toots; he presents her with a present - Jerry. But Toots would rather play mother to Jerry than eat him, much to Tom''s annoyance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shtXuZSPEigyKpD8ebZ9VHYrPUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234329'),
  ('683975834216832999', 'Love Me!', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Philipp Eichholtz, Fee Scherer', 'Philipp Eichholtz', 'Lilli Meinhardt, Axel Ranisch, Peter Trabner, Eva Bay, Christian Ehrich, David Brizzi, Gabriele Domschke, Italo De Angelis', null, 'Sarah is loud, non-conform, rude, honest and provocative. She seems invincible, but she is lonely and lost. Struggling with her daily life.', 'Sarah is loud, non-conform, rude, honest and provocative. She seems invincible, but she is lonely and lost. Struggling with her daily life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KvXP4snurDItYK7Gcno856IlY4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336307'),
  ('154858409660365739', 'Love Meetings', 1965, 'Documentary', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Mario Bernardo, Tonino Delli Colli', null, 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Lello Bersani, Alberto Moravia, Cesare Musatti, Peppino Di Capri, Ezio Pascutti, William Negri, Carlo Furlanis', null, 'Pier Paolo Pasolini sets out to interview Italians about sex, apparently their least favorite thing to talk about in public: he asks children if they know where babies come from; asks old and young women if they support gender equality; asks both sexes if a woman''s virginity still matters, what do they think of homosexuality, if divorce should be legal, or if they support the recent abolition of brothels. He interviews blue-collar workers, intellectuals, college students, rural farmers, the bourgeoisie, and every other kind of people, painting a vivid portrait of a rapidly-industrializing Italy, hanging between modernity and tradition — toward both of which Pasolini shows equal distrust.', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini sets out to interview Italians about sex, apparently their least favorite thing to talk about in public: he asks children if they know where babies come from; asks old and young women if they support gender equality; asks both sexes if a woman''s virginity still matters, what do they think of homosexuality, if divorce should be legal, or if they support the recent abolition of brothels. He interviews blue-collar workers, intellectuals, college students, rural farmers, the bourgeoisie, and every other kind of people, painting a vivid portrait of a rapidly-industrializing Italy, hanging between modernity and tradition — toward both of which Pasolini shows equal distrust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olOuK4gkrYzgo7xJWR1EugZ2vdS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42733'),
  ('203505280126883988', 'Love Mocktail 3', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Darling Krishna, Sri Crazymindz', 'Darling Krishna, Milana Nagaraj, Yadunandan', 'Madesh, Vasu, Darling Krishna, Milana Nagaraj, Samvrutha Sunil', null, 'Aadi''s journey into fatherhood begins with adoption, as he and young Nidhi forge an unbreakable connection through daily joys and obstacles that transform his life and reveal what truly matters.', 'Aadi''s journey into fatherhood begins with adoption, as he and young Nidhi forge an unbreakable connection through daily joys and obstacles that transform his life and reveal what truly matters.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F8OHAR38PPh0QLyJDkRHJaF49zhl.jpg', 'plex:movie:love-mocktail-3'),
  ('1121727875363878268', 'Love My Chance', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Ender Mıhlar', null, 'Cem Gelinoğlu, Gökhan Kıraç, Zeynep Tuğçe Bayat, Metin Yıldız, Ümit Yesin, Gülsüm Alkan, Burak Tamdoğan, Metin Coşkun', null, 'Sebahattin is known around town as a magnet for misfortune. But to win over the woman of his dreams, he changes his ways to change his luck.', 'Sebahattin is known around town as a magnet for misfortune. But to win over the woman of his dreams, he changes his ways to change his luck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/asDzU3FRwg2xbaNdldtcKDcIQ5I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474120'),
  ('1128723330288356694', 'Love My Life', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Koji Kawano, Toshiyuki Honma', 'Hiroko Kanasugi', 'Rei Yoshii, Asami Imajuku, Takamasa Suga, Issey Takahashi, Naomi Akimoto, Miyoko Asada, Kami Hiraiwa, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi', null, 'Ichiko and Eri are two beautiful Japanese Uni students who are in a lesbian relationship. Ichiko comes out to her father who tells her he is also gay and her mother was a lesbian.', 'Ichiko and Eri are two beautiful Japanese Uni students who are in a lesbian relationship. Ichiko comes out to her father who tells her he is also gay and her mother was a lesbian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkBtrb00RcCuLjtx9vWub7z2l60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40701'),
  ('542151827714449197', 'Love n'' Dancing', 2009, 'Romance, Drama', 'Robert Iscove, Frank Byers', 'Tom Malloy', 'Amy Smart, Tom Malloy, Billy Zane, Nicola Royston, Caroline Rhea, Betty White, Leila Arcieri, Rachel Dratch', 'PG-13', 'When a bored-with-life English teacher meets a West Coast Swing champion dancer, they have an instant connection. Both feel that the other can fulfill what was missing in their lives. Jake and Jessica must try to elude all obstacles, romantic or otherwise, to stay focused on the goal - winning the World Title and winning each other. Will they give in to the pressure or come out like champs?', 'When a bored-with-life English teacher meets a West Coast Swing champion dancer, they have an instant connection. Both feel that the other can fulfill what was missing in their lives. Jake and Jessica must try to elude all obstacles, romantic or otherwise, to stay focused on the goal - winning the World Title and winning each other. Will they give in to the pressure or come out like champs?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQiKnCSs1W158nQ30jqGZgRO4cv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16004'),
  ('765733301542210060', 'Love Naturally', 2010, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Christophe Douchand', 'Camille Pouzol', 'Delphine Chanéac, Thierry Neuvic, Laure Marsac, Stéphane Metzger, Emmanuel Patron, Laurent Collombert, Gérard Croce, Hugo Moan', null, 'Parisian businesswoman Lili travels to rural France for a wedding and falls in love with Luc, a single father and farmer.', 'Parisian businesswoman Lili travels to rural France for a wedding and falls in love with Luc, a single father and farmer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxPoldH5zuhaNt9ifE0oj5DwrhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334568'),
  ('1099142488771693258', 'Love Nest', 1951, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Joseph M. Newman, Lloyd Ahern Sr., Jasper Blystone', 'I. A. L. Diamond', 'June Haver, William Lundigan, Frank Fay, Marilyn Monroe, Jack Paar, Leatrice Joy, Henry Kulky, Leo Cleary', null, 'Jim and Connie''s postwar New York building troubles keep Jim from working on his novel. Ex-WAC from Jim''s army days Roberta moves in, further upsetting Connie but pleasing Jim''s friend Ed. Tenant Charley, who marries tenant Eadie, loans money to Jim to help him keep the building, money which this Casanova obtains from rich widows.', 'Jim and Connie''s postwar New York building troubles keep Jim from working on his novel. Ex-WAC from Jim''s army days Roberta moves in, further upsetting Connie but pleasing Jim''s friend Ed. Tenant Charley, who marries tenant Eadie, loans money to Jim to help him keep the building, money which this Casanova obtains from rich widows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baFv5L12aDMLB5OTmyjDXy34TbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16089'),
  ('745036814302698053', 'Love Never Dies', 2012, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Guy Simpson, Simon Phillips, Brett Sullivan', 'Ben Elton, Glenn Slater, Frederick Forsyth', 'Ben Lewis, Anna O''Byrne, María Mercedes, Simon Gleeson, Sharon Millerchip, Emma J. Hawkins, Paul Tabone, Dean Vince', 'NR', 'Set ten years after the events at the Paris Opera House, the Phantom has fled to New York, where he lives amongst the joyrides and freak shows of Coney Island. He has finally found a place for his music to soar, all that is missing is his love Christine Daaé. In a bid to win back her love, the Phantom lures Christine, her husband Raoul, and their young son Gustave from Manhattan, to the glittering and glorious world of Coney Island... they have no idea what lies in store for them...', 'Set ten years after the events at the Paris Opera House, the Phantom has fled to New York, where he lives amongst the joyrides and freak shows of Coney Island. He has finally found a place for his music to soar, all that is missing is his love Christine Daaé. In a bid to win back her love, the Phantom lures Christine, her husband Raoul, and their young son Gustave from Manhattan, to the glittering and glorious world of Coney Island... they have no idea what lies in store for them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66PKthTm3oi2lrsahRbaAPOnimT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88920'),
  ('816576775099460429', 'Love Never Ends', 2023, 'Drama, Romance, Family', 'Han Yan, Roman Jiang', 'Li Liangwen, Hu Zechen, Chen Wenjie', 'Ni Dahong, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Cecilia Yip Tung, Cheng Guo, Lu Qiuping, Zhang Lixing, Cui Song', null, 'Have you ever wondered how you will age? Four 60-year-olds, two twilight loves, their love is kind and pure, romantic and intense. In this limited journey of life, before it is too late, one wants to say "I love you!', 'Have you ever wondered how you will age? Four 60-year-olds, two twilight loves, their love is kind and pure, romantic and intense. In this limited journey of life, before it is too late, one wants to say "I love you!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j89uaJkihUoa4ELxzm27E8x7AdZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1091508'),
  ('97696998128898627', 'Love Now', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chong Yun-su, Kang Seung-gi', 'Kim Jin, Kim Seon-mi', 'Uhm Jung-hwa, Park Yong-woo, Lee Dong-gun, Han Chae-young, Oh Ji-yeong, Choi Jae-won', null, 'Young-joon and So-yeo are a young couple with their marriage relatively stable. On a day their mutual friend opens a wine bar, they come across Min-jae and Yu-na, a couple quite the opposite of themselves. After a trade of talks, Young-joon becomes a client of fashion consultant Yu-na, while hotelier Min-jae agrees to help So-yeo book a hotel for her Hong Kong business trip. So-yeo meets Min-jae by chance in Hong Kong, while Young-joon trades suggestive remarks with Yu-na who visits him on a consulting session. That night, the four of them find in the other partner what had been missing in their respective marriages…(hancinema.net)', 'Young-joon and So-yeo are a young couple with their marriage relatively stable. On a day their mutual friend opens a wine bar, they come across Min-jae and Yu-na, a couple quite the opposite of themselves. After a trade of talks, Young-joon becomes a client of fashion consultant Yu-na, while hotelier Min-jae agrees to help So-yeo book a hotel for her Hong Kong business trip. So-yeo meets Min-jae by chance in Hong Kong, while Young-joon trades suggestive remarks with Yu-na who visits him on a consulting session. That night, the four of them find in the other partner what had been missing in their respective marriages…(hancinema.net)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mKXakzBVmdu0CATOWJEKL8dIXA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41186'),
  ('316859517969780155', 'Love O2O', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Tianyu Zhao', 'Shen Feixian', 'AngelaBaby, Jing Boran, Bai Yu, Janice Wu, Tan Songyun, Li Xian, Li Qin, Du Yuchen', null, 'A college stud tries to level up his relationship with a computer science major after becoming attracted to her skills in an online role-playing game.', 'A college stud tries to level up his relationship with a computer science major after becoming attracted to her skills in an online role-playing game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CLPSenC8TY9slwaSCXQGJ5UclO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412190'),
  ('552935660144225228', 'Love Object', 2004, 'Drama, Horror, Romance, Thriller', 'Robert Parigi, Sidney Sidell, Otto Michael Penzato', null, 'Desmond Harrington, Melissa Sagemiller, Udo Kier, Rip Torn, John Cassini, Brad William Henke, Camille Guaty, Michael Peña', 'R', 'The twisted tale of Kenneth, socially insecure technical writer who forms an obsessive relationship with "Nikki", an anatomically accurate silicone sex doll he orders over the Internet.', 'The twisted tale of Kenneth, socially insecure technical writer who forms an obsessive relationship with "Nikki", an anatomically accurate silicone sex doll he orders over the Internet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUXaPxe7hyksghZYcXyQ9UxSTT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16973'),
  ('574159966229481879', 'Love of Giant', 1976, 'Romance, Drama', 'Osman F. Seden', 'Bülent Oran', 'Türkan Şoray, Kadir İnanır, Savaş Başar, Elif Pektaş, Osman F. Seden, Ayfer Feray, Gunfer Feray, Filiz Alyanak', null, 'Reunion of two former lovers brings the end to the society they are part of through hate through revenge and through bloodshed, especially when the lovers were obliged to stand against their associates and families.', 'Reunion of two former lovers brings the end to the society they are part of through hate through revenge and through bloodshed, especially when the lovers were obliged to stand against their associates and families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5m6tcSHF4Hjry7eTEtovm3wNMPp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501325'),
  ('249929377714112685', 'Love of My Loves', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Daniel Jacobs, Manolo Caro', 'Manolo Caro', 'Sandra Echeverría, Marimar Vega, Erick Elías, Sebastián Zurita, Juan Pablo Medina, Mariana Treviño, Rossy de Palma, Lorena Velázquez', null, 'Two couples get to know what we all dream about: love at first sight. The problem is they meet it with different people to the ones they are engaged with, and they are just at seven days to get married. Up to that moment, they have to reconsider what’s love and what’s a habit, and to face them going against an idea with an expiration date: marriage. "Love of my loves" is based upon the successful mexican theatrical play "Un dos tres por mí y por todos mis amores", and explores compromise, doubts and commitment mixing drama and comedy.', 'Two couples get to know what we all dream about: love at first sight. The problem is they meet it with different people to the ones they are engaged with, and they are just at seven days to get married. Up to that moment, they have to reconsider what’s love and what’s a habit, and to face them going against an idea with an expiration date: marriage. "Love of my loves" is based upon the successful mexican theatrical play "Un dos tres por mí y por todos mis amores", and explores compromise, doubts and commitment mixing drama and comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zOHoqD7VCXfDtVVwpbnpfM7oNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267093'),
  ('619288063296397418', 'Love of Siam', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chitti Urnorakankij, Toey Jaruvaateekul, Chookiat Sakveerakul', 'Chookiat Sakveerakul', 'Witwisit Hiranyawongkul, Mario Maurer, Chermarn Boonyasak, Sinjai Plengpanich, Songsit Rungnopakunsi, Pimpan Buranapim, Narinchot Wachirathonniyomkul, Jirayu La-ongmanee', null, 'Best friends as children, Mew and Tong run into each other years later as young men and find they have unexpected feelings for each other.', 'Best friends as children, Mew and Tong run into each other years later as young men and find they have unexpected feelings for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aygb9QAy4PDVnU1i1gD9F9LW3lo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56295'),
  ('588216446359548659', 'Love on a Diet', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Johnnie To, Wai Ka-Fai, Four Tse Liu-Shut', 'Yau Nai-Hoi, Wai Ka-Fai', 'Andy Lau, Sammi Cheng Sau-Man, Lam Suet, Rikiya Kurokawa, Sato Keiji, Asuka Higuchi, Wong Mei-Fan, Po Ming-Nam', null, 'A depressed, obese woman tries to lose weight in order to win back her ex-boyfriend with the help of a fellow Hong Konger whom she met in Japan.', 'A depressed, obese woman tries to lose weight in order to win back her ex-boyfriend with the help of a fellow Hong Konger whom she met in Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCbmHKAfJd7xoFPmhTvCJVSFyHE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43152'),
  ('457083049357920939', 'Love on a Pillow', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roger Vadim, Armand Thirard', 'Claude Choublier, Roger Vadim', 'Brigitte Bardot, Robert Hossein, Jean-Marc Bory, Michel Serrault, Jacqueline Porel, Jean-Marc Tennberg, Robert Dalban, Ursula Vian-Kübler', null, 'A young girl rescues a man from a suicide attempt. He turns out to be a sociopath, who begins to take over her life, abusing her both verbally and emotionally, yet she can''t seem to tear herself away from him.', 'A young girl rescues a man from a suicide attempt. He turns out to be a sociopath, who begins to take over her life, abusing her both verbally and emotionally, yet she can''t seem to tear herself away from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tehOtb6QLQO8D9w2KXXwOIKrBY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66916'),
  ('643217436818762885', 'Love on a Weekend', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Salvador Aguirre', 'José Ángel Montiel, Carmen Galán', 'Adriana Barraza, Juan Carlos Barreto, Luis Ernesto Franco, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Sophie Gómez, Aida López, Pascacio López, Noé Hernández', null, 'One city. Three days, three social classes, three love songs, human beings who coexist without touching one another, joined by mirages and hopes. Their struggles to survive are individual and secret; there are no winners or losers. The seeming order is maintained and a weekend begins.', 'One city. Three days, three social classes, three love songs, human beings who coexist without touching one another, joined by mirages and hopes. Their struggles to survive are individual and secret; there are no winners or losers. The seeming order is maintained and a weekend begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsrNop18Iv9HmATRrS6ZpKBUErS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108321'),
  ('699770582056032260', 'Love on Delivery', 1994, 'Comedy, Action', 'Lee Lik-Chi, David Chung', 'Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu', 'Stephen Chow, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Ben Lam Kwok-Bun, Joe Cheng Cho, Billy Chow Bei-Lei, Leo Ku, Wong Yat-Fei', null, 'Ho Kam-An is a lovestruck dim sum delivery boy who falls for a beautiful judo student. After being humiliated by her boyfriend, Ho Kam-An seeks the services of an aging master who teaches him a half-assed style of kung fu, "Karate Kid"-style.', 'Ho Kam-An is a lovestruck dim sum delivery boy who falls for a beautiful judo student. After being humiliated by her boyfriend, Ho Kam-An seeks the services of an aging master who teaches him a half-assed style of kung fu, "Karate Kid"-style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OVkDveP5OrgAoV4fwWy7zoMLr5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53163'),
  ('212259068769463267', 'Love on Harbor Island', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Geoff Wallace, Matthew Tingey, C. Damon Harper', 'Lucie Guest, Andrea Shawcross', 'Morgan Kohan, Marcus Rosner, Brenda Matthews, Emma Cam, Jeff Gonek, Brendan Taylor, Tiffani Timms, Elizabeth McLaughlin', null, 'Interior designer Lily returns home to help her Aunt Maggie run her marina-side bed and breakfast when she meets Marcus, a handsome seaplane pilot whose work delivering rescue dogs helps Lily discover that home really is where the heart is', 'Interior designer Lily returns home to help her Aunt Maggie run her marina-side bed and breakfast when she meets Marcus, a handsome seaplane pilot whose work delivering rescue dogs helps Lily discover that home really is where the heart is', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBe7UPnqfEsMesPqx4j3pHmfYJr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:690211'),
  ('328401513156330602', 'Love on Ice', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Shelley Fairfield, Rob Cotterill, Stephen Bélanger', 'Matthew Coppola', 'Andrew W. Walker, Gail O''Grady, Julie Berman, Kate Drummond, Ipsita Paul, Ana Golja, Neil Crone, Linda Kash', null, 'Emily James, now 27 years old and considered a relic in the world of figure skating, gets an improbably shot to reclaim skating glory when a young coach sees greatness in her. Together, they find their love of skating goes beyond the ice.', 'Emily James, now 27 years old and considered a relic in the world of figure skating, gets an improbably shot to reclaim skating glory when a young coach sees greatness in her. Together, they find their love of skating goes beyond the ice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgJmMMxftJVkt94IJXuqbHkNj5r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433677'),
  ('664986404893075447', 'Love on Iceland', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Tómas Örn Tómasson, William Thomas Möller, Siggi Kjartan', null, 'Kaitlin Doubleday, Colin Donnell, Patti Murin, Preston Sadleir, Kate Easton, Jóel Sæmundsson, Sveinn Ólafur Gunnarsson, Svandís Dóra Einarsdóttir', null, 'Searching for a fresh podcast idea for work, Chloe heads on a spontaneous trip to Iceland with her college friends. She doesn’t expect to run into her ex, Charlie, but what starts as begrudgingly spending more time together, results in new beginnings for them both.', 'Searching for a fresh podcast idea for work, Chloe heads on a spontaneous trip to Iceland with her college friends. She doesn’t expect to run into her ex, Charlie, but what starts as begrudgingly spending more time together, results in new beginnings for them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ms64L6H4ffrjz6NwA6NAw1rGjZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649880'),
  ('219848363981726689', 'Love on Safari', 2018, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Leif Bristow, Daniel Villeneuve', 'Elizabeth Stewart', 'Lacey Chabert, Jon Cor, Brittany Bristow, Francis Chouler, John Indi, Patrick Lyster, Abigail Kubeka, Jonathan Roxmouth', null, 'An American web designer inherits an animal reserve in South Africa. A no-nonsense ranger takes her on a safari in hopes that she will fall in love with the land, the animals and him.', 'An American web designer inherits an animal reserve in South Africa. A no-nonsense ranger takes her on a safari in hopes that she will fall in love with the land, the animals and him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzvkk5W0yqyyNESMzhOz9oYL95H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525454'),
  ('978181575791149612', 'Love on the Amazon', 2026, 'Romance, Adventure, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Colin Theys', 'Juliana Wimbles', 'Jaicy Elliot, Rafael de la Fuente, Raissa Xavier, Omar Pelaez, Persephone Brada-Redman', 'TV-G', 'Claire travels to Brazil and hires Danny, a riverboat captain, to help her deliver an important message for her sister Amelia, a marine biologist studying pink dolphins on the Amazon River.', 'Claire travels to Brazil and hires Danny, a riverboat captain, to help her deliver an important message for her sister Amelia, a marine biologist studying pink dolphins on the Amazon River.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F6%2Fgracenote%2F674a2dba994d438083a31750e2ff6d8f.jpg', 'plex:movie:love-on-the-amazon'),
  ('998536689639908002', 'Love On The Cloud', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Gu Changwei', 'Yang Weiwei', 'AngelaBaby, Chen He, Zhang Luyi, Cao Lu, Wang Ji, Jiang Ruijia, Jiang Wenli, Tong Dawei', null, 'Romance gets complicated in modern-day Beijing.', 'Romance gets complicated in modern-day Beijing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wf50DWkxOuOThfY2rcgnR3ym0DP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313452'),
  ('648147104386401126', 'Love on the Dole', 1941, 'Drama', 'John Baxter, James Wilson', 'Rollo Gamble, Barbara K. Emary', 'Deborah Kerr, Clifford Evans, George Carney, Mary Merrall, Geoffrey Hibbert, Joyce Howard, Frank Cellier, Martin Walker', null, 'Depressing and realistic family drama about the struggles of unemployment and poverty in 1930s Lancashire. The 20-year-old Kerr gives an emotionally charged performance as Hardcastle, one of the cotton workers trying to make life better. Interlaced with humour that brings a ray of sunshine to the pervasive bleakness, this remains a powerful social study of life between the wars, and was a rare problem picture to come out of Britain at the time.', 'Depressing and realistic family drama about the struggles of unemployment and poverty in 1930s Lancashire. The 20-year-old Kerr gives an emotionally charged performance as Hardcastle, one of the cotton workers trying to make life better. Interlaced with humour that brings a ray of sunshine to the pervasive bleakness, this remains a powerful social study of life between the wars, and was a rare problem picture to come out of Britain at the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEX0D5HlksonyZMrFSduwHOJrto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81120'),
