  ('944493588834221483', 'Love on the Rise', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Ferguson Sauvé-Rogan, Ferguson Sauvé-Rogan', 'Elizabeth Snoderly, Ferguson Sauvé-Rogan, Lisa Chapman', 'Katrina Norman, Brad Benedict, Lexi Giovagnoli, Douglas Spain, Buzz Van Dyke, Jann Van Dyke, Amanda Goodyear, Jacob Keohane', null, 'A baker mistakes a wealthy bachelor for a waiter and the two quickly fall in love, not realizing his company is trying to evict her bakery.', 'A baker mistakes a wealthy bachelor for a waiter and the two quickly fall in love, not realizing his company is trying to evict her bakery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Twoq37KJudpNuXh5Zbp91IhsSq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676468'),
  ('892529017847740943', 'Love on the Riviera', 1958, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gianni Franciolini, Enzo Serafin, Andrea A. Tomassi', 'Sergio Amidei, Alberto Moravia, Ennio Flaiano', 'Alberto Sordi, Michèle Morgan, Marcello Mastroianni, Sylva Koscina, Dorian Gray, Jorge Mistral, Franca Marzi, Franco Fabrizi', null, 'It is Summer. It is the right time for love, especially in a most romantic place as Golfo del Tigullio. Different stories: Dorina looking for a rich lover; Clara who takes a fancy to the young Walter while her daughter Lina tries to save her; Aristarco who gave up his career to follow Ada''s, but who likes Jacqueline; Renata who is offered by her husband to Ferrari to get money; Marcello who, extraditing Micheline to France, misses the train and falls in love with her.', 'It is Summer. It is the right time for love, especially in a most romantic place as Golfo del Tigullio. Different stories: Dorina looking for a rich lover; Clara who takes a fancy to the young Walter while her daughter Lina tries to save her; Aristarco who gave up his career to follow Ada''s, but who likes Jacqueline; Renata who is offered by her husband to Ferrari to get money; Marcello who, extraditing Micheline to France, misses the train and falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXRUgyEkBAEK7CyCvZS3hW3T4um.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81872'),
