  ('939166177253564950', 'Love on the Sidelines', 2016, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Arlene L. Arnold, Mark Herfindahl, Adam Sliwinski', 'Judith Berg, Sandra Berg', 'Emily Kinney, John Reardon, Joe Theismann, Luisa d''Oliveira, Elise Gatien, Victor Zinck, Jr., Barbara Tyson, Hayley Sales', 'PG', 'A down-on-her-luck young woman who falls into a job as a personal assistant to a star quarterback sidelined with an injury. He''s never had a female assistant before and she knows nothing about football.', 'A down-on-her-luck young woman who falls into a job as a personal assistant to a star quarterback sidelined with an injury. He''s never had a female assistant before and she knows nothing about football.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPFXIYMzOX7LebQT53Bxc0R1eug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374607'),
  ('904621031372763305', 'Love on the Slopes', 2018, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Mike Kam, Paul Ziller', 'Kirsten Hansen', 'Katrina Bowden, Thomas Beaudoin, Anthony Konechny, Elysia Rotaru, Chris Shields, Corey Woods, Doron Bell, Beverley Breuer', null, 'NYC-based copy editor, Alex, is sent to Ridgeline Resort, an extreme sports outpost, to write a story for a travel writing competition. At first, she fails at everything – much to the chagrin of Cole, an extreme sports enthusiast who thinks this city girl should head back to New York. But when Alex offers to assist Cole with his local arts festival, he reluctantly obliges to be her guide as she faces her fears doing one extreme sport after the next.', 'NYC-based copy editor, Alex, is sent to Ridgeline Resort, an extreme sports outpost, to write a story for a travel writing competition. At first, she fails at everything – much to the chagrin of Cole, an extreme sports enthusiast who thinks this city girl should head back to New York. But when Alex offers to assist Cole with his local arts festival, he reluctantly obliges to be her guide as she faces her fears doing one extreme sport after the next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YVFAR9EkvVhUrKjg4TsA6nD621.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493762'),
