  ('720480565894537771', 'Love On-Air', 2012, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kwon Chil-in, Choi Joo-young', 'Kim Je-young', 'Lee Min-jung, Lee Jung-jin, Lee Kwang-soo, Seo Yeong, Jeong Yu-mi, Ahn Mi-na, Jeong Man-sik, Kim Jung-tae', null, 'Jin-ah, a radio host and singer, works hard to make sure she does well on air. When she is accused of plagiarism, her life is turned upside down and she must revive her career.', 'Jin-ah, a radio host and singer, works hard to make sure she does well on air. When she is accused of plagiarism, her life is turned upside down and she must revive her career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNIjAFmskXAODLlryy7Y17yb02j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94555'),
