  ('389836885007152090', 'Love Phobia', 2006, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kang Ji-eun, Kim Yong-heung, Shin Hak-sung', 'Hwang In-ho', 'Kang Hye-jung, Cho Seung-woo, Lee Jae-yong, Byeon Ju-yeon, Park Gun-tae, Jung Jin-young, Chung Sung-hwa, Kang Shin-il', null, 'On a sunny day, a boy named Jo-kang meets Ari, a girl in a yellow raincoat, and they become friends. Jo-kang falls helplessly in love with the quirky but attractive Ari, but one day, she suddenly disappears.', 'On a sunny day, a boy named Jo-kang meets Ari, a girl in a yellow raincoat, and they become friends. Jo-kang falls helplessly in love with the quirky but attractive Ari, but one day, she suddenly disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mpTwSDnlULTlq61bOSV5eZd9On.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87295'),
  ('793519055771050285', 'Love Potion No. 9', 1992, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Dale Launer, William Wages', 'Dale Launer', 'Sandra Bullock, Tate Donovan, Anne Bancroft, Blake Clark, Rebecca Staab, Mary Mara, Dale Midkiff, Hillary B. Smith', 'PG-13', 'Unlucky in love, chemist Paul Matthews visits gypsy Madame Rosa for help. Quickly realizing he is a hopeless nerd, she gifts him with Love Potion No. 8, which makes anyone who wears it irresistible to the opposite sex for four hours. Paul and animal psychologist coworker Diane Farrow decide to test it on themselves. The awkward pair suddenly find themselves alluring to anyone they approach, but soon realize they are most attracted to each other.', 'Unlucky in love, chemist Paul Matthews visits gypsy Madame Rosa for help. Quickly realizing he is a hopeless nerd, she gifts him with Love Potion No. 8, which makes anyone who wears it irresistible to the opposite sex for four hours. Paul and animal psychologist coworker Diane Farrow decide to test it on themselves. The awkward pair suddenly find themselves alluring to anyone they approach, but soon realize they are most attracted to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0DYahGGueR96mhajPGGgZpFL4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26255'),
