  ('269231028982478029', 'Love the Coopers', 2015, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Jessie Nelson, Elliot Davis, Chris Cleek', 'Steven Rogers', 'Diane Keaton, John Goodman, Ed Helms, Amanda Seyfried, Alan Arkin, Steve Martin, Olivia Wilde, Marisa Tomei', 'PG-13', 'When four generations of the Cooper clan come together for their annual Christmas Eve celebration, a series of unexpected visitors and unlikely events turn the night upside down, leading them all toward a surprising rediscovery of family bonds and the spirit of the holiday.', 'When four generations of the Cooper clan come together for their annual Christmas Eve celebration, a series of unexpected visitors and unlikely events turn the night upside down, leading them all toward a surprising rediscovery of family bonds and the spirit of the holiday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPW1BHZhUEViOmDAHFfyLezoQdI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333348'),
  ('22517263280921701', 'Love the Hard Way', 2003, 'Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Peter Sehr, Guy Dufaux', 'Marie Noëlle, Wang Shuo, Peter Sehr', 'Adrien Brody, Charlotte Ayanna, August Diehl, Jon Seda, Pam Grier, Liza Jessie Peterson, Elizabeth Regen, Kate Moennig', null, 'Claire, a brilliant student, seeks answers to the meaning of life in the calm of her biology laboratory. One day, she meets a mysterious young man, Jack, at the cinema, and is intrigued by his style, assurance and audacity.', 'Claire, a brilliant student, seeks answers to the meaning of life in the calm of her biology laboratory. One day, she meets a mysterious young man, Jack, at the cinema, and is intrigued by his style, assurance and audacity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3QvdfN1tE3Rf3oUhezBQBbgX4i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39125'),
  ('1067066077982051323', 'Love The Way You Are', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Dai Mengying, Zhou Tong', 'Dai Mengying, Zhou Tong', 'Vivian Sung, Song Weilong, Lin Yanrou, King Shih-chieh, Moon Wang, Phil Hou, Bernard Sen Jun, Sean Lin', null, 'Opposites clash when spunky girl next door Lin Lin meets eccentric nerd Yuke. Despite being neighbors and schoolmates since childhood, Lin Lin and Yuke barely know each other. When the pair are both admitted into the same university, Lin Lin discovers that Yuke harbors a secret crush for campus beauty, Ruting. Ever the busybody, Lin Lin decides to matchmake Yuke and Ruting, only to find herself gradually falling for Yuke.', 'Opposites clash when spunky girl next door Lin Lin meets eccentric nerd Yuke. Despite being neighbors and schoolmates since childhood, Lin Lin and Yuke barely know each other. When the pair are both admitted into the same university, Lin Lin discovers that Yuke harbors a secret crush for campus beauty, Ruting. Ever the busybody, Lin Lin decides to matchmake Yuke and Ruting, only to find herself gradually falling for Yuke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enWliJYULIHvPvxzTzneHSvdVzH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597295'),
  ('1071189134125972022', 'Love Thing', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Moritz Anton, Anika Decker, Manuel Kreuzpaintner', 'Anika Decker', 'Elyas M''Barek, Lucie Heinze, Peri Baumeister, Alexandra Maria Lara, Denis Moschitto, Linda Pöppel, Lucas Reiber, Rick Kavanian', null, 'Red carpet, spotlights, screaming fans, photo- graphers chasing for the best photo, camera teams waiting for interviews - a premiere is about to take place and everyone’s eagerly awaiting to see Germany‘s biggest film star, Marvin Bosch. But Marvin’s nowhere to be seen after his interview with the bitchy tabloid journalist Bettina Bamberger ended in disaster. On the run from the media, the star lands in a small, independent feminist LGBT+ theater called “3000” of all places, which is on the verge of going out of business.', 'Red carpet, spotlights, screaming fans, photo- graphers chasing for the best photo, camera teams waiting for interviews - a premiere is about to take place and everyone’s eagerly awaiting to see Germany‘s biggest film star, Marvin Bosch. But Marvin’s nowhere to be seen after his interview with the bitchy tabloid journalist Bettina Bamberger ended in disaster. On the run from the media, the star lands in a small, independent feminist LGBT+ theater called “3000” of all places, which is on the verge of going out of business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nlij46VZsHku2gWQMTO6BQv31e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790806'),
  ('12032441154231774', 'Love Thy Neighbour', 1973, 'Comedy', 'John Robins, Moray Grant', 'Vince Powell, Harry Driver', 'Jack Smethurst, Rudolph Walker, Kate Williams, Nina Baden-Semper, Bill Fraser, Charles Hyatt, Patricia Hayes, Melvyn Hayes', null, 'Two men who are nextdoor neighbors constantly battle it out over seemingly trivial offenses. Their wives, on the other hand, are best of friends. The two couples attempt to win a ''love-thy-neighbor'' competition by lying...', 'Two men who are nextdoor neighbors constantly battle it out over seemingly trivial offenses. Their wives, on the other hand, are best of friends. The two couples attempt to win a ''love-thy-neighbor'' competition by lying...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7K7Sq0QCNXwYwYewtwiZ7tTJusA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87068'),
