  ('41615169471399913', 'Love Under the Crucifix', 1962, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Yoshio Miyajima', 'Masashige Narusawa', 'Ineko Arima, Tatsuya Nakadai, Ganjirō Nakamura II, Mieko Takamine, Osamu Takizawa, Manami Fuji, Hisaya Ito, Kōji Nanbara', null, 'A tea master and his daughter Ogin are both Christians in feudal Japan. Ogin falls in love with a married feudal prince who shares her faith. When the Shogun bans Christianity, the situation worsens.', 'A tea master and his daughter Ogin are both Christians in feudal Japan. Ogin falls in love with a married feudal prince who shares her faith. When the Shogun bans Christianity, the situation worsens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wXdFRLVkf6d4E97ie8UtdHFrxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257089'),
  ('799862243206507679', 'Love Under the Date-Tree', 1990, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stavros Tsiolis', 'Dimitris Kehaidis, Stavros Tsiolis', 'Argyris Bakirtzis, Lazaros Andreou, Vina Asiki, Dora Masklavanou, Vicky Psaltidou, Maria Thanoglou, Frosso Litra, Christos Vakalopoulos', null, 'Panagiotis and Giannis are two good friends but also rivals in love. The first is a merchant and the second a violinist; one is tall and slim and the other short and fat; one is bossy, the other one mild. Both make an inimitable comic couple, wandering in the Peloponnese, looking for a date tree that will prove the innocence or guilt of the wife of one of them and possibly lover of the other. They are guided by an old picture depicting Panagiotis'' wife, Maria, in the arms of Giannis, under a date tree. However, the area of their search, there are no date trees.', 'Panagiotis and Giannis are two good friends but also rivals in love. The first is a merchant and the second a violinist; one is tall and slim and the other short and fat; one is bossy, the other one mild. Both make an inimitable comic couple, wandering in the Peloponnese, looking for a date tree that will prove the innocence or guilt of the wife of one of them and possibly lover of the other. They are guided by an old picture depicting Panagiotis'' wife, Maria, in the arms of Giannis, under a date tree. However, the area of their search, there are no date trees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Lfu3JGvq7woRhiVCpRCGT8S7BI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341502'),
