  ('234688151948616838', 'Love Wrecked', 2005, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Randal Kleiser, Jim Goldthwait, Dan Katzman', 'Stephen Langford', 'Amanda Bynes, Chris Carmack, Jonathan Bennett, Jamie-Lynn Sigler, Joey Kern, Lance Bass, Kathy Griffin, Fred Willard', 'PG-13', '18-year-old Jenny Taylor is ecstatic when she finds out that her favorite rock star, Jason Masters, is a guest at the tropical resort where she is working for the summer. When they are both thrown overboard during a Caribbean cruise, she saves his life and they find themselves stranded on a remote beach. Deliriously in love with the idea of time alone with him, she manages to hide the fact that they''re a stone''s throw away from their resort.', '18-year-old Jenny Taylor is ecstatic when she finds out that her favorite rock star, Jason Masters, is a guest at the tropical resort where she is working for the summer. When they are both thrown overboard during a Caribbean cruise, she saves his life and they find themselves stranded on a remote beach. Deliriously in love with the idea of time alone with him, she manages to hide the fact that they''re a stone''s throw away from their resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inCHWvO1EVXa2SYYaBLavL9KkjR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27902'),
  ('34759684354422656', 'Love You Like Christmas', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Graeme Campbell, Fraser Brown, Karl Jason', null, 'Brennan Elliott, Bonnie Somerville, Madison Brydges, Precious Chong, Richard Waugh, Graham Scott Fleming, Sadie LeBlanc, Andre Richards', null, 'Maddie, a high-powered marketing executive, is on her way to a client’s wedding but her plans are derailed by car trouble. When a fork in the road leads her to Christmas Valley, a town in love with Christmas, an unexpected encounter and a group of strangers that start to feel like family will have her questioning what she’s really been missing in life.', 'Maddie, a high-powered marketing executive, is on her way to a client’s wedding but her plans are derailed by car trouble. When a fork in the road leads her to Christmas Valley, a town in love with Christmas, an unexpected encounter and a group of strangers that start to feel like family will have her questioning what she’s really been missing in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GwTYscLzIVimiLAlnEPSZS3mpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421624'),
  ('417567414690492584', 'Love You to Death', 2019, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Greg Fawcett, Peter Menzies Jr., Alex Kalymnios', 'Anthony Jaswinski', 'Marcia Gay Harden, Emily Skeggs, Tate Donovan, Brennan Keel Cook, Kayla Deorksen, Kurt Ostlund, Alison Araya, Heather Doerksen', null, 'Inspired by a true story, this film tells the shocking tale of a mother and daughter who are nothing like they seem, their tumultuous relationship ending in a brutal murder.', 'Inspired by a true story, this film tells the shocking tale of a mother and daughter who are nothing like they seem, their tumultuous relationship ending in a brutal murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42Y8lRpaNZBMvzz1Rnv7RSQfqNs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574151'),
  ('237290859693389383', 'Love You To Debt', 2024, 'Drama, Romance, Action', 'Waasuthep Ketpetch, Wongwattana Chunhavuttiyanon, Chutigan Seechomphu', 'Yoo Gap-yeol', 'Vachirawit Chivaaree, Urassaya Sperbund, Pornchita Na Songkhla, Niti Chaichitathorn, Wachara Pan-iam, Wongsakorn Rassamitat, Prakpoom Jongmunwattana, D Gerrard', null, 'In the world of a famous seaside town in Thailand, he is a debt collector whose profession forces him into daily conflict and violence.', 'In the world of a famous seaside town in Thailand, he is a debt collector whose profession forces him into daily conflict and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTuoq2SOxGzFkrQnTmTmNh6HHnq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1052160'),
  ('145707268729082314', 'Love You You', 2011, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Jingle Ma Choh-Sing, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing', 'Jingle Ma Choh-Sing, Wang Jin-Qi', 'AngelaBaby, Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Zhu Yuchen, Zhou Yang, Steve Yap, Alvin Wong, He Jie, Weng Qia Te', null, 'A paralegal is sent on a undercover mission to inspect the young owner of a stunning beach resort for illegal practices. The pair bicker and fight, but the rules of attraction says otherwise...', 'A paralegal is sent on a undercover mission to inspect the young owner of a stunning beach resort for illegal practices. The pair bicker and fight, but the rules of attraction says otherwise...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofo0yDbZyk4NvndIWbIkKJp7DWF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79151'),
  ('964886893744021103', 'Love Your Enemies', 2022, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Jan Josef Liefers, Ralf Noack', 'Fred Breinersdorfer', 'Edgar Selge, Hans-Uwe Bauer, Barbara Schnitzler, Steffi Kühnert, Axel Prahl, Ilja Bultmann, Luca Gugolz, Stephan Grossmann', null, 'GDR, January 1990. After his ouster and the fall of the wall, dictator Erich Honecker and his wife Margot find themselves virtually homeless. Only Protestant pastor Uwe Holmer and his family, who, like many others, have suffered under his tyrannical regime, offer them refuge.', 'GDR, January 1990. After his ouster and the fall of the wall, dictator Erich Honecker and his wife Margot find themselves virtually homeless. Only Protestant pastor Uwe Holmer and his family, who, like many others, have suffered under his tyrannical regime, offer them refuge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKP8fMXGuvzevFqWLAoBtlH8QCx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:948182'),
  ('83921622673812527', 'Love Yourself Tender', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ivan Kitaev, Maxim Smirnov', 'Darya Gratsevich, Olga Primachenko', 'Olga Primachenko, Karina Razumovskaya, Artyom Tkachenko, Pelageya Nevzorova', null, 'Nadua is a successful otolaryngologist-surgeon, but by the age of 40 she suddenly realized that she didn''t know anything about herself at all. Every day at work, she examines the sensory organs of patients, but she has forgotten how to hear her own feelings, or maybe she has never heard them. Her husband Boris left her two years ago, unable to stand the routine, although the couple is still not divorced. Nadya brings up her daughter Oliviya and continues to live in her mother-in-law''s apartment. Nadya needs changes to see that there really is a lot of love in the world. And in her life there are six "lessons of tenderness", each of which will help her to find herself again, her own voice and her new hope.', 'Nadua is a successful otolaryngologist-surgeon, but by the age of 40 she suddenly realized that she didn''t know anything about herself at all. Every day at work, she examines the sensory organs of patients, but she has forgotten how to hear her own feelings, or maybe she has never heard them. Her husband Boris left her two years ago, unable to stand the routine, although the couple is still not divorced. Nadya brings up her daughter Oliviya and continues to live in her mother-in-law''s apartment. Nadya needs changes to see that there really is a lot of love in the world. And in her life there are six "lessons of tenderness", each of which will help her to find herself again, her own voice and her new hope.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F8Xn2VQp7tZEEvk0H3cdDAXVWQJy.jpg', 'plex:movie:be-gentle-with-yourself'),
  ('232133035409251823', 'Love, 100°C', 2010, 'Romance', 'Kim Jho Gwang-soo, Lee Hyung-bin', 'Kim Jho Gwang-soo, Min Yong-keun', 'Kim Do-jin, Kwak Jae-won, Yoon Se-hyun, Lee Sun-ju, Ryu Hye-young, Lee Ji-sun, Jung Jae-sik', null, 'Min-soo, a hearing-impaired boy, is gay and he likes his classmate, Ji-seok. One day, Min-soo impulsively has sex with a man who works in a public bath, an experience that lends him a new-found confidence, but at a heavy price.', 'Min-soo, a hearing-impaired boy, is gay and he likes his classmate, Ji-seok. One day, Min-soo impulsively has sex with a man who works in a public bath, an experience that lends him a new-found confidence, but at a heavy price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqzQWVGc8QkNJQuWfdmpOIkLXrT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113558'),
  ('16412198234843211', 'Love, Again', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Son Jin-yong, Park Yong-jib', 'Park Yong-jib', 'Kwon Sang-woo, Lee Jung-hyun, Lee Jong-hyuk, Sung Dong-il, Jung Sang-hoon, Kim Hyun-sook, Park Kyung-hye, Ku Sung-hwan', null, 'After an embarrassing divorce ceremony, Hyun-woo returns to the single life that he dreamed of and hopes to enjoy his freedom forever. Just six months later, his ex-wife Sun-young comes back into his life, but as the love interest of Sang-chul, an old friend from high school. Now he has to try and escape from her sudden return and avoid his friend who''s keen on introducing his new love to his old friend.', 'After an embarrassing divorce ceremony, Hyun-woo returns to the single life that he dreamed of and hopes to enjoy his freedom forever. Just six months later, his ex-wife Sun-young comes back into his life, but as the love interest of Sang-chul, an old friend from high school. Now he has to try and escape from her sudden return and avoid his friend who''s keen on introducing his new love to his old friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAV21X4HKpQjXxYJLEecCmpV9oi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572703'),
  ('987018907696777605', 'Love, Antosha', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Garret Price, Radan Popović', null, 'Anton Yelchin, Viktor Yelchin, Irina Korina, Nicolas Cage, Jennifer Lawrence, Chris Pine, John Cho, J.J. Abrams', null, 'From a prolific career in film and television, Anton Yelchin left an indelible legacy as an actor. Through his journals and other writings, his photography, the original music he wrote, and interviews with his family, friends, and colleagues, this film looks not just at Anton''s impressive career, but at a broader portrait of the man.', 'From a prolific career in film and television, Anton Yelchin left an indelible legacy as an actor. Through his journals and other writings, his photography, the original music he wrote, and interviews with his family, friends, and colleagues, this film looks not just at Anton''s impressive career, but at a broader portrait of the man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AntNP1sX7qKBT7hSYM4248RKMaL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565276'),
  ('935275290816554542', 'Love, Bitter', 2009, 'Drama', 'A. Taner Elhan, Renda Güner', 'Onur Ünlü', 'Halit Ergenç, Cansu Dere, Songül Öden, Ezgi Asaroğlu, Tuluğ Özlü, Ozan Osmanpaşaoğlu, Enis Yıldız, Serap Matyaş', null, 'Orhan, who works as a literature professor at a university in Eskisehir, unexpectedly ends his relationship with Ayse whom he was planning to marry, and comes to Istanbul where he meets Oya. After living possibly the happiest days of his life with Oya, who is a photographer, Orhan finds himself in the midst of a challenging love triangle as a result of the horrible things they encounter the first days of their marriage.', 'Orhan, who works as a literature professor at a university in Eskisehir, unexpectedly ends his relationship with Ayse whom he was planning to marry, and comes to Istanbul where he meets Oya. After living possibly the happiest days of his life with Oya, who is a photographer, Orhan finds himself in the midst of a challenging love triangle as a result of the horrible things they encounter the first days of their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFOsxJ6cQ8H4LvnOhhGl4IGct9m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35173'),
  ('891912426231217619', 'Love, Cheat & Steal', 1993, 'Thriller, Crime, TV Movie, Drama', 'William Curran, Jeff Crawford, Roger La Page', 'William Curran', 'John Lithgow, Eric Roberts, Mädchen Amick, Richard Edson, Donald Moffat, David Ackroyd, Dan O''Herlihy, Jason Workman', 'R', 'Paul Harrington thinks he has the perfect wife... stunning, kind, and ambitious. Yet behind Lauren''s pretty face lies a wicked person who sent her former boyfriend to jail by setting him up. Reno Adams has lost seven years of his life in Jail and wants revenge. After escaping, he tracks Lauren down and intends to make her and her husband''s life a living hell.', 'Paul Harrington thinks he has the perfect wife... stunning, kind, and ambitious. Yet behind Lauren''s pretty face lies a wicked person who sent her former boyfriend to jail by setting him up. Reno Adams has lost seven years of his life in Jail and wants revenge. After escaping, he tracks Lauren down and intends to make her and her husband''s life a living hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6clL4lnwo8ddC7Lj6yrgDUd6I4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90376'),
  ('486749432652120301', 'Love, Chunibyo & Other Delusions! Rikka Version', 2013, 'Comedy, Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Ai Yukimura, Rin Yamamoto, Yota Tsuruoka', 'Jukki Hanada', 'Soichiro Hoshi, Chinatsu Akasaki, Maaya Uchida, Jun Fukuyama, Sumire Uesaka, Eri Sendai, Azumi Asakura, Kanae Oki', 'PG-13', 'Summary of the first season of the show, as seen from Rikka''s perspective with new elements.', 'Summary of the first season of the show, as seen from Rikka''s perspective with new elements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GXDfLX2FRgPwn9L7CCFcWVe6YP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214553'),
  ('623427447917850556', 'Love, Chunibyo & Other Delusions! Take On Me', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Shouko Ikeda, Kohei Okamura, Futoshi Nishiya', 'Jukki Hanada', 'Jun Fukuyama, Maaya Uchida, Chinatsu Akasaki, Azumi Asakura, Sumire Uesaka, Juri Nagatsuma, Eri Sendai, Soichiro Hoshi', 'PG-13', 'Yuuta and Rikka are in their third year of high school. One day in Spring, Touka declares that she will take Rikka to Italy with her, as her job has stabilized there and thinks they should migrate together as a family. Touka is also worried about Rikka not being competent enough to advance to universities in Japan. The gangs from the club suggested Yuuta, who doesn''t want to be separated, to elope with Rikka!! A runaway drama throughout Japan begins.', 'Yuuta and Rikka are in their third year of high school. One day in Spring, Touka declares that she will take Rikka to Italy with her, as her job has stabilized there and thinks they should migrate together as a family. Touka is also worried about Rikka not being competent enough to advance to universities in Japan. The gangs from the club suggested Yuuta, who doesn''t want to be separated, to elope with Rikka!! A runaway drama throughout Japan begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGceYWj3oKCfEiMdaYbwovgvOnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460399'),
  ('958392713094401994', 'Love, Classified', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Stacey N. Harding, Will McKnight, Matthew Blecha', 'Lynn Sternberger', 'Melora Hardin, Katherine McNamara, Max Lloyd-Jones, Arienne Mandi, Matthew Kevin Anderson, Baraka Rahmani, Rohain Arora, Matina Birtch', 'G', 'Romance novelist Emilia is a whirlwind who blows back into the lives of her adult children, Taylor and Zach, under the pretense of a book signing arranged by her hometown''s local book shop. As Emilia tries to reconnect, Taylor and Zach explore new and past relationships through an app that boasts old-fashioned human connection by way of the classified ad. Zach is given a chance to heal old wounds while Taylor matches with a woman that changes the way she''s always thought about love.', 'Romance novelist Emilia is a whirlwind who blows back into the lives of her adult children, Taylor and Zach, under the pretense of a book signing arranged by her hometown''s local book shop. As Emilia tries to reconnect, Taylor and Zach explore new and past relationships through an app that boasts old-fashioned human connection by way of the classified ad. Zach is given a chance to heal old wounds while Taylor matches with a woman that changes the way she''s always thought about love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6oA5yWqcCyZ0q5358059jz5f8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939575'),
  ('773757583381691953', 'Love, Deutschmarks and Death', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Cem Kaya', 'Cem Kaya, Mehmet Akif Büyükatalay', 'İsmet Topçu, Ömer Boral, Yüksel Ergin, İhsan Ergin, Metin Türköz, Adnan Türköz, Yüksel Özkasap, Cevdet Yıldırım', null, 'Cem Kaya’s dense documentary essay celebrates 60 years of Turkish music in Germany. An alternative post-war history that is at the same time a musical Who’s Who – from Yüksel Özkasap to Derdiyoklar and Muhabbet.', 'Cem Kaya’s dense documentary essay celebrates 60 years of Turkish music in Germany. An alternative post-war history that is at the same time a musical Who’s Who – from Yüksel Özkasap to Derdiyoklar and Muhabbet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDhJTlhRo3GcaKmR0aDAosVmNiH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928350'),
  ('582431399708065204', 'Love, Divided', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Patricia Font, Bernat Bosch', 'Marta Sánchez', 'Aitana, Fernando Guallar, Natalia Rodríguez, Adam Jezierski, Paco Tous, Miguel Ángel Muñoz, Àlex Maruny, Macarena de Rueda', 'PG-13', 'Valentina is a young pianist starting over. Her neighbor David is an inventor who hates noise. And a paper-thin wall is about to become their matchmaker.', 'Valentina is a young pianist starting over. Her neighbor David is an inventor who hates noise. And a paper-thin wall is about to become their matchmaker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvrkAXaFFPpJCFcus18qlsGfOrz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005681'),
  ('329995737832468278', 'Love, etc.', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marion Vernoux, Éric Gautier, Olivier Coutard', 'Dodine Herry-Grimaldi, Marion Vernoux', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Yvan Attal, Charles Berling, Thibault de Montalembert, Élodie Navarre, Marie Adam, Charlotte Maury-Sentier, Yvan Martin', null, 'A triangle: love, obsession, and choice. Pierre, a ladies'' man who has little cash and no fixed residence, describes his best friend Benoît as the world''s oldest 32-year-old. The shy, well-employed Benoît''s life changes when he answers the personal ad of Marie, a 25-year-old who restores paintings. He''s attracted to her and she likes his steady calm and his honest attention. They''re soon a couple, and they include Pierre in their dinners, outings, and trips. What will happen when Pierre realizes that he too is in love with Marie?', 'A triangle: love, obsession, and choice. Pierre, a ladies'' man who has little cash and no fixed residence, describes his best friend Benoît as the world''s oldest 32-year-old. The shy, well-employed Benoît''s life changes when he answers the personal ad of Marie, a 25-year-old who restores paintings. He''s attracted to her and she likes his steady calm and his honest attention. They''re soon a couple, and they include Pierre in their dinners, outings, and trips. What will happen when Pierre realizes that he too is in love with Marie?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTeN63kPWnFYTVZNs1s0TR35oCL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186705'),
  ('1040247892551807148', 'Love, Eventually', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Vytautas Adomaitis, Jaunius Sarapinas, Danielė Zavadskytė', 'Matas Vildžius', 'Inga Jankauskaitė, Valentinas Krulikovskis, Deividas Breivė, Sofija Gedgaudaitė, Leonardas Pobedonoscevas', null, 'Two middle-agers - a dreamy fisherman and an emotionally guarded architect - are lured into five dates by their scheming adult children, only to discover through a series of awkward situations that it''s never too late to fall in love.', 'Two middle-agers - a dreamy fisherman and an emotionally guarded architect - are lured into five dates by their scheming adult children, only to discover through a series of awkward situations that it''s never too late to fall in love.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2qmv5DyUXt0t9JWeLycX1R0VBKh.jpg', 'plex:movie:kai-nesitiki'),
  ('1014570387079007710', 'Love, Fall & Order', 2019, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Kristoffer Carrillo, Ryan Miningham, Ryan McDowell', 'Audrey Shulman', 'Erin Cahill, Gregory Harrison, Trevor Donovan, Jan Broberg Felt, Hailey Smith, K.C. Clyde, Drew Fuller, Yolanda Stange', 'G', 'When Claire goes home to save her dad''s annual Fall Fest on her family''s pumpkin farm, sparks fly with an old rival – the opposing lawyer she now faces in court.', 'When Claire goes home to save her dad''s annual Fall Fest on her family''s pumpkin farm, sparks fly with an old rival – the opposing lawyer she now faces in court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kM8ZCOHDvRE8Qs499w0tfP06t0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631049'),
  ('1054069605065734809', 'Love, Forgotten', 2026, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Dániel Tiszeker, Ádám Pataki, Réka Tomasovszki', 'Dubinyák Réka, Fanni Szántó, Adam Abraham', 'Veronika Nemes-Jeles, Vivien Rujder, Estilla Mikecz, Judit Hernádi', null, 'Eszter is a successful actress who unexpectedly suffers an accident and suffers amnesia. It turns out that reality has been mixed up in her head: she believes that she lives in the nineties, is a hairdresser and is searching for the One.', 'Eszter is a successful actress who unexpectedly suffers an accident and suffers amnesia. It turns out that reality has been mixed up in her head: she believes that she lives in the nineties, is a hairdresser and is searching for the One.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FvysEQvmPwh2yJVLzOe21bZlECOy.jpg', 'plex:movie:beled-estem'),
  ('674134601057802129', 'Love, Game, Match', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Christine Conradt, Andy Hodgson', 'Michael Perronne', 'Cristine Prosperi, Dale Moss, Brooke Burfitt, Sylvia Grace Crim, Kim Baptiste, Emma Frances Burge, Fred Galle, Andrew Farrier', null, 'When economics teacher and new-in-town Liz challenges her high school students to create business plans, she has no idea that the class winners will actually start their own matchmaking service! Asked to set up her own profile to help them kickstart their careers, as well as team up with handsome tennis coach Ted to organize the school carnival, Liz must navigate the dynamics of this new school, as well as the algorithms of her own heart.', 'When economics teacher and new-in-town Liz challenges her high school students to create business plans, she has no idea that the class winners will actually start their own matchmaking service! Asked to set up her own profile to help them kickstart their careers, as well as team up with handsome tennis coach Ted to organize the school carnival, Liz must navigate the dynamics of this new school, as well as the algorithms of her own heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FGivyRD459et1VvmHwVoWE9mwH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912809'),
  ('543965429281520012', 'Love, Guaranteed', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy', 'José David Montero, Mark Steven Johnson', 'Elizabeth Hackett, Hilary Galanoy', 'Rachael Leigh Cook, Damon Wayans Jr., Heather Graham, Caitlin Howden, Brendan Taylor, Sebastian Billingsley-Rodriguez, Sean Amsing, Lisa Durupt', 'PG', 'A lawyer takes on a new client that wants to sue a dating website because it guarantees love.', 'A lawyer takes on a new client that wants to sue a dating website because it guarantees love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6K22JB6fZZLBuM0knfl8rs9Zoxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644090'),
  ('215052975050700618', 'Love, Honour and Obey', 2000, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Dominic Anciano, Ray Burdis, John Ward', 'Ray Burdis, Dominic Anciano', 'Jonny Lee Miller, Jude Law, Ray Winstone, Sean Pertwee, Rhys Ifans, Sadie Frost, Perry Benson, Ray Burdis', null, 'Jonny dreams of leaving his dead-end job as a courier. Through his childhood best friend, nephew of the notorious crime lord Ray Kreed, he wins his way into the toughest gang in North London. Hungry for action, Jonny sparks a feud between Ray''s gang and a rival firm in South London headed by drug kingpin Sean and his lieutenant Matthew.', 'Jonny dreams of leaving his dead-end job as a courier. Through his childhood best friend, nephew of the notorious crime lord Ray Kreed, he wins his way into the toughest gang in North London. Hungry for action, Jonny sparks a feud between Ray''s gang and a rival firm in South London headed by drug kingpin Sean and his lieutenant Matthew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVJ3ZLCHfWUMkV1sIhnJXDGbJUW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18002'),
  ('93583155543089805', 'Love, In Between', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chong Yun-su', 'Yong-jun Park, Chong Yun-su, Shin Yang-joong', 'Shin Eun-kyung, Jung Jun-ho, Shim Yi Young, Choi Jae-won, Kwon Seong-min, Lee Seon-jin', null, 'Formerly known as "Two Women" or "Freezing Rain". A man who wants all love, a wife who approaches her husband''s other woman, and a woman who wants to keep her love. A classy melodrama of these three people and their risky encounter.', 'Formerly known as "Two Women" or "Freezing Rain". A man who wants all love, a wife who approaches her husband''s other woman, and a woman who wants to keep her love. A classy melodrama of these three people and their risky encounter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mI8BczHfZSuLyiqNcfhq2Ps4toa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59866'),
  ('474437187444632959', 'Love, Lies', 2016, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Park Heung-sik, Shin Kyung-man, Kim Jun-sik', 'Ha Young-joon', 'Han Hyo-joo, Chun Woo-hee, Yoo Yeon-seok, Park Sung-woong, Jang Young-nam, Lee Han-wi, Ryu Hye-young, Kim Su-an', null, 'Two best friends, So-yool and Yeon-hee, dream of becoming the top artists in Seoul together. But their friendship doesn''t last long as Yoon-woo, So-yool''s first love and songwriter, falls in love with Yeon-hee and her voice. So-yool''s feeling of jealousy and inferiority towards Yeon-hee grows by the day, and she eventually makes a drastic decision to bring the two lovers down.', 'Two best friends, So-yool and Yeon-hee, dream of becoming the top artists in Seoul together. But their friendship doesn''t last long as Yoon-woo, So-yool''s first love and songwriter, falls in love with Yeon-hee and her voice. So-yool''s feeling of jealousy and inferiority towards Yeon-hee grows by the day, and she eventually makes a drastic decision to bring the two lovers down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohePb2nuja8VUEjhJIpbyiwAAgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385261'),
  ('160150296537808310', 'Love, Lights, Hanukkah!', 2020, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Randal Platt, Mark Jean', 'Karen Berger', 'Mia Kirshner, Ben Savage, Marilu Henner, Madeline Hirvonen, Brandi Alexander, Bradley Stryker, Michael Teigen, Advah Soudack', null, 'As Christina prepares her restaurant for its busiest time of year, she gets back a DNA test revealing that she’s Jewish. The discovery leads her to a new family and an unlikely romance over eight nights.', 'As Christina prepares her restaurant for its busiest time of year, she gets back a DNA test revealing that she’s Jewish. The discovery leads her to a new family and an unlikely romance over eight nights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPwBjXBgT8tOmtLuIIrBveYaa7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746062'),
  ('166619627646903266', 'Love, Lost & Found', 2021, 'Romance', 'John Lyde, John Lyde', 'Jake Stormoen, Melanie Stone', 'Trevor Donovan, Danielle Chuchran, Melanie Stone, Jake Stormoen', null, 'A shallow and slightly clueless social media influencer takes his girlfriend out to the wilderness with the intention of live-streaming "the most epic proposal ever!" But things take an unexpected turn after she slips off the edge of a cliff in order to get that perfect shot. It takes being separated in the wild and overcoming nature''s obstacles for them both to realize they just might not meant for each other...while finding love in new, unexpected places-like an old flame turned Search and Rescue volunteer, and a capable female park ranger.', 'A shallow and slightly clueless social media influencer takes his girlfriend out to the wilderness with the intention of live-streaming "the most epic proposal ever!" But things take an unexpected turn after she slips off the edge of a cliff in order to get that perfect shot. It takes being separated in the wild and overcoming nature''s obstacles for them both to realize they just might not meant for each other...while finding love in new, unexpected places-like an old flame turned Search and Rescue volunteer, and a capable female park ranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aguv9VfQLnK8fMXlCbxITdhgAcV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783790'),
  ('337619378007603041', 'Love, Marilyn', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Liz Garbus, Maryse Alberti', 'Ralph Greenson, Liz Garbus, Truman Capote', 'Marilyn Monroe, Elizabeth Banks, Lindsay Lohan, Evan Rachel Wood, Uma Thurman, Ben Foster, Jeremy Piven, Jennifer Ehle', 'NR', 'Using the book ''Fragments'', which collects Marilyn Monroe''s poems, notes and letters, and with participation from the Arthur Miller and Truman Capote estates who have contributed more material, each of the actresses will embody the legend at various stages in her life.', 'Using the book ''Fragments'', which collects Marilyn Monroe''s poems, notes and letters, and with participation from the Arthur Miller and Truman Capote estates who have contributed more material, each of the actresses will embody the legend at various stages in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWwZEW6kOpQ6CEw2n2y6kvVXYAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121831'),
  ('589116690203836579', 'Love, Math and Sex', 1997, 'Romance, Drama', 'Charlotte Silvera, Yves Cape', 'Charlotte Silvera, Jean-Luc Nivaggioni', 'Julie Delarme, Georges Corraface, Marie-Christine Barrault, Christophe Malavoy, Agnès Soral, Anna Prucnal, Marie Laforêt, Louis Navarre', null, 'A highly intelligent teenage girl has an affair with a 40-year-old man.', 'A highly intelligent teenage girl has an affair with a 40-year-old man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYST9YmEPJB8YGIMGBqjpHtZSLq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98501'),
  ('1049757543778058195', 'Love, Pain and Vice Versa', 2008, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Alfonso Pineda Ulloa, Damián García', 'Blas Valdez', 'Bárbara Mori, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Marina de Tavira, Joaquín Cosío, Irene Azuela, Tony Dalton, Marimar Vega, Alejandra Adame', 'PG-13', 'Chelo is an architect, withdrawing from her social life because of realistic dreams she''s having of a romance with a strange man. She''s convinced the man is real, out there, destined to be with her. She reports a rape to the police, describing the man of her dreams to a sketch artist. The police find a suspect: he''s Marcos, a physician. Chelo tells the police this is not the man who raped her, but now she has Marcos in her sights. Her plan for him to fall in love with her is complicated by his having a fiancée. What can Chelo do? Meanwhile, Marcos has violent dreams about an unfamiliar woman. Chronologies overlap, glass breaks. Can a mind lie to itself?', 'Chelo is an architect, withdrawing from her social life because of realistic dreams she''s having of a romance with a strange man. She''s convinced the man is real, out there, destined to be with her. She reports a rape to the police, describing the man of her dreams to a sketch artist. The police find a suspect: he''s Marcos, a physician. Chelo tells the police this is not the man who raped her, but now she has Marcos in her sights. Her plan for him to fall in love with her is complicated by his having a fiancée. What can Chelo do? Meanwhile, Marcos has violent dreams about an unfamiliar woman. Chronologies overlap, glass breaks. Can a mind lie to itself?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cxq4xuLxvF1aHdv1Znu3jGOXP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64228'),
  ('79493615186877865', 'Love, Romance & Chocolate', 2019, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Patrick Hella, Arnaud Kervyn, Bruno Illunga', 'Rebecca Schechter', 'Lacey Chabert, Will Kemp, Brittany Bristow, Guillaume Dolmans, Joseph Olivennes, Loriane Klupsch, Floriane Bibauw, Maarten Ketels', null, 'Emma and chocolatier Luc compete for Belgium''s Royal Chocolatier. The beauty and romance of Bruges inspire unique chocolate combinations, but will their entry win without them losing their hearts?', 'Emma and chocolatier Luc compete for Belgium''s Royal Chocolatier. The beauty and romance of Bruges inspire unique chocolate combinations, but will their entry win without them losing their hearts?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0ay0Td2gxq2zEdAlphb2RsdeTX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574936'),
  ('366407598062782594', 'Love, Rosie', 2014, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Christian Ditter, Christian Rein', 'Juliette Towhidi', 'Lily Collins, Sam Claflin, Christian Cooke, Tamsin Egerton, Suki Waterhouse, Jaime Winstone, Art Parkinson, Jamie Beamish', 'R', 'Since the moment they met at age 5, Rosie and Alex have been best friends, facing the highs and lows of growing up side by side. A fleeting shared moment, one missed opportunity, and the decisions that follow send their lives in completely different directions. As each navigates the complexities of life, love, and everything in between, they always find their way back to each other - but is it just friendship, or something more?', 'Since the moment they met at age 5, Rosie and Alex have been best friends, facing the highs and lows of growing up side by side. A fleeting shared moment, one missed opportunity, and the decisions that follow send their lives in completely different directions. As each navigates the complexities of life, love, and everything in between, they always find their way back to each other - but is it just friendship, or something more?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Mf9GgyNv5jjLAAPGsom9skH2Du.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200727'),
  ('195254868954920815', 'Love, So Divine', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Heo In-moo', 'Heo In-moo', 'Ha Ji-won, Kwon Sang-woo, Kim In-kwon, Kim In-mun, Kim Seon-hwa, Chun Woo-hee, Jeon Hye-jin, Kim Il-woo', null, 'Kyu-sik is a seminary student, who one day falls during a church service, dropping a precious, pope-blessed relic. As punishment, he and his comic relief friend Seon-dal are sent away to a small church in rural Korea to work in a sort of priest limbo until they get their act together.', 'Kyu-sik is a seminary student, who one day falls during a church service, dropping a precious, pope-blessed relic. As punishment, he and his comic relief friend Seon-dal are sent away to a small church in rural Korea to work in a sort of priest limbo until they get their act together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IPYhz6YcxASTg72XqOECfyAlSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49201'),
  ('697173843977500107', 'Love, Spells and All That', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Türksoy Gölebeyi, Ümit Ünal', 'Ümit Ünal', 'Ece Dizdar, Selen Uçer, Ayşenil Şamlıoğlu, Uygar Özçelik, Emrah Kolukısa, Damla Ersan, Tonguç Rador, Şirzat Bilallar', null, 'In their youth, Eren and Reyhan, who grew up in Büyükada, had a great love. As soon as their families heard about this relationship, they separated them. Eren, the daughter of a wealthy family, returns to the island years later and finds Reyhan in an unexpected situation.', 'In their youth, Eren and Reyhan, who grew up in Büyükada, had a great love. As soon as their families heard about this relationship, they separated them. Eren, the daughter of a wealthy family, returns to the island years later and finds Reyhan in an unexpected situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BwKqh7oe0ZGBuRHIi3AkOiVCHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636553'),
  ('133949730319485419', 'Love, Surreal and Odd', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Yılmaz Erdoğan', 'Aylin Kontente, Bülent Emrah Parlak, Büşra Pekin, Çağlar Çorumlu, Fatih Artman, Gupse Özay, Serkan Keskin, Şebnem Bozoklu', null, 'When a group of people meets at the same party, they form four different relationships, each experiencing similar phases of love.', 'When a group of people meets at the same party, they form four different relationships, each experiencing similar phases of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Q7oRuLgHhi3XMbIB9sOmDlw52Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447447'),
  ('535126318144151460', 'Love, Ted Bundy', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Christopher Cassel', 'Magda Gora', 'Tierra Therese Ellis, Joe Maria Fernandez, John Kennedy, Marc Moise, Mike Nyman', null, 'As notorious serial killer Ted Bundy awaited execution, he exchanged chilling letters with the woman he loved like a sister. Now she finally reveals the untold story of the letters, and her harrowing journey with the man she discovered was a monster.', 'As notorious serial killer Ted Bundy awaited execution, he exchanged chilling letters with the woman he loved like a sister. Now she finally reveals the untold story of the letters, and her harrowing journey with the man she discovered was a monster.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1QxozVBTyOM2U1ZP36ZvGzuEi6w.jpg', 'plex:movie:love-ted-bundy-2026'),
  ('1032363542724500903', 'Love, Wedding, Marriage', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Dermot Mulroney, Óttar Guðnason', 'Caprice Crane', 'Mandy Moore, Kellan Lutz, James Brolin, Jane Seymour, Jessica Szohr, Michael Weston, Marta Żmuda-Trzebiatowska, Richard Alan Reid', 'PG-13', 'A happy newlywed marriage counselor''s views on wedded bliss get thrown for a loop when she finds out her parents are getting divorced.', 'A happy newlywed marriage counselor''s views on wedded bliss get thrown for a loop when she finds out her parents are getting divorced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NrzuMavrCTh0j2CNs44BEWGg4C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59296'),
  ('273214340669049834', 'Love, Weddings & Other Disasters', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Nick Remy Matthews, Dennis Dugan', 'Dennis Dugan', 'Diane Keaton, Jeremy Irons, Maggie Grace, Diego Boneta, Andrew Bachelor, Veronica Ferres, Jesse McCartney, Melinda Hill', 'PG-13', 'A fussy celebrity caterer, a blind woman, a tour-bus guide and an inexperienced wedding planner search for love.', 'A fussy celebrity caterer, a blind woman, a tour-bus guide and an inexperienced wedding planner search for love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NyNfNop1gOLapYUdCA2VwCwbvk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627103'),
  ('120807345626952443', 'Love! Valour! Compassion!', 1997, 'Drama', 'Joe Mantello, Alik Sakharov', 'Terrence McNally', 'Jason Alexander, Stephen Spinella, Stephen Bogardus, Randy Becker, John Benjamin Hickey, Justin Kirk, John Glover', null, 'A group of gay friends spend summer weekends together at a lakeside house in upstate New York. As the season progresses and secrets begin to surface, the complex relationships within the group are sometimes strained and sometimes strengthened.', 'A group of gay friends spend summer weekends together at a lakeside house in upstate New York. As the season progresses and secrets begin to surface, the complex relationships within the group are sometimes strained and sometimes strengthened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IcLQpZZUPgevqj05xFbg40jTle.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64802'),
  ('167263696304524166', 'Love.com', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Anita Barbosa, André Lavenère, Paula Horta', 'Saulo Aride, Bruno Garotti, Leandro Matos', 'Isis Valverde, Gil Coelho, Joaquim Lopes, Carol Portes, Alexandra Richter, Marcos Mion, João Côrtes, César Cardadeiro', null, 'It''s a love story between a fashion blogger and a video game blogger. The beauty and the nerd.', 'It''s a love story between a fashion blogger and a video game blogger. The beauty and the nerd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6i8TdiQQ9d8uvtPcYVkzSWZQ4fQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448763'),
  ('262692176045197817', 'Love''s Abiding Joy', 2006, 'Drama, Romance, Western, Family, TV Movie', 'Michael Landon Jr., Brian Shanley', null, 'Erin Cottrell, Logan Bartholomew, William Morgan Sheppard, James Tupper, Irene Bedard, Dale Midkiff, Frank McRae, Drew Tyler Bell', null, 'The continued Westward journey of settlers Missie and Willie Lahaye. Their roots now firmly planted as they set up homestead in the far West, Missie begins to realize her passion for teaching as Willie cares for the couple''s young daughter Kathy while expanding the family ranch with a little help from sons Jeff and Matthew. When the frontier railroad comes to town, the pleasure of a long-promised visit from Missie''s father Clark is suddenly offset by the tragic death of young Kathy. As the untimely demise of their beloved daughter begins to drive an emotional wedge between Missie and Willie, the devastated father unexpectedly accepts an offer made by the powerful Samuel Doros to assume the role of town sheriff. Their faith shaken and their once close-knit bond suddenly torn asunder, Missie and Willie desperately attempt to bring their crumbling family back together as son Jeff faces a series of dangers while hopelessly falling for Doros'' beautiful daughter Colette.', 'The continued Westward journey of settlers Missie and Willie Lahaye. Their roots now firmly planted as they set up homestead in the far West, Missie begins to realize her passion for teaching as Willie cares for the couple''s young daughter Kathy while expanding the family ranch with a little help from sons Jeff and Matthew. When the frontier railroad comes to town, the pleasure of a long-promised visit from Missie''s father Clark is suddenly offset by the tragic death of young Kathy. As the untimely demise of their beloved daughter begins to drive an emotional wedge between Missie and Willie, the devastated father unexpectedly accepts an offer made by the powerful Samuel Doros to assume the role of town sheriff. Their faith shaken and their once close-knit bond suddenly torn asunder, Missie and Willie desperately attempt to bring their crumbling family back together as son Jeff faces a series of dangers while hopelessly falling for Doros'' beautiful daughter Colette.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnaJeSqEy4svDD0zaEdgoXtY4ug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22488'),
  ('1045181609412784287', 'Love''s Coming', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Naphat Chaithiangthum', 'Naphat Chaithiangthum', 'Jinna Pichit-O-Pakun, Papungkorn Sakunsong, Chanon Santinatornkul, Suraphat Kirivichien, Korn Khunatipapisiri', null, 'The storyline revolves around a group of schoolboys who suspect two of their number are in love with each other. They come up with ways to prove the secret love affair, but things get more complicated when a girl comes into play.', 'The storyline revolves around a group of schoolboys who suspect two of their number are in love with each other. They come up with ways to prove the secret love affair, but things get more complicated when a girl comes into play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBjxBar0IIOjrK1bcqzdPw9R1z9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287170'),
  ('238810399101324857', 'Love''s Crucible', 1922, 'Drama', 'Victor Sjöström, Julius Jaenzon', 'Hjalmar Bergman, Victor Sjöström', 'Jenny Hasselqvist, Ivan Hedqvist, Tore Svennberg, Gösta Ekman, Knut Lindroth, Waldemar Wohlström, Nils Asther, Torsten Bergström', null, 'At the end of the middle ages, Ursula is accused of having poisoned her own husband. She claims she is innocent, but to prove it, she must submit to a ritual: trial by fire, walking on fire along a path leading directly to a crucifix. A film that has been much commended for the visual creativity shown by the director in successive blending in of images involving Ursula, her husband, the Virgin Mary, and Jesus Christ. Much applauded, also: the performance of Jenny Hasselqvist, thus described by French director René Clair: “We shall never forget her flaming eyes, the severity of her spirit, her abrupt and alarmed expressions, like an animal under threat.”', 'At the end of the middle ages, Ursula is accused of having poisoned her own husband. She claims she is innocent, but to prove it, she must submit to a ritual: trial by fire, walking on fire along a path leading directly to a crucifix. A film that has been much commended for the visual creativity shown by the director in successive blending in of images involving Ursula, her husband, the Virgin Mary, and Jesus Christ. Much applauded, also: the performance of Jenny Hasselqvist, thus described by French director René Clair: “We shall never forget her flaming eyes, the severity of her spirit, her abrupt and alarmed expressions, like an animal under threat.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBLv9XJ48zOUbXTEFKDyu5AZ7zn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210381'),
  ('867401924725165808', 'Love''s Deadly Triangle: The Texas Cadet Murder', 1997, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Richard A. Colla, James L. Carter', 'Steve Johnson', 'Holly Marie Combs, David Lipper, Cassidy Rae, Gary Grubbs, Kurt Fuller, Dee Wallace, JoAnna Garcia Swisher, Joanna Canton', null, 'Based on a true story, this film recounts the story of Diane Zamora and David Graham, two high school sweethearts who swear to always be together, even as they enter separate military academies. But when David confesses he had an affair with a classmate, Diane has an ultimatum, leading the two into a murderous pact with severe repercussions.', 'Based on a true story, this film recounts the story of Diane Zamora and David Graham, two high school sweethearts who swear to always be together, even as they enter separate military academies. But when David confesses he had an affair with a classmate, Diane has an ultimatum, leading the two into a murderous pact with severe repercussions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzSnmvDyJxodFmrO4I40igCvbRE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201703'),
  ('511867123032318004', 'Love''s Enduring Promise', 2004, 'Drama, Romance, Western, Family, TV Movie', 'Michael Landon Jr., Maximo Munzi, Lance Lanfear', null, 'January Jones, Logan Bartholomew, Dale Midkiff, Katherine Heigl, Kesun Loder, Logan Arens, Mackenzie Astin, Cliff DeYoung', null, 'In the 1800s frontier, Missie Davis is a bright and beautiful schoolteacher whose love for the prairie is matched only by her passion for books. When Missie encounters Grant, a handsome New England railroad executive, she feels as though she''s met a hero from one of her novels.', 'In the 1800s frontier, Missie Davis is a bright and beautiful schoolteacher whose love for the prairie is matched only by her passion for books. When Missie encounters Grant, a handsome New England railroad executive, she feels as though she''s met a hero from one of her novels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aakkjr1wjTO8T2a3bPsYKGkKtLX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20641'),
  ('344670508262590320', 'Love''s Kitchen', 2011, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'James Hacking, Jordan Cushing', 'James Hacking', 'Dougray Scott, Claire Forlani, Holly Gibbs, Lee Boardman, Michelle Ryan, Matthew Clancy, Peter Bowles, Katrine De Candole', 'PG-13', 'Rob Haley, an up-and-coming chef and restaurateur in London, is grief-stricken when he loses his wife. With encouragement from his infamous friend and real life TV Chef Gordon Ramsay, Rob decides to spice up his life by turning a run-down country pub into a gourmet restaurant. His food catches the eye - and taste buds - of beautiful American food critic Kate Templeton and they soon both write a recipe for love that leaves both their hearts - and their stomachs - in full.', 'Rob Haley, an up-and-coming chef and restaurateur in London, is grief-stricken when he loses his wife. With encouragement from his infamous friend and real life TV Chef Gordon Ramsay, Rob decides to spice up his life by turning a run-down country pub into a gourmet restaurant. His food catches the eye - and taste buds - of beautiful American food critic Kate Templeton and they soon both write a recipe for love that leaves both their hearts - and their stomachs - in full.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKedM3lkGfqrXfbJdRuaerFwC7z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66945'),
  ('754574198078084736', 'Love''s Labour''s Lost', 2000, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Kenneth Branagh, Alex Thomson, Sallie Hard', 'Kenneth Branagh', 'Alessandro Nivola, Alicia Silverstone, Natascha McElhone, Kenneth Branagh, Carmen Ejogo, Matthew Lillard, Adrian Lester, Emily Mortimer', 'PG', 'A scholarly king and his three companions swear off the society of women for three years, only to have a diplomatic visit from a French princess and her three ladies-in-waiting thwart their intentions.', 'A scholarly king and his three companions swear off the society of women for three years, only to have a diplomatic visit from a French princess and her three ladies-in-waiting thwart their intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rJr9b0Mc8wEAqzuDUkz0zg1BX7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51333'),
  ('794856799569817088', 'Love''s Last Resort', 2017, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Garrett O''Brien, Chris Fishel, Clifford Breakfield', 'Melissa Rundle', 'Alix Angelis, Thomas Beaudoin, Jesse Hutch, April Bowlby, Lily Rains, Alan Thicke, Ellen Greene, Bob Rumnock', null, 'After ten years of dating, Chloe’s boyfriend Eric still hasn’t matured. Hoping to give him the push he needs, she dumps him; confident Eric will grow up and beg her to come back. However, six months later, Eric meets Chloe for dinner with big news: he’s getting married in a week. Needing a break to mend her broken heart, Chloe takes a vacation, but when she arrives, she learns that Eric and his fiancée are getting married at the same resort!', 'After ten years of dating, Chloe’s boyfriend Eric still hasn’t matured. Hoping to give him the push he needs, she dumps him; confident Eric will grow up and beg her to come back. However, six months later, Eric meets Chloe for dinner with big news: he’s getting married in a week. Needing a break to mend her broken heart, Chloe takes a vacation, but when she arrives, she learns that Eric and his fiancée are getting married at the same resort!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jJ1HazHHm9y5eafS5KprFchPCq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463314'),
  ('333424027073456245', 'Love''s Long Journey', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, Western, Family, TV Movie', 'Michael Landon Jr., Brian Shanley, Athena Pesante', null, 'Erin Cottrell, Logan Bartholomew, William Morgan Sheppard, Dale Midkiff, James Tupper, Frank McRae, Johann Urb, John Savage', null, 'Missie''s surprise pregnancy sets her on a new course that is both thrilling and terrifying. After all the planning and dreaming, she and her husband Willie are headed west in a covered wagon, leaving behind the prairie home of Missie''s parents. Now, caught between the excitement of the new adventure and the pain of not knowing when she''ll see her family again, Missie copes with the challenges, and cherishes the rewards, of her new homestead.', 'Missie''s surprise pregnancy sets her on a new course that is both thrilling and terrifying. After all the planning and dreaming, she and her husband Willie are headed west in a covered wagon, leaving behind the prairie home of Missie''s parents. Now, caught between the excitement of the new adventure and the pain of not knowing when she''ll see her family again, Missie copes with the challenges, and cherishes the rewards, of her new homestead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYPJFCO5h2Cd46ObIqeuelNX8EW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20583'),
  ('960609491835006001', 'Love''s Unending Legacy', 2007, 'Drama, Romance, Western, Family, TV Movie', 'Mark Griffiths, Brian Shanley', 'Pamela Wallace', 'Erin Cottrell, Holliston Coleman, Victor Browne, Hank Stratton, Braeden Lemasters, Dave Florek, Stephanie Nash, Bret Loehr', null, 'Missie three years later: being a single mother after her husband Willie was shot during a poker scuffle. She and Maddy move back in with her parents Clark and Marty. She finds a new home, and finds a new teaching position that she settles right into, but Missie has lost all faith in herself, until a chance encounter at her father''s church where she adopts homeless orphan Belinda Marshall.', 'Missie three years later: being a single mother after her husband Willie was shot during a poker scuffle. She and Maddy move back in with her parents Clark and Marty. She finds a new home, and finds a new teaching position that she settles right into, but Missie has lost all faith in herself, until a chance encounter at her father''s church where she adopts homeless orphan Belinda Marshall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xi57bQTg33RpduDphkvtdWkEI7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30975'),
  ('237654326968305779', 'Love''s Unfolding Dream', 2007, 'Drama, Romance, Western, Family, TV Movie', 'Harvey Frost', null, 'Erin Cottrell, Scout Taylor-Compton, Dale Midkiff, Robert Pine, Victor Browne, Samantha Smith, Patrick Levis, Nancy Linehan Charles', 'PG', 'Centers on Missy''s adopted daughter Belinda Tyler as she follows her dream. Belinda wants to be a doctor, but this time period does not look kindly on women with careers, especially one in the medical field. But Belinda is a strong-minded woman and deeply wants a career as a doctor. She manages to prove her abilities while assisting the local doctor and caring for an old woman who recently experienced a stroke. Belinda nurses her back to health and helps her regain the use of her arm again. Belinda also meets the nephew of their deceased neighbor. Drew comes to town to get his uncle''s farm in shape to sell. After that he intends on returning to New York to join his father''s law practice. He has no desire to stay in this small, unsophisticated town. But after meeting Belinda he has second thoughts. Belinda also feels something for Drew, but she is conflicted because she wants to be a doctor...', 'Centers on Missy''s adopted daughter Belinda Tyler as she follows her dream. Belinda wants to be a doctor, but this time period does not look kindly on women with careers, especially one in the medical field. But Belinda is a strong-minded woman and deeply wants a career as a doctor. She manages to prove her abilities while assisting the local doctor and caring for an old woman who recently experienced a stroke. Belinda nurses her back to health and helps her regain the use of her arm again. Belinda also meets the nephew of their deceased neighbor. Drew comes to town to get his uncle''s farm in shape to sell. After that he intends on returning to New York to join his father''s law practice. He has no desire to stay in this small, unsophisticated town. But after meeting Belinda he has second thoughts. Belinda also feels something for Drew, but she is conflicted because she wants to be a doctor...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OCcCfioaoUS1q5nemO8uSciKRj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49857'),
  ('788543846591602753', 'Love''s Whirlpool', 2014, 'Drama', 'Daisuke Miura, Shin Hayasaka', 'Daisuke Miura', 'Sosuke Ikematsu, Mugi Kadowaki, Kenichi Takitoh, Eriko Nakamura, Hirofumi Arai, Yoko Mitsuya, Muck Akazawa, Ryusuke Komakine', null, 'A room in a fancy downtown apartment. The evening orgy kicks off with eight men and women meeting for the first time, including an unemployed guy who pays the 20,000 yen party fee with money from his parents, and a female college student whose run-of-the-mill appearance hides a voracious sexual appetite.', 'A room in a fancy downtown apartment. The evening orgy kicks off with eight men and women meeting for the first time, including an unemployed guy who pays the 20,000 yen party fee with money from his parents, and a female college student whose run-of-the-mill appearance hides a voracious sexual appetite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tW5fNVdn5dCr5KC0tmZ05AVkuTM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279185'),
  ('182243459435540574', 'Love/Juice', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kaze Shindo, Koji Kanaya, Yoshiyuki Ikawa', 'Kaze Shindo', 'Mika Okuno, Chika Fujimura, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Toshiya Nagasawa', null, 'Twenty-something lesbian Chinatsu shares a one-bedroom apartment with heterosexual Kyoko. Although Chinatsu and Kyoko have a passing attraction, Kyoko is mostly interested in men, especially one who tends the fish in a pet store, who despite her efforts, doesn''t seem to be interested in her.', 'Twenty-something lesbian Chinatsu shares a one-bedroom apartment with heterosexual Kyoko. Although Chinatsu and Kyoko have a passing attraction, Kyoko is mostly interested in men, especially one who tends the fish in a pet store, who despite her efforts, doesn''t seem to be interested in her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSMdbUu34LifKE0FlGpz9oXKGvf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125710'),
  ('659214230662603887', 'Love+Sling', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kim Dae-woong, Lee Hyung-deok, Park Cheong-woo', 'Kim Dae-woong', 'Yoo Hai-jin, Kim Min-jae, Lee Sung-kyung, Sung Dong-il, Jin Kyung, Na Moon-hee, Hwang Woo-seul-hye, Park Gyu-young', null, 'A former wrestler bonds with his son over the sport. But then the son''s girlfriend falls in love with the father.', 'A former wrestler bonds with his son over the sport. But then the son''s girlfriend falls in love with the father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDBKygZb24ekwcGonQGXqSGcqaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518682'),
  ('319072045757006157', 'Loveable', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lilja Ingolfsdottir, Øystein Mamen, Paul Tunge', 'Lilja Ingolfsdottir', 'Helga Guren, Oddgeir Thune, Heidi Gjermundsen, Maja Tothammer-Hruza, Marte Magnusdotter Solem, Elisabeth Sand, Aksel August Lenander-Lervik, Victor Roll Nordstoga', null, 'Maria finds herself at a crossroads when her husband suddenly announces that he wants to end their relationship. She must either let her whole world come crashing down, or come to terms with the life she has and find a way forward.', 'Maria finds herself at a crossroads when her husband suddenly announces that he wants to end their relationship. She must either let her whole world come crashing down, or come to terms with the life she has and find a way forward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3g1ikwXdRC3PoVHSoH8JM97G0jx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1082900'),
  ('840073092466829257', 'Lovecraft: Fear of the Unknown', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Frank H. Woodward', 'Frank H. Woodward', 'Neil Gaiman, John Carpenter, Guillermo del Toro, Ramsey Campbell, Stuart Gordon, S.T. Joshi, Caitlin R. Kiernan, Andrew Migliore', 'NR', 'A chronicle of the life, work and mind that created the Cthulhu mythos.', 'A chronicle of the life, work and mind that created the Cthulhu mythos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pQUzBpALk2aSApgQW43xJE7l1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44038'),
  ('792729766732373086', 'Lovecut', 2020, 'Drama', 'Iliana Estañol, Johanna Lietha', 'Johanna Lietha, Iliana Estañol', 'Sara Toth, Kerem Abdelhamed, Luca von Schrader, Max Kuess, Melissa Irowa, Valentin Gruber, Raphaela Gasper, Alexander Jagsch', null, 'Through different intersecting stories, the film tells about the lives of three teenage couples who are trying to find their own identities in a digital paced world.', 'Through different intersecting stories, the film tells about the lives of three teenage couples who are trying to find their own identities in a digital paced world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/subhzhanuzxPhh1jotcRJa8eJdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655524'),
  ('970989743473412325', 'Loved', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Erin Dignam, Reynaldo Villalobos', 'Erin Dignam', 'Robin Wright, William Hurt, Anthony Lucero, Richard Schiff, Jennifer Rubin, Paul Dooley, Amy Madigan, Natsuko Ohama', null, 'After a man is accused of driving his third wife to suicide, his first wife Hedda, a troubled woman who can''t hate or hurt others even if they had wronged her, is subpoenaed to testify on his abusive behavior during their marriage.', 'After a man is accused of driving his third wife to suicide, his first wife Hedda, a troubled woman who can''t hate or hurt others even if they had wronged her, is subpoenaed to testify on his abusive behavior during their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44TM8OWnhL4JXHcCcAQChJ5LGnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55139'),
  ('136407039819711363', 'Loved Gun', 2004, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kensaku Watanabe, Kei Yasuda', 'Kensaku Watanabe', 'Masatoshi Nagase, Aoi Miyazaki, Hirofumi Arai, Ittoku Kishibe, Hironobu Nomura, Seiichi Tanabe, Genjiro Arato', null, 'A story about a hitman named Hayamada who carries a distinctive red gun. As the film progresses we discover the reason for his work, and how he came to be alone. His aim right now is to reach a desitination, but he''s late.', 'A story about a hitman named Hayamada who carries a distinctive red gun. As the film progresses we discover the reason for his work, and how he came to be alone. His aim right now is to reach a desitination, but he''s late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqj2124Bj92xLjTof4NjGtNo5FF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52727'),
  ('195267665200594489', 'Loved Up', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Cattaneo, Pip Short, Julian Court', 'Ol Parker', 'Lena Headey, Ian Hart, Linda Bassett, Milly Gregory, Jason Isaacs, Rick Warden, Charlie Creed-Miles, Andrew Rajan', null, 'Tells the story of a girl who, while working in a London cafe, meets a "raver" who introduces her to the drug Ecstasy and the whole British drugs scene. The girl falls in love with the raver, played splendidly by Ian Hart, but - when fired from her cafe job - she becomes involved with the seedier world of dealing.', 'Tells the story of a girl who, while working in a London cafe, meets a "raver" who introduces her to the drug Ecstasy and the whole British drugs scene. The girl falls in love with the raver, played splendidly by Ian Hart, but - when fired from her cafe job - she becomes involved with the seedier world of dealing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUWLYSye8aKd53zC2RBzTe5hmml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88412'),
  ('1037362256040821016', 'Lovefilm', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'István Szabó, József Lörincz', 'István Szabó', 'András Bálint, Judit Halász, Edit Kelemen, András Szamosfalvi, Rita Békés, Mária Boga, Erzsébet Mialkovszky, Péter Huszti', null, 'A story of two young people in Hungary, Jancsi and Kata. First they are good friends, later lovers. Soon after the 1956 Revolution Kata leaves Hungary, Jancsi stays there. After 10 years Jancsi is allowed to visit Kata in France, their love is reborn, but after a short, very happy period Jancsi has to return to Hungary and their love fades as years have gone by.', 'A story of two young people in Hungary, Jancsi and Kata. First they are good friends, later lovers. Soon after the 1956 Revolution Kata leaves Hungary, Jancsi stays there. After 10 years Jancsi is allowed to visit Kata in France, their love is reborn, but after a short, very happy period Jancsi has to return to Hungary and their love fades as years have gone by.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSXSZT64iA9Q964PfwLjm9Brz3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79264'),
  ('715137976536019502', 'Lovelace', 2013, 'Drama', 'Jeffrey Friedman, Rob Epstein, Eric Alan Edwards', 'Andy Bellin', 'Amanda Seyfried, Sharon Stone, Robert Patrick, Peter Sarsgaard, Hank Azaria, Juno Temple, Wes Bentley, Adam Brody', 'R', 'Story of Linda Lovelace, who is used and abused by the porn industry at the behest of her coercive husband, before taking control of her life.', 'Story of Linda Lovelace, who is used and abused by the porn industry at the behest of her coercive husband, before taking control of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibt7chnBsaDbE6ZVwyneuZwYfsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77805'),
  ('81748644199593972', 'Loveland', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Romance, Thriller', 'Ivan Sen, Michael Bate, Rebecca Keros', 'Ivan Sen', 'Ryan Kwanten, Jillian Nguyen, Hugo Weaving, Michael Chan, Rhamsy, Franck Matour, Andrew Ng, Shinji Ikefuji', 'R', 'In an uncharted future, two hardened souls meet and confront each other with the things they have done and what they have become.', 'In an uncharted future, two hardened souls meet and confront each other with the things they have done and what they have become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vShzct1YA6Fh7UwoNHkjZoZuav5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659924'),
  ('125845451216028107', 'Loveless', 2017, 'Drama', 'Andrey Zvyagintsev, Mikhail Krichman, Asya Gusakova', 'Oleg Negin, Andrey Zvyagintsev', 'Maryana Spivak, Aleksey Rozin, Matvey Novikov, Alexey Fateev, Marina Vasilyeva, Andris Keišs, Nataliya Potapova, Sergey Borisov', null, 'Zhenya and Boris are going through a vicious divorce marked by resentment, frustration and recriminations. Already embarking on new lives, each with a new partner, they are impatient to start again, to turn the page – even if it means threatening to abandon their 12-year-old son Alyosha. Until, after witnessing one of their fights, Alyosha disappears.', 'Zhenya and Boris are going through a vicious divorce marked by resentment, frustration and recriminations. Already embarking on new lives, each with a new partner, they are impatient to start again, to turn the page – even if it means threatening to abandon their 12-year-old son Alyosha. Until, after witnessing one of their fights, Alyosha disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBUsLGZoGuLKMuHj19mjG9iCDoq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429174'),
  ('760864974232272942', 'Lovelife', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jon Harmon Feldman', 'Jon Harmon Feldman', 'Saffron Burrows, Bruce Davison, Sherilyn Fenn, Carla Gugino, Peter Krause, Matt Letscher, Jon Tenney', 'R', 'Twenty-somethings learn the ups and downs of single life in the 90''s as they struggle with commitment, jealousy, and the nightmare of dating a friend of a friend.', 'Twenty-somethings learn the ups and downs of single life in the 90''s as they struggle with commitment, jealousy, and the nightmare of dating a friend of a friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f16baW8QfvZhUS4TvW6R9HPwZoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114558'),
  ('186553733059543', 'Lovelines', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Duke Callaghan, Rod Amateau, Laura Andrus', 'Chip Hand, William Byron Hillman', 'Greg Bradford, Mary Beth Evans, Don Michael Paul, Tammy Taylor, Stacey Toten, Robert DeLapp, Todd Bryant, Frank Zagarino', 'R', 'Greed, lust, dirty tricks and bloody fist fights... All those things that make life worth living. When Piper and Rick, the two hottest properties in the Battle of the Bands want to make it, only one thing stands in their way. They''re from opposing High Schools. And Malibu High''s 6''6" muscle-bound monster Godzilla is going to do everything and anything stop his sweet little sister getting it on with some jerk from the Coldwater Canyon High. When all else fails, only Lovelines answering service can keep them together.', 'Greed, lust, dirty tricks and bloody fist fights... All those things that make life worth living. When Piper and Rick, the two hottest properties in the Battle of the Bands want to make it, only one thing stands in their way. They''re from opposing High Schools. And Malibu High''s 6''6" muscle-bound monster Godzilla is going to do everything and anything stop his sweet little sister getting it on with some jerk from the Coldwater Canyon High. When all else fails, only Lovelines answering service can keep them together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3UhAjpsOvkbIIrYGgByoMJTiPQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84771'),
