  ('19136544844622074', 'Lovelorn Leghorn', 1951, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'The other hens make fun of Miss Prissy, who still has not found a husband. Prissy sets out, rolling pin in hand, to find one, and she comes upon confirmed bachelor Foghorn Leghorn in the midst of his feud with the barnyard dog. The dog helps Prissy take Foghorn as her mate by knocking him out and stuffing him in a picnic basket!', 'The other hens make fun of Miss Prissy, who still has not found a husband. Prissy sets out, rolling pin in hand, to find one, and she comes upon confirmed bachelor Foghorn Leghorn in the midst of his feud with the barnyard dog. The dog helps Prissy take Foghorn as her mate by knocking him out and stuffing him in a picnic basket!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odj8L6vuXUyQpFc8P6H91shcTDF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121169'),
  ('435193798019148504', 'Lovely & Amazing', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Nicole Holofcener, Harlan Bosmajian, Nicholas Lee', 'Nicole Holofcener', 'Catherine Keener, Brenda Blethyn, Emily Mortimer, Raven Goodwin, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Clark Gregg, Jake Gyllenhaal, James Le Gros', null, 'An intimate family portrait of four hapless but resilient women and the bittersweet lessons they learn in keeping up with the hectic demands of their individual neuroses. Each of the women seeks redemption in her own haphazard way, but whatever salvation they find is illusory and short-lived.', 'An intimate family portrait of four hapless but resilient women and the bittersweet lessons they learn in keeping up with the hectic demands of their individual neuroses. Each of the women seeks redemption in her own haphazard way, but whatever salvation they find is illusory and short-lived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HZ7Y7N4KHapO5ylOY8BePQYC5X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50035'),
  ('3880439620125536', 'Lovely Boy', 2021, 'Drama, Music', 'Gianluca Palma, Francesco Lettieri, Salvatore Cerella', 'Peppe Fiore, Francesco Lettieri', 'Andrea Carpenzano, Daniele Del Plavignano, Ludovica Martino, Riccardo De Filippis, Enrico Borello, Federica Rosellini, Valerio Desirò, Rosella Tancredi', null, 'Nic, also called "Lovely Boy", is the rising star of the roman suburbs. Tattoos and pure talent, he creates the XXG with his friend Borneo, a music duo that is headed straight to the top. Nic is then sucked into a spiral of self-destruction, which will lead him to a breaking point: he will soon have to deal with himself.', 'Nic, also called "Lovely Boy", is the rising star of the roman suburbs. Tattoos and pure talent, he creates the XXG with his friend Borneo, a music duo that is headed straight to the top. Nic is then sucked into a spiral of self-destruction, which will lead him to a breaking point: he will soon have to deal with himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3pNP2dtWZr9nAsA8brXSIQDMlo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:817959'),
  ('359259582202405993', 'Lovely Complex', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kitaji Ishikawa', 'Osamu Suzuki', 'Ema Fujisawa, Teppei Koike, Nami Tamaki, Risa Kudo, Susumu Terajima, Shizuyo Yamasaki, Yusuke Yamazaki, Hiro Mizushima', null, 'Koizumi Risa an unusually tall high school girl, meets the "vertically challenged" young man Otani Atsushi. They find common ground in height anxieties and interests. Risa, a tall Japanese girl, gets rejected by a boy because she is taller than him. Otani, a short Japanese guy, gets rejected by a girl because he is shorter than her. Obviously these two would make the oddest of couples and would never be a good match for each other right?', 'Koizumi Risa an unusually tall high school girl, meets the "vertically challenged" young man Otani Atsushi. They find common ground in height anxieties and interests. Risa, a tall Japanese girl, gets rejected by a boy because she is taller than him. Otani, a short Japanese guy, gets rejected by a girl because he is shorter than her. Obviously these two would make the oddest of couples and would never be a good match for each other right?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gg29jTdK3oQtl79dHqpyJey4gC5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37213'),
