  ('341702036128092218', 'Lovers Lost', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Takashi Kawamata', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Tatsuo Nogami', 'Keiko Matsuzaka, Hiroyuki Sanada, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Koichi Sato, Mariko Kaga, Maki Carrousel, Akira Emoto, Rei Okamoto', null, 'A poignant love story between a 29-year-old woman, who has once been a prostitute but is now the mistress of a wealthy jewelry merchant, and a 19-year-old college student.', 'A poignant love story between a 29-year-old woman, who has once been a prostitute but is now the mistress of a wealthy jewelry merchant, and a 19-year-old college student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBgIMPKwo5w6m0794659GnofJVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157786'),
  ('416004593883508687', 'Lovers of 6 Years', 2008, 'Romance, Drama', 'Park Hyun-jin, Park Yong-su', 'Park Hyun-jin, Yang Hyeon-chan, Choi Jin-young', 'Kim Ha-neul, Yoon Kye-sang, Shin Sung-rok, Kim Hye-ok, Lee Dae-yeon, Cha Hyun-jung, Kim Jae-rok, Ok Ji-young', null, 'Da-Jin and Jae-Young have been in an all too comfortable relationship for the past six years. Although they don''t live together, their apartments reside side by side. But trouble brews for the couple when they begin to fall for their respective co-workers. Can Da-Jin and Jae-Young''s relationship survive these outside temptations?', 'Da-Jin and Jae-Young have been in an all too comfortable relationship for the past six years. Although they don''t live together, their apartments reside side by side. But trouble brews for the couple when they begin to fall for their respective co-workers. Can Da-Jin and Jae-Young''s relationship survive these outside temptations?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFZJ6snNRD0ZZvfjN5sRJegXh5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18464'),
  ('1007063173909346879', 'Lovers of Devil''s Island', 1973, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco', 'Jesús Franco', 'Andrés Resino, Geneviève Robert, Dennis Price, Rosa Palomar, Josyane Gibert, Danielle Godet, Gogó Rojo, Jean-Louis Collins', null, 'A lawyer finds out that a young couple convicted of murder was in fact framed for the crime and goes to the prison with the hope of freeing them and learns the events that happened to the two from a fellow prisoner who helped them escape.', 'A lawyer finds out that a young couple convicted of murder was in fact framed for the crime and goes to the prison with the hope of freeing them and learns the events that happened to the two from a fellow prisoner who helped them escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liq9KXVesxLnXEhk7qzKOLv7HmA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120186'),
