  ('324090046648438979', 'Lovers of the Arctic Circle', 1998, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Julio Medem, Gonzalo F. Berridi, Fernando Victoria de Lecea', 'Julio Medem', 'Najwa Nimri, Fele Martínez, Nancho Novo, Maru Valdivielso, Sara Valiente, Peru Medem, Kristel Díaz, Víctor Hugo Oliveira', 'R', 'As young children, Otto and Ana become best friends, leading to the marriage of Ana''s mother to Otto''s father. When Otto and Ana become teenagers, they begin a sexual relationship, which they hide from their parents. The two fall deeply in love and seem destined to spend the rest of their lives together. However, their relationship is tested when Otto''s mother dies and the two are separated.', 'As young children, Otto and Ana become best friends, leading to the marriage of Ana''s mother to Otto''s father. When Otto and Ana become teenagers, they begin a sexual relationship, which they hide from their parents. The two fall deeply in love and seem destined to spend the rest of their lives together. However, their relationship is tested when Otto''s mother dies and the two are separated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hUFwXtUIJQdayIkaTR835QyaKT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1414'),
  ('664135861433528742', 'Lovers of the Café Flore', 2006, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Ilan Duran Cohen', null, 'Anna Mouglalis, Lorànt Deutsch, Caroline Silhol, Kal Weber, Clémence Poésy, Julien Baumgartner, Sarah Stern, Didier Sandre', null, 'In 1924, Simone de Beauvoir, a girl with polished appearance, prepares for her final examination in philosophy and meets Jean-Paul Sartre. He seems to know her true personality and considers her the only woman worthy of his intellect. Their chaotic love serves as the premise for her magnum opus The Second Sex.', 'In 1924, Simone de Beauvoir, a girl with polished appearance, prepares for her final examination in philosophy and meets Jean-Paul Sartre. He seems to know her true personality and considers her the only woman worthy of his intellect. Their chaotic love serves as the premise for her magnum opus The Second Sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jij7HrQTAKNsCD8NRN8wizYPDex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142023'),
  ('403657559797149563', 'Lovers: A True Story', 1991, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Vicente Aranda, José Luis Alcaine', 'Vicente Aranda, Álvaro del Amo, Carlos Pérez Merinero', 'Victoria Abril, Jorge Sanz, Maribel Verdú, Saturnino García, Enrique Cerro, Mabel Escaño, Alicia Agut, José Cerro', 'NR', 'A torrid affair between a recently discharged serviceman and an attractive widow leads to murder.', 'A torrid affair between a recently discharged serviceman and an attractive widow leads to murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QcqoV8HwHJQEvhAcV5OAAq0WuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41782'),
  ('506932943591401631', 'Lovers'' Concerto', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lee Han, Nam Jin-a', 'Lee Han', 'Cha Tae-hyun, Son Ye-jin, Lee Eun-ju, Moon Geun-young, Kwak Jung-wook, Lee Moon-sik', null, 'A college student befriends two cute girls his age. He loses contact with them. He tries to find them years later.', 'A college student befriends two cute girls his age. He loses contact with them. He tries to find them years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vW1wzczT4ZYvwARJkZx3k4EfD0h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54332'),
  ('890513386743144360', 'Lovers'' Net', 1955, 'Romance, Drama', 'Henri Verneuil, Claude Pinoteau, Roger Hubert', 'Marcel Rivet', 'Daniel Gélin, Françoise Arnoul, Trevor Howard, Marcel Dalio, Amália Rodrigues, Betty Stockfeld, Jacques Moulières, Georges Chamarat', null, 'Daniel Gelin plays a soldier who is acquitted after committing a crime of passion. Relocating to Lisbon, and still feeling remorse over his impulsive killing of his faithless wife, Gelin manages to find love in the form of gorgeous widow Francoise Arnoul. Alas, it turns out that Arnoul has a sordid past of her own, leaving our hero sadder but wiser.', 'Daniel Gelin plays a soldier who is acquitted after committing a crime of passion. Relocating to Lisbon, and still feeling remorse over his impulsive killing of his faithless wife, Gelin manages to find love in the form of gorgeous widow Francoise Arnoul. Alas, it turns out that Arnoul has a sordid past of her own, leaving our hero sadder but wiser.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9TRK3Uk3Nwy42q7ET0wmchS5Mu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122231'),
  ('413600829254220015', 'Loves of a Blonde', 1965, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Miloš Forman, Ivan Passer, Miroslav Ondříček', 'Miloš Forman, Ivan Passer, Jaroslav Papoušek', 'Hana Brejchová, Vladimír Pucholt, Vladimír Menšík, Ivan Kheil, Jiří Hrubý, Milada Ježková, Josef Šebánek, Josef Kolb', null, 'Andula, an innocent Czech girl from a factory town, is desperately in search of love. She believes she''s found it when she beds Milda, a charming young musician visiting from Prague. Milda, however, is only looking for a casual encounter, and leaves town assuming he''ll never see Andula again. But when Andula doesn''t hear from him, she packs up and heads to Prague, to the surprise of Milda and his parents.', 'Andula, an innocent Czech girl from a factory town, is desperately in search of love. She believes she''s found it when she beds Milda, a charming young musician visiting from Prague. Milda, however, is only looking for a casual encounter, and leaves town assuming he''ll never see Andula again. But when Andula doesn''t hear from him, she packs up and heads to Prague, to the surprise of Milda and his parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyRg6Qh4oN1KRfkx8Q3DFzA642P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39387'),
  ('57600980547520276', 'Loves of a French Pussycat', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Hans Billian, Stanislav Szomolányi', 'Hans Billian', 'Sybil Danning, Michael Cromer, Marlène Appelt, Katja Büchele, Ulla Kopa, Fernando Gómez, Heinz Peter Schuck, Olga Bringmann', null, 'Rolf, a sex-advice columnist and a lecher, has affairs with numerous women, but never a permanent relationship. Suzanne, one of his ex-lovers, offers to bet that no woman can get Rolf to propose marriage, a bet her girlfriend Andrea eagerly accepts. But there''s a catch: To win the bet, Andrea must get the womanizing Rolf to commit to marriage without first going to bed with him.', 'Rolf, a sex-advice columnist and a lecher, has affairs with numerous women, but never a permanent relationship. Suzanne, one of his ex-lovers, offers to bet that no woman can get Rolf to propose marriage, a bet her girlfriend Andrea eagerly accepts. But there''s a catch: To win the bet, Andrea must get the womanizing Rolf to commit to marriage without first going to bed with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdTvop9C03TkoWCK0KIgfTIqLlg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264980'),
  ('96384704711728474', 'Loves of Casanova', 1927, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Alexandre Volkoff, Anatole Litvak, Léonce-Henri Burel', 'Norbert Falk, Ivan Mosjoukine, Alexandre Volkoff', 'Ivan Mosjoukine, Diana Karenne, Suzanne Bianchetti, Jenny Jugo, Rina De Liguoro, Nina Koshetz, Olga Day, Paul Guidé', null, 'Republic of Venice, 1760. Pursued by a vengeful husband, the intrepid womanizer Casanova, who symbolizes the decline of the city and its fall into debauchery, manages to escape and, by a circuitous route, arrives in Saint Petersburg, where he will be involved in the many plots that threaten the throne of Czar Peter III…', 'Republic of Venice, 1760. Pursued by a vengeful husband, the intrepid womanizer Casanova, who symbolizes the decline of the city and its fall into debauchery, manages to escape and, by a circuitous route, arrives in Saint Petersburg, where he will be involved in the many plots that threaten the throne of Czar Peter III…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftflZmKts3kYFoXiS1RHtYS048A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66449'),
  ('142544264738176754', 'Lovesick', 1983, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Marshall Brickman, Gerry Fisher', 'Marshall Brickman', 'Dudley Moore, Elizabeth McGovern, John Huston, Alan King, Gene Saks, Wallace Shawn, Ron Silver, Renée Taylor', 'PG', 'Sigmund Freud''s ghost advises a married New York psychiatrist in love with a patient.', 'Sigmund Freud''s ghost advises a married New York psychiatrist in love with a patient.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73lfTXbEaQCxCCRzz7NHRg7bhAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71357'),
  ('942363321922261695', 'Lovesick', 2011, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Rocky Jo', 'Rocky Jo', 'Ariel Lin, Chen Bolin, Li Yifeng, Joelle Lu, Renee Yuan, Yang Zishan, Michael Tao, Edwin Gerard', null, 'Liang Ruoqing is a girl who, after being lied to and dumped by her ideal high-school boyfriend Ai Ren, develops love phobia and vows to never fall in love again. However, she meets a handsome doctor Lu Zhehan at her grandfather''s hospital. Lu Zhehan seems to be the perfect guy but since she doesn''t believe in "perfect" anymore, she thinks that he is too good to be true. Her new journey begins when she tries to show to all of the women that this doctor is not as good as everyone thinks he is, but fate is playing a trick on her. The more she tries to uncover his hidden evil nature, the more she discovers that he may be the right guy to cure her love phobia.', 'Liang Ruoqing is a girl who, after being lied to and dumped by her ideal high-school boyfriend Ai Ren, develops love phobia and vows to never fall in love again. However, she meets a handsome doctor Lu Zhehan at her grandfather''s hospital. Lu Zhehan seems to be the perfect guy but since she doesn''t believe in "perfect" anymore, she thinks that he is too good to be true. Her new journey begins when she tries to show to all of the women that this doctor is not as good as everyone thinks he is, but fate is playing a trick on her. The more she tries to uncover his hidden evil nature, the more she discovers that he may be the right guy to cure her love phobia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oFNEEfqvhePQd7CLqkJsxrrAgF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89941'),
  ('119168326148636228', 'Lovesick', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Luke Matheny, Bobby Webster, Vanessa Rodriguez Spencer', 'Dean Young', 'Matt LeBlanc, Ali Larter, Adam Rodriguez, Ashley Williams, Rebecca Naomi Jones, Carsen Warner, Connie Sawyer, Cameron Richardson', null, 'The story of Charlie Darby, who has everything going for him: a great job, friends, family, the whole package. The one thing Charlie doesn''t have is love, because every time he gets close, he goes clinically insane. When he meets the perfect girl, Charlie must overcome his psychosis to claim his chance at true love.', 'The story of Charlie Darby, who has everything going for him: a great job, friends, family, the whole package. The one thing Charlie doesn''t have is love, because every time he gets close, he goes clinically insane. When he meets the perfect girl, Charlie must overcome his psychosis to claim his chance at true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxFjqVyBjzvjLrBQ5wKvxdC3OyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319389'),
  ('938280221168573552', 'Lovesick', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hsu Fu-hsiang, Garvin Chan, Yu Hui-wen', 'Hsu Fu-hsiang, Wang Yu-chen', 'Zhan Huai-yun, Victoria Chiang, Liu Hsiu-fu, Akira Huang, Umin Boya, Pink Yang, Bai Jing-yi, Ernest Kung', null, 'A love story that starts with pretending to be sick, describing a troubled teenager named Ye Zijie who always loves to get into trouble. By chance, he discovered that "it''s good to be sick".', 'A love story that starts with pretending to be sick, describing a troubled teenager named Ye Zijie who always loves to get into trouble. By chance, he discovered that "it''s good to be sick".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ePumjbIaNRWQsNw5xxLCPCvpZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1321139'),
  ('873461630110840514', 'Lovesick Ellie', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Koichiro Miki, Shu Kawashima, Jun Yokoishi', 'Satoko Okazaki', 'Nanoka Hara, Ryubi Miyase, Takuya Nishimura, Mizuho Shiromiya, Kodai Fujimoto, Keito Tsuna, Yuta Koseki, Mako Yamaguchi', null, 'Eriko Ichimura has an ordinary and unnoticed student life at her high school. Her only joy is to watch popular male student Akira Omi and imagine them being a couple. She writes down those thoughts on her social media account under the name of Lovesick Ellie. Akira Omi seems like a perfect guy, with good looks and gentle personality. One day, she witnesses Akira Omi spouting vulgar language and she realizes he is kind of like a two-faced person. Making things worse, her fantasy thoughts are discovered by him. He thinks that she is funny and he approaches her.', 'Eriko Ichimura has an ordinary and unnoticed student life at her high school. Her only joy is to watch popular male student Akira Omi and imagine them being a couple. She writes down those thoughts on her social media account under the name of Lovesick Ellie. Akira Omi seems like a perfect guy, with good looks and gentle personality. One day, she witnesses Akira Omi spouting vulgar language and she realizes he is kind of like a two-faced person. Making things worse, her fantasy thoughts are discovered by him. He thinks that she is funny and he approaches her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udQmpEgdBFQmiF0rKaLDmrpwpT5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1260982'),
  ('890081161597733533', 'Lovesong', 2001, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'This lush, sensuous film is based on paintings of unusual variety and intricacy. Brakhage''s desire to include all the complexities of living in his work is evident in this "love song."', 'This lush, sensuous film is based on paintings of unusual variety and intricacy. Brakhage''s desire to include all the complexities of living in his work is evident in this "love song."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejUTMQ41xKAymHMTDWXm2ysl54.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126218'),
  ('458980543716814920', 'Lovesong', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'So Yong Kim, Guy Godfree, Kat Westergaard', 'So Yong Kim, Bradley Rust Gray', 'Riley Keough, Jena Malone, Jessie Ok Gray, Sky Ok Gray, Brooklyn Decker, Amy Seimetz, Ryan Eggold, Rosanna Arquette', null, 'Neglected by her husband, Sarah embarks on an impromptu road trip with her young daughter and her best friend, Mindy. Along the way, the dynamic between the two friends intensifies before circumstances force them apart. Years later, Sarah attempts to rebuild their intimate connection in the days before Mindy’s wedding.', 'Neglected by her husband, Sarah embarks on an impromptu road trip with her young daughter and her best friend, Mindy. Along the way, the dynamic between the two friends intensifies before circumstances force them apart. Years later, Sarah attempts to rebuild their intimate connection in the days before Mindy’s wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43yEeZbFeFOah9mZWIIJe57STKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371447'),
  ('137351660540933404', 'Lovestruck: The Musical', 2013, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance, Music, TV Movie', 'Sanaa Hamri, H.H. Cooper, Checco Varese', 'Jaylynn Bailey, Terry Rossio', 'Chelsea Kane, Drew Seeley, Sara Paxton, Tom Wopat, Jane Seymour, Alexander DiPersia, Adrienne Bailon-Houghton, Sarab Kamoo', null, 'Harper was one of the best dancers to hit Broadway, but an injury caused her to leave the spotlight, become a choreographer, and raise her daughter Mirabella. When Mirabella decides to quit the show to get married, her mother is determined to put a stop to the wedding and show Mirabella that she cannot give up her career for love.', 'Harper was one of the best dancers to hit Broadway, but an injury caused her to leave the spotlight, become a choreographer, and raise her daughter Mirabella. When Mirabella decides to quit the show to get married, her mother is determined to put a stop to the wedding and show Mirabella that she cannot give up her career for love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SYu78HqqrDw0Pph44Ikr1eNJbN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189204'),
  ('1111047082423477686', 'Lovey-Dovey', 2007, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Strizhenov, Grigoriy Yablochnikov, Stanislav Dmitriev', 'Alexander Oleynikov', 'Gosha Kutsenko, Kristina Orbakayte, Evgeniy Stychkin, Mikhail Kozakov, Andrey Krasko, Aleksandr Strizhenov, Yekaterina Strizhenova, Olga Orlova', null, 'Andrei and Marina are married for 7 years and they feel there is no more love. They ask a famous doctor to help them, and he helps... by putting their minds into the bodies of each other. Now Andrei is in his wife''s head, so he lives the life of his own wife, who runs an art gallery, and Marina in the body of Andrei becomes a lawyer...', 'Andrei and Marina are married for 7 years and they feel there is no more love. They ask a famous doctor to help them, and he helps... by putting their minds into the bodies of each other. Now Andrei is in his wife''s head, so he lives the life of his own wife, who runs an art gallery, and Marina in the body of Andrei becomes a lawyer...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22TlILLLWmzAwQpv7Y3eS7NDvR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62731'),
  ('787207890774981575', 'Lovey-Dovey 2', 2008, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Maxim Pezhemsky, Anton Antonov', 'Andrey Kureychik, Alexander Oleynikov', 'Kristina Orbakayte, Gosha Kutsenko, Alina Bulynko, Denis Paramonov, Mikhail Kozakov, Lydia Velezheva, Kirill Pletnyov, Olga Orlova', null, 'In this sequel of Lovey-Dovey Andrey and Marina are exchanging bodies again - but this time with their children.', 'In this sequel of Lovey-Dovey Andrey and Marina are exchanging bodies again - but this time with their children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld0lAkm461RRIA9q9DDiTDxOr5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62732'),
  ('976968962254828199', 'Loveyapa', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Advait Chandan, Tanishk Bagchi, Ramesh Nare', 'Sneha Desai', 'Junaid Khan, Khushi Kapoor, Kunj Anand, Grusha Kapoor, Ashutosh Rana, Tanvika Parlikar, Kiku Sharda, Aditya Kulshreshtha', null, 'The madness after a couple exchanges their mobile phones and begins to unearth bitter truth about each other.', 'The madness after a couple exchanges their mobile phones and begins to unearth bitter truth about each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohHiDAwaOo6R1ovMgmUhrBuvknU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1213866'),
  ('597057593659592873', 'Loveyatri', 2018, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Abhiraj Minawala, Jishnu Bhattacharjee, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Niren Bhatt', 'Aayush Sharma, Hira Warina, Kamil Lemieszewski, Dilyana Bouklieva, Hiten Patel, Colin Murtagh, Preety Tarsariya, Danny Mahoney', null, 'Romance blossoms between young Sushrut and Michelle when they meet during the festival of Navratri. When Michelle returns home to the United Kingdom, Sushrut embarks on an adventurous journey through a strange land to win back the woman he loves.', 'Romance blossoms between young Sushrut and Michelle when they meet during the festival of Navratri. When Michelle returns home to the United Kingdom, Sushrut embarks on an adventurous journey through a strange land to win back the woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aq5RNE6L8gPSQwSaueur97IbpFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549829'),
  ('51499424366012775', 'Loving', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'Irvin Kershner, Edward Folger, Allan Wertheim', 'Don Devlin', 'George Segal, Eva Marie Saint, Sterling Hayden, Keenan Wynn, Nancie Phillips, Janis Young, David Doyle, Paul Sparer', 'R', 'Brooks Wilson is in crisis. He is torn between his wife Selma and two daughters and his mistress Grace, and also between his career as a successful illustrator and his feeling that he might still produce something worthwhile.', 'Brooks Wilson is in crisis. He is torn between his wife Selma and two daughters and his mistress Grace, and also between his career as a successful illustrator and his feeling that he might still produce something worthwhile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwMISwAert29Hr8ntky9B80fCez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92269'),
  ('903408805388839086', 'Loving', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jeff Nichols, Adam Stone, Cas Donovan', 'Jeff Nichols', 'Joel Edgerton, Ruth Negga, Michael Shannon, Marton Csokas, Nick Kroll, Bill Camp, Sharon Blackwood, Alano Miller', 'PG-13', 'In 1958, in the state of Virginia, the idea of interracial marriage was not only considered to be immoral to many, it was also illegal. When Richard and Mildred fall in love, they are aware of the eyes staring at them and the words said behind their backs. It''s when they get married, however, that words and looks become actions, and the two are arrested. The couple decide to take their case all of the way to the Supreme Court in order to fight for their love. Based on a true story.', 'In 1958, in the state of Virginia, the idea of interracial marriage was not only considered to be immoral to many, it was also illegal. When Richard and Mildred fall in love, they are aware of the eyes staring at them and the words said behind their backs. It''s when they get married, however, that words and looks become actions, and the two are arrested. The couple decide to take their case all of the way to the Supreme Court in order to fight for their love. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teNPeDIRGWxtvMaJsNa7lw5IgiL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339419'),
  ('281016403933552034', 'Loving', 2017, 'Romance', 'Esteban Crespo, Ángel Amorós', 'Esteban Crespo, Mario Fernández Alonso', 'María Pedraza, Pol Monen, Natalia Tena, Greta Fernández, María Caballero, Fran Morales, Gustavo Salmerón, Antonio Valero', null, 'Laura and Carlos love each other as if every day was the last, and perhaps that first love intensity is what will tear them apart a year later.', 'Laura and Carlos love each other as if every day was the last, and perhaps that first love intensity is what will tear them apart a year later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uOMVZ6oG00xjq0KQiExRBw2s3P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441614'),
  ('779680326680725849', 'Loving Adults', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Barbara Topsøe-Rothenborg, Philippe Kress', null, 'Dar Salim, Sonja Richter, Sus Wilkins, Mikael Birkkjær, Lars Ranthe, Morten Burian, Iris Mealor Olsen, Benjamin Kitter', null, 'The thin line between love and hate turns deadly when a wife discovers her husband’s affair — and they both take extreme measures to get what they want.', 'The thin line between love and hate turns deadly when a wife discovers her husband’s affair — and they both take extreme measures to get what they want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSNHg7qReDtBk1u2PaSSzTTQ8ax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:990691'),
  ('206949714535184187', 'Loving Annabelle', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Katherine Brooks, Cynthia Pusheck, John Samaras', 'Katherine Brooks', 'Erin Kelly, Diane Gaidry, Laura Breckenridge, Michelle Horn, Gustine Fudickar, Ilene Graff, Kevin McCarthy, Markus Flanagan', 'NR', 'Annabelle is the wise-beyond-her-years newcomer to an exclusive Catholic girls school. Having been expelled from her first two schools she''s bound to stir some trouble. Sparks fly though when sexual chemistry appears between her and the Head of her dorm and English teacher, Simone Bradley. Annabelle pursues her relentlessly and until the end the older woman manages to avoid the law.', 'Annabelle is the wise-beyond-her-years newcomer to an exclusive Catholic girls school. Having been expelled from her first two schools she''s bound to stir some trouble. Sparks fly though when sexual chemistry appears between her and the Head of her dorm and English teacher, Simone Bradley. Annabelle pursues her relentlessly and until the end the older woman manages to avoid the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezgUinJ6bH0xOWQTqPpb0b7qzE6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19344'),
  ('139790610597748227', 'Loving Badly', 1969, 'Drama', 'Fernando Di Leo, Franco Villa', 'Enzo Dell''Acqua, Fernando Di Leo, Nino Latino', 'Nieves Navarro, Gianni Macchia, Micaela Pignatelli, Lucio Dalla, Lea Lander, Sergio Ammirata, Ugo Adinolfi, María Luisa Sala', null, 'Anna is the personal secretary of a rich industrialist who falls in love with her boss'' daughter''s leftist boyfriend, Carlo. Anna pretty much severs her ties with her boss (who she also had romantic moments with) and after she moves in with the college student Carlo she attempts to provide for both, but soon fails in finding job opportunities and sinks into the sleazy world of drugs and prostitution. Carlo''s right wing brother demands Carlo begins his relationship with daughter of the powerful businessman in order to guarantee financial freedom for the rest of his life.', 'Anna is the personal secretary of a rich industrialist who falls in love with her boss'' daughter''s leftist boyfriend, Carlo. Anna pretty much severs her ties with her boss (who she also had romantic moments with) and after she moves in with the college student Carlo she attempts to provide for both, but soon fails in finding job opportunities and sinks into the sleazy world of drugs and prostitution. Carlo''s right wing brother demands Carlo begins his relationship with daughter of the powerful businessman in order to guarantee financial freedom for the rest of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1obLLma76hsdAkzhx8TBb93fSJA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155132'),
  ('471646187416867498', 'Loving Couples', 1964, 'Drama', 'Mai Zetterling, Sven Nykvist, Lena Malmsjö', 'David Hughes, Mai Zetterling', 'Harriet Andersson, Gunnel Lindblom, Gio Petré, Anita Björk, Gunnar Björnstrand, Eva Dahlbeck, Jan Malmsjö, Heinz Hopf', null, 'As three pregnant women wait to have their babies in a hospital in Stockholm at the outbreak of the Great War, they relive their childhood and youthful experiences.', 'As three pregnant women wait to have their babies in a hospital in Stockholm at the outbreak of the Great War, they relive their childhood and youthful experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdDpMubZJV3fTMzQ6hsI9FNggeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180971'),
  ('799840515523630270', 'Loving Couples', 1980, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Carl Olsen, Kathy Slakey, Michael Looney', 'Martin Donovan', 'Shirley MacLaine, James Coburn, Susan Sarandon, Stephen Collins, Sally Kellerman, Nan Martin, Shelly Batt, Bernard Behrens', null, 'Walter is a successful doctor, and so is his wife Evelyn. Wealthy and good-looking, they should be a happily married couple, but they''re not. Walter is so caught up in his career that he fails to keep up with Evelyn. So when she falls for the charms of Greg, a real estate Romeo, it takes Walter by surprise. Even more so, because he finds out about it from Stephanie, Greg''s deserted TV weather girl girlfriend.', 'Walter is a successful doctor, and so is his wife Evelyn. Wealthy and good-looking, they should be a happily married couple, but they''re not. Walter is so caught up in his career that he fails to keep up with Evelyn. So when she falls for the charms of Greg, a real estate Romeo, it takes Walter by surprise. Even more so, because he finds out about it from Stephanie, Greg''s deserted TV weather girl girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfMaLd2LkOhOTGgMkVyJ3KQX4vK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242758'),
  ('19317377528636543', 'Loving Highsmith', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Raphael Bondy, Signe Astrup, Eva Vitija', 'Eva Vitija', 'Gwendoline Christie, Annina Butterworth, Marijane Meaker, Courtney Coates Blackman, Judy Coates, Dan Coates, Monique Buffet, Tabea Blumenschein', null, 'The story of the life, loves and work of US writer Patricia Highsmith (1921-95), told through her unpublished diaries, her own voice and that of those who knew her, both family and close friends.', 'The story of the life, loves and work of US writer Patricia Highsmith (1921-95), told through her unpublished diaries, her own voice and that of those who knew her, both family and close friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Y4wZhIkDOnO1pdYszjzwYPq89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915939'),
  ('1106518519336482698', 'Loving Ibiza', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Klaas de Jong, Johan Nijenhuis', 'Maarten Lebens, Annelou Verboon, Tijs van Marle', 'Jan Kooijman, Jim Bakkum, Sanne Vogel, Gigi Ravelli, Kim Feenstra, Simone Kleinsma, Willeke van Ammelrooy, Rick Engelkes', null, 'Kevin is a young footballer who recently made a multimillion deal by transferring to FC Barcelona. He hardly realizes what is happening to him. Too young, too rich, too beautiful. His girlfriend Elza knows how Kevin should spend his millions. She is eagerly anticipating her birthday where Kevin will ask her the most important question of all. Kevin''s grandmother Karla observes it all from the sidelines with concern. Fortunately there is the down-to-earth event planner Lizzy who shows Kevin the meaning of true love.', 'Kevin is a young footballer who recently made a multimillion deal by transferring to FC Barcelona. He hardly realizes what is happening to him. Too young, too rich, too beautiful. His girlfriend Elza knows how Kevin should spend his millions. She is eagerly anticipating her birthday where Kevin will ask her the most important question of all. Kevin''s grandmother Karla observes it all from the sidelines with concern. Fortunately there is the down-to-earth event planner Lizzy who shows Kevin the meaning of true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srfg90ModqcMNpfeVxEkn5fAxlp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164130'),
  ('651630860783661220', 'Loving Leah', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Charles Minsky, Jeff Bleckner, Thomas Fatone', null, 'Lauren Ambrose, Adam Kaufman, Susie Essman, Harris Yulin, Natasha Lyonne, Christy Pusz, Ricki Lake, Mercedes Ruehl', null, 'When Leah''s husband Benjamin dies suddenly, Benjamin''s brother Jake is stunned to learn he is expected to marry the childless Leah to carry on his brother''s name. Jake suggests to Leah that they get married and maintain a secretly platonic relationship. The harder they try to disguise their "pretend" marriage, the more their appreciation for each other''s worlds grow, and out of understanding, a real love develops.', 'When Leah''s husband Benjamin dies suddenly, Benjamin''s brother Jake is stunned to learn he is expected to marry the childless Leah to carry on his brother''s name. Jake suggests to Leah that they get married and maintain a secretly platonic relationship. The harder they try to disguise their "pretend" marriage, the more their appreciation for each other''s worlds grow, and out of understanding, a real love develops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1s0WPhi7isv6LaG0UF13ettmTyj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52221'),
  ('490670569356360032', 'Loving Maradona', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Javier Vázquez, Marcelo Lavintman', 'Javier Vázquez, Nicolás Avruj', 'Diego Maradona', null, 'What do they have in common a boy playing in a field of Villa Fiorito and the owner of a bar in Naples? What do they have in common 500 people celebrating Christmas on October 30 and 25 football fans showing their tattoos? They are all loving Maradona.', 'What do they have in common a boy playing in a field of Villa Fiorito and the owner of a bar in Naples? What do they have in common 500 people celebrating Christmas on October 30 and 25 football fans showing their tattoos? They are all loving Maradona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoDuHuI0DkNe82EJwVqvUjOLc8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99005'),
  ('205542643033581944', 'Loving Memories', 2023, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Guillaume Bureau, Colin Lévêque, Adélaïde Mauvernay', 'Guillaume Bureau, Robin Campillo', 'Leïla Bekhti, Karim Leklou, Louise Bourgoin, Jean-Charles Clichet, Ghislain de Fonclare, Jeanne Cohendy, Véronique Ruggia Saura, Emmanuelle Schaaff', null, '1916. Julien Delaunay is reported missing in action during the Great War. His wife, Julie, refuses to believe he is dead. 1919. When a photo of an amnesic drifter appears in the press, Julie immediately recognizes him as her beloved husband. They are reunited and, little by little, she helps him to fall in love with her again. Until another woman claims to be the man’s real wife…', '1916. Julien Delaunay is reported missing in action during the Great War. His wife, Julie, refuses to believe he is dead. 1919. When a photo of an amnesic drifter appears in the press, Julie immediately recognizes him as her beloved husband. They are reunited and, little by little, she helps him to fall in love with her again. Until another woman claims to be the man’s real wife…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xO9h6o4LGagbnvwql41hL9tBcrm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957607'),
