  ('87147640131313317', 'Low Life', 2004, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Im Kwon-taek, Kim Dong-ho, Jung Il-sung', 'Im Kwon-taek', 'Cho Seung-woo, Kim Gyu-ri, Kim Hak-jun, Yu Ha-jun, Kim Nam-gil, Tae In-ho, Gi Jeong-su, Moon Jeong-hee', null, 'A sprawling story of one man''s tumultuous life within the context of the South Korean political situation during the second half of the 20th century.', 'A sprawling story of one man''s tumultuous life within the context of the South Korean political situation during the second half of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8faeFq7Jc91tvhnCA9hzHYjY7AQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177152'),
  ('739824181725608481', 'Low Life', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Elisabeth Perceval, Nicolas Klotz, Hélène Louvart', 'Nicolas Klotz, Elisabeth Perceval', 'Camille Rutherford, Arash Naiman, Luc Chessel, Winson Calixte, Maud Wyler, Michaël Evans, Mathilde Bisson, Mathieu Moreau Domecq', null, 'A group of young people are organizing. One night, they face the police who came to evacuate an African squat. Carmen meets Hussain, a young afghan poet. Crazy in love, they don’t leave each other. But a curse hangs over the city, papers are carrying death, bodies are falling. Panicked at the idea that he could get arrested, Carmen forbids him to go out, and locks herself with him. Gradually, Hussain get the feeling that she is watching him…', 'A group of young people are organizing. One night, they face the police who came to evacuate an African squat. Carmen meets Hussain, a young afghan poet. Crazy in love, they don’t leave each other. But a curse hangs over the city, papers are carrying death, bodies are falling. Panicked at the idea that he could get arrested, Carmen forbids him to go out, and locks herself with him. Gradually, Hussain get the feeling that she is watching him…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lgxYhzZaaggweWBdvQOwvQch3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103375'),
  ('897319423098830397', 'Low Profile', 1993, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Claude Zidi, François Catonné', 'Claude Zidi, Didier Kaminka, Simon Michaël', 'Patrick Bruel, Sandra Speichert, Didier Bezace, Jean Yanne, Jacques Rosny, Jean-Louis Tribes, Jean-Pierre Castaldi, Arnaud Giovaninetti', null, 'A disillusioned police detective, used as a scapegoat by his corrupted superior, fights back by becoming a competent criminal.', 'A disillusioned police detective, used as a scapegoat by his corrupted superior, fights back by becoming a competent criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yb3qBfSJEIza6laBVYX7Zgob8FP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57944'),
  ('36161077778835389', 'Low Profile', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Cécilia Rouaud, Renaud Chassaing, Marc Le Hingrat', 'Cécilia Rouaud', 'Denis Ménochet, Vanessa Paradis, Léa Drucker, Laurent Lucas, Laurent Capelluto, Angèle Garnier, Louise Grinberg, Noémie Landreau', null, 'There''s nothing to keep Yvan in Paris any longer. His wife has left him to live in Thailand. His teenage daughters have chosen to live with his sister Ariane, who is as anxious as she is admirable. Yvan is ready to leave... when beautiful Emmanuelle enters his life. She makes babies as easily as she falls in love, and she''s accompanied by Léo, the little boy who Yvan''s wife had with another man. Yvan is going to have to change his plans.', 'There''s nothing to keep Yvan in Paris any longer. His wife has left him to live in Thailand. His teenage daughters have chosen to live with his sister Ariane, who is as anxious as she is admirable. Yvan is ready to leave... when beautiful Emmanuelle enters his life. She makes babies as easily as she falls in love, and she''s accompanied by Léo, the little boy who Yvan''s wife had with another man. Yvan is going to have to change his plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stzg8LBDtlLiB0D3VLVaTCBA264.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147798'),
  ('661005127081402588', 'Low Season', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Peerawat Sangklang, Chutharat Buaplod, Phadej Onlahung', 'Isra Wechakum, Wipada Weanpetch, Pruch Neamsri', 'Mario Maurer, Ploypailin Thangprapaporn, Kidakarn Chatkaewmanee, Nakorn Silachai, Akarin Akaranitimaytharatt, Sriphan Chunechomboon, Sakonrat Woraurai, Nachat Juntapun', null, 'When her ability to see ghosts ruins her love life, a heartbroken woman seeks solace at a mountain resort, encountering several fellow lonely singletons.', 'When her ability to see ghosts ruins her love life, a heartbroken woman seeks solace at a mountain resort, encountering several fellow lonely singletons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRZcPJwHecww2x9J0RoFAW2hLTb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658450'),
  ('1015333820301602493', 'Low Tide', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Andrew Ellmaker, Kevin McMullin, Alexis Vail', 'Kevin McMullin', 'Jaeden Martell, Keean Johnson, Shea Whigham, Alex Neustaedter, Daniel Zolghadri, Kristine Froseth, Mike Hodge, Michael David Baldwin', 'R', 'In the long days of summer in a beach town on the New Jersey shore, high schooler Alan and his friends Red and Smitty break into vacation homes to steal valuables, funding dates at the boardwalk and lunches at the burger stand. When Alan and his younger brother Peter find a bag of gold coins, they try to hide them from the others — but Red, suspicious and violently unpredictable, seems willing to do anything to get the money.', 'In the long days of summer in a beach town on the New Jersey shore, high schooler Alan and his friends Red and Smitty break into vacation homes to steal valuables, funding dates at the boardwalk and lunches at the burger stand. When Alan and his younger brother Peter find a bag of gold coins, they try to hide them from the others — but Red, suspicious and violently unpredictable, seems willing to do anything to get the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEZrBPoWu4QYgOh594uCxDCEQDx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493066'),
  ('706232945772919983', 'Lower City', 2005, 'Drama', 'Toca Seabra, Sérgio Machado', 'Adriana Rattes, Gil Vicente Tavares', 'Lázaro Ramos, Wagner Moura, Alice Braga, Maria Menezes, João Miguel, Débora Santiago, Hugo Rodas, Divina Valéria', 'R', 'Best friends Deco and Naldinho co-own a cargo boat in Brazil''s Salvador da Bahia. They give a ride to a sultry prostitute named Karinna, and soon both men fall prey to her considerable sexual charms, pushing the bounds of their friendship to the limit.', 'Best friends Deco and Naldinho co-own a cargo boat in Brazil''s Salvador da Bahia. They give a ride to a sultry prostitute named Karinna, and soon both men fall prey to her considerable sexual charms, pushing the bounds of their friendship to the limit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFWvDBCN2LpVczu6ZKQq8B0AIYG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8443'),
