  ('1037260891843343554', 'Lt. Robin Crusoe U.S.N.', 1966, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Byron Paul, William E. Snyder', 'Don DaGradi', 'Dick Van Dyke, Nancy Kwan, Akim Tamiroff, Arthur Malet, Tyler McVey, Peter Renaday, Peter Duryea, John Dennis', 'G', 'Lt. Robin Crusoe is a navy pilot who bails out of his plane after engine trouble. He reaches a deserted island paradise where he builds a house and begins to adjust to life. He is in for trouble however when a local girl is banished to the island by her father, who then comes after Crusoe.', 'Lt. Robin Crusoe is a navy pilot who bails out of his plane after engine trouble. He reaches a deserted island paradise where he builds a house and begins to adjust to life. He is in for trouble however when a local girl is banished to the island by her father, who then comes after Crusoe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXxf8Is4LG48e2SOloFq7U43SbK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54227'),
