  ('686898097539256777', 'Ludo', 2015, 'Horror', 'Sayak Bhattacharya, Qaushiq Mukherjee, Qaushiq Mukherjee', 'Qaushiq Mukherjee', 'Kamalika Banerjee, Joyraj Bhattacharjee, Soumendra Bhattacharya, Ananya Biswas, Ranodeep Bose, Murari Mukherjee, Rii Sen, Subholina Sen', null, 'Needing a secluded place for a late-night tryst, two couples stow away in a mall after hours, but are quickly ensnared in a gruesome and deadly game.', 'Needing a secluded place for a late-night tryst, two couples stow away in a mall after hours, but are quickly ensnared in a gruesome and deadly game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rso6tCy4IZOcjckDQdRdPciWHfw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349138'),
  ('260529369110537275', 'Ludo', 2020, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Anurag Basu, Allan Amin, Anurag Basu', 'Anurag Basu', 'Pankaj Tripathi, Abhishek Bachchan, Inayat Verma, Rajkummar Rao, Fatima Sana Shaikh, Aditya Roy Kapur, Sanya Malhotra, Rohit Saraf', 'PG-13', 'Ludo is about the butterfly effect and how, despite all the chaos and crowd of the world, all our lives are inextricably connected. From a resurfaced sex tape to a rogue suitcase of money, four wildly different stories overlap at the whims of fate, chance and one eccentric criminal.', 'Ludo is about the butterfly effect and how, despite all the chaos and crowd of the world, all our lives are inextricably connected. From a resurfaced sex tape to a rogue suitcase of money, four wildly different stories overlap at the whims of fate, chance and one eccentric criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWq4HzuIcvoFss4BDkILYZqceuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658412'),
  ('968750074692368356', 'Ludwig', 1973, 'Drama, History', 'Luchino Visconti, Armando Nannuzzi, Giorgio Ferrara', 'Enrico Medioli, Luchino Visconti, Suso Cecchi d''Amico', 'Helmut Berger, Romy Schneider, Trevor Howard, Silvana Mangano, Gert Fröbe, Helmut Griem, Izabella Telezynska, Umberto Orsini', 'R', 'Historical evocation of Ludwig, king of Bavaria, from his crowning in 1864 until his death in 1886, as a romantic hero. Fan of Richard Wagner, betrayed by him, in love with his cousin Elisabeth of Austria, abandoned by her, tormented by his homosexuality, he will little by little slip towards madness.', 'Historical evocation of Ludwig, king of Bavaria, from his crowning in 1864 until his death in 1886, as a romantic hero. Fan of Richard Wagner, betrayed by him, in love with his cousin Elisabeth of Austria, abandoned by her, tormented by his homosexuality, he will little by little slip towards madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ruh503sW0dkIcWdTKkvY01B8rc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3478'),
  ('827781479408628489', 'Ludwig – Requiem for a Virgin King', 1972, 'Drama, History', 'Hans-Jürgen Syberberg, Dietrich Lohmann', 'Hans-Jürgen Syberberg', 'Harry Baer, Ingrid Caven, Peter Kern, Monica Bleibtreu, Gert Haucke, Günther Kaufmann, Hanna Köhler, Ursula Strätz', null, 'Reflected in an artificial and bombastically staged illusory world with Wagnerian compositions, glossy and satirical time references, 19th century German figures and traditions are stripped of their mythology and interpreted by the Germany of 1972.', 'Reflected in an artificial and bombastically staged illusory world with Wagnerian compositions, glossy and satirical time references, 19th century German figures and traditions are stripped of their mythology and interpreted by the Germany of 1972.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6nY5ZIFMzJwg5OtTGQk7gyHQPz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198605'),
  ('393516801652344467', 'Ludwig II', 2012, 'Drama, History', 'Marie Noëlle, Peter Sehr, Christian Berger', 'Peter Sehr, Marie Noëlle', 'Sabin Tambrea, Sebastian Schipper, Tom Schilling, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Axel Milberg, Hannah Herzsprung, Edgar Selge, Gedeon Burkhard', null, 'A dramatic retelling of the life of Ludwig II, King of Bavaria, one of the most fascinating monarchs of modern times. From his accession to the throne at the age of 18 to his passionate support of Richard Wagner and his music. From his ingenuous political commitment to his obsessive construction of extravagant palaces and to his gradual withdrawal into a lonely dream world, an epic narrative of breathtaking grandeur.', 'A dramatic retelling of the life of Ludwig II, King of Bavaria, one of the most fascinating monarchs of modern times. From his accession to the throne at the age of 18 to his passionate support of Richard Wagner and his music. From his ingenuous political commitment to his obsessive construction of extravagant palaces and to his gradual withdrawal into a lonely dream world, an epic narrative of breathtaking grandeur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qV2G4LeylJmhWZRa9mOb9IEPsgS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152135'),
  ('8738331801824311', 'Luffy''s Fall! The Unexplored Region - Grand Adventure in the Ocean''s Navel', 2000, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Yukio Kaizawa', 'Hiroshi Hashimoto', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Kazuya Nakai, Akemi Okamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Hiroaki Hirata, Akio Otsuka, Minami Takayama, Ikue Otani', null, 'The Straw Hat Pirates stumble upon an enormous hole in the ocean, at the bottom of which lies a mysterious island known as the "Ocean''s Navel". The Straw Hat Pirates resolve to find the island''s treasure, which can supposedly grant any wish, but the island''s inhabitants possess agendas of their own for their new guests...', 'The Straw Hat Pirates stumble upon an enormous hole in the ocean, at the bottom of which lies a mysterious island known as the "Ocean''s Navel". The Straw Hat Pirates resolve to find the island''s treasure, which can supposedly grant any wish, but the island''s inhabitants possess agendas of their own for their new guests...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJCR5fDGxY98T6WrkswRHPwvDg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1051942'),
  ('822785052125908350', 'Lügen und andere Wahrheiten', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Vanessa Jopp, Henner Besuch', 'Vanessa Jopp', 'Meret Becker, Thomas Heinze, Florian David Fitz, Jeanette Hain, Alina Levshin, Lilith Stangenberg, Elisabeth Trissenaar, Julia Helbich', null, 'Six intertwined people struggle with their own sincerity, and, in so doing, unravel their secrets and the lies they live.', 'Six intertwined people struggle with their own sincerity, and, in so doing, unravel their secrets and the lies they live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxl5OOKDklWPC6EZOPvIE2uvOQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284864'),
  ('262456356156308256', 'Luigi Proietti detto Gigi', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Giulia Bertini, Edoardo Leo', null, 'Gigi Proietti, Edoardo Leo, Renzo Arbore, Lello Arzilli, Paola Cortellesi, Fiorello, Alessandro Fioroni, Alessandro Gassmann', null, 'Documentary about the film and theater career of the roman actor, Gigi Proietti, who passed away on 2 November 2020', 'Documentary about the film and theater career of the roman actor, Gigi Proietti, who passed away on 2 November 2020', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKLNI8K7HMDa62CO8YLKhKTf99T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:889629'),
  ('377752651367637840', 'Luis and the Aliens', 2018, 'Animation, Family', 'Wolfgang Lauenstein, Christoph Lauenstein, Seán McCormack', 'Seán McCormack', 'Callum Maloney, Dermot Magennis, Ian Coppinger, Paul Tylak, Lucy Carolan, Eoin Daly, Aileen Mythen, Simon Toal', 'G', '11-year-old Luis makes friends with three loveable little aliens, who crash their UFO into his house. In return for Luis'' help in finding the home-shopping channel stuff they came for, they save Luis from boarding school - and an exciting adventure follows.', '11-year-old Luis makes friends with three loveable little aliens, who crash their UFO into his house. In return for Luis'' help in finding the home-shopping channel stuff they came for, they save Luis from boarding school - and an exciting adventure follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oq7s5ru4hjp83mi4fWSJ0L7yUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432383'),
  ('1123971276644299814', 'Luisa Spagnoli', 2016, 'Drama, TV Movie, History', 'Francesco Sperandeo, Marco Pieroni, Lodovico Gasparini', 'Franco Bernini, Gloria Malatesta', 'Luisa Ranieri, Vinicio Marchioni, Massimo Dapporto, Matteo Martari, Elena Radonicich, Federica De Cola, Antonello Fassari, Franco Castellano', null, 'This is a true story of Luisa Spagnoli who was an Italian businesswoman, famous for creating a women''s fashion store and the chocolate brand, Perugia. The show is a romantic telling of her life. Considering that women were not involved in business, it is an amazing story of someone way ahead of her time.', 'This is a true story of Luisa Spagnoli who was an Italian businesswoman, famous for creating a women''s fashion store and the chocolate brand, Perugia. The show is a romantic telling of her life. Considering that women were not involved in business, it is an amazing story of someone way ahead of her time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3X9cwLwHNKOw5Y5kmxeYAhVCjUl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510061'),
  ('247622952333513303', 'Luise', 2023, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Fanette Martinie, Tatiana Merizalde Dobles, Lotta Kilian', 'Sebastian Bleyl, Matthias Luthardt', 'Luise Aschenbrenner, Christa Théret, Leonard Kunz, Aleksandar Jovanović', null, 'Summer, 1918. Two young women, Luise and Elsa live alone on a secluded farm in Alsace. As young German deserter Hermann comes along, a new relationship forms between the three, filled with love, competition and hate.', 'Summer, 1918. Two young women, Luise and Elsa live alone on a secluded farm in Alsace. As young German deserter Hermann comes along, a new relationship forms between the three, filled with love, competition and hate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jxY0Fg830fmd9XIgCyowjdIHHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:750167'),
  ('686275204058659041', 'Luka Chuppi', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Laxman Utekar, Rohit Sharma, Kritika Singh', 'Rohan Shankar', 'Kartik Aaryan, Kriti Sanon, Vinay Pathak, Pankaj Tripathi, Aparshakti Khurana, Vishwanath Chatterjee, Atul Srivastava, Alka Amin', null, 'The story of a television reporter in Mathura who falls in love with a headstrong woman.', 'The story of a television reporter in Mathura who falls in love with a headstrong woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozCWKIQisOfWFgJDLMggIeEFTLE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585062'),
  ('93935082225422107', 'Lula, the Son of Brazil', 2010, 'Drama, History', 'Fábio Barreto, Marcelo Santiago, Wellington Pingo', 'Fernando Bonassi, Denise Paraná, Daniel Tendler', 'Rui Ricardo Diaz, Glória Pires, Cleo, Juliana Baroni, Milhem Cortaz, Lucélia Santos, Antônio Pitanga, Celso Frateschi', null, 'The true story of a working class boy who moves to the nation''s financial capital at a young age and becomes one the most influential politicians in Brazilian history.', 'The true story of a working class boy who moves to the nation''s financial capital at a young age and becomes one the most influential politicians in Brazilian history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBMfXW9J9iH81Ni34fplljW03eX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43615'),
  ('489011487032613857', 'Lulk', 2026, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Janko Krist', 'Janko Krist', 'Arjan Ederveen, Thom Hoffman, Jan Willem Hofma', null, 'In a desperate attempt to pay off his family''s debts, a metalworker stages a bank robbery that spirals into a hostage standoff.', 'In a desperate attempt to pay off his family''s debts, a metalworker stages a bank robbery that spirals into a hostage standoff.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FhQMw6k0vCfYfmY8BqkrchGKKelt.jpg', 'plex:movie:lulk'),
  ('392389629181317645', 'Lullaby', 2014, 'Drama', 'Andrew Levitas, Florian Ballhaus', 'Andrew Levitas', 'Garrett Hedlund, Richard Jenkins, Anne Archer, Jessica Brown Findlay, Amy Adams, Jessica Barden, Terrence Howard, Jennifer Hudson', null, 'Estranged from his family, Jonathan (Hedlund) discovers his father has decided to take himself off life support in forty-eight hours’ time. During this intensely condensed period, a lifetime of drama plays out. Robert (Jenkins) fights a zero sum game to reclaim all that his illness stole from his family. A debate rages on patients’ rights and what it truly means to be free. Jonathan reconciles with his father, reconnects with his mother (Archer), sister (Brown-Findlay), and his love (Adams) and reclaims his voice through two unlikely catalysts – a young, wise-beyond-her-years patient (Barden) and a no-nonsense nurse (Hudson). Through this intensely life affirming prism, an unexpected and powerful journey of love, laughter, and forgiveness unfolds.', 'Estranged from his family, Jonathan (Hedlund) discovers his father has decided to take himself off life support in forty-eight hours’ time. During this intensely condensed period, a lifetime of drama plays out. Robert (Jenkins) fights a zero sum game to reclaim all that his illness stole from his family. A debate rages on patients’ rights and what it truly means to be free. Jonathan reconciles with his father, reconnects with his mother (Archer), sister (Brown-Findlay), and his love (Adams) and reclaims his voice through two unlikely catalysts – a young, wise-beyond-her-years patient (Barden) and a no-nonsense nurse (Hudson). Through this intensely life affirming prism, an unexpected and powerful journey of love, laughter, and forgiveness unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghKDvp24lXKo6b1TtILweFKy6yV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261768'),
  ('224664910369410676', 'Lullaby', 2022, 'Drama', 'Alauda Ruiz de Azúa, Jon D. Domínguez, Martin Bustos', 'Alauda Ruiz de Azúa', 'Laia Costa, Susi Sánchez, Ramón Barea, Mikel Bustamante, José Ramón Soroiz, Asier Valdestilla, Justi Larrinaga, Isidoro Fernández', null, 'Amaia has just become a mother, and the challenge is even more significant than she imagined. So when her partner has to leave for several weeks because of his job, she decides to spend time with her parents in a lovely coastal village in the Basque Country and hopefully share the responsibility of looking after her baby. However, she forgot that even when one becomes a parent, one never stops being a daughter.', 'Amaia has just become a mother, and the challenge is even more significant than she imagined. So when her partner has to leave for several weeks because of his job, she decides to spend time with her parents in a lovely coastal village in the Basque Country and hopefully share the responsibility of looking after her baby. However, she forgot that even when one becomes a parent, one never stops being a daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Zt8sVMHNq83C80OsABQIcW3fK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835504'),
  ('1096149309105461379', 'Lullaby Land', 1933, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'George Gramlich, Alberta Perkins, Cora Hunter Parks', 'NR', 'A baby is transported to Lullaby Land, where pacifiers grow on trees, diapers, bottles, and potty chairs march on parade, and the gingham dog comes to life. He wanders into the "keep out" cave, full of things like scissors, knives, and fountain pens that are not for baby and begins smashing watches with hammers and playing with giant matches. The matches chase after him; baby escapes by riding a bar of soap across a pond, but the smoke from the matches turns into boogey-men. The benevolent sandman, dressed as a wizard, spots baby hiding and works his magic, bringing us back to the real nursery.', 'A baby is transported to Lullaby Land, where pacifiers grow on trees, diapers, bottles, and potty chairs march on parade, and the gingham dog comes to life. He wanders into the "keep out" cave, full of things like scissors, knives, and fountain pens that are not for baby and begins smashing watches with hammers and playing with giant matches. The matches chase after him; baby escapes by riding a bar of soap across a pond, but the smoke from the matches turns into boogey-men. The benevolent sandman, dressed as a wizard, spots baby hiding and works his magic, bringing us back to the real nursery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7j2jQsDoe0swbne2FnwsV7MYaez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107661'),
  ('711968644856970876', 'Lullaby of Broadway', 1951, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'David Butler, Ray Heindorf, Philip Quinn', 'Earl Baldwin', 'Doris Day, Gene Nelson, S.Z. Sakall, Billy De Wolfe, Gladys George, Florence Bates, Anne Triola, Hanley Stafford', 'NR', 'Pretty Melinda Howard has been abroad singing with a musical troupe. She decides to return home to surprise her mother whom she thinks is a successful Broadway star with a mansion in Manhattan. She doesn''t know that her mother is actually a burnt-out cabaret singer with a love for whiskey. When she arrives at the mansion, she is taken in by the two servants who are friends of her mother''s. The house actually belongs to Adolph Hubbell, a kind-hearted Broadway producer who also gets drawn into the charade. Hubbell takes a shine to Melinda and agrees to star her in his next show. Melinda also finds romance with a handsome hoofer who''s also in the show. All is going well for Melinda except that she wants to see her mother who keeps putting off their reunion.', 'Pretty Melinda Howard has been abroad singing with a musical troupe. She decides to return home to surprise her mother whom she thinks is a successful Broadway star with a mansion in Manhattan. She doesn''t know that her mother is actually a burnt-out cabaret singer with a love for whiskey. When she arrives at the mansion, she is taken in by the two servants who are friends of her mother''s. The house actually belongs to Adolph Hubbell, a kind-hearted Broadway producer who also gets drawn into the charade. Hubbell takes a shine to Melinda and agrees to star her in his next show. Melinda also finds romance with a handsome hoofer who''s also in the show. All is going well for Melinda except that she wants to see her mother who keeps putting off their reunion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gz4TUoGzjju9iBfd0fN6nB0kyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43377'),
  ('406734283624467635', 'Lullaby of the Earth', 1976, 'Drama', 'Yasuzō Masumura, Yoshihisa Nakagawa', 'Yoshio Shirasaka', 'Mieko Harada, Natsuko Kahara, Mihoko Nakagawa, Yûsuke Satô, Shigeo Katō, Eiji Okada, Meiko Kaji, Kinuyo Tanaka', null, 'The story of an orphan girl, brought up in naive, rustic innocence by an elderly relative, who is suddenly exposed to the brutality, greed and deceptiveness of the outside world when her grandmother dies.', 'The story of an orphan girl, brought up in naive, rustic innocence by an elderly relative, who is suddenly exposed to the brutality, greed and deceptiveness of the outside world when her grandmother dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/df0viL7wzcFhUefBrx0DWckx9C6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129377'),
  ('819775913680268926', 'Lullaby to Kill', 1977, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Kon Ichikawa, Kiyoshi Hasegawa', 'Kon Ichikawa', 'Koji Ishizaka, Tomisaburō Wakayama, Keiko Kishi, Akiko Nishina, Koji Kita, Yoko Takahashi, Mitsuko Kusabue, Hisano Yamaoka', null, 'Kôsuke Kindaichi, a somewhat peculiar private detective, visits a remote town. He meets a police detective and they start to investigate an old unsolved murder. Then some murders happen. Kindaichi must find out about the past in order to reveal who the murderer is.', 'Kôsuke Kindaichi, a somewhat peculiar private detective, visits a remote town. He meets a police detective and they start to investigate an old unsolved murder. Then some murders happen. Kindaichi must find out about the past in order to reveal who the murderer is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEzupHDsuPAum94miHHjafjjyaa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129378'),
  ('989800099307118705', 'Lulli', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'César Rodrigues, José Roberto Eliezer, Adolpho Knauth', 'Thalita Rebouças, Renato Fagundes', 'Larissa Manoela, Vinícius Redd, Amanda de Godoi, Sergio Malheiros, Yara Charry, Nicolas Ahnert, Paula Possani, Gabriel Contente', null, 'After getting electrocuted by an MRI machine, an ambitious young medical student begins to hear the thoughts of others.', 'After getting electrocuted by an MRI machine, an ambitious young medical student begins to hear the thoughts of others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztJHKv6KSSgCTWAI2STrX2BeuJZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:700127'),
  ('658578134281236184', 'Lulu', 1980, 'Drama', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Michael Steinke', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Frank Wedekind', 'Anne Bennent, Michele Placido, Jean-Jacques Delbo, Hans-Jürgen Schatz, Bruno Hübner, Beate Kopp, Carlo Enrici, Pierre Saintons', null, 'Lulu models for a young painter who tries to seduce her. When her husband enters the room he dies from a heart attack. Lulu marries the painter, who commits suicide when he finds out that she has been having a long standing affair with Dr Schon and whose son gives her a job. Lulu kills Dr Schon and goes to London to live with his son. Eventually, she becomes a prostitute and dies a victim of Jack the Ripper.', 'Lulu models for a young painter who tries to seduce her. When her husband enters the room he dies from a heart attack. Lulu marries the painter, who commits suicide when he finds out that she has been having a long standing affair with Dr Schon and whose son gives her a job. Lulu kills Dr Schon and goes to London to live with his son. Eventually, she becomes a prostitute and dies a victim of Jack the Ripper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPCjmaLpwxpjNjSAwXkhvdxqTNo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181719'),
  ('1015612764866776128', 'Lulu and Jimi', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Oskar Roehler, Wedigo von Schultzendorff', null, 'Jennifer Decker, Ray Fearon, Katrin Sass, Udo Kier, Rolf Zacher, Bastian Pastewka, Ulrich Thomsen, Hans-Michael Rehberg', null, 'About sweeping love, rock & roll and getting rid of all that stale air of the fifties. You''ve got the good guys - that''s Lulu and Jimi - and the bad guys: Lulu''s mother Gertrud, her secret lover Schultz, the chauffeur, and a wicked old shrink, Von Oppeln, crouching in his gloomy office like a spider waiting to pounce on his prey Lulu. Light and darkness, bright garish colours, hot rock & roll and wild dance numbers mark this road movie about lovers fleeing from the evil powers of a deeply bigoted society. A drama about the relationship between a young black man and a rich German girl.', 'About sweeping love, rock & roll and getting rid of all that stale air of the fifties. You''ve got the good guys - that''s Lulu and Jimi - and the bad guys: Lulu''s mother Gertrud, her secret lover Schultz, the chauffeur, and a wicked old shrink, Von Oppeln, crouching in his gloomy office like a spider waiting to pounce on his prey Lulu. Light and darkness, bright garish colours, hot rock & roll and wild dance numbers mark this road movie about lovers fleeing from the evil powers of a deeply bigoted society. A drama about the relationship between a young black man and a rich German girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syJAF8EBbiA4c2DKXtCmFxA2L8A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8887'),
  ('458178114818863784', 'Lulu in the Nude', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sólveig Anspach, Isabelle Razavet', 'Jean-Luc Gaget, Sólveig Anspach', 'Karin Viard, Bouli Lanners, Claude Gensac, Pascal Demolon, Philippe Rebbot, Marie Payen, Solène Rigot, Nina Meurisse', null, 'After a job interview gone wrong, Lulu sets sail leaving her husband and three children behind. But being an adventurer is easier said than done.', 'After a job interview gone wrong, Lulu sets sail leaving her husband and three children behind. But being an adventurer is easier said than done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttf8EMBlU7yup93MDs9GnkisRQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236873'),
  ('919907211421031903', 'Lulu on the Bridge', 1998, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Paul Auster, Robert E. Warren, Jeffrey T. Bernstein', 'Paul Auster', 'Harvey Keitel, Mira Sorvino, Willem Dafoe, Gina Gershon, Mandy Patinkin, Vanessa Redgrave, Don Byron, Richard Edson', 'PG-13', 'A famous jazz saxophonist''s life is forever changed after he is accidentally shot.', 'A famous jazz saxophonist''s life is forever changed after he is accidentally shot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wcqbfKtZtbpRPO2ymldubnUnSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42848'),
  ('682765776828077583', 'Lumber Jack-Rabbit', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Norman Nesbitt', 'NR', 'Bugs Bunny stumbles on the carrot patch of Paul Bunyan, but doesn''t realize that it is guarded by a 124-foot, 4,600-ton dog named Smidgen.', 'Bugs Bunny stumbles on the carrot patch of Paul Bunyan, but doesn''t realize that it is guarded by a 124-foot, 4,600-ton dog named Smidgen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZAdnafLTjwBwM9eon1ktmdxyuP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103962'),
  ('907414474624420502', 'Lumber Jerks', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', 'NR', 'Two polite gophers find that their home, a tree, has been cut down and taken away. They find it in a log pile about to be taken inside a processing factory. Following it into there, they become caught in the daunting machinery.', 'Two polite gophers find that their home, a tree, has been cut down and taken away. They find it in a log pile about to be taken inside a processing factory. Following it into there, they become caught in the daunting machinery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kFNCYNvwEcCpYH9s4lPuIa24hg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100319'),
  ('185556669299147669', 'Lumberjack Man', 2015, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Josh Bear, Joseph Winchester', 'Ed Kuehnel, Matt Entin, Bill Muehl', 'Michael Madsen, Ciara Flynn, Jarrett King, Brina Palencia, Alex Dobrenko, Chase Joliet, Jasmin Carina, Wray Crawford', null, 'As the staff of Good Friends Church Camp prepares for a spring break filled with "Fun Under the Son", a demon logger rises from his sap boiler to wreak his vengeance and feast on flapjacks soaked in the blood of his victims.', 'As the staff of Good Friends Church Camp prepares for a spring break filled with "Fun Under the Son", a demon logger rises from his sap boiler to wreak his vengeance and feast on flapjacks soaked in the blood of his victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/taXsvq2EpUTcU0QZtKYIYQ86C22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356486'),
  ('368695310977220531', 'Lumberjack the Monster', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Takashi Miike, Nobuyasu Kita, Masayuki Taniguchi', 'Hiroyoshi Koiwai', 'Kazuya Kamenashi, Nanao, Riho Yoshioka, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Shota Sometani, Shido Nakamura, Reon Yuzuki, Minosuke', 'R', 'A self-proclaimed psychopath, coldblooded lawyer Ninomiya becomes obsessed with stopping an ax-wielding serial killer who''s made him their next target.', 'A self-proclaimed psychopath, coldblooded lawyer Ninomiya becomes obsessed with stopping an ax-wielding serial killer who''s made him their next target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4JykK8lELrPMq4yqkIoZ6xDMe7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1137142'),
  ('296233238553075905', 'Lumière', 1976, 'Drama, Romance', 'Patrick Jaquillard, Jean Léon, Jeanne Moreau', 'Jeanne Moreau', 'Lucia Bosè, Francine Racette, Caroline Cartier, Jeanne Moreau, Keith Carradine, François Simon, Bruno Ganz, René Féret', null, 'Sarah, an actress nearing her forties, has invited 3 friends to join her for a holiday in Provence. This is the prologue for what happened a year ago in Paris with a man Sarah had long considered a platonic friend. She had just finished a film, had also finished her relationship with the director and was about to receive an award…', 'Sarah, an actress nearing her forties, has invited 3 friends to join her for a holiday in Provence. This is the prologue for what happened a year ago in Paris with a man Sarah had long considered a platonic friend. She had just finished a film, had also finished her relationship with the director and was about to receive an award…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOXNhDXTgz8uIz789RIjCBYSJQu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200323'),
  ('378948678344921673', 'Lumière & Company', 1995, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Lasse Hallström, Vicente Aranda, John Boorman', null, 'Jeff Alperi, Romane Bohringer, Bruno Ganz, Ticky Holgado, Alan Rickman, Liam Neeson, Stephen Rea, Sven Nykvist', null, '40 international directors were asked to make a short film using the original Cinematographe invented by the Lumière Brothers, working under conditions similar to those of 1895. There were three rules: (1) The film could be no longer than 52 seconds, (2) no synchronized sound was permitted, and (3) no more than three takes.', '40 international directors were asked to make a short film using the original Cinematographe invented by the Lumière Brothers, working under conditions similar to those of 1895. There were three rules: (1) The film could be no longer than 52 seconds, (2) no synchronized sound was permitted, and (3) no more than three takes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSQ394UJb2xjMfwucHiHxg8XR5f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48336'),
  ('644964105097063072', 'Lumière, Le Cinéma!', 2024, 'Documentary, History', 'Thierry Frémaux', 'Thierry Frémaux', 'Thierry Frémaux, Francis Ford Coppola, Roman Coppola, Bertrand Tavernier, Valerio Mastandrea', null, 'In one of those wonderful coincidences of history, lumière, the French word for “light,” was also the last name of brothers Auguste and Louis, whose brilliant invention, the cinematograph, helped to inaugurate the most beloved art form of the last 130 years. Institute Lumière director Thierry Frémaux uses Lumière, Le Cinema! to guide the viewer through over a hundred shorts—some famous, some forgotten, some never before seen—directed by Lumière and company. In the process, Frémaux illuminates how the brothers employed the camera as a creative instrument as they (and their operators) mastered framing, staging, and subject selection for quotidian and exotic microdocumentaries as well as the first ever fictional motion pictures. The result is not only a glorious re(telling) of the genesis of cinema but a profound meditation on the beautiful world captured—and the mysterious world imagined—by the Lumières.', 'In one of those wonderful coincidences of history, lumière, the French word for “light,” was also the last name of brothers Auguste and Louis, whose brilliant invention, the cinematograph, helped to inaugurate the most beloved art form of the last 130 years. Institute Lumière director Thierry Frémaux uses Lumière, Le Cinema! to guide the viewer through over a hundred shorts—some famous, some forgotten, some never before seen—directed by Lumière and company. In the process, Frémaux illuminates how the brothers employed the camera as a creative instrument as they (and their operators) mastered framing, staging, and subject selection for quotidian and exotic microdocumentaries as well as the first ever fictional motion pictures. The result is not only a glorious re(telling) of the genesis of cinema but a profound meditation on the beautiful world captured—and the mysterious world imagined—by the Lumières.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZCBDsnLXdLptJOSPG7mm0dblqU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639590'),
  ('168276070244142451', 'Lumière!', 2016, 'Documentary, History', 'Thierry Frémaux', 'Thierry Frémaux', 'Thierry Frémaux, Martin Scorsese', null, 'A collection of restored prints from the Lumière Brothers.', 'A collection of restored prints from the Lumière Brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TnpI6FzESvmzT0hBG7kaPUIY9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411003'),
  ('844241227400460140', 'Luminaris', 2011, 'Animation, Family', 'Juan Pablo Zaramella, Diana Rascovschi, Sol Rulloni', 'Gustavo Cornillón, Juan Pablo Zaramella', 'Gustavo Cornillón, María Alché, Luis Rial', null, 'In a world controlled and timed by the light, a common man has a plan that could change the destiny.', 'In a world controlled and timed by the light, a common man has a plan that could change the destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvhfgpZsF9htNKbTag2HJ9Ww6hw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89461'),
  ('906454958564109401', 'Luminous Procuress', 1971, 'Fantasy', 'Steven Arnold', 'Steven Arnold', 'Pandora, Steve Solberg, Ronald Farrell, Doro Franco, Cherel Fitzpatrick, Ruth Weiss', null, 'A series of erotic vignettes and sexual imagery (mostly of the gay variety) are presented courtesy of The Cockettes (a gay/drag performance art ensemble of late 60s/early 70s San Francisco).', 'A series of erotic vignettes and sexual imagery (mostly of the gay variety) are presented courtesy of The Cockettes (a gay/drag performance art ensemble of late 60s/early 70s San Francisco).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etOFVVBKVvapo4CFZeDDXXpFH6Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108775'),
  ('108868814730283081', 'Lumumba', 2000, 'Drama, History', 'Raoul Peck, Bernard Lutic', 'Dan Edelstein, Raoul Peck, Pascal Bonitzer', 'Ériq Ebouaney, Alex Descas, Théophile Sowié, Maka Kotto, Dieudonné Kabongo, Pascal N''Zonzi, Cheik Doukouré, Makena Diop', null, 'The true story of the rise to power and brutal assassination of the formerly vilified and later redeemed leader of the independent Congo, Patrice Lumumba. Using newly discovered historical evidence, Haitian-born and later Congo-raised writer and director Raoul Peck renders an emotional and tautly woven account of the mail clerk and beer salesman with a flair for oratory and an uncompromising belief in the capacity of his homeland to build a prosperous nation independent of its former Belgian overlords. Lumumba emerges here as the heroic sacrificial lamb dubiously portrayed by the international media and led to slaughter by commercial and political interests in Belgium, the United States, the international community, and Lumumba''s own administration; a true story of political intrigue and murder where political entities, captains of commerce, and the military dovetail in their quest for economic and political hegemony.', 'The true story of the rise to power and brutal assassination of the formerly vilified and later redeemed leader of the independent Congo, Patrice Lumumba. Using newly discovered historical evidence, Haitian-born and later Congo-raised writer and director Raoul Peck renders an emotional and tautly woven account of the mail clerk and beer salesman with a flair for oratory and an uncompromising belief in the capacity of his homeland to build a prosperous nation independent of its former Belgian overlords. Lumumba emerges here as the heroic sacrificial lamb dubiously portrayed by the international media and led to slaughter by commercial and political interests in Belgium, the United States, the international community, and Lumumba''s own administration; a true story of political intrigue and murder where political entities, captains of commerce, and the military dovetail in their quest for economic and political hegemony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evopdRBKjj85zttxMcrZ5xujaS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55551'),
  ('1058605671939447233', 'Lumumba: Death of a Prophet', 1991, 'Documentary', 'Raoul Peck, Philippe Ros, Matthias Kälin', 'Raoul Peck', 'Patrice Lumumba, Raoul Peck, Pierre Devos', null, 'Documentary about African political leader Patrice Lumumba, who was Prime Minister of Zaire (now Democratic Republic of Congo) when he was assassinated in 1961.', 'Documentary about African political leader Patrice Lumumba, who was Prime Minister of Zaire (now Democratic Republic of Congo) when he was assassinated in 1961.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3Etu3B63W8BpVunwpjWYjTN6V5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127293'),
  ('929196130893888577', 'Luna', 1979, 'Drama', 'Gabriele Polverosi, Giuseppe Bertolucci, Jirges Ristum', 'Giuseppe Bertolucci, Clare Peploe, Bernardo Bertolucci', 'Jill Clayburgh, Matthew Barry, Veronica Lazăr, Renato Salvatori, Fred Gwynne, Alida Valli, Elisabetta Campeti, Franco Citti', 'R', 'While touring in Italy, a recently-widowed American opera singer has an incestuous relationship with her 15-year-old son to help him overcome his heroin addiction.', 'While touring in Italy, a recently-widowed American opera singer has an incestuous relationship with her 15-year-old son to help him overcome his heroin addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mO1Asyzl3gmuvFWYtfzI73LhXQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30636'),
  ('856721673123006230', 'Luna', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Elsa Diringer, Elin Kirschfink', 'Elsa Diringer', 'Laëtitia Clément, Rod Paradot, Lyna Khoudri, Julien Bodet, Frédéric Pierrot, Juliette Arnaud, Dylan Crusol, Victoria Fossard', null, 'A film in which the director captures the beautiful and accurate qualities of reality when building the energetic portrait of a 16-year-old girl immersed in the macho culture of urban suburban south-west France, just a stone’s throw away from the nearby countryside.', 'A film in which the director captures the beautiful and accurate qualities of reality when building the energetic portrait of a 16-year-old girl immersed in the macho culture of urban suburban south-west France, just a stone’s throw away from the nearby countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cH0CkoQPsGJA6SODws6nsWFvWHq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479758'),
  ('471213488372490714', 'Luna caliente', 2009, 'Thriller', 'Vicente Aranda', 'Vicente Aranda', 'Eduard Fernández, Thaïs Blume, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Jose Coronado, Mary Carmen Ramírez, Carla Sánchez', null, 'In the autumn of 1970, Juan, a Spanish poet living in Paris working for UNESCO, returns on vacation to his hometown, Burgos. The city is under heavy police and military surveillance due to the so-called Burgos process, a summary military trial against a group of ETA members and other militants against Francisco Franco’s regime.', 'In the autumn of 1970, Juan, a Spanish poet living in Paris working for UNESCO, returns on vacation to his hometown, Burgos. The city is under heavy police and military surveillance due to the so-called Burgos process, a summary military trial against a group of ETA members and other militants against Francisco Franco’s regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ny3YpezC0xgxN4mr7CG9yWRkWwo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115723'),
  ('110036001299340647', 'Luna Papa', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Martin Gschlacht, Bakhtyar Khudojnazarov, Rali Ralchev', 'Bakhtyar Khudojnazarov, Irakli Kvirikadze', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Chulpan Khamatova, Ato Mukhamedzhanov, Merab Ninidze, Polina Raykina, Nikolay Fomenko, Lola Mirzorakhimova, Sherali Abdulkajsov', null, 'The unborn child of Mamlakat is telling her story. She is 17, beautiful and vivacious, and dreaming secretly of becoming an actress. She lives with her father and brother in a small village in Central Asia. One night she is seduced by an actor from a travelling troupe, who poses as a friend of Tom Cruise, and gets her pregnant. She tries to abort, but her father and brother become determined to find the seducer, setting in motion a cascade of comic adventures.', 'The unborn child of Mamlakat is telling her story. She is 17, beautiful and vivacious, and dreaming secretly of becoming an actress. She lives with her father and brother in a small village in Central Asia. One night she is seduced by an actor from a travelling troupe, who poses as a friend of Tom Cruise, and gets her pregnant. She tries to abort, but her father and brother become determined to find the seducer, setting in motion a cascade of comic adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yzM7xSapMZfQEK9PDQ0lNc9IP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10573'),
  ('180268602395164235', 'Luna Park', 1992, 'Drama', 'Pavel Lungin, Denis Evstigneev, Pierre Lorrain', 'Pavel Lungin', 'Oleg Borisov, Natalya Yegorova, Nonna Mordyukova, Mikhail Golubovich, Aleksandr Feklistov, Tatyana Lebedkova, Klavdiya Kozlyonkova, Aleksandr Savin', null, 'Andrei is the head of a gang of antisemitic skinheads clinging to the old communist ideals in post-Communist Moscow. When he learns that his long lost father actually is a Jewish bohemian living in Moscow, rather than an Afghanistan war hero, he traces him down in order to kill him. But the intriguing father and his "reactionary" lifstyle soon fascinates Andrei which leads to a clash with his gang.', 'Andrei is the head of a gang of antisemitic skinheads clinging to the old communist ideals in post-Communist Moscow. When he learns that his long lost father actually is a Jewish bohemian living in Moscow, rather than an Afghanistan war hero, he traces him down in order to kill him. But the intriguing father and his "reactionary" lifstyle soon fascinates Andrei which leads to a clash with his gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iN0bHbtE7i3Yv5533giRuPpNb1o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41767'),
  ('1085857407055502107', 'Luna''s Revenge', 2018, 'Thriller, Action', 'Khaled Kaissar, Namche Okon', 'Ulrike Schölles, Ali Zojaji, Alexander Costea', 'Lisa Vicari, Carlo Ljubek, Branko Tomović, Rainer Bock, Genija Rykova, Benjamin Sadler, Bibiana Beglau, Annika Blendl', null, 'When Luna’s family is killed in cold blood on a mountain vacation, she barely escapes, and has to discover she’s been living a lie: her dad was a Russian secret agent, and her family was just a front. Luna has the opportunity to flee the country. But first she wants revenge.', 'When Luna’s family is killed in cold blood on a mountain vacation, she barely escapes, and has to discover she’s been living a lie: her dad was a Russian secret agent, and her family was just a front. Luna has the opportunity to flee the country. But first she wants revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kp0pdsw5dA8KXzxun4FrQHM2K0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398826'),
  ('412347465803412836', 'Lunacy', 2005, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Jan Švankmajer, Juraj Galvánek', 'Jan Švankmajer', 'Pavel Liška, Jan Tříska, Anna Geislerová, Jaroslav Dušek, Martin Huba, Karel Heřman, Pavel Nový, Stano Dančiak', null, 'A man takes up residence with a mysterious marquis and is soon persuaded to enter into an asylum for preventative therapy. Things are not what they seem, and the marquis may be even more sinister than what the young man might have predicted.', 'A man takes up residence with a mysterious marquis and is soon persuaded to enter into an asylum for preventative therapy. Things are not what they seem, and the marquis may be even more sinister than what the young man might have predicted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n03zXfOnaMvv3m9F2Y2Hp9jRZCE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21156'),
  ('294468652310385747', 'Lunaire', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Raphaël Descraques', 'Raphaël Descraques, Cyprien Iov', 'Cyprien Iov, Gaspard Meier-Chaurand, Tiphaine Daviot, Julien Drion, Jérémie Dethelot, Claudette Walker, Camille Fievez, Allison Chassagne', null, 'A lunatic guy saves a party thanks to his imagination.', 'A lunatic guy saves a party thanks to his imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNTTZ69WkBMRRGYqMqG32GS3hH2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608191'),
  ('646318972337814501', 'Lunana: A Yak in the Classroom', 2019, 'Drama', 'Pawo Choyning Dorji, Jigme Tenzing, Kelzang Dorjee', 'Pawo Choyning Dorji', 'Sherab Dorji, Ugyen Norbu Lhendup, Keldon Lhamo Gurung, Pem Zam, Chimi Dem, Kunzang Wangdi, Tshering Dorji, Sangay Lham', 'PG-13', 'A teacher, in search of inspiration, travels to the most remote school in the world, where he ends up realizing how important his job is and appreciating the value of yak dung.', 'A teacher, in search of inspiration, travels to the most remote school in the world, where he ends up realizing how important his job is and appreciating the value of yak dung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mL1OQc1cxGsOIVHgjDvyvmPSmad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627087'),
  ('205293142409773796', 'Lunatics: A Love Story', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Horror', 'Josh Becker, Jeffrey Dougherty, John Cameron', 'Josh Becker', 'Ted Raimi, Deborah Foreman, Bruce Campbell, George Aguilar, Brian McCree, Eddy Roumaya, Michelle Stacey, John Hardy', 'PG-13', 'In the seedy part of Los Angeles, a man who writes poetry has spent six months without leaving his apartment because of his paranoid delusions involving sadistic doctors, rappers, and spiders. A woman who seems to jinx things by wanting to help is dumped by her boyfriend and finds herself penniless on the streets, and soon runs afoul of a local gang. Due to a telephone glitch, the man calls her at a phone booth trying to dial a "talk line" and invites her to his place. There they must help each other to overcome their respective problems.', 'In the seedy part of Los Angeles, a man who writes poetry has spent six months without leaving his apartment because of his paranoid delusions involving sadistic doctors, rappers, and spiders. A woman who seems to jinx things by wanting to help is dumped by her boyfriend and finds herself penniless on the streets, and soon runs afoul of a local gang. Due to a telephone glitch, the man calls her at a phone booth trying to dial a "talk line" and invites her to his place. There they must help each other to overcome their respective problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmwoWOdmIKXPeDr722R6dubzOXS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31564'),
  ('818650400622678992', 'Lunchbox', 2004, 'Romance, Drama', 'Shinji Imaoka, Kazuhiro Suzuki, Ippei Itou', 'Shinji Imaoka', 'Yumika Hayashi, Mutsuo Yoshioka, Lemon Hanazawa, Kiyomi Itō, Yohta Kawase, Yūji Tajiri, Takeshi Itō, Kazunori Sakurai', null, 'The film tells the story of Aiko, a 35-year-old mute woman who works in a bowling alley, and her brief romance with Yoshioka, a younger man who works as a postal carrier. The two meet when Aiko accidentally knocks Yoshioka off his bicycle, and they have a sexual encounter soon after. Aiko begins preparing lunchboxes and giving them to Yoshioka at his workplace as a way of expressing affection, which she cannot do verbally.', 'The film tells the story of Aiko, a 35-year-old mute woman who works in a bowling alley, and her brief romance with Yoshioka, a younger man who works as a postal carrier. The two meet when Aiko accidentally knocks Yoshioka off his bicycle, and they have a sexual encounter soon after. Aiko begins preparing lunchboxes and giving them to Yoshioka at his workplace as a way of expressing affection, which she cannot do verbally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZfLoUPpNem1J4WOspE837u04ww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238442'),
  ('783239191136551338', 'Lupin III: The First', 2019, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Yoji Shimizu, Takashi Yamazaki, Stephane Mangin', 'Takashi Yamazaki', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Miyuki Sawashiro, Daisuke Namikawa, Koichi Yamadera, Suzu Hirose, Kotaro Yoshida, Tatsuya Fujiwara', 'PG-13', 'The iconic "gentleman thief" Lupin III returns in an action-packed, continent-spanning adventure, as Lupin III and his colorful underworld companions race to uncover the secrets of the mysterious Bresson Diary, before it falls into the hands of a dark cabal that will stop at nothing to resurrect the Third Reich.', 'The iconic "gentleman thief" Lupin III returns in an action-packed, continent-spanning adventure, as Lupin III and his colorful underworld companions race to uncover the secrets of the mysterious Bresson Diary, before it falls into the hands of a dark cabal that will stop at nothing to resurrect the Third Reich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEKzkOF0uImcs4CdhPQpF8TwVDE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614587'),
  ('600372446315371288', 'Lupin the 3rd', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Ryuhei Kitamura, Pedro J. Márquez, Zengo Makabe', 'Mataichirô Yamamoto', 'Shun Oguri, Meisa Kuroki, Go Ayano, Tadanobu Asano, Tetsuji Tamayama, Vithaya Pansringarm, Rhatha Phongam, Thanayong Wongtrakul', 'PG-13', 'Interpol Inspector Zenigata begins a world-wide hunt for the infamous thief Arsène Lupin III, who, with his cavalcade of collaborators infiltrate a highly secured fortress-like safe named the ''Ark of Navarone'' to claim the "Crimson Heart of Cleopatra".', 'Interpol Inspector Zenigata begins a world-wide hunt for the infamous thief Arsène Lupin III, who, with his cavalcade of collaborators infiltrate a highly secured fortress-like safe named the ''Ark of Navarone'' to claim the "Crimson Heart of Cleopatra".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xgRjTYDVFEVQeRUrsbQQtKA6I5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241868'),
  ('436976114741316597', 'LUPIN THE 3rd vs. CAT''S EYE', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Hiroyuki Seshita, Kobun Shizuno, Keisuke Ide', 'Shuji Kuzuhara', 'Kanichi Kurita, Akio Otsuka, Miyuki Sawashiro, Daisuke Namikawa, Koichi Yamadera, Keiko Toda, Rica Fukami, Chika Sakamoto', 'PG-13', 'Lupin III competes with the Kisugi sisters to steal a triptych of paintings that once belonged to their father, and which hold the key to a long-unsolved mystery.', 'Lupin III competes with the Kisugi sisters to steal a triptych of paintings that once belonged to their father, and which hold the key to a long-unsolved mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0RQ2B2Tz3diM25GJ8ir8JJMUkB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027159'),
  ('825318562455394117', 'Lupin the 3rd: Goemon''s Blood Spray', 2017, 'Animation, Action, Crime, Drama', 'Hiroshi Oizumi, Takeshi Koike, Takeshi Koike', 'Yuya Takahashi', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Miyuki Sawashiro, Daisuke Namikawa, Koichi Yamadera, Takaya Hashi, Atsuki Tani, Atsuo Hasegawa', 'NR', 'A yakuza boss hires Goemon Ishikawa, a modern day samurai, to protect him aboard his cruise ship casino. Everything goes sideways when the famous thief, Lupin the Third, tries to rob the vessel. Lupin''s being hunted by a powerful and mysterious man: the so called “Ghost of Bermuda.” With Goemon''s employer dead in the ensuing chaos, his honor is at stake, and the only way to preserve it is with blood. But this opponent is like no other, and to make things right, Goemon may need to sharpen not only his sword, but himself as well!', 'A yakuza boss hires Goemon Ishikawa, a modern day samurai, to protect him aboard his cruise ship casino. Everything goes sideways when the famous thief, Lupin the Third, tries to rob the vessel. Lupin''s being hunted by a powerful and mysterious man: the so called “Ghost of Bermuda.” With Goemon''s employer dead in the ensuing chaos, his honor is at stake, and the only way to preserve it is with blood. But this opponent is like no other, and to make things right, Goemon may need to sharpen not only his sword, but himself as well!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdITbnd5QJzSWhntA3KkvQV4JHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456611'),
  ('718718540684036313', 'Lupin the 3rd: The Elusiveness of the Fog', 2007, 'Animation, Adventure, Crime, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Toshihiko Masuda, Satoshi Hirayama, Ichirou Ogawa', 'Yuka Yamada', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Shido Nakamura, Houko Kuwashima, Mari Sekine', 'PG-13', 'Following a lead from Fujiko, Lupin and Jigen excavate the sea floor in Kiritappu to search for a lost underwater treasure that supposedly holds the secrets of time travel. After the Lupin gang escapes a run-in with the law, a strange man calling himself Kyousuke Mamoh strands the Lupin gang hundreds of years in the past.', 'Following a lead from Fujiko, Lupin and Jigen excavate the sea floor in Kiritappu to search for a lost underwater treasure that supposedly holds the secrets of time travel. After the Lupin gang escapes a run-in with the law, a strange man calling himself Kyousuke Mamoh strands the Lupin gang hundreds of years in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqurpBUD6NdtIYPEdBsNv2tE4Md.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80863'),
  ('92038938446513775', 'Lupin the IIIrd: Fujiko''s Lie', 2019, 'Animation, Crime, Action, Drama', 'Yoji Shimizu, Takeshi Koike, Takeshi Koike', 'Yuya Takahashi', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Miyuki Sawashiro, Mamoru Miyano, Tomoe Hanba, Yasuyoshi Hara, Biichi Sato, Farahnaz Nikray', 'NR', 'Fujiko Mine, the devastating femme fatale whose only loyalty is to her desire, befriends a young boy whose late father hid away a fortune. A killer is on the boy''s trail and it''s up to Fujiko to stop him: but where do her interests really lie?', 'Fujiko Mine, the devastating femme fatale whose only loyalty is to her desire, befriends a young boy whose late father hid away a fortune. A killer is on the boy''s trail and it''s up to Fujiko to stop him: but where do her interests really lie?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3p7SVGNllrEUtjisdH7m09yoWdD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587870'),
  ('809263446914853238', 'LUPIN THE IIIRD: The Movie - The Immortal Bloodline', 2025, 'Animation, Action, Crime', 'Takeshi Koike, Wakiko Kume, Nobuo Tomizawa', 'Yuya Takahashi', 'Kanichi Kurita, Akio Otsuka, Daisuke Namikawa, Miyuki Sawashiro, Koichi Yamadera, Ainosuke Kataoka, Aoi Morikawa, Akio Hirose', 'NR', 'After fending off a series of skilled assassins, gentleman thief Lupin III and his band of allies follow a strange invitation to an uncharted island. When their plane is shot down, the gang is stranded and soon hunted by the island’s inhabitants, past enemies, and a monstrous immortal being known as Muom, who threatens to destroy Lupin''s legacy. As a deadly toxic fog settles over them, Lupin must confront his greatest enemy in his most daring escapade yet.', 'After fending off a series of skilled assassins, gentleman thief Lupin III and his band of allies follow a strange invitation to an uncharted island. When their plane is shot down, the gang is stranded and soon hunted by the island’s inhabitants, past enemies, and a monstrous immortal being known as Muom, who threatens to destroy Lupin''s legacy. As a deadly toxic fog settles over them, Lupin must confront his greatest enemy in his most daring escapade yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKgPFG7EDU8v4YLtXvUDRSBmBWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1395140'),
  ('29347593972882687', 'LUPIN THE IIIRD: Zenigata and the Two Lupins', 2025, 'Animation, Crime, Action, Adventure', 'Takeshi Koike, Katsuhito Ishii, Takeshi Koike', 'Yuya Takahashi', 'Kanichi Kurita, Akio Otsuka, Daisuke Namikawa, Miyuki Sawashiro, Koichi Yamadera, Kenyu Horiuchi, Haruhiko Jo, Junko Kitanishi', 'R', 'Inspector Zenigata pursues Lupin as the prime suspect behind a terrorist attack. But when he manages to confront the famous thief, he quickly deduces that the bomber is a second, fake Lupin. Now, it''s up to Zenigata to capture both Lupins and solve the mystery behind the bombing.', 'Inspector Zenigata pursues Lupin as the prime suspect behind a terrorist attack. But when he manages to confront the famous thief, he quickly deduces that the bomber is a second, fake Lupin. Now, it''s up to Zenigata to capture both Lupins and solve the mystery behind the bombing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drWqajJkJcgKu0WQcfz3ohadLhV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1474048'),
  ('622914667772368174', 'Lupin the Third vs. Detective Conan', 2009, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Crime, TV Movie', 'Hajime Kamegaki, Tatsuo Noguchi', 'Atsushi Maekawa', 'Kanichi Kurita, Minami Takayama, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya', 'PG-13', 'When a wealthy woman and her son die in a hunting accident, it''s up to Conan Edogawa to solve the case. Meanwhile, Lupin the Third is after the Queen Crown, owned by the Vesparand royal family. When these two legendary characters meet, who will win the day?! Followed by “Lupin the Third vs. Detective Conan: The Movie” (2013).', 'When a wealthy woman and her son die in a hunting accident, it''s up to Conan Edogawa to solve the case. Meanwhile, Lupin the Third is after the Queen Crown, owned by the Vesparand royal family. When these two legendary characters meet, who will win the day?! Followed by “Lupin the Third vs. Detective Conan: The Movie” (2013).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPYveL8hkrymMzrUgTt9uIm652Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46033'),
  ('496497504722574671', 'Lupin the Third vs. Detective Conan: The Movie', 2013, 'Animation, Action, Thriller', 'Hajime Kamegaki, Tatsuo Noguchi, Ryota Morikawa', 'Atsushi Maekawa', 'Kanichi Kurita, Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Rikiya Koyama, Megumi Hayashibara, Daisuke Namikawa', 'PG-13', 'Conan Edogawa sets out to apprehend Lupin the Third, the suspect of stealing a jewel called Cherry Sapphire.', 'Conan Edogawa sets out to apprehend Lupin the Third, the suspect of stealing a jewel called Cherry Sapphire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyLW346kEV7E8GgibUGeG7pNSFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239529'),
  ('253328765811663884', 'Lupin the Third: Alcatraz Connection', 2001, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie, Crime', 'Hideki Tonokatsu, Satoshi Hirayama, Toshimitsu Kobayashi', 'Hiroshi Kashiwabara', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Taro Ishida, Akio Otsuka, Gen Idemitsu', null, 'Secretly operating his cruiser as a casino at sea isn’t enough for mafia don Lukino Marcano. He’s also looking for the gold-laden boat wreckage worth the budget of a small country! Lupin sniffs out the plan to recover this long-lost treasure and brings along his partners Jigen, Goemon, and Fujiko for the ride to crash Lukino’s party.', 'Secretly operating his cruiser as a casino at sea isn’t enough for mafia don Lukino Marcano. He’s also looking for the gold-laden boat wreckage worth the budget of a small country! Lupin sniffs out the plan to recover this long-lost treasure and brings along his partners Jigen, Goemon, and Fujiko for the ride to crash Lukino’s party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etfvsfGwftCF58mMQDcOEjb7tL5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78139'),
  ('1152903168212808001', 'Lupin the Third: Angel Tactics', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Crime, TV Movie', 'Shigeyuki Miya, Satoshi Hirayama, Eiji Ishimoto', 'Atsushi Maekawa', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Naoko Matsui, Mamiko Noto, Satomi Arai', null, 'Stolen from the famous "secret" Air Force base, Area 51, Lupin''s most recently stolen treasure holds a secret. Four "Bloody Angels," the toughest women Lupin has ever faced, want the treasure for their own terrorist purposes. Meanwhile Zenigata teams up with a female police officer to hunt Lupin and the terrorists down.', 'Stolen from the famous "secret" Air Force base, Area 51, Lupin''s most recently stolen treasure holds a secret. Four "Bloody Angels," the toughest women Lupin has ever faced, want the treasure for their own terrorist purposes. Meanwhile Zenigata teams up with a female police officer to hunt Lupin and the terrorists down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8BmuLT5lxj8wnBpo9qJ2nca7TD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39954'),
  ('814319429739986497', 'Lupin the Third: Blood Seal of the Eternal Mermaid', 2011, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie, Crime, Drama', 'Teiichi Takiguchi, Yoshiharu Sato, Hirofumi Nakata', 'Michihiro Tsuchiya', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Miyuki Sawashiro, Daisuke Namikawa, Koichi Yamadera, Akira Ishida, Haruka Shibuya, Risa Shimizu', null, 'Gemstone, the Mermaid''s Scale, appears in a secret, underground auction. The queen of the underworld coerces Lupin into stealing the rock for her. Quickly discovering not only that the stone is a forgery, but that the real Mermaid''s Scale is part of an unsolved riddle that leads to transcending mortality!', 'Gemstone, the Mermaid''s Scale, appears in a secret, underground auction. The queen of the underworld coerces Lupin into stealing the rock for her. Quickly discovering not only that the stone is a forgery, but that the real Mermaid''s Scale is part of an unsolved riddle that leads to transcending mortality!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiE9Vh76MXa4RpfsN4dZWlNnavC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80405'),
  ('508484212814654689', 'Lupin the Third: Bye Bye, Lady Liberty', 1989, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie, Crime', 'Seiji Suzuki, Hirokata Takahashi, Taizo Matsuzaki', null, 'Yasuo Yamada, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Yui Komazuka, Mayumi Tanaka, Masane Tsukayama', null, 'Foiled repeatedly by the predictions of Interpol''s supercomputer, Lupin has settled down. His partner Jigen asks him to pull one last heist: recover the Super Egg, a massive diamond hidden somewhere inside the Statue of Liberty.', 'Foiled repeatedly by the predictions of Interpol''s supercomputer, Lupin has settled down. His partner Jigen asks him to pull one last heist: recover the Super Egg, a massive diamond hidden somewhere inside the Statue of Liberty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kU7Gai6yZF9bMIUD1MIzFYBuN6U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31051'),
  ('637351356032340729', 'Lupin the Third: Dead or Alive', 1996, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Kazuhiko Kato, Takahiko Shobu, Yasuhiro Seo', 'Hiroshi Sakakibara', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Minami Takayama, Banjo Ginga, Toru Furuya', 'PG-13', 'When Lupin heads to the kingdom of Zufu to pilfer its treasure, he incurs the wrath of its psychotic ruler General Headhunter, who places a dead-or-alive bounty on his head.', 'When Lupin heads to the kingdom of Zufu to pilfer its treasure, he incurs the wrath of its psychotic ruler General Headhunter, who places a dead-or-alive bounty on his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozIL93nbJzjjSIPlgbwuuxBadu2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31050'),
  ('169312253938407038', 'Lupin the Third: Dragon of Doom', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Crime', 'Masaharu Okuwaki, Seiji Suzuki, Hajime Hasegawa', 'Nobuaki Kishima', 'Yasuo Yamada, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Naoko Matsui, Junpei Takiguchi, Banjo Ginga', null, 'The Lupin gang is once again dragged onto a wild treasure hunt! This time, the objective is a mysterious, small dragon statue that even Goemon''s steel-rendering blade Zantetsuken cannot cut. The artifact, which once eluded even Lupin the Third''s esteemed grandfather, rests deep undersea inside the infamous Titanic, and is the key to unlocking the mystery of Zantetsuken''s almighty strength. A wealthy gangster, Lupin, and Goemon all want the statue for themselves!', 'The Lupin gang is once again dragged onto a wild treasure hunt! This time, the objective is a mysterious, small dragon statue that even Goemon''s steel-rendering blade Zantetsuken cannot cut. The artifact, which once eluded even Lupin the Third''s esteemed grandfather, rests deep undersea inside the infamous Titanic, and is the key to unlocking the mystery of Zantetsuken''s almighty strength. A wealthy gangster, Lupin, and Goemon all want the statue for themselves!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QjLhHlUEjkrCV7daIvruxeRBo1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51943'),
  ('332604456111629428', 'Lupin the Third: Episode 0: First Contact', 2002, 'Animation, TV Movie, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Minoru Ohara, Satoshi Kato, Seiji Suzuki', 'Shouji Yonemura', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Romi Park, Shūichirō Moriyama, Shunsuke Sakuno', 'PG-13', 'The stickup that started it all! Lupin III and Fujiko are both after an ancient artifact Jigen is supposed to protect, while Goemon happens to be searching for his clan’s lost treasure nearby. Of course, Inspector Zenigata isn’t far behind. This is the story of our heroes’ very first meeting!', 'The stickup that started it all! Lupin III and Fujiko are both after an ancient artifact Jigen is supposed to protect, while Goemon happens to be searching for his clan’s lost treasure nearby. Of course, Inspector Zenigata isn’t far behind. This is the story of our heroes’ very first meeting!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIu4HPo7FvsnuG0q9MvHsgow4uv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109572'),
  ('416309750103049841', 'Lupin the Third: Farewell to Nostradamus', 1995, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Takeshi Shirato, Nobuo Tomizawa, Shunya Ito', 'Hiroshi Kashiwabara, Toshiya Itô', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Yumi Adachi, Hōsei Komatsu, Fumi Dan', 'PG-13', 'A simple diamond heist leads Lupin into the machinations of a bizarre cult based around the prophecies of Nostradamus. They kidnap Julia, the daughter of Douglas, a wealthy American who is seeking the presidency, along with Lupin''s diamond. At stake is the lost book of prophecy Douglas holds in the vault at the top of his skyscraper.', 'A simple diamond heist leads Lupin into the machinations of a bizarre cult based around the prophecies of Nostradamus. They kidnap Julia, the daughter of Douglas, a wealthy American who is seeking the presidency, along with Lupin''s diamond. At stake is the lost book of prophecy Douglas holds in the vault at the top of his skyscraper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zd6ItdUDgxLtf7Yp6MVvWp0G9Y9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31049'),
  ('641327119925909436', 'Lupin the Third: From Siberia with Love', 1992, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Osamu Dezaki, Kiyotoshi Aoi, Satoshi Hirayama', 'Hiroshi Kashiwabara', 'Yasuo Yamada, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Yuko Sasaki, Tamio Ohki, Masao Imanishi', null, 'Notorious thief Lupin the Third aims to steal the lost treasure of the Romanov royal family with his criminal associates along for the ride. The treasure is an immense quantity of gold hidden underground in the vaults of a mysterious Texas bank. But to obtain the gold, Lupin and his friends will have to face down both the Mafia and Rasputon, the telepathic descendant of the mad monk Rasputin. Lupin again eludes inspector Zenigata with the help of a mysterious blonde named Judy Scott, as Rasputon manipulates the world''s leaders to put every obstacle in Lupin''s path.', 'Notorious thief Lupin the Third aims to steal the lost treasure of the Romanov royal family with his criminal associates along for the ride. The treasure is an immense quantity of gold hidden underground in the vaults of a mysterious Texas bank. But to obtain the gold, Lupin and his friends will have to face down both the Mafia and Rasputon, the telepathic descendant of the mad monk Rasputin. Lupin again eludes inspector Zenigata with the help of a mysterious blonde named Judy Scott, as Rasputon manipulates the world''s leaders to put every obstacle in Lupin''s path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nRER0r2ZKQlP4S2gLkPUYGYwfY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80857'),
  ('155484840894537882', 'Lupin the Third: Goodbye Partner', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Crime, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Hirotaka Marufuji, Koji Yamakawa, Masahito Yamashita', 'Takehiko Hata', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Miyuki Sawashiro, Daisuke Namikawa, Koichi Yamadera, Minako Kotobuki, Junichi Suwabe, Yoji Ueda', 'PG-13', 'A warrant’s been issued for an arrest but this time, it’s not for Lupin. Authorities are after Inspector Zenigata as they suspect Pops has been in cahoots with the master thief all along. In an effort to vouch for Zenigata’s innocence, Lupin is challenged to steal the curious Time Crystal. As Lupin and his gang go after the famed diamond he’s confronted with the unexpected betrayal of his most trusted partner.', 'A warrant’s been issued for an arrest but this time, it’s not for Lupin. Authorities are after Inspector Zenigata as they suspect Pops has been in cahoots with the master thief all along. In an effort to vouch for Zenigata’s innocence, Lupin is challenged to steal the curious Time Crystal. As Lupin and his gang go after the famed diamond he’s confronted with the unexpected betrayal of his most trusted partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npjW3X9nKcg315wB2QnLTEXoEAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572616'),
  ('424636024205195985', 'Lupin the Third: Green vs Red', 2008, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Shigeyuki Miya, Takayo Nishimura, Manabu Nakatake', 'Toshimichi Ohkawa', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Jin Katagiri, Aya Hirano, Kenichi Ogata', null, 'When a Lupin impersonator is arrested for shoplifting in Tokyo, dozens of other copycats converge on the city to clear the name of Arsene Lupin III. The real Lupin is in town too, both to watch the show and to steal a mysterious item called the Ice Cube. But one of those impostors also has sights on the Cube. Is he good enough to beat the original at his own game?', 'When a Lupin impersonator is arrested for shoplifting in Tokyo, dozens of other copycats converge on the city to clear the name of Arsene Lupin III. The real Lupin is in town too, both to watch the show and to steal a mysterious item called the Ice Cube. But one of those impostors also has sights on the Cube. Is he good enough to beat the original at his own game?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWFxFDe9cwrmeNh56WyKw2lOhcb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26546'),
  ('427683071492207792', 'Lupin the Third: Is Lupin Still Burning?', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Animation', 'Kazuhiko Kato, Jun Kawagoe, Jiro Tazawa', null, 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Miyuki Sawashiro, Daisuke Namikawa, Koichi Yamadera, Chafurin, Manabu Muraji, Hiroshi Yanaka', null, 'When a long-dead foe sends Lupin III on a road trip through time, he’ll have to be careful to keep the past intact to protect his future… if he can make it back there at all!', 'When a long-dead foe sends Lupin III on a road trip through time, he’ll have to be careful to keep the past intact to protect his future… if he can make it back there at all!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mqzs8ZneYjCgcRTnfT9mYEt3fq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567767'),
  ('959235400580567979', 'Lupin the Third: Island of Assassins', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, TV Movie, Crime, Drama', 'Hiroyuki Yano, Fuminori Kizaki, Masatoshi Otani', 'Shouji Yonemura', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Emi Shinohara, Masane Tsukayama, Kenji Utsumi', 'PG-13', 'Lupin is framed for the murder of Inspector Zenigata by a mysterious assailant holding a silver-coloured Walther P38 pistol Lupin himself once owned. Tracking the true killer leads Lupin to the island of the bloodthirsty Tarantula assassins inside the Devil’s Triangle. After joining the spider-tattooed army against their will, Lupin and his gang make both new friends and enemies as they not only plan to take home the Tarantulas’ massive gold repository for themselves, but hunt down the shooter from Lupin’s past. Can Lupin put to rest this demon who haunts his memories with the Walther P38?', 'Lupin is framed for the murder of Inspector Zenigata by a mysterious assailant holding a silver-coloured Walther P38 pistol Lupin himself once owned. Tracking the true killer leads Lupin to the island of the bloodthirsty Tarantula assassins inside the Devil’s Triangle. After joining the spider-tattooed army against their will, Lupin and his gang make both new friends and enemies as they not only plan to take home the Tarantulas’ massive gold repository for themselves, but hunt down the shooter from Lupin’s past. Can Lupin put to rest this demon who haunts his memories with the Walther P38?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9R23LFhmlzDGpYpKYjFyJ7XjRt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31599'),
  ('836967018087858616', 'Lupin the Third: Italian Game', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Crime', 'Yuichiro Yano, Kazuhide Tomonaga, Kae Anzai', null, 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Miyuki Sawashiro, Daisuke Namikawa, Koichi Yamadera, Yukiyo Fujii, Jin Yamanoi, Shunsuke Sakuya', null, 'Lupin investigates the kidnapping of a former love in Italy, and is drawn into a game with an unknown enemy.', 'Lupin investigates the kidnapping of a former love in Italy, and is drawn into a game with an unknown enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEr9uvhTZj9v1zXtZuSko05hV8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404532'),
  ('37635868904580452', 'Lupin the Third: Jigen''s Gravestone', 2014, 'Animation, Adventure, Action, Crime', 'Takeshi Koike, Takeshi Koike, Jiro Tazawa', 'Yuya Takahashi', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Miyuki Sawashiro, Koichi Yamadera, Akio Hirose, Kanji Obana, Marika Minase, Aki Nagao', 'PG-13', 'Lupin & Jigen have their sights set on a treasure called the Little Comet, which is located in the heavily fortified country of East Doroa. During the heist, Jigen is almost killed by a sniper named Yael Okuzaki. His specialty is preparing tombstones for his targets before executing them. It''s said that no one can survive after Yael makes their tombstone.', 'Lupin & Jigen have their sights set on a treasure called the Little Comet, which is located in the heavily fortified country of East Doroa. During the heist, Jigen is almost killed by a sniper named Yael Okuzaki. His specialty is preparing tombstones for his targets before executing them. It''s said that no one can survive after Yael makes their tombstone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZrbFDbjZ0oXy3RCyiYkNxQtwmB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260516'),
  ('66628816542580746', 'Lupin the Third: Missed by a Dollar', 2000, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, TV Movie, Crime', 'Seiji Suzuki, Toshimitsu Kobayashi, Ichirou Ogawa', 'Hiroshi Sakakibara', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Mami Koyama, Rica Matsumoto, Jouji Nakata', 'PG-13', 'Master thief Lupin the Third and his friends have to compete with a greedy banker and her minions to help solve a mystery leading to a treasure that is said to hold history''s most powerful rulers.', 'Master thief Lupin the Third and his friends have to compete with a greedy banker and her minions to help solve a mystery leading to a treasure that is said to hold history''s most powerful rulers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyGciiThArN1yW4AWrmhqS1lvaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31053'),
  ('532416185268980626', 'Lupin the Third: Napoleon''s Dictionary', 1991, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, TV Movie, Crime', 'Osamu Dezaki, Ayumi Kudō, Hajime Hasegawa', 'Hiroshi Kashiwabara', 'Yasuo Yamada, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Keiko Toda, Tōru Ōhira, Kei Yoshimizu', null, 'The secret of the Lupin family treasure is out: its location is written inside a dictionary once owned by Napoleon Bonaparte himself! When the dictionary turns up as the prize for a historic motor car race, the notorious Lupin the Third and his criminal cadre race the world''s superpowers to win - or steal - the Dictionary and unearth his grandfather''s legacy of riches!', 'The secret of the Lupin family treasure is out: its location is written inside a dictionary once owned by Napoleon Bonaparte himself! When the dictionary turns up as the prize for a historic motor car race, the notorious Lupin the Third and his criminal cadre race the world''s superpowers to win - or steal - the Dictionary and unearth his grandfather''s legacy of riches!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rK3JCT4Y21PX6j00kpnoVoSA33X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80865'),
  ('215805828421342503', 'Lupin the Third: Operation: Return the Treasure', 2003, 'Animation, TV Movie, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Kojiro Hayashi, Jun Kawagoe, Satoshi Hirayama', 'Hiroshi Kashiwabara', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Rei Igarashi, Rino Katase, Koichi Yamadera', null, 'After robbing a Moscow casino right under Zenigata''s nose, Lupin is given a job to return 6 treasures to their original areas for an old friend of his, so Lupin can receive an even better treasure to gain.', 'After robbing a Moscow casino right under Zenigata''s nose, Lupin is given a job to return 6 treasures to their original areas for an old friend of his, so Lupin can receive an even better treasure to gain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ShUmTEkPLQBwzjBH5qlMimkXR3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80868'),
  ('990496105704221842', 'Lupin the Third: Pilot Film', 1969, 'Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Animation', 'Masaaki Osumi', 'Tsutomu Shibayama, Gisaburō Sugii, Yasuo Otsuka', 'Taichiro Hirokawa, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Gorō Naya, Shinsuke Chikaishi, Koichi Kitamura, Nobuo Tanaka, Nachi Nozawa', null, 'The first animated adaptation of the popular manga series, this pilot introduces the main characters of "Lupin the Third" with montages, presented through a short frame narrative illustrating a typical gang escape.', 'The first animated adaptation of the popular manga series, this pilot introduces the main characters of "Lupin the Third" with montages, presented through a short frame narrative illustrating a typical gang escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9OardwT06PAAsqKmmOx4zijIm1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172591'),
  ('1073474053386968561', 'Lupin the Third: Princess of the Breeze', 2013, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie, Crime, Adventure', 'Takaomi Kanasaki, Masayuki Kawaguchi', 'Touko Machida, Shigeru Morita, Katsuro Hidaka', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Miyuki Sawashiro, Daisuke Namikawa, Koichi Yamadera, Yui Ishikawa, Kanako Miyamoto, Hiroshi Kamiya', null, 'After a chaotic heist, Lupin and Jigen find themselves becoming caretakers of a baby boy, while a young sky pirate called Yutika is after their loot. Yutika is an inhabitant of the city-state of Shahalta, which has recently fallen to a shady minister. Soon, Lupin''s gang and Yutika join forces to uncover one of Shahalta''s greatest treasures, facing off against both Shahaltan authorities and Zenigata.', 'After a chaotic heist, Lupin and Jigen find themselves becoming caretakers of a baby boy, while a young sky pirate called Yutika is after their loot. Yutika is an inhabitant of the city-state of Shahalta, which has recently fallen to a shady minister. Soon, Lupin''s gang and Yutika join forces to uncover one of Shahalta''s greatest treasures, facing off against both Shahaltan authorities and Zenigata.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9Xe1zR9qwxGCNz0tdbsIwgitiw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245928'),
  ('735937978968836175', 'Lupin the Third: Prison of the Past', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Crime, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Yooko Kadokura, Satoshi Hirayama, Yoji Shimizu', 'Shatner Nishida', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Miyuki Sawashiro, Daisuke Namikawa, Koichi Yamadera, Houko Kuwashima, Hiroaki Hirata, Nobunaga Shimazaki', null, 'To rescue a famous criminal from imprisonment, Lupin and his team infiltrate the Kingdom of Dorrente. While the skillful thieves from around the world are gathering, Lupin tries to reveal the secret hidden in the kingdom.', 'To rescue a famous criminal from imprisonment, Lupin and his team infiltrate the Kingdom of Dorrente. While the skillful thieves from around the world are gathering, Lupin tries to reveal the secret hidden in the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFGxlUcdOUYSjD9x7kgHjOhEacH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641909'),
  ('46515697368148760', 'Lupin the Third: Return of Pycal', 2002, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Mamoru Hamatsu, Satoshi Kato, Satoshi Ohtsubo', 'Ryou Katsuragi', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Nachi Nozawa, Takeshi Aono, Junpei Takiguchi', 'PG-13', 'Lupin steals an extraordinary gem from a Mediterranean party, only to be interrupted by Pycal, the trickster "magician" who had apparently died fighting Lupin early in his career. Pycal, now armed with real magical abilities, is determined to take revenge.', 'Lupin steals an extraordinary gem from a Mediterranean party, only to be interrupted by Pycal, the trickster "magician" who had apparently died fighting Lupin early in his career. Pycal, now armed with real magical abilities, is determined to take revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMavOcSOYrG81AU8L0D51YsWqQc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33176'),
  ('51726376777824165', 'Lupin the Third: Seven Days Rhapsody', 2006, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie, Crime', 'Hajime Kamegaki, Masahiko Yoda, Masakazu Saitou', 'Hiroshi Kashiwabara', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Mariya Ise, Masane Tsukayama, Fumihiko Tachiki', 'PG-13', 'After a successful heist at the race track, talented thief Lupin has his sights set on a valuable diamond set to be displayed in seven days. His plan is complicated when he saves a young girl named Michelle from a group of thugs. Michelle''s father is very rich and connected to the diamond; her father also enlists an old mercenary friend of Jigen to persuade Jigen to work for him. Goemon has also been hired by Fujiko to assist her in her own plans for the diamond. With no one to turn to and double-crosses galore, can Lupin pull things together in a week?', 'After a successful heist at the race track, talented thief Lupin has his sights set on a valuable diamond set to be displayed in seven days. His plan is complicated when he saves a young girl named Michelle from a group of thugs. Michelle''s father is very rich and connected to the diamond; her father also enlists an old mercenary friend of Jigen to persuade Jigen to work for him. Goemon has also been hired by Fujiko to assist her in her own plans for the diamond. With no one to turn to and double-crosses galore, can Lupin pull things together in a week?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSl1FVGHb3ZWFtQy9H9TOpJm2Ow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80860'),
  ('1081070984933604874', 'Lupin the Third: Strange Psychokinetic Strategy', 1974, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Takashi Tsuboshima, Kôji Ichihara', 'Hiroshi Nagano', 'Yūki Meguro, Eiko Ezaki, Kunie Tanaka, Shirō Itō, Maria Anzai, Kiyoshi Maekawa, Hsiao Hui-mei, Akira Hitomi', null, 'The Maccherone organization is out to get a priceless national treasure. But when they see third-generation cat-burglar Lupin as an obstacle, countless assassins are sent to kill him on sight and kidnap his girl Fujiko! Can Lupin get the loot before the Maccherone gang, rescue Fujiko, and stay alive at the same time?', 'The Maccherone organization is out to get a priceless national treasure. But when they see third-generation cat-burglar Lupin as an obstacle, countless assassins are sent to kill him on sight and kidnap his girl Fujiko! Can Lupin get the loot before the Maccherone gang, rescue Fujiko, and stay alive at the same time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmqZsKuRaKt48HBUlTxeSIHPS11.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97734'),
  ('57251090765491746', 'Lupin the Third: Swallowtail Tattoo', 2004, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie, Crime', 'Haruo Sotozaki, Kazuhiro Oki, Seiji Suzuki', 'Toshimichi Ohkawa', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Yuu Asakawa, Takeshi Aono, Kōji Nakata', 'PG-13', 'Fujiko and Lupin are kidnapped by Malkovich, a notorious criminal escaped from Alcatraz who forces Lupin to steal the "Bull''s Eye," a precious stone.', 'Fujiko and Lupin are kidnapped by Malkovich, a notorious criminal escaped from Alcatraz who forces Lupin to steal the "Bull''s Eye," a precious stone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRo4gxWnjh2nYfvbKDCopYzRo70.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80866'),
  ('454147860110956772', 'Lupin the Third: Sweet Lost Night', 2008, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie, Crime', 'Fujio Suzuki, Jouji Yanase, Mitsuru Nasukawa', 'Toshimichi Ohkawa', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Aruno Tahara, Masato Hagiwara, Umeka Shouji', 'PG-13', 'Gifted thief Lupin the Third scores a "magic lamp" and finds it contains a genie. However, after the clock strikes 7 p.m., he can''t seem to remember anything… Finding himself in Singapore, Lupin must battle his way past the forces of Colonel Garlic and discover the secret behind the lamp – but every night at 7 p.m., his memory is wiped clean! How can Lupin piece together this puzzle when he can''t even remember what he''s doing?', 'Gifted thief Lupin the Third scores a "magic lamp" and finds it contains a genie. However, after the clock strikes 7 p.m., he can''t seem to remember anything… Finding himself in Singapore, Lupin must battle his way past the forces of Colonel Garlic and discover the secret behind the lamp – but every night at 7 p.m., his memory is wiped clean! How can Lupin piece together this puzzle when he can''t even remember what he''s doing?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOCza5fb9mG5jWKcJ5Ajk1yv8Nb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59719'),
  ('518322728582010237', 'Lupin the Third: The Columbus Files', 1999, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie, Drama, Crime', 'Setsuo Takase, Hajime Hasegawa, Seiji Suzuki', 'Shinzo Fujita', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Keiko Toda, Shigeru Chiba, Shūichirō Moriyama', 'PG-13', 'When Fujiko secures a file that documents the location of the fabled Columbus Egg – a mystical relic that controls the weather – she quickly recruits Lupin and the gang to track down the long-lost treasure. Unfortunately, her memory of Lupin and his friends are wiped out almost entirely. Can the gang restore Fujiko’s memory before the Egg falls into the hands of a madman?', 'When Fujiko secures a file that documents the location of the fabled Columbus Egg – a mystical relic that controls the weather – she quickly recruits Lupin and the gang to track down the long-lost treasure. Unfortunately, her memory of Lupin and his friends are wiped out almost entirely. Can the gang restore Fujiko’s memory before the Egg falls into the hands of a madman?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqERsGKYo6jgSXdWP7JuvCM7Hp1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31594'),
  ('1117785278947511685', 'Lupin the Third: The Fuma Conspiracy', 1987, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Yasuo Otsuka, Masayuki Ozeki, Akio Saito', 'Makoto Naito', 'Toshio Furukawa, Banjo Ginga, Mami Koyama, Kaneto Shiozawa, Seizo Kato, Mayumi Shou, Kohei Miyauchi, Masashi Hirose', 'PG-13', 'Goemon''s wedding to Murasaki Suminawa, daughter of a samurai clan''s leader, is interrupted when the Fuma ninjas attack, kidnapping the bride-to-be and demanding her family''s ancient treasure as ransom. Lupin, Jigen, Goemon and Fujiko work together once again to try to save Murasaki and get to the treasure before the Fuma can steal it.', 'Goemon''s wedding to Murasaki Suminawa, daughter of a samurai clan''s leader, is interrupted when the Fuma ninjas attack, kidnapping the bride-to-be and demanding her family''s ancient treasure as ransom. Lupin, Jigen, Goemon and Fujiko work together once again to try to save Murasaki and get to the treasure before the Fuma can steal it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewldOPVHNeuAzHwR4njdGlDcVRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50482'),
  ('12049641797113397', 'Lupin the Third: The Hemingway Papers', 1990, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie, Crime', 'Hajime Hasegawa, Seiji Suzuki, Osamu Dezaki', 'Kazuhiko Kato', 'Yasuo Yamada, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Yuko Sasaki, Kosei Tomita, Osamu Kobayashi', null, 'A bloody civil war is the setting for Lupin''s latest caper; the leader for one of the factions holds documents written by Earnest Hemingway and contain the location of a remarkable treasure. With Goemon and Jigen fighting on opposite sides of the war, Lupin must tackle this challenge alone. As the war rages on, can Lupin secure the treasure and keep Goemon and Jigen from killing each other?!', 'A bloody civil war is the setting for Lupin''s latest caper; the leader for one of the factions holds documents written by Earnest Hemingway and contain the location of a remarkable treasure. With Goemon and Jigen fighting on opposite sides of the war, Lupin must tackle this challenge alone. As the war rages on, can Lupin secure the treasure and keep Goemon and Jigen from killing each other?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4HuZNoojVtwpvWaQQ4Xgw3aU4O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80861'),
  ('708063568336400555', 'Lupin the Third: The Last Job', 2010, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, TV Movie, Crime', 'Shinichi Suzuki, Tatsuo Noguchi, Kenji Hachizaki', 'Toshimichi Ohkawa', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Aya Hirano, Romi Park, Masane Tsukayama', null, 'Lupin begins his heist by stealing a newly-discovered Japanese cultural treasure being transported to Germany. During his attempt to steal the treasure, however, he witnesses the always-ambitious Zenigata''s supposed "death," a plan hatched by a ninja clan who are also after the treasure. Can Lupin and his friends prevent the ninja clan from obtaining what they seek?', 'Lupin begins his heist by stealing a newly-discovered Japanese cultural treasure being transported to Germany. During his attempt to steal the treasure, however, he witnesses the always-ambitious Zenigata''s supposed "death," a plan hatched by a ninja clan who are also after the treasure. Can Lupin and his friends prevent the ninja clan from obtaining what they seek?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmtKzfbQHht7KthPpN99dMnUI2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39952'),
  ('1090799636320929014', 'Lupin the Third: The Legend of the Gold of Babylon', 1985, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Seijun Suzuki, Shigetsugu Yoshida, Hidetoshi Owashi', 'Yoshio Urasawa, Atsushi Yamatoya', 'Yasuo Yamada, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Toki Shiozawa, Maki Carrousel, Chikao Ohtsuka', null, 'Lupin squares off with two criminal families and Inspector Zenigata''s new female patrol to track down a hoard of biblical-era treasure.', 'Lupin squares off with two criminal families and Inspector Zenigata''s new female patrol to track down a hoard of biblical-era treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sC0nlE0XiUYF2yL6tBpoDmHYyNK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32873'),
  ('528488460716087361', 'Lupin the Third: The Mystery of Mamo', 1978, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Yoshio Kabashima, Keishichi Kuroki, Soji Yoshikawa', 'Atsushi Yamatoya, Soji Yoshikawa', 'Yasuo Yamada, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Kō Nishimura, Tōru Ōhira, Hidekatsu Shibata', 'PG-13', 'While attempting to win the affections of a beautiful rival, a master thief risks death to learn the secret intentions of a wealthy and seemingly immortal, but certainly ruthless, recluse.', 'While attempting to win the affections of a beautiful rival, a master thief risks death to learn the secret intentions of a wealthy and seemingly immortal, but certainly ruthless, recluse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgxMZcUW9HQOSFy6fzUWFA8BLo1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30143'),
  ('1015842696139825747', 'Lupin the Third: The Pursuit of Harimao''s Treasure', 1995, 'Animation, TV Movie, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Osamu Dezaki, Seiji Suzuki, Hajime Hasegawa', 'Hiroshi Kashiwabara', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Maya Okamoto, Tadashi Nakamura, Hirotaka Suzuoki', 'PG-13', 'The infamous bandit Harimao hid a treasure, and to retrieve it, Lupin and the gang must gather three lost statues. When the Nazi-like group Neo-Himmel make a run for the goods, Lupin reluctantly partners with the aging "double-O" MI-6 agent Sir Archer and his granddaughter Diana to gather the statues first. Can this unorthodox team bond well enough to see this mission through?', 'The infamous bandit Harimao hid a treasure, and to retrieve it, Lupin and the gang must gather three lost statues. When the Nazi-like group Neo-Himmel make a run for the goods, Lupin reluctantly partners with the aging "double-O" MI-6 agent Sir Archer and his granddaughter Diana to gather the statues first. Can this unorthodox team bond well enough to see this mission through?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZRnMvO7YLttRWOi1AvqiZIEQGk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45378'),
  ('155259748796289986', 'Lupin the Third: The Secret of Twilight Gemini', 1996, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Crime, TV Movie', 'Gisaburō Sugii, Hajime Hasegawa, Seiji Suzuki', 'Hideki Mitsui', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Aya Hisakawa, Yuzuru Fujimoto, Shūichirō Moriyama', null, 'As Lupin''s mentor Don Dolune lies on his deathbed, he hands the master thief a gift, the diamond named Twilight. Though it''s only half the treasure — the other half of the Twilight can be found in Morocco. Lupin must contend with his on-again-off-again-partner Fujiko, his feelings for the mysterious Lara, and the relentless whip-wielding maniac Sadachiyo in order to bring Twilight back to its full glory.', 'As Lupin''s mentor Don Dolune lies on his deathbed, he hands the master thief a gift, the diamond named Twilight. Though it''s only half the treasure — the other half of the Twilight can be found in Morocco. Lupin must contend with his on-again-off-again-partner Fujiko, his feelings for the mysterious Lara, and the relentless whip-wielding maniac Sadachiyo in order to bring Twilight back to its full glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nw1K8VMyiKyEIHV8RJc9RUGsur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53894'),
  ('381588569353419652', 'Lupin the Third: The Secret Page of Marco Polo', 2012, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Adventure, TV Movie, Crime', 'Takahisa Ichikawa, Hajime Kamegaki, Katsumi Minoguchi', 'Katsuro Hidaka', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Miyuki Sawashiro, Daisuke Namikawa, Koichi Yamadera, Marina Inoue, Kōji Ishī, Ichiro Nagai', null, 'Researchers unearth a long-lost page of "The Travels of Marco Polo" and discover it''s a clue to a lost treasure! Lupin appears to swipe the tablet, but he leaves empty-handed... and as a murder suspect! He shrugs off being framed for the death of an archaeology professor just enough to go treasure-hunting. Tailed by both a weapons dealer and ICPO Inspector Zenigata, Lupin must rely on his gunslinging partner Jigen and the professor''s granddaughter Lisa to stay two steps ahead. Meanwhile, the swordsman Goemon rethinks his devotion to the blade and finds romance deep in the mountains. Two tales collide in a worldwide adventure packed with history and laughs!', 'Researchers unearth a long-lost page of "The Travels of Marco Polo" and discover it''s a clue to a lost treasure! Lupin appears to swipe the tablet, but he leaves empty-handed... and as a murder suspect! He shrugs off being framed for the death of an archaeology professor just enough to go treasure-hunting. Tailed by both a weapons dealer and ICPO Inspector Zenigata, Lupin must rely on his gunslinging partner Jigen and the professor''s granddaughter Lisa to stay two steps ahead. Meanwhile, the swordsman Goemon rethinks his devotion to the blade and finds romance deep in the mountains. Two tales collide in a worldwide adventure packed with history and laughs!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IzUpNKc0UJUUZ1kunOUkjI1lbU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251432'),
  ('1065809811724787081', 'Lupin the Third: Tokyo Crisis', 1998, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Drama, TV Movie, Crime', 'Toshiya Shinohara, Satoshi Hirayama, Takashi Sano', 'Shinzo Fujita', 'Kanichi Kurita, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Megumi Hayashibara, Koichi Yamadera, Seinosuke Nakajima', 'PG-13', 'Lupin''s plans to intercept two old glass photographic plates from being delivered to a mysterious art dealer named Mr. Suzuki misfires, and it doesn''t help matters that Goemon and Jigen are suffering from... efficiency problems. Meanwhile, Inspector Zenigata has a new tag-along in the Lupin chase: the beautiful young reporter Maria. But what is Maria''s connection to the mysterious Mr. Suzuki?', 'Lupin''s plans to intercept two old glass photographic plates from being delivered to a mysterious art dealer named Mr. Suzuki misfires, and it doesn''t help matters that Goemon and Jigen are suffering from... efficiency problems. Meanwhile, Inspector Zenigata has a new tag-along in the Lupin chase: the beautiful young reporter Maria. But what is Maria''s connection to the mysterious Mr. Suzuki?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t423jUrgro2rqV3TOOx7lbAbUNw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31595'),
  ('529504750537553865', 'Lupin the Third: Voyage to Danger', 1993, 'Animation, TV Movie, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Masaaki Osumi, Hiroyuki Horiuchi, Madoka Hirayama', 'Hiroshi Kashiwabara', 'Yasuo Yamada, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Eiko Masuyama, Makio Inoue, Gorō Naya, Atsuko Tanaka, Nachi Nozawa, Unsho Ishizuka', null, 'After Inspector Zenigata is reassigned from the Lupin case and grows despondent, master thief Lupin the Third decides to help him get his old job back, teaming up with the old man to destroy the international weapon smugglers Shot Shell. Together with Lupin''s long-time partners in crime, they steal a nuclear Russian submarine and enlist the help of a nuclear physicist named Karen, who keeps suspiciously eyeing Lupin''s partner Jigen. If that weren''t enough, Zenigata''s Interpol successor is an assassin who aims to pick off the Lupin gang one by one.', 'After Inspector Zenigata is reassigned from the Lupin case and grows despondent, master thief Lupin the Third decides to help him get his old job back, teaming up with the old man to destroy the international weapon smugglers Shot Shell. Together with Lupin''s long-time partners in crime, they steal a nuclear Russian submarine and enlist the help of a nuclear physicist named Karen, who keeps suspiciously eyeing Lupin''s partner Jigen. If that weren''t enough, Zenigata''s Interpol successor is an assassin who aims to pick off the Lupin gang one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEk6DypuBtMoag88YegTAl9z1Rc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76190'),
  ('826098646605711702', 'Lupt', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Prabhuraj, Prakash Kutty', 'Prabhuraj', 'Javed Jaffrey, Vijay Raaz, Meenakshi Dixit, Rishina Kandhari, Niki Aneja Walia, Nataša Stanković', null, 'A road trip turns into a spooky nightmare as a family of four is attacked by strange entities', 'A road trip turns into a spooky nightmare as a family of four is attacked by strange entities', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3dYk4c8dH3IHOAgVfmOpPbacG0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538126'),
  ('766797364851401171', 'Lure', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Oliver Cox', 'Oliver Cox', 'Silvia Presente, Kit Esuruoso, Paul David-Gough, Pippa Winslow, Gregory Fung', null, 'After being invited to a party by a mysterious and alluring woman, six men awake to find themselves part of a cult family''s gruesome annual tradition to find the perfect suitor.', 'After being invited to a party by a mysterious and alluring woman, six men awake to find themselves part of a cult family''s gruesome annual tradition to find the perfect suitor.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FzwGIXXauPHkGCEgDc13raAsG4Uk.jpg', 'plex:movie:lure-2026'),
  ('894617330353791532', 'Lure of the Wilderness', 1952, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Jean Negulesco, Edward Cronjager', 'Louis Lantz', 'Jean Peters, Jeffrey Hunter, Constance Smith, Walter Brennan, Tom Tully, Harry Shannon, Will Wright, Jack Elam', 'NR', 'A young girl and her father, who is unjustly accused of murder, seek refuge in a Georgia swamp until they are befriended by a trapper who penetrates the swamp in search of his dog.', 'A young girl and her father, who is unjustly accused of murder, seek refuge in a Georgia swamp until they are befriended by a trapper who penetrates the swamp in search of his dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OlYzgeQjLfoORi8eDBmEFVPTSC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249846'),
  ('1016872742660505554', 'Lured', 1947, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Douglas Sirk, William H. Daniels, Victor Greene', 'Leo Rosten', 'George Sanders, Lucille Ball, Charles Coburn, Boris Karloff, Cedric Hardwicke, Joseph Calleia, Alan Mowbray, George Zucco', 'NR', 'Sandra Carpenter is a London-based dancer who is distraught to learn that her friend has disappeared. Soon after the disappearance, she''s approached by Harley Temple, a police investigator who believes her friend has been murdered by a serial killer who uses personal ads to find his victims. Temple hatches a plan to catch the killer using Sandra as bait, and Sandra agrees to help.', 'Sandra Carpenter is a London-based dancer who is distraught to learn that her friend has disappeared. Soon after the disappearance, she''s approached by Harley Temple, a police investigator who believes her friend has been murdered by a serial killer who uses personal ads to find his victims. Temple hatches a plan to catch the killer using Sandra as bait, and Sandra agrees to help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nBt4ljVJGSynBEHI9xgD0GS6pe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30308'),
  ('185813746060306717', 'Lurker', 2025, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alex Russell, Pat Scola, Heather Lynn', 'Alex Russell', 'Théodore Pellerin, Archie Madekwe, Havana Rose Liu, Sunny Suljic, Daniel Zolghadri, Zack Fox, Cam Hicks, Chaize Macklin', 'R', 'When a twenty-something retail clerk encounters a rising pop star, he takes the opportunity to edge his way into the in-crowd. But as the line between friend and fan blurs beyond recognition, access and proximity become a matter of life and death.', 'When a twenty-something retail clerk encounters a rising pop star, he takes the opportunity to edge his way into the in-crowd. But as the line between friend and fan blurs beyond recognition, access and proximity become a matter of life and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rbY3fjXQpt4sQLQvKD7CT6oJsS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1264573'),
  ('331972827548943178', 'Lurkers', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Roberta Findlay, Roberta Findlay', 'Ed Kelleher, Harriette Vidal', 'Christine Moore, Gary Warner, Marina Taylor, Roy MacArthur, Nancy Groff, Peter Oliver-Norman, Tom Billett, Carissa Channing', null, 'When Cathy was a girl, she saw her deranged mother murder her father and only narrowly escaped with her life. Haunted by memories of her macabre childhood, her nightmares turn into a terrifying reality when she''s lured back to her childhood home.', 'When Cathy was a girl, she saw her deranged mother murder her father and only narrowly escaped with her life. Haunted by memories of her macabre childhood, her nightmares turn into a terrifying reality when she''s lured back to her childhood home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12AsFH3CKHIc8lYxLnF63IuW5zV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28035'),
  ('37657004974115835', 'Lurking Fear', 1994, 'Horror, Crime', 'Adolfo Bartoli, C. Courtney Joyner, James Lawrence Spencer', 'C. Courtney Joyner', 'Jon Finch, Blake Adams, Ashley Laurence, Vincent Schiavelli, Jeffrey Combs, Allison Mackie, Paul Mantee, Joseph Leavengood', 'R', 'The storm-swept and depopulated town of Leffert’s Corners has been terrorized for decades by grotesque creatures that breed in the depths beneath the local cemetery. A group of townspeople have hatched a last-ditch plan to destroy the ghoul-infested graveyard, but their mission is interrupted by the arrival of a band of violent thieves intent on retrieving money hidden in one of the graves.', 'The storm-swept and depopulated town of Leffert’s Corners has been terrorized for decades by grotesque creatures that breed in the depths beneath the local cemetery. A group of townspeople have hatched a last-ditch plan to destroy the ghoul-infested graveyard, but their mission is interrupted by the arrival of a band of violent thieves intent on retrieving money hidden in one of the graves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EiQ8WjBtW5VvHPHevrvnFCE0sB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44265'),
  ('809157668843876706', 'Luscious', 1999, 'Drama', 'Ludek Bogner, Evan Georgiades', 'Evan Georgiades', 'Kari Wührer, Stephen Shellen, Ilene Kristen', 'R', 'When a passionate young model convinces her boyfriend, a painter, to take to the canvas to renew their sexual chemistry, their erotic, uninhibited masterpieces command the attention of the art world. Smothered in paint, the couple slip and slide into a new realm of their relationship.', 'When a passionate young model convinces her boyfriend, a painter, to take to the canvas to renew their sexual chemistry, their erotic, uninhibited masterpieces command the attention of the art world. Smothered in paint, the couple slip and slide into a new realm of their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68g9dEkHefMaA9Oxx7FyU8nEOpV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58947'),
  ('549918948173737031', 'Lusers', 2015, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Ticoy Rodriguez', 'Fernando Castets', 'Felipe Izquierdo, Gaby Espino, Pablo Granados, Cristián de la Fuente, Carlos Alcántara, Carlos Carlín', null, 'Three guys from differents countries come together in a funny adventure through the jungle in order to get to the Final of the FIFA World Cup Brasil 2014.', 'Three guys from differents countries come together in a funny adventure through the jungle in order to get to the Final of the FIFA World Cup Brasil 2014.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUvqrAQ1HS8AuUA7VEg6R4yRhR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373878'),
  ('140274245102835745', 'Lust for a Vampire', 1971, 'Horror', 'Jimmy Sangster, David Muir, David Bracknell', 'Tudor Gates', 'Barbara Jefford, Ralph Bates, Suzanna Leigh, Yutte Stensgaard, Michael Johnson, Helen Christie, Mike Raven, Pippa Steel', 'R', 'In 1830, the Karnstein heirs use the blood of an innocent to bring forth the evil that is the beautiful Mircalla - or as she was in 1710, Carmilla. The nearby Finishing School offers rich pickings not only in in the blood of nubile young ladies but also with the headmaster who is desperate to become Mircalla''s disciple, and the equally besotted and even more foolish author Richard Lestrange.', 'In 1830, the Karnstein heirs use the blood of an innocent to bring forth the evil that is the beautiful Mircalla - or as she was in 1710, Carmilla. The nearby Finishing School offers rich pickings not only in in the blood of nubile young ladies but also with the headmaster who is desperate to become Mircalla''s disciple, and the equally besotted and even more foolish author Richard Lestrange.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovaDuEswr439cxPeUaOF3TcsSNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31472'),
  ('476012968312935591', 'Lust for Frankenstein', 1998, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Raquel Cabra', 'Kevin Collins, Jesús Franco', 'Michelle Bauer, Lina Romay, Analía Ivars, Amber Newman, Carlos Subterfuge, Robert King, Rachel Sheppard, Pedro Temboury', null, 'Moira Frankenstein, the grand-daughter of noted mad scientist Dr. Frankenstein, has become obsessed with the work of her ancestor and she decides to pick up the family business where he left off.', 'Moira Frankenstein, the grand-daughter of noted mad scientist Dr. Frankenstein, has become obsessed with the work of her ancestor and she decides to pick up the family business where he left off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCaJIN3bKMrkNTphnaSksabQ92Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3290'),
  ('976220369293063569', 'Lust for Freedom', 1987, 'Action', 'Eric Louzil, Ron Chapman', 'Eric Louzil, Craig Kusaba, Duke Howard', 'Melanie Coll, William J. Kulzer, Judi Trevor, Howard Knight, Elizabeth Carlisle, Dee Booher, John Tallman, Rob Rosen', 'R', 'A former female cop is framed by corrupt police, acting in collusion with the local judge, and has to fight her way out of the pen, alone, against tough inmates, and the people in charge.', 'A former female cop is framed by corrupt police, acting in collusion with the local judge, and has to fight her way out of the pen, alone, against tough inmates, and the people in charge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5atOgVb2v6KuhdFdQKyO86bYur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86688'),
  ('723259087090081898', 'Lust for Gold', 1949, 'Action, Western, Drama', 'George Marshall, S. Sylvan Simon, Archie Stout', 'Ted Sherdeman, Richard English', 'Ida Lupino, Glenn Ford, Gig Young, William Prince, Edgar Buchanan, Will Geer, Paul Ford, Jay Silverheels', 'NR', 'A man determined to track down the fabled Arizona gold mine known as The Lost Dutchman has an affair with a married treasure hunter, whose pursuit of the mine has lead her to double-cross her husband.', 'A man determined to track down the fabled Arizona gold mine known as The Lost Dutchman has an affair with a married treasure hunter, whose pursuit of the mine has lead her to double-cross her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAcPR8tht7tBTdMvfxjSSGUcK7Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94139'),
  ('793337297022569200', 'Lust for Gold: A Race Against Time', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Robert May', 'Robert May', null, null, 'A team of modern adventurers is on a quest for gold in the mountains of eastern Arizona.', 'A team of modern adventurers is on a quest for gold in the mountains of eastern Arizona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqrKavooKU8atYzlsgfozdaQrDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816711'),
  ('775850616993581409', 'Lust for Life', 1956, 'Drama, History', 'Al Jennings, Vincente Minnelli, Russell Harlan', 'Norman Corwin', 'Kirk Douglas, Anthony Quinn, James Donald, Pamela Brown, Everett Sloane, Niall MacGinnis, Noel Purcell, Henry Daniell', 'NR', 'An intense and imaginative artist, revered Dutch painter Vincent van Gogh possesses undeniable talent, but he is plagued by mental problems and frustrations with failure. Supported by his brother, Theo, the tormented Van Gogh eventually leaves Holland for France, where he meets volatile fellow painter Paul Gauguin and struggles to find greater inspiration.', 'An intense and imaginative artist, revered Dutch painter Vincent van Gogh possesses undeniable talent, but he is plagued by mental problems and frustrations with failure. Supported by his brother, Theo, the tormented Van Gogh eventually leaves Holland for France, where he meets volatile fellow painter Paul Gauguin and struggles to find greater inspiration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlK3LG3W41eF3N1tk0SEM7Dln2x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29592'),
  ('1026193340601736132', 'Lust for Life', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Michela Andreozzi, Maurizio Calvesi, Livio Bordone', 'Fabio Volo, Filippo Bologna, Michela Andreozzi', 'Fabio Volo, Vittoria Puccini, Ludovico Nava, Jonis Bashir, Corrado Nuzzo, Benoît Maréchal, Iván Sánchez, Luna Bova', null, 'A couple in crisis after the birth of their first son rekindles their love during a trip to Norway.', 'A couple in crisis after the birth of their first son rekindles their love during a trip to Norway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDxyCXsxjXSLaj2uQtcMj5Vjth3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1077426'),
  ('1150753025625117567', 'Lust in the Dust', 1985, 'Comedy, Western', 'Paul Bartel', 'Philip John Taylor', 'Tab Hunter, Divine, Lainie Kazan, Geoffrey Lewis, Henry Silva, Cesar Romero, Gina Gallego, Nedra Volz', 'R', 'Assaulted by outlaws, donkey-riding Rosie joins a silent drifter''s search for gold in the Old West.', 'Assaulted by outlaws, donkey-riding Rosie joins a silent drifter''s search for gold in the Old West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QNVgDTlM551UUaAxwdVMcZ7aWT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47107'),
  ('614734691957045234', 'Lust of the Vampire', 1957, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Riccardo Freda, Mario Bava, Piero Regnoli', 'Riccardo Freda, Piero Regnoli, Mario Bava', 'Gianna Maria Canale, Carlo D''Angelo, Dario Michaelis, Paul Müller, Wandisa Guida, Angelo Galassi, Renato Tontini, Charles Fawcett', null, 'A mad scientist captures young women and drains their blood, in order to keep alive an ancient, evil duchess.', 'A mad scientist captures young women and drains their blood, in order to keep alive an ancient, evil duchess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1erlBZP5BKOvZJQ7yv0eDpKrY47.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28061'),
  ('518973247796782555', 'Lust Stories', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Karan Johar, Dibakar Banerjee, Zoya Akhtar', 'Anurag Kashyap, Radhika Apte, Ruchika Oberoi', 'Kiara Advani, Radhika Apte, Akash Thosar, Randeep Jha, Bhumi Pednekar, Neil Bhoopalam, Jaideep Ahlawat, Manisha Koirala', 'R', 'An anthology of four stories that sheds light on modern relationships from the viewpoint of the Indian woman.', 'An anthology of four stories that sheds light on modern relationships from the viewpoint of the Indian woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mP5HehSpCaRGd6ej66jxkhdl60B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530154'),
  ('1059872461884161854', 'Lust Stories 2', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Konkona Sen Sharma, R. Balki, Amit Sharma', 'Saurabh Choudhary, Rishi Virmani, Pooja Tolani', 'Neena Gupta, Mrunal Thakur, Tamannaah Bhatia, Kajol, Angad Bedi, Hemant Kher, Tillotama Shome, Amruta Subhash', 'R', 'Four eminent Indian directors explore sex, desire and love through short films in this sequel to 2018''s Emmy-nominated ''Lust Stories''.', 'Four eminent Indian directors explore sex, desire and love through short films in this sequel to 2018''s Emmy-nominated ''Lust Stories''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5x729JI6wZs9hCqX7tc7oH87ih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1136736'),
  ('261926837665293217', 'Lustful Life: Night Make Me Wet!', 1981, 'Drama', 'Shōgorō Nishimura, Yasuhiro Horiuchi, Yoshihiro Yamazaki', 'Akio Ido', 'Yuki Kazamatsuri, Junko Mabuki, Ayako Ota, Tsutomu Akashi, Shin''ichi Arai, Iwao Dan, Naomi Hagio, Tarô Iwate', null, 'A woman endures the life of a prostitute for a yakuza pimp.', 'A woman endures the life of a prostitute for a yakuza pimp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehQDTPHFc39XwgHd2e9RWCHCsLS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671361'),
  ('1017876455408265236', 'Lute: Forge On or Die', 1987, 'Drama', 'Vicente Aranda, Alfredo Mayo, José Luis Alcaine', 'Eleuterio Sánchez', 'Imanol Arias, Victoria Abril, Antonio Valero, Carlos Tristancho, Diana Peñalver, Margarita Calahorra, Manuel de Blas, Luis Marín', null, 'In Spain of the 1960s, a poor family of quinquis - a nomadic ethnic group with a tradition as old as that of the gypsises of Spain but with even more obscure origins - have a nomadic life marked by poverty. The son, Eleuterio Sánchez Rodriguez, nicknamed "El Lute", steals some chickens and is condemned to six months in jail. El Lute moves to the slum outskirts of Madrid with his common law wife, Chelo, starting an itinerant life as a peddler of pots and pans and living in a quinqui shantytown. He gradually embarks upon as life of petty criminality, eventually participating in the theft of a jewelry store during which a bystander is killed.', 'In Spain of the 1960s, a poor family of quinquis - a nomadic ethnic group with a tradition as old as that of the gypsises of Spain but with even more obscure origins - have a nomadic life marked by poverty. The son, Eleuterio Sánchez Rodriguez, nicknamed "El Lute", steals some chickens and is condemned to six months in jail. El Lute moves to the slum outskirts of Madrid with his common law wife, Chelo, starting an itinerant life as a peddler of pots and pans and living in a quinqui shantytown. He gradually embarks upon as life of petty criminality, eventually participating in the theft of a jewelry store during which a bystander is killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oONiv6etDkhjPfmzPjHInEDPg8p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115693'),
  ('944617975263733740', 'Luther', 2003, 'Drama, History', 'Eric Till, Robert Fraisse', 'Camille Thomasson, Bart Gavigan', 'Joseph Fiennes, Jonathan Firth, Claire Cox, Alfred Molina, Peter Ustinov, Bruno Ganz, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Maria Simon', 'PG-13', 'During the early 16th century, idealistic German monk Martin Luther, disgusted by the materialism in the church, begins the dialogue that will lead to the Protestant Reformation.', 'During the early 16th century, idealistic German monk Martin Luther, disgusted by the materialism in the church, begins the dialogue that will lead to the Protestant Reformation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Z3wlA8sKdd3tPTZW8N1q3YEd5f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5653'),
  ('1120758638680569042', 'Luther the Geek', 1989, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Carlton J. Albright, David Knox', 'Carlton J. Albright', 'Edward Terry, Joan Roth, Stacy Haiduk, Thomas Mills, Jerry Clarke, Tom Brittingham, Carlton Williams, ''Chicken'' Klabunde', 'NR', 'A psychotic killer convicted of multiple murders is released on parole after spending twenty years in prison. His psychosis immediately takes over and he goes on a killing spree.', 'A psychotic killer convicted of multiple murders is released on parole after spending twenty years in prison. His psychosis immediately takes over and he goes on a killing spree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iD0VRF0QQtbV0dQfpvUsbK4FGqK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67515');
